{"id": "15866", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15866", "title": "Derrick Kakooza", "text": "Derrick Kakooza (wavutse ku ya 23 Ukwakira 2002) upima metero imwe na sanimetero mirongo inani neshantu (1.85cm) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda kuri ubu ukina nku mukinnyi ukina mu b'imbere mu ikipe ya ENPPI yo mu Misiri.\nUmwuga waikipe.\nKakooza wavukiye i Kampala, yatangiye umwuga we mu ishuri rya Polisi rya Naguru, mbere yo kwinjira muri Polisi Kampala. Amaze kuzamurwa mu ikipe ya mbere hamwe na Polisi,yagize ibihe byiza mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2021 mu batarengeje imyaka 20 byatumye yerekeza mu ikipe yo mububiligi ya Anderlecht. Imyitwarire ye ya shampiyona nayo yari mwiza, yatsinze ibitego umunani mu mikino cumi n'umunani muri shampiyona ebyiri. \nNyuma yo kwimukira muri Anderlecht, Kakooza yarangije kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Valmiera yo muri Lativiya mu ntangiriro zo muri 2022 avuye muri Polisi FC. \nAmaze gukina umukino umwe mu gikombe cya Finilande na KuPS, Kakooza yasinyiye ikipe ya ENPPI yo mu Misiri muri Mutarama 2023. \nIcyubahiro.\nUganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20"}
{"id": "15867", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15867", "title": "Alex Kakuba", "text": "Alex Kakuba (wavutse 12 Kamena 1991)ni umukinnnyi wumupira w'amaguru ukpmoka muriUganda kuri ubu ukinira CD Cova da Piedade.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKakuba yatangiye umwuga we muri Proline FC. Yavuye muri Proline FC mu mpeshyi ya 2012, yimukira ku buntu mu ikipe yo mu cyiciro cya kane muri Porutugali ikipe ya Esperan\u00e7a Lagos. Muri Mutarama 2013, yinjiye mu cyiciro cya kabiri cyitwa Covilh\u00e3, yakinnye imikino 50 ya shampiyona bibiri. Ku ya 14 Kamena 2014, Kakuba yimukiye muri Estoril Praia muri Primeira Liga, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka ine. \nKakuba yasinye imyaka 2 muri PAS Giannina muri Nyakanga 2018. Yarekuwe ku buntu ku ya 10 Ukuboza 2018. \nKu ya 27 Werurwe 2019, Kakuba yasinyiye ikipe ya Lori FC. Muri Kamena 2019, yinjiye mu ikipe ya CD Cova da Piedade yo muri Porutugali. "}
{"id": "15868", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15868", "title": "Edward Kalungi", "text": "Kalungi Edward (wavutse ku ya Ukwakira 1977)ni umugande wasezeye gukina umupira w'amaguru wa babigize umwuga, ukina nka myugariromu ikipe y'igihugu muri 1993 kugeza 2003. \nGukina umwuga.\nKalungi yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Express FC ya Uganda, Shinas FC yomuri Omani, Hue FC yomuri Viyetinamu, Reba E San FC (Tayilande), Al-Wasl FC (mubarabu), na Sulut United FC yo muri Indoneziya. Yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 2010.\nIkipe y'igihugu.\nKalungi yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ku ya 3 Nzeri 1993 bakina na Tanzaniya. Kalungi yatsinze igitego cya mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ku ya 23 Ugushyingo 2000 n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Somaliya mu gikombe cya CECAFA muri 2000.\nUmwuga nyuma yumupira wamaguru.\nMuri 2013, Kalungi yatorewe kuba intumwa y'ishyirahamwe ry'abakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda. Ukuboza 2018, Kalungi yagizwe umukozi muri FUFA, ishami rishinzwe kugenzura ibikorwa remezo by\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda. "}
{"id": "15869", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15869", "title": "Henri Kalungi", "text": "Henry Kalungi (wavutse ku ya 25 Ugushyingo 1987) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uvuka i Kampala muri Uganda.\nUmwuga.\nIshuri Rikuru.\nKalungi yavuye mu gihugu cya Uganda yerekeza muri Amerika mu 2006 kugira ngo yige kandi akina umupira w'amaguru muri kaminuza ya Winthrop. Yakinnye imikino 56 muri Winthrop mu myaka itatu yamaze muri yo kaminuza, yiswe ikipe ya MVP yo mu 2006, kandi ahabwa Ikipe ya Big South All-Tournament Team na NSCAA / adidas All-South Atlantic Region Team.\nKalungi yakinnye na Hampton Roads Piranhas na Fredericksburg Gunners muri USL Premier Development League, yashyizwe mu itsinda rya makipe yabaye aya mbere muri 2008.\numwuga.\nKalungi yatoranijwe mu cyiciro cya kane (53 muri rusange) ya MLS SuperDraft yo mu 2009 na Colorado Rapids, ariko ntabwo yahawe amasezerano niyi kipe. Nyuma yaje gusinyana na Richmond Kickers yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri muri USL, maze atangira umwuga we ku ya 18 Mata 2009 mu mukino wa Richmond wabahuje urangira ari 2-2 na Harrisburg City Island. Yagumanye na Richmond mu bihe byo uri 2009, 2010, na 2011. Iyi kipe yongeye kumusinyisha muri shampiyona yo muri 2012 ku ya 22 Nzeri 2011. \nKalungi yatijwe muri Proline FC yo muri shampiyona yaUganda ku ya 3 Ukwakira 2011. Azasubira i Richmond muri Gashyantare 2012. aho yari aherutse gusinywa na Charlotte Independence. \nMpuzamahanga.\nKalungi yagaragaye mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20 ndetse n'ikipe nkuru y'igihugu."}
{"id": "15870", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15870", "title": "Hannington Kalyesubula", "text": "Hannington Kalyesubula (yavutse ku ya 28 Mutarama 1982) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, kuri ubu ukinira ikipe ya Rwenshama FC muri shampiyona ya Uganda. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga muri na Villa SC muri shampiyona ya Uganda, nyuma yimukira muri Polisi Jinja, mbere yuko mu 2006 ajya gukina muri Saint-George SA muri Shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere muri Etiyopiya. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka 2 muri Etiyopiya, SC Villa yamusinyishije ku ya 14 Ukuboza 2008 ku masezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri., \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nUmunyezamu yari umunyamuryango wa Uganda. "}
{"id": "15871", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15871", "title": "Diaz Kambere", "text": "Diaz Kambere ni umukinnyi w'umugande ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Kanada. Kugeza ubu akina muri Afurika United FC muri Multicultural Soccer League ya British Columbia. Akora nk'umutoza mukuru w abakobwa muri Delview Secondary \nUmwuga.\nIshuri Rikuru.\nKambere yavukiye muri Uganda, ariko yimukira i Surrey, muri Columbiya yu bwongereza n'umuryango we akiri umwana. Yabaye umunyeshuri mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Centennial i Coquitlam n\u2019ishuri ribanza rya John Norquay i Vancouver, yakinnye umupira mu rubyiruko mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino rya kanada na bataliyani ryi Vancouver (ICSF) ndetse na Eagle Ridge Rogue Selects i Coquitlam, BC, kandi yari umunyamuryango wa Columbiya yu bwongereza. itsinda ry'intara k'urwego rwa bari munsi yimwaka 15, 16, na 18. Amaze kwimuka n'umuryango we mu majyepfo ya Mainland muri 1992 yize muri Langara College no muri Trinity Western University, aho yize Kinetics na Psychology. \nAbabigize umwuga.\nKambere yasinyiye Vancouver Whitecaps yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cya USL muri 2006, nyuma akina imikino 28 mu myaka ibiri hamwe niyi kipe. Ku ya 6 Nzeri 2008, yasinye amasezerano y\u2019umunsi umwe na Toronto FC kugira ngo abashe gukina umukino na Chivas USA, kubera ko iyo kipe yabuze abakinnyi icyenda mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nMpuzamahanga.\nKambere yahgarariye kanada muri 2008 mumarushanwa ya CONCACAF Olympic Qualifying tournament."}
{"id": "15872", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15872", "title": "Milton Karisa", "text": "Milton yakiniye ikipe ya Jinja Municipal Council Football Club kuva 2011 kugeza 2013, muri Bul FCkuva 2013 kugeza muri 2016, ubu akina muri Vipers S.C.\nBUL FC.\nMilton muri 2013 yinjiye muri Bul FC avuye mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Jinja. Yatangiye gukinira iyi kipe yakinnye na Kansai Plascon FC (yahoze yitwa Sadolin Paints FC) muri 2013, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kuri Bul yakinnye na Kiira Young FC kuri Stade Namboole."}
{"id": "15873", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15873", "title": "Lawrence Kasadha", "text": "Lawrence Kenneth Kasadha (wavutse 14 Nyakanga 1994) ni myugariro mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Bul FC yo muri Uganda. \nYabanje gukina shampiyona imwe mu ikipe ya SC Villa, SC Victoria University, KCCA no mu cyiciro cyo hasi c ndetse no muri shampiyona ya Kenya mu ikipe ya Nairobi City Stars, Bandari FC Kenya na Tusker FC \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKasadha yatangiriye mu cyiciro cyo hasi cya Jinja Municipal Council Hippos FC muri 2011 mbere yuko yinjira muri SC Villa mu cyiciro cya mbere, mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2012. Nyuma y'amezi atandatu, hagati ya 2012, yasinyiye gukinira kaminuza ya SC Victoria. \nNyuma yimukiye muri Kenya yinjira mu ikipe ya Nairobi City Stars muri shampiyona yo muri 2014 maze shampiyona irangiye yerekeza muri Bandari FC yo muri Kenya muri shampiyona ya 2015 hari amakuru ko afite ahandi ashaka kujya muri Ushuru FC \nYagarutse muri Uganda muri 2016 yinjira muri KCCA ariko agaruka muri Kenya muri shampiyona ya 2018 hamwe na Tusker FC \nYarekuwe na Tusker nyuma y'amezi atandatu gusa hanyuma asubira muri Uganda akomeza kujya muri Gaddafi FC batsindiye kuza mu marushanwa yisumbuyeho mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2020-21, hanyuma yari Bul. FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKasadha yahoze akinira ikipe ya Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20, akaba yarahamagawe inshuro eshanu mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda."}
{"id": "15874", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15874", "title": "Richard Kasagga", "text": "Richard Juuko Kasagga (yavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda ukina nka myugariromu ikipe ya Olympique B\u00e9ja muri shampiyona ya Tuniziya.akaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nikipe.\nUmwuga wambere.\nKasagga yatangiye umwuga wo gukina mu makipe yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda muri Kiira Young FC muri 2013 aho yakinnye kugeza 2015.\u00a0\nTugarutse muri Uganda.\nMuri 2016, yasinyiye umujyi wa Uganda mu ikipe ya Kampala City Authority aho yakinnye shampiyona ebyiri mbere yo kwimukira muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC. Kasagga yagaragaye muri shampiyona ya Uganda hamwe na URA kuva 2017 kugeza 2018."}
{"id": "15875", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15875", "title": "Jamil Kasirye", "text": "Jamil Kasirye (wavutse 1954) ni umunyezamu mu mupira w'amaguru uri mu kiruhuko cyizabukuru wakiniye Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 1978.\nUmwuga.\nYavukiye i Kasubi mu nkengero za Kampala, Kasirye yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Lint FC, Kampala City Council FC, SC Villa na Bank of Uganda FC. Yatsindiye ibikombe bibiri bya shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere muri Uganda hamwe na Villa, yegukana igikombe cya Uganda inshuro eshatu kabiri na KCC rimwe na Villa, anayobora ikipe ya Villa yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1983. \nKasirye yagiye agaragara inshuro nyinshi mu rubyiruko rwa Uganda ndetse n'amakipe akomeye y'igihugu. Umukino we wa nyuma yatsinzwe na Zambiya ibitego 0-3 muri Nyakanga muri 1984. "}
{"id": "15876", "revid": "10613", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15876", "title": "Abubakar Kasule", "text": "Abubakar Muhammad Kasule uzwi cyane ku izina rya Abubakar Kasule ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Express FC yo muri shampiyona ya uganda. \nubuzima bw'ite.\nAbubakare kasule,ni umukinyi w'umupira w'amaguru wo muri Uganda.yavukiye muri Uganda ku wa 5 Mutarama 1999. Mu mwaka wa 2022 yasubiye muri Express FC nyuma yo kuba yari yaragiye muri leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika gukomeza amasomo muri kaminuza no gukina umupira."}
{"id": "15877", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15877", "title": "Nowa Babadi Kasule", "text": "Noah Babadi Kasule (wavutse 15 Gicurasi 1985) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda.\nUmwuga.\nKasule yatangiye umwuga we mu ikpe ya Kampala yitwa kampala City Council mbere yo kwimukira muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC. Mu 2007, Kasule yimukiye muri Arumeniya, amara imyaka ine akina muri Banants mbere yo kumara imyaka itatu i Gandzasar Kapan n'umwaka umwe muri Ulisses."}
{"id": "15878", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15878", "title": "Robert Katende", "text": "Robert Katende ni umutoza wa chess muri Uganda, mu mupira w'amaguru, na injeniyeri. Ni n'umuyobozi mukuru wa siporo yo hanze.\nYateje imbere umukino wa chess mu cyaro hamwe n'abana bo m'umuhanda wa Kampala. Azwiho kandi kuba yarayoboye Phiona Mutesi, umukandida wa mbere w\u2019umugore m\u2019umukino wa chess muri Uganda ndetse n\u2019igitabo cya 2012 cyanditswe na Tim Crothers na filime Umwamikazi wa Katwe muri 2016, yiyobowe na Nair Mira, ikandikwa na William Wheeler. David Oyelowo yakinnye nka Robert Katende muri iyi filime, inagaragaramo Lupita Nyong'o na Madina Nalwanga. \nUbuzima bw'ambere n'uburere.\nKatende yavukiye mu karere ka Kiboga, na nyina w'u mwangavu, yabanaga na nyirakuru mu bwana bwe. Yakuriye i Naakulabye, m'umujyi wa Kampala. Yatangiye ubuzima bwe mu ishuri ribanze rya St Elizabeth nyuma ajya mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Lubiri aho yamenyekanye muri chess. Kuva i Lubiri, yinjiye muri kaminuza ya Kyambogo aho yakuye impamyabumenyi mu by'ubwubatsi, ateza imbere imyumvire ya chess. Yatangiye umupira w'amaguru nyuma akinana ubuhanga mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Miracle, Top TV FC, hamwe na ba ambasaderi ba siporo. \nKugeza ubu Katende afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu ikoranabuhanga rya mudasobwa ndetse n\u2019impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu iterambere ry\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Northwest muri Amerika. \nNi umukinnyi wemewe na chess FIDE umwigisha na arbiter. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2018, Katende yatoranijwe kugirango yinjire muri gahunda yo gutangiza abayobozi muri Obama Foundation. \nUmuryango.\nKatende yashakanye na Sarah Ntongo. Bafitanye abakobwa batatu. \nIbihembo.\nMuri 2017, mu rwego rwo kubahiriza uruhare Katende yagize mu muryango wa chess, Ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya Chess (FIDE) ryamuhaye igihembo cya Tigran Petrosian. \nMuri 2018, Katende yari umwe mu bayobozi 200 b'Abanyafurika bemewe na Fondasiyo ya Obama. Ibikorwa bye byagaragaye no mu nama ya Fondasiyo ya Obama muri 2018. \nUmwanditsi.\nMuri 2019, Katende yasohoye igitabo yise Knight idafite Ikigo gisobanura ingorane zo mu bwana bwe nu buryo yahisemo gukoresha chess nk'igikoresho cyo guhindura ubuzima. "}
{"id": "15879", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15879", "title": "Allan Kateregga", "text": "Allan Kateregga (wavutse ku ya 3 Kamena 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi ukinira hagati mu kibuga, mu ikipe ya FC Saint-\u00c9loi Lupopo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Usibye Uganda, yakiniye muri Kenya, Afurika y'Epfo, na Iraki. \nUmwuga.\nMuri Nyakanga 2019, yagarutse avuye mu ntizanyo muri Maritzburg United, Kateregga yemeye gusesa amasezerano na Cape Town City. "}
{"id": "15880", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15880", "title": "Godfrey Kateregga", "text": "Godfrey Kateregga (5 Gicurasi 1960 - 13 Werurwe 1999) yari rutahizamu wakinaga umupira w'amaguru wakiniye ikipe y'ihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda.\nUmwuga.\nKateregga yavukiye i Mulago mu nkengero za Kampala, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Tobacco FC, Kampala City Council FC, SC Villa na Express FC. Yatsindiye ibikombe bine bya shampiyona muri Uganda,bibiri muri KCC na Villa, kandi yegukana igikombe cya Uganda inshuro eshanu (bibiri muri KCC n'umwe muri Villa). \nKateregga yagaragaye inshuro nyinshi mu ikipe nkuru yi gihugu ya Uganda. "}
{"id": "15881", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15881", "title": "Habib Kavuma", "text": "Habib Kavuma (wavutse 4 Nzeri 1991)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira Amajyepfo ya Samity, nka myugariro.\nUmwuga.\nYavukiye i Makindye, Kavuma yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda no mu Rwanda muri Bunamwaya, APR, Kampala Capital City Authority na SC Villa. Muri Nyakanga 2022, byatangajwe ku mugaragaro ko Kavuma yasinyiye gukina shampiyona ya CFL yo mu majyepfo ya Samity mu Buhinde. \nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2009. "}
{"id": "15882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15882", "title": "Hood Kaweesa", "text": "Hood Kaweesa (wavutse 22 Nyakanga 1982) ni umukinnyi ukina nka myugariro mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Polisi FC. Yari umwe mu bagize itsinda ry\u2019igikombe cya CECAFA muri 2002. "}
{"id": "15883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15883", "title": "Vincent Kayizzi", "text": "Vincent Kayizzi (wavutse 6 Werurwe 1984) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe OC Bokavu Dawa.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKayizzi yatangiye gukina muri ikipe yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda muri Kampala City Council FC. Muri shampiyona 2006/07 yagize amahirwe aza mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru yo mu Rwanda yitwa APR FC. Muri Mutarama 2009, yimukiye i Burayi gukina mu gikombe cya mbere muri Seribiya (icyiciro cya kabiri cyo muri Seribiya) FK Srem, iyi kipe ikaba iyambere mu Burayi mu kuzana bakinnyi baturutse Uganda, nka Nestroy Kizito na Phillip Ssozi. Nyuma yaje kugira ikindi gihe mu Burayi, ubwo yakinaga na Motor Lublin muri Shampiyona ya kabiri ya Polonye 2012\u201313. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKayizzi akina mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda kuva 2004, kugeza muri 2014, afite imipira 40 n'ibitego 4 yatsinze. "}
{"id": "15884", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15884", "title": "Aziz Kayondo", "text": "Aziz Abdu Kayondo (wavutse ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2002) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nka myugariro mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. "}
{"id": "15885", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15885", "title": "Martin Kayongo-Mutumba", "text": "Martin Kayongo-Mutumba (yavutse yitwa Martin Mutumba, ku ya 15 Kamena 1985) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga wakinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga. Yibukwa cyane kumwanya muri AIK, aho yatsindiye Allsvenskan na Svenska Cupen muri 2009. Yavukiye muri Suwede ku babyeyi bakomoka muri Uganda, yahagarariye amakipe yo muri Suwede baterengeje imyaka 17 na 19 mbere yo gukinira umukino mpuzamahanga wa mbere muri Uganda muri 2012.\nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nMu 2004 AIK yifuzaga ko Mutumba yakina na FC Caf\u00e9 Opera, ikipe yakoraga nk'ikipe ntoya ya AIK. Kubwamahirwe macye, Mutumba yavunitse ukuguru mu marushanwa yo mu rugo yakinnye na bagenzi be mbere yuko shampiyona itangira kandi ntabwo yigeze ashobora gukina umukino uwo ari wo wose wa Caf\u00e9 Opera. Yavuze ko yatakaje imbaraga zogukina umupira w'amaguru, Urukiko rw'ubucamanza rw'amuhaye amahirwe ya kabiri ahitamo gukomeza umupira. \nUbuzima bwite.\nIgihe yabanje gusinyana na AIK, akiri ingimbi, ise yaretse akazi maze Mutumba ukiri muto aha umuryango amafaranga yinjiza. Iyo kipe yamuretse aragenda, umuryango wahise wisanga m'ubibazo by'ubukungu. "}
{"id": "15886", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15886", "title": "Igishanga cya Gatuna", "text": "Igishanga cya Gatuna gifite hegitari umunani 8 cyeguriwe abatuye hafi y\u2019umupaka wa Gatuna kugira ngo biteze imbere babinyujije mu buhinzi bakorera muri icyo gishanga.\nUmushinga wo gutunganya Igishanga cya Gatuna.\nUmushinga wo kugitunganya, uzibanda ku gutunganya ubutaka buri ku buso bwa Hegitari 600, bwo mu misozi igikikije, mu rwego rwo kuburinda kwangirizwa n\u2019isuri. Bizajyana n\u2019ingamba zo gukangurira ababuhinga kubahiriza ibikenerwa byose mu kongera umusaruro harimo imbuto nziza, ifumbire y\u2019imborera n\u2019imvaruganda, imiti, ishwagara n\u2019ibindi bituma umusaruro wiyongera.Ni igishanga kiri ku buso bwa Hegitari 220, izikunze kurengerwa n\u2019amazi y\u2019imvura, zikaba zibarirwa muri 20.Mu umushinga wo kugitunganya haziyongeraho Damu, izayobora amazi mu buryo bworohereza abahinzi mu mirimo ijyanye no kuhira imyaka, bityo bajye babasha no guhinga batitaye ku kurindira imvura.Ibyo bizarushaho kubakira abahinzi ubushobozi, no guca imyumvire y\u2019abagitekereza ko umurimo w\u2019ubuhinzi ari uwa ba \u201cmbuze uko ngira\u201d.Ubwo bizaba byashyizwe mu bikorwa, umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi, uzarushaho kwiyongera.Igihe kirageze ngo umuhinzi yubakirwe ubushobozi bumugira rwiyemezamirimo nk\u2019abandi bose babarizwa mu rindi shoramari rirambye. Ibi rero ntiyabigeraho mu gihe agihura n\u2019inzitizi zirimo n\u2019isuri, ari na yo mpamvu Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yatekereje icyafasha umuhinzi guhangana n\u2019izo mbogamizi akabukora kinyamwuga byisanzuye.Igice kitagerwamo n\u2019isuri muri iki gishanga, ngo nibura mu gihe hahinzwe ibirayi, hasarurwa Toni 19 kuri Hegitari imwe. Gahunda yo kugitunganya ikubiye mu mushinga mugari wo kwita ku buhinzi n\u2019ubworozi watangiye gukorerwa mu Turere tw\u2019igihugu guhera mu mwaka wa 2022, ukazamara imyaka itanu.\nUko byari bimeze mu Igishanga cya Gatuna.\nMugihe kinini cyari gishize bamwe mu bahinga mugishanga cya Gatuna bataka igihombo baterwaga n\u2019amazi y\u2019imvura yateraga imyuzure muri icyo gishanga,Abafite imirima muri icyo gishanga, abagituriye n\u2019abaturage biganjemo abo mu Mirenge ya Kaniga na Cyumba mu Karere ka Gicumbi iki gishanga kibarizwamo, bagaragaza ko uko kwangirizwa imyaka y\u2019abo n\u2019amazi yarengeraga imirima imwe n\u2019imwe ikigize byatumaga babaga bataha ntamusaruro.Bavugako bahoraga bahangayitse bibaza amaherezo y\u2019icyo kibazo barayobewe, kuko inzego zose bigaragara ko zakagize icyo zibikoraho, bari barazegereye barazitakambiye ngo zibarwaneho zibafashe gushaka umuti w\u2019icyo kibazo.Nubwo ibintu byose ku masoko ya byihagazeho muri Gicumbi, naho ibirayi byageze ku mafaranga 550. Imbuto imboga n\u2019ibindi biribwa biragurwa n\u2019Umuntu wifite, byaratumbagiye ku kigero kirenze kure uko byahoze mbere.Ubuyobozi butekereza ko kuba kiri hafi gutunganywa, abahinzi bazarushaho kongera imbaraga n\u2019ubushake mu buhinzi buteye imbere bityo n\u2019abakenera umusaruro ugiturukamo babyungukiremo."}
{"id": "15887", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15887", "title": "Kizito Keziron", "text": "Kizito Keziron ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ZESCO United muri shampiyona ya Zambiya hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda (\"Cranes\") nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga. Muri 2015, Keziron yari mu bahatanira kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka w\u2019igihembo cy\u2019abakinnyi ba FUFA Airtel.\nUmwuga w'urubyiruko.\nAkiri muto, yari umunyamuryango wa Kitende Mutagatifu Mariya aho yari mu ikipe yegukanye igikombe cya Copa Coca-Cola yo muri 2013 i Kabale. Nyuma yinjiye muri KJT Rweshama aho yakiniye shampiyona imwe muri 2013/14. \nUmwuga.\nKerala Blasters FC.\nYatangiye gukinira Blasters ku ya 4 Mutarama 2018 na FC Pune City aje asimbuye Dimitar Berbatov ku munota wa 46. Ntabwo yashoboye gukina shampiyona yose kuko yagize imvune hagati muri shampiyona yo muri 2017-18. Yakomeje kwitwara neza muri Blasters muri shampiyona ya 2018-19. \nKCCA FC.\nMuri Nzeri 2019 yinjiye muri KCCA FC asinya amasezerano y'imyaka 2. Ku ya 2 Ukwakira 2019, yatangiye gukinira KCCA FC na Tooro FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKizito yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda, ku ya 9 Ugushyingo 2014 kuri Stade y'igihugu ya Mandela bakina na Etiyopiya. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ku ya 4 Nyakanga 2015, bakina na Tanzaniya mu cyiciro kibanza cya CHAN muri 2016. Yari mu ikipe ya Uganda Cranes yatwaye igikombe cya CECAFA muri 2015 muri Etiyopiya. Yabaye kandi mu ikipe ya Uganda yakinnye muri CHAN muri 2016 yabereye mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "15888", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15888", "title": "Jimmy Kidega", "text": "James Jimmy Kidega (wavutse 16 Kanama 1982) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri ugande wahoze akina umupira wamaguru ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga.\nUbuzima bwihariye.\nYavukiye i Jinja, murumuna we ni Moses Oloya, wakinnye umupira mpuzamahanga muri Uganda. \nUmwuga.\nKidega yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri SC Villa, Express, Rayon Sports fc yo mu Rwanda, La Passe, Gulu United, Uganda Revenue Authority, Chanthaburi na Bontang. Yatsindiye imipira ibiri mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. "}
{"id": "15889", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15889", "title": "Hamis Kiiza", "text": "Hamis Diego Kiiza (yavutse ku ya 10 Ukuboza 1990) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukina muri Kagera Sugar FC, muri shampiyona yambere ya Tanzaniya.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nDiego yatangiye gukinira Cranes muri Bobby Williamson muri Gicurasi 2011 ubwo yahamagarwaga mu ikipe ya batarengeje imwaka 23 ubwo bahuraga na Tanzaniya mu majonjora y'imikino yose ya Afurika. Yatsinze ibitego 3 mu mikino 2 ubwo bakinaga na Tanzaniya afasha ikipe kuzamuka mu cyiciro gikurikira guhura na Kenya. Nyuma yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya bari munsi y'imyaka 23, yazamuwe mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu yuzuye izakina na Gineya-Bisawu mu majonjora akomeye yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 2012 ku ya 4 Kamena 2011. "}
{"id": "15890", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15890", "title": "Igishanga cya Rugeramigozi", "text": "Mubikorwa byo gutunganya iki gishanga yakozwe harimo kongera ingomero z\u2019amazi zuhira umuceri.\nGahunda yo gutunganya Igishanga cya Rugeramigozi.\nMubikorwa byo gutunganya iki gishanga yakozwe harimo kongera ingomero z\u2019amazi zuhira umuceli, kurwanya isuri mu nkengero z\u2019igishanga, haterwa ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka kandi abahinzi bagahugurwa gufata neza imiyoboro y\u2019amazi.Abahinzi kandi bubakiwe ubwanikiro buhagije ku buryo ngo umusaruro wabo utangirikira mu mirima, banigishwa kwikorera ifumbire y\u2019ibirundo bitanga nibura toni zisaga 100 yunganira imvaruganda.Ibiti bisaga ibihumbi 100 bizafasha abahinzi gukomeza kongera umusaruro, kuko bizafasha kurinda imiyoboro twubatse itanga amazi mu mirima isuri iyangiza kuko ubundi aha nta mazi yahageraga.Umuhuzabikorwa wafashaga abahinzi ba Rugeramigozi yavuga ko mu bikorwa bibungabunga ibidukikije muri iki gishanga birimo no gutera ibiti ku materasi akikije igishanga.Buri wese akwiye kuba ijisho rya mugenzi we, kugira ngo bakomeze kubona umusaruro uhagije w\u2019umuceli muwurinda isuri yawangiza.Igihembwe cyashize abahinzi bakaba barabashije kugurisha Toni 356 bavuye kuri 274 bari bagurishije mu mwaka wa 2016, hatabariwemo uwo bajya kurya iwabo.\nIbindi Wamenya kumusaruro Abahinzi babonaga.\nAbahinzi b\u2019umuceri mu gishanga cya Rugeramigozi baravuga ko umusaruro wabo ukomeje kwiyongera,bavuga ko mu gihembwe cyari gishize cy\u2019ihinga mu mwaka wa 2016 bari biyemeje kuzamura umusaruro kugera kuri Toni 200 kuri Hegitari 57, bakaba barabashije kubona umusaruro ungana na Toni 189 bavuye kuri Toni 125.Umwe mubahinga avugako ahinga kuri hegitari eshanu ariko yajyaga yeza kg 200 ariko aho ahuguriwe gutera umuceli ku murongo no gukoresha ifumbire y\u2019ibirundo ageze kuri kg 382.Ubuso bwose bwa Rugeramigozi ya mbere n\u2019iya kabiri busaga Hegitari 100 zihingwaho n\u2019amakoperative ya COCAR na KIABER.Umukozi w\u2019Akarere ka Muhanga wari ushinzwe igenamigambi avuga ko DUHAMIC ADRI yifatanyije n\u2019Akarere mu kwesa imihigo ine irimo no kongera umusaruro ku bihingwa by\u2019umuceri n\u2019ibigoli."}
{"id": "15891", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15891", "title": "Ali Kimera", "text": "Ali Kimera ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru, ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umuzamu wa Busoga United. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15892", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15892", "title": "Jimmy Kirunda", "text": "James C. Kirunda (1950 - 25 Gicurasi 2020) yari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda akaba n'umuyobozi w'umupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. \nYitabiriye imikino itanu yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika ndetse anayobora Uganda mu marushanwa atatu yanyuma.\nYabaye umuyobozi w'ikipe y'igihugu hagati yo muri 1989 na 1996. "}
{"id": "15893", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15893", "title": "Igishanga cya Ruterana", "text": "Igishanga cya Ruterana, giherereye mu murenge wa Rongi mu karere ka Muhanga.\nIbyo wamenya ku Igishanga cya Ruterana.\nIgishanga cya Ruterana, cyo mu karere ka Muhanga, k\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019umushinga protos bigishijwe kwita kubidukikije,ndetse banahabwa ubumenyi mu gutunganya uturima twigikoni.uyu mushinga wari usanzwe ubafasha wahagaritse ibikorwa byawo maze ubyegurira akarere ka muhanga.Ubwo abo baturage bavuga ko bageze kuri byinshi, ngo haracyari byinshi bari bizeye ko bazakora k\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019umushinga, akaba ariho bahera basaba akarere ka muhanga kubaba hafi muburyo bwimyumvire ndetse no mubushobozi.Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Muhanga,nabwo bwizeza aba baturage ko buzakomeza kubafasha nkuko bwari busanzwe bukorana n\u2019uyumushinga, ariko kandi bunasaba abaturage kugira uruhare mu gusigasira ibyo bagezeho.Abaturage bavuga babihuriraho n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019umushinga protos, aho busaba akarere, gukomeza kuba hafi abaturage mu rwego rwo kubafasha gukomeza kugira imibereho myiza.Mu ubufatanye kuva mu mwaka wa 2014, ni bwo abo baturage batangiye gufashwa muri gahunda zigamije kurengera ibidukikije, ndetse no kuzamura imibereho yabo, ubu bakaba bashyizwe mu maboko y\u2019Akarere byumwihariko, nyuma yuko ibikorwa byumushinga bigeze kumusozo."}
{"id": "15894", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15894", "title": "Ronnie Kiseka", "text": "Ronnie Kisekka (wavutse 5 Ukuboza 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nka myugariro. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroc. "}
{"id": "15895", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15895", "title": "Henri Kisekka", "text": "Henry Kisekka (wavutse 31 Kanama 1989) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi wo k'uruhande w'ikipe ya Aizawl muri shampiyona ya I.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAfatwa nk'umukinnyi w'ingenzi mu bashaka ibitero muri Dong Nai muri 2012, yatsinze ibitego 11, afasha ikipe ye kugera ku ntera. Ntibyatinze, yakiriye guhamagarwa mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mbere y\u2019amajonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi cyo muri 2014. \nBinh Duong FC yahagaritse amasezerano ya Henry Kisekka muri 2016. \nMohammedan.\nKu ya 6 Mata 2022, hatangajwe ko ikipe ya shampiyona ya I mu ikipe ya Mohammedan yarangije gusinyisha Kisekka mu ikipe ya Bhawanipore ikorera mu mujyi wa Kolkata. Ku ya 30 Mata, yatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri \"Black Panthers\" na NEROCA. Ku butegetsi bwa Nikola Stojanovi\u0107, ikipe ye ku nshuro ya mbere, yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona y\u2019igihugu cya mbere muri shampiyona ya 2021-22, ariko yarangije ari igisonga nyuma yo gutsindwa na Gokulam Kerala ibitego 2-1. \nAizawl.\nKu ya 21 Nzeri, mbere yuko shampiyona yo muri 2022-23 shampiyona itangira, Aizawl yatangaje ko yasinyishije Kisekka. Yatangiye gukinira iyi kipe ku ya 15 Ugushyingo na TRAU banganyije 1-1. "}
{"id": "15896", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15896", "title": "Joel Kitamirike", "text": "Joel Derick Kitamirike (wavutse 5 Mata 1984) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga w'akinnye nka myugariro. Yakiniye ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya mbere ya Brentford muri shampiyona ya 2003\u201304 ndetse no muri Dundee yo muri shampiyona ya Sikotishi muri 2005. Ikipe ye aheruka ni Chelmsford City. Yavukiye muri Uganda, yimukira mu Bwongereza akiri umwana kandi afite ubwenegihugu bw'Ubwongereza.\nUgushyingo 2008 yakatiwe igifungo cy\u2019amezi 20 azira gutanga ibiyobyabwenge byo mu rwego rwa A. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKitamirike yavukiye i Kampala, muri Uganda, mu 1984 aza mu Bwongereza afite imyaka itandatu. Yatangiye umwuga we nk'umukinnyi mu bana ba Chelsea, aho yagaragaye inshuro imwe munsi yabafite imyaka 17, ahagarara mu gikombe cya UEFA na Hapoel Tel Aviv, ubwo abakinnyi benshi batagiye muri Isiraheli kubera guhungabanya n'umutekano. Yinjiye muri Brentford ku ntizanyo muri Nzeri 2003, yongera ngutizwa mu Gushyingo 2003 mu gihe gisigaye cya shampiyona yo muri 2003\u201304, aho yakinnye imikino 25 ya shampiyona ndetse n\u2019igikombe muri Brentford. Yarekuwe na Chelsea mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2003\u201304, nyuma yi geragezwa n\u2019ikipe yo mubuholandi Willem II Tilburg na Walsall, yinjira mu mujyi wa Mansfield mu Kuboza 2004 nta masezerano yagiranye. Yakiniye Mansfield inshuro ebyiri mbere yo kwinjira muri Dundee muri Mutarama 2005 ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Yatangiye gukina mukibuga muri Dundee inshuro zirindwi, muri shampiyona yo muri 2004\u201305 ubwo iyi kipe yasezererwaga muri shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cya Sikotishi ndetse ikongera kugaragara inshuro ebyiri mbere yo kuva muri iyi kipe mu Gushyingo 2005 nyuma yo kwemeranya gusesa amasezerano. Nyuma y'amezi abiri, yinjiye mu ikipe nkuru yo muri majori, mu ikipe ya Columbus Crew. \nYagaragaye rimwe muri Crew mbere yo kugwa mu mupira w'amaguru utari shampiyona yu Bwongereza no gukinira Fisher Athletic na Weymouth. Yarekuwe na Weymouth muri Gashyantare 2008 yinjira mu ikipe ya Chelmsford City, akaba yarigaragaje rimwe mbere yo kuva muri iyi kipe mu mpera za shampiyona yo muri 2007\u201308. \nUgushyingo 2008 yakatiwe igifungo cy\u2019amezi 20 azira gutanga ibiyobyabwenge byo mu rwego rwa A. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKitamirike yari ahagarariye Ubwongereza ku rwego rw\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 15 muri 2004, ikipe y\u2019umupira w'amaguru y\u2019igihugu cya Uganda yamushyize mu ikipe yabo mu majonjora y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019isi ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu muri 2006 yakinnye na DR Congo muri Kamena 2004, akoresha amategeko mashya ya FIFA bituma yemererwa gukinira igihugu cye cy'amavuko kurwego mpuzamahanga rwose. Nubwo Kitamirike yari ashishikajwe no gukina, amategeko y\u2019abinjira muri Uganda ntiyemeraga ubwenegihugu bubiri. Kitamirike ntiyashakaga kureka ubwenegihugu bw'Ubwongereza kugira ngo abone pasiporo ya Uganda bityo abura umukino. "}
{"id": "15897", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15897", "title": "Igishanga cya Nyarububa", "text": "Igishanga cya Nyarububa gihuza Umurenge wa Cyungo na Rukozo mu Karere ka Rulindo.\nTumenye Igishanga cya Nyarububa.\nIgishanga cya Nyarububa gikikijwe n\u2019imisozi miremire mu kugitunganya, Leta yafatanyije n\u2019abaturage baca amaterasi y\u2019indinganire ku misozi ikikije icyo gishanga, amazi ntiyongera kubona aho amenera, baragikamura bakoresheje imigende y\u2019amazi, abaturage batangira guhinga ntacyo bishisha.Abo baturage bavuga ko nta wari wigeze agerageza kugihinga ngo asarure, kubera ko imvura yagwaga amazi aturuka muri iyo misozi akakirengera.Mbere yo gutunganya iki gishanga hashyirwa amaterasi ku misozi igikikije, hashyirwa n\u2019imiferege irinda amazi kwinjira muri icyo gishanga, nta muturage wahingaga ngo asarure. Bamaraga guhinga amazi akuzura igihingwa ushyizemo kikabora, ikibashije gushinga umuzi gitangiye gukura amazi y\u2019imvura akava muri ya misozi byose akabirengera.Igishanga cyari cyarabahombeje, cyarabateje inzara mu buryo bukomeye, barabagobotse baragitunganya, aheraga igice cy\u2019umufuka uraheza ibiri cyangwa itatu, ubuyobozi barabushimira cyane.Uwahingaga imigenda itanu yabonaga umusaruro w\u2019ibiro bitarenze 15, ubu umuntu arahinga akaba yakweza nka toni y\u2019ibigori, barashesha bakabona kawunga, barimo kurya neza, abana bameze neza nta kibazo. Ubuyobozi barabushimira cyane, icyo gishanga cyari ikibazo ariko ubu ni igisubizo.\nIbindi Wamenya ku Igishanga cya Nyarububa.\nUbuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Rulindo icyo busaba abaturage n\u2019uko bakoresha icyo gishanga bakagihingamo ibihingwa byateganyijwe. Nk\u2019uko babibonye mu minsi yashize, ubuyobozi bukuru bw\u2019Igihugu bwabageneye inyongeramusaruro ya nk\u2019unganire, ibyo byose ni bwa buyobozi bwiza buhora bwifuza ko umuturage yatera imbere.Abahinga mugishanga ubwabo barabyivugira ko mu mateka yabo icyo gishanga cyabayeho kitabafasha, ariko kubera imiyoborere myiza cyaratunganyijwe, Ubuyobozi burifuza ko bakibyaza umusaruro bagihingamo mu bihe byose by\u2019ihinga, ntihagire igihe kibacika, ariko bahingamo ibyo bagiriwemo inama n\u2019ubuyobozi byamaze gukorerwa ubushakashatsi, mu rwego rwo kubafasha kongera umusaruro. Ubuhinzi bube inkomoko y\u2019ubukungu nk\u2019uko biri mu cyerekezo Igihugu cyihaye."}
{"id": "15898", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15898", "title": "Fabian Kizito", "text": "Fabian Derrick Subi Kizito (yavutse 26 Nyakanga 1990) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi w'imbere mu kibuga muri SV TEC.\nUmwuga.\nKizito yavukiye i Kampala, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu Buholandi muri DOTO Pernis, RKSV Leonidas, DCV Krimpen, Veensche Boys, BVCB Bergschenhoek na VV Hillegersberg. Muri Kanama 2019 yasinyiye ikipe ya Suwede ya Nyk\u00f6pings BIS. \nYatsindiye ibitego bibiri muri Uganda muri 2012, atsinda igitego kimwe. Igitego cye cyaje ku ncuro ya mbere mu mukino wa gicuti na Misiri. Umukino we wa kabiri wari umukino wo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cyisi cya FIFA bakina na Angola. "}
{"id": "15899", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15899", "title": "Geoffrey Kizito", "text": "Geoffrey Baba Kizito (yavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe Than Quang Ninh yo muri Vietinami, nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i Kampa, kuva muri 2012 na 2013 yari muri Vietinamu hamwe na Xuan Thanh Sai Gon. Mu ntangiriro za Mutarama 2014 yasinyanye amasezerano yo gukinira shampiyona ya Kenya mu ikipe ya Gor Mahia. Yagarutse muri Vietinamu muri shampiyona yo muri 2015, hamwe na Than Quang Ninh. Muri 2018 yinjiye muri Saigon. Yimukiye muri Than Qu\u1ea3ng Ninh muri shampiyona yo muri 2020. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira mpuzamahanga muri Uganda mu 2012. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMuri 2017 yabaye umuturage ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Vietnam, ku izina rya Tr\u1ea7n Trung Hi\u1ebfu. "}
{"id": "15900", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15900", "title": "Joseph Kizito (umupira w'amaguru)", "text": "Joseph Nestroy Kizito (wavutse 27 Nyakanga 1982) ni umugande wahoze akina umupira w'amaguru wa babigize umwuga ukina nka myugariro.\nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, Kizito yari ahagarariye Uganda kuva muri 2001 kugeza 2011, amaze kwinjiza inshuro 39 mu ikipey'igihugu.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMu gihugu cye, Kizito yamaze imyaka ine muri Villa, afasha iyi kipe gutwara ibikombe bine bikurikirana (2000, 2001, 2002, na 2002\u201303) n'ibikombe bibiri bya Uganda (2000 na 2002). Yatsindiye igikombe cya Kagame Interclub muri 2003, mbere yo kwimukira mu mahanga.\nNyuma yo kuba uwashakira aho akina, Kizito yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri na Partizan ku ya 2 Nyakanga 2010. Yatangiye gukinira iyi kipe nyuma yiminsi 19, akina iminota 90 yuzuye, batsinda igitego 1-0 na shampiyona wa Arumeniya muri Pyunik, mu mikino ya kabiri yi cyiciro cya kabiri cya majonjora ya UEFA muri 2010\u201311. Mu mwaka wa 2010\u201311 muri Seribiya, Kizito yanzinze imikino 14, iyi kipe yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona. Yafashije kandi ikipe ye gutwara Igikombe cya Seribiya muri 2010\u201311, bityo ikusanya kabiri. Mu Kwakira 2011, Kizito yahagaritse amasezerano yagiranye na Partizan ku bwumvikane. \nNyuma yo gusubira mu gihugu cye, Kizito yasinyiye ikipe ya Victoriya yazamukiyemo muri kaminuza ya Victoriya muri Kanama 2012, ahakina umwaka umwe. Yaje kumarayo imyaka itatu yakurikiyeho, mbere yo kugenda muri Nyakanga 2015. Nyuma gato, Kizito yinjiye muri ikipe yo muri Uganda ya Lweza.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKizito yakinnye bwa mbere mu marushanwa ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2001. Yakomeje atsinda ibitego 39 muri Cranes mumyaka icumi yakurikiye. Muri Gashyantare 2012, Kizito yatangaje ko yeguye mu mupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKizito ukomoka mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya, yavukiye i Mutukula, muri Uganda ku mupaka wa Tanzaniya na Uganda. Ni murumuna wa Manfred Kizito, wari uhagarariye u Rwanda ku rwego mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "15901", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15901", "title": "Manfred Kizito", "text": "Manfred Kizito (wavutse 14 Werurwe 1980) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wacyuye igihe, wakinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. Yavukiye muri Uganda, yaserukiye u Rwanda mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKizito yavukiye i Kampala, muri Uganda, ubuzima bwe bwa mbere yakinnye muri Polisi hamwe na Villa, mbere yo kwimukira mu Rwanda muri 2005 gukinira APR FC na ATRACO FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nN'ubwo yavukiye muri Uganda, Kizito yahawe pasiporo y'u Rwanda, kandi ahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu cyu Rwanda, yahamagawe inshuro 19 mu ikipe y'igihugu hagati ya 2004 na 2007, harimo no mu mikino itandatu yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. \nUbuzima bwite.\nMurumuna we Nestroy nawe ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru. "}
{"id": "15902", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15902", "title": "Edward Kizza", "text": "Edward Kizza (wavutse 17 Ukuboza 1998)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi w'imbere mu kibuga muri Pittsburgh Riverhounds muri Shampiyona ya USL.\nUmwuga.\nKizza yavukiye i Kampala, yimukiye muri Amerika hamwe n'ababyeyi be afite imyaka 14. Yize umwaka wa mbere w'amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rya Carlisle mbere yo kwinjira mu ishuri rya Montverde Academy hafi ya Orlando, muri Floride. Hamwe na Montverde, Kizza yari muri gahunda ya SIMA kandi yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 41 mu bakinnyi ku mwanya wa 41 mu rwego rwigihugu na topdrawersoccer yavuye muri shampiyona nkuru. \nKu ya 5 Werurwe 2021, Kizza yasinyanye amasezerano y'umwuga na Revolution yo mu Bwongereza nyuma yo gushimisha abatoza muri shampiyona. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere muri Revolution ku ya 17 Mata 2021 muri shampiyona yabo yakinnye na Chicago Fire, yaje nk'umusimbura ku munota wa 83 banganya ibitego 2-2, maze akubita umupira ku mutwe. \nNyuma y'igihembwe cyo muri 2022, Kizza yarekuwe nu Bwongereza bushya. \nMemphis 901 (inguzanyo).\nKu ya 30 Werurwe 2022, Ubwongereza bwatangaje ko bagurije Kizza mu ikipe ya shampiyona ya USL Championship mu ikipe ya Memphis 901 mu gihe gisigaye cya shampiyona 2022. Kizza yahamagawe ari mu ntizanyo ye muri Nyakanga 2022.\nPittsburgh Riverhounds (inguzanyo).\nKu ya 15 Nyakanga 2022, ikipe yo muri shampiyona ya USL ya Pittsburgh Riverhounds SC yatangaje ko baguze Kizza ku ntizanyo mu gihe cyari gisigaye cya shampiyona muri 2022. \nPittsburgh Riverhounds.\nKu ya 13 Mutarama 2023, Kizza yimukiye i Riverhounds guturayo. "}
{"id": "15903", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15903", "title": "Mustafa Kizza", "text": "Mustafa Kizza (wavutse ku ya 3 Ukwakira 1999) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe yigihugu ya Uganda ukina inyuma kuruhande.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKCCA FC.\nKu ya 24 Gashyantare 2017, Kizza yashyizwe mu ikipe Kampala Capital City,i Lugogo. Ku ya 3 Werurwe 2017, Kizza yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya Kampala Capital City Authority na Bright Stars FC kuri stade ya Phillip Omondi Yatsinze igitego cya mbere mu mujyi wa Kampala Capital City Authority kuri Polisi FC ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 2017 kuri Stade ya Phillip Omondi Lugogo. Yagaragaye mu mikino 7 yakinnye na Kampala Capital City Authority. \nKizza yakinnye umukino wa mbere wa shampiyona bakina na Bright Stars FC kuri Stade ya Phillip Omondi StarTimes, Kampala Capital City Authority (yatsinze 2\u20131). Yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri shampiyona yatsinze Polisi FC kuri Stade ya Phillip Omondi i Lugoggo. Yakinnye imikino 23 muri shampiyona. Ubuyobozi bukuru bwa Kampala bwatwiye shampiyona. Kizza yarangije shampiyona ya 2018\u20132019 muri Uganda, afite imipira yavuyemo ibitego 25 muri kiriya gihembwe; ibitego 16 muri Uganda, 6 muri Caf, 4 mu Igikombe cya Uganda maze atsinda ibitego 2 muri shampiyona. \nKizza yakinnye umukino we wa mbere muri icyo gihembwe na Maroons FC, yakinnye imikino 24 ya Uganda Premier League akora 14 bafasha; 2 afasha muri Caf, no gutsinda ibitego 6. \nKizza yakinnye umukino we wa mbere wa shampiyona bakina na Wakiso Giants FC ku ya 31 Kanama 2019 maze batsinda muri uwo mukino, Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Umujyi wa Kampala bwatsinze igitego 1-0.\nCF Montr\u00e9al.\nMuri Nyakanga 2020, yasinye muri Impinduka ya Montreal (yaje kwitwa CF Montr\u00e9al muri 2021). Nyuma y'igihembwe cya 2021, amasezerano ya Kizza yangiwe na Montr\u00e9al. "}
{"id": "15904", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15904", "title": "Allan Kyambadde", "text": "Allan Kyambadde (wavutse 15 Mutarama 1996)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya El Gouna muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Misiri. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMuri Kanama 2019, Kyambadde yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Misiri ya El Gouna FC avuye muri Kampala Capital City Authority FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yatumiye Kyambadde kuba umwe mu bakinnyi b'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mu marushanwa y'ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019amarushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15905", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15905", "title": "Saidi Kyeyune", "text": "Saidi Kyeyune (wavutse 1 Mutarama 1993)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, ya mutumiwe kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15906", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15906", "title": "Melvyn Lorenzen", "text": "Melvyn Lorenzen (wavutse 26 Ugushyingo 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina ku ruhande bazatira izamu muri Wormatia Worms. Afite kandi ubwenegihugu bw'Ubudage. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nWerder Bremen.\nLorenzen yinjiye muri SV Werder Bremen muri 2013 avuye muri Holstein Kiel. Yatangiye bwa mbere Bundesliga ku ya 5 Ukwakira 2013 na VfB Stuttgart. Yasimbuye Eljero Elia nyuma y'iminota 88 banganya 1-1 i Stuttgart.\nADO Den Haag.\nMu mpera za Nyakanga 2017, Lorenzen yinjiye mu ikipe ya Eredivisie ADO Den Haag ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe FC Utrecht baza gutsindwa 3-0 m'urugo.\nKarpaty Lviv na Persela Lamongan.\nMuri Werurwe 2021, nyuma yo gutsinda AFC Wimbledon muri Nzeri 2020, Lorenzen yasinyanye amasezerano y'ukwezi kumwe n'ikipe ya Indoneziya ya Persela Lamongan yo muri Liga 1. \nSligo Rovers.\nKu ya 23 Kanama 2021, Lorenzen yasinyanye na Sligo Rovers yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Shampiyona yo muri Irilande mu mikino 13 yarisigaye muri shampiyona yabo muri 2021, nyuma y'ibyumweru bibiri imyitozo niyi kipe. Yavuye muri iyo kipe shampiyona irangiye. \nWormatia Worms.\nLorenzen yinjiye muri Wormatia Worms, wazamuwe muri Regionalliga S\u00fcdwest, muri Nzeri 2022. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nLorenzen yavukiye i Londere mu Bwongereza kuri se uvuka Uganda na nyina w'umudage. Amazina ye akomoka kuri nyina. Se yitwa Drake Mugisa. Mu 2016, yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda, maze atangira umukino wa mbere mu mukino wa gicuti yatsinzwe na Zimbabwe ibitego 2-0 ku ya 31 Gicurasi 2016. "}
{"id": "15907", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15907", "title": "Edrisa Lubega", "text": "Edrisa Lubega (wavutse 17 Mata 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nChristened 'Torres' nyuma ya Fernando Torres, yavukiye mu muryango ufite abana 4 kwa Mugisha Tumushabe na Rebecca Nakamya. \nYatsinze igitego cya mbere muri shampiyona ya Uganda muri 2016-17. \nMbere yuko Proline FC yazamurwa mu ntera, ubwo bakinaga muri shampiyona ya FUFA, niwe rutahizamu wabo wa mbere, watsinze ibitego 21, bituma ashobora gutorwa mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. \nIshuri rye ritabizi, Dynamic SS, Lubega yavuye gukinira Proline FC atabimenyesheje umuntu numwe, afitanye isano n\u2019ishuri cyangwa ubunyamabanga bw\u2019amarushanwa, bityo ntiyashobora kwitabira amarushanwa y\u2019ishuri rya Copa Coca-Cola muri 2016 akurikije amategeko. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nFloridsdorfer AC.\nMuri Gashyantare 2017, Lubega yatijwe muri Ositarariya, mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru mu cyiciro cya kabiri mu ikipe ya Floridedorfer AC. Yatangiye gukinira muri shampiyona muri iyi kipe ku ya 24 Gashyantare 2017 atsinda 1-0 iwayo batsinda Autriche Lustenau. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere cya shampiyona muri iyi kipe ku ya 12 Gicurasi 2017, atsinda igitego ku munota wa 10 yatsinze Wiener Neustadt ibitego 3-0. Igitego cye,yarahawe umupira na George Davies, cyatsinze na Floridsdorfer igitego 1-0. \nSV Ried.\nMuri Nyakanga 2018, Lubega yongeye gutizwa, kuri iyi nshuromuri SV Ried umwaka umwe, ahitamo kongera undi mwaka. Yatangiye gukina shampiyona muri iyi kipe ku ya 5 Kanama 2018, yandikisha umufasha ku izamu rya Thomas Mayer kuko Ried yatsinze WSG Wattens ibitego 2-1. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere cyo guhatanira iyi kipe ku ya 17 Kanama 2018 atsinda ibitego 3-0 iwayo bahananye na FC Liefering. Igitego cye, cyatsinzwe ku munota wa 45 kandi afashijwe na Manuel Kerhe, bituma batsinda igitego 1-0 kuri Ried. \nProline.\nMuri Kanama 2019, Lubega yagarutse muri Proline asinya amasezerano y'umwaka umwe gusa. \nEstrela.\nKu ya 17 Nyakanga 2021, yinjiye muri Estrela da Amadora muri Porutugali ku nguzanyo. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMilutin Sredojevi\u0107 yashyize Edrisa Lubega mu ikipe ye igizwe n'abantu 30 mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. Yatangiye gukina imikino mpuzamahanga ku ya 27 Mutarama 2016, aje asimbuye ku munota wa 79 asimbuye Erisa Ssekisambu banganya na Zimbabwe igitego 1-1 mu cyiciro cya Shampiyona y\u2019Afurika. "}
{"id": "15908", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15908", "title": "Azake Luboyera", "text": "Azake Luboyera (yavutse 6 Mata 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina mu b'imbere.\nGukina umwuga.\nUrubyiruko.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Hans Production Academy muri Uganda, Luboyera yaje kwinjira muri Aspire Academy yo muri Qatar muri 2012. Nyuma yo kuva muri Aspire muri 2014, Luboyera yinjiye muri gahunda ya Ottawa Fury muri 2015. \nOttawa Fury.\nKu ya 20 Nyakanga 2017 Luboyera yasinye amasezerano ye ya mbere y'umwuga muri Ottawa Fury. Yatangiye umwuga we muri Ottawa nyuma y'iminsi icyenda, atsinda igitego cyo gufungura itsinze rya Toronto FC II ibitego 2-0. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nLuboyera yakinnye imikino ibiri mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda y'abatarengeje imyaka 20, mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo guhatanira yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika mu baterengeje imyaka 20 muri 2017. "}
{"id": "15909", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15909", "title": "Charles Lukwago", "text": "Charles Lukwago (wavutse ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 1992) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umuzamu, mu ikipe ya Saint George yo muri Etiyopiya, ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMu mpeshyi 2021, Lukwago yasinyiye ikipe ya Saint George yo muri Etiyopiya Premier League ku masezerano yimyaka ibiri. "}
{"id": "15910", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15910", "title": "Halid Lwaliwa", "text": "Halid Lwaliwa (wavutse ku ya 22 Kanama 1996) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinyi wo hagati mu kibuga wa FK Bregalnica \u0160tip hamwe n'ikipe yumupira w'amaguru ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nLwaliwa wavukiye Iganga, Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye ryitiriwe Mutagatifu Mariya i Kitende, mbere yo gutangira umwuga we w\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Vipers SC aho yazamuwe mu ikipe nkuru muri 2014. Yasinye amasezerano yo kongera amasezerano muri Kanama 2018. Mu 2022, Halid yinjiye mu karere ka FK Bregalnica mu majyaruguru ya Makedoniya. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye ku rwego mpuzamahanga ku ya 21 Nzeri 2019 atsinda u Burundi ibitego 3-0 mu majonjora yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2020. "}
{"id": "15911", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15911", "title": "Taddeo Lwanga", "text": "Taddeo Lwanga (wavutse ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina muri Arta Solar7 muri shampiyona ya Djibouti ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAkiri muto, yari umunyamuryango wa Ndejje United FC mu cyiciro cya kabiri, mbere yo kwitabira igikombe cya Buganda Masaza cya Kyadondo. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nExpress FC.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, Lwanga yinjiye muri Express FC. Yatangiye gukinira Express FC ihanganye na Polisi FC ku ya 11 Gashyantare 2014. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Express FC bakina na Lweza Football Club ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 2014. \nSC Villa.\nMuri 2015, yinjiye muri SC Villa atangira bakina na Bright Stars i Mwererwe ku ya 25 Kanama 2015. Yagaragaje ibihe bitazibagirana muri Sports Club Villa, igitego yatsinze Al Khartoum SC yo muri Sudani mu gikombe cya CAF Confederations Cup muri Gashyantare 2016. Taddeo yagize ibihe byiza bifasha SC Villa kurangiza umwanya wa kabiri muri shampiyona ya Uganda. \nVipers SC.\nMuri 2017, Lwanga yinjiye muri Vipers SC maze asinyana amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Yatangiye gukinira Bright Stars FC ku ya 12 Nzeri 2017. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri Vipers SC na Proline FC ku ya 24 Ukuboza 2017 kuri Stade ya Mutagatifu Mariya. \nTanta.\nMuri Kanama 2019, Lwanga yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Misiri muri Tanta SC. \nSimba SC.\nKu ya 2 Ukuboza 2020, Lwanga yinjiye muri Simba SC ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. \nArta / Solar7.\nKu ya 19 Kanama 2022, Lwanga yinjiye muri Arta Solar7 nk'umukinnyi w'igenga ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nTaddeo yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda bakina n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Malawi mu mukino wa gicuti wabereye kuri sitade Kamuzu. "}
{"id": "15912", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15912", "title": "Brian Majwega", "text": "Brian Majwega ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina hagati mu kibuga, akaba umukinnyi wa KCCA FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15913", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15913", "title": "Simeon Masaba", "text": "Simeon Masaba (wavutse ku ya 23 Werurwe 1983) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira muri shampiyona ya Uganda, mu ikipe Uganda Revenue Authority SC, aho akina nka myugariro.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Polisi Jinja muri shampiyona ya Uganda, mbere yo kwerekeza muri Villa SC muri 2004. Yagarutse muri Polisi Jinja muri 2006 maze muri 2008 atangira gukina inshuro ebyiri na Villa SC muri 2008. Simeon Masaba ahitamo kwinjira muri Uganda Revenue Authority, kumasezerano y'umwaka umwe ku mashiringi miliyoni 10..\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMasaba yakiniye ubu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. Yakinnye imikino 69, atsinda ibitego 7."}
{"id": "15914", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15914", "title": "Tom Masiko", "text": "Tom Masiko (wavutse 17 Gashyantare 1996) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Wakiso Giants, nk'umukinnyi ukina imbere.\nUmwuga.\nYakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri ikipe ya Kampala Capital City Authority, muri Vipers na Wakiso Giants. \nYatangiye gukinira imikino mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2013. "}
{"id": "15915", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15915", "title": "Geofrey Massa", "text": "Geofrey Massa (wavutse 19 Gashyantare 1986) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira muri shampiyona ya KTFF S\u00fcper Lig k'uruhande rwa K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck Kaymakl\u0131 muri Chiypure ya ruguru.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i Jinja, Massa yatangiye umwuga we muri 2004 hamwe n'ikipe ya Police FC muri shampiyona ya Uganda, mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Al-Masry Club yo mu Misiri muri 2005. Yakinnye imyaka itatu muri Egiputa mbere yo kwimukira mu 2008 mu ikipe yo muri Afurika yepfo ya Jomo Cosmos, yakinnye imikino 14 atsinda igitego kimwe. Muri 2008, yavuye muyo kipe asubira mu Misiri maze asinyana na Itesalat. Massa yinjiye ku ya 14 Nzeri 2011 muri shampiyona ya Telsim Super League, mu ikipe ya Yenicami A\u011fdelen SK. Ku ya 21 Kanama 2013, yasinyanye amasezerano na kaminuza yo muri Afurika y'Epfo ya Pretoria FC yo kuyikinira. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMassa yagiye agaragara mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda, akaza bwa mbere muri 2005. "}
{"id": "15916", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15916", "title": "Rogers Mato", "text": "Rogers Mato (wavutse ku ya 10 Ukwakira 2003) Ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina muri shampiyona ya Uganda, mu ikipe ya KCCA FC ndetse n'ikipe yi gihugu ya uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nNk'umusore Mato yakiniye ikipe ya Lweza FC na Maroons FC muri ya shampiyona y'abato. Muri 2018 yinjiye mu ikipe yabato ya Proline FC muri shampiyona ya FUFA. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2019\u201320, Mato yazamuwe mu ikipe nkuru, ariko yaje gusezererwa n'iyi kipe muri shampiyona kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. Yabaye umukinnyi w'ingenzi muri iyi kipe muri gihembwe cyakurikiyeho, abayobora mu majonjora yo kuzamukahe juru yo kuza igihe gito atsinze Gadaffi FC. Muri Nzeri 2021 hatangajwe ko uyu mukinnyi yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 4 na shampiyona wa Uganda ku inshuro ya 13 KCCA FC ku giciro kitaramenyekana. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, Mato yahamagawe mu ikipe nkuru y'igihugu mu mukino wo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2022 nu Rwanda. Nyuma y'amezi abiri yagaragaye mu ikipe y'igihugu mu mukino wo kwitoza n'ikipe ihagarariye yo mu karere ka Nyaruguru. Mato yafunguye amazamu m'ugihe ikipe y'igihugu yagiye gutsinda 3\u20131. Muri Mutarama 2022, yongeye guhamagarwa mu mikino itanu ya gicuti n\u2019impande z\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi na Aziya ubwo Cranes yagendaga muri Turukiya, Iraki, na Bahirayine. Yakomeje gukina umukino wa mbere mu mukino ubanza na Isilande ku ya 12 Mutarama 2022. Yatangiye akina iminota mirongo inani amaherezo anganya 1-1. "}
{"id": "15917", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15917", "title": "Sula Matovu", "text": "Sula Matovu (wavutse ku ya 17 Nyakanga 1992) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nka rutahizamu akaba n'umukinnyi wo hagati muri Al-Orouba SC muri shampiyona ya Oman Professional League ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nMatovu yatangiye umwuga wo gukina akiri mu ishuri mbere yo kwinjira mu ishuri ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Proline FC mu 2007. Igihe yari muri iryo shuri yerekanye ubushobozi budasanzwe n\u2019imikorere ikomeye maze yinjira muri Nalubaale Buikwe muri shampiyona ya Uganda Super League. Nyuma y'igihembwe kimwe yinjiye muri Proline FC aho yatsindaga buri gihe muri Uganda, kubera ubuhanga bwe bukomeye, nu muvuduko mwinshi ubwo yakuyemo abo bahanganye, gutsinda neza no kwambuka umupira, kugenzura neza umupira, kugenzura no gutambuka ndetse no kwerekana neza m'umikino y'umupira w'amaguru yashimishije umutoza w'ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru wa Uganda, Bobby Williamson wamuhamagaye mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. Yagaragaye kandi mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya batarengeje imyaka 20 ya Uganda ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya 23 ya Uganda. \nMutagatifu George FC (Inguzanyo).\nMuri Mutarama 2011, Matovu yimukiye mu ikipe ya Saint George FC yo muri Etiyopiya yatojwe na Giuseppe Dossena ku masezerano y'inguzanyo y'amezi 6. \nErbil SC.\nMuri Kanama 2012, Matovu yarangije kwimuka umwaka umwe muri Erbil SC. Ku ya 25 Nzeri 2012, mu mukino wa kabiri wa kimwe cya kane kirangiza muri Aziya, Matovu yatsinze Erbil SC igitego cya mbere mu minota 37 ku munota wa 1 na Kelantan bituma Erbil SC ikomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 2012, yaje asimbuye ku munota wa 46 ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Aziya yakinnye na Al Kuwait maze Erbil SC ikomeza gutsindwa ibitego 4\u20130. Ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 2012, Matovu yatsinze igitego cya mbere cya shampiyona yo muri Iraki hamwe na Kurdish ku minota wa 7 yatsinze Al Sulimaniya ibitego 3-2. \nBK H\u00e4cken.\nNyuma y'igihembwe gishimishije hamwe na Erbil SC yo muri Iraki, ikipe ya BK H\u00e4cken yo muri Suwede Allsvenskan yamutumiye mu igeragezwa by'ibyumweru 3 aho yashimishije iyi kipe ya tekinike maze aba umukinnyi wihuta cyane m'umateka y'ikipe maze arasinya. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri BK H\u00e4cken itsinze FC Dallas mu mukino wa mbere wa shampiyona kuva yatangira kuba umukinnyi ucyenewe mu ikipe ya Gothenburg BK H\u00e4cken.\nAbayobozi ba Kaizer.\nNyuma yo kumara 2014 mu ikipe ya BK H\u00e4cken yo muri Suwede ya Allsvenskan, yahujwe no kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Kaizer Chiefs muri shampiyona yo muri Afurika yepfo ku ya 20 Kamena 2015. Yatangiye imyitozo hamwe na Kaizer Chiefs ku ya 24 Kamena 2015 nyuma asinyana amasezerano y\u2019amezi atandatu ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2015. Sula yatsinze igitego cya kane yatsinze 4\u20130 yatsinze Volcan de Moroni wa komore muri 2016 marushanwa ya CAF. "}
{"id": "15918", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15918", "title": "Boban Zirintusa", "text": "Boban Zirintusa Bogere (wavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1992) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda, ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya Mtibwa muri Shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere muri Tanzaniya ndetse no mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nBoban yabanje gukina muri Vipers na Simba zo muri Tanzaniya, Mtibwa Sugar yo muri Tanzaniya, Dynamos na Highfield zo muri Zimbabwe, Polokwane city yo muri Afurika y'Epfo, Buildcon yo muri Zambiya na Etiyopiya Coffee yo muri Etiyopiya. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nInzoka.\nBoban yageze muri iyo kipe mu mwaka wa 2006 rw'agati muri shampiyona. Yasinywe n'umutoza Charles Ayiekoh, kugirango akomeze ikipe mugihe cyo guhangana ni cyiciro cya mbere muri shampiyona wa Vipers muri shampiyona yambere. Yabaye muri iyo kipe y'amateka yarokotse kumanuka kumutwe nyuma yo kutsindwa ibitego 4-1 bya Kampala United ku mukino wa kabiri uheruka gukina na shampiyona yo muri 2006 mbere yo kuva muri Vipers muri 2008. \nDynamos.\nYinjiye muri Dynamos muri Highfield FC muri Mutarama 2013. Boban Zirintusa yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Dynamos ubwo ibihangange bya Harare byatsindaga umukino wa mbere wa Champiyona mu cyiciro cya mbere cyatsinze na Lesotho Correctional Services FC kuri sitade Rufaro. Boban yaje kuza asimbuye Tichaona Mabvura ku munota wa 68. \nUmujyi wa Polokwane.\nBoban yinjiye mu mujyi wa Polokwane FC mu Kwakira 2014 avuye muri Dynamos. Boban wasimbuye mu gice cya kabiri, yatsinze igitego cya mbere ku mukino wa mbere yakinnye muri Polokwane nyuma y\u2019ubufasha bwa Esau Kanyenda ku munota wa 47 kugira ngo afashe Umujyi wa Polokwane guhagarika Bidvest Wits kuri 2\u20130 muri shampiyona ya ligue ya ABSA. \nKubaka.\nKu ya 24 Nyakanga 2017, Zirintusa yemeye amasezerano n\u2019ikipe yo muri Zambiya yitwa Buildcon Football club. \nIkipi yimikino ya Kawa ya Etiyopiya.\nMuri Mutarama 2018, Boban yagiye gukina muri Etiyopiya Coffee Sports Club. \nKirinya - Jinja Amashuri Yisumbuye.\nMuri Nzeri 2019, yinjiye muri Kirinya - Jinja Senior Secondary School FC. atangiye gukinara Bul FC. \nMtibwa.\nMuri Mutarama 2020, Boban yongeye gukinira Mtibwa. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBoban yanyuze mu ikipe y'igihugu yu mupira w'amaguru yashyizweho, ikiniye Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20, kugeza mu ikipe nkuru, nyamara yatangiye gukinira ikipe ye y'igihugu nkuru mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya Berezile muri 2014 Uganda na Liberiya, ku ya 24 Werurwe 2013 i Samuel K.Doe Sitade Imikino muri Monoroviya. "}
{"id": "15919", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15919", "title": "Ismail Watenga", "text": "Ismail Watenga (yavutse 15 Gicurasi 1995) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nk'umuzamu mu ikipe ya Vipers SC \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sredojevi\u0107, ya mutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019amarushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, kunganya na Zimbabwe, no gutsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15920", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15920", "title": "Hassan Wasswa", "text": "Hassan Mawanda Wasswa (yavutse ku ya 14 Gashyantare 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga, ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda, ukinira ikipe ya Jeddah yo muri Arabiya Sawudite ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKu ya 4 Mutarama 2017, Wasswa yimukiye mu ikipe ya Nejmeh yo muri Libani. Ariko, kubera ibibazo by'imvune, ntabwo yagaragaye muri iyi kipe. Muri Kanama 2019, Wasswa yinjiye mu ikipe ya Jeddah Club yo muri Arabiya Sawudite. "}
{"id": "15921", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15921", "title": "Geoffrey Wasswa", "text": "Geofrey Wasswa Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nka myugariro muri shampiyona ya Uganda, mu ikipe ya SC Villa hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga w'urubyiruko.\nWasswa yatangiye umwuga we wu mupira w'amaguru akiri umwana muri Haka Academy, aho yateye imbere mu mupira w'amaguru, mu ishuri ubwo yinjiraga mu mashuri yisumbuye kuri St Mary's Kitende yatorewe kuba umukinnyi mwiza w'iburasirazuba muri shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru ya Airtel Raising Stars. ku ishuri kuri St Marys Kitende, Wasswa yatsinze ibikombe byinshi bya Copa Coca-Cola mu ishuri ndetse na shampiyona y'ishuri rya Afrika y'uburasirazuba.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nVipers SC.\nYinjiye muri Vipers SC mu 2015 afite imyaka 16. Yakinnye imikino 72 atsinda ibitego 8, muri 2015\u201316 Wasswa yari mu ikipe ya Junior ariko anakinira Ikipe nkuru. wasswa yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya Vipers SC Senior muri 2016 na Bul FC kuri stade Nakivubo umukino Vipers SC yatsinze igitego 1-0 \nYatsindiye ibikombe byinshi hamwe na Vipers SC muri 2018 muri shampiyona ya Uganda. \nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2016\u201317, yatsindiye Igikombe cya Uganda kuri Vipers sc maze atorerwa kuba Uganda, umukinnyi ufite impano nziza na Azam abaterankunga ba shampiyona. Yakinnye imikino 18.\nWasswa Geoffrey yagiye agaragara muri Vipers SC ku mugabane ndetse anakina imikino myinshi haba mu gikombe cya CAF Confederations Cup, CAF Champions League na El Merrichk wo muri Sudani ndetse na CS Constantaine wo muri Alijeriya haba mu gihugu ndetse no hanze yacyo. \nSC Villa.\nWasswa yasinyiye SC Villa muri Mutarama 2021. Ku mukino wa mbere yakiniye kaminuza ya Ndejje University FC, maze yatsinze igitego afasha ikipe ye nshya kujya mu gikombe cya Uganda.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu myaka 18, Wasswa Geoffrey yatangiye gukinira amakipe y'abatarengeje imyaka, mu byiciro byinshi nko muri COSAFA, hagati Zambiya ikina Uganda abataregeje imyaka 20, Lesthoso ikina Uganda, Zimbabwe ikina Uganda, hamwe na Uganda ikina Misiri.\nMuri Werurwe 2018, Wasswa Geoffrey yakiriye guhamagarwa mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda n'umutoza S\u00e9bastien Desabre mu kiruhuko kiri mpuzamahanga ariko ntiyigeze aba mu ikipe ya nyuma ariko anakurikiranwa n'ikipe ya tekinike ya Cranes."}
{"id": "15922", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15922", "title": "Ivan Wani", "text": "Ivan Wani Adebo Levi (wavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1998), uzwi ku izina rya Ivan Wani, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati, mu ikipe ya Busoga United FC yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Sudani y'Amajyepfo.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nWani ya maze gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Sudani y'Amajyepfo. "}
{"id": "15923", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15923", "title": "Solomon Walusimbi", "text": "Walusimbi Solomon (wavutse 19 Nzeri 1999) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nka rutahizamu mu ikipe ya Maroons FC muri shampiyona ya Uganda. \nikipe.\nMaroons FC.\nWalusimbi yatangiye gukina muri Maroons FC ku ya 15 Nzeri 2016, ku munsi wo gutangiza shampiyona nkuru yo muri 2016-17, na Paidha Black Angels kuri sitade Bar Okoro mu karere ka Zombo, maze umukino urangira banganyije ibitego 2-2. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Maroons FC ku ya 13 Ukwakira 2016 ku munota wa 82 bakina na Bright Light FC, Maroons FC yatsinze ibitego 2-0. Yatsinze igitego cyenda mu kwiyamamaza atsinda Sporting United ibitego 4-1 muri FUFA. Mu mukino wanyuma wo muri 2016/17 FUFA, Walusimbi yatsinze igitego cyatsinze Maroons FC bityo azamurwa muri Uganda muri 2017-2018. Yatsinze ibitego 9 byose muri Maroons FC mu gihe cyo kwiyamamaza Big League. \nKu ya 24 Ukwakira 2017, Walusimbi yerekanye bwa mbere muri shampiyona muri Uganda, ubwo yinjiraga nk'umusimbura ku munota wa 72 wa William Wadri maze atsinda igitego ku munota wa 78 bakina na Masavu FC, Maroons FC yatsinze igitego 1-0. Muri shampiyona ya mbere ya Uganda yatsinze ibitego bitanu mu mikino 24 ya shampiyona. "}
{"id": "15924", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15924", "title": "Godfrey Walusimbi", "text": "Godfrey Walusimbi (wavutse ku ya 3 Nyakanga 1989) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi w'ibumoso mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. Niwe mukinnyi wa mbere ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda wakinnye imikino mpuzamahanga irenga 100. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMuri Kamena 2011, Walusimbi yagiye muri Suwede mu igeragezwa, ryi byumweru bibiri hamwe n'ikipe ya Allsvenskan kuruhande rwa BK H\u00e4cken. \nCS Don Bosco.\nMuri Mutarama 2013, yavuye i Bunamwaya yerekeza muri DR Congo muri CS Don Bosco. Amaze amezi make hamwe nikipe, yahagaritse amasezerano ye bitewe n'umusaruro mucye. Yagarutse mu ikipe yahoze yitwa SC Villa. \nGor Mahia.\nMu Kuboza 2013, Walusimbi yinjiye muri Shampiyona yo muri Kenya mu ikipe ya Gor Mahia aho yatozwaga na Bobby Williamson wahoze atoza ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nAbayobozi ba Kaizer.\nMuri Kanama 2018, Walusimbi yimukiye mu ikipe ya Kaizer Chiefs yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yo mu cyiciro cya mbere, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka itatu. Ikiguzi cyo kwimura cyari hafi miliyoni 4.4 z'amafaranga y'Afurika y'Epfo. Yatangiye gukina shampiyona muri iyi kipe ku ya 18 Nzeri 2018, akina iminota mirongo icyenda yose yatsinze ibitego 2-0 bahanganye na Free State Stars. Muri Mutarama 2019, Walusimbi yavuye muri iyo kipe, ahitamo gusubira gukina mu rugo muri Uganda. \nVllaznia.\nMuri Nzeri 2019, Walusimbi yinjiye mu ikipe ya KF Vllaznia Shkod\u00ebr yo muri Alubaniya Superliga ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. Yavuye muri iyo kipe shampiyona irangiye. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 4 Nzeri 2010, Walusimbi yerekeje mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mu mukino wo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika muri 2012 na Angola mu rwego rwo gusimbura Nestory Kizito wakomeretse. Ku ya 16 Mata 2011, yafashije Ikipe ya Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 23 gutsinda ibitego 2-1 byatsinzwe na Tanzaniya mu majonjora yo gukina imikino ya Afurika yose yitwaye neza aho yatsindiye igitego cya mbere akoresheje imirimo yo guhanga ku ruhande rw'ibumoso. Ku ya 4 Kamena 2011, yatsinze Gineya-Bisawu mu mukino ukomeye wo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2012. Igitego nicyo cya mbere mu gutsinda ibitego 2-0 kuri cranes ya babonye iri mu itsinda rya mbere rya J imbere ya Stade y'igihugu ya Mandela yuzuye.\u00a0"}
{"id": "15925", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15925", "title": "Enock Walusimbi", "text": "Enock Walusimbi (wavutse ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa Uganda ukina nka myugariro muri shampiyona ya Scotthead League One mu ikipe ya Peterhead ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nWalusimbi yavukiye i Kampala. \nNyuma yo gukina na Shafranto na Nansana United, Walusimbi yakiniye Bright Stars hagati muri 2016 na 2020. Walusimbi yasinyiye Express FC ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri muri Nzeri 2020, maze ahabwa kapiteni w'iyi kipe mbere ya shampiyona yo muri 2020\u201321. Yatsinze muri shampiyona ya Uganda Premier League muri cyiciro cya mbere hamwe na Express. \nMu mpeshyi 2022, byavuzwe ko Walusimbi yakoreye ibizamini muri ikipe ya Dundee United yo muri shampiyona ya Scottish Premiership. Walusimbi yasinye muri Scottish League One mu ikipe ya Peterhead muri Nzeri 2022. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nAmaze kuyobora kapiteni wa Uganda abatarengeje imyaka 23, yakinnye bwa mbere muri Uganda ku ya 29 Kanama 2021 ubwo yatsindwaga na gicuti bakina na Etiyopiya 2\u20131. "}
{"id": "15926", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15926", "title": "Moses Waiswa", "text": "Moses Waiswa Ndhondhi (wavutse ku ya 20 Mata 1997) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya SuperSport United, nk'umukinnyi wo hagati utera.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i Kampala, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu ikipe ya V\u00e4xj\u00f6 United hamwe na Vipers. Yasinyiye Vipers muri Mutarama 2017. Yatsindiye Shampiyona yo muri Uganda muri 2017\u201318 hamwe niyi kipe. Muri Mutarama 2020 yasinyiye ikipe ya SuperSport United yo muri Afrika yepfo. Ku ya 25 Mutarama 2020 yatangiye gukinira SuperSport United na Chippa United. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2017. Yatsinze igitegocya mbere nyuma yo guhamagarwa mu ikipe yi gihugu. "}
{"id": "15927", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15927", "title": "Innocent Wafula", "text": "Innocent Esimu Wafula (wavutse ku ya 1 Mata 1998) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nka myugariro muri shampiyona uganda ya Premier League mu ikipe ya KCCA FC ndetse nikipe yigihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nWafula yinjiye muri Chemelil Sugar muri 2014 maze atangira gukinira Muhoroni youth, ku ya 22 Gashyantare 2014. Chemelil Sugar yatsinze 2\u20130 Wafula atanga imipira yavuyemo ibitego. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kuri Chemelil Sugar bakina na Tusker ku ya 23 Mata 2014 kuri Sitade ya Ruaraka i Nayirobi. \nWafula yinjiye muri Gor Mahia muri 2015 avuye muri Chemelil Sugar. Mu mukino wa mbere yakinnye batsinze KCB umukino urangira ari 1-0. Muri Mutarama 2017 yasinye amasezerano mashya y'imyaka ibiri muri Gor Mahia. Ku ya 17 Nzeri 2017, Wafula yatsinze igitego kitazibagirana muri Gor Mahia ikina na SoNy Sugar kuri Stade y'igihugu ya Nyayo, nibwo Gor Mahia itigeze iba ku nshuro ya 15 y'igikombe cya shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Kenya bityo itwara umwaka wa gatatu ukurikirana. \nWafula yinjiye muri Vipers SC muri Mutarama 2019 asinya amasezerano y'imyaka itatu., \nWafula yinjiye muri Mbarara City FC muri Mutarama 2021, avuye muri Vipers SC ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. Yatangiye bwa mbere ku ya 13 Mata 2021 na MYDA. \nKu ya 24 Kanama 2021, Wafula yasinyanye amasezerano y'umwaka na KCCA FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nWafula yatangiye gukinira mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ku ya 6 Nzeri 2021 bakina na Mali mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi muri 2022, ubwo yinjiraga nk'umusimbura wasimbuye Emmanuel Okwi ku munota wa 69. Umukino wabereye kuri Stade ya St Mary-Kitende urangira 0\u20130. \nUbuzima bwite.\nWafula yabyawe na nyakwigendera Bwire Ogutu na Mary Omoding bo mu Karere ka Busia. "}
{"id": "15929", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15929", "title": "Minisiteri ishinzwe imicungire y'ibiza n'impunzi", "text": "Minisiteri ishinzwe imicungire y'ibiza n'impunzi (\"Ministry of Disaster Management and Refugee Affairs\", MIDIMAR) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe gukumira no guhangana n'ibiza. Ishinzwe kandi ibibazo by'impunzi.\nUbu iyi minisiteri yitwa MINEMA (\"Ministry in Charge of Emergency Management\"). Kuva muri Kanama 2023, Minisitiri wayo ni Albert Murasira.\nInshingano.\nIcyerekezo cya MINEMA ni igihugu gishobora guhangana n'ibiza, kandi gicunga neza ibibazo by'impunzi.\nMINEMA ishinzwe gukumira ibiza, kugabanya ingaruka zabyo, gutabara, no gusana nyuma y'ibiza. Ibyo biza birimo imyuzure, imitingito n'inkangu. Ishinzwe kandi politiki y'impunzi ihuje n'amategeko y'u Rwanda n'amasezerano mpuzamahanga.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MINEMA ni izi:\nAbaminisitiri.\nMarcel Gatsinzi yatangiye kuyobora iyi minisiteri ku wa 12 Mata 2010.\nKu wa 22 Kanama 2023, Albert Murasira yagizwe Minisitiri ushinzwe MINEMA. Yasimbuye Solange Kayisire. Mbere yaho, Murasira yari Minisitiri w'Ingabo kugeza muri Kamena 2023. Muri Nyakanga 2026, yari akiri Minisitiri wa MINEMA."}
{"id": "15930", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15930", "title": "Nicholas Wadada", "text": "Nicholas Wadada Wakiro (wavutse 27 Nyakanga 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru, ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinyi w'iburyo wa Azam FC yo muri Tanzaniya ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nWadada yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru, akiri urubyiruko afite imyaka 13 mu ikipe ya Lukuli United muri 2007. Nyuma yaje kwinjira muri Kitende ya Mutagatifu Mariya muri 2010, maze muri uwo mwaka yinjira muri shampiyona ya Uganda Super League, mu ikipe ya Bunamwaya FC (ubu ni Vipers SC).\nBunamwaya FC.\nWadada yinjiye muri Bunamwaya FC mu mwaka wa 2010, afite imyaka 16 yari umukinnyi ukina iburyo inyuma mu kibuga.\nMuri shampiyona ya 2011\u201312 Wadada yabaye umukinnyi udasanzwe yari mu ikipe yarangije kumwanya wa kabiri muri shampiyona ya Uganda Super League 2011\u201312.\nMuri 2012\u201313 Wadada yakinnye imikino 20 ya shampiyona, mu gihe Bunamwaya yaje ku mwanya wa gatatu muri shampiyona ya Uganda Premier League.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMukuru.\nWadada yari mu bakinnyi agera kuri 23 bageze muri AFCON yo muri 2017 i Gaboni. Yatangiye umukino umwe akaza gusimburwa mu mukino na Misiri.\nYakinnye imikino itandatu mu majonjora yimikino y'igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2018, bakina na Misiri, Gana na Repubulika ya Kongo. \nWadada yatsinze igitego mu mukino bakina na Niger ku ya 2 Kamena 2018 mu marushanwa y\u2019ibihugu bitatu yabereye i Niamey."}
{"id": "15931", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15931", "title": "Brian Umony", "text": "Brian Umony (wavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka i Jinja, muri Uganda ukinira Kampala City Council FC. Kuva mu 2009, yabaye kandi umukinyi mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nUmony yavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1988 i Jinja kuri Francis Kermit na Loise Uwanchango, ni umuhererezi mu bana bane. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa nyina muri 1997, yimukiye i Kampala kubana na nyirarume. Yatangiye gukina umupira akiri muto,akora cyane no kugera mu m'akipe y\u2019ishuri kuko yahoraga yirengagizwa kuberako yari muto. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\n2009-12.\nMuri Gashyantare 2011, amaze kwitoza hamwe niyi kipe mu gihe cyabanjirije shampiyona, Umony yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019intizanyo y\u2019umwaka umwe na Portland Timbers umwaka wa mbere muri Shampiyona nkuru ya Major league. \nNyuma y'igihembwe cya 2011, Ibiti byatangaje ko banze guhitamo kugura uburenganzira bwa Umony kandi ko atazagaruka muri shampiyona 2012. \nMuri Mutarama 2012, Umony yasinyanye n'ikipe ya Vietiname yaje yahindutse Becamex Binh Duong. \nMuri ukuboza 2012, Umony yasinye amasazerano y'imwaka ibiri muri Tanzaniya mu ikipe ya Azam F.C.\nMuri Mata 2018, Umony yimukiye gukina mu Buhinde muri shampiyona ya I-League asinyana n'ikipe ya Gokulam Kerala FC ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nUmony yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda muri 2009. Yatsinze mu gikombe cya CECAFA cyo muri 2008, ibitego bitanu byafashije igihugu cye gutwara igikombe cya 10 cya CECAFA. \nUbuzima bwite.\nUmony yarangije muri kaminuza ya Kyambogo. Akunda gusoma imirimo yo Shakespeare. "}
{"id": "15932", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15932", "title": "Basil Tuma", "text": "Basil Tenywa Tuma (yavutse ku ya 24 Mata 2005) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Maltese muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi muri shampiyona ya EFL mu ikipe ya Reading. Nubwo yavukiye muri Uganda, umuryango we w'imukiye i Berkshire akiri muto.\nUmwuga wumupira wamaguru.\nikipe.\nGusoma.\nTuma yerekeje bwa mbere mu mukino wa EFL Cup 2-1 batsinzwe na Stevenage ku ya 9 Kanama 2022, akina iminota 55 mbere yo gusimburwa na Jahmari Clarke. \nMpuzamahanga.\nTuma yaserukiye Uganda muri Shampiyona ya CECAFA yabatarengeje imyaka 17 muri 2020, aho batsinze muriTanzaniya ku mukino wa nyuma. Tuma yahamagawe muri Malta yabatarengeje imyaka 19 muri Nzeri 2022. \nImikino ngororamubiri.\nTuma yize muri Eton College arangiza ari kumwanya wa 3 muri Junior y'abahungu muri metero 100, muri Shampiyona ya ESAA y'Amashuri Yisumbuye ya Track &amp; Field 2019, hamwe n'amasegonda 11.23. "}
{"id": "15933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15933", "title": "Charles Tibingana", "text": "Charles Tibingana Mwesigye (wavutse ku ya 28 Kanama 1994) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wakinaga nk'umukinnyi ukina kuruhande iburyo. Yavukiye muri Uganda, yaginiye u Rwanda ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga.\nTibingana yavukiye i Mbarara, muri Uganda, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu ikipe ya Proline, Victoria Unversity, APR FC, Bullets, AS Kigali na Yala United. \nYatangiye gukinira imikino mpuzamahanga mu Rwanda muri 2011, yaje twitabira igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyabatarengeje imwaka 17 muri 2011. "}
{"id": "15934", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15934", "title": "Abubaker Tabula", "text": "Abubaker Tabula (wavutse 12 kamena 1980) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda akaba ari umutoza. Yahoze ari umukinnyi mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru ya Uganda \"Uganda Cranes\" ndetse anayibera kapiteni iyi kipe muri 2005. \nUmwuga.\nYari Myugariro yakinnye muri SC Villa muri 2001, Kampala City Council FC muri 2005 Proline FC yo muri 2013, Simba FC,hamwe na ikipe zo mu Rwanda nka APR FC muri 2007 ndetse vuba aha muri Suwede muri GIF Sundsvall. \nKuri ubu Tabula atoza Maroons FC yo muri Uganda. Ni umwe mu kinaga inyuma kuruhande muri Uganda beza. \nYibukako atazibagirwa uko batsinzwe nu Rwanda muri 2004, kuri stade ya Namboole, rukina Afcon bw'ambere."}
{"id": "15935", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15935", "title": "Phillip Ssozi", "text": "Phillip Ssozi (yavutse ku ya 23 Nyakanga 1982) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru, uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru i Kampala muri Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nPhillip yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe ya Uganda ayoboye ikipe ya Villa SC, amaze gutwara Shampiyona eshanu zikurikirana. Ukuboza muri 2003 yimukiye i Burayi, gukina muri Seribiya muri Shampiyona ya mbere ya Seribiya (ubwo ni cyiciro cya 2 cya Seribiya). Iyo kipe izwiho kuzana abakinnyi benshi ba Uganda mu i Burayi, ariko nyuma yo kurangiza icyo gihembwe, Ssozi yagarutse muri Afurika, kuri iyi nshuro akinira mu ikipe ikomeye yo mu Rwanda ya APR FC kuva mu murwa mukuru w\u2019iki gihugu Kigali. Ngaho yatsinze muri uwo mwaka wa 2005, Shampiyona yu Rwanda. Nyuma yi cyo gihembwe, yagarutse muri Uganda aho yakinnye bwa mbere muri Victor FC ya Kampala, kuva 2007 akinira mu yindi kipe y\u2019umurwa mukuru, ya Express Red Eagles.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKuva mu 1999, Ssozi yakinnye imikino 22 mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda, atsinda ibitego 2. "}
{"id": "15936", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15936", "title": "Sam Ssimbwa", "text": "Sam Ssimbwa (wavutse 1967) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Uganda, ubu akaba ari umutoza.\nUmwuga.\nYakiniye amakipe atatu: nka KK Cosmos muri 1986, KCC FC muri 1987 kugeza 1995 na Mbale Intwari FC muri 1999 kugeza 2000. Yakinnye kandi mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda.\nYatoje amakipe nka Health FC (1998), na Mbale Intwari FC (1999-2000), na Masaka LC FC (2001), Polisi ya Gisirikare FC muri (2002), na KCC FC (kabiri 2002 &amp; 2009), Top TV FC (2003-2004), Rwanda ATRACO FC (2006), Express FC (2007), Simba SC (2008) na Kenya Sofapaka FC (2009-2010). \nKuva mu Gushyingo kugeza Ukuboza 2012 yatoje ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Somaliya. Mbere yari umutoza mukuru wa kaminuza ya SC Victoria. Nyuma yaje gutoza ikipe ya Express FC na Police FC yo mu Rwanda Ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2014 SC Villa yashyizeho Ssimbwa nk'umutoza. "}
{"id": "15937", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15937", "title": "Steven Sserwadda", "text": "Steven Sserwadda (wavutse ku ya 28 Kanama 2002) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati mukibuga, muri shampiyona ya League soccer mu ikipe nkuru y\u2019umupira w'amaguru ya New York Red Bulls ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKCCA.\nSserwadda yavukiye i Kampala, yatangiye gukina mu rubyiruko rw\u2019ikipe ya Kampala Capital City Authority FC muri 2015. Muri 2018 yazamuwe mu ikipe ya mbere ya KCCA nyuma yo kuzamuka mu ntera y'a makipe y'urubyiruko. Nyuma y'amezi make, yagaragaye bwa mbere mu makipe mpuzamahanga mu gikombe cya CAF Confederation Cup yo muri 2018\u201319 yabatsinze ikipe yo muri Tanzaniya,ya Mtibwa Sugar. Muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu gikombe cya Uganda, Sserwadda yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu bitego bigera 9-0 batsinze ikipe ya Synergy FC. Mu gihe yari kumwe niyi kipe yatsindiye ibikombe bitandukanye, harimo: Igikombe kimwe cya Kagame Interclub, igikombe kimwe cya Uganda Premier League, na 2 Super, n'igikombe cya Super 8. \nKu ya 30 Nzeri 2021, Sserwadda yinjiye muri Shampiyona ya USLmu ikipe ya New York Red Bulls II. Sserwadda yatangiye gukinira Red Bulls II ku ya 15 Ukwakira 2021, ubwo yanganyaga na Tampa Bay Rowdies igitego 1-1. Ku ya 31 Nyakanga 2022, Sserwadda yatsinze igitego cya mbere hamwe na New York Red Bulls II ubwo yatsirwaga na New Mexico United 1-2. Ku ya 9 Kanama 2022, Sserwadda yatsinze igitego cyo kunganya intsinzi ya Atlanta United 2-1. \nNew York Red Bulls (intizanyo).\nKu ya 22 Kamena 2022, New York Red Bulls yatangaje ko basinyanye na Sserwadda ku ntizanyo y'igihe gito, mbere yogukina yuko kimwe cya kane kirangiza muri Amerika ya 2022 bakina na New York City FC. Sserwadda yerekeje mu ikipe ya mbere muri Red Bulls umunsi umwe asimbuye Luquinhas ku munota wa 84. \nMuri New York Red Bulls.\nKu ya 9 Nyakanga 2022, Sswerwadda y'imukiye burundu kuri Red Bulls ku rutonde rw'amakipe ya mbere. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nSserwadda yagaragaye mu mikino itandatu yose yakiniye Uganda mu gikombe cy'ibihugu cyo 2021 bya Afrika abaterengeje imyaka 20. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu matsinda, agira uruhare runini mu kwiruka ku mukino wa nyuma. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mu mukino wa gicuti 1\u20131 (5\u20134) yatsinze Tajikistan ku ya 25 Werurwe 2022. "}
{"id": "15938", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15938", "title": "Simon Sserunkuma", "text": "Simon Peter Sserunkuma (wavutse 19 Nzeri 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipea ya Simba SC yo muri Premier League ya Tanzaniya. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAbatsinze FC.\nYatangiye bwa mbere muri shampiyona yo muri 2007 mu mukino yakinnye na Kampala City Council FC. Mu gihe yamaranye na Victors FC yabatsindiye Super League muri 2008, ni umukinnyi ufite agaciro n'igikombe cya Uganda mu mwaka umwe. \nSC Villa.\nYabaye umukinnyi uhenze cyane mu mateka ya Uganda ubwo SC Villa yishyuraga Victors FC miliyoni 16 z'amashiringi ($ 10,000) muri Gicurasi muri 2009. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nSserunkuma yerekeje mu ikipe y'igihugu ubwo yatozwaga na Bobby Williamson baje gutsinda Malawi ibitego 2-1. Muri Werurwe 2010, yaje gukira imvune yari yakomeretse kugira ngo abashe kujya mu majonjora yo guhatanira itike yo guhatanira kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika cya (CHAN) bakinnye n'Uburundi aho yagize uruhare rukomeye mu gutsinda iyi kipe y'igihugu. "}
{"id": "15939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15939", "title": "Geoffrey Sserunkuma", "text": "Geoffrey Sserunkuma (ku ya 7 Kamena 1983) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri uganda wa bigize umwuga, ukina muri Wakiso FC hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu ya uganda nka rutahizamu.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nSserukuma akina nka rutahizamu, yakiniye ikipe ya Polisi Jinja. Yishimiye gutsinda ari muri Kampala City Council FC mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Saint-George SA yo muri Etiyopiya muri shampiyyona ya Premier League muri Nyakanga 2007. Mu mpeshyi 2008, yavuye muri ikipe ya Addis Ababa yimukira muri Bloemfontein Celtic. Muri Nyakanga 2009, yavuye muri Bloemfontein Celtic kwimukira i Vasco Da Gama, nyuma yo guterana amagambo n'umuyobozi wa Celtic, Owen da Gama. \nBidvest Wits.\nKu ya 6 Mata 2010, Sserunkuma yasinyiye ikipe ya Bidvest Wits yemera amasezerano y'iyi kipe imyaka ibiri. \nVasco Da Gama.\nAriko, yagarutse muri Vasco Da Gama muri gihmbwe cya yakurikiyeho, akina mu cyiciro cya kabiri nyuma yo gusezererwa kwi kipe kuva mu isonga. \nIkipe yumupira wamaguru ya Lweza.\nMuri 2015, Sserunkuma yinjiye muri Lweza FC. Sserunkuma yakinnye shampiyona yo muri Lweza FC atsinda ibitego umunani muri icyo gihembwe. \nKubaka FC.\nMuri Nyakanga 2017, Sserunkuma yinjiye muri Buildcon FC Ku ya 12 Kanama, Sserunkuma yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Buildcon FC na Lusaka Dynamos mu mukino wa shampiyona wa bereye kuri Stade Levy Mwanawasa. \nNAPSA Inyenyeri.\nYakiniye NAPSA Stars FC FC igihembwe kimwe.\nWakiso Giants FC.\nKu ya 7 Kanama 2019, Sserunkuma yinjiye mu gukina muri Wakiso Giants FC. "}
{"id": "15940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15940", "title": "Dan Sserunkuma", "text": "Daniel Sserunkuma uzwi ku izina rya Muzenyi (yavutse ku ya 14 Ukuboza 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka i Kampala muri Uganda, kuri ubu ukina nka rutahizamu muri Vipers SC n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda (\"Cranes\"). \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nSserunkuma yavukiye kandi akurira mu gice cya Lubaga cyo mu karere ka Kampala. Yize mu ishuri rya Mutagatifu Mariya i Kitende ryanabyaye abakinnyi ba Uganda nka David Obua, Eric Obua, Emmanuel Okwi na Ibrahim Juma.\nExpress.\nMu Gushyingo 2013, Sserunkuma yateje impagarara muri iyi kipe atanga ku mugaragaro icyifuzo cyo kwimura, agaragaza ko yifuza kujya mu ikipe ya FC Banants yo muri Arumeniya. Ariko, umukinnyi ntiyari yemerewe kuva muri iyo kipe. \nMuri 2014, niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona yi cyiciro cya mbere cya Kenya muri 2014 yatsinze ibitego 16. \nSimba SC.\nUkuboza 2014, Sserunkuma yimukiye ku buntu mu bihangange byo muri Tanzaniya cya Simba. Yahagaritse amasezerano yagiranye ni yi kipe ku bwumvikane nyuma y\u2019amezi atanu gusa muri shampiyona ya Tanzaniya Premier League. \nUlisses.\nKu ya 30 Nyakanga 2015, hatangajwe ko Sserunkuma yinjiye mu ikipe ya Ulisses yo muri Arumeniya ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. \nMuri Nzeri 2017, Dan yinjiye muri Express FC. Dan yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Express yakinnye na Maroons Football Club ku ya 27 Nzeri 2017 \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Gashyantare 2013, Sserunkuma yakiriye ikipe ya mbere ihamagarira muri Cranes ya Uganda. Mu mukino we wa mbere yakinnye nu Rwanda, yatsinze igitego kimwe kuri penariti m ugihe yatanze umupira uvamo igitego kindi. "}
{"id": "15941", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15941", "title": "Mike Sserumaga", "text": "Michael Sserumaga (wavutse ku ya 3 Kanama 1989) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka i Kampala muri Uganda, ukinira SC Villa. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukina muri Polisi Jinja mbere yo kwimukira muri Kanama 2007, mu rubyiruko uruhande rwa Helsingborgs. Yazamuwe mu ikipe nkuru muri shampiyona yo muri 2008. Icyakora mu myitozo hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Uganda KB Intare, y'agize imvune ikomeye y'amaguru y'amaze hafi umwaka.\nMuri Nzeri 2009, Sserumagga yasinyanye amasezerano y'umwaka umwe na Uganda Revenue Authority SC, nyuma yo kugira ngo yisubireho kandi abone gusubira mu Burayi. bahagarariye muri shampiyona ya Caf Champions League muri Uganda na Bunamwaya SC basinyishije Sserumaga amasezerano y'amezi 6.\nMuri Gashyantare 2011, yinjiye mu ikipe y'u Rwanda mu ikipe ya Rayon Sport fc. \nMpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda ku ya 8 Kamena 2008 yakina na Benin."}
{"id": "15942", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15942", "title": "Eugene Sseppuya", "text": "Andrew Eugene Sseppuya (yavutse 1 Mata 1983) ni rutahizamu ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda. Sseppuya yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUbuzima.\nSseppuya yarangije kwerekeza mu ikipe yu mupira w'amaguru ya Arumeniya FC Banants kumafaranga atazwi. Nyuma yi cyiciro cya shampiyona cya shampiyona ya 2007, yarekuwe atagaragara muri shampiyona. Nyuma yinjiye mu ikipe ya Seribiya FK Vojvodina. Mu gihe cy'itumba 2008\u201309 idirishya, yinjiye muri FK \u010cukari\u010dki. Mu mpera za Mata 2009, ni we watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona ya Superliga yo muri Seribiya 2008\u201309, akaba yarakinnye umukino umwe na Vojvodina na 11 kuri \u010cukari\u010dki mu gihe yatsinze ibitego birindwi, byose bikaba bivuze ko igitego kimwe kuri buri minota 114 kuri ikibuga. \nMu Kwakira 2009, yasinye amasezerano yu mwaka umwe muri FK Mladi Radnik. Ku ya 16 Werurwe 2010, Sseppuya yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe yo muri Lituwaniya yitwa FK S\u016bduva. Ku ya 1 Kanama 2010, Sseppuya yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe yo muri shampiyona ya A-League mu ikipe y'Amajyaruguru ya Queensland Fury bituma aba umukinnyi wa 20 w'iyi kipe wasinyiye shampiyona itaha. Sseppuya yatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri Fury mumikino yabo 3, 2-2 banganya na Melbourne Victory. Yarekuwe muri Fury nyuma yuko ikipe yikubye. \nMu mpera za Werurwe 2011, ya sinyanye amasezerano n\u2019ikipe ya Petrolul Ploie\u0219ti yo muri Rumaniya muri Liga II. Yarekuwe muri iyi kipe mu mpeshyi, nyuma yuko iyi kipe imaze kuzamuka muri Liga I. Mu ntangiriro za Nzeri 2011 yasubiye muri Seribiya maze asinyana amasezerano y\u2019imyaka 2 na FK Borac \u010ca\u010dak. Azaboneka muri iyi kipe mu cyiciro cya 5 cya SuperLiga ya 2011\u201312. \nMuri Nyakanga 2012, nyuma yo gusezererwa kwa Borac muri shampiyona ya SuperLiga, Sseppuya yakoze igeragerwa muri Boyac\u00e1 Chico, nubwo nyuma amaherezo yasinywe muri FK Jedinstvo Bijelo Polje muri Shampiyona yambere ya Montenegrin. \nSseppuya yatsinze ibitego 3 mu mikino 4 yakiniye FC Istiklol mbere yuko arekurwa niyi kipe muri Mutarama 2014. "}
{"id": "15943", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15943", "title": "Robert Ssentongo (umupira w'amaguru)", "text": "Robert Ssentongo (wavutse ku ya 5 Kamena 1988) Ni umkinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Kyetume FC, nka rutahizamu.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nSsentongo yavukiye i Kampala, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu ikipe ya Simba, SC Villa, Kampala City Council, Brabrand, Lyon African, URA, Saint George, Fasil Kenema, na Kyetume FC. \nYatsinze ibitego 3 mu mukino, yo muri shampiyona ya FUFA Big League, yo kuzamura imikino yanyuma yo muri 2019 kugirango afashe Kyetume FC kubona kuzamurwa mu ntera yambere ku nshuro yambere. \nMuri 2018 yasinyiye ikipe ya Kyetume FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira muri mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2004, kandi yagaragaye mu mikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. Niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Cecafa, mu gilombe cya Challenge muri 2012. Yabaye umwe mu bakinnyi muri Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2016. "}
{"id": "15944", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15944", "title": "Titus Ssematimba", "text": "Titus Ssematimba (wavutse 15 Kanama 2003) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukinira Wakiso Giants FC muri Premier League ya Uganda ndetse n'ikipe yigihugu ya Uganda nku mukinnyi wo hagati wataka i zamu. Muri Shampiyona yo muri 2022 muri CECAFA mu bataewnge imyaka 20 yabereye, muri Sudani, Ssematimba yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019iri rushanwa. \nUmwuga.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, Ssematimba yamuritswe muri Wakiso Giants FC avuye mu karere ka Black Star FC mu karere ka Kampala. Ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 2021, yatangiye gukinira ikipe ye ya Wakiso Giants FC ubwo yoherezwaga muri SC Villa ibitego 3-1 mu kigo cy\u2019imyidagaduro cya Kavumba aho yatsindiye umupira muri uwo mukino. \nUganda U20.\nSsematimba yakiniye Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20 mu gikombe cyo muri 2022 uri CECAFA yabataregeje 20 cyabereye yo muri Sudani muri 2022. Yatangiye bwa mbere ku ya 29 Ukwakira 2022, ahanganye na Tanzaniya abatarengeje 20 kuri Stade ya Al-Hilal, Omdurman. \nIkipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nKu ya 21 Nzeri 2022, Ssematimba yerekeje bwa mbere muri Uganda mu marushanwa ya Tri-national yakininye na Uganda. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSsematimba yabyawe na Godfrey Kibuka Semuwemba na Bridget Nabulya Ssematimba. Amashuri abanza yatangiriye mu ishuri ry\u2019incuke rya Golden Age, Kibuye maze yinjira mu ishuri ribanza rya Kyagwe mbere yo kwinjira mu ishuri ribanza ry\u2019Urwibutso rwa Yusuf Banaziyo, Najjanankumbi ku muhanda wa Entebbe. Amashuri yisumbuye, yize amasomo ye asanzwe na muri College ya London. "}
{"id": "15945", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15945", "title": "Erisa Ssekisambu", "text": "Erisa Ssekisambu (wavutse ku ya 28 Kanama 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukinira mu ikipe ya Kiyovu sports muri Shampiyona y'u Rwanda ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga.\nUmwuga.\nSsekisambu yagiye agaragara mu makipe atandukanye yo muri Uganda nka SC Villa, Express FC, Uganda Revenue Authority SC, Vipers SC ndetse yakinnye muri KCCA FC. \nExpress.\nSsekisambu yinjiye muri Express muri Mutarama 2012. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere ku ya 22 Gashyantare 2012 na Water FC umukino urangira ari 0\u20130. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere yatsinze Masaka Local Council FC ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2012 naho Express yatsinze igitego 1-0. \nUganda Revenue Authority SC.\nMuri Kamena 2012, Ssekisambu yinjiye muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC avuye muri Express fc. \nSC Villa.\nSsekisambu yagarutse muri SC Villa muri 2015. Yakinnye na Soana FC nku mukino w'ambere agarutse muri SC Villa. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere cya shampiyona na Express maze umukino urangira utsinze na SC Villa 2\u20131.\nVipers SC.\nMuri Nyakanga 2015, Ssekisambu yimukiye muri Vipers SC muri 2015., Yakinnye umukino wa mbere na Bidco FC, Vipers SC yatsinze igitego 1-0. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri Vipers SC yatsinze Saints FC. Ssekisambu yarangije shampiyona yatsinze ibitego 16 nubwo hari abanyabwenge bavuga ko yatsinze 17 muri shampiyona ya Uganda Premier League yo muri 2015\u201316 Sekisambu yatsinze igitego cyamateka kuri Vipers SC na Enyimba FC ku ya 12 Gashyantare 2016 mu cyiciro kibanza. icyiciro cya CAF Champions League umukino ubanza. \nGor Mahia.\nKu ya 1 Ugushyingo 2018, hatangajwe ko Ssekisambu yinjiye mu ikipe ya Gor Mahia yo muri Kenya ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2019 yatsinze Hattrick ye ya mbere kuri Gor Mahia na Mount Kenya United. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 20 Kamena 2015, yakinnye bwa mbere muri Uganda na Tanzaniya maze atsinda ibitego 2 ku ncuro ya mbere. Yari umwe mu ba star bamurika muri Final ya CHAN 2016 yabereye mu Rwanda ubwo yatsindaga ibitego 2-2 na Mali. \nMuri Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2014, Erisa niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Uganda. "}
{"id": "15946", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15946", "title": "Robert Ssejjemba", "text": "Robert Ssejjemba (wavutse ku ya 5 Ukuboza 1980) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ni umutoza usanzwe muri gahunda y\u2019umupira w'amaguru w\u2019abagabo ya kaminuza ya Wayland Baptist.\nUmwuga.\nMu mpera zumwaka wo muri 2006, muri Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru yatangirijwe imwe muri DC United, ariko ntabwo yasinywe amasezerano y'umwuga nabo. Nyuma yakinnye muri shampiyona yo muri 2007 na Richmond Kickers mbere yo kwerekeza muri Charlotte Eagles muri shampiyona yo muri 2008. Ku mukino wa nyuma wa USL wo mu cyiciro cya kabiri cyo muri 2008 hamwe na Eagles, ariko,yagize imvune ari muri ACL yatumwe arangiza umwuga wo gukina Ssejjemba. Yagaragaye mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda inshuro nyinshi, harimo n'amajonjora yo kujya mu gikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2006. \nMu 2009, yabaye umutoza mukuru wa gahunda y'umupira w'amaguru mu bagabo yasubukuwe muri kaminuza ya Virginia Intermont College, ari mwarimu. \u00a0Nyuma, yabaye umutoza mukuru w'ikipe y'abagabo ya kaminuza y\u2019amajyepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba kuva muri 2014 kugeza 2019. Muri 2019, yabaye umutoza mukuru wa kaminuza ya Batisita ya Wayland. "}
{"id": "15947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15947", "title": "Godfrey Ssali", "text": "Godfrey Ssali (yavutse ku ya 6 Gashyantare 1977) ni umukinnyi ukina hagati mu kibuga mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina mu ikipe ya Express FC yo muri Uganda.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we na Polisi Jinja muri shampiyona ya Premier League ya Uganda, mbere yo muri 2004 y'imukira muri Express FC.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYakinnye kuva 2003 kugeza hagati muri 2004 mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda."}
{"id": "15948", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15948", "title": "Pione Sisto", "text": "Pione Sisto Ifolo Emirmija (yavutse 4 Gashyantare 1995) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri shampiyona ya Danemarike ukina nk'umukinnyi w\u2019ibumoso, mu ikipe ya Midtjylland yo muri Danemarike.\nYatangiye umwuga we w'abigize umwuga hamwe na Midtjylland yo muri shampiyona ya Danemarike Superliga, amaze kugaragara imikino114 yose ndetse atsinda ibitego 31 muri shampiyona eshanu. Muri 2016 yimukiye muri Celta Vigo kumafaranga miliyoni 5 zama euro, aho yatsinze ibitego 18 m'umikino 135. Muri 2020, yagarutse muri Midtjylland kuri miliyoni 3 z'amayero.\nSisto yagaragaye bwa mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Danemarike muri 2015, kandi yari mu bakinnyi babo mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA muri 2018.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nPione Sisto yavukiye i Kampala, muri Uganda, avukira mu muryango ukomoka muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo. Umuryango wa Sisto w'imukiye muri Danimarike afite amezi abiri. Yagaragaye na Tj\u00f8rring NIBA muri 2002, afite imyaka irindwi, y'imukira mu rubyiruko rwa FC Midtjylland muri 2010. \nMidtjylland.\nYatsindiye Midtjylland ikina na Manchester United itsinze iwayo ibitego 2-1 muri Europa League ku ya 18 Gashyantare muri 2016. Yatsinze kandi igitego cyo gufungura umukino wa kabiri kuri Old Trafford mbere yuko Midtjylland ikomeza gutsindwa 5\u20131 (6\u20133 kuri rusange) na United maze yanga kuva muri Europa League. "}
{"id": "15949", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15949", "title": "Muhammad Shaban", "text": "Muhammad Shaban (wavutse 11 Mutarama 1998) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga ukomka muri Uganda ukinira muri Onduparaka, nka rutahizamu.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nShaban yavukiye muri Arua, Shaban yasinye amasezerano na Vipers muri 2015, ariko biba impfabusa maze asinyira Onduparaka. Yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka itatu na Kampala Capital City Authority muri Kwakira 2017, atsinda igitego cya mbere nyuma y'ukwezi. Muri Kanama 2018, yajwe kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo ya Orlando Pirates na Raja Casablanca yo muri Maroke. Yasinyiye Raja Casablanca muri shampiyona yo muri 2018\u201319, akina shampiyona 5, mbere yo gusubira muri Vipers muri Kanama 2019. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira mpuzamahanga mu 2016, kandi yashyizwe mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya Afurika 2017. "}
{"id": "15950", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15950", "title": "Yunus Sentamu", "text": "Yunus Sentamu (wavutse 13 Kanama 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nkimbere..\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nllves.\nMuri Nyakanga 2016, Sentamu yasonewe gukinira muri FC Ilves muri Veikkausliiga nyuma yo gukemura ibibazo bya visa, kuko yari yarasinyanye amasezerano muri Mutarama 2016. \nTirana.\nKu ya 19 Kamena 2017, Sentamu yimukiye muri Tirana mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Alubaniya. Yatangiye umukino ubanza mu mukino ubanza muri 2017\u201318 muri UEFA Europa League icyiciro cya mbere cyamajonjora, yakinnye na Maccabi Tel Aviv maze Tirana yatsinzwe ibitego 2-0. Yakinnye i mu mukino wagarutse kuri Stade ya Selman St\u00ebrmasi, ahabwa ikarita itukura kubera ikosa kuko Tirana yatsinzwe ibitego 3\u20130, maze basezererwa kuri 5\u20130 yose hamwe. \nSentamu yayoboye Tirana bwa mbere ku ya 25 Ugushyingo mu kunganya igitego 1-1 na Sh\u00ebnkolli ku mukino wa shampionat wa 9. Icyakora, icyemezo cy'ikipe cyo kumugira kapiteni w'umukino cya maganiwe cyane na bafana. Umuyobozi Z\u00e9 Maria yaburanye amahitamo ye kandi anashimira Sentamu, amwita \"urugero kuri bose\". Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere cya shampiyona ku ya 17 Ukuboza mu mukino wa 6\u20130 wa Pogradeci wemewe ku munsi wa 11. Mu mukino uheruka wa 2017, Sentamu yatsinze penariti yatsinzwe na Karabeci kandi we ubwe yatsinze igitego cya gatatu mu gutsinda 0-4 kuri Naft\u00ebtari Ku\u00e7ov\u00eb abaye umukinnyi wa mbere wa Tirana wageze ku mibare ibiri muri shampiyona ya 2017\u201318. \nSentamu yashoje shampiyona ye ya mbere muri Alubaniya atsinze ibitego 12 m'umikino 19 yakinnye shampiyona kuko Tirana yatwaye shampiyona w\u2019icyiciro cya mbere muri Alubaniya nyuma yo gutsinda Kastrioti Kruj\u00eb ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2018. "}
{"id": "15951", "revid": "14338", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15951", "title": "Nelson Senkatuka", "text": "Nelson Senkatuka (yavutse ku ya 10 Nzeri 1997) Ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri uganda ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Bright stars FC muri shampiyona ya uganda no mu ikipe y'igihugu the Cranes, akina nka rutahizamu.\nSenkatuka yatangiye umwuga muri Hope Doves FC i Kampala aho yamaze shampiyona bibiri akinira Erith na Belvedere FC, Cranes United FC, Kampala, Proline Football Club ndetse ubu akaba ari muri Bright Stars FC.\nUmwuga wa club.\nIbyiringiro Inuma FC.\nMugihe muri Byiringiro Inuma yayoboye asubira inyuma kuzamurwa mu ntera kuva muri Kampala Regional League yatsinze ibitego byinshi yatsinze ibitego 23 mumikino 24 n'ibitego 27 mumikino 31. \nErith &amp; Belvedere.\nMugihe yari mu bushakashatsi mu Bwongereza, Senkatuka yakiniye Erith &amp; Belvedere FC muri Shampiyona yumupira wamaguru ya Ryman akina imikino itanu atsinda igitego kimwe. \nCranes United FC.\nSenkatuka yanagaragaye muri Cranes United FC muri Essex Alliance Football League aho yakinnye imikino 34 atsinda ibitego 45.\nNjyanama y'Umujyi wa Kampala.\nMugihe yari Njyanama yumujyi wa Kampala, Senkatuka yakinnye imikino 16 atsinda ibitego 4. \nProline y'umupira w'amaguru.\nYashyizwe ahagaragara muri Proline Football Club ku wa gatandatu 12 Kanama 2016. Yabaye m'ubatsinze ibitego bitanu by'ambere muri shampiyona ya Uganda Super League muri 2016/2017 yatsinze ibitego 11 ndetse anatanga imipira 7 ivamo ibitego. \nMoghreb T\u00e9touan.\nKu ya 13 Nzeri 2019 Nelson yinjiye muri Moghreb T\u00e9touan ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu. \nBright Stars Umupira wamaguru.\nKu ya 22 Nzeri 2021, yongeye gusinyira ikipe ya Bright Stars Football Club maze atsinda igitego cya mbere ku munsi wafunguwe wa 2021-2022 muri Uganda Premier League yari ihanganye na Mbarara City FC. Ku ya 5 Ukuboza 2021 na UPDF SC, Senkatuka yarangije ibitego 50 muri Uganda Premier League.\nAmateka yawe bwite.\nSenkatuka ni Muganda k'ubwoko bugwa munsi yu muryango wa Mbogo. "}
{"id": "15952", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15952", "title": "Ibra Sekajja", "text": "Ibra Sekajja (yavutse 31 Ukwakira 1992)Ni umukinnyi ukinaumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUmwuga.\nYavukiye muri Uganda, yize amashuri yisumbuye ku ishuri ry\u2019abaturage rya Ashburton kuva muri 2004 kugeza 2009.\nSekajja yatangiye umwuga muri Crystal Palace ku ya 30 Mata 2011, mu birori byabereye mu mujyi wa Hull. Yatsinze igitego cyo ku munota wa 88 kunganya igitego cya mbere. Sekajja yari yiganje mu kibuga mu minota mike yanyuma yu mukino, yemeza ko banganya na Hull byatumye umutekano w\u2019ingoro muri Shampiyona. Yizihije akoresheje inshuro eshatu. \nNyuma yo kwitwara neza mu wa mujyi wa Braintree na Hemel Hempstead Town muri shampiyona yo muri 2015-16, Sekajja yinjiye muri Dulwich Hamlet wo mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cya Isthmian, atangira gukina atsinda ibitego 2-2 umukino wahuje Enfield Town ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2016. Yasoje shampiyona ya mbere muri iyi kipe atsinda ibitego 17 mu marushanwa yose, harimo igice cya mbere cyatsinzwe na Enfield Town mu mukino wa kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza cya Isthmian League. Nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego 12 bya shampiyona muri Dulwich muri 2016\u201317, yinjiye mu mujyi wa Bognor Regis muri 2017\u201318. Muri 2018-19 Sekajja yakiniye Havant &amp;amp; Waterlooville mbere yo kwinjira muri Gosport Borough muri Werurwe. \nSekajja yinjiye muri Maidenhead United mu Gushyingo 2019. Muri Mutarama 2020, yagiye kugeragezwa mu mujyi wa Grimsby. \nSekajja yongeye kwinjira muri Dulwich Hamlet muri Mutarama 2021. \nKu ya 15 Kanama 2022, yasinyiye muri AC Oulu muri Finilande kugeza shampiyona irangiye. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nSekajja yafashije u Bwongereza kurwego rwa bafite munsi y'imyaka 16. Muri Kanama 2013, yahamagawe mu ikipe ya Uganda mu mukino wa gicuti na Misiri. Ntiyakinnye kuko yari atarabona pasiporo ye ya Uganda. \nImibare yumwuga.\nfff"}
{"id": "15953", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15953", "title": "Ibrahim Sekagya", "text": "Ibrahim Sekagya (wavutse ku ya 19 Ukuboza 1980) ni Uganda wahoze akina umupira w'amaguru wakinnye hagati mu kibuga. Kugeza ubu ni umutoza mukuru wa New York Red Bulls II yo muri MLS Next Pro.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2013, Sekagya yinjiye mu ikipe ya MLS New York Red Bulls ku buntu, nyuma yo kuva mu ikipe ya mushiki we ya Red Bull Salzburg. Ku ya 4 Kanama 2013, Sekagya yerekeje bwa mbere i New York atangira ari umukinnyi wo hagati arinda izamu, intsinzi kuri Sporting Kansas City ibitego 3-2. Ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2013, Sekagya yatsinze igitego cyatsinzwe mu mukino uheruka wa shampiyona yakinnye na Chicago Fire kuri Red Bull Arena kugira ngo afashe ikipe ye gutsinda 5-2 kandi ibe shampiyona isanzwe. Nicyo gikombe cyambere cy'ikipe mumateka yimyaka igera 17. Ariko, gutanga kwa Sekagya byatumye habaho kunganya igitego cyatsinzwe na Houston yatsinze ibitego 2-1 byatsindiye New York mu mukino wo kwishyura wa MLS 2013. Muri shampiyona 2014 Sekagya yabaye umukinnyi usanzwe utangira i New York ufasha iyi kipe kugera ku mukino wo kwishyura wa MLS. Sekagya yasezeye mu mupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga mu ntangiriro yo muri 2015.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nSekagya yakinnye mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda aho yari kapiteni w'iyi kipe. Yagaragaye inshuro 8 anatsindira igitego kimwe mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi cya FIFA cyo muri 2006, ndetse n\u2019imikino 3 ndetse n\u2019igitego mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi cya FIFA cyo muri 2010. "}
{"id": "15954", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15954", "title": "Lawrence Segawa", "text": "Lawrence Segawa (wavutse ku ya 10 Nzeri 1984) ni umugande ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga uvuka i Jinja muri Uganda uheruka gukinira Uganda Revenue Authority SC.\nUmwuga.\nYakiniye Police FC mbere yo kwimukira mu mahanga, Muri 2006, yimukiye muri Sudani aho yasinye ikipe ylgihangange muri iki gihugu yitwa Al-Merreikh. Ubukurikira y'imukiye muri Seribiya, maze asinya, mu kiruhuko cy\u2019itumba cya shampiyona yo muri 2009-10, hamwe na FK Srem ukomoka muri Sremska Mitrovica, ikipe ifite umuco umaze kumenyekana wo gutumiza abakinnyi b'umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Uganda, kandi aho azahurira na mugenzi we bakinira ikipe y\u2019igihugu Vincent. Kayizi."}
{"id": "15955", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15955", "title": "Jamal Salim", "text": "Omar Jamal Salim Magoola (yavutse ku ya 27 Gicurasi 1995), uzwi ku izina rya Jamal Salim, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukinira ikipe ya Richards bay fc.\nUmwuga.\nSalim yakinye umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda no muri Express FC na Kampala Capital City Authority FC. \nYasinye muri Express FC nyuma y\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019akarere ka muri 2011, ryatsinzwe n'ikipe yo hagati, Mu mwaka wo muri 2012, yize muri kaminuza ya Kampala nk'umunyeshuri wiga mu mwaka wa mbere akorera impamyabumenyi mu micungire y\u2019abakozi kandi yari umwe mu bahatanira izamu rya Bell Super League. Yatangiye gukina imikino mpuzamahanga muri Uganda ku ya 10 Nyakanga 2012 na Sudani y'Amajyepfo. Yabaye umwe mu bagize Ikipe ya Cranes ya Uganda mu mikino ibiri yanyuma ya Afurika y\u2019ibihugu muri AFCON muri 2017 i Gabon na 2019 muri Egiputa. "}
{"id": "15956", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15956", "title": "Denis Rukundo", "text": "Denis Rukundo (yavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1996) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Rwanda ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati wa Police FC ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru y'u Rwanda.\nUmwuga wa bigize umwuga.\nRukundo yatangiye umwuga mu gihugu cya Uganda hamwe na Maroons FC na KCCA FC, mbere yo kuva muri Ugandaajya muri APR FC muri 2017. Ku ya 20 Kanama 2019, yasubiye muri Uganda asinyana amasezerano na Police FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nRukundo yavukiye muri Uganda kuri se w'u Rwanda na nyina wa Uganda. Yahamagariwe guhagararira ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda mu mukino wa gicuti muri Kamena 2021. Yatangiye gukinira u Rwanda mu mukino wa gicuti yatsinze Repubulika ya Centarafurike 2-0 ku ya 3 Kamena 2021. "}
{"id": "15957", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15957", "title": "Kasule Owen", "text": "Kasule Owen (wavutse ku ya 3 Werurwe 1989 i Kampala) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda super league muri URA SC.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nOwen yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina muri Nakawa United, mbere yo kwinjira muri Kampala City Council FC \nBunamwaya FC.\nMuri 2008, Owen yinjiye muri Bunamwaya SC, aho yatsindiye igikombe cya Shampiyona hamwe nabo muri 2009\u201310, atsinda ibitego 12 avuye mu gikombe cyo muri Afurika. \nHoang Anh Gia Lai FC.\nMuri 2012, Owen yinjiye mu ikipe yo muri Vietiname yitwa Hoang Anh Gia Lai FC aho yayikiniye shampiyona imwe atsinda ibitego 1 mu mikino 6 ya shampiyona.\nURA SC.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2012\u00a0, Owen yinjiye muri Uganda mu ikipe ya URA SC."}
{"id": "15958", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15958", "title": "David Otti", "text": "David Otti Ni umwe mubari abatoza bubahwa cyane muri Uganda, akaba n'umwe mu bantu bambaye neza mu mupira w'amaguru wa Uganda. Yavukiye i Gulu, mu majyaruguru ya Uganda kandi yapfuye afite imyaka 71 ku ya 3 Werurwe 2011 mu bitaro bya Case MedCare i Kampala. Raporo y\u2019ubuvuzi yabanje kwerekana ko yatewe na embolisme y\u2019ibihaha mbere yuko umurambo we w'imurirwa mu bitaro by\u2019igihugu bya Referral Mulago kugira ngobapime uko wapfuye. Ibihe byari bikomeye m'ugihe cyitangazamakuru. Yarwaye na diyabete, mu gihe yari akiri umutoza wa Express FC, n'ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. \nUkwezi kwa Otti kwaciwe muri Gicurasi umwaka ushize nyuma y\u2019intambara yari imaze imyaka ine irwaye diyabete. Mu gihe cye, yatoje amakipe atatu ya mbere ya Uganda - Express, KCC na SC Villa.\nYarambuye amaboko atoza hirya no hino mu karere nko akore ku mpande za Kenya, Volcano United na Gor Mahia 1981\u201383), Siporo (NCS) umunyamabanga mukuru. \nNi muri Express FC, aho Otti yubahwa cyane kuba yarazanye iyi kipe igikombe cya mbere cya shampiyona mu myaka hafi makumyabiri ishize muri 1993. Yatsindiye kandi ibikombe bitatu bya Uganda mu gihe yari ahari. \nOtti yibukwa cyane nkumwe m'ubatoza batsinze neza umupira w'amaguru wa Uganda kandi yayoboye amakipe yose akomeye mumupira w'amaguru wa Uganda arimo Express, SC Villa na KCC FC ku mazina menshi, kandi yatsinze haba mu buryo bwo gutera no kwirwanaho. Umwuga we watangiye mu myaka ya za 1960, akinira Bitumastic na Uganda Cranes (ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda), harimo n'igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1968. Yatangiye umwuga w'ubutoza mu 1973. \nYatoje kandi Uganda Cranes, ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda yaje amajonjora mu gikombe cy'Afurika i Cairo (1974) na Etiyopiya (1976).\nMuri make kandi y'agize igihe gito cyo gutoza muri Somaliya no mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nDavid Otti yashakanye na Kwizera, babyarana abana batanu, Richard Otti, Juddy Akello Olunga, Leonard Odong, David Ochan, na Jackie Otti. Yashyinguwe i Pece. "}
{"id": "15959", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15959", "title": "Ibrahim Orit", "text": "Ibrahim Orit (wavutse 28 Nyakanga 1998)Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nkumukinyi wa Vipers SC hamwe n'ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nOrit yavukiye mu bitaro bya Soroti, muri Uganda, nk'uwa kabiri wavutse mu muryango w'abantu batandatu, nubwo ababyeyi be bombi bapfuye bakiri bato ba Orit. Yize mu ishuri ribanza rya Aloet, ariko byabaye ngombwa ko areka amashuri nyuma y'urupfu rw'ababyeyi be kuko nta mafaranga yo kwishyura amafaranga y'ishuri. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nOrit yatangiye umwuga we muri Odudwi FC mu cyiciro cya kane cyo muri Uganda mu 2013, yagiye yitwara neza muri Soroti Garage, Junior Eagles na Future Stars mbere yo gusinyisha ikipe ya Mbarara City yo muri Uganda mu mpeshyi 2017. Ku ya 2 Nyakanga 2020, byatangajwe ko Orit yinjiye muri shampiyona na Uganda Vipers SC ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu, bibaye ku nshuro yabo ya kabiri muri iyo mpeshyi. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nOrit yatangiye gukinira Uganda ku ya 22 Mutarama 2021 itsinzwe na Togo ibitego 2-1 muri Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2020. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere muri Uganda mu mukino wakurikiyeho akoresheje ishoti riva kuri metero 16 atsinzwe na Maroke 5-2 ku ya 26 Mutarama. \nUburyo bwo gukina.\nOrit ikina nka winger. Nyuma yo gusinyira muri iyi kipe, umuyobozi wa Vipers SC, Fred Kajoba, yatangaje ko yakinnye nk \"umukinnyi wagutse ukunze guca ibumoso ariko akaba yarakinnye iburyo ndetse na rutahizamu mukuru\". "}
{"id": "15960", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15960", "title": "Moses Opondo", "text": "Moses Opondo (yavutse 28 Ukwakira 1997) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira muri AC Horsens n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nOpondo yavukiye muri Uganda, yimukira muri Danimarike ari kumwe na nyina afite imyaka ine. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nVendsyssel.\nMuri Nyakanga 2016, Opondo yatijwe muri gahunda y'urubyiruko muri AaB kuri Vendsyssel FF. Yatangiye gukinira icyiciro cya mbere cya Danemarike ku ya 24 Nyakanga 2016, aje asimbuye ku munota wa 61 asimbuye Washington Brand\u00e3o itsinzwe na HB K\u00f8ge igitego 1-0. Muri Mutarama 2017, inguzanyo ya Opondo yahinduwe amasezerano ahoraho. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere cyo guhatanira iyi kipe ku ya 14 Gicurasi 2017 atsindwa na 1-0 muri shampiyona na FC Helsing\u00f8r. Igitego cye, cyatsinzwe ku munota wa 64, nicyo gitego cyonyine cyyu mukino. Muri Nyakanga 2017, amasezerano ya Opondo yongerewe kugeza mu mpeshyi ya 2019. Vendsyssel yasezerewe muri Danemarike Superliga nyuma ya shampiyona ya 2019\u201320. \nOB.\nMuri Kamena 2019, hatangajwe ko Opondo yasinyanye amasezerano n\u2019imyaka ine na Odense Boldklub (OB). Nk\u2019uko \"Tipsbladet\" ibitangaza, OB yari yaramuhaye ingingo yo kugura hafi miliyoni 1 DKK. \nYagize amahirwe yo gukinira OB muri Superliga ku ya 14 Nyakanga 2019, ariko ku munsi wa kane ni bwo yaje mu kibuga nk'umusimbura nyuma y'iminota 71 kuri Jens Thomasen atsinze 0-1. hejuru ya Esbjerg fB. \nAC Horsens.\nKu ya 24 Mutarama 2022, Opondo yagurijwe mu ikipe ya Danemark yo mu cyiciro cya mbere AC Horsens muri shampiyona isigaye. Kurangiza shampiyona igitego kimwe mumikino 10, hemejwe ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2022, ko Opondo yasinyiye burundu muri AC Horsens, yandika amasezerano kugeza muri Kamena 2026. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Gicurasi 2018, Opondo yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mu mukino wa gicuti na Nigeri na Repubulika ya Centarafurike. Yatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga ku ya 2 Kamena 2018 yatsinzwe na Nigeri ibitego 2-1. "}
{"id": "15961", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15961", "title": "Denis Onyango", "text": "Denis Masinde Onyango (yavutse ku ya 15 Gicurasi 1985) ni umuganda ukina umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga ukina mu izamu, wakinaga muri afurika yepfo.\nAmaze gutangira umwuga we mu gihugu cye kavukire, Onyango yagiye gukina muri Shampiyona y\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika yepfo muri ikipe ya Supersport United, Mpumalanga Black Aces, na Mamelodi Sundowns. Hamwe na Mamelodi Sundowns, ye gukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona cya CAF muri 2016 kandi yitabira igikombe cyisi cya FIFA cya makipe muri 2016. Yatowe nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Afurika ukomoka muri Afurika muri 2016. Yashyizwe kandi ku izamu rya cumi ryiza ku isi ku rutonde rw\u2019umwaka wo muri 2016, ryakozwe n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry'amateka y'umupira w'amaguru &amp;amp; Ibarurishamibare. \nYaserukiye Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2017, anabatwara kugeza igihe yegiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 2021. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nOnyango yavukiye i Kampala, muri Uganda, yatangiye umwuga we na SC Villa i Kampala nyuma yinjira muri St. George SA muri Etiyopiya.\nSuperSport United na Mpumalanga Umukara Aces.\nMu 2006, Onyango yinjiye mu ikipe ya Supersport United yo muri Afurika y'Epfo.\nKu ya 8 Nyakanga 2010, yarekuwe na SuperSport United.\nKu ya 26 Nyakanga, Mpumalanga Black Aces yasinyishije Onyango k'ubuntu. \nMamelodi Sundowns.\nMuri 2011, Onyango yinjiye mu ikipe ya Mamelodi Sundowns yo muri Afurika y'Epfo. \nKu ya 2 Kanama 2013, yatanze inguzanyo ku bahanganye muri shampiyona Bidvest Wits. \nMuri Nyakanga 2014, Mamelodi Sundowns yakoresheje uburyo bwo kongera amasezerano ya Onyango umwaka. \nOnyango yatsindiye umunyezamu wa PSL igihembo cya shampiyona (umukinnyi mwiza mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Afurika yepfo) muri shampiyona yo muri 2015\u201316 kandi agumana impapuro 14 zisukuye kuko Sundowns yabonye amanota 71. "}
{"id": "15962", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15962", "title": "Phillip Omondi", "text": "Phillip Omondi (1957 - 21 Mata 1999) yari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda.\nGukina umwuga.\nNi umukinnyi ukina imbere, Omondi yakiniye ikipe ya Kampala City Council FC kuva 1973 kugeza 1979, ubwo yimukiraga mu gihugu cya leta zunze ubumwe z'abaabu kugirango yinjire muri Sharjah. \nOmondi yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mu gikombe cy'Afurika cyo muri 1974, 1976 na 1978, aho ari we watsinze ibitego byinshi kuko Uganda yarangije ku mwanya wa kabiri. Yafashije kandi ikipe gutwara ibikombe bya CECAFA cyo muri 1973 na 1977. \nUmwuga nk'umuyobozi.\nNyuma yogusoza umwuga gukina, Omondi yabaye umuyobozi wa Banki ya Uganda FC na KCC mbere y\u2019izabukuru muri 1992. "}
{"id": "15963", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15963", "title": "Moses Oloya", "text": "Moses Oloya (wavutse 22 Ukwakira 1992) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya H\u1ea3i Ph\u00f2ng yo muri Vietiname.\nUbuzima bwambere kandi bwihariye.\nMurumuna wa Oloya ni Jimmy Kidega, wanakinnye umupira mpuzamahanga muri Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nOloya yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda, Vietiname na Burusiya mu buyobozi bwa Kampala Capital City, Xuan Thanh Sai Gon, Becamex Binh Duong, Kuban Krasnodar na Hanoi FC. \nYasinyiye Haiphong muri shampiyona yo mui 2022. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira mpuzamahanga muri Uganda mu 2011, kandi yagaragaye mu mikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. Yari umwe mu bagize ikipe ya Uganda yari mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2017. "}
{"id": "15964", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15964", "title": "Francis Olaki", "text": "Francis Ronald Olaki Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wumupira ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nka rutahizamu cyangwa umukinnyi w\u2019ibumoso muri Buildcon FC muri Zambiya. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNi murumuna wa Emmanuel Okwi, umwe mu bagize ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda, ubu akaba akinira ikipe ya Simba Sports ikipe yo muri Tanzaniya. "}
{"id": "15965", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15965", "title": "Simon Okwi", "text": "Simon Okwi Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi w'imbere muri kaminuza ya Victoria ya SC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15966", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15966", "title": "Emmanuel Okwi", "text": "Emmanuel Arnold Okwi (yavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1992) ni umukinnyi ukina w\u2019umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukina nku mukinnyi w\u2019ibumoso mu ikipe ya Al Ittihad Alexandrie Club yo mu Misiri ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nOkwi yakiniye ikipe ya SC Villa yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda Super League mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe ya Simba SC yo muri Tanzaniya ku madolari 40.000. \nMuri Mutarama 2013, ikipe yo muri Tuniziya ya \u00c9toile Sportive du Sahel yasinyiye Okwi amafaranga yo kohereza muri Tanzaniya amafaranga agera kuri madorari 300.000. Iyi kipe ariko yananiwe kwishyura amafaranga Simba SC Nyuma yaje guhanagurwa na komite ishinzwe imikino y\u2019abakinnyi ba FIFA mu Kuboza 2013 kugira ngo asubire muri SC Villa nubwo icyemezo cyahinduwe nyuma y\u2019amezi abiri kugira ngo ashobore gukinira Youth Africans S.C, nubwo Simba SC yigaragambije. \nOkwi yongeye kwiyunga na Simba SC muri Kanama 2014 mu masezerano y'amezi atandatu, asobanura ko Youth Africans S.C bahagaritse amasezerano ye bananiwe kwishyura amadorari ibihumbi 50 by'Amerika yari amurimo. Okwi yanze gukina imikino itanu yanyuma ya shampiyona muri 2013\u201314 ku bakiri bato bo muri Afrika kubera impaka zo kwishyura. Youth Africans S.C yamaganye cyane iyimurwa ya Simba SC bavuga ko amasezerano agikurikizwa. Ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru muri Tanzaniya ryanze icyo kirego muri Nzeri 2014. \nMuri Nyakanga 2015, S\u00f8nderjyskE Fodbold yasinyiye Okwi ku masezerano y'imyaka itanu, byemejwe na Simba SC, azakomeza kugeza muri 2020. Muri Mutarama 2017, Okwi yemeye gusesa amasezerano. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu mikino itandatu. \nAgarutse avuye muri Danemarike Okwi yongeye kwinjira mu ikipe yahoze yitwa SC Villa asinya amasezerano y'amezi atandatu. Yatsinze ibitego 10 mu mikino 13 ya Uganda Premier League. \nMuri Kamena 2017, Okwi yasinyanye na Simba SC ku nshuro ya gatatu mu mwuga we yemeye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri. \nMuri Nyakanga 2019, nyuma yo kwitwara neza mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2019, Okwi yinjiye mu ikipe ya Al Ittihad yo mu Misiri yo mu Misiri mu masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. "}
{"id": "15967", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15967", "title": "Dennis Okot", "text": "Dennis Okot Oola (yavutse 1 Ukuboza 1990)Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira BIDCO Bul, nka myugariro.\nUmwuga.\nYavukiye i Gulu, yakinnye umupira wa maguru muri kaminuza ya Victoria na Kampala Capital City Authority. \nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2015. "}
{"id": "15968", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15968", "title": "Sezari Okhuti", "text": "Caesar Okhuti (yavutse 7 Ukwakira 1990) ni umutoza ukomoka muri Uganda akaba nu mukinnyi wakinaga umupira w'amaguru uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru. Yayoboye ikipe ya Arua Hill Sports Club kuva muri shampiyona ya FUFA Big League kugeza muri shampiyona ya Uganda Premier League muri 2021. Okhuti yari mu ikipe ya Onduparaka FC yazamuwe muri 2016. Yigeze gukinira Express na KCCA FC ariko atizwa muri Onduparaka FC muri shampiyona yo muri 2016/17. Yatsinze muri shampiyona na Bunamwaya SC yo muri 2010 na KCCA FC muri 2016. Yasezeye mu mupira wamaguru wa bigize umwuga ku ya 17 Kanama 2021, nyuma yo gutsinda umukino wa nyuma wa StarTimes FUFA Big League hamwe na Arua Hill SC.\nUmwuga mukuru.\nOkhuti yatangiye umwuga muri 2007 akoresha Arua ukomoka muri Uganda muri shampiyona ya Super League Ediofe Hills FC na URA FC. Yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda n'umutoza Laszlo Csaba nyuma y'uwo mwaka. Umwaka ukurikira, Bunamwaya SC y'amuguze agahigo ki gihugu miriyoni 12. Imvune yo mu mugongo muri Nzeri 2008 yamuhagaritse amezi abiri ariko agaruka kurangiza shampiyona nk'umukinnyi wa gatatu watsinze ibitego byinshi n'ibitego 18. Yamenyekanye mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu cya Uganda mu 2009. Muri 2010, Okhuti yafashije Bunamwaya gutwara igikombe cya USL. \nKu ya 20 Gicurasi 2011, Okhuti yasinye amasezerano na Vissai Ninh B\u00ecnh muri Viyetinamu muri V.League 1 aho yatsinze ibitego bine mu mezi atatu. Yagarutse muri Mutarama 2012 gukinira Bunamwaya.\nMuri 2014, Okhuti yinjiye muri El Nasir yo muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo, ariko shampiyona yakurikiyeho yasubiye mu rugo kugira ngo afashe Onduparaka FC ikora muri Arua kuzamuka muri shampiyona ya Uganda.\nKu wa gatandatu, 5 Ukuboza 2015 kuri Stade Addis Ababa muri Etiyopiya, Okhuti yabonye i gitego cyonyine ya tsindiye u Rwanda mutwara igikombe cya 14 cya CECAFA Senior Challenge Cup muri Uganda. Bibaye ku nshuro ya kane Uganda itsinze u Rwanda ku mukino wa nyuma (2003, 2009, 1011, 2015) kandi ni bwo bwa mbere umutoza wa Seribiya wo muri Seribiya Milutin \"Micho\" Sredojevic yari ayitsinze, kuko yatsinzwe imyaka ine inyuma ya Uganda mu gihe yatozaga u Rwanda. Caesar yatsinze ibitego bitatu muri iryo rushanwa nka kapitane we n'umuhungu wa kera, wa Kitende Mutagatifu Mariya Farouk Miya. Okhuti avuga ko kugaruka kwe \"guhindura imyumvire\". Nibwo yegukanye igikombe cya kabiri CECAFA. \nOkhuti yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Uganda muri CHAN muri 2016. "}
{"id": "15969", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15969", "title": "Tito Okello (umupira w'amaguru)", "text": "Tito Okello (wavutse 7 Mutarama 1996) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Sudani yepfo ukina nkumukinnyi ukinira ikipe yo muri Irani ya Paykan FC ndetse nikipe y'igihugu ya Sudani yepfo. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nOkello yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Sudani y'Amajyepfo ku ya 10 Ukwakira 2020 bakina na Kameruni B. "}
{"id": "15970", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15970", "title": "Allan Okello", "text": "Allan Okello (yavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 2000) Yabaye umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru muri KCCA FC, ku ntizanyo ya paradou AC hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu ya ugandanka rutahizamu, ni umukinnyi wa Fufa Airtel w'umwaka wa 2019.\nKCCA FC.\nKu ya 24 Gashyantare 2017, Okello yashyizwe ahagaragara mu ikipe ya Kampala Capital City, i Lugogo. Okello yinjije igitego bitatu maze atanga umupira wavuyemo igitego kimwe ku ncuro ya mbere ubwo ubuyobozi bwa Kampala Capital City City bwatsindaga Onduparaka FC 7\u20130 kuri stade ya Phillip Omondi ku ya 27 Gashyantare 2017, bityo aba umukinnyi wa mbere watsinze ibitego muri shampiyona ya Premier League ya Uganda muri 2016\u20132017. Muri Nyakanga 2017, amakipe menshi y'abigize umwuga ku isi nka Mamelodi Sundowns, Amsterdamsche Football Club Ajax hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Al Ahly Sporting Club yo muri Egiputa yerekanye ko ishishikajwe na Okello. Icyakora, intumwa ye, Isaac Mwesigwa yemeje ko \"atazava mu gihugu atarangije amashuri ye yo mu rwego rwa A.\" \n2018\u201319 Uganda Premier League.\nOkello yakinnye umukino we wa mbere wa shampiyona ku ya 28 Nzeri, ahanganye na Soana FC kuri Stade ya Phillip Omondi StarTimes, Kampala Capital City Authority (yatsinze 2\u20131). Yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri shampiyona yakinnye na Onduparaka ku ya 19 Ukwakira kuri Green Light Stadium, muir Arua. OKello yakinnye umukino wa nyuma wa shampiyona na Maroons FC ku ya 4 Gicurasi 2019, kuri Stade ya Phillip Omondi. Yakinnye imikino irenga 24 muri shampiyona. Ubuyobozi bukuru bwa Kampala bwabaye shampiyona. OKello yarangije shampiyona ya 2018\u20132019 ya Uganda Premier League n'ibitego bitandatu. \nParadou AC.\nKu ya 21 Mutarama 2020, Okello yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 3 na Paradou AC. \nKCCA FC Garuka.\nKu ya 20 Nzeri 2022, Okello yasinyanye amasezerano y'inguzanyo y'umwaka na KCCA FC. "}
{"id": "15971", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15971", "title": "Tony Odur", "text": "Tony Odur (wavutse 7 Ukuboza 1984) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda uheruka gukinira Katwe United yo muri Uganda. Odur kandi yagiye agaragara mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. Muri Werurwe 2010, Odur yatsinze ibitego bitazibagirana yakinnye n'Uburundi mu majonjora ya CHAN.\nmuri 2014 muri CAF muri Champion League.\n Mu marushanwa ya CAF Champions League muri 2014, KCCA FC vs El Merriekih Tony Odur yari ku rupapuro, rw'amanota rw'abatsinze igitego kimwe n'ikindi cyatsinzwe na mugenzi we Herman Wasswa kugira ngo batsindiye hanze muri sudani, ishingiye kuri El Merriekih mu mukino wa 1, yatsinze igitego mu mikino ya 2 aho KCAA FC yatsinzwe na El Merriekih mu rugo, kampala, igiteranyo cya 3-2 bishyigikira KCCA FC gukomeza. Murin shampiyona ya CAF champions league yo muri 2014 na Nkana bakina na KCCA FC, Odur yatsinze igitego kumunsi wa 26 mu mukino urangira banganyije 2-2, kandi ibi byatumye aba umukinnyi wenyine wa KCCA watsinze ibitego mu mikino itatu mu mikino ya CAF Champions league muri 2014. \n2003 kugeza ubu.\nOdur yagaragaye muri 2003 nku musore ushimishije muri Express FC. Hamwe nu muto witwa Mark Mwambo, kuva aho yaretse umukino, wo hagati, bari abana bashya kuri bariyeri yavuye ku ntebe muri Shampiyona ya makipe ya CECAFA muri uwo mwaka kugirango bahindure umukino. Bombi ni bo bavuganaga muri kiriya gihe kandi birashimishije cyane iyo shampiyona irangiye, bafashije Express gutwara igikombe cya Kakungulu. Ariko gukomera cyane ni byiza gutinda kunganya, Odur yatsinze ku mukino wanyuma wa Kakungulu muri 2004 na KCC. \nAriko, ibibazo bya Odur byabaye iikinyabupfura gicye. Faruuk Ssimbwa, wahoze ari umuyobozi muri Express hagati ya 2005 na 2007 yatangarije [ikinyamakuru Uganda] ko Odur yari umuhanga nuko atumvira. Ati: \"Yari umukinnyi wifuzwaga gushaka gufata ikipe, ariko ntashobonte niba adahawe icyo ashaka.\" \nNimwe mumpamvu yarange kureka ikipe akajya muri Bunamwaya. Yagize kandi ibizamini by'igeragezwa muri Danimarike nubwo atatsinze, kandi Tony yagize ati: \"Nkeneye kongera kurasa amahirwe nk'aya niyo mpamvu nkora cyane.\" \nMuri Mata 2014, Tony yagiye muri Viyetinamu gukomeza akazi ki nzozi ze, zo gukinira ahandi hanze ya Shampiyona, bityo yerekeza mu ikipe ikorera muri Viyetinamu, Sai Gon FC kugira nakore igeragezwa muri Mata 2014. Muri 2014 Tony yabuze umukino ukomeye mu gikombe cya Uganda, kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza na kaminuza ya Sc victoria kuri stade ya phillip omondi, kubera imvune yo mu ivi ariko KCCF yatsinze uyu umukino ibitego 2-1 "}
{"id": "15972", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15972", "title": "Robert Odongkara", "text": "Robert Odongkara (wavutse ku ya 2 Nzeri 1989) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Horeya AC ya Gineya, nk'umuzamu.\nUmwuga.\nOdongkara yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Villa, Uganda Revenue Authority na Saint George. \nMu Kwakira 2018, Odongkara yimukiye mu mujyi wa Adama muri Shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Etiyopiya nyuma y'imyaka irindwi ari kumwe na Saint George. Muri Kanama 2019, Odongkara yarangije kwimukira muri Horoya AC ku masezerano yi myaka ibiri. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2010, yagaragaye mu mikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. Yagaragaye inshuro imwe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2017, akina iminota mirongo icyenda yose yo kunganya 1-1 mu matsinda hamwe na Mali. "}
{"id": "15973", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15973", "title": "Joseph Ochaya", "text": "Joseph Benson Ochaya (yavutse ku ya 14 Ukuboza 1993) Ni umugande ukina nkuwabigize umyuga mu mukino w'umupira w'amaguru, ukina mu misiri mu ikipe ya Al Mokawloon Al Arab no mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nOchaya yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu Kampala city Council / Ubuyobozi bw'Umujyi wa Kampala, Navibank S\u00e0i G\u00f2n, Asante Kotoko, na Lusaka Dynamos, TP Mazembe na Al Mokawloon Al Arab. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nOchaya yavukiye i Kampala, yatangiye umwuga we mu Kampala city Council.\nMu Gushyingo 2012, yavuye mu Kampala city Council yimukira mu ikipe ya Asante Kotoko yo muri Gana ku giciro cy\u2019amadorari 30.000. Muri Kanama 2013, yagiye mu igeragezwa mu ikipe yo mu Budage SpVgg Greuther F\u00fcrth Yabaye Umukinnyi w\u2019icyiciro cya mbere muri Uganda, Umukinnyi ufite agaciro cyane' muri shampiyona yo muri 2015-16, ubwo yakinaga na Kampala Capital City Authority. Kwimukira muri yo ikipe yo muri Afrika yepfo Bidvest Wits muri Kanama 2016 byaguye. \nMuri Werurwe 2017, Ochaya yarangije kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Zusiya Lusaka Dynamos. Mu Kwakira 2018, yasinyanye n'ikipe ya Kongo TP Mazembe. Muri Nzeri 2022, yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Misiri Al Mokawloon Al Arab. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Nzeri 2012, Ochaya yakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda, atangira bwa mbere muri uwo mwaka. Yagaragaye mu mikino yo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cyisi cya FIFA. Yabaye umwe mu bakinnyi muri Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2016. "}
{"id": "15974", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15974", "title": "Patrick Ochan (umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru)", "text": "Patrick Ochan (wavutse ku 10 Ukuboza 1990) Ni umugande ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina hagati mu kibuga muri Kyetume FC no mu ikipe y'iguhugu ya uganda,\nGukina amateka.\nPatrick yabanje gukina muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC, no muri Saint George FC muri Etiyopiya, Simba SC muri Tanzaniya, na TP Mazembe yo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ndetse no muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC.: Lapasse Football Club yo muri shampiyona ya Seyishele Premier League. aGaruka muri URA Uganda Revenue Authority SC muri 2015-2017, nyuma yaho yagiye muri Bukavu Dawa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 2017. Muri Nzeri 2018, yinjiye muri Kyetume FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\n\"Ibarurishamibare neza nkumukino wakinnye 10 Nzeri 2017\" "}
{"id": "15975", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15975", "title": "Benjamin Ochan", "text": "Benjamin Ochan Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira muri KCCA FC muri shampiyona ya Premier League ya Uganda nkumuzamu. Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. Kuva mu Kwakira 2021, afata nka kapiteni wa KCCA FC. \nUmwuga.\nOchan yakiniye amakipe atandukanye nka KCCA FC, Bloemfontein Celtic, Villa SC, Victoria University SC, Kabwe Warriors, AFC Leopards kuri ubu muri KCCA FC\nKCCA FC.\nMuri 2015, yinjiye muri KCCA FC muri kaminuza ya Victoria ya SC, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka 2. Yatangiye bwa mbere bakina na Uganda Revenue Authority. Ni umwe mu bakinnyi bake muri shampiyona bakinnye imikino 15 yose mu cyiciro cya mbere cya 2016/17 ya Uganda Premier League, Ochan yagumanye impapuro 8 zisukuye hamwe 4 baza mu cyiciro cya mbere mu gihe abandi 4 baza muri icyiciro cya kabiri. Ukuboza 2016, Ochan yasinye andi masezerano yu mwaka 1 ya mugumanye muri KCCA FC kugeza muri Mutarama 2018. Mu gihe muri KCCA FC Ochan yari kapiteni wungirije wa kabiri. Mu minsi ye yera kandi nziza i Lugogo niho KCCA FC yujuje ibisabwa mu mupira wa maguru ku mugabane wa Afurika nyuma yo gutsinda ikipe ya Al-Masry yo mu Misiri muri penaliti binyuze mu guhindura umwanzuro mu Misiri., \nKabwe Warriors.\nMuri Mutarama 2018, Ochan yinjiye muri Kabwe Warriors nyuma ya Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2018 yabereye muri Maroke anasinya amasezerano yi myaka 3. Ku ya 14 Nyakanga 2019 Ochan yavuye muri Kabwe Warriors FC ku masezerano yo kumvikana. \nIngwe ya AFC.\nKu ya 16 Nyakanga 2019 yinjiye muri AFC Leopards ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. \nKCCA FC.\nOchan yongeye kwinjira muri KCCA FC ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri ku ya 13 Nzeri 2021. Yabaye kapiteni wa KCCA FC kuva mu Kwakira 2021. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nOchan yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda ku ya 30 Nzeri 2013 akina n'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Misiri mu mukino wa gicuti. Muri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019amarushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroc. "}
{"id": "15976", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15976", "title": "Denis Obua (umupira w'amaguru)", "text": "Denis Obua (13 Kamena 1947 - 4 Gicurasi 2010) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba umuyobozi w\u2019ishyirahamwe rya Uganda, akaba yarakinnye ibumoso muri Uganda hagati yo muri 1968 na 1977 nyuma akaza kuba perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda (FUFA) n'umuyobozi w'Inama ishinzwe amashyirahamwe y'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba no Hagati (CECAFA).\nGukina umwuga.\nUmwuga wa club.\nDenis Otim Obua yavutse ku ya 13 Kamena 1947 mu mudugudu wa Akol mu Karere ka Amolatar muri Uganda. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Boroboro na Manjasi High School, Tororo, aho, muri 1967, impano ye yamenyekanye maze asinywa muri Coffee United FC. Umwaka wakurikiyeho yinjiye muri Police FC, bakorana umwuga umwe nk'umupira w'amaguru n'umupolisi. Muri 1977, Obua niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona, afite ibitego 24, ariko nyuma yuko Polisi isezerewe mu mpera za shampiyona yo muri 1978 yinjiye muri Maroons FC ya Luzira. \nObua yakiniye Maroons gusa igihembwe kimwe. Muri Mata 1979, umunyagitugu wa Uganda, Idi Amin, yirukanwe maze, mu gihe kihungabana cy'akurikiyeho, abakinnyi benshi bo muri Simba FC - ikipe, icyo gihe, bakuwe mu bakozi bakuru b'ingabo - batawe muri yombi. Kugira ngo wirinde ibintu nk'ibyo, Obua n'abandi bakinnyi benshi b'umupira w'amaguru bahungiye muri Kenya, aho yakiniye Luo Union. Yagarutse muri Uganda mu 1980 maze asubira muri Polisi FC, ariko ntiyasubirana imiterere maze arasezera. Muri 1983, yavuye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru yinjira muri Villa SC, wari yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere muri Uganda umwaka ushize. \nObua yakiniye Villa mu mikino yombi yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019igikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019igikombe cyo muri 1983, ariko, mbere gato yuko umukino ubanza wa kimwe cya kane kirangiza, yakomerekeye mu kibazo cyatumye umwuga we wo gukina urangira. Yari muwa kabari i Kamwokya ubwo yagabweho igitero n\u2019abantu bitwaje imbunda, batangira kurasa ku bakiriya batabishaka. Obua yarashwe mu nda, nubwo yajyanywe mu Budage bw'Iburengerazuba kwivuza, ntiyashoboye gukomeza gukina. \nUmuryango.\nDenis Obua yabyaye abana 18. Umuhungu we David yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Uganda kandi yakinishaga Umutima muri shampiyona ya Premier League ya sikotishi. Undi muhungu, Eric, akinira SC Villa yari muri Uganda Super League, naho uwa gatatu, Kevin, akinira ishuri rye, Ishuri ryisumbuye rya St Mary, Kitende. Umukobwa, Sarah Desire Birungi, ayoboye ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ubwishingizi ya netball muri Netball League ya Uganda. "}
{"id": "15977", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15977", "title": "David Obua", "text": "David Obua (wavutse 10 Mata 1984) ni umutoza wumupira wamaguru wa Uganda, wahoze ari umukinnyi. Ni umutoza w'ungirije wa Maroons FC yo muri Uganda Premier League. Mu mwuga we wo gukina, Obua yakiniye Polisi FC, Raleigh Capital Express, Wilmington Hammerheads, Kaizer Chiefs na Heart of Midlothian muri Scottish Premier League. Ku rwego mpuzamahanga, yari ahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda kandi afite agahigo ko kuba yaratsinze ibitego byinshi muri iki gihugu mu gikombe cya Afurika ndetse no mu majonjora y'igikombe cy'isi. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nObua yavukiye i Kampala, muri Uganda, yakiniye amakipe menshi mu gihugu cya Uganda harimo na Police FC. Yamaze kandi igihe muri Morice no muri Amerika, aho yakiniye Raleigh Capital Express na Wilmington Hammerheads igihe yigaga muri kaminuza.\nObua yagaragaye na Kaizer Chiefs ubwo yakinaga mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda na Afurika yepfo maze ahabwa amasezerano y'imyaka 3. Yatangiye bwa mbere ku ya 11 Kanama 2005 atsinda Dynamos ibitego 2-0. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere cya Chiefs muri derby ya Soweto ku ya 29 Ukwakira 2005. Obua yatangajwe cyane igihe yari muri Afurika yepfo, yegukana igikombe cya shampiyona ndetse n\u2019umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Afurika yepfo muri shampiyona 2006\u201307. \nNyuma yo kurangiza amasezerano ya Kaizer Chiefs yabonetse k'ubuntu mu mpeshyi ya 2008. Yatangiye igeragezwa mu ikipe ya West Ham United yo mu cyiciro cya mbere, mbere yo kwemeranya n\u2019ikipe ya Scottish Premier League yo mu gihugu cya Scottish Premier League. Ku ya 6 Kanama, byagaragaye ko Obua yahawe uruhushya rwo gukora kandi yasinyiye imitima."}
{"id": "15978", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15978", "title": "Ivan Ntege", "text": "Ivan Ntege (wavutse 8 Nzeri 1994) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira muri KF Tirana muri Alubaniya ndetse nikipe yigihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sredojevi\u0107, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cyo muri Afurika muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15979", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15979", "title": "Julius Ntambi", "text": "Julius Ntambi Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikibuga mu ikipe yo muri Kiira Young. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15980", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15980", "title": "Derrick Nsibambi", "text": "Derrick Nsibambi (yavutse ku ya 19 Kamena 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Uganda uherutse gukinira ikipe ya Smouha yo mu Misiri ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ukina imbere.\nUmwuga.\nYakinnye umupira wamaguru muri Kampala Capital City Authority na Smouha. \nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2017. "}
{"id": "15981", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15981", "title": "Stephen Nsereko", "text": "Stephen Nsereko (yavutse ku ya 20 Nyakanga 1986) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda.\nUmwuga.\nIshuri Rikuru.\nNsereko yize muri kaminuza ya Buganda mu gihugu cye kavukire cya Uganda, anagira umwuga wo gukina muri Villa Kampala yo muri Uganda Super League, mbere yo kwimukira muri Amerika muri 2006, yaje kwitabira no gukina umupira w'amaguru muma shuri makuru no muri kaminuza ya Winthrop. Yatoranijwe nk'inama nkuru y\u2019umwaka wa 2006 mu majyepfo y\u2019umwaka, yashyizwe mu itsinda rya Big South Conference All-Freshmen Team, atoranywa na College Soccer News nk'umwe mu ba mbere 100 muri 2006, akomeza kubawe inshuro eshatu zose -Inama Nkuru y'Amajyepfo n'akarere ka Atalantika y'Amajyepfo yose. \nNsereko yakinnye kandi na Hampton Roads Piranhas na Fredericksburg Gunners muri USL Premier League League.\nAbabigize umwuga.\nNsereko yabaye umunyamwuga muri 2010 ubwo yasinyaga na Richmond Kickers wo mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya USL. Yatangiye gukinira iyi kipe ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2010 mu mukino yakinnye na Real Maryland Monarchs. \nMpuzamahanga.\nNsereko ni umunyamuryango wuzuye w'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda ; yagaragaye mu mikino itatu y'igihugu cye mu marushanwa yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA 2006, yakinnye na Burkina Faso, Gana na Cape Veride. "}
{"id": "15982", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15982", "title": "Moses Nsereko", "text": "Moses Nsereko (yapfuye ku ya 15 Nzeri 1991) yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wo muri Uganda, ari nu umuyobozi, Mu mwuga we wo gukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati, yakiniye ikipe yigihugu ya Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya Afurika cyo muri 1976 na 1978. \nUmwuga wo kuyobora.\nNsereko yinjiye mu Kampala city council (KCC) nk'umuhungu w'umupira mu mpera zo muri 1960, ariko buri gihe yagiye agaragara mu ikipe ya kabiri y'iyi kipe. Mu 1970 ni bwo yashoboye kwambara umwenda w'umuhondo \"uzwi\" wa KCC. Kugeza 1971, yatangiye mu ikipe ya KCC. yabanje koherezwa nk'umukinnyi w\u2019iburyo n'umutoza Jaberi Bidandi Ssali, Nsereko yahinduye umwanya wo hagati mu kibuga. Nku mukinnyi muri KCC, yafashije iyi kipe gutwara shampiyona y'igihugu ya Uganda muri 1976 na 1977, ndetse n'igikombe cya CECAFA ya makipe muri 1978. \nMu 1979, Nsereko yagizwe umukinnyi n'umutoza muri KCC nyuma yo kugenda kwa Bidandi Ssali. Nkumukinnyi-umutoza mukuru muri KCC, Nsereko yatsindiye Uganda Super League muri 1981, 1983, na 1985, ndetse ni gikombe cya Uganda muri 1979, 1980, 1982, na 1984. Nyuma yi gihembwe kidashimishije muri 1986, yeguye muri 1987. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNsereko yari umusore mpuzamahanga mbere yo gukinira ikipe yigihugu ya Uganda. Yakinnye imikino umunani atsinda igitego kimwe muri Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 1976 na 1978, maze atoranywa mu itsinda ry\u2019irushanwa rya nyuma. Nsereko yegukanye igikombe cya CECAFA muri 1973, 1976, na 1977 ; yawushije penalti ya nyuma mu gutsindwa kurasa na Tanzaniya mu marushanwa yo muri 1974. \nUmwuga wo kuyobora.\nMuri Mata 1989, Nsereko yatorewe kuba umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019umupira wamaguru muri Uganda (FUFA). Ku buyobozi bwa Perezida John Semanobe, yakoze mu gushinga inzego z'umupira w'amaguru. Bitewe no kuvugurura iterambere ry\u2019umupira wa maguru mu rubyiruko, ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda yegukanye ibikombe byigikombe cya CECAFA mu 1989 na 1990. Nsereko yari afite umwanya muri FUFA kugeza apfuye muri 1991. \nUrupfu.\nKu ya 15 Nzeri 1991, Nsereko yiciwe bunyamaswa hanze y'urugo rwe mu nzu ya Wampewo i Kololo, Kampala. Abantu bitwaje imbunda batamenyekanye ntibigeze bashyikirizwa ubutabera. Nsereko yasize abapfakazi babiri n'abana barenga barindwi. \nUrupfu rwa Nsereko rwateje akaga umupira w'amaguru wa Uganda abashyigikiye KCC. "}
{"id": "15983", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15983", "title": "Andereya Mwesigwa", "text": "Andrew Mwesigwa (wavutse ku ya 24 Mata 1984) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Uganda wahoze akina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa kinnye nka myugariro.\nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMwesigwa yatangiye umwuga we muri 2002 akinira ikipe ya Villa SC yo muri Uganda, mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Islande ya \u00cdBV muri 2006. \nNyuma yo kumara shampiyona yo muri 2010 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Chongqing Lifan yo mu Bushinwa, muri Gashyantare 2011 yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri n\u2019ikipe yo muri Kazakisitani Premier League yo muri FC Ordabasy. \nMuri Gashyantare 2013, Mwesigwa yongereye amasezerano na Ordabasy, nyuma yo gutwara igikombe cya Super cup cya Qazaqistan muri 2012. Mwesigwa yavuye muri Ordabasy mu Kuboza 2014. \nMuri Gicurasi 2015, bivugwa ko Mwesigwa yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019imyaka itatu na Bidvest Wits yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019umupira wa maguru, ariko imishyikirano ya masezerano irahagarara maze Mwesigwa ntabwo asinyira Bidvest Wits. \nNyuma muri 2015, Mwesigwa yakiniye Yenicami A\u011fdelen muri KTFF S\u00fcper Lig, mbere yo kugenda muri Mutarama 2016. \nNyuma yo kuva muri Yenicami A\u011fdelen, Mwesigwa yagiye mu rubanza hamwe no muri V.League uruhande rwa 1 H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i, mu 2016 rwimurirwa mu mujyi wa Ho Chi Minh maze rwitwa S\u00e0i G\u00f2n FC Yamaranye shampiyona yo muri 2016 na S\u00e0i G\u00f2n, akora 23 imikino ya shampiyona. \nMuri Mutarama 2017, Mwesigwa yagiye mu igeragezwa n'ikipe yahoze yitwa FC Ordabasy. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMwesigwa yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Uganda muri 2003. "}
{"id": "15984", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15984", "title": "Hamza Muwonge", "text": "Hamza Mulindwa Muwonge (yavutse ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 1982) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira Bright Stars, nk'umuzamu.\nUmwuga.\nMuwonge wavukiye i Kampala, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Ggaba United, Kampala United, Simba, Bunamwaya ariyo Vipers, Thika United na Bright Stars. \nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2007, kandi yagaragaye mu mikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA. "}
{"id": "15985", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15985", "title": "Martin Muwanga", "text": "Martin Muwanga (wavutse ku ya 20 Ukwakira 1983) ni umukinnyi wari rutahizamu w'umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda. Kugeza ubu akinira ikipe ya Uganda Premier League mu ikipe ya Uganda Revenue Authority SC.\nUmwuga.\nMuwanga yatangiye umwuga we na Polisi Jinja muri shampiyina ya Premier League ya Uganda, mbere yo kwerekeza muri ATRACO FC muri 2006 hanyuma yerekeza muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC muri 2008.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYakinnye kuva muri 2004 kugeza muri 2005 imikino ibiri mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda."}
{"id": "15986", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15986", "title": "Bernard Muwanga", "text": "Bernard Muwanga (yavutse ku ya 25 Kanama 1993) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Proline FC, nka myugariro akaba n'umukinnyi wo hagati. \nUmwuga.\nYavukiye i Kampala, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Bright Stars, SC Villa na Kampala Capital City Authority. \nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2015. "}
{"id": "15987", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15987", "title": "Travis Mutyaba", "text": "Travis Mutyaba (yavutse ku ya 7 Kanama 2005) ni umukinniy ukina umupira w'amaguru uvuka i Nansana Uganda ukinira ikipe ya SC Villa yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda Premier League ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMuri Kanama 2021 Mutyaba yasinye amasezerano yi myaka itatu na ikipe ya Uganda Premier League yitwa SC Villa. Mbere yo gusinyira Villa, yakiniye ikipe y'abato ya Vipers SC na Synergy FC yo muri Futsal Super League, aho yari umwe mu batsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona. Ukuboza 2021, bivugwa ko yari amaze gukurura amakipe yo mu Butaliyani n'Ubufaransa. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri 2019 Mutyaba yari mu ikipe ya Uganda y'abatarengeje imyaka 15 yatsindiye Shampiyona ya CECAFA yabatarengeje imyaka 15 muri 2019 muri Eritereya. Mu mukino wa kabiri w'ikipe yo mu matsinda, yatsinze ibitego bibiri gusa ikipe ye yatsinze na Tanzaniya. Yongeye gutsinda igitego yatsinze 4-0 kuri Kenya ku mukino wanyuma kugirango afashe gutwara igikombe. Umwaka ukurikira yagizwe umukinnyi ufite agaciro cyane kuko Uganda yatsindiye muri Shampiyona ya CECAFA yabaterengeje imyaka 17 yo muri 2020 yabereye mu Rwanda. \nMutyaba yahamagawe mu ikipe nkuru y'igihugu mu mukino wa gicuti na Tanzaniya afite imyaka 16. Yakomeje atangira gukinira umukino wa nyuma intsinzi ya 2-0. Muri Mutarama 2022 yongeye guhamagarwa mu mikino itanu ya gicuti n\u2019impande z\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi na Aziya ubwo Cranes yagendaga muri Turukiya, Iraki, na Bahirayini. "}
{"id": "15988", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15988", "title": "Muzamir Mutyaba", "text": "Muzamir Mutyaba (yavutse 10 Ukwakira 1993) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Express, nku mukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga.\nYakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Maroons, kaminuza ya Victoria na Kampala Capital City Authority. Nyuma yo kuva muri KCCA mu mpera za shampiyona yo muri 2019\u201320, muri Mutarama 2021 yasinyiye muri Express. \nYatangiye gukinira ari mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2014. "}
{"id": "15990", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15990", "title": "Mike Mutyaba", "text": "Mike Mutyaba nanone yiswe Sulaiman Mutyaba (yavutse ku ya 23 Werurwe 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda wakinnye nk'umukinnyi w'imbere mu kibuga. Ubusanzwe y'akinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati unyura ibumoso nyamara yari afite ubushobozi bwo gukina neza iburyo cyangwa imbere.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBunamwaya SC.\nMike Mutyaba yinjiye mu kipe kuva akiri mu ishuri kubera ko mbere yari umukinnyi w\u2019ishuri mu ikipe y\u2019iwabo ya Express FC maze aza gutangira umukino wa mbere. \nEl Merreikh.\nMutyaba yiagiye muri El Merreikh, Mu mubano mwiza bafitanye, Mike Mutyaba yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri, mu gibihangange cyo muri Sudani aricyo El-Merreikh, nyuma y'iminsi ibiri ikipe ya Bunamwaya SC yohereje Owen Kasule yinjiye mu ikipe yo muri Viyetinamu ya Hoang Ahn Gia Lai asinya amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri.\nUmunyamakuru wa FUFA, Rogers Mulindwa, yatangarije abanyamakuru ati: \"Turemeza ko Mike Mutyaba yinjiye muri El-Merreikh kandi tumaze gusohora icyemezo mpuzamahanga cyo kwimura umuntu cya (ITC).\" \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYari mu ikipe ya Uganda ya batarengeje imyak 23. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe nkuru ya Uganda muri 2011. "}
{"id": "15991", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15991", "title": "Allan Musoke", "text": "Allan Musoke (wavutse 1980) ni umukinnyi ukina rugby m ubumwe bwa Uganda. Akina ku ruhande. Mubuhanga, akaba akora nk'umukozi ushinzwe abakozi muri Uganda Telecom Ltd.\nMusoke yakoze siporo nyinshi kuva akiri muto. Yakinnye umukino wa basketball muri DMark Power muri Ligue ya FUBA, kuva 1996 kugeza 1999, yari umuzamu, hamwe n'umupira w'amaguru muri Nsibirwa Hall, muri kaminuza ya Makerere, kuva mu 2000 kugeza 2002, yari nka rutahizamu, kugeza ubwo yiyemeje gukina gusa rugby.\nMusoke ni umwe m'ubakinnyi beza ba ruhago ba Uganda muri iki gihe, nubwo atigeze akina mu mahanga. Ikipe ye kuri ubu ni UTL Kobs. Yabaye inshuro ebyiri MVP ya ruganda ya rugby.\nAkina ku rwego mpuzamahanga muri Uganda, kuri ubu akaba ari we watsinze ibitego byinshi muri \"Cranes\". Yabaye umukinnyi w'ingenzi mu ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya CAR Africa Cup ku ya 29 Nzeri 2007, batsinze Madagasikari 42\u201311, mu mukino yatsinze igerageza. \nMusoke kandi yakiniye ikipe mpuzamahanga african Leopards, ku ya 23 Nyakanga 2005, mu gutsindwa muri 15-30 n\u2019abanyeshuri bo muri Afurika yepfo, muri Ellis Park, Johannesburg."}
{"id": "15992", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15992", "title": "Majid Musisi", "text": "Majid Musisi (yiswe Magid Musisi) (yavutse 15 Nzeri 1967 - 13 Ukuboza 2005) yari umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Uganda wavuzwe kuba ari we mukinnyi wa mbere w\u2019umupira wamaguru wa Uganda wasinyiye ikipe y\u2019i Burayi. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMusisi yabyawe na Siraje Katende na Deborah Namutebi. Yize mu ishuri ribanza rya New Mulago nyuma yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Bashir, ariko nyuma areka ishuri kugira ngo akore umwuga w'umupira w'amaguru \nUmwuga.\nMajid Musisi, kimwe n'abandi bakinnyi benshi b'umupira w'amaguru kuva muri mirongo inani, yakuze mu mwuga we w'umupira w'amaguru ku kibuga kizwi cyane cya Mulago, kizwi cyane ku izina rya 'Maracana' yerekeza kuri sitade izwi cyane yo muri Berezile. Kuruhande nka Adam Semugabi na Rajab Sekalye, yari umwe mubyifuzo bya mbere mu mashuri abanza ya New Mulago.\nStocky, yari afite imbaraga kandi afite umuvuduko, Musisi yarengeje imyaka ye maze agaragara muri bagenzi be ku buryo muri 1983 - ku myaka 16 gusa - uruhande rwa kabiri rwa Pepsi FC rwaramufashe. Muri icyo gikorwa, Majid Musisi yaretse kwiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Bashir i Wandegeya. Nyuma yi gihembwe gishimishije, umutekinisiye wa SC Villa, David Otti yabonye uyu musore maze ahita amwandikisha mu ikipe ya Villa yiteguraga Shampiyona ya Cecafa muri Mutarama 1985.\nIcyakora, Majid Musisi yabuze urugendo igihe pasiporo ye yarangiraga, ikipe ya Villa yerekeje muri Sudani guhura na El-Hilal muri Shampiyona y\u2019Afurika ya ikipe nyuma y'ibyumweru bitatu. Muri kiriya gihe, SC Villa yarafite imbaraga zavutse zifite ibikombe bibiri bya shampiyona zimaze gukenyera. Rogers Nsubuga niwe wabaye umukinnyi wa mbere muri iyi kipe hamwe na Ronald Vubya na Shaban Mwinda utari kure.\nNyuma yo kumarana ibihe bibiri na Rennes mu Bufaransa aho yakinnye imikino igera 64 yose yatsinze ibitego 18 (Shampiyona 2 nigikombe cy'ubufaransa), yagurishijwe mu ikipe yo muri Turukiya ya Bursaspor, nyuma yaje kugurishwa muri \u00c7anakkale Dardanelspor kuri miliyari y'amafaranga 1.8 yohereza ari amashiringi ya Uganda, gukora amateka ku isoko ryo kwimura ibicuruzwa bihenze cyane muri Uganda. Muri shampiyona ya 1996, yatowe nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi mu mahanga muri shampiyona ya Turukiya. Amaze gukina muri Turukiya yagize amarozi akinira \u0110\u00e0 N\u1eb5ng muri Viyetinamu. Yashinze \"icyamamare\" muri Bursaspor ingona yo kwizihiza ibitego mu mukino wa UEFA, Intertoto Igikombe cyahuje ikipe y'Ubudage Karlsruher SC ku ya 2 Kanama 1995. \nYakinnye kandi mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nImpaka.\nMagid Musisi yashakanye na Suzan Nantongo bari baratandukanye mbere gato y'urupfu rwe. Musisi yabyaye abana barindwi \nYapfuye nyuma y\u2019uburwayi bwari bumaze igihe ku ya 13 Ukuboza 2005 mu rugo rwa nyina i Bwaise, mu nkengero z\u2019umujyi wa Kampala, aho yari acumbitse nyuma y\u2019uko ubuzima bwe bari bumeze nabi. Umurambo we wimuriwe mu rugo rwe rwa Muyenga, aho ajyanwa mu baturanyi ba Bukasa kugira ngo ushyingurwe saa yine z'ijoro ku ya 14 Ukuboza 2005. "}
{"id": "15993", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15993", "title": "Paul Musamali", "text": "Paul Musamali (yavutse ku ya 20 Ukwakira 1994) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina umupira w'amaguru i bumoso, muri buildcom FC yo muri zambiya premier league no mu kipe y'igihugu ya uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nSC Villa.\nMusamali yinjiye muri SC Villa muri 2012. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya Express FC maze atsinda igitego cya mbere muri SC Villa bakina na Ndejje University FC mu gikombe cya Uganda.\nIburengerazuba.\nYinjiye muri Western Stima muri 2014, atangira gukinira Nakumatt FC maze atsinda igitego cye cya mbere yatsinze bakina na Kakamega Homeboyz\nKCCA.\nMu mwaka wo muri 2016, Musamali yinjiye mu Kampala city council atangira gukinira bahanganye na Vipers ndetse atsinda igitego cye cya mbere mu Nama Njyanama y'Umujyi wa Kampala bakina na Onduparaka. \nKubaka FC.\nMusamali yinjiye muri Buildcon FC kumasezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Yatangiye gukinira bahanganye na Kabwe Warriors.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMusamali yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ku ya 14 Nyakanga 2017 n'a majonjora yahanganye na Sudani y'Amajyepfo yo muri Chan muri 2018.\nIcyubahiro.\nKampala University FC\nUbuyobozi bukuru bwa Kampala\nUbuyobozi bukuru bwa Kampala"}
{"id": "15994", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15994", "title": "Allan Tarsis Munaaba", "text": "Allan Tarsis Munaaba (Yavutse ku ya 19 Mata 1989 ni umugande wakinnye umupira w'amaguru, uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru, wakinaga muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC, akaba akora muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC nku muyobozi mukuru, kuva muri Nzeri 2021. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMunaaba yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru muri Jinja Municipal Council FC muri 2005, SC Villa kandi aheruka gukina muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC. Yinjiye muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC muri 2008 maze atangira gukinira ikipe ya Young Africans FC mu gikombe cya Cecafa cyo muri 2008, Uganda Revenue Authority SC yatsinze ibitego 2-0 aho Allan yatanze umupira ku gitego cya kabiri. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Uganda Revenue Authority SC bakina na Sharing FC i Nakivubo muri 2009. Allan yari umwe mu bakinnyi bakinnye mu gikombe cya CAF Confederation muri 2015 kandi bagaragara mu mikino yose. Allan kandi ni kapiteni wa Uganda Revenue Authority SC. Muri Kamena 2020, yasezeye mu mupira w'amaguru. Muri Nzeri 2021, yagizwe umuyobozi mushya wa Uganda Revenue Authority Umuyobozi mukuru wa SC asimbuye Henry Mayeku. \nImibereho.\nMuri 2012, Munaaba yabonye impamyabumenyi yo muri Bachelor of Business mu kwamamaza muri kaminuza ya Makerere. "}
{"id": "15995", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15995", "title": "Isaac Muleme", "text": "Isaac Muleme (wavutse 10 Ukwakira 1992) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nkumukinyi w'ibumoso kuva muri Viktoria \u017di\u017ekov. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMuri Gashyantare 2019, Isaka yinjiye mu ikipe yo muri Tch\u00e8ke muri Viktoria \u017di\u017ekov avuye mu ikipe ya Haras El Hodoud yo mu Misiri. \nMuri Gashyantare 2020, Muleme yinjiye mu ikipe ya Fortuna Liga FC Nitra ku ntizanyo ya kimwe cya kabiri. Yatangiye shampiyona mu gihe cya mbere abonye amahirwe, mu rugo i pod Zoborom, ku ya 15 Gashyantare 2020 bakina na Pohronie. Pohronie na Nitra bari mu ntambara itaziguye yo kwirinda aho bamanuka, Nitra irusha amanota \u017diar nad Hronom yari ishingiye ku bashya. Muleme yatangiye ku munota wa 81, ubwo yinjiraga asimbuye Duje Javor\u010di\u0107. Umukino washojwe banganya igitego. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sredojevi\u0107, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019amarushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "15996", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15996", "title": "Steven Mukwala", "text": "Steven Mukwala (Yavutse 15 Nyakanga 1999) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nka rutahizamu muri Asante Kotoko SC yo muri Gana. Yakiniye Vipers SC atizwa muri Maroons FC yo muri Uganda Premier League. \nUmwuga.\nikipe.\nMuri Mutarama 2017, byatangajwe ko Mukwala azinjira mu ikipe nkuru ya Vipers SC yo muri Uganda, Vipers SC mu byavuzwe ko hari ikintu cy'ambere cyatangiye kumuvana mu mupira w'amaguru wa Masaza kugeza kuri w\u2019umupira wamaguru wa Uganda. \nMuri 2018, Mukwala yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ya batarengeje imwaka 23 gukina na Gana na Kameruni aho yatsinze igitego kimwe ndetse akaba yari no mu ikipe ya Uganda yitabiriye amarushanwa ya COSAFA yabereye muri Lesotho maze abasha gufasha Uganda kurangiza ku mwanya wa 3 inyuma Misiri imaze gutsinda ibitego 3. \nMuri Gashyantare 2017, Mukwala yari mu itsinda rya Vipers Team ryatsinze Azam muri Uganda Premier League kandi yari muri gahunda za Miguel Da Costa umutoza wa Vipers icyo gihe wari wamugiriye ikizere nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego bikomeye ikipe mu gushaka ku mugikombe muri 2017. \nMuri 2019, Mukwala yatijwe muri Maroons FC muri shampiyona nshya yo muri 2019-2020 aho yatsinze ibitego 13 ndetse numwe mubatsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona n'imikino itanu yo kujya muri Uganda Premier League. Umuvuduko n'imbaraga zo kurangiza umupira byashimishije andi makipe menshi ariko ashyira imbere ikipe yo mu bwana ya Vipers SC. "}
{"id": "15997", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15997", "title": "Ronald Mukiibi", "text": "Ronald Mukiibi (wavutse ku ya 16 Nzeri 1991) ni umukinnyi ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda, ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Suwede ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina nka myugariro mu ikipe ya Degerfors. yagaragaye mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda ku rwego mpuzamahanga kandi afite pasiporo ya Suwede.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nIkipe ye ya mbere yakiniye ya Allsvenskan yari BK H\u00e4cken. Nyuma yaje kumara imyaka myinshi muri upstarts \u00d6stersunds FK. Mu mpeshyi yo muri 2021 yararekuwe, gusa agaruka muri Nzeri, uwo mwaka nyuma yo kunanirwa kubona indi kipe. Nyuma yi gihembwe cyo muri 2021 yongeye kurekurwa.\nKu ya 31 Mutarama 2022, Mukiibi yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri na Degerfors. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMukiibi yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cy'Afurika cyo muri 2017, ariko yanga kwitabira. \nIcyakora, yemeye guhamagarwa muri 2019 ubwo yongeye guhamagarwa mu ikipe ibanza y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2019, nyuma akaza guhamagarwa mu bakinnyi 23 ba nyuma ku ya 11 Kamena. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere yatsinze kote Divuwari igitego 1-0 ku ya 15 Kamena 2019. "}
{"id": "15998", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15998", "title": "Ashe Mukasa", "text": "Ashe Mukasa (Yavutse Mata 1952) yahoze ari umukinnyi wo hagati wumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda wakiniye Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 1978.\nUmwuga.\nMukasa yavukiye mu gace ka Lungujja ko muri Kampala, yatangiye umwuga we akina n\u2019urubyiruko rwaho Nateete Young Stars na Nakivubo Boys. Muri 1969, yinjiye muri Coffee FC yo mu cyiciro cya mbere muri shampiyona. Igihe cyakurikiyeho, yimukiye muri NIC FC mu cyiciro cya kabiri. \nMu 1972, Mukasa yagarutse mu cyiciro cya mbere hamwe na Express FC, iyi kipe yari gutwara ibikombe bibiri bya shampiyona mu bihe bitanu. \nMukasa yakiniye Uganda ku mukino wa nyuma wo muri 1974, 1976 na 1978. "}
{"id": "15999", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15999", "title": "Godfrey Mugisha", "text": "Mugisha Godfrey (Yavutse ku ya 23 Ukwakira 1978) yahoze ari umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda wakinnye nkumukinnyi ukina hagati kandi ari rutahizamu. Godfrey yakinnye cyane nko kina kuruhande. Yahagarariye Uganda mu batarengeje imyaka 17, abatarengeje imyaka 19 na 21, abatarengeje imyaka 23, n'ikipe nkuru y'igihugu ya Cranes. Yagombaga gukinira ikipe y'abatarengeje imyaka 23 (Imikino yose yo muri Afurika) muri Afurika y'Epfo ariko yaje kuvayo kubera imvune. Yagize uruhare runini mu kuyobora KCC FC muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri shampiyona ya Afrika. \nYimukiye muri Reta zunzubumwe z'Amerika muri 2000 kugira ngo yige kaminuza, arangiza afite impamyabumenyi muri sisitemu yo gutanga amakuru no gushushanya. Yabaye itsinda rya mbere mu nama zose muri 2002, 2003, na MVP mukarere ka XII 2003, naho Abanyamerika bose bubahwa muri 2003. Mu mwaka wa mukuru 2004/05 yatumiwe muri Chicago Storm, ikipe yumupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga. Icyo gihe yari hafi kurangiza kugirango ashobore gusinya."}
{"id": "16000", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16000", "title": "Yasser Mugerwa", "text": "Yassar Mugerwa Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya KCCA FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019amarushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "16001", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16001", "title": "Bevis Mugabi", "text": "Bevis Kristofer Kizito Mugabi (Yavutse ku ya 1 Gicurasi 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nka myugariro mu shampiyona ya sikotishi mu ikipe ya Motherwell. Yabanje gukina shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru yo mu Bwongereza muri Yeovil Town. Yavukiye mu Bwongereza, ahagarariye Uganda ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUbuzima bwambere kandi bwihariye.\nMugabi yavukiye i Harrow, Londere, ku babyeyi baturutse i Kampala, muri Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nMugabi yatangiye umwuga muri Fulham mbere yo kwinjira muri gahunda y\u2019urubyiruko ya Southampton muri Nyakanga 2011, anasinyana amasezerano n\u2019imyaka ibiri ni gice n\u2019ikipe muri Gashyantare 2015. \nUmujyi wa Yeovil.\nYasinyiye mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Yeovil Town ku ya 5 Kanama 2016 ku masezerano y'umwaka. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe ye ya mbere ku ya 9 Kanama 2016, asimbuye ku munota wa 54 mu mukino wa shampiyona ya EFL Cup na Walsall. Mugabi yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kuri Yeovil mu gikombe cya EFL wabahuje na Portsmouth ku ya 30 Kanama 2016. Muri Gicurasi 2017, yasinyanye amasezerano n\u2019imyaka ibiri n\u2019iyi kipe \nMu mpera za shampiyona yo muri 2018\u201319, Mugabi yarekuwe na Yeovil nyuma yo gusezererwa muri shampiyona ya kabiri. \nMubyeyi.\nKu ya 12 Nzeri 2019, Mugabi yasinyiye Motherwell ku masezerano kugeza muri Mutarama 2020. Nyuma yuko mugenzi wo muri Motherwell Charles Dunne akomeretse, Mugabi yari yiteguye gutangira bwa mbere vuba nkuko byari byitezwe. Ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 2019, Motherwell yatangaje ko bongereye amasezerano na Mugabi kugeza mu mpeshyi ya 2021. \nKu ya 18 Gashyantare 2022, Mugabi yasinyanye amasezerano na Motherwell, kugeza mu mpeshyi ya 2024. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMugabi yari yemerewe guhagararira Ubwongereza cyangwa Uganda ku rwego mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "16002", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16002", "title": "Musa Mudde", "text": "Musa Mudde (Yavutse ku ya 23 Gicurasi 1990) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muriUganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga. \nUmwuga.\nMusa Mudde yagaragaye bwa mbere mu gukina mu Buhinde, akinira ikipe ya Gokulam Kerala muri sahmpiyona ya I-League.\u00a0"}
{"id": "16003", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16003", "title": "Paul Mucureezi", "text": "Paul Mucureezi (wavutse 11 Gashyantare 1993)Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati wa Kitara FC muri shampiyona ikomeye yitiriwe Startimes muri Fufa. "}
{"id": "16004", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16004", "title": "Hassan Mubiru", "text": "Hassan Mubiru (yavutse ku ya 16 Ukuboza 1978) ni umukinnyi akaba rutahizamu w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka i Lukuli, mu gice cya Makindye, mu karere ka Kampala muri Uganda wakiniye Express FC.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nHassan Mubiru wavukiye i Lukuli, mu nkengero z'akarere ka Kampala mu gice cya Makindye, ni umwe mu bakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru bafite ubuhanga, Uganda yigeze itunga. Yavutse ku ya 16/12/1988, Mubiru yatangiye umwuga we w'umupira w'amaguru mu ishuri kimwe n'abandi bakinnyi benshi b'umupira w'amaguru mu gihugu. Ariko, inzozi ze akiri umwana ntizari kuba umupira wamaguru nkuko yahoraga arota umwuga mubyamategeko cyangwa ubuvuzi. Ntabwo byari bikwiye kuba yarangije ishuri murwego rwa O. Yize amashuri abanza ya Katwe Noor mbere yo kwinjira mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Makindye amashuri yisumbuye.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kuva mu ishuri mu 1994, Mubiru yahisemo kwibanda ku mupira w'amaguru maze umwuga we ushingiwwa ahitwa Lukuli United, igice cya mbere mu mudugudu yavukiyemo. Umutoza Walakira Siraje wakoraga uruhande icyo gihe yahamagaye Mubiru amusaba kwitoza hamwe niyi kipe. Imbere yahindutse intangiriro ako kanya. Mu 1995/6 Amarushanwa ya shampiyona yicyiciro cya mbere Kampala, Lukuli United yagaragaye hamwe namakipe menshi ko mu yandi harimo Police FC. Ibikorwa bya Mubiru ku ruhande rw'iburyo rwagati rwagati muri iri rushanwa byashimishije benshi barimo umutoza wa Polisi FC, Denis Obua (wahoze ari perezida wa FUFA) washukishije umuzamu abapolisi ba Nakawa kugira ngo yinjire mu bapolisi nyuma yo kwinjira mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019icyiciro cya mbere mu gihugu.. Muri iki gihe, Mubiru yari ashishikajwe no kujya mu ikipe kuko yashakaga kuba umukinnyi wa shampiyona.\nMubiru yayoboye muri shampiyona ya Premier League yo muri Kenya mu gutsinda ibitego ibihe bitatu bikurikiranye (2001, 2002 na 2003) ubwo yari muri Express FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMu gihe Majid Musisi wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Turukiya atari adahari, Mubiru yahamagariwe kuzuza mu mwanya mu Musisi, mu itsinda ry\u2019amajonjora yo gushaka umwanya hamwe na Musisi mu itsinda ry\u2019amajonjora yo guhatanira itike yo guhatanira nini za Musiri mu matsinda ane yo gushaka itike yo guhatanira itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika. Yatangiye agahigo ka dasanzwe muri uyu mukino, atsinda ibitego bibiri, harimo imyigaragambyo itazibagirana ku munota wa nyuma yahaye Uganda intsinzi y'ibitego 2-1. Kuva icyo gihe, yagize uruhare runini mu ikipe y'igihugu."}
{"id": "16005", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16005", "title": "Dan Mubiru", "text": "Daniel Mubiru (wavutse ku ya 25 Ukwakira 1976) ni umukinnyi ukina wo hagati mu kibuga ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina mu ikipe ya Polisi ya Jinja muri shampiyona ya Premier League. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we na Villa SC muri Premier League ya Uganda, mbere yo muri 2003 yimukira muri Polisi Jinja.\nMpuzamahanga.\nMubiru yakinnye kuva 2002 kugeza 2004 mu ikipe yumupira w'amaguru ya Uganda."}
{"id": "16006", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16006", "title": "Martin Mpuga", "text": "Martin Mpuga (wavutse 20 Ugushyingo 1992) ni umikinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Uganda, wakinnye nka myugariro wa Maroons FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. "}
{"id": "16007", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16007", "title": "Joseph Mpande", "text": "Joseph Mpande (wavutse 12 Werurwe 1994) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina muri Viyetinamu nku mukinnyi wa H\u1ea3i Ph\u00f2ng muri shampiyona ya V.League 1. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kujya mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda mu gikombe cya Afurika 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu matsinda y\u2019irushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. \nAmaze kuva muri Miyanimari, yimukiye muri Viyetinamu akinira i Hai Phong."}
{"id": "16008", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16008", "title": "Farouk Miya", "text": "Farouk Miya (wavutse 26 Ugushyingo 1997)Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w' amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga, ukinira mu ikipe ya TFF Yambere Ya makipe ya \u00c7aykur Rizespor hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMuri Mutarama 2016, hatangajwe ko Miya azinjira mu ikipe nkuru y\u2019Ububiligi,ya Standard Li\u00e8ge mu byavuzwe ko ari amasezerano y\u2019intizanyo yabanje kumuvana mu ikipe ya Vipers yo muri Uganda. Standard Li\u00e8ge yabonye serivisi zayo ku giciro cya 400.000 US $. \nKu ya 31 Mutarama 2017, Miya yagurijwe muri Royal Excel Mouscron kugeza shampiyona irangiye. \nMuri Gashyantare 2018, Miya yagurijwe muri S\u0259bail FK, agaruka mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2017\u201318. \nKu ya 20 Kanama 2019, Miya yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka itatu na S\u00fcper Lig kuruhande rwa Konyaspor. Yatangiye umukino we nyuma yiminsi itanu ahanganye na Galatasaray kuri Stade T\u00fcrk Telekom. \nYinjiye mu ikipe ya TFF Yambere Yambere \u00c7aykur Rizespor mu masezerano y'imyaka ibiri muri Nyakanga 2022. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMiya yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda ku ya 11 Nyakanga 2014 na Seychelles. "}
{"id": "16009", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16009", "title": "Charles Livingstone Mbabazi", "text": "Charles Livingstone Mbabazi (Yavutse ku ya 18 Ukwakira 1980) ni umutoza w\u2019umupira wamaguru wa Uganda akaba yarahoze akinira ikipe ya Athletic St Patrick muri Shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere muri Irlande ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. Yari umukinnyi ufite ubushobozi bwo gukina haba mu m'ababa cyangwa imbere. Mu gihe y'amaze muri ikipe yakoresheje izina rya Mbabazi inyuma mu myenda ye.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nMbabazi yamenyekanijwe na St Patrick n'umukozi icyo gihe yari John Fashanu. Yabanje gukinira ikipe ya Al Ahly SC muri shampiyona ya Premier League yo mu Misiri. Nyuma y'imishyikirano y'amaze igihe kinini arekurwa ku rwego mpuzamahanga na Federasiyo y\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ya Uganda, yatangiye ku munsi wa St Stephen ku munsi wo muri 1999 yakinnye na Athlone Town mu gikombe cya Leinster. Mbabazi yabaye umufana ukomeye, atsinda igitego cya mbere bakinnye na Longford Town mu mikino ya Ligue y'abereye muri Richmond Park. yatsinze igitego mu rugo kwa Bray Wanderers, nyuma y'iminsi ine gusa na murumuna we bapfuye muri Uganda.\nMuri Kamena 2002, Mbabzai yatsinze igitego bakinnye na HNK Rijeka mu gikombe cya Intertoto UEFA 2002. Uyu mukino wanditswe mu mateka k'ubatagatifu nkubwa mbere batsinze mu marushanwa ya makipe yi Burayi. Nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego hanze, Charles yongeyekuzuguza inshundura mu cyiciro gikurikira mu mukino wo mu rugo na KAA Gent. \nMu 2003, byabaye ngombwa ko asezera kubera ikibazo cy'umutima nyuma yo kugwa mu kibuga mu mukino wa shampiyona na Bohemians. Ubuhamya yatanze ku guhitamo Brian Kerr bwabaye mu Gushyingo 2004 mbere yo gusubira muri Uganda. Mbabazi yatsindiye Uganda inshuro 36."}
{"id": "16010", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16010", "title": "Tony Mawejje", "text": "Anthony Mawejje Jr. (Yavutse ku ya 15 Ukuboza 1986) Ni umugande wakinnye umupira w'amaguru arkina hagati muri police FC, ndetse no mu ikipe y'igihugu ya ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMawejje mbere yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri mu ikipe ya Tippeligaen yo muri Noruveje Haugesund mbere ya shampiyona yo muri 2014. Muri Nyakanga 2014, nyuma yo kwitaba Haugesund inshuro eshatu gusa, Mawejje yimukiye i Valur ku ntizanyo. Ku ya 27 Mutarama 2015, Mawejje yabaye umukinnyi ku buntu. \nTirana.\nMuri Nyakanga Mawejje yinjiye muri Tirana muri Alubaniya maze atangira umukino wa mbere ku ya 6 Nzeri 2017 atsinda FK Kuk\u00ebsi aho yakinnye umukino wose. Tony yatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri Tirana ku ya 16 Nzeri 2017 bakina na KS Iliria ; Tirana yatsinze 1-0. "}
{"id": "16011", "revid": "11911", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16011", "title": "Haruna Mawa", "text": "Haruna Mawa ni umutoza wumupira wamaguru ukina muri Uganda kandi yahoze ari umupira w'amaguru. Nkumukinnyi, yakiniye Rayon Sports fc mu Rwanda. Mu Gushyingo 2016, yagizwe umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Somaliya. "}
{"id": "16012", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16012", "title": "Benjaloud Youssouf", "text": "Benjaloud Youssouf (wavutse 11 Gashyantare 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati, mu ikipe yu bufaransa ya LB Ch\u00e2teauroux. Yavukiye mu Bufaransa, ahagarariye Comore ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i Marseille, Youssouf yari mu ikipe ya FC Nantes ya batarengeje imyaka 19 yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza cya Coupe ya Gambardella. Yinjiye muri Orl\u00e9ans muri 2013 ahindura umwuga arikumwe nabo. \nMuri Kamena 2017 yimukiye muri AJ Auxerre, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka itatu. \nAmasezerano ye ya Auxerre arangiye, ntiyabashije kugaragara mu ikipe ya mbere muri shampiyona yose ya 2019\u201320, Youssouf yasinyiye muri Le Mans. \nKu ya 23 Kamena 2021, yasinyanye na Ch\u00e2teauroux imyaka ibiri. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYoussouf yerekanye bwa mbere muri komore muri 2015. "}
{"id": "16013", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16013", "title": "Great Rift Valley", "text": "Ikibaya kinini cya Rift ni izina ryatanzwe muri 1894 n'umushakashatsi ukomoka muri ekosi witwa John Walter Gregory, nyuma y'urugendo rwe muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, mu itsinda ryari irya geologiya rigizwe n'uruhererekane rw'ibishanga n'ibirunga, biherereye muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nryitwa irya furika y'Iburasirazuba cyangwa \"Irikora kuri afurika y'Iburasirazuba\", iri rigizwe n'amashami menshi agabanijwemo ibice by'ibibaya, nayo ubwayo agabanijwemo uduce duto, ikibaya cy'amasoko. Ibi byinjira mu imiterere yose izina rya \"sisitemu yo muri Afrika yuburasirazuba\". Ihuriro hamwe n\u2019\u2019inyanja Itukura, Ikigobe cya Suez Ikosa na Levant Fault bigize Sisitemu ya Afro-Arabiya.\nMubyukuri, amakosa yose ya tectonic yerekeje muri Afrika no muri Aziya Ntoya nko mu kilometero cya 7\u00a0000,\u00a0uva mu majyaruguru ugana mu majyepfo, na kilometero 30 Kuri kimometero 100\u00a0z'ubugari, kuva muri Libani kugera muri Mozambike, unyura ku nyanja Itukura n'ibiyaga binini byo muri Afurika. Igabanya Ihembe rya Afurika mo kabiri: isahani ya Somaliya, iburasirazuba, iragenda iva ku isahani ya Afurika, y'iburengerazuba. Igabanyijemo, igana mu majyepfo ya Etiyopiya, ku mpande zombi za Uganda. igashamika iry\u2019iburengerazuba (Albertine rift) rinyura mu biyaga binini byo muri Afurika, ryakozwe no kwegeranya amazi mu kwiheba, mu gihe ishami ry\u2019iburasirazuba (Gregory rift) ryambukiranya Kenya na Tanzaniya mu burasirazuba bw\u2019ikiyaga cya Victoriya, aho rigizwe n'umugozi muto.\nUbumenyi.\nNi ahantu hameze nk'umwobo.\nUbumenyi bwa geologiya.\nKumeneka.\nKuva mu majyaruguru ugana mu majyepfo, tectonike agizwe no yo kwa Afar (harimo Ikigobe cya Tadjoura na Block ya Danakil), ikibaya cya Awash, ikibaya cya Omo, ikiyaga cya Turkana, nyuma y\u2019ikosa rya Afurika ryigabanyijemo amashami abiri, rigira Ikomeye Ibiyaga bya Afurika mu burengerazuba n'ibiyaga bito mu burasirazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Victoria, kugira ngo bihure mu majyepfo mu kiyaga cya Malawi no mu kibaya cya Shire, mu majyepfo ya Malawi."}
{"id": "16015", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16015", "title": "Igishanga cya bishenyi", "text": "Igishanga cya Bishenyi giherereye mu Murenge wa Rugalika mu Karere ka Kamonyi, cyuzuye biturutse ku mvura nyinshi yahaguye none ubu abaturage ntibari kubona uko bagenda, Ni igishanga kiri ku umuhanda uhuza Bishenyi, Kigese na Rugalika, kucyambuka bifashishaga amateme atatu ariho na yo imvura yayatwaye. Imvura yatangiye kugwa kare, ikagwa mu buryo budasanzwe ku buryo abaturage bahatuye bakorera mu Mujyi wa Kigali n\u2019abanyeshuri bavaga ku mashuri batari kubona uko bataha. Ni igishanga gisanzwe cyuzura iyo habayeho ikibazo cy\u2019imvura nyinshi igwa igihe kirekire."}
{"id": "16016", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16016", "title": "Ikibaya cya Mukunguri", "text": "Ikibaya cya Mukunguri, ni igishana kiri mu mirenge ya Mugina na Nyamiyaga ho mu karere ka Kamonyi hamwe no mu Murenge wa Kinazi wo mu Karere ka Ruhango, ahakorerwa ubuhibw'umuceri muri iki gishanga, aho hamaze imyaka isaga 40 hari ubu buhinzi muri iki gishanga cya Mukunguri. Abahinzi bibumbiye mu ma Zone 13 mu gishanga gifite ubuso bwose bugera kuri Hegitali 700 ariko wakuramo imigezi n\u2019ahanyuzwa imiyoboro n\u2019ibindi bikorwa by\u2019ahadahingwa ugasanga gisigarana nka Hegitali 500 zirenga. Gusa na none kubera ibibazo by\u2019ibiza byakuze kwibasira iki gishanga, ubuso bubyazwa umusaruro bubarirwa muri Hegitali 400 zirenga. muri iki gishanga harimo abahinzi bibumbiye muri koperative zitandukaNYE nka COPRORIZ\nKugitunganya.\nUmushinga wo kugitunganya, uzibanda ku gutunganya ubutaka buri ku buso bwa Hegitari 700, bwo mu misozi igikikije, mu rwego rwo kuburinda kwangirizwa n\u2019isuri. Bizajyana n\u2019ingamba zo gukangurira ababuhinga kubahiriza ibikenerwa byose mu kongera umusaruro harimo imbuto nziza, ifumbire y\u2019imborera n\u2019imvaruganda, imiti, ishwagara n\u2019ibindi bituma umusaruro wiyongera.Ni igishanga kiri ku buso bwa Hegitari 700, izikunze kurengerwa n\u2019amazi y\u2019imvura, zikaba zibarirwa muri 20.Mu umushinga wo kugitunganya haziyongeraho Damu, izayobora amazi mu buryo bworohereza abahinzi mu mirimo ijyanye no kuhira imyaka, bityo bajye babasha no guhinga batitaye ku kurindira imvura.Ibyo bizarushaho kubakira abahinzi ubushobozi, no guca imyumvire y\u2019abagitekereza ko umurimo w\u2019ubuhinzi ari uwa ba \u201cmbuze uko ngira\u201d.Ubwo bizaba byashyizwe mu bikorwa, umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi, uzarushaho kwiyongera.Igihe kirageze ngo umuhinzi yubakirwe ubushobozi bumugira rwiyemezamirimo nk\u2019abandi bose babarizwa mu rindi shoramari rirambye."}
{"id": "16017", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16017", "title": "Igishanga cya Cyoganyoni", "text": "Igishanga cyangwa Ikidendezi cya Cyoganyoni, kiri hagati y'akagari ka Ruyenzi ho mu murenge wa Runda n'aka Kigese ho mu murenge wa Rugarika. Abaturage bagituriye, niho bavoma amazi kuko amariba avamo amazi meza aherereye kure yabo.\nUbuhinzi.\nKu nkuka z'igishanga cya Cyoganyoni, hari ibiraro by'ingurube n'iby'inka, muri iki gihe cy'imvura, imyanda isohokamo ikaba iruhukira muri icyo kidendezi, abaturage bakaba bavuga ko ibyo byiyongera ku myanda ituruka mu mugezi wa Bishenyi wisuka muri Cyoganyoni, uba wazanye imyanda itandukanye irimo ifumbire mvaruganda bafumbiza imyaka bahinga muri icyo gishanga.\nKu Gisana.\nMugihe kinini cyari gishize bamwe mu bahinga mu gishanga cya Cyoganyoni bataka igihombo baterwaga n\u2019amazi y\u2019imvura yateraga imyuzure muri icyo gishanga,Abafite imirima muri icyo gishanga, abagituriye n\u2019abaturage biganjemo abo mu Mirenge ya Kaniga na Cyumba mu Karere ka ngoma iki gishanga kibarizwamo, bagaragaza ko uko kwangirizwa imyaka y\u2019abo n\u2019amazi yarengeraga imirima imwe n\u2019imwe ikigize byatumaga babaga bataha ntamusaruro.Bavugako bahoraga bahangayitse bibaza amaherezo y\u2019icyo kibazo barayobewe, kuko inzego zose bigaragara ko zakagize icyo zibikoraho, bari barazegereye barazitakambiye ngo zibarwaneho zibafashe gushaka umuti w\u2019icyo kibazo.Nubwo ibintu byose ku masoko ya byihagazeho muri Ngoma, naho ibirayi byageze ku mafaranga 550. Imbuto imboga n\u2019ibindi biribwa biragurwa n\u2019Umuntu wifite, byaratumbagiye ku kigero kirenze kure uko byahoze mbere.Ubuyobozi butekereza ko kuba kiri hafi gutunganywa, abahinzi bazarushaho kongera imbaraga n\u2019ubushake mu buhinzi buteye imbere bityo n\u2019abakenera umusaruro ugiturukamo babyungukiremo."}
{"id": "16018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16018", "title": "Igishanga cya Kilimbi", "text": "Ni igishanga kiri mu Mudugudu wa Gatyazo, Akagari ka Rugali mu Murenge wa Macuba mu Karere ka Nyamasheke, aha niho hatangijwe igihembwe cya kabiri cy\u2019ihinga cy\u2019umwaka wa 2012-2013 batangira batera ibigori mu materasi ari ku misozi ikikije umugezi wa Kilimbi. Aya materasi ari guterwaho ibigori yaciwe mu mirima y\u2019abaturage ku nkunga y\u2019umushinga wa Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi ushinzwe gutunganya ibishanga no kubibungabunga. Uyu mushinga ukorera mu Mirenge ya Macuba na Kilimbi hagamijwe gutunganya.Muri iki gihembwe ahatoranyijwe hazahingwa ibigori muri aka karere hangana na hegitari 2500, bikaba biteganyijwe ko kubiba bizarangirana.\nUmushinga.\nMu rwego rwo kubungabunga neza iki gishanga babanje gukora amaterasi ku misozi imenera amazi muri iki gishanga, ibi bikaba byarafashije abaturage gutunganya imirima yabo bityo bikazabafasha no kongera umusaruro. Abakorewe aya materasi kuyitaho bakayabyaza umusaruro kandi bakayafata neza kugira ngo atangirika, kuko ari ku misozi ihanamye bagateraho urubingo. Aya materasi ari guterwaho ibigori yaciwe mu mirima y\u2019abaturage ku nkunga y\u2019umushinga wa Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi ushinzwe gutunganya ibishanga no kubibungabunga. Uyu mushinga ukorera mu Mirenge ya Macuba na Kilimbi hagamijwe gutunganya igishanga cya Kilimbi"}
{"id": "16019", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16019", "title": "Igishanga Cya Nyagahembe", "text": "Muri 2023 mu Karere ka Nyamasheke hazatangira ibikorwa byo kubungabunga inkengero z\u2019umugezi wa Nyagahembe. Bizakorwa ku buso bwa Kilometero 36 buterweho\u00a0 imigano, urubingo \u00a0n\u2019ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka. bizaba ari igisubizo k\u2019ugukumira amazi y\u2019uyu mugezi yangizaga hegitari nyinshi z\u2019umuceri bahahingaga.\nUbuhinzi.\nAbahinzi b\u2019iki gihingwa ngangurarugo kikaba na ngengabukungu iyo cyeze ari kinshi kikagemurirwa amahanga bari baherutse kubwira itangazamakuru ko Minisiteri y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi yababeshye kuzagitunganya bagategereza bagaheba.\nUmushinga.\nKoperative yabo \u00a0igizwe n\u2019abanyamuryango 179, Bavuga ko iyo habaye umwuzure, igishanga kikuzura, imyaka yabo ikangirika bahomba kandi na Leta ntigire icyo ibamarira mu kubashumbusha. Ikibabaje kurushaho ni uko basanzwe bishyura ubwishingizi, Tuzatangira kurwanya isuri mu mabanga y\u2019imisozi yose ikikije igishanga cya Nyagahembe ku buso bwa hegitari 80. Hazakorwaho amaterasi y\u2019indinganire hacukurweho imirwanyasuri ndetse haterwe n\u2019ibiti ndumburabutaka bivangwa n\u2019imyaka ndetse n\u2019urubingo. Politiki y\u2019ubuhinzi ya Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda kuri paji yayo ya 231 ivuga ko mu gutunganya ibishanga no kuhira hari gahunda yo gufasha abahinzi kubona ibikoresho byo kwifashisha bakabyishyura buhoro buhoro ku mafaranga make kuzageza babyegukanye."}
{"id": "16020", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16020", "title": "Umusozi Mabu", "text": "Umusozi Mabu ni umusozi uri mu majyaruguru ya Mozambike, uzwi cyane kubera ishyamba rigwamo imvura cyane ryakuze. Umusozi Mabu ufite uburebure bwa metero1700 kandi ni ishyamba rifite hegitari 7000. Nubwo bizwi cyane mu karere, ishyamba ry'umusozi Mabu hamwe n\u2019ibinyabuzima bitandukanye cyane ntibyari bizwi nk' bimera n\u2019inyamaswa kugeza mu 2005. ubwo wasuwe nyuma kuri Google Earth mu 2005 n'itsinda ry'abahanga bo mu kigo cyita ku kubungabunga imisozi ya Mulanje (MMCT) hamwe n'abashakashatsi mu by'imiterere ya ornithologue, nyuma mu 2008 n'abahanga bo mu busitani bwa Kew Royal Botanic ; mugushakisha icyogajuru cya Google Earth kugirango ushakishe ahantu nyaburanga hatamenyekana muri Afrika. Bikunze kwitwa \" Ishyamba rya Google \". \nIbituye ku musozi Mabu.\nHariho abaturage baturiye umusozi wa Mabu, hafi yabo ni Nangaze, Nvava, na Limbue. Uyu musozi ugira uruhare runini mubuzima bw'abaturage, kandi muri cosmologiya y'umuyobozi wa Nangaze. Inkuru zaho zivuga ko abayobozi ba mbere ba Nvava cyangwa umuryango wa Nangaze nyuma yo gupfa umwuka wabo wagurutse kumusozi. Ni n'impamvu ituma buri umwe muri aba baturage avuga ko byemewe ko ari umusozi wa Mabu. Abaturage bitabaza umusozi kugirango bakingire, nanone poroteyine zituruka ku nyamaswa, kurisha kw'amatungo, n\u2019imihango gakondo. Ibi bikorwa byabyaye ubumenyi bwinshi bwaho kubyerekeye uyu musozi utaracukumburwa bijyanye n'inyungu ziyongera kuri Mabu. Muri cosmology yabo Umusozi Mabu ni ingingo y'umuco igomba kubahwa.\nKugeza ubu, hari imiryango ibiri itegamiye kuri Leta ya Mozambike ikorana n\u2019abaturage guhindura umusozi wa Mabu ahantu ho kubungabunga ibidukikije, ari bo Justica Ambiental na RADEZA. Iyi miryango itegamiye kuri leta yashizeho amashyirahamwe yo kurinda umusozi wa Mabu mu baturage batandukanye. Justica Ambiental yashinze amashyirahamwe muri Nangaze, Nvava, Namadoe na Limbue. RADEZA yashyizeho komite zishinzwe gucunga umutungo kamere mu miryango ine yavuzwe n'izindi esheshatu. RADEZA ifatanije na ITC (Iniciativa de Terras Privadas) yemeje guverinoma gutanga ibyemezo by'ubutaka bw'abaturage - DUAT. Kugeza, ubungubu nta kubungabunga Mabu byemewe. Ariko, amashyirahamwe agenzura uko umusozi nishyamba byajya bisurwa.\nUbwoko.\nMu moko 126 y\u2019inyoni yamenyekanye, hari abwoko burindwi bushya bw'amoko y\u2019inyoni zibangamiwe ku isi mu ishyamba, harimo na Thyolo alethe, abandi baturage bose bakaba babangamiwe no kwangiza amashyamba no gutema amashyamba. \nHabonetse amoko menshi mashya mu ishyamba ry'umusozi Mabu. Gutandukanya ishyamba ry'imvura, bikikijwe na savannah, bituma bishoboka ko ryakira amoko menshi mbere atavumbuwe. Amazina y' ubwoko kugeza ubu burimo:\nMuri iryo shyamba hashobora kuba hari andi moko menshi mashya, hamwe n\u2019abakandida kugeza ubu barimo umunyabwenge, pseudo-sikorupiyo, ibikeri, udusimba, udusimba, injangwe, nudukoko dutandukanye. \nMuri Kamena 2009, guverinoma ya Mozambike yatangaje ko bazashyiraho ingamba zo kubungabunga ibidukikije kugira ngo ibicuruzwa bitinjira mu bucuruzi. Ishyamba rya Mabu ngo niryo shyamba rinini rinini ryo hagati muri Afurika. Amashyamba yo muri Afrika adahumanye no gutema ibiti nibindi bikorwa byabantu ntibisanzwe. Ishyamba ry'umusozi Mabu rikikijwe n'uturere twangijwe n'intambara y'abenegihugu ya Mozambike (1977\u20131992). Kubona umuhanda mubi, no kuyikoresha nkubuhungiro kubaturage baho mugihe cyintambara byose byagize uruhare mukurinda. Nta nyandiko zerekana ingendo zabanjirije cyangwa gukusanya ingendo zavumbuwe. "}
{"id": "16021", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16021", "title": "Igishanga cya Mulindi", "text": "Igishanga cya Mulindi cyangwa Ikibaya cya Mulindi kiri mu karere ka Gicumbi,gifite ubuso bwa hegitare 1200, cyose cyari gisanzwe kirimo icyayi, ariko imwe mu mirima yacyo yari iri ku buso bwa hegitare 150 yatembeyemo imyuzure n\u2019isuri biva ku misozi, bigiteza kuma.\nUmushinga.\nUmushinga w\u2019Ikigega cy\u2019Ibidukikije, ushinzwe kubaka ubudahangwa bw\u2019abaturage b\u2019Akarere ka Gicumbi mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe, harimo kubafasha kurwanya isuri n\u2019imyuzure, ndetse no kongera umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi. rero umushinga \u2019Green Gicumbi\u2019 ukorera muri ako Karere uvuga ko Leta n\u2019abaturage batakomeza guhomba icyayi cyahingwaga mu kibaya cya Mulindi kubera imyuzure, ukaba urimo gufasha abagihinga ku misozi.\nIcyayi.\nUbundi icyayi kigira imizi miremire, iyo igeze ku mazi yo mu butaka biteza igiti cyose guhita cyuma. nubwo icyayi gikunda ahantu hahora imvura, icyo ku misozi ari cyo gikura neza kandi kikaryoha bitewe n\u2019uko ibibabi bisoromwa biba bitarigeze birengerwa n\u2019imyuzure yo mu gishanga. wari ufite umurima w\u2019icyayi ungana na 1/2 cya hegitare mu kibaya cya Mulindi, avuga ko bataraterwa n\u2019imyuzure yasoromaga ibiro birenga 150 buri byumweru bibiri, ariko ubu ngo nta na 70kg abasha kubona. icyayi yahinze imusozi yatangiye kubona ko kizamuha umusaruro ungana cyangwa urenga uwo yabonaga mu kibaya cya Mulindi ubwo yari atarangirizwa n\u2019imyuzure hamwe n\u2019isuri imanuka ku misozi."}
{"id": "16022", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16022", "title": "Igishanga cya Cyohoha-Rukeri", "text": "Igishanga cya Cyohoha - Rukeri giherereye mu karere ka Rulindo, aha abaturage bavuga nta nyungu bagikuramo kuko bishyurwa amafaranga make ku kilo bakanakatwa amafaranga menshi y\u2019ifumbire. Abo bahinzi kandi bavuga ko banakatwa amafaranga y\u2019abatunganya bityo ngo bakaba basanga ubuhinzi bwabo nta kamaro bubafitiye uretse kubakamuramo imbaraga.\nIcyayi.\nUhinga icyayi muri iki gishanga, avuga ko ubu buhinzi bugirira akamaro abatari abahinzi ngo kuko ababagurira icyayi bakanabaterera imiti babaca amafaranga menshi. abasoromyi bo bahabwa amafaranga 21 ku kilo basoromye, twe twagiteye tukagikorera tukakitaho bakaduha 45 ku kilo, bagahindukira bagakuramo amafaranga y\u2019amafumbire hakaba ubwo usanga mu kwezi umuntu asigarana ubusa agataha uko yaje."}
{"id": "16025", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16025", "title": "Igishanga Cyohoha", "text": "Igishanga cya Cyohoha kiri mu karere ka Bugesera mu murenge wa Mayange, bamwe mu baturage bavuga ko babuze icyo bakora nyuma yo kubuzwa guhinga mu gishanga cya Cyohoha ahateye ibiti, mu gishanga cya Cyohoka hagati y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019u Burundi.\nUrufunzo.\nmu myaka ya za 2000 ikiyaga cyaCyohoha, cyarakamye amazi ashiramo tukajya duhingamo urutoki, ibishyimbo, amateke n\u2019imyumbati. Ariko mu mwaka muri 2016 REMA yatangiye kutwigisha uko twahinga imusozi tukareka guhinga mu kiyaga,batangira gutera imigano ku nkengero z\u2019ikiyaga. itsinda ribungabunga ikiyaga cya Cyohoha. Avuga ko imyumvire yabo yahindutse ubu bakaba babungabunga ikiyaga babishyizeho umwete. kubungabunga ikiyaga cya Cyohoha dufashwa kujya tubyaza umusaruro urufunzo bakuramo ari narwo rugira uruhare mu gukamyamo amazi. Umwe Ati: \u201cBatwigishije gukora pipinyeri no gutubura imbuto z\u2019ibiti byo gutera. Urufunzo dukura mu kiyaga turubohamo isakaro ryo gutwikiriza ingemwe kugirango ziticwa n\u2019izuba zikuma.\nImigano.\nImigano iteye mu gishanga cya Murago iteye ku nkengero za Cyohoha, umushinga wa bamboo uzabafasha kuyibyaza umusaruro kuburyo bazatera imbere kandi bagakomeza no kubungabunga iki kiyaga n\u2019ibidukikije muri rusange badafite imbogamizi z\u2019ubushobozi."}
{"id": "16026", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16026", "title": "Igishanga cya Mugonero", "text": "igishanga cya Mugonero gifite hegitare 50, kiri mu murenge wa Mahembe mu karere ka Nyamasheke, bivugwa ko nta musaruro w\u2019umuceri bafite biturutse ku kuba amazi atakigera mu miyoboro y\u2019igishanga.\numuceri.\nAba baturage bavuga ko mbere bezaga umuceri mwinshi ariko aho sosiyete y\u2019Abashinwa itunganyirije ikiraro kiri hejuru y\u2019umugezi wa Kiboga amazi atakinjira mu miyoboro, mbere amazi yarazaga neza nta kibazo ariko aho abashinwa baziye ntitwongeye kuyabona, ubu turahinga ntidusarure. nta musaruro tuzabona kubera kubura amazi kuko imvura ntacyo itumariye, ubu umuceri wagomba kuba uzanye uruyange.\u201d Akomeza avuga ko mbere yezaga imfuka 100 y\u2019umuceri utonoye ariko ko ubu abona nta na 50 azabona."}
{"id": "16027", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16027", "title": "Igishanga cya Rusuri", "text": "Igishanga cya Rusuri, kiri gutunganywa n'umushinga Welthungerhilfe kuva ku wa 26 Kamena 2015 urimo gutunganya iki gishanga cya Rusuri cyo mu Murenge wa Rwaniro mu Karere ka Huye, kugira ngo kizajye gihingwamo umuceri. iki gishanga, ngo uretse kuba bagiye kubona akazi kabinjiriza amafaranga mu gihe cy\u2019amezi 20, ngo na nyuma yaho bazabasha kujya bahinga beze kurusha uko byari bisanzwe, nta n\u2019uboneshereje nk\u2019uko byari byarabaye akamenyero.\nMu kugitunganya.\nIgishanga bagiye gutunganya gifite ubuso bwa ha 120, ariko ngo nibamara kugitunganya, umuceri uzajya uhingwa kuri ha 70 gusa. Hegitari zisigaye, zimwe ni izizasigwa ku butaka bwegereye umugezi unyura muri iki gishanga, izindi ziri ku butaka bwo mu nkengero z\u2019igishanga buzasigwa bugaterwaho ibiti hibanzwe ku byagirira akamaro abaturage, urugero nka avoka. Hari n\u2019ibice bizagenda bisigara hagati mu gishanga bitazajya bihingwa, kugira ngo bizajye bisukura amazi yo mu gishanga. Kuri buri rugomero rw\u2019amazi hazasigwa umwanya utazahingwamo, waretswe ku buryo bwa kamere, bya byatsi bisanzwemo bikagumamo. Turi no gutekereza ku byatsi twakongeramo, byifitemo ubushobozi bwo gufata amafumbire aba yashyizwe mu muceri, amazi akazajya avamo yamaze kuyungururwa.\nIki gishanga nikimara gutunganywa, imiryango 700 igituriye, haherewe ku yari isanzwe igihingamo, ndetse no ku ikennye kurusha iyindi, izabasha kujya ihinga umuceri. Ngo kizaba kinabereye ijisho, ku buryo ba mukerarugendo bashobora kuzagisura."}
{"id": "16028", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16028", "title": "Igishanga cya Ngiryi", "text": "Igishanga cya Ngiryi kiri mu karere ka Huye, aho gikorerarmo na Koperative ya COPRORIZ Ngiryi, ihinga umuceri mu gishanga cya Ngiryi gihuza imirenge 3 ya: Musha, Ndora na Gishubi. harimo ikibazo cy'amazi make n'inyubako z'igishanga zishaje.\nMuri Huye.\nTaliki ya 3 Gashyantare Isi yizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga wo kwita ku bishanga n\u2019ahantu hahehereye, akarere ka Huye kakaba gashyize imbaraga mu gutunganya ibishanga ngo karusheho kugira isura nziza itoshye kuko ibi bikorwa binahindurira abaturage ubuzima. Mu rwego rwo kubungabunga ibishanga kimwe n\u2019ibindi bice bihehereye, Ubuyobozi bw\u2019akarere ka Huye buvuga ko bwamaze guha umurongo gahunda yo gutunganya ibishanga.\nMu gihugu cyu Rwanda.\nIbishanga bigizwe na 10, 6% by\u2019ubutaka bw\u2019u Rwanda hamwe n\u2019ibishanga bigera ku 915 byavumbuwe mu gihugu hose. Muri ibyo, ibishanga 38 bingana na 20% y\u2019ubuso bwose birarinzwe."}
{"id": "16029", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16029", "title": "Igishanga cya Jeredi", "text": "Igishanga cya Jeredi, Igishanga cya Jeredi cyaratunganyijwe kugira ngo kirusheho kubyazwa umusaruro.\nImiterere.\nIgishanga gito cyitiriwe Jeredi gifite ubuso bwa hegitari 5 \u00a0giherereye hagati y'Utugari twa Cubi na Nyamiramba mu Murenge wa Kayenzi, kuri uyu wa kane tariki ya 27 Nzeri 2018 nibwo hakiriwe by'agateganyo imirimo yo kugitunganya, kugira ngo kizabyazwe umusaruro mu buryo bufatika.\nIgishanga.\nKwakira imirimo yakozwe muri iki gishanga, byakozwe ku bufatanye n'Urwego rw'Inkeragutabara (Reserve Force) ari nabo batunganyije igishanga, muri iki gikorwa cyo kwakira imirimo yakozwe hari kandi tsinda ry'abakozi baturutse ku cyicaro cy'Akarere riyobowe n'Umuyobozi w'Agateganyo w'Ishami ry'ubuhinzi n'umutungo kamere bwana Mukiza Justin, itsinda ryaturutse ku Murenge ndetse n'Umufatanyabikorwa w'Umushinga RWAARI. Bimwe mu byakozwe mu gutunganya igishanga harimo ku gukora inziza(imiyoboro) z'amazi kugira ngo birinde ko isuri ya hato na hato, ikindi kandi imirima nayo yaratunganyijwe.\nIbindi.\nMuri iki gishanga ubusanzwe hari hasanzwe hakoreramo amatsinda mato mato y'abahinzi agera kuri 3, ngo ariko nkuko umukozi ushinzwe ubuhinzi mu Murenge abitangaza, biteganyijwe ko ayo matsinda yazakorwamo itsinda rimwe kugira ngo bifashe muri gahunda ya \"smart Nkunganire. Nubwo n'ibindi bihingwa nk'ibigori n'ibishyimbo bigomba kwibandwaho kuko iki gishanga ari cyiza, u wari ukuriye itsinda rya mu gikorwa cyo kwakira iyi mirimo yakozwe mu gutunganya igishanga, yasabye abahinzi ko bashishikarira guhingamo n'imboga kugira ngo bashobora kubona amafaranga kuko imboga zitanga umusaruro mu buryo bwihuse."}
{"id": "16030", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16030", "title": "Igishanga cya Mirayi", "text": "Igishanga cya Mirayi gikora ku mirenge ya Muganza na Gishubi abagihingamo umuceri ubu bari gusarura ariko umusaruro wabo wagabanutse ku rwego rwa kimwe cya kabiri. Impamvu ngo ni imirimo yo gutunganya urundi ruhande rw\u2019iki gishanga yatumye ahahinze hakama. Abahinzi muri aka gace ubuzima bwabo bushingiye ku gihingwa cy\u2019umuceri ariko bavuga ko kubera iki kibazo ubu aho basaruraga 250Kg z\u2019umuceri hari abari kuvanamo 100Kg gusa. Igishanga cya Mirayi n'Igishanga cya Nkunamo bihuza Gishubi na Mamba usanga umusaruro ari mukeya kuko ni Ibishanga byakamye, hasabwa ko byubakwaho ingomero zigezweho zigafasha kubyuhira bigahingwa hakabaho kuboneka k'umusaruro kuko ibishanga ni bimwe mu bifasha abaturage benshi kubona imirimo bakabona uko bahinga bakiteza imbere bakabona ibyo kudya bivuye mubuhinzi cyane ko mubishanga akenshi hakorwamo ubuhinzi bw'imiceri cyangwa se hagakorwa ubuhinzi bw'ibigori."}
{"id": "16031", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16031", "title": "Igishanga cya Base", "text": "Igishanga cya Base,ni Igishanga cya Base cyose kiri mu karere ka Ruhango, hamwe gifite ubuso bwa hegitari 110. Imibare itangwa n'akarere ivuga ko 40 muri zo ari zo zangiritse. aho amazi y\u2019imvura menshi abangiriza aturuka ku bisenge by\u2019inyubako zo mu Mujyi wa Ruhango n\u2019uwa Nyanza akamanukana umuvuduko agana mu mirima yabo, hari Hegitari nyinshi z\u2019umuceri zarengewe n\u2019isuri ahari hahinze umuceri hagaragara umucanga."}
{"id": "16032", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16032", "title": "Igishanga cya Bahimba", "text": "Igishanga cya Bahimba ni igishanga gihingwamo n'abaturage b'imirenge ya Bushoki, Tumba,Mbogo na Base na Rusiga yose yo mu karere ka rulindo mu intara y'ajyaruguru. Igishanga cya Bahimba kiri mu karere ka Rulindo, kuwa mbere tariki 08/10/2012, Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe, yasuye ibikorwa bitandukanye bijyanye n\u2019ubuhinzi bikorerwa mu gishanga cya Bahimba asanga icyo gishanga kitabyazwa umusaruro nk\u2019uko bikwiye.\nAbayobozi.\nabayobozi b\u2019akarere ka Rulindo yasabye gukoresha ingufu zose, bafatanyije n\u2019abaturage, bagashaka imbuto ikwiranye n\u2019icyo gishanga maze kigahingwa bakakibyaza umusaruro ku buryo bugaragara. Kimwe muri ibyo bibazo ni amazi yireka ahantu hamwe ntagere mu mirima y\u2019abaturage yose. Ngo hari imiyoboro y\u2019amazi yagombaga gutunganywa itaratunganywa ariko barimo gushaka uburyo yatunganywa bafatanije na MINAGRI."}
{"id": "16033", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16033", "title": "Rafid Abdullahi", "text": "Rafidine Abdullah (wavutse 15 Mutarama 1994) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati. Akunda gukina haba kwirwanaho cyangwa kubabaza. Yavukiye mu Bufaransa, ahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu ya komore ku isi.\nAkazi ka ikipe.\nMarseille.\nNyuma yo kwitoza hamwe n\u2019ikipe nkuru muri shampiyona yo muri 2011\u201312 iyobowe n uwahoze ari umutoza Didier Deschamps, mbere yi gihembwe kiyobowe n'umuyobozi mushya \u00c9lie Baup, Abdullah yasubijwe mu ikipe nkuru burundu kandi yambaye nimero ya nimero 13. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere wa bigize umwuga ku ya 9 Kanama 2012 mu mukino wa kabiri w\u2019amajonjora yo gushaka itike yo gukina na Eski\u015fehirspor yo muri Turukiya. \nC\u00e1diz.\nKu ya 3 Kanama 2016, Abdullah yagiye mu mahanga ku nshuro ya mbere mu mwuga we, asinyana amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri n\u2019ikipe ya Espagne Segunda Divisi\u00f3n C\u00e1diz CF. \nWasland-Beveren.\nKu ya 17 Nyakanga 2018, Waasland-Beveren yatangaje ko basinyanye na Abdullah ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. Nyuma yo gukina iminota 644 gusa mu mikino icumi, Abdullah n'iyi kipe bahisemo gusesa amasezerano babyumvikanyeho ku ya 28 Mutarama 2019. \"Amasezerano ya Abdullah yarangiye nyuma yuko Waasland-Bveren yanze kongererwa igihe shampiyona irangiye mu Busuwisi 2021-22.\" \nIbikorwa mpuzamahanga.\nAbdullah yavukiye mu Bufaransa ku babyeyi b'Abasetsa. Umusore w\u2019Ubufaransa wari uhagarariye igihugu cye kurwego rwabatarengeje imyaka 18. Yagarutse mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Comoros atangira kubakinira mu mukino wa gicuti na Togo n'amanota 2-2. "}
{"id": "16034", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16034", "title": "Benik Afobe", "text": "Benik Tunani Afobe (yavutse 12 Gashyantare 1993) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nka rutahizamu wa Hatta. Yavukiye mu Bwongereza, yaserukiye ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo inshuro esheshatu hagati yo muri 2017 na 2018.\nAfobe yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019umwuga na Arsenal muri Gashyantare muri 2010, maze atizwa mu makipe atandukanye arimo Huddersfield Town, Reading, Bolton Wanderers, Millwall, Sheffield ku wa gatatu na Milton Keynes Dons mbere yo gusinyisha ikipe ya Wolverhampton Wanderers muri Mutarama 2015. Umwaka umwe, yasinyiye Bournemouth ku mayelo miliyoni 10. Nyuma y'igihembwe, yagarutse ku ntizanyo yahoze mu ikipe y\u2019wolves muri shampiyona yakurikiyeho aho yabonye amayelo miliyoni 10 yoherejwe muri Molineux. Icyakora bidatinze, yinjiye muri Stoke City mu ntangiriro ku nguzanyo mbere yo guhinduka burundu muri Mutarama 2019.\nAfobe yari mu ikipe y'Ubwongereza yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona yo mu Burayi munsi yabafite imyaka 17 -FA y'abatarengeje imyaka 17 muri Gicurasi 2010. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAfobe yavukiye i Leyton, muri Londere, akurira i Dagenham aho yize amashuri abanza ya Monteagle ndetse n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019abaturage rya Jo Richardson. Yinjiye muri Arsenal Academy afite imyaka itandatu; yakinaga mu cyumweru cya shampiyona Eclipse FC i Dagenham ubwo yabonwaga numuskuti wa Arsenal - Gary Nott. Yinjiye muri Arsenal ku ya 1 Gicurasi 2001. Yatsinze ibitego 40 muri U-16 muri 2007\u201308, ibitego 11 mumikino 13 yakinnye muri 2008\u201309, n'ibitego 21 mumikino 24 yakinnye muri Arsenal U-18 muri 2009\u201310. Yatorewe kuba umukinnyi U-18 wa Arsenal muri shampiyona. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nArsenal.\nAfobe yahise atsinda ibitego bibiri batsinda Manchester United ibitego 4-0 mu mikino yi cyiciro cya kabiri nyuma yo kuza kumusimbura. Mu cyiciro cya gatatu, yatsinze ibindi bitego bibiri kugirango afashe ikipe ye gutsinda Bradford City no kugera mu cyiciro cya kane. Ku ya 29 Ugushyingo, Afobe yatsinze Hat trick itsinze Colchester United 6\u20130. "}
{"id": "16035", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16035", "title": "Chadrac Akolo", "text": "Chadrac Akolo (wavutse ku ya 1 Mata 1995) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ufite ubwengehiguhu bwa kanada ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe y\u2019abasuwisi ya St. Gallen ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo. \nUbuzima bwambere.\nAkolo wavukiye muri DR Congo, yavuye mu gihugu cye n'umuryango we kubera imvururu za politiki zaho maze agenda yambuka inyanja ya Mediterane, agera mu Busuwisi afite imyaka 14. Aho niho yakuye ijisho akinira FC Sion yo muri shampiyona yo Busuwisi Super League. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKu ya 1 Gashyantare 2016, Akolo wavutse i Kinshasa yinjiye muri Neuch\u00e2tel Xamax ku ntizanyo kugeza shampiyona irangiye muri 2015-16. \nKu ya 9 Nyakanga 2017, Akolo yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ine na VfB Stuttgart. \nMuri Nyakanga 2019, yimukiye muri Amiens SC. \nYinjiye muri SC Paderborn ku ntizanyo kugeza shampiyona irangiye muri Gashyantare 2021. \nKu ya 3 Nyakanga 2022, Akolo yimukiye i St. Gallen mu Busuwisi ku masezerano y'imyaka ibiri. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nAkolo yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya DR Congo mu mukino wo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA kuya 2 gashyantare 2018 na Tuniziya ku ya 5 Nzeri 2017. "}
{"id": "16036", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16036", "title": "Dieumerci Amale", "text": "Dieumerci Mukoko Amale (wavutse 17 Ukwakira 1998) Ni umukinnyi ukina umukinnyi w'umupira ukomoka muri Congo ukina nk'umukinnyi wi nyuma wa DHJ. Ahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo. \nGukina umwuga.\nAmale yamaze ubuzima bwe bwa mbere akinira ikipe ya DCMP mu gihugu cye cykaavukire cya DR Congo. Yimukiye mu ikipe ya DHJ yo muri Maroke ku ya 5 Ugushyingo 2020. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 18 Nzeri 2019. Amale yatangiriye muri DR Congo mu mukina wa gicuti cyatsinzwe n'u Rwanda ibitego 3-2 "}
{"id": "16037", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16037", "title": "Yves Angani", "text": "Yves Angani ni umukinnyi ukina mu ikipe mpuzamahanga mu mupira, w'amaguru wa Congo, wavutse 26 April Ku ya 26 Mata 1991. Akina nka rutahizamu. \nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYves Angani yatangiye umwuga we muri ikipe yo muri Congo ya FC Syst\u00e8me. Mu 2012, yimukiye mu Burayi yinjira mu ikipe y'Ububiligi KRC Genk.\nTHE1 ku ya 1 Nyakanga 2013, yagurijwe igihembwe (hiyongereyeho umwaka 1 nk'uburyo bwo guhitamo) muri FC Metz, yazamuwe ku mwanya wa 2\u00a0Igice cy'Abafaransa.\nMu guhitamo.\nYves Angani ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga w'umukongomani, "}
