{"id": "16039", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16039", "title": "Britt Assombalonga", "text": "Britt Curtis Assombalonga (yavutse kuya 6 ukuboza Ku 1992) Ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru wa congo ukina nka rutahizamu muri Watford FC.\nUbuzima.\nAssambalonga yavukiye muri Zayire (izina ryitiriwe Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuya 1971 kugeza 1997) ariko umuryango we wimukiye i Londres afite amezi umunani. Yakuriye mu kazu k'Ubusuwisi, mu gace ka Londere ka Kamden. Yagiye mu ishuri rya Whitefield kandi ni umuhungu wa Fedor Assombalonga, wahoze akina umupira mpuzamahanga wa Zayire.\nPeterborough United.\nKu ya 6 Kanama 2014, Assombalonga yinjiye mu Nottingham Forest, ku masezerano y\u2019imyaka itanu ku giciro cy\u2019amafaranga miliyoni 5 zishobora kuzamuka kugera kuri miliyoni 8 zishingiye ku bigaragara (muri zo Watford izahabwa 50% kubera kugurisha ku ngingo). Ibi byatumye ishyamba rya Assombalonga Nottingham ryashyirwa umukono ku masezerano, hiyongeraho miliyoni 4.5 zama pound yahawe Celtic kuri rutahizamu Pierre van Hooijdonk mu 1997. Assombalonga yatsinze ibitego bye byambere mu mashyamba nyuma yiminsi cumi n'ibiri nyuma yo gusinyana na Bolton Wanderers kuri Stade Macron. Nyuma yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu mikino ibiri yakurikiyeho na Bournemouth na Reading. Yatsinze igitego muri East Midlands Derby, afungura amazamu na Derby County. Assombalonga yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere ku ishyamba ku ya 17 Nzeri itsinze iwayo ibitego 5-3 na Fulham iherutse gusezererwa. Nyuma yongeye gutsinda igitego gikurikiraho yakinnye na East Midlands Derby, anganya na Pride Pariki amaherezo atsinda ibitego 2-1. Ku ya 11 Gashyantare 2015 batsinze Wigan Athletic ibitego 3-0, Assombalonga yagize imvune ikomeye yo mu ivi bikekwa ko itazakomeza kumara amezi cumi n'abiri. Assombalonga iragaruka mukibuga cya Shampiyona nyuma y'amezi cumi n'ane adahari, mugihe cya 43\u00a0umunsi wa shampionat na Blackburn Rovers isimbuye Robert Tesche kuminota 84\u00a0 (1-1).\nKu ya 6 Kanama 2016, iyobowe n'umutoza mushya Philippe Montanier, yatsindiye Burton umukino wo gufungura shampiyona.\nKu ya 29 Mutarama 2022, yinjiye muri Watford FC.\nMu guhitamo.\nKu ya 27 Werurwe 2018, Britt Assombalonga yishimiye guhitamo kwe kwa mbere na Tanzaniya, mu mukino wa gicuti.\nYatoranijwe na Florent Ibenge kugirango azitabira igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2019. Ku munsi wa 3 yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere muguhangana na Zimbabwe."}
{"id": "16041", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16041", "title": "Ikiyaga Nasser", "text": "Ikiyaga Nasser ni ikiyaga kinini cyakozwe n'abantu. Kiri mu majyepfo ya Misiri no mu majyaruguru ya Sudani. Cyabayeho kubera urugomero runini rwa Aswan rwubatswe ku mugezi wa Nili.\nIkiyaga Nasser ni kimwe mu biyaga binini ku isi byakozwe n'abantu. Amazi yacyo atanga amashanyarazi muri Misiri.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga Nasser ni kimwe mu biyaga binini ku isi byakozwe n'abantu. Gifite uburebure bwa km 479. Ahagutse cyane, gifite km 16. Gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 5 250. Gishobora kubika amazi agera kuri km\u00b3 132.\nAmateka.\nIkiyaga cyabayeho kubera iyubakwa ry'urugomero runini rwa Aswan ku mugezi wa Nili. Urwo rugomero rwubatswe hagati ya 1958 na 1970.\nAmashanyarazi n'amazi.\nAmazi y'Ikiyaga Nasser akoreshwa n'urugomero rwa Aswan mu gutanga amashanyarazi. Misiri ifite impungenge ko urugomero rushya rwa Etiyopiya ruzagabanya amazi ya Nili yinjira mu kiyaga. Ibyo byagabanya amashanyarazi atangwa n'urugomero rwa Aswan."}
{"id": "16042", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16042", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Manzala", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Manzala ni ikiyaga cy'amazi y'umunyu cyo mu majyaruguru y'iburasirazuba bwa Misiri. Kiri ku nkombe y'Inyanja ya Mediterane, mu Delta ya Nili, hafi ya Port Said.\nNi cyo kiyaga kinini mu biyaga byo mu majyaruguru ya Delta ya Nili. Kuva mu kinyejana cya 20, ubuso bwacyo bwaragabanutse cyane.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Manzala kiri mu majyaruguru y'iburasirazuba bwa Misiri, hafi ya Port Said. Kiri ku birometero bike uvuye ku matongo ya kera ya Tanis. Ni cyo kiyaga kinini mu biyaga byo mu majyaruguru ya Delta. Mu 2008, cyari gifite uburebure bwa km 47 n'ubugari bwa km 30.\nIkiyaga ntikigira ubujyakuzimu bunini. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo buri hagati ya m 4 na m 5. Hasi y'ikiyaga hari ibumba ryoroshye.\nUmuyoboro wa Suez.\nPort Said yashinzwe hafi y'Ikiyaga cya Manzala mu kinyejana cya 19, igihe hubakwaga Umuyoboro wa Suez. Ikiyaga kiri mu majyepfo y'ikibuga cy'indege cya Port Said. Kibuza umujyi kwaguka.\nUburobyi.\nIkiyaga cya Manzala cyahoze ari isoko y'amafi ahendutse muri Misiri. Ariko umwanda mu mazi wagabanyije umusaruro. Mu 1985, uburobyi bwakorerwaga ku buso bwa hegitari 89 000. Bwakoreshaga abantu bagera ku 17 000.\nLeta ya Misiri yumukije igice kinini cy'ikiyaga kugira ngo gihingwe. Ariko ibihingwa ntibyakuze neza mu butaka bw'umunyu. Kugeza mu 2001, ikiyaga cyari cyatakaje hafi 80 % by'ubuso bwacyo."}
{"id": "16044", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16044", "title": "Dikilu Bageta", "text": "Serge Dikilu Bageta (yavutse ku ya 24 Werurwe 1978 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri congo wahoze akina umupira wamaguru aheruka gukinira Free State Stars FC.\nUmwuga.\nYinjiye muri Ajax CT muri 2003, mbere yakinnye muri DC Motema Pembe na Tout Puissant Mazembe. Kuva yinjira muri iyi kipe, Bageta yagize uruhare runini hagati nka myugariro wa Ajax. Aherutse guhuzwa no kwerekeza mu makipe menshi yo mu Burayi. Yavuye muri Ajax muri 2008 yinjira muri Afurika yepfo muri Maritzburg United. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nni Myugariro nu munyamahanga ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo."}
{"id": "16045", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16045", "title": "C\u00e9dric Bakambu", "text": "C\u00e9dric Bakambu (yavutse ku ya 11 Mata 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nk'umukinnyi ukina imbere mu ikipe ya Olympiacos yo muri shampiyona yo Bugereki ya Super League ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo.\nYatangiye gukinira by'umwuga muri Sochaux mu mwaka wa 2010, anabakinira imikino 107 yemewe mu bihe bitanu, atsinda ibitego 21. Nyuma yi mukiye i Bursaspor kuri miliyoni 1.8 zamayelo, arangiza ari we watsinze ibitego byinshi kuko ikipe ye yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri mu gikombe cya Turukiya, mbere yo gusinyira Villarreal nyuma yumwaka.\nYavukiye mu Bufaransa, yabahagarariye ku rwego mpuzamahanga ubyiruko kugeza ku batarengeje imyaka 20, atsinda ibitego umunani mu mikino 38 anatsindira Shampiyona y\u2019Uburayi yo muri 2010 mu batarengeje imyaka 19. Muri 2015, yatangiye gukinira ikipe ye y'igihugu ya Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBakambu yavukiye i Vitry-sur-Seine, yatangiye umwuga we muri Ivry waho afite imyaka 10 mbere yo kwimukira i Sochaux nyuma yimyaka ine. \nKu ya 1 Gicurasi 2010, Bakambu yakinnye umukino wa nyuma wa Coupe Gambardella muri 2010 maze atsindira ikipe ye igitego kuri Stade ya France. Sochaux ariko, yatsinzwe umukino 4\u20133 kuri penariti. Yabanje gutsinda ibitego bibiri muri kimwe cya kane yatsinze kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza yatsinze Metz. \nBakambu yatangiye umwuga we ku ya 7 Kanama 2010 mu mukino wafunguye wa Sochaux wo muri shampiyona ya Ligue 1 na Arles-Avignon, agaragara nk'umusimbura ku munota wa 83 wasimbuye Modibo Ma\u00efga ku ntsinzi y'ibitego 2\u20131 kuri Stade Auguste Bonal. Ukwezi kwakurikiyeho, yasinyanye amasezerano ye yambere yumwuga yemera amasezerano y'imyaka itatu niyi kipe kugeza muri Kamena 2013. "}
{"id": "16046", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16046", "title": "Esele Bakasu", "text": "Esele Bakasu (yavutse Ku ya 13 Werurwe 1975) muri Zaire, ubu ni muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru wa congo (DRC), wakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zaire cyangwa DRC, yakinnye hagati muri 1997 na 2002.\nAri mu itsinda ryatoranijwe mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 1998, 2000 na 2002. Yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa muri 1998.\nYakinnye kandi imikino ibiri, ibara icyiciro kibanza cy'igikombe cy'isi."}
{"id": "16047", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16047", "title": "Jean-Bertrand Balekita", "text": "Jean-Bertrand Baleckita (Ku ya 6 Mutarama 1948) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo wavukiye i Brazzaville muri Afurika ekwatoriyare. Akina nka rutahizamu.\nAbavandimwe be Serge-Simon Balekita-Nzaba na Ferdinand nabo ni abakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru.\nUbuzima.\nJean-Bertrand Balekita yegukanye igikombe cya Afurika muri 1972. Yarushanwe nyuma y'imyaka ibiri mu marushanwa yo muri 1974 yasohotse.\nAmaze gukura nk'umupira w'amaguru, yinjiye mu gisirikare maze aba umukoloneli kandi akora ku mwanya wa attach\u00e9 wa gisirikare kuri ambasade ya Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo muri kuba."}
{"id": "16048", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16048", "title": "Musemestre Bamba", "text": "Musemestre Bamba yavutse Ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1971 i Kinshasa ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Icyo gihe yari umutoza wungirije wa SC Roland Beckum.\nUmwuga.\nikipe.\nYakinnye nk'umukinnyi ukina hagati. Musemestre Bamba yakiniye US Kintambo na AS Vita Club yi Kinshasa muri Kongo atangiye umwuga we mbere yinjira muri shampiyona ya Turukiya i Denizlispor muri shampiyona yo muri 1994-1995. Nyuma yimukiye mu Budage aho yakiniye SpVg Marl na VfB H\u00fcls.\nMu 1996, Abanyekongo basinyanye na LR Ahlen. Hamwe niyi kipe, yitabiriye kuzamuka kugera mu cyiciro cya2 muri Bundesliga mu mpera za shampiyona ya 1999\u201300 Regionalliga, mu cyiciro cya kane cyumupira w'amaguru w\u2019Ubudage, aho iyi kipe yagumye imyaka itandatu. Yatsinze imikino 314\u00a0yose (harimo 173\u00a0) muri iyi kipe (niya nyuma yiswe Rot Weiss Ahlen muri 2006), atsinda ibitego 54\u00a0harimo 24 muri Bundesliga ya kabiri. Uyu mukinnyi wibasiye impande zose yakoreshejwe nkikarita kubera imyaka afite kubakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru kuva ikipe ye yamanuka muri Regionalliga Nord muri 2006. Bitewe n'ubudahemuka bwe muri iyi kipe, Musemestre Bamba ni umwe mu bakinnyi bakunzwe cyane muri iyi kipe. Ariko, amasezerano ye ntiyongeye kongerwa nyuma yi gihembwe cyo muri 2006-2007.\nMu gice cya mbere cya shampiyona yo muri 2007\u201308, Musemestre Bamba yagiranye amasezerano na SV Lippstadt 08 muri Oberliga Westfalen, ariko agaruka muri Regionalliga Nord muri SC Verl mu kiruhuko cy\u2019itumba, aho yakuye amasezerano kugeza mu mpera za 2008 Igihembwe -2009. Ariko, aya masezerano araseswa muri kuboza 2008 kubwu mvikane ningirakamaro mu mpera zumwaka. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010, Musemestre Bamba yakiniye irushanwa y'igihugu cya shampiyona SG Telgte. Kuva muri shampiyona ya 2010\u201311 yakiniye SC Roland Beckum, bazamuwe mu ntera bava muri Landesliga bajya muri Verbandsliga muri 2011 na Oberliga Westfalen muri 2012. Kuva mu 2012 yabaye umutoza wungirije w'ikipe ya Beckum Oberliga.\nIgihugu.\nBamba akina imikino itatu mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, atatsinze igitego."}
{"id": "16049", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16049", "title": "Yannick Bangala", "text": "Yannick Bangala Litomba,(yavutse taliki ya 14 Mata 1994) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru waRepuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo. Akina nka myugariro cyangwa umukinnyi wo hagati urinda izamu, kuri ubu akinira Young Africans. \nUbuzima.\nHamwe no gutoranya Abanyekongo batarengeje imyaka 20, yitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Africa cyo muri 2013 cyateguwe muri Alijeriya. Hamwe n\u2019abatoranijwe nyamukuru, yaje kwitabira amarushanwa y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2014 na 2016. Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo yatsindiye ku nshuro ya 2016 yabereye mu Rwanda, itsinze Mali ku mukino wa nyuma n'amanota 3-0."}
{"id": "16050", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16050", "title": "Jean-Kasongo Banza", "text": "Jean-Kasongo Banza (yavutseKu ya 26 Kamena 1974 apfa ku ya 7 Kamena 2024) i Kinshasa, icyo gihe hitwaya muri Zaire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo wakinnye nka rutahizamu. \nUbuzima.\nYiswe abashyigikiye ikipe ya AS Vita Club \" \"Korando\" \".\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zaire hanyuma ikitwa DRC, yakinnye imikino 25 (nta gitego yatsinze) hagati muri 1996 na 2001.\nAri mu ikipe mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1996, 1998 na 2000. Yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa muri 1998."}
{"id": "16051", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16051", "title": "Yannick Bapupa", "text": "Ngabu Yannick Bapupa (yavutse Ku ya 21 Mutarama 1982) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo i Kinshasa (Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ahahoze ari Zayire). Yakinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nYatojwe mu ikipe ya AS Vita, Bapupa yari afite imyaka makumyabiri(20) ubwo yimukiye muri Suwede.\nKu ya 5 Ugushyingo 2009, yiyandikishije muri shampiyona eshatu hamwe na Kalmar FF, batwaye shampiyona y'igihugu muri 2008 nu mwanya 4 m'umwaka ushize. Umubare w'amafaranga yimuwe noneho abarirwa kuri miliyoni 4 SEK, hiyongereyeho igihembo cyo gusinya kingana na miliyoni 1.3 mu SEK. Nyuma yiminsi icumi ageze i Sm\u00e5land (5Ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 2009), uyu mukinnyi yatawe muri yombi azira gufata ku ngufu umukobwa w\u2019imyaka 18 i G\u00e4vle mu birori byihariye byateguwe ejo bundi. Bimaze kumenyekana kuri polisi (muri 2007, yakatiwe amasaha 90 yo gukora umuganda n\u2019ihazabu y\u2019amafaranga 40\u00a0000 mu SEK kubera gukubita mugenzi we), Bapupa yakatiwe igifungo cy\u2019imyaka ibiri. Ku ya 12 Werurwe 2010, kimwe no kwishyura indishyi zingana na 85\u00a0000 muSEK ku wahohotewe, ariko aratoroka yirukanwa.\nYarekuwe Ku ya 7 Kamena 2011, Kalmar ntashaka kugarura kY masezerano yasheshwe Ku ya 14 Mata 2010, amasaha make nyuma y'ubujurire bwe bwanzwe n'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rwa Suwede. Mu masezerano yagiranye na SFF, iyi kipe ntabwo isabwa kwishyura umushahara wumukinnyi utarigeze akina ku mugaragaro amabara ye. Ku rundi ruhande, Bapupa agumana igihembo cye cyo gusinya. Ubu nta masezerano, asa naho yiyemeje gukomeza umwuga we nk'uko byatangajwe n'umukozi we Innocent Okeke. Uwahoze ari perezida muri Gefle IF, Leif Lindstrand, aratangaza ku ruhande rwe ko adateganya kugaruka ku Banyekongo muri iyi kipe aho yamaze ibihe bine."}
{"id": "16052", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16052", "title": "Yeremiya Basilua", "text": "J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Basilua ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo..\nUbuzima.\nYatsinze igitego muri Seyishele Ku ya 29 Gashyantare 2012, mugihe cy'ambere cyatoranijwe (nicya nyuma).\nYaje gutorwa mu ikipe y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 y\u2019Abanyekongo mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2013. Hamwe n'imikino yo kunganya no gutsindwa kabiri, Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo ntiyashoboye kurenga icyiciro cya mbere."}
{"id": "16053", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16053", "title": "J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Basilua", "text": "Basilua J\u00e9r\u00e9mie ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo..\nUbuzima.\nYatsinze igitego muri Seyishele Ku ya 29 Gashyantare 2012, mugihe cy'ambere cyatoranijwe (nicya nyuma).\nYaje gutorwa mu ikipe y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 y\u2019Abanyekongo mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2013. Hamwe n'imikino yo kunganya no gutsindwa kabiri, Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo ntiyashoboye kurenga icyiciro cya mbere."}
{"id": "16054", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16054", "title": "Samuel Bastien", "text": "Samuel Bastien, wavutse Ku ya 26 Nzeri 1996 i Meux mu Bubiligi, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati muri Burnley FC.\nUbuzima.\nUrubyiruko n'amahugurwa.\nSamuel Bastien wavutse ku babyeyi b'Abanyekongo, yarezwe na Patrick na Monique Bastien akiri muto. Yatojwe muri RFC Meux na UR Namur, Samuel Bastien yahise amara ibihe bitatu mu makipe y'urubyiruko ya Standard de Li\u00e8ge mbere yo kwinjira mu ishuri rya RSC Anderlecht.\nMuri ikipe.\nRSC Anderlecht.\nKu ya 6 Ukuboza 2014, ubwo yatsindwaga na RSC Anderlecht kuri Royal Mouscron Peruwelz (4-2), Samuel Bastien yakinnye iminota ye ya mbere y'umwuga afite imyaka 18.\nAmerika Avellino (intizanyo).\nBitewe no kutagira ibyiringiro kuri Anderlecht, yagurijwe muri Amerika Avellino umwaka umwe muri Serie ya B.\nChievo Verona.\nKanama 2016, agurishwa muri Chievo Verona na Anderlecht. aHasigaye imyaka bibiri.\nIbipimo bya Liege.\nKu ya 1 Nyakanga 2018, Samuel Bastien yasubiye mu Bubiligi asinyana muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge. Ku ya 22 Nyakanga 2018, yakinnye iminota ye ya mbere hamwe na Standard de Li\u00e8ge gusa baza gutsindwa mu gikombe cy\u2019Ububiligi cyatsinzwe na FC Bruges (2-1). Ku ya 7 Kanama 2018, yakinnye umukino we wambere w'iburayi mu mikino ya gatatu yo gushaka itike yo guhatanira igikombe cya Shampiyona iwayo na Ajax Amsterdam (2-2). Ku ya 18 Kanama 2018, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kuri Rouches itsinze na KSC Lokeren (0-3). Ku ya 12 Ukuboza 2019, Samuel Bastien yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere muri shampiyona ya Europa League mu mukino wanganyije na Arsenal (2-2). Ku ya 15 Ukuboza 2019, mugihe cy'umukino wahuje Standard na Anderlecht, Bastien yavuy mu kibuga afite imvune. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, nyuma yo gukora ibizamini byo kwa muganga, hamenyekanye imvune y'ukuguru kw'ibumoso. Iyi mvune imuhagarika kugeza mu mpera zo muri 2019. Muri shampiyona ya 2020\u201321, Samuel Bastien yazamuwe kuba visi kapiteni na Philippe Montanier. Yatangiye shampiyona atsinda igitego mu mikino yambere yo mu rugo yakinnye na Cercle Brugge Ku ya 8 Kanama 2020 (1-0). Ku ya 17 Kanama 2020, mu mukino wa kabiri wa shampiyona yakinnye na Waasland-Beveren, yongeye gutsinda igitego ariko arakomereka atinze umukino. Samuel Bastien arwaye myotendinous disinsertion ya kimwe cya kabiri cy'ibumoso (hamstring). Imvune yamusize ukwezi kurenga bituma abura imikino icyenda."}
{"id": "16055", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16055", "title": "Mukoko Batezadio", "text": "Mukoko Batezadio, (yavutse Ku ya 24 Ukwakira 1992) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo, ukina nka rutahizamu kuri Ittihad ya Tangier.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYitabira na AS Vita Club muri marushanwa ya Afrika Champions League ndetse n'igikombe cya Confederation. Yageze ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Confederation Cup muri 2018, batsindwa na Raja de Casablanca. Batezadio yatsinze igitego ku mukino wa nyuma w'icyiciro cya kabiri, ariko bikaba byagaragaye ko bidahagije kugirango batsinda irushanwa.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe ya Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo, Ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 2015, mu mukino wa gicuti na Zambiya (intsinzi 0-3). Nyuma yakinnye bukeye na Angola (gutsindwa 1-0). Ariko, iyi mikino yombi ntabwo yemewe na FIFA.\nNyuma, muri 2016, yitabiriye igikombe cya COSAFA. Akina imikino itatu muri iri rushanwa, ahanganye na Mozambike, Botswana na Swaziland. Congo yaje ku mwanya wa kane mu marushanwa.\nIbihembo.\nMuri ikipe.\nAS Vita Club"}
{"id": "16056", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16056", "title": "Patrick Batshi", "text": "Patrick Batshi uzwi nka \"Anelka\" (yavutse Ku ya 20 Ukwakira 1984) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\nPatrick Batshi yatangiye umwuga wo gukina muri 2004 hamwe na AS Vita Club yi Kinshasa, aho yakinnye imyaka itatu mbere yo kwinjira muri AS Vita Kabasha mu Gushyingo 2006. Nyuma y'amezi atatu, yavuye mu gihugu cye cya Kongo maze atura muri Shipure y'Amajyaruguru aho yasinye muri Gashyantare 2007 n'ikipe ya Telsim S\u00fcper Lig club muri shampiyona ya Ozank\u00f6y SK. Nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego 23 mu mikino 38 mu myaka itatu nigice, Batshi yimuye mu Gushyingo 2010 ku mukinnyi wa shampiyona \u00c7etinkaya TSK.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakinnye guhitamo kwe kugeza ubu muri 2005 mu mukino wa gicuti wabereye muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo."}
{"id": "16057", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16057", "title": "Epotele Bazamba", "text": "Epotele Bazamba (yavutse Ku ya 13 Gicurasi 1976 icyo gihe ari muri Zaire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa congo (DRC), wakinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. \nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zaire nyuma yabaye DRC Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo, yakinnye hagati yo muri 1997 na 2001.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 1998 na 2000. Yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa yo muri 1998.\nYakinnye imikino itandatu abara icyiciro cya mbere cy'igikombe cy'isi, mu gihe cyo muri 1998 na 2002 "}
{"id": "16058", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16058", "title": "Eddy Bembuana-Keve", "text": "Eddy Bembuana-Keve, yavutse Ku ya 24 Ukuboza 1972 mucyari Zaire, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga wumupira wamaguru ukomoka muri congo wavukiye mu bubiligi mu mwaka wa 2001 wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nAkina umwuga we wose mu bubiligi usibye igihembwe yari mu butaliyani.\nYitabiriye CAN muri 1998, aho yakinnye imikino itatu atsinda igitego muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Yahagaritse umwuga we wu mwuga muri 2003.\nUmwuga.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri 1998, Eddy Bembuana-Keve yahamagawe inshuro nyinshi mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Kongo kandi yakinnye cyane mu mikino itatu ya CAN muri 1998, atsinda igitego kimwe."}
{"id": "16059", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16059", "title": "Ben Malango", "text": "Ben Malango, uzwi ku izina ryuzuye rya Ben Malango Ngita, (wavutse10 Ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1993) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka i Kinshasa muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo. Akina nka rutahizamu muri Qatar SC no ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nUrubyiruko n'amahugurwa.\nBen Malango Ngita yavutse ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1993 i Masina, muri komini mu burasirazuba bwa Kinshasa, umurwa mukuru n'umujyi munini wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yatangiye gukina umupira wamaguru mu ikipe yoroheje ya Jack Tr\u00e9sor Kinshasa, bamarana imyaka ye ya mbere yo kwitoza.\nGutangira muri Don Bosco (2013-2016).\nMuri 2013, ubwo yari afite imyaka 20, Malango yagiye i Lumumbashi, agamije kwinjira muri Cercle Sportif Don Bosco, yazamuwe mu ntera mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Kongo. Yavumbuwe mu ba bigize umwuga akina imikino ya shampiyona ya DRC muri 2013-2014, aho iyi kipe yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri mu itsinda ryayo, ihuza na nyampinga uzaza, ya muri TP Mazembe. Ibi bimufasha kugera kuri play-off, azayirangiza kumwanya wa kane.\nIbyahishuwe kuri TP Mazembe (2016-2019).\nBen Malango amaze gutsinda ibitego umunani ndetse na bane bamufasha mu cyiciro cya mbere cya shampiyona, Ben Malango ntiyigeze ahunga y\u2019ikipe yitwaye neza muri iki gihugu, TP Mazembe, yatangaje ko izinjira mu Gushyingo 2016.\nKu ya 19 Ugushyingo 2017, yegukanye igikombe cya Confederation Cup muri 2017, yatsinze ikipe ya Supersport United yo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Byagaragaye ko yatsinze igitego muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza umukino wa mbere yakinnye n'ikipe ya Maroc FUS Rabat.\nAkina kandi umukino wanyuma wa Afurika muri Super Cup muri 2017 na 2018. Muri 2017, ikipe ye yatsinzwe na Mamelodi Sundowns. Muri 2018, ikipe ye yongeye gutsindwa, kuri iyi nshuro na Wydad AC.\nYageze no muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza muri Champions League muri 2018 hamwe ni yi kipe, hanyuma kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri 2019. Yatsinze ibitego birindwi muri iri rushanwa yo muri 2018. Yatsinze igitego cyatsinzwe n'ikipe ya yo muri Mozambike, nyuma yikubye kabiri ikipe ya ES S\u00e9tif yo muri Alijeriya.\nMu Gushyingo 2018, ubwo CAF yashyize ahagaragara urutonde rwa batoranijwe mu byiciro bitandukanye by\u2019imihango itandukanye ya CAF muri 2018, Ben Malango yashyizwe mu cyiciro cy\u2019umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Afurika w\u2019umwaka hamwe n\u2019abandi bakinnyi bagera 33."}
{"id": "16060", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16060", "title": "Janvier Besala Bokungu", "text": "Mutarama Besala Bokungu (yavutse ku ya 30 Mutarama 1989) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, ukina mu binyuma-iburyo.\nUbuzima.\nMuri Nyakanga 2007, yimuriwe muri Esperance Sportive de Tunis. Amasezerano ye y'agombaga kurangira muri Kamena 2011. Janvier Besala yagarutse muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo avuye mu kwakira 2010. Yashoboye, muburyo bubi, gusubiza mu ikipe ya TP Mazembe atanyuze ku miyoboro yemewe. CAF ishinja ikipe ya TP Mazembe kuba yaratanze umukinnyi utujuje ibyangombwa mu mukino wahuje ikipe ya Simba FC yo muri Tanzaniya, ndetse na Wydad wo muri Casablanca ubara, ku mukino wa nyuma wa 16 na 8 wa nyuma wa Champions League muri 2011. Ku ya 14 Gicurasi 2011, CAF yahisemo kutemera ikipe ya congo."}
{"id": "16061", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16061", "title": "Joel Beya", "text": "Joel Beya Tumetuka, (yavutse Ku ya 8 Ukuboza 1999) i Lubumbashi, muri congo, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akina ari mpuzamahanga ukina nka rutahizamu muri TP Mazembe.\nJo\u00ebl Beya yatoje muri ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Ecofoot Katumbi. Akina muri shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru mu ntara afite ibitego 11 mu mikino 8, bityo ikipe ikazamuka ikagera kuri linafoot yo muri congo, aho yaje kurangira yatsinze ibitego byinshi muri iyi kipe ibitego 5, kandi afite pasiporo ye kubacuruzi ba Don Bosco. Beya yarangije gutsinda ibitego byinshi kuri Don Bosco ibitego 7 maze ubuyobozi bufata icyemezo cyo kumuzana muri Tout Puissant Mazembe. Yazamutse neza aho yakinnye igikombe cye cya mbere cya Afrika, akurwaho na Raja de Casablanca, yaje gukina k' umunota wa 78."}
{"id": "16062", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16062", "title": "Gerard Biena Mukunku", "text": "Gerard Biena Mukunku, (wavutse Ku ya 5 Werurwe 1977) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muricongo, ukina nka myugariro, ubu ni umutoza w'umupira w'amaguru. Ni umwe mu bagize itsinda ry\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira wamaguru i Kinshasa, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUmwuga.\nMukunku yakinnye mu gihugu mu makipe nka Desembe na Vita, babaye na shampiyo w\u2019igihugu inshuro enye. Nubwo myugariro yari ku mwanya wamyugariro, Mukunku niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri iyi kipe, akaba ari we watsinze penaliti. Muri icyo gihe, Mukunku yanakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo. Mu 2000, umukozi w'umupira w'amaguru yatangiye gushakira, Mukunka ibintu byinjiza amafaranga. Abanyekongo barebaga mu Bubiligi Lokeren na Tuniziya \u00c9toile du Sahel, ariko nta makipe n'imwe yaje asubira i Vita. Mu 2001, Mukunku yakinnye umukino wa mbere w'ikipe y'igihugu mu marushanwa yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi muri 2002 na Tuniziya \nMu 2000, umuyobozi wa Spartak Moscou, Yury Zavarzin, wagize uruhare mu bucuruzi bwa diyama, yahawe uburenganzira na Vita Club. Nyiri Spartak, Andrei Chervichenko, yakuye umukinnyi mwiza w'iyi kipe Gerard Mukunka muri iyo kipe, asinyisha umukinnyi amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri.\nMukunku yasubiye mu gihugu cye kavukire yimukira muri club TP Mazembe. Umwaka umwe, Fakel yasubiye mu cyiciro cya mbere maze atumira Mukunku kongera gukinira ikipe ya Voronezh, ariko aranga. Mukunku yaje kwinjira mu ikipe ya Maniema Union, aba kapiteni w'ikipe kandi yitabira imikino ya CAF Confederations Cup muri 2008.\nMu mwaka wa 2014, Mukunku yahatiwe guhagarika umwuga we nyuma yo gutsinda umucamanza mu mukino w\u2019igikombe cya DR Congo, kuko atemerewe imyaka icumi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMukunku afite umugore Bongueli n'abana babiri, umuhungu Jordan hamwe n'umukobwa Prisilla, ndetse n'abana yareze. Uyu mugore kandi yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru, akinira ikipe ya Milinga yo muri Kongo ndetse n'ikipe y'abagore ya Kongo Ni umuyoboke wa Kimbanguism."}
{"id": "16063", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16063", "title": "Eric Bokanga Musau", "text": "Eric Bokanga Musau,(wavutse Ku ya 9 Ukwakira 1988) i Kinshasa muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa congo. Akina nka rutahizamu mu ikipe ya AS Vita Club.\nUbuzima.\nYakinnye kugeza icyo gihe muri JAC Tr\u00e9sor na Benfica de Luanda hanyuma muri AS Vita Club, yinjiye muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge mu kwimura impeshyi muri shampiyona ya 2010/2011.\nNyuma yo guturuka mu gihugu cye agakurikirwa n\u2019amakipe akomeye yo mu Burayi, Standard de Li\u00e8ge yahisemo kumugura mu ikipe ye, AS Vita Club. Nyuma yo gutsinda ibizamini byuzuye, yakurikiwe na AJ Auxerre. Mugihe umukinnyi yari akwiye gukodeshwa muri AS Vita Club, yimurwa rero burundu kumafaranga agera kuri miliyoni 60.000 za madorali. Umukinnyi wa congo yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri hariya muri Li\u00e8ge club nu mwaka winyongera. Kubwamahirwe make, uku gutangaza kurangira kunanirwa, umukinnyi kuba soyvent yakomeretse kandi adashobora kumenyera imiterere yuburayi bwo gukina, igihe cye cyo gukina kiragabanuka kandi ntagihamagariwe guhitamo. Yahagaritse amasezerano muri Mutarama 2011 akanasinyana na TP Mazembe mu rwego rwo kubyutsa impano ye.\nKu ya 19 Mutarama 2011, Bokanga na Standard de Li\u00e8ge bagenda babyumvikanyweho, "}
{"id": "16064", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16064", "title": "Gladys Bokese", "text": "Gladys Bokese (yavutse Ku ya 10 Nzeri 1983) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wumupira wamaguru ukomoaka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo(DRC) i Kinshasa. Akina nka myugariro wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa congo, yitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yakiriye ikarita itukura mu mukino wahuje Kameruni kubera gukubita cyane Achille Webo mu gihe CAN muri 2006. Yatsindiye igikombe cya mbere cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2009 hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi baho muri Kote Divawari.\nBokese ari mu ba kapiteni b'ibyamamare b'ikipe y'icyatsi n'umweru y'umurwa mukuru wa DRC, Daring Club Motema Pembe (DMCP).\nYayoboye ikipe ye inshuro nyinshi mu marushanwa y'igihugu, Igikombe cya Congo na Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru yabatijwe VSL-Vodacom Super League, ndetse no ku rwego mpuzamahanga igikombe cya CAF, C2 ndetse rimwe muri CAF Champions League."}
{"id": "16065", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16065", "title": "Jeremy Bokila", "text": "J\u00e9r\u00e9my Bokila (yavutse Ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 1988) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo ukina nka rutahizamu muri Willem II Tilburg.\nUbuzima.\nJ\u00e9r\u00e9my Bokila yimukiye akiri muto hamwe n'ababyeyi be mu Buholandi. Aho niho yatangiriye umupira we wa mbere, muri ZSV Zelos, ikipe yakiniraga. Amaze imyaka icumi mu m'akipe atandukanye yabato y'imyaka, yinjiye muri nucleus y'urubyiruko rwi kipe ya kabiri ya AGOVV Apeldoorn. Ku ya 10 Kanama 2007, yakinnye umukino we wambere kumugaragaro na FC Den Bosch. Ufite ibihe bitatu, yahisemo kugerageza amahirwe ye mu mahanga mu mwaka wo muri 2010 asinyana na SV Zulte Waregem, mu bubiligi.\nMu ikipe ye nshya, J\u00e9r\u00e9my Bokila akunze kuba umusimbura. Nyuma y'umwaka, yemeye gutizwa muri Sparta Rotterdam, aho yatsinze ibitego byinshi. Agaruka i Waregem muri Kamena 2012, yongeye gutizwa, kuri iyi nshuro muri FC Petrolul Ploie\u0219ti, muri Rumaniya. Imyitwarire ye myiza imwemerera gushyirwa mu ikipe y'igihugu ku mukino wa gicuti na Burkina Faso. Ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 2012."}
{"id": "16066", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16066", "title": "N'Dingi Bokila", "text": "N'Dingi Bokila Mandjombolo ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Zaire (muri iki gihe DR Congo), wavukiye Ku ya 27 Ugushyingo 1954.\nMu bindi bintu, yatsinze ibitego bitatu mu cyiciro cya 2 mu Bubiligi, munsi yi jacketi yra K. RC Harelbeke, wamuhesheje izina rya \"Isaro rya Harelbeke\".\nBenshi mu bana be nabo babaye abakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru. Uzwi cyane ni J\u00e9r\u00e9my nawe wabaye umukinnyi ukina mumahanga ukomoka muri congo."}
{"id": "16067", "revid": "17598", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16067", "title": "Yannick Bolasie", "text": "Yannick Bolasie, (wavutse Ku ya 24 Gicurasi 1989 i Lyon mu Bufaransa) ni umukinnyi w' umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya,ukina ku rwego mpuzamahanga.Akina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nIntangiriro.\nBolasie yatangiye umwuga we muri Rushden na Diamonds afite imyaka 16. Yamaranye amezi ane niyi kipe mbere yo kwerekeza muri ikipe ya Maltese Floriana FC.\nYagarutse mu Bwongereza muri 2008 nyuma y\u2019icyifuzo cyatanzwe na Plymouth Argyle, ahakura amasezerano y'imyaka 2. Yinjiye muri Dagenham na Redbridge mu rubanza ariko asubira i Plymouth nyuma y\u2019urubanza rutarangiye. Muri Ugushyingo 2008, yagurishijwe muri Rushden na Diamonds maze atangira gukinira Eastbourne Borough kuri 29 ugushyingo kandi yagaragaye inshuro zirindwi muri Conference National mbere yo gusubira i Plymouth muri Mutarama 2009. Bolasie ari ku ntizanyo ebyiri zikurikiranye kuri Barnet FC.\nUmujyi wa Bristol.\nYannick Bolasie yinjiye mu mujyi wa Bristol mu mpeshyi ya 2011. Yakinnye imikino makumyabiri n'itanu mu marushanwa yose mu gihe cye cyonyine muri ikipe D 2 yo mubwongereza.\nIngoro ya Crystal.\nMuri Kanama 2012, yemeye gusinya imyaka itatu hamwe na Crystal Palace.\nMu gihembwe cya 2014-2015, mu Ugushyingo 2014, yihesheje izina yitwara neza mu mukino wahuje Liverpool warangiye ari 3-1 ashyigikira Crystal Palace. Bolasie yakuyeho Dejan Lovren akoresheje urutonde rwa tekinike kandi aha izamu igihe kitoroshye mu mukino wose. Mu kwezi k'Ukuboza, umukinnyi wa Kongo yageze ku bikorwa bikomeye na Tottenham (intsinzi 2-1). Mugihe asa nkaho ameze nabi hafi yinguni, arahindukira atunguranye, azamura umupira ahita asiga Christian Eriksen na Roberto Soldado kumwanya mbere yo kwambuka. Ku ya 4 Werurwe 2015, yatanze infashanyo ebyiri zagize uruhare mu gutsinda 3-1 na Queens Park Rangers. Muri Mata, yatsinze ibitego bitatu mu minota 11 yakinnye na Sunderland yahaye intsinzi ikipe ye.\nEverton F.C..\nKu ya 15 Kanama 2016, Yannick Bolasie yinjiye mu ikipe ya Everton mu bihe bitanu. Yatangiye gukinira ubwo yinjiraga ku isaha mu mukino ubara umunsi wa kabiri wa Premier League na West Bromwich Albion (intsinzi 1-2). 22 Ukwakira ubukurikiyeho, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere hamwe na Everton na Burnley (gutsindwa 2-1). Ku ya 4 Ukuboza 2016, umukinnyi wo hagati wa congo yirukanwe kubera imvune yakinnye na Manchester United (1-1). Imitsi yo mu ivi yagize ingaruka kandi Bolasie yagombaga kubagwa. Mutarama 4 Ubukurikira, umutoza wa Everton, Ronald Koeman, yatangaje ko bizatwara hagati y'amezi cumi n'umwe na cumi n'abiri mbere yuko Yannick Bolasie agaruka.\nKu ya 26 Ukuboza 2017, umukinnyi wo hagati wa congo yagarutse mu kibuga cya Premier League nyuma y'umwaka urenga imvune yo mu ivi ubwo yatangiraga na West Bromwich Albion. Yatsinze igitego kimwe mu mikino cumi n'irindwi mu gice cya kabiri cya shampiyona cyo muri 2017-2018.\nInguzanyo kuri Aston Villa.\nKu ya 25 Kanama 2018, Bolasie yatijwe igihembwe muri Aston Villa. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu mikino makumyabiri nimwe ya shampiyona mbere yo gusubira mu ikipe ya Everton hakiri kare nkuko byari byitezwe Mutarama 2019.\nInguzanyo kuri Anderlecht.\nKu ya 31 Mutarama 2019, Bolasie yatijwe muri RSC Anderlecht kugeza shampiyona irangiye. Yatsinze ibitego bitandatu mu mikino cumi n'irindwi ya shampiyona yakiniye ikipe y'Ububiligi.\nIntizanyo kuri Sport CP.\nKu ya 2 Nzeri 2019, Bolasie yongeye gutizwa, iki gihe cy'igihe muri Sporting CP."}
{"id": "16068", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16068", "title": "Jonathan Bolingi", "text": "Jonathan Bolingi Mpangi Merikani, (yavutse Ku ya 30 Kamena 1994) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Repuburika Iharanaira Demokarasi ya congo (DRC). Akina nka rutahizamu muri Buriram United. Ni umuhungu wa Mpangi Merikani, wahoze ari umunyezamu wa DCMP.\nJonathan Bolingi yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona cy\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika muri 2016 hamwe n\u2019igihugu cye ndetse na CAF Champions League muri 2015 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Tout Puissant Mazembe yo muri Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAgeze i Lubumbashi mu mwaka wo muri 2010 nyuma y\u2019igihe gito yamaze muri Kimbangu Sport, yatijwe mu ikipe ya Don Bosco aho yatwaye igikombe cya Congo kandi agaragaza ko ari umuntu watanze rutahizamu w\u2019umucuruzi Chico Ushindi. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu cyiciro kibanza cy'igikombe cya Congo na Tshipepele mu mukino wo kugaruka afite intsinzi nini (7-0), nyuma atsinda igitego muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza na AS Dauphins Noirs de Goma kugira ngo atsinde (4- 1). Yatsinze kabiri, Ku ya 30 Werurwe 2013 kurwanya Amerika Tshinkunku m'ugihe cya 3rd\u00a0Umunsi wa \"Linafoot\", kubwi ntsinzi ya Don Bosco (3-0).\nMuri mwambaro ya Jomo Cosmos (yo muri Afurika y'Epfo), mu mikino icyenda ya mbere ya shampiyona, yahiye ubwoba kuri konti, yandikisha ibitego 23 byose cyangwa bisi zose hamwe 2.5 kuri buri mukino. Ikipe yo muri Afurika yepfo, yakoresheje se Mpangi Merikani w'imyaka 25, yifuza kubona serivisi zayo, ariko ntabashe kubona amasezerano ya Don Bosco. Kugaruka kwe i Lubumbashi byanze bikunze, nubwo uru ruzinduko rudasanzwe muri Afrika yepfo, kuko uyu mukinnyi rwose yari uwa TP Mazembe.\nKuva hejuru ya metero 85, Jonathan Bolingi (ku bilo 74) arashobora gukina kumurongo wose w'ibitero. Umwirondoro we ushukisha vuba Patrice Carteron udatezuka kumwinjiza mubakozi be.\nYatsinze igitego cye cya mbere muri CAF Champions League Ku ya 9 Werurwe 2014 ahanganye na Astres FC ya Douala (Kameruni), agarutse nyuma yo kungukirwa n'ikosa ryakozwe n'umuzamu wa Kameruni. Yatsinze Supercup ya Congo na MK Etanch\u00e9it\u00e9 atsinda igitego cya kabiri kuri TP Mazembe ariko ikibabaje kuri we, yarakomeretse kandi byabaye ngombwa aha abandi. Yatsinze ibitego bi tatu na AS Bantou Ku ya 5 Ukwakira 2014, kumunsi 1 wa Linafoot, harimo ibitego bibiri by'umutwe, kugirango batsinde cyane (7-0). Ku ya 9 Ukuboza 2014, yatsinze igitego kimwe rukumbi cya Mazembe yatsinze AS Dauphins Noirs muri Goma ayoboye umupira wa Kabaso Chongo muri 93\u00a0iminota.\nYakurikiranwe n'amakipe menshi yo mu bubiligi, amaherezo yasinyiye Ku ya 31 Mutarama 2017 kuri Standard de Li\u00e8ge ku nguzanyo ihitamo kugura.\nYatsinze igitego cye cya mbere hamwe na Standard de Li\u00e8ge yatsinze KV Kortrijk reuge agaruka gukina.\nYasinyanye by'imazeyo na Standard de Li\u00e8ge kuri1 Ku ya 18 Gicurasi 2017."}
{"id": "16069", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16069", "title": "Theo Bongonda", "text": "Theo Bongonda Mbul'Ofeko Batombo, bakunze kwita Theo Bongonda, (yavutse Ku ya 20 Ugushyingo 1995) i Charleroi mu Bubiligi, ni ukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Kuri ubu akinira C\u00e1diz CF nk'umukinnyi w'ibumoso."}
{"id": "16070", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16070", "title": "Marvel Bope", "text": "Marvel Bope Bokadi, (yavutse Ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1996) i Kinshasa, muri congo, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi ukina hagati cyangwa myugariro kuri Standard de Li\u00e8ge.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nHamwe n'ikipe TP Mazembe, yatsindiye igikombe cya Afurika Champions League muri 2015, yatsinze ikipe ya USM Algeria ku mukino wa nyuma. Uku kwimikwa kumwemerera kwitabira igikombe cyisi cya ma kipe muri 2015 cyateguwe mu Buyapani. Mu gihugu cye kavukire, ubuhanga bwe bwa tekinike bwamuhesheje izina rya Zidane.\n7Ku ya 31 Mutarama 2017, yasinyiye kuri Standard de Li\u00e8ge ku ntizanyo ahitamo kugurwa. Merveille arimo gukina umukino we wa mbere wo gukina na Rouches na Union Saint-Gilloise (2-2). Ku ya 18 Gicurasi 2017, Standard yashyizeho uburyo bwo kwimura bwa nyuma Jonathan Bolingi, Christian Luyindama na Merveille Bope Bokadi, bose babanje kugurizwa na Ikipe ya Tout Puissant.\nUfite imikino umunani mu mikino icyenda ya mbere ya shampiyona yo muri 2017-2018, yagize ikibazo cyo gucika imbere mu rugendo yerekeza muri Anderlecht ku 1 Ukwakira. Abanyekongo ntibasubiye mu kibuga kugeza ku ya 3 Gashyantare 2019 igihe Anderlecht yamwakiriye, asimbuye mu izamu hagati mugenzi we Christian Luyindama wari wavuye i Galatasaray.\nKu ya 19 Nzeri, yakinnye umukino we wa mbere wa Europa League na Vit\u00f3ria Guimar\u00e3es (intsinzi 2-0), bituma ahuza hagati na Konstantinos Laifis. Muri 2019, yarekuwe azize imvune mu cyiciro cya mbere cya shampiyona y\u2019Ububiligi yakinnye na Lommel ku ya 26 Nzeri. Yasuzumwe ikindi cyacitse cy'imbere y'imbere, iki gihe mu ivi ry'iburyo. Hatarashira imyaka ibiri, Merveille na we yararwaye imitsi ya Achilles yongeye kumukomeza kumara amezi menshi. Nubwo ibyo byose byahindutse, buri gihe abonye umwanya we muri Li\u00e8ge cumi n'umwe.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nHamwe no gutoranya Abanyekongo, yitabiriye irushanwa rya Toulon muri 2013 nyuma rishyirwaho bwa mbere kuri Stade des Martyrs na Angola kuri Ku ya 26 Werurwe 2016 (Gutsinda 2-1). Merveille yahise yitabira Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2016 yabereye mu Rwanda, atsinda igitego yatsinze Angola. DR Congo yatsinze irushanwa itsinze Mali kumukino wanyuma."}
{"id": "16071", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16071", "title": "Jordan Botaka", "text": "Jordan Botaka, (wavutse Ku ya 24 Kamena 1993) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo, ukina nk'umukinnyi ukinira iburyo i Hapoel Jerusalem, ku ntizanyo ya La Gantoise.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nBotaka ukomoka mu gace ka Kinshasa k\u2019ababyeyi b\u2019Abanyekongo, yatangiye umwuga we mu Buholandi muri mwambaro ya RKVV Westlandia hanyuma kuva muri ADO La Haye, mbere yuko ababyeyi be bimukira muri Antwerp. Botaka yahise yinjira mu mashuri ya RSC Anderlecht, KSK Beveren hanyuma ajya KSC Lokeren.\nClub Brugge.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Club Brugge.\nMuri shampiyona 2 yakinnye muri ikipe ya ruguru ya Venise, ntiyakina umukino numwe.\nExcelsior Rotterdam.\nNyuma y'ibihe bibiri muri iyi kipe adakinnye umukino numwe n'ikipe ya mbere, n'intizanyo yahawe CF Belenenses, yinjiye muri Excelsior Rotterdam aho yabonye aho atangirira. Hamwe niyi kipe, yabaye kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu gikombe cy\u2019Ubuholandi muri 2015.\nLeeds United F.C..\nMuri 2016, yinjiye mu ikipe Leeds United ikina Shampiyona.\nUmukino wa Charlton F.C..\nKu ya 11 Kanama 2016, yatijwe muri Charlton Athletic igihembwe kimwe.\nK Sint-Truiden VV.\nKu ya 26 Kamena 2017, Jordan Botaka yasinyanye amasezerano y'ibihemwe 3 muri K Saint-Trond VV.\nYahise yigaragaza nk'intangiriro idashidikanywaho ndetse aba kapiteni w'ikipe.\nKAA La Gantoise.\nKu ya 19 Gicurasi 2020, yiyemeje ibihembwe bine ashyigikira KAA La Gantoise, kurwanya amafaranga angana na 600.000 euro.\nCharleroi SC.\nKunanirwa kwishyira muri Ghent, Jordan Botaka yatijwe ku ya 23 Mutarama 2021 amezi 6 ahitamo kuguma muri Sporting de Charleroi.\nYageze mu cyiciro cya kabiri gishimishije hamwe na \"Zebras\" ariko ananirwa kumvisha ubuyobozi bw'ikipe gukoresha uburyo bwo kugura bukubiye mu ntizanyo.\nSubira i Ghent.\nTugarutse i Ghent, Jordan Botaka ashyirwa muri B nucleus ku ya 22 Kamena 2021 n'umutoza Hein Vanhaezebrouck.\nUmukinnyi arimo gushakisha byi mazeyo ikibazo gishya.\nFortuna Sittard.\nKu ya 28 Mutarama 2022, Jordan Botaka yagurijwe kugeza shampiyona irangiye Fortuna Sittard, muri Eredivisie.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nHamwe n\u2019Abaholandi batarengeje imyaka 19, yitabiriye amajonjora yo guhatanira itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19."}
{"id": "16072", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16072", "title": "Pierre Botayi", "text": "Pierre Botayi Bomato (wavutse Ku ya 11 Werurwe 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa congo i Kinshasa muri congo. Akina nka rutahizamu kuri Panth\u00e8re du Nd\u00e9.\nUbuzima.\nPierre Botayi yakira ibihe bibiri mu ikipe ya DR Congo. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu Ku ya 27 Kanama 2011, mu wagicuti na Angola (intsinzi 1-2). Akina umukino we wa kabiri Ku ya 23 Gashyantare 2012, mu mukino wa gicuti na Tanzaniya (0-0).\nMuri ikipe, akinira Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Angola, na Kameruni."}
{"id": "16073", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16073", "title": "Andr\u00e9 Bukia", "text": "Andr\u00e9 Watshini Bukia, mu magambo ahinnye Andr\u00e9 Bukia(yavutse3 marsKu ya 3 Werurwe 1995), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka i Kinshasa muriwa congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati utera muri Al-Batin FC.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\nAndr\u00e9 Bukia yavuye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo afite imyaka cumi n'icyenda yinjira muri FC Penafiel yo muri Porutugali.\nMu guhitamo.\nYahamagariwe bwa mbere mu gutoranya shampiyona irangiye yo muri 2015-2016, umukino wa gicuti na Romaniya. Yubaha guhitamo kwe kwambere Ku ya 25 Kamena 2016 bakina na Suwazilande, mu gikombe cya COSAFA muri 2016 (gutsindwa 1-0)."}
{"id": "16074", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16074", "title": "Tshimen Bwanga", "text": "Tshimen Bwanga (wavutse Ku ya 5 Mutarama 1949) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Zaire. Yakinnye mu buzima bwe bwose muri Tout Puissant Mazembe, aho yitabiriye imikino irenga 300 n'ikipe ye.\nYatangiye icyiciro cye muri shampiyona yo muri1963-1964 nkumuto wa Tout Puissant Englebert, mbere yuko yinjira mu ikipe yabigenewe y'ikipe ye yi myitozo igihembwe yakurikiyeho, nyuma yinjira mu matsinda ya bigize umwuga mu gihe cya 1965-1966 aho yatsindiye gukurikira icyiciro cya mbere, hamwe n'abatsinze inshuro eshanu muri Afurika Champions League.\nAzamenya guhitamo kwe bwa mbere hamwe n'ingwe ya Zayire muri 1968 abitegetswe na Andr\u00e9 Mori, mbere yuko Blagoja Vidini\u0107 atangira kuyobora iryo hitamo muri 1970. Vidini\u0107 yashyizeho visi-kapiteni Tshimen Bwanga akihagera. Yaje kuba kapiteni muri 1972.\nKugeza ubu atuye mu Bufaransa, muri Les Ulis muri Essonne, umujyi utari muto cyane mu buryo bwa siporo, aho abantu bamwe na bamwe nka Thierry Henry, Patrice \u00c9vra, cyangwa Anthony Martial bakuriye."}
{"id": "16075", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16075", "title": "Francis Chansa", "text": "Francis Chansa (wavutse10 septembreKu ya 10 Nzeri 1974) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) i Lubumbashi.\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika mu 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16076", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16076", "title": "Yves Diba Ilunga", "text": "Yves Diba Ilunga (yavutse Ku ya 12 Kanama 1987) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga no muri congo i Lubumbashi. Akina nka rutahizamu w'ikipe yo muri Qatari ya Al Kharitiyath n'ikipe y'igihugu ya congo.\nUbuzima.\nYatoranijwe bwa mbere Ku ya 11 Kanama 2010 hamwe n'ikipe ya A ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mukino wa gicuti na Misiri aho yanatsinze igitego cye cya mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ya A. Mbere, yari yarahamagawe mu ikipe ya A mu mukino wo kwishyura ndetse no mu cyiciro cya nyuma cya CHAN muri 2009 (Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika). Umukino we wa mbere na A 'yakiniwe i Lubumbashi na Repubulika ya Kongo mu cyiciro cyo gukuraho. Kuriyi nshuro, azafungura amazamu yu mukino uzarangira itsinze 3-0."}
{"id": "16077", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16077", "title": "Guelor Dibulana", "text": "Guelor Dibulana, (yavutse Ku ya 13 Gicurasi 1989 apfa Ku ya 28 Werurwe 2013) yavukiye i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina mu izamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYatangiye umwuga we wumwuga afite imyaka 22 hamwe na FC Nzakimuena muri (2011-2012), nyuma akina shampiyona hamwe na FC Les Stars muri (2012-2013).\nNyuma yaje gusinyana na DC Motema Pembe, ikipe yakinnye kugeza apfuye Werurwe 2013, byabaye mu gihe cy'impanuka yo mu muhanda.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatoranijwe mu ikipe y'igihugu mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2014, ariko ntabwo yaje gukina.\nKugaragara kwe gusa muri mwambaro w'igihugu bibaho Ku ya 15 Mutarama 2012, mu gice cya kabiri cyu mukino wa gicuti na Oman (2-2)."}
{"id": "16078", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16078", "title": "Rodrigue Dikaba", "text": "Rodrigue Dikaba (Yavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1985) Ni umukinnyi nku mufaransa, ukomoka muri Congo, Umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka i congo wavukiye Toulouse.\nUmwanya akunda ni kuruhande. Ni umunyamahanga wa congo.\nUmwuga.\nYatojwe muri Arras Football, yabonywe na AS Beauvais, umuturage w'igihugu, wa muzanye muri 2006. Hamwe na ASBO, yatsinze vuba ananirwa gutsinda mu kuzamuka muri Ligue ya 2, yahembwe mu ikipe y'igihugu.\nMuri Mutarama 2008, guhitamo Congo igahamagarira serivisi za gukina umukino n'ikipe y' Ubufaransa ya A.\nAS Beauvais Oise ikora nk'isoko: abaye intandaro yo kwirwanaho kwa Beauvais, abikesha gukomera kwe no gucuranga. Mu riryo muri 2009, yahisemo kutaguma muri Picardy ariko ntiyabona ikipe. Amaherezo, yageze mu itumba ryo muri 2009, mu ikipe ya FC Ceahl\u0103ul Piatra Neam\u0163, icyo gihe yari itara ritukura rya Rumaniya muri D1.\nYinjiye Nyakanga 2010 mu ikipe ya Oldham Athletic ariko nyuma yo kugaragara inshuro 2 n\u2019imvune mu ikipe y' igihugu, yarekuwe niyi kipe Ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2010. Muri Mutarama 2011 yongeye kwinjira muri Beauvais."}
{"id": "16079", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16079", "title": "Patrick Dimbala", "text": "Patrick Dimbala Mawongo (yavutse Ku ya 20 Nzeri 1982 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba umubiligi ukomoka muri congo usanzwe ari umutoza wungirije muri ROCC (Royal Olympic Club ya Charleroi yashinzwe mu 1912) mu bubiligi mu gice cya 2 cy'abatabigize umwuga.\nUmwuga.\nAmahugurwa.\nDimbala yahuguye muri SV Asse kuva 1991 kugeza 1996, hanyuma no muri Eendracht Aalst kuva 1996 kugeza 1999.\nUmwuga wabigize umwuga.\nMuri Ukuboza 1999, imyitozo ye, Eendracht Aalst yamuhaye amahirwe mu makipe yambere. Azakinira harimo igitunguru mu ikino 37, ku bitego 7 yatsinze. Imyitwarire ye ireba ikipe ya Jupiler League: KAA La Gantoise yinjiye mu gihe cyi imbeho muri 2001-2002.\nKuri Gent, yakinnye imikino 38 ku bitego 5 yatsinze mbere yo kwimurirwa muri KV Kortrijk, yongera mu cyiciro cya kabiri, aho yagumye amezi 6 gusa.\nNa none, ni igice cya 1 umuturage wamuhamagariye: umuturanyi, Royal Excelsior Mouscron. Mubindi bihe bibiri, Dimbala yambaraga umwenda wa Hurlus inshuro 57, atsinda ibitego 7. Impinga yiki gihe ikomeje umukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cyababiligi yatsinzwe Gicurasi 2006 kurwanya muri SV Zulte Waregem.\nAriko ikipe y'umupaka ihura n ibibazo by'amafaranga Dimbala yimukira mu bugereki. Ubwa mbere muri APO Levadiakos kuva 2007 kugeza 2009, no kuva 2009 muri PAS Giannina.\nAgarutse muri Nzeri 2014 mu Bubiligi anasinyana amasezerano y'igihembwe muri Royal Football Club Tournai."}
{"id": "16080", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16080", "title": "Ava Dongo", "text": "Ava Dongo Luete (wavutse Ku ya 27 Mutarama 1996) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru uvuka congo i Kinshasa ukina nka myugariro wo hagati muri Royal Antwerp FC yo mu Bubiligi.\nUbuzima.\nKu ya 18 Nzeri 2019, yakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, mu mukino wa gicuti yakinnye n'u Rwanda. Yahise agaragara atsinda igitego. Ariko, DRC yatsinzwe 2-3."}
{"id": "16081", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16081", "title": "Elos Elonga-Ekakia", "text": "Elos Elonga-Ekakia (yavutse Ku ya 2 Gicurasi 1974) ni umukinnyi ukinaumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, ubu yahinduwe umutoza w'urubyiruko. Amaze umwuga we wose mu mwuga mu Bubiligi, akina mu ma kipe abiri akomeye yo muri iki gihugu, FC Bruges na Anderlecht, kandi yambaraga umwenda w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu cya Kongo inshuro mirongo itatu.\nNyuma yo gutwara igikombe cyo w\u2019Ububiligi hamwe na Anderlecht muri 2000, yaguye mu mpanuka ikomeye yo mu muhanda ituma ataba mu murima imyaka hafi 3. Ekakia yahise akina ibihe bitarenze bibiri bya Francs Borains, ariko ingaruka zimpanuka zagaragaye mu mukino we. Urubyiruko rw'ikipe rwa bigaragaje, Lokeren.\nUmwuga.\nElonga-Ekakia yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya AS Vita Club, imwe mu makipe akomeye i Kinshasa, umurwa mukuru wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 1993. Byihuse cyane, yabonywe na bashakishwa abakinnyi muri Beveren, ikipe yo m'ububiligi, ariko ntabwo yigeze abona amahirwe ahari. Nyuma yu mwaka ku ntebe, yimukiye i Lokeren, waje gukina mu cyiciro cya 2. Yatsindiye igikombe muri 1995-1996, hamwe n'ibitego 14, yagize uruhare runini mu kuzamuka kw'iyi kipe muri D1. Igihe abantu bashya bateraga i Lokeren muri 1998, Jan Koller na Jean-Paul Boeka-Lisasi, Ekakia yabonye igihe cye cyo gukina kigabanuka, kandi ageze mu kibuga wasangaga akenshi bifata uruhande. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, yerekeje muri FC Brugge, shampiyo urinda izamu, hamwe na mugenzi we Koen Schockaert.\nEkakia amara igihe muri Bruges, abujijwe na bakinnyi nka Gert Verheyen cyangwa Edgaras Jankauskas. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri gusa, maze ava muri iyo kipe yerekeza kuri Anderlecht bahanganye, aho yasanze Jan Koller. Muri icyo gihembwe, mauve yiganjemo shampiyona, kandi Ekakia ya gombaga guhangana n\u2019amarushanwa akomeye cyane na Koller, ariko na Tomasz Radzinski, Oleg Iachtchouk, Edrissa Sonko cyangwa Y\u00e1nnis Anastas\u00edou. Nyamara yakinnye imikino igera kuri mirongo itatu, kandi afite ibitego icumi, yagize uruhare mu gutwara igikombe cya shampiyona w\u2019Ububiligi ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya Pro League muri 2000.\nKubwamahirwe, nyuma gato yo gutsindira igihugu, Ekakia yaguye mu mpanuka ikomeye yo mu muhanda. Yatanyaguje imitsi ye ikomeye, maze ihungabana ritera kuva amaraso mu bwonko. Ufatwa nk'uwatsinzwe mu mupira w'amaguru, bimutwara hafi imyaka itatu kugirango agaruke mu kibuga. Yagarutse mu cyiciro cya 3, ahitwa Francs Borains, aho yakinnye kugeza muri 2004 mbere yo kumanika burundu.\nMuri Kanama 2010, yagizwe umutoza wihariye w'amakipe y'urubyiruko ya Lokeren "}
{"id": "16082", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16082", "title": "Richard Ekunde", "text": "Richard Ekunde (Ku ya 4 Kanama 1982) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kino-congo i Kinshasa. Akina nka myugariro muri ikipe yo muri Noruveje ya Viking FK i Stavanger."}
{"id": "16083", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16083", "title": "Meschack Elia", "text": "Meschack Elia, (yavutse Ku ya 6 Kanama 1992) i Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo (DRC). Akina nka rutahizamu w'ikipe yo mu Busuwisi ya BSC Young Boys.\nUbuzima.\nMeschack Elia akomoka muri komini ya N'Sele i Kinshasa. Yatangiye gukina umupira hakiri kare, nka benshi mu rubyiruko rwo mu gace atuyemo mbere yo kuvumburwa na Alain le Jeune, perezida w'ikigo cyo gutangiza abana b'Abanyekongo mu mupira w'amaguru.CIECF\".\nMuri 2012, yitabiriye irushanwa rya Airtel Young Talent Tournament aho ikipe ye yitabiriye icyiciro cya nyuma muri Kenya. Akina akurikirana hamwe na Green Angels na Jogarry.\nMuri Nzeri 2014, yinjiye muri CS Don Bosco kandi yiboneye iterambere ritangaje.\nMeschack Elia ntaramenyekana muri rusange, muri CHAN yo Rwanda muri 2016, aho yabaye ikintu gikomeye cyo gutoranya kandi agaragaza impano ye yose.\nKu ya 9 Nyakanga 2022, yongereye amasezerano muri BSC Young Boys, kugeza muri 2024.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nKu mukino wa nyuma w'irushanwa rya Mali, yafunguye amazamu ku gutandukana n'umutwe wa Jonathan Bolingi. Yatsinze igitego cya kabiri ku mupira wa Yannick Bangala: yataye umunyezamu wo muri Mali Dyigui Diarra mbere yo gutsinda igitego cyubusa. Umukino urangira intsinzi isobanutse (3-0) ishyigikira abakinnyi ba congo. Yongeye gutorwa umuntu wumukino. Kim's Mavuangu\nYarangije nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri aya marushanwa n'ibitego bine ndetse anatorwa nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri iri rushanwa."}
{"id": "16084", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16084", "title": "Doris Fuakumputu", "text": "Doris Fuakumputu (wavutse Ku ya 18 Mata 1984) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomomka muri congo i Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUyu ni rutahizamu akaba ari mpuzamahanga wa congo, akaba yarakinnye umukino muri ekipe y'igihugu bw'ambere muri 2008)."}
{"id": "16085", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16085", "title": "Doxa Gikanji", "text": "Doxa Gikanji ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa DR Congo mbere.\" "}
{"id": "16086", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16086", "title": "Roger Hitoto", "text": "Roger Hitoto, (Yavutse Ku ya 24 Gashyantare 1969) i Mbandaka (muri Zayire, ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo), ni umukinnyi ukina arimpuzamahanga mu umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUmukinnyi hagati mu kibuga hamwe n'uwatwitse, Hitoto yamaze igihe kinini cyu mwuga we mubufaransa.\nUmwuga.\nYatojwe ari muri FC Melun, Hitoto yahiswemo afite imyaka 15 na FC Rouen. Ku myaka 19, muri 1988, yatangiye bwa mbere mu cyiciro cya 2. Muri shampiyona esheshatu yakinnye imikino 147 muri D2 (igitego 1) na 10 muri gikombe cya bafaransa. Nyuma yaje kwinjizwa muri Lille OSC, ikipe ikomeye. Buhoro yigaragaza nk'intangiriro, akurikira Jakob Friis-Hansen. Yakinnye shampiyona bitatu muri D1 (imikino 66 n'ibitego 3) hanyuma bibiri muri D2 (imikino 43).\nYatoranijwe mu ikipe ya Zaire (yiswe iya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 1997), yitabira igikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 1996 (yakinnye imikino 2) hamwe na 1998 (imikino 3). Yakinnye kandi imikino itatu yujuje ibisabwa mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1998.\nYakomeretse cyane muri 1998, Hitoto yavuye i Lille muri 1999 yerekeza mu Bushinwa hanyuma muri katari. Mu 2001, yagarutse muri shampiyona muri FC Rouen, asubira muri katari, nyuma arangiza umwuga we mu ma kipe yakiniraga harimo FC Mantes, CMS Oissel, ni zindi.\nNyuma yuko atangiye izabukuru muri siporo, Hitoto yongeye kuba umujyanama ku isi mu umupira w'amaguru maze afata inshingano muri federasiyo y'umupira w'amaguru ya Kongo, nk'umuyobozi ureberera mu Burayi."}
{"id": "16087", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16087", "title": "Florent Ibenge", "text": "Jean-Florent Ikwange Ibenge (yavutse Ku ya 4 Ukuboza 1961) yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, wahindutse umutoza, yavukiye i Mbandaka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nizina ba muhimba ni Coach Endroit, uzwi ku izina rya Florent Ibenge, amazina ye nyakuri ni Jean Florent Ibenge Ikwange, ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Kongo, wavukiye i Mbandaka mu cyahoze ari intara ya Ekateri yo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ku ya 4 Ukuboza 1961, afite abavandimwe na bashiki bacu. akaba Umukunzi umupira w'amaguru kuva akiri muto, yikubita ku rutugu hamwe n'umupira w'amaguru wahoze muri Zairian (ingwe ya Zaire) maze ava muri Zaire yerekeza i Burayi mu myaka 12 kubera impamvu zo kwiga, mu gihe yakinaga umupira. muri 2004, yatoje nk'umutoza, muri 2008 aba umutoza wungirije mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Kongo, nyuma gato yo kwitwara neza ku mugabane wa Aziya, muri 2012 asinyana amasezerano na AS Vita Club maze yibutswa nk'umutoza w'igihugu muri 2015 muri CAN gukinisha kuva aho yakinnye uruhare rwabatoza kabiri.\nni muri 2020 nibwo umutoza Ibenge yavuye muri AS Vita Club kubera ibikorwa yaramaze kugeraho byo muri Afurika.\nIbeng\u00e9 yavuye muri AS Vita Club.\nUmutoza wa AS V. Club, Jean Florent Ibenge, ubwo yatandukanaga n'ikipe ya Kinshasa, amaze imyaka myinshi atoza. Ibi byatangajwe ku wa gatatu tariki ya 30 Kamena 2021 ku mbuga na Perezida wa AS Vita Club, Bestine Kazadi.\nAti: \u201cNshuti nshyigikiye, ndatangaza kugenda ku mutoza wacu Jean-Florent Ibenge. Mu izina rya AS V. Club, turamushimira serivisi yatanzwe kandi tumwifurije gutsinda\u201d ibi bikaba byavuzwe na Madamu Kazadi, nta yandi makuru arambuye.\nJean Florent Ibenge yabanye na AS Vita Club kuva muri 2013\nDore amateka ye:\nIbenge.\nMu gihe cya Ibenge, Les l\u00e9opards ya DRC yashoboye kwinjira mu myaka itatu kuva muri 2016 kugeza 2018 muri 50 ba mbere ku isi ku rutonde rwa FIFA.\nAriko, iyi kipe yabuze igikombe cyisi cya 2018 ihuza 2-2 na Tuniziya iwayo mugihe amanota yari 2-0 hasigaye iminota 15. Nubwo intsinzi yatsinze Libiya na Gineya muminsi yanyuma, Ingwe izabura isi. Ibenge asa nkaho yatakaje flair.\nIbihembo.\nUmutoza.\nMuri ikipe.\nAS Vita Club\nRS Berkane\nItandukaniro ryumuntu.\nUrubuga rwihariye Four FourTwo ruhuza Florent Ibenge 50\u00a0umutoza ku isi muri 2015."}
{"id": "16088", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16088", "title": "Jordan Ikoko", "text": "Jordan Ikoko, (yavutse Ku ya 3 Gashyantare 1994) yari muri Montereau-Fault-Yonne, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC) ukina nka myugariro muri Paphos FC.\nUbuzima.\nParis Saint Germain.\nJordan Ikoko yavukiye i Montereau muri 1994 afite ubwenegihugu bwa Kongo. Yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru muri 2002 muri Mitry Mory Football, umujyi yakuriyemo mbere yo kwinjira muri Villeparisis US Municipale nyuma yimyaka ibiri. Mu 2007, yinjiye mu kigo cy\u2019amahugurwa cya Paris Saint-Germain. Muri Kamena 2009, yabaye uwa rangije mu gikombe cy\u2019igihugu ku bana bafite imyaka 14 ahitamo Paris-\u00cele-de-France League. Mu ikipe ya Paris, yakinnye imikino itanu ya CFA mu ikipe ya B muri shampiyona yo muri 2010-2011 hanyuma yigaragaza nk'intangiriro mu ikipe yabigenewe mu bihe bya kurikiyeho, akina imikino 20 muri 2011-2012 hanyuma 18 muri 2012 -2013.\nUrukurikirane rw'inguzanyo.\nKu ya 7 Kanama 2013, Jordan Ikoko yasinyanye amasezerano yu mwuga n\u2019ikipe ya Paris mu gihe cyi myaka itatu ahita agurizwa muri Amerika Cr\u00e9teil-Lusitanos. Yakinnye umukino wa mbere wa bigize umwuga kuri Ku ya 16 Kanama 2013, kumunsi wa gatatu wa Ligue 2, na SM Caen wa simbuye Augusto Pereira Loureiro kumwanya wa 63\u00a0umunota w'umukino (gutsindwa 3-0). Icyumweru cyakurikiyeho, yashinzwe bwa mbere ahanganye na FC Istres (kunganya 2-2).\nMuri shampiyona 2014-2015, PSG ya mugurije ubugira kabiri, kuriyi nshuro Le Havre, ikipe ya Ligue 2 aho yakinnye imikino igera kuri 20 ya shampiyona.\nUmwaka umwe, Ku ya 24 Nyakanga 2015, yongeye gutizwa maze atwara RC Lens.\nEA Guingamp.\nKu ya 23 Kamena 2016, yinjiye muri En avant Guingamp ku masezerano yi myaka itatu kugirango asubize Lars Jacobsen. Byu mwihariko yatsinze igitego we nyine, ku ya 13 Kanama 2017 ubwo yakiniraga Paris Saint-Germain Football Club, ikipe ye yitoreza, kumunsi wa kabiri wa Ligue ya 1 muri 2017-2018.\nLudogorets Razgrad.\nMuri Kamena 2019, yasinye amasezerano na Ludogorets Razgrad muri Bulugariya.\nMu guhitamo.\nhamwe n'urubyiruko.\nJordan Ikoko yatoranijwe bwa mbere hamwe nu bufaransa batarengeje imyaka igera 16 Ku ya 29 Nzeri 2009, mugushirwaho na Wales mu mikino ya gicuti (intsinzi 6-0). Yatsinze igitego cya mbere hamwe n'iri hitamo Ku ya 1 Ukuboza 2009 mu mukino wa gicuti n'Ububiligi (intsinzi 4-1).\nKu ya 3 Nyakanga 2013, yatoranijwe na Francis Smerecki kwitabira muri Euro yo 2013 bari munsi yimyaka 19. Nyuma yo gutangira amarushanwa bitoroshye, yakuye Espayne muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza maze yinjira mu mukino wa nyuma yakinnye na Seribiya bitewe n'ibitego bya Yassine Benzia na Antoine Conte. Les Bleuets yatsinzwe igitego 1-0 kumukino wanyuma. Yegereye iri rushanwa nka bafite kandi yitabira imikino yose yi kipe yu bufaransa.\nHamwe no guhitamo DRC.\nKu ya 31 Ukwakira 2016, yatoranijwe rero n'umutoza w'ikipe umupira w'amaguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo amezi make mbere yuko CAN muri 2017 yujuje ibyangombwa byo gutoranya Abanyekongo.\nYatoranijwe muri CAN muri 2017, yakinnye umukino wa mbere na Kote Divuwari (2-2).\nIbihembo.\nHamwe n\u2019Ubufaransa bwabatarengeje imyaka 19, yabaye uwanyuma wa Euro muri 2013."}
{"id": "16089", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16089", "title": "Herita Ilunga", "text": "Herita N'Kongolo Ilunga, (yavutse Ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1982) i Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nIlunga yavuye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo akiri muto cyane, yaje mu Bufaransa atangira umupira w'amaguru muri Sarceles.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\nIntangiriro igoye.\nMu 1995, yinjiye mu kigo cya mahugurwa cya Amiens SC. Nyuma yi mikino myiza n'urubyiruko rwa Amiens, yavuye kuri Stade Rennes nyuma yi myaka ine. Nubwo bikiri ibyiringiro nki bisanzwe, ibibazo ntabwo bihinduka kumushyigikira kandi amahirwe yogukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga asa nkaho agabanuka.\nMuri Kamena 2002, iki gihe mu mahanga na Barcelona, mu byukuri aho asinyira Espanyole.\nMutagatifu Etienne.\nFr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Antonetti, icyo gihe yari umutoza wa ASSE, ashaka igisubizo ku ruhande rw'ibumoso. Afite amafaranga make kandi ubushakashatsi bwi mbitse (yavumbuye Michael Essien byu mwihariko) bi zamutera kubona intizanyo ahitamo kugura umusore wi myaka 21. Ako kanya, yishyizemo nta mpungenge kuko uruhande rwi bumoso rwitiriwe maze Greens isubira muri Ligue 1 mu mpera ziki gihembwe cyo muri 2003-2004. Antonetti, utaremezwa mu nshingano ze, Elie Baup asimbuye. Ikipe ikoresha uburyo bwo kugura."}
{"id": "16090", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16090", "title": "Giannelli Imbula", "text": "Giannelli Imbula Wanga, (yavutse Ku ya 12 Nzeri 1992) i Vilvoorde mu Bubiligi, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga wumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati muri Tuzlaspor.\nUbuzima.\nIntangiriro.\nYanyuze mu rubyiruko rwo muri Amerika Argentineuil na Racing Club de France, yageze muri 2004, mu kigo cy\u2019imyitozo cya Paris Saint-Germain mbere yi gihembwe mbere yo gusubira mu Isiganwa. Muri 2007, yinjiye mu kigo cyigisha En avant Guingamp.\nKu ya 16 Ukwakira 2009, yakinnye umukino we wa mbere wa bigize umwuga yakinnye niyi kipe Dijon FCO icyarimwe abaye umukinnyi muto wa bayeho muri Ligue 2, afite imyaka 17, ukwezi kumwe n'iminsi 4. Yitabiriye umukino wa kabiri mbere yuko iyi kipe isubira mu cyiciro cya gatatu. Ariko iyi kipe ikomeza shampiyona imwe gusa kubururu, mu rwego mbere yo kuzamuka dukesha umwanya wa gatatu. Yahawe umupira mwiza cyane, yakiriwe neza nabatoza bahanganye, nka Philippe Hinschberger wa muhamagaye \"umunyamahanga\u00bb, cyangwa na Erick Mombaerts amubonamo\u00abumukinnyi w'indashyikirwa\u00bb. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Ligue 2, Ku ya 11 Mutarama 2013, kuri Stade Oc\u00e9ane, mu gutsinda kuri Le Havre igitego. Gukurikira avant Guingamp kuzamuka muri Ligue 1 muri Gicurasi 2013, ni cyera \u201dUmukinnyi mwiza muri Ligue 2 na bagenzi be mu gihe cy'ibikombe bya UNFP.\nImikino ya Olempike.\nKu ya 19 Nyakanga 2013, yasinyanye amasezerano yi myaka 5 na Oleympike ya Marseille. Iherere kanyabubasha rigera kuri miliyoni 7.5 zama yero hiyongereyeho + miliyoni 2 za bonusi. Nyuma yo gutangira ibyiringiro na OM, mu mikino ye ya mbere muri L ya1 yakinnye n'ikipe yahoze yitwa EA Guingamp, Ku ya 11 Nzeri 2013 noneho umukino wa mbere wa Champions League wu mwuga we na Arsenal kuri Stade V\u00e9lodrome, Ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2013, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere hamwe na Phocaeans, Ku ya 24 Nzeri 2013 kurwanya AS Saint-\u00c9tienne mu gutsinda ibitego bibiri kuri OM. Muri iki gihembwe cya mbere kandi nubwo amarushanwa yari mu mwanya we, yakinnye buri gihe kandi yitabira imikino mirongo itatu ni rindwi mu marushanwa yose.\nFC Porto noneho Stoke City.\nKu ya 31 Kanama 2017, yasinyiye igihembwe cy'intizanyo muri Toulouse FC nta mahitamo yo kugura muri Stoke City."}
{"id": "16091", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16091", "title": "Arnold Isako", "text": "Arnold Isako, uzwi kandi ku izina rya Arnold Issoko, (yavutse Ku ya 6 Mata 1992), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri kongo. Akina iburyo hagana inyuma, ariko kandi nku mukinnyi w'iburyo.\nUbuzima.\nAmaze gukora byinshi mu mwuga we muri Porutugali (amaze kugaragara inshuro zirenga 80 muri shampiyona ya Porutugali mu bihe bitatu yakinnye na Vit\u00f3ria Set\u00fabal FC) hanyuma mu Buhinde na Mumbai City FC, yasinye muri 2019 na SM Caen, ikipe ya Ligue 2 yo mu Bufaransa.\nYatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo mu mukino wa gicuti na Romaniya muri Gicurasi 2016."}
{"id": "16092", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16092", "title": "Musasa Kabamba", "text": "Musasa Kabamba (yavutse ku ya 30 Gicurasi 1982) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri (DRC) i Kinshasa.\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16093", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16093", "title": "Nicod\u00e8me Kabamba", "text": "Nicod\u00e8me Kabamba Wa Kabengu, uzwi ku izina rya \"Serpent de Rail\" cyangwa \"Umushakashatsi\" (yavutse Ku ya 29 Nyakanga 1936), yahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) yahindutswe nyuma umutoza.\nUbuzima.\nKapiteni w'ikipe ya congo yatsindiye CAN muri 1968, Nicod\u00e8me Kabamba yatsinze ibitego bibiri yatsinze Congo-Brazzaville. Yabaye mpuzamahanga kuva muri 1956 kugeza 1969 akinira Amerika Panda, DC Motema Pembe na Standard de Li\u00e8ge muri 1959 - 1963).\nYaje kuba umutoza hagati muri 1973 na 2003: ni umutoza wungirije w'ikipe y'igihugu muri CAN muri 1974, yatsinze irushanwa. Ayobora amakipe ya SCOM Mikishi, FC Saint \u00c9loi Lupopo, DC Motema Pembe (kuva muri 2003) na TP Mazembe. Muri 2013, yahawe igikombe cyi cyubahiro cyo muri UFC.\nAbapfuye.\nYapfuye ku ya 29 Gashyantare 2020 mu ivuriro ya Ngalima i Gombe maze, ahambwa ku ya 10 Gicurasi 2020 mu irimbi rya Necropolis."}
{"id": "16094", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16094", "title": "Junior Kabananga", "text": "Junior Kabananga (yavutse ku ya 4 Mata 1989) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) i Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUmwuga.\nYiswe Uhoraho Ku ya 25 Nzeri 2014 na Florent Ibenge ku mukino ukomeye mu mikino ya CAN muri 2015 na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nKu ya 15 Ukwakira 2014, yatsinze igitego muri Abidjan, igitego kiva mu kugenzura igituza mu mukino wa kabiri na Kote Divuwari.\nUmunota wanyuma wumushyitsi wa CAN muri 2017 kubwinyungu za Herv\u00e9 Kage, niwe ugaragaza ikipe mu gihe cya marushanwa. Mu byukuri, yatsinze ibitego cyihuse mu matsinda yakinnye na Maroke (1-0), na kote divuwari (2-2), ndetse no gutsinda Togo (3-1). Mu gihe ikipe ye yasezerewe muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza yakinnye na Gana (2-1), ibitego bitatu yabanje gutsinda bya muhaye umwanya wa mbere muri CAN, kurutonde rwabatsinze."}
{"id": "16095", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16095", "title": "Kadima Kabangu", "text": "Kadima Kabangu, izina ryuzuye ni Dark Johns Kadima Kabangu, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nKabangu yakiniye ikipe ya Lupopo yo muri Kongo, mbere yo kwimukira muri 2016 yerekeza i Budapest Honv\u00e9d FC muri Hongiriya.\nHamwe na Budapest Honv\u00e9d, yakinnye imikino 12 mu cyiciro cya mbere, atsinda ibitego bibiri. Nubwo yakinnye bike, yatsindiye kuba shampiyona wa Hongiriya muri 2017. Uku kwimikwa kumwemerera gukina mu cyiciro kibanza cya Champions League mu mpeshyi yo muri 2017.\nNyuma yimukiye muri Arumeniya muri 2018.\nMuri 2019, yasubiye mu rugo, asinya muri na DC Motema Pembe. Igihe cyakurikiyeho, yamenyekanye muri DR Congo abikesheje \"inyundo yo mu mutwe\"\u00a0[].\nKu ya 21 Mutarama 2022, yageze muri Maroke kugira ngo asinyane amasezerano yi bihe bitatu n'igice na Raja Club Athletic.\nKu ya 22 Gashyantare, yatsinze igitego cya mbere hamwe na \"Greens\" mu mutwe wumunsi wa 18 wa shampionat na JS Soualem (intsinzi 0-1).\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nKu ya 10 Nzeri 2014, Kadima Kabangu yakiriye umwe rukumbi mu ikipe ya Congo, na Siyera Lewone. DRC yatsinze 0-2 muriyi nama yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika muri 2015.\nIbihembo.\nRaja Club Athletic"}
{"id": "16096", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16096", "title": "Mulota Patou Kabangu", "text": "Mulota Patou Kabangu (yavutse Ku ya 31 Ukuboza 1985) ni umukinnyi ukina wumupira wamaguru ukomoka (DRC) i Kinshasa. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati cyangwa rutahizamu. Kuri ubu akinira ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Saint Eloi Lupopo i Lubumbashi.\nYaje kumenyekana cyane muri CAF Champions League muri 2010, yatsindiye n'ikipe ye, ndetse no mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cya ikipe muri 2010, aho TP Mazembe yageze ku mukino wa nyuma na Inter Milan. Yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Bubiligi RSC Anderlecht ku ya 1 Mutarama 2012. Intizanyo ye ntiyongerewe asubira muri TP Mazembe muri Kamena 2012. Muri 2017 yinjiye muri Daring Club Motema Pembe. Muri 2021, asinyina na FC Saint Eloi Lupopo\nUbuzima.\nKabangu yavukiye i Kinshasa. Yatangiye bwa mbere muri club yaho, umujyi wa Kin. Muri 2009, yinjiye muri TP Mazembe. Uyu mwaka, yatsindiye igikombe cya shampiyona ya Congo. Mu mwaka wa 2010, TP Mazembe yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona, yujuje ibisabwa mu gikombe cy'isi cya ikipe.\nKu ya 14 Ugushyingo 2010, yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu gikombe cyisi cya ikipe. Ikipe ya mutoje, TP Mazembe, yatsinze 2\u20130 na SC Internacional yo muri Burezile. TP Mazembe niyo kipe yambere yaba Abanyaburayi cyangwa Abanyamerika yepfo bakinnye umukino wanyuma w'igikombe cyisi cya FIFA.\nMuri Mutarama 2012, yasinyiye ikipe y'Ububiligi RSC Anderlecht. Arakina bike. Akenshi ku ntebe, ahitamo kuva mu ikipe y'Ububiligi.\nKu ya 30 Kamena 2013, Kabangu yinjiye muri Qatar Stars League, muri ikipe ya Al Ahli SC.\nMuri 2017, yinjiye muri Tout Puissant Mazembe, ikipe ye yitoreza."}
{"id": "16097", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16097", "title": "Babo Kabasu", "text": "Dominique Babo Kabasu (yavutse Ku ya 4 Werurwe 1950) noneho muri Kongo Mbiligi ubu ni muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi wari mpuzamahanga wumupira wamaguru wa congo (DRC), wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zaire, yakinnye imikino 3, ku gitego kimwe yatsinze, hagati yo muri 1974 na 1976.\nYatsindiye Igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1974 hanyuma atoranywa muri, uwo mwaka kugira ngo yitabire Igikombe cy'isi mu Budage."}
{"id": "16098", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16098", "title": "Eugene Kabongo Ngoy", "text": "Eug\u00e8ne Kabongo Ngoy (yavutse Ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 1960) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC), i L\u00e9opoldville muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yakinaga nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nAkinira ikipe ya RFC Seraing, RC Paris, RSC Anderlecht, Olympique Lyonnais na SC Bastia.\nYatsinze ibitego 29 mu cyiciro cya 2 muri shampiyona yo muri 1985\u201386 hanyuma atsinda ibitego 22 muri shampiyona yo muri 1988\u201389.\nYitabiriye igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1988 hamwe n'ikipe ya Zaire ubu ni congo.\nUmwuga we warangiye ubwo Shampiyona yi gihugu yatangazaga ko adakwiriye ku mubiri Ku ya 1 Werurwe 1992."}
{"id": "16099", "revid": "11335", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16099", "title": "Mutamba Kabongo", "text": "Mutamba Kabongo (yavutse Ku ya 9 Ukuboza 1970) noneho ubu ni muri Zaire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muriwa congo (DRC), wakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zaire hanyuma yitwa DRC, yakinnye imikino 7 (nta gitego yatsinze) hagati yo muri 1996 na 2001.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika cyo muri1996 na 1998. Yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa yo muri 1998.\nYakinnye kandi imikino itatu ibara imikino ibanza y'Igikombe cy'isi, muri 1998 na 2002 "}
{"id": "16100", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16100", "title": "Ubuvumo bwa Musanze", "text": "Mu Rwanda muri rusange hari ubuvumo burenga 50, i Musanze honyine hari 12 bufitanye isano n\u2019uruhererekane rw\u2019ibisozi binini cyane byitwa Ibirunga. Aha hamaze kuba agace k\u2019ubukerarugendo bunogeye ijisho ku banyamahanga ndetse n\u2019abanyarwanda bagenda batahura ibyiza bitatse igihugu cyabo.\nImiterere.\nUbu buvumo bufite uburebure hafi kilometero ebyiri,ubujyakuzimu bwa metero10 na 40, n\u2019ubugari bwa metero 3 kugeza kuri metero 10.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi ariko bugaragaza ko ubu buvumo bukomoka ku iruka ry\u2019ibirunga biri hejuru yabwo ryabayeho mu myaka ibihumbi byinshi ishize, aho ibikoma (magma) biva mu birunga aribyo byagiye byuma bigasigaramo ibyanya munsi ari nabyo byavuyemo ubu buvumo.\nMu mateka ya vuba aha hantu habaye ubwihisho bw\u2019abateraga u Rwanda bavuye muri Congo Kinshasa bita abacengezi, gusa intambara yo kubarwanya irangira bayitsinzwe ndetse benshi babugwamo.\nIbindi.\nUbu buvumo buratangaje cyane kuko hari n\u2019ibice byabwo bikomeza bikagera no muri Congo Kinshasa, igihande cy\u2019i Musanze na Kinigi kiratunganyije cyane, harimo urumuri ruhagije n\u2019umutekano usesuye, ni ahantu heza ho gusura kuri buri munyarwanda wifuza kubona ibyiza by\u2019igihugu cye kuri kiriya giciro."}
{"id": "16101", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16101", "title": "Ubuvumo bwa Samatare", "text": "Ubuvumo bwa Samatare buherereye mu karere ka Rwamagana Umurenge wa Gahengeri, Akagari ka Kagezi, Ni ubuvumo burebure kuburyo n\u2019ahabatuye batazi uko bureshya cyangea uko bwabayeho. Buri mu musozi w\u2019amabuye menshi, buteye ubwoba n\u2019amatsiko cyane.\nImiterere.\nUbuvumo bwa Samatare ni ubuvumo nyabagendwa ku ntangiriro zabwo kugera kuri za metero nke ugenda, harimo ibyumba (inzira zibushamikiyeho) kandi ni ubuvumo benshi baza gusengeramo nubwo bitemewe kubera impamvu z\u2019umutekano w\u2019abajyamo.\nMuri ubu buvumo harimo udupapuro twanditseho ibyifuzo abasengaga banditse batura Imana, abaza kuhasengera abenshi ni abaturuka kure baza bagafata amajoro atari make.\nIyo ubonye ubu buvumo usanga buteye amatsiko cyane ku buryo buramutse bukozweho ubushakashatsi bugatunganywa bukitabwaho bwahinduka ahantu nyaburanga hakurura amatsiko y\u2019abantu ari nako hinjiza imari n\u2019iterambere hafi yabwo."}
{"id": "16102", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16102", "title": "Ubuvumo bwa Nyankokoma", "text": "Ubu buvumo bwa Nyankokoma bwitirirwa Ruganzu buri mu karere ka Gicumbi mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru mu murenge wa Ruvune mu mudugudu wa Nyankokoma. Buri ku musozi muremure uhanamye, ahantu hateye ubwoba bukabije kuko uramutse uguye ibyawe byaba bisa nk'aho birangiye, kubona icyaguhagarika biragoye bitewe n'uburyo hacuramye.\nImiterere.\nMuri ubu buvumo harimo icyumba kinini cyane bita Kambere ahagana hejuru imbere hari uwundi mwenge urimo ikindi cyumba ho, bisa n\u2019ibigoye kuhinjira kuko byagusaba kurira kandi kanyerera.\nMunsi yawo, hari uwundi mwenge muto kwinjiramo bisaba gukambakamba. Iki cyumba bakita Kagondo. Hari umwijima uteye ubwoba ntushobora kubona ikintu na kimwe n\u2019amaso utifashishije urumuri. \nNi icyumba ubona gisa n'aho ari kigari. Ku nkuta zo muri ubu buvumo hari aho ubona udupapuro twashyizwe hagati y\u2019amabuye turimo ibyifuzo by'abagenda baza kuhasengera. Izi nkuta kandi ziranyerera, ziriho amazi ameze nk\u2019amavuta."}
{"id": "16103", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16103", "title": "Ubuvumo bwa Nyakavumu", "text": "Ubuvumo bwa Nyakavumu buherereye mu Mudugudu wa Kigarama, Akagari ka Bisesero, Umurenge wa Mubuga, Akarere ka Karongi, Intara y\u2019Iburengerazuba.\nAmateka.\nUbu buvumo bukekwa ko bwaguyemo abantu bagera kuri 200 bazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994, buracyabitse imibiri y\u2019aba bantu, nubwo bwose hakomeje igikorwa cyo kuyikuramo. \nUbuvumo bwa Nyakavumu ni burebure kandi bufite amakona imbere, bityo gutaburura imibiri ari igikorwa kigomba ubuhanga n\u2019ubushobozi."}
{"id": "16104", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16104", "title": "Ubuvumo bwa Hang Son Doong", "text": "Hang Son Doong ni ubuvumo bw'amayobera buherereye muri pariki ya Phong Nha Ke, ku mupaka wa Vietnam na Laos. Nyuma y\u2019ubushakashatsi bwakozwe n\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019abashakashatsi ku by\u2019ubuvumo b\u2019Abongereza muri 2009-2010, Hang Son Doong yafunguwe nk\u2019icyanya nyaburanga kuva muri 2013.\nImiterere.\nUbu buvumo bufite metero zirenga 200 z\u2019ubugari, metero 150 z\u2019ubujyejuru na metero 6,500 z\u2019uburebure; nubwo abashakashatsi bavuze ko mu gihe kingana n\u2019umwaka bamaze muri ubwo buvumo batabashije kubuzenguruka bwose. Abashakashatsi bemeje ko ubuvumo bwa Hang Son Doong buruta ubwari buzwi ko ari bwo bunini bwa Deer buri muri \nMalaysia bufite metero 90 z\u2019ubugari, metero 100 z\u2019ubujyejuru na kilometero 2 z\u2019uburebure.\nUbu buvumo bumaze imyaka isaga miliyoni 5. Bitewe na calcium carbonate iba muri ubu buvumo hashobora kuboneka ibicu bitanga imvura ndetse ikaba ijya inahagwa, cyangwa se ikabura ubutaka bwaho bukuma. Muri 2013 ni bwo abakerarugendo ba mbere basuye ubu buvumo aho kuhasura byari ukwishyura $3000."}
{"id": "16105", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16105", "title": "Inyoni ya woodcock", "text": "Hariho ubwoko bw\u2019inyoni zimuka imigabane cyangwa se ahandi hantu ziba zisanzwe zituye kubera impamvu zitandukanye, mu ngendo zazo ariko zigenda zihagararara kugira ngo ziruhuke, nyamara inyoni zitwa b\u00e9casses (mu Gifaransa) cyangwa woodcock (mu Cyongereza) ziruka ahantu hangana kuriya nta kuruhuka ndetse zinagendera ku butumburuke buri hejuru cyane, ahantu hataba umuyaga.\nImiterere.\nIyi nyoni ya woodcock ibasha kuguruka ahantu hareshya n\u2019ibilometero ibihumbi 4 na metero 620 mu gihe kingana n\u2019iminsi ibiri gusa, mu gihe zagurutse ahantu hareshya n\u2019ibilometero 7153 mu minsi itatu n\u2019igice. \nIbindi.\nIzi nyoni zitura muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo mu gihe umugabane w\u2019u Burayi uri mu bihe by\u2019ubukonje, zikongera kwimuka zihagaruka mu gihe impeshyi igeze, zigatura mu Burayi bw\u2019Uburasirazuba."}
{"id": "16106", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16106", "title": "Inganji", "text": "Inyoni yitwa Inganji ni imwe mu nyoni zikunzwe muri Pariki y\u2019igihugu ya Nyungwe. Ubwoko bw\u2019iyi nyoni bukunze kuba mu mashyamba y\u2019inzitane akenshi usanga arimo aya kimeza yo muri Afurika yo hagati. \nImiterere.\nIyi nyoni ikunze muri Pariki ya Nyungwe, ifite ijwi ryiza cyane usanga ba mukerarugendo bishimiye, kubera kuririmba neza bigasa n\u2019amajwi meza ashimisha abayumva.\nSi izi nyoni gusa usanga zikunzwe kuko bamwe usanga bakunda ubwoko bwazo, uko zisa, amajwi yazo azitandukanya aho zimwe ziririmba zisakuza, izindi zituje, izindi zikavuga nk\u2019ingoma, imyirongi, bigaha Pariki ubwiza bw\u2019amajwi agenda anyuranamo."}
{"id": "16107", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16107", "title": "Inyoni ya Autruche", "text": "Ni kenshi abantu bagiye bagaragaza ko inyoni ya Autruche, kubera ubwenge buke ihisha umutwe mu mucanga igihe yihisha abantu cyangwa inyamaswa zishobora kuyisagarira.\nImiterere.\nubushakashatsi buvuga ko Autruche ifite ubwenge buke kubera ko ifite ubwonko buto (bupima amagarama 26.3) ugereranyije n\u2019ijisho ryayo kuko ryo rifite umurambararo wa sentimetero eshanu, aho ryenda kungana n\u2019umupira wa Biallard.\nKuba iyi nyoni yihuta cyane iyo igendera ku maguru kurusha uko izindi nyamaswa zabikora. Umuvuduko wayo ushobora kugera kuri kilometero 64.3 ku isaha, nicyo abahanga mu by\u2019inyamaswa bavuga ko idakoresha ubu buryo bwo gushyira umutwe mu mucanga yihisha kuko ifite ubushobozi bwo guhunga ndetse igasiga icyaba kiyisagariye.\nIyi nyoni kubera igihagararo cyayo gishobora kugera kuri metero ebyiri ndetse ikagira n\u2019ibiro 150 biyiha umugeri uremereye ikoresha mu kwirinda, bityo ikaba idakeneye guhisha umutwe gusa.\nImyorokere.\nImpamvu Autruche ikunze kugaragara yashyize umutwe mu mucanga, abahanga mu by\u2019inyamaswa bavuga ko biterwa n\u2019uko iyi nyoni iyo igeze cyo gutera amagi no kuyararira icukura umwobo ushobora kugera kuri santimetero 91 z\u2019ubujyakuzimu kugira ngo iyarinde izindi nyamaswa zishobora kuyarya.\nIbi Autruche zikomeza kubikora kugeza igihe amagi yazo aturazwe, abahanga bakaba bavuga ko ari ho haturutse imyumvire y\u2019uko mu buryo bwo kwihisha zishyira umutwe mu mucanga.\nMu rwego rwo kurinda aya magi, Autruche y\u2019ingabo n\u2019iy\u2019ingore zisimburana mu kuyacunga rimwe na rimwe zikajya zinyuzamo zigashyira umutwe mu mucanga mu rwego rwo kuyahindura zikoreresheje umunwa wazo kugeza igihe zumvise ko ari mu cyerekezo zifuza."}
{"id": "16108", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16108", "title": "Inyoni ya Barge rousse", "text": "Inyoni ya Barge rousse ishobora kwiha umwanya wo kuruhuka ariko bitayisabye kugwa mu giti cyangwa ku butaka. Ibi ngo ikaba ibikora iruhura igice kimwe cy\u2019ubwonko bwayo kikamera nk\u2019igisinziriye mu gihe ikindi gice kiyifasha gukomeza gukubita amababa iguruka.\nUbushakashatsi.\nInyoni ikiri nto yo mu bwoko bwa \u201cBarge rousse\u201d yaciye agahigo ko kuguruka ibirometero 13 560 aho yakoze urwo rugendo ikarusoza idahagaze ngo igire icyo kurya cyangwa icyo kunywa ifata.\nIyi nyoni ifite imyaka ibiri yabashije kumara iminsi 11 n\u2019amajoro 11 hiyongereyeho isaha imwe, iguruka ku buryo byayibashishije guhagurukira muri Alasika ho muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika, ikagwa ku Kirwa cya Tasmanie kiri mu Majyepfo ya Australie."}
{"id": "16109", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16109", "title": "Ikiyaga cy'Ihema", "text": "Ikiyaga cy'Ihema ni ikiyaga cyo mu burasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Akarere ka Kayonza, mu majyepfo ya Pariki y'Akagera. Inkombe yacyo y'iburasirazuba ni umupaka w'u Rwanda na Tanzaniya.\nIkiyaga cy'Ihema ni cyo kiyaga kinini muri Pariki y'Akagera. Kibamo imvubu n'ingona. Abakerarugendo bagitemberamo mu bwato.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cy'Ihema kiri ku butumburuke bwa m 1 292. Gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 90. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo buri hagati ya m 5 na m 7. Buhinduka bitewe n'ahantu n'igihe cy'umwaka.\nIkiyaga gikikijwe n'ibishanga binini by'urufunzo. Umugezi wa Akagera ugaburira ibiyaga bigera kuri cumi na bibiri. Ikiyaga cy'Ihema ni kimwe muri byo. Amazi y'Ikiyaga cy'Ihema yisuka mu Mugezi wa Akagera.\nUbushyuhe bwo muri ako karere buri hagati ya dogere 21 na 26. Imvura igwa ku mwaka ni nka mm 1 100.\nIbinyabuzima.\nIkiyaga cy'Ihema kibamo imvubu nyinshi n'ingona. Intare n'ingwe ziza kunywa amazi ku nkombe zacyo.\nIbishanga bikikije ikiyaga ni ingenzi ku inyamaswa za pariki. Biziha amazi yo kunywa igihe cyose. Ni n'ahantu h'ingenzi h'inyoni zo mu mazi. Muri izo nyoni harimo shoebill (\"Balaeniceps rex\") na papyrus gonolek (\"Laniarius mufumbiri\").\nMu 1934, itegeko ryashyizeho pariki ryabujije uburobyi mu biyaga byayo. Nyuma, politiki nshya yo gucunga pariki yemeye uburobyi.\nUbukerarugendo.\nGutembera mu bwato ku Kiyaga cy'Ihema ni kimwe mu bikorwa by'ingenzi by'abasura Pariki y'Akagera. Abakerarugendo babona imvubu, ingona n'inyoni nyinshi zo mu mazi.\nIbibazo.\nIkibazo gikomeye cy'Ikiyaga cy'Ihema ni amarebe. Amarebe ni ikimera cyo mu mazi. Atwikira amazi y'ikiyaga. Agabanya umwuka wa ogisijeni uri mu mazi. Ibyo byangiza ibinyabuzima.\nIkiyaga gihujwe n'Umugezi wa Akagera binyuze mu bishanga. Kubera iyo mpamvu, amarebe ashobora gukwira no mu zindi nzuzi n'ibiyaga."}
{"id": "16110", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16110", "title": "Felicien Kabundi", "text": "F\u00e9licien Kabundi Tshiamalenga (yavutse Ku ya 15 Gicurasi 1980) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) i Kananga. Akina nka myugariro wi nyuma. Yahindutse igihangange cyo muri Sudani muri ikipe ya Al Hilal Omdurman.\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16111", "title": "Elias Kachunga", "text": "Elias Kachunga, (wavutse Ku ya 22 Mata 1992) i Haan mu Budage, Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri wa congo. Ni rutahizamu w'ikipe yo mubwongereza yitwa Bolton Wanderers.\nUmwuga.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2014-15, yatsinze ibitego bitandatu bya Bundesliga.\nKu ya 26 Kamena 2015, yinjiye muri FC Ingolstadt.\nKu ya 24 Kamena 2016, Elias Kachunga yatijwe mu gihembwe kimwe ahitamo kuguma mu ikipe y\u2019Ubwongereza ya Huddersfield Town, muri iyo Shampiyona yitwa championship. Imvune yo mu kaguru mu mukino yakinnye na Newcastle yarangije shampiyona ye ya 2017\u201318.\nNyuma yo gukina n'amakipe y'urubyiruko yo mu Budage, yubashye ihamagarwa rye rya mbere muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ku ya 26 Werurwe 2017 aje gukina umukino wa gicuti na Kenya.\nKu ya 2 Nzeri 2020, yinjiye muri Sheffield ku ya gatatu.\nKu ya 6 Kanama 2021, yinjiye muri Bolton Wanderers.\nUbuzima bwite.\nElias Kachunga yabyawe na nyina w\u2019umudage na se w\u2019umunyekongo, Innocent Kachunga, wavukiye mu mujyi wa Goma maze yerekeza mu Budage muri 1987."}
{"id": "16112", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16112", "title": "Herve Kage", "text": "Herv\u00e9 Kage, (Yavute ku ya 10 Mata 1989 i kinshasa) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru, ukomoka muri Congo, aka yarabigize umwuga, akina hagati mu kibuga, muri RE Virton.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nRSC Anderlecht (2006-2009).\nKage yasinye amasezerano ye yu mwuga muri gihembwe cyo muri 2006-2007 na RSC Anderlecht. Muri 2007, yatijwe muri RKC Waalwijk amezi 6, aho yakinnye imikino ine. Muri shampiyona yakurikiyeho, yongeye gutizwa na Anderlecht mu ikipe ya Royale Union Saint-Gilloise. Yakinnye imikino 14 kandi atsinda igitego cya mbere cyu mwuga we \nRoyal Charleroi SC (2009-2012).\nMu 2009, Herv\u00e9 Kage yimuriwe muri Royal Charleroi SC, aho atakinnye umukino n'umwe muri Anderlecht. Akina umukino we wambere hamwe n'ikipe ye nshya muri Kanama 2009, bakina na FC Brugge. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010, yakinnye imikino 23 atatsinze igitego na kimwe. Muri 2011, yatijwe i Betar Yeruzalemu, aho yakinnye imikino 6 gusa. Muri 2011-2012, yakinnye imikino 29 atsinda ibitego 5, amateka ye muri shampiyona imwe.\nKAA La Gantoise (2013-2014).\nMurijanvier 2013Mutarama 2013, asinyana amasezerano na La Gantoise, azayinjiramo muri shampiyona itaha. Nyuma y'iminsi icumi, nyuma yo gukurwa muri nucleus yikipe yambere, ubuyobozi bwa Charleroi bwemeye kuyimurira muri club ya Ghent ako kanya kubera indishyi zamafaranga.\nKRC Genk (kuva 2014).\nHerv\u00e9 Kag\u00e9 yinjiye muri Nyakanga 2014 kuri KRC Genk amasezerano y'imyaka 3 hamwe n'imyaka 2 yinyongera. Yahagurutse rero muri La Gantoise aho atigeze yinjira muri gahunda z'umutoza mushya, Hein Vanhaezebrouck.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nGuhamagarwa kwe kwa mbere mu ikipe ya Congo kwabaye Ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 2012 bakina na Burkina Faso. Muri Mutarama 2015, yatoranijwe gukina mu gikombe cya Afurika."}
{"id": "16113", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16113", "title": "Etepe Kakoko", "text": "Emmanuel Kakoko Etep\u00e9, (yavutse Ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 1950) avukira i L\u00e9opoldville, ni umupira wamaguru akaba umu Zayirwa wo mu myaka ya za 1970 na 1980.\nUbuzima.\nNka rutahizamu, Emmanuel Kakoko Etep\u00e9 yari umukinnyi ukina nkumunyamahanga ukomoka wu Zayirwa. Yatsinze muri AFCON muri 1974 kandi yitabira igikombe cyisi cya FIFA muri 1974, aho yakinnye atangira gukina na Scotland, na Yugosilaviya (ariko yasimbuwe mu gice cya kabiri) ntiyakina na Burezile. Zaire yaviriyemo mu cyiciro cya mbere.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Imana Kinshasa, atwara shampiyona ya Zayire inshuro ebyiri n'igikombe. Yasinye muri 1981 na VfB Stuttgart, akina umukino umwe gusa muri Bundesliga (na Werder Bremen, Ku ya 19 Ukuboza 1981 (2-2)), udatsinze igitego. Nyuma y imuriwe kuri 1. FC Saarbr\u00fccken, mu bihe bibiri, yatsindiye Oberliga Sud-Ouest (Ikidage D3) mu 1983. Yarangije umwuga we muri Borussia Neunkirchen.\nUmuhungu we, Yannick Kakoko, kuri ubu akina mu Budage, muri SpVgg Greuther F\u00fcrth."}
{"id": "16114", "revid": "12135", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16114", "title": "Gael Kakuta", "text": "Gael Kakuta,(yavutse Ku ya 21 Kamena 1991) yavukiye i Lille, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri wa congo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati utera muri Amiens SC.\nKakuta yatojwe muri RC Lens ariko atangira umwuga we muri Chelsea FC aho afatwa nk'impano mu gukora. Guharanira kwemeza, azi amakipe menshi, akenshi muburyo bwi nguzanyo, atabashije kwemeza ibyiringiro amuha.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nAmahugurwa kuri RC Lens.\nGa\u00ebl Kakuta yatangiye gukina umupira afite imyaka irindwi nyuma yo kubona nyirarume akinira ikipe yikiniraga i Lille. Yakinnye imikino ye ya mbere muri US Lille-Moulins maze atsindwa umukino we wa mbere cumi na barindwi kuri umwe. Muri 1999, yinjiye muri Racing Club de Lens hanyuma ikigo cya Li\u00e9vin kibanziriza imyitozo nyuma y'imyaka itanu. Yahamaze imyaka ibiri, imyitozo mu cyumweru kandi akina imikino ye muri wikendi. Yatojwe cyane na Joachim Marx, wahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Polonye.\nInzira mu Bwongereza.\nMuri Nyakanga 2007, yinjiye mu Bwongereza no mu ikipe ya Chelsea, yemeza ko afite impano n'umukoresha w'iyi kipe Guy Hillion. Yinjiye mu izamu, yahise aba umwe mu bakinnyi bakomeye mu ikipe ye maze agirwa umukinnyi witwaye neza mu mwaka wa shampiyona irangiye, amaze gutsinda ibitego cumi na bibiri mu mikino makumyabiri nine. Igihe cyakurikiyeho, yakomeje imyitozo mu ikipe imwe hanyuma asinya amasezerano yumwuga muri 2009.\nKu ya 17 Mutarama 2009, Luiz Felipe Scolari amuhamagara mu banyamwuga, kumukino wa shampiyona na Stoke City. Mu ntangiriro za Gashyantare 2009, uyu mu kinnyi yaravunitse cyane ukuguru mu myitozo, bityo biba ngombwa ko ataboneka mu gihe cy'amezi umunani gusa yakurikiyeho. Ku ya 3 Nzeri 2009, Kakuta yahagaritswe mu marushanwa yose mu gihe cy\u2019amezi ane nyuma ya makimbirane hagati y\u2019ikipe ye yitoreza, Lens, na Chelsea. Amaherezo, ihagarikwa ryavanyweho, Chelsea irabyemera \"kugurisha hafi miliyoni eshatu z'amayero kuri Lens. Ku ya 21 Ugushyingo, Carlo Ancelotti yatangiye umwuga we wa mbere amuzana mu kibuga cya Wolverhampton ku munota wa mirongo itanu n'umunani. Igihembwe kirangiye, uku gukina kumwemerera kubona izina rya shampyona mu Ubwongereza. Ku ya 8 Ukuboza 2009, Ga\u00ebl Kakuta yinjiye mu mateka y'iyi kipe, abaye umukinnyi muto washyizweho muri Champions League, ahanganye n'ikipe ya APOEL Nicosia. Yari afite imyaka cumi n'umunani, amezi atanu n'iminsi cumi n'irindwi.\nKu ya 26 Mutarama 2011, kubera kubura umwanya wo gukina, yagurijwe muri Fulham kugeza shampiyona irangiye, nta buryo bwo kugura. Agarutse i Londres, umutoza we mushya Andr\u00e9 Villas-Boas ntabwo yamwizeye kandi yagurijwe na Bolton Ku ya 31 Kanama 2011 Kuri1Ku ya 1 Mutarama 2012."}
{"id": "16115", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16115", "title": "Otepa Kalambay", "text": "Paul-Mohamed Kalambay Otepa (yavutse Ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 1948 apfa ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 2024) muri Kongo Mbiligi ubu ni muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa congo (DRC), wakinnye nkumuzamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye umukino umwe, atatsinze igitego, muri 1974.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu isi yateguwe mu Budage, nta mukino numwe akina."}
{"id": "16116", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16116", "title": "Pascal Kalemba", "text": "Pascal Kalemba (yavutse Ku ya 26 Gashyantare 1979 i Kinshasa apfa Ku ya 27 Ugushyingo 2012) mu mujyi yavukiyemo, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru, akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC). Akina nk'umuzamu.\nUbuzima.\nYagiye mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 2002 asimbuye no mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo nk'intangiriro aho yagaragaye nk'umuzamu mwiza ariko kubera imyitwarire ye. Nyuma yo kugenda kwa Claude Le Roy ku buyobozi bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ntazongera gutorwa mu ikipe y'igihugu kubera kutitwara neza.\nPascal Kalemba Lukoki yapfuye Ku ya 27 Ugushyingo 2012 i Kinshasa, afite imyaka 33."}
{"id": "16117", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16117", "title": "Dieudonne Kalulika", "text": "Dieudonn\u00e9 Kalulika, (wavukiye Kinshasa Ku ya 10 Mutarama 1981), ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa congo, ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati utera. Yakiniye ikipe ya CD Primeiro de Agosto yo muri Angola kuva muri Mutarama 2013, nyuma yo kumara igihe kinini mu buzima bwe mu Bubiligi.\nyakinnye inshuro 12 n'ibitego 4 yatsindiye mu ikipe y'igihugu ya congo, yakinnye mu gikombe cy'Afurika muri 2004.\nUmwuga.\nIntambwe yambere muri congo.\nDieudonn\u00e9 Kalulika yatangiye umupira w'amaguru muri 1997 muri AS Ma\u00efka, mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Kongo. Yakiniyeyo ibihe bibiri, yibeshya ko yatsinze ibitego, nyuma aragenda agerageza amahirwe ye mu mahanga muri 1999. Yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Burundi ya Atl\u00e9tico OFC, nubwo yatsinze ibitego byinshi, yahuye n\u2019ivanguramoko na bagenzi be, bituma ava muri iyo kipe asubira mu gihugu cye kavukire nyuma ya shampiyona. Nyuma yinjiye muri US Safari, no mu cyiciro cya kabiri, ubwo yatangiraga kwiga amategeko. Muri 2001, yinjijwe muri Tout Puissant Mazembe, ikipe nini ya Lubumbashi, ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere. Muri shampiyona ye ya mbere muri iyi kipe, yatsindiye igikombe cyigihugu. Imyitwarire ye myiza ya makipe yafunguye amarembo ikipe y'igihugu muri 2004, aho yakinnye muri CAN muri 2004, aho igihugu cye cyasezerewe mu cyiciro cya mbere.\nKugera mu Bubiligi.\nDieudonn\u00e9 Kalulika yahise agaragara n\u2019uwahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wu bubiligi, Luc Nilis, wamusinyishije na Beringen Heusden-Zolder, ikipe ikina mu cyiciro cya 2 aho yari umuyobozi wa tekiniki. Yakinnye umukino wa mbere ku ya 31 Kanama 2005 hanze ya Oud-Heverlee Louvain maze yishimira itangira rya mbere afite igitego cya mbere nyuma yiminsi itatu ahanganye na Red Star Waasland. Ni umukinnyi usanzwe mu ikipe kandi yatsinze ibitego bitandatu bya shampiyona. Kubwamahirwe, iyi kipe ifite ibibazo bikomeye bya mafaranga kandi ihatirwa gusaba guhomba muri Werurwe 2006. Uyu mukinnyi yaje kurangiza shampiyona muri KVSK United, bakinana mu cyiciro cya nyuma cyi cyiciro cya 2. Yatsinze ibitego bitanu mu mikino itandatu, nyamara byagaragaye ko bidahagije kwinjira mu ntore."}
{"id": "16118", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16118", "title": "Dioko Kaluyituka", "text": "Alain Dioko Kaluyituka, (yavutse Ku ya 2 Mutarama 1987), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa Kino-congo wakinnye nkimbere-imbere.\nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYatojwe muri Vita Club i Kinshasa, yagize ibihe byiza bya kabiri hamwe na dolphine y'umukara, wa mugurishije kuri TP Mazembe. Yigaragaza vuba muri iyi ikipe, hamwe no kwihuta gukubita no gutondeka neza. Ni intwari ya CAF Champions League muri 2009, na CAF Champions League 2010 yatsinzwe n'ikipe ye. Ariko mugihe cy'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA muri 2010, aho Amavubi yageze bidasanzwe kumukino wanyuma na Inter Milan (gutsindwa 0-3). Muri iri rushanwa, Kaluyituka yagize ubwoba bwo kurinda Amerika yepfo amakipe yo muri Mexico yo muri Pachuca na Sport yo muri Berezile Internacional. Yatowe nk'umukinnyi wa kabiri witwaye neza muri iri rushanwa nyuma ya Andr\u00e9s D'Alessandro.\nYasinyanye na Al Ahli SC muri katari muri 2011, ahita yigaragaza nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri iyi kipe akaba n'umwe mu batsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona (nubwo yahageze muri shampiyona). Ariko, ntashobora kubuza gusezererwa kw'ikipe ye shampiyona irangiye. Yagurijwe rero muri ikipe, ya Al Kharitiyath, kugirango agume muri cyiciro\u00a0cya mbere. Asanga ikipe ya Al Ahli nyuma yo kuzamuka kwe byihuse mu ntore za katari.\nYasoje shampiyona yo muri 2013-2014 nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona ya katari n'ibitego 22, imbere y'abakinnyi nka Saez, Dagano, Youssef Msakni, Adriano, na Nene.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2014-2015, nubwo hari ba rutahizamu benshi nka Hamdi Harbaoui, Issam Jem\u00e2a, Imoh Ezekiyeli, Romarinho, Sebasti\u00e1n Quintana, Paulinho, cyangwa Younis Mahmoud, yarangije gutsinda ibitego byinshi ku nshuro ya kabiri yikurikiranya, atsinda ibitego 25. Yatowe kandi umukinnyi mwiza wa shampiyona.\nMuri 2015, yavuye mu ikipe ya Al Ahli SC yinjira mu ikipe ya Al-Gharafa. Muri 2016, yagurijwe umwaka umwe muri Lekhwiya SC, imwe mu makipe meza muri katari."}
{"id": "16119", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16119", "title": "Pedro Kamata", "text": "Pedro Kamata (yavutse Ku ya 6 Nzeri 1981) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukomoko muri Congo, ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo i Luanda (Angola). Yakinaga nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nYatojwe muri AJ Auxerre (1993-2001).\nyaje mu mupira w'amaguru hamwe n'amakipe ya Auvergne ya Neuvy na Moulins (Allier). Muri 1994, yinjiye mu kigo cy'amahugurwa cya Association de la jeunesse auxerroise.\nFC Groningen (2002-2003).\nMuri 2002 yagiye mu Buholandi muri FC Groningen.\nTugarutse muri Auvergne no mu karere ka Berry (2003-2005).\nMuri 2003, yinjiye muri Clermont Foot 63. Yakinnye imikino 18 ya shampiyona 2 atsinda ibitego bibiri.\nIgihe cyakurikiyeho, yagiye muri La Berrichonne de Ch\u00e2teauroux, akiri muri L2. Yakinnye imikino 14 atsinda ibitego bibiri yatsinze maze ikipe ye ibasha kugera ku mukino w'anyuma wa mu gikombe cy'ubufaransa, na Paris Saint-Germain itsinzwe (1-0).\nMu 2004, yagarutse muri Clermont Foot 63. Yakinnye imikino 10 atsinda igitego, mbere yo gusubira muri La Berrichonne de Ch\u00e2teauroux muri shampiyona yo muri 2004-2005, iyi kipe yaje ku mwanya wa gatanu muri shampiyona ya shampiyona 2.\nIcyerekezo Ubutaliyani (2005-2011).\nMu mpeshyi ya 2005, Pedro Kamata yageze mu Butaliyani gukina mu ikipe ya AC Legnano, akina muri Serie C2. Yakinnye imikino 82 atsinda ibitego 5. umwaka wa 2 bivamo kuzamuka muri Serie C1 hamwe ni cyubahiro cya shampiyona yo muri Serie C2 muri 2007. Ku ya 22 Mutarama 2008, yasinye amasezerano na AS Bari (Serie B) kugeza mu mwaka wo muri 2011 shampiyona irangiye, iyi kipe yazamuwe muri Serie A, yakinnye imikino 60 atsinda igitego 1.\nKamata yarahamaga we mu Ukuboza 2005 n'umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Angola. Ariko, amaherezo yahisemo gukina n'igihugu cya se,cya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nAS Yzeure (2011-2012).\nKu ya 27 Nzeri 2011, yagarutse muri Allier aho asinyana amasezerano na AS Yzeure ukinira mu itsinda B rya CFA. Yakinnye imikino 23 atsinda ibitego 3."}
{"id": "16120", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16120", "title": "Wilson Kamavuaka", "text": "Wilson Kamavuaka, (yavutse Ku ya 29 Werurwe 1990) i D\u00fcren mu Budage, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga mumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati urinda.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nWilson yavukiye mu Budage, i D\u00fcren mu majyaruguru ya Rhine-Westphalie, yatangiye umupira w'amaguru mu ikipe ya Sportfreunde D\u00fcren kuva muri 1999 kugeza 2007, ubwo yinjiraga mu makipe y'urubyiruko ya Alemannia Aachen. Muri 2009, yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri nitsinda ryabigenewe rya TSG 1899 Hoffenheim.\nNyuma yi bihe bibiri, amasezerano ye ntabwo yongerewe kandi Wilson akorana na reji ya 1. FC Nuremberg, ariko yahise yinjira mu ikipe y'ambere. Ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2011, yatangiye umwuga we muminota irindwi ishize yakinnye na FSV Mainz 05 (3-3).\nYabonye umupinnyi ngenderwaho bwa mbere muri Bundesliga ku ya 10\u00a0umunsi i Munich na Bayern, ariko ikipe ye yatsinzwe cyane (0-4), Wilson akina umukino wose. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yagurijwe mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'Ubudage muri SSV Jahn Regensburg.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNubwo Wilson yari umunyamwuga kandi ukina nk'umukunzi wi kibuga cya Hoffenheim, Wilson yatangiye gukinira ikipe yi gihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo Ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2010 i Innsbruck muri Otirishiya, mu mukino wa gicuti na Arabiya Sawudite (0-2)."}
{"id": "16121", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16121", "title": "Albert Kanta Kambala", "text": "Albert Kanta Kambala, Ni umukinnyi ukina numupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa Zayire, wakinnye nkumukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\numwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i \u00c9lisabethville, Kambala yatangiye umwuga we muri TP Mazembe. Nyuma yi mukiye mu Bugereki hamwe na Alpha Ethniki afite imyaka 23, asinyana na Rodos FC mu bihembwe bibiri. Yarangije umwuga we wo gukina mu Bubiligi ahabwa uruhushya rwa UEFA Pro ku ishuri rya Heysel.\nUmwuga wo gutoza.\nAyobora amakipe menshi yumupira w'amaguru muri DR Congo, harimo DCMP, AS Vita Club, AS Dragons, SC Cilu, AS Kabasha, OC Bukavu Dawa na FC Makila Mabe.\nAbapfuye.\nKanta Kambala yapfiriye mu bitaro i Kikwit afite imyaka 50\u00a0."}
{"id": "16122", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16122", "title": "Jean-Paul Kamudimba", "text": "Jean-Paul Kamudimba, (yavutse amakuru kuri Gashyantare 1982) i Lubumbashi, n'umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri wa congo.\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nKuri ubu atuye hagati y'Ubwongereza n'Ubufaransa, aho umuryango we uba."}
{"id": "16123", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16123", "title": "Deo Kanda", "text": "D\u00e9o Gracia Kanda Mukoko (yavutse Ku ya 11 Kanama 1989) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Congo (DRC) i Matad.\nAkina nku wo hagati ibumoso muri sukari ya Mtibwa\nUbuzima.\nUmukinnyi wihuta cyane kandi ni umu tekinike nubwo afite metero 1,71, nu mwe mu byiringiro bikomeye bya congo byigihe cye.\nDaring Club Motema Pembe.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Daring Club Motema Pembe mbere yo kwinjira muri TP Mazembe.\nTP Mazembe.\nKu ya 13 Ugushyingo 2010, yatsinze igitego cyo kunganya na Esipagne Esp\u00e9rance de Tunis yo muri Tuniziya mu kugaruka kwa nyuma kwa CAF Champions League (amanota ya nyuma 1-1).\nYitabira ikipe ya batarengeje imyaka 23 mu majonjora ya CAF mu marushanwa y'umupira w'amaguru yaberaga i Londres ndetse no mu majonjora yo gukina imikino ya Afurika muri 2011.\nRaja Casablanca.\nMuri 2013, yavuye muri Tout Puissant Mazembe yerekeza muri Raja Casablanca.\nI Raja Casablanca, yitabiriye igikombe cyisi cya FIFA muri 2013.\nAS Vita ikipe.\nMuri 2014, yasinyanye muri AS Vita Club.\nSubira kuri TP Mazembe.\nMuri 2015 yagarutse muri Tout Puissant Mazembe.Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere na FC Saint Eloi Lupopo.\nIbihembo.\nMuri ikipe.\nTP Mazembe\nRaja wa Casablanca\nAS Vita Club"}
{"id": "16125", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16125", "title": "Tr\u00e9sor Kandol", "text": "Ubutunzi Osmar Kandol, (yavutse Ku ya 30 Kanama 1981) i Banga, ni umukinnyi w'umupira ukomoka muri wa congo uzwi cyane kumwanya we muri Leeds United."}
{"id": "16126", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16126", "title": "Thierry Kasereka", "text": "Thierry Kasereka ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUmwuga.\nKasereka yavukiye i Goma mu ntara ya Kivu y'Amajyaruguru kandi amarana igihe n'ababyeyi be i Cri\u0219cior, Hunedoara, muri Rumaniya, muri Transylvania, mbere yo gusubira muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 2003.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\nKasereka yatangiye umwuga we mu kigo cyigisha umupira w'amaguru i Kinshasa, Yaje kwimukira muri DC Virunga mu mpeshyi yo muri 2005 mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe y'urubyiruko ya AS Vita Club muri 2007. mu mpeshyi ya 2010, Kasereka yasinyanye n'ikipe nkuru AS Vita Club Kinshasa, muri Ligue 1. Muri shampiyona ye yambere yambere (2010), yahise atwara shampiyona yi gihugu.\nIkipe y'igihugu.\nKasereka yari mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo yatoranijwe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2014 kizabera muri Afurika yepfo, mbere yo kuvanwa mu ikipe nyuma yuko umutoza w\u2019i gihugu Claude Le Roy mbere gato yuko irushanwa ritangira. Kasereka yakinnye imikino itandatu kugeza uryo yashyirwaho bwa mbere muri 2011. Yabanje gukina muri DR Congo ya batarengeje imyaka 23 mu gushaka itike yo kuzitabira imikino ya Olempike izabera i Londres muri 2012 Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa akomeye ya Toulon muri 2013.\nIgikombe.\nAS Vita club"}
{"id": "16127", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16127", "title": "Belux Bukasa Kasongo", "text": "Belux Bukasa Kasongo (yavutse Ku ya 13 Kanama 1979), muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo yahoze akina umupira w'amaguru nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. Nyuma yu mwuga we wo gukina yatangiye umwuga wo gutoza.\nAfite uruhushya rwa CAF D ni umutoza wikipe ya AmaZulu FC munsi yabafite imyaka 19.\nIbihembo.\nHamwe na BEC Tero Sasana FC"}
{"id": "16128", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16128", "title": "Kabwe Kasongo", "text": "Kabwe Kasongo (yavutse Ku ya 31 Nyakanga 1970) Ni umukinnyi ukina wumupira wamaguru ukomoka muri (DRC) i Kinshasa. Yakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nKabwe Kasongo yitabiriye Igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 1992, Igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 1994, Igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 1996 ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 2000 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMuri ikipe, akina cyane ashyigikiye Vitoriya Guimar\u00e3es na Deportivo Chaves. Yakinnye imikino 39 yose mu cyiciro 1 cya Porutugali naho imikino 211 muri 2&amp;nbsp;Igabana ry'igiportigale.\nKu ya 19 Gashyantare 2020, yabaye umutoza wa Sabroso Sport Clube, ikipe yo mu karere ka Vila Real."}
{"id": "16129", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16129", "title": "Pierre Mwana Kasongo", "text": "Pierre Mwana Kasongo nanone yitwa Muana) yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga wavutse Ku ya 10 Ukwakira 1938 kandi yapfuye Ku ya 13 Mutarama 1986. Yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu Les L\u00e9opards, atoza andi n'amakipe yaho kandi akinira amakipe abiri yo mu Bubiligi. Yari azwi cyane kubera ubuhanga, impano n'imiterere. Yari umwe mu bakinnyi bake b'Abanyekongo batoranijwe gukina umupira w'amaguru mu Burayi muri 1963. Yagumye i Ghent, umujyi w\u2019icyambu na komine mu karere ka Flemande mu Bubiligi. Igihe y'amaze mu Bubiligi, yakiniye amakipe ya Gantoise (1965-1967) na Vervi\u00e9tois (1961-1965).\nUrubyiruko n'umwuga.\nPierre Mwana Kasongo yari umupira w'amaguru w'umuhanga kandi ufite ubuhanga bwo gukina umupira w'amaguru aho yagaragaye mu bwana bwe. Nyina yavuze ko yanze gukina n'ibindi bikinisho kandi yishimira gukina n'umupira we w'amaguru. Amaze gukura, yari azwi cyane kubera kuba umuntu ufite uburakari buke kandi yari azwiho kurwana iyo arakaye cyane, ariko ibyo ntibyigeze bimubuza umwuga we w'umupira w'amaguru. Imico nk'iyi yamuhesheje amazina yamwiziritseho kugeza apfuye nka \"Bomber\u00bb,\u00abVolvo\u00bbn'abandi menshi nka\u00abMwadia Nvita\u00bb. Igihe kimwe, Kasongo yarwanye na Bakekole Lumumba hanze y'urubyiniro. Muri 1960, Kasongo yakiniye FC St. Eloi muri Elisabethville, ubu yitwa Lubumbashi, kugeza muri 1961. Mbere yo kwimukira mu Bubiligi, we n'umugore we babyaranye abana batatu kandi babiri muri bo bimukana na we n'umugore we mu Bubiligi. Mu gihe ya maze mu Bubiligi ni bwo we n'umugore we babyaranye umwana wabo wa kane n'uwa gatanu. Nku musore ufite impano; yatorewe gukinira i Burayi yimurirwa mu Bubiligi muri 1961 mu rwego rwo gushimangira amakipe y'Ububiligi. Hamwe na Patrice Kimoni na Stanislas Kalamba, Kasongo yashoboye kwinjiza muri RCS Verviers, izwi kandi nka CS Vervietois. Yakiniye RCS Verviers kuva 1965 kugeza 1966 hanyuma bidatinze yinjira muri ARA Gent, uzwi nka KAA Gent muri Nyakanga 1967, asigaye kugeza 1968. Mu 1968, Igikombe cya Afurika cyabereye muri Etiyopiya naho Congo ikina na Gana ku mukino wa nyuma kuri Stade Addis Ababa ku ngoma ya Haile Selassie. Leon Mungamuni yatsinze iminota icumi m]ugihe cyinyongera m'ugihe Congo-Kinshasa yatsinze ibitego 3-2 kugirango igere kumukino wanyuma ihure na Gana. Pierre Kalala Mukendi yatsinze igitego cy'umukino mu gice cya kabiri cyafashijwe n'umupaka winyuma wa Kasongo. Kubera iyi ntsinzi yatsinze Gana niho Ingwe yegukanye igikombe cya mbere cya AFCON. Baba shampiyo basubiye mu gihugu cyabo, bakiriwe na Mobutu na ba minisitiri be, barimo Etienne Tshisekedi wahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa Kongo. Bakiriwe neza kandi batumirwa gufata amafoto yemewe na Mobutu. Bose bari bambaye imyenda imwe kandi bose bari bambaye ingofero y\u2019ingwe ya Mobutu. Nyuma yo gutsinda CAN 1968, Perezida Mobutu Sese Seko yatumiye ikipe ya Pel\u00e9 na Burezile FC Santos mu mikino ya gicuti i Zayire. Mwana Kasongo yari umwe mu bakinnyi bari mu ikipe ya Kongo yakinnye n'umukinnyi uzwi cyane wo muri Burezile ndetse n'ikipe ye yose."}
{"id": "16130", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16130", "title": "John Kasusula", "text": "Jean Kasusula Kilitsho, (yavutse Ku ya 5 Kanama 1982) i Kisangani, ni umukinnyi wumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC). Akina nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nJean Kasusula yatangiye umwuga we muri Kisangani ikipe yaho ya AS Makiso muri 2002. Nyuma yinjiye muri Kabasha Goma FC.\nMu 2003, yinjiye muri Tout Puissant Mazembe, imwe mu makipe akomeye mu gihugu.\nMuri 2009, mugihe cy'igikombe cyisi cyatsinze igitego yatsinze Auckland City FC.\nImikino yo gukina.\nKasusula azwiho umusaraba mwiza no gutera imigeri kubusa."}
{"id": "16131", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16131", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Bosumtwi", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Bosumtwi n icyo kiyaga cyonyine kiba muri Gana. Giherereye mu mwobo wa kera muri kilometero Ni 30 mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba bwa Kumasi, umurwa wa Ashanti, kandi ni ahantu hakunze gukorerwa imyidagaduro. Hari imidugudu igera kuri 30 hafi y'ikiyaga cya Bosumtwi,iyo midugudu ituwe n\u2019abaturage bagera ku bihumbi 70. umudugudu wamamaye cyane aho ba mukerarugendo bakunze gutura ni Abono. \nAshanti ifata Bosumtwi nk' ikiyaga cyera. Dukurikije imyizerere gakondo, roho z'abapfuye ziza aho ku kiyaga gusezera ku mana Asase Ya. Kubera iyo mpamvu, bifatwa nk'ibyemewe kuroba mu kiyaga gusa hakoreshejwe mbaho. Mu bwoko bw'amafi yo mu kiyaga harimo \"Hemichromis frempongi\", hamwe na \"Tilapia busumana\" na \"T. discolor\". \nAmateka y'ikirere.\nMbere y\u2019ingaruka za asteroide, ako gace kari ishyamba rikunda kugwamo imvura cyane ryuzuye inyamanswa. Nyuma y'ingaruka, icyobo cyavuyemo cyuzuye amazi agize ikiyaga cya Bosumtwi. \nIbihe by'imvura nyinshi byuzuje cya cyobo amazi, bituma urwego rwikiyaga ruzamuka hejuru y'ibice byo hasi. Ibihe nkibi bigaragazwa n\u2019ibisigazwa by\u2019amafi biboneka ku misozi. Amazi ni yo yatemba ava mu kibaya anyuze mu muyoboro wuzuye., ariko hari igihe usanga amazi ari make ku buryo ishyamba ryinjira mu kibaya bigatuma ikiyaga kiba gito gusa. "}
{"id": "16132", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16132", "title": "Edo Kayembe", "text": "Edo Kayembe, (yavutse Ku ya 3 Kamena 1998) i Kananga muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati urinda Watford FC.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nEdo Kayembe ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yatangiye umupira w'amaguru mu mujyi yavukiyemo (kananga) mbere yo guhaguruka yerekeza i Kinshasa aho yatangiriye umwuga we w'umwuga n'ikipe ya Sharks XI FC. Yageze mu Bubiligi yinjira muri RSC Anderlecht muri 2017 imyaka ine n'igice. Ku ya 22 Ukuboza 2017, yakinnye umukino we wa mbere wa bigize umwuga na Anderlecht, mu mukino wa Jupiler Pro League na KAS Eupen. Uwo munsi yaje gukina mu mwanya wa Adrien Trebel, maze ikipe ye itsindira igitego cyatsinzwe nil.\nMu mpera z'umwaka wo muri 2018, yakinnye imikino ibiri mu rwego rw'amatsinda yo mu gikombe cya Europa League, ubwo yakiraga Spartak Trnava, hanyuma ku cyatsi cya Dinamo Zagreb.\nKu ya 14 Nzeri 2020, Kayembe yemeye imyaka itatu n'indi kipe yo muri Bubiligi, KAS Eupen.\nKu ya 7 Mutarama 2022, Kayembe yinjiye muri Watford FC, aho yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ine nigice.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nKu ya 10 Ukwakira 2019, Edo Kayembe yishimiye itorwa rye rya mbere hamwe n'ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, mu mukino wa gicuti na Alijeriya. Yaje gukina mumikino uwo munsi maze amakipe yombi anganya (1-1)."}
{"id": "16133", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16133", "title": "Mwamba Kazadi", "text": "Mwamba Kazadi (Yavutse Ku ya 6 Werurwe 1947 - 1996). ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo Yakinnye nk'umuzamu, cyane muri Tout Puissant Mazembe.\nUbuzima.\nYavutse Ku ya 6 Werurwe 1947, Kongo Mbiligi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMwamba Kazadi yitabiriye igikombe cy'isi muri 1974 hamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire."}
{"id": "16134", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16134", "title": "Francis Kazadi", "text": "Francis Kazadi (yavutse Ku ya 20 Nyakanga 1992) i Kinshasa, ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nka rutahizamu wa Tala'ea El Geish, ku ntizanyo yatanzwe na Al-Masry Club."}
{"id": "16135", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16135", "title": "Neeskens Kebano", "text": "Neeskens Kebano, (yavutse Ku ya 10 Werurwe 1992) muri Montereau-Fault-Yonne (muri Seine-et-Marne), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati utera Fulham.\nYatoranijwe mu ikipe y'Ubufaransa kuva ku batarengeje imyaka 17 kugeza ku myaka 20, yahisemo muri 2014 gukinira ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo yitabiriye igikombe cya Afurika muri 2015.\nUrubyiruko.\nNeeskens Kebano yatangiye umupira w'amaguru afite imyaka 6 muri ikipe ya Montereau-Fault-Yonne. Se yamuhaye izina rye rya mbere yerekeza kuri Johan Neeskens, umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru mu Buholandi wo mu myaka ya za 70. Yamenyekanye na Paris Saint-Germain mu gihe cyo gushakisha kwinjira muri INF Clairefontaine. Nyuma y'amezi make yi bigeragezo, y'asinyiye kandi yinjira mu ikipe ya PSG y'imyaka 13 muri 2005.\nParis Saint Germain.\nYatojwe muri PSG, yazamutse mu ntera yinjira mu ikipe yabigenewe, muri CFA, muri 2010. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere n'ikipe ya mbere ya PSG Ku ya 2 Gashyantare 2011, ku myaka 18, na FC Martigues muri gikombe cya bafaransa. ya 2 Werurwe, yatsinze igitego cya mbere cyumwuga muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza amarushanwa. Ufite CFA kandi yitabiriye imikino irindwi muri shampiyona yo muri 2010-2011, yasinyanye amasezerano yambere yu mwuga, m'ugihe cy'imyaka 3, hamwe na Paris SG.\nMu ntangiriro za shampiyona yo muri 2012\u201313, yongereye amasezerano na PSG indi myaka ibiri, mbere yo kujya mu ntizanyo kuri Stade Malherbe de Caen, muri Ligue 2 kugirango abone umwanya wo gukina. Abamugaye kubera imvune yo mu ivi byatumye ataba mu kibuga amezi 3, yitabira imikino 12 ya shampiyona."}
{"id": "16136", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16136", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Logipi", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Logipi ni ikiyaga cy'amazi y'umunyu cyo mu majyaruguru ya Kenya. Kiri mu majyaruguru y'ikibaya cya Suguta. Gitandukanyijwe n'Ikiyaga cya Turkana n'urukurikirane rw'ibirunga bito.\nIkiyaga cya Logipi ntikigira ubujyakuzimu bunini. Amazi yacyo agaburira inyoni nyinshi za flamingo.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Logipi gifite ubujyakuzimu bwa m 3 kugeza kuri m 5. Gifite uburebure bwa km 6 n'ubugari bwa km 3. Amazi yacyo arimo umunyu mwinshi wa \"sodium bicarbonate\". Igipimo cy'ubusharire bwayo (pH) kiri hagati ya 9,5 na 10,5. Umunyu wayo uri hagati ya g 20 na g 50 kuri litiro.\nMu 2020, imvura nyinshi yatumye Ikiyaga cya Turkana cyuzura. Amazi yacyo yarengeye Ikiyaga cya Logipi.\nIbinyabuzima.\nInyoni za flamingo zikunze kuba ku Kiyaga cya Logipi. Zirya udukoko two mu mazi twitwa \"Arthrospira\" (Spirulina) n'ibindi binyabuzima bito byo mu mazi."}
{"id": "16137", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16137", "title": "Jeans Kembo uba Kembo", "text": "Jean Kembo uba Kembo (Yavutse Ku ya 27 Ukuboza 1947 i Leopoldville, Ku ya 26 Werurwe 2007) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wo muri Zayire. \nUbuzima.\nYahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga, yitabiriye kwimikwa ku mugabane w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Zayire, mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 1968 muri Etiyopiya, na 1974 muri Egiputa.\nYiswe \"Bwana Goal\", yafashije cyane Zayire, umukino urangiye, abaye umukinnyi wa mbere wo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara kugira ngo abashe kujya mu cyiciro cya nyuma cy\u2019igikombe cyisi cya FIFA, atsinda ibitego bibiri kuri Maroke Ukuboza 1973.\nNi se wa Jir\u00e8s Kembo Ekoko, nawe ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga."}
{"id": "16138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16138", "title": "Julien Kialunda", "text": "Julien Kialunda, (yavutse Ku ya 24 Mata 1940 i Matadi muri Kongo, apfa Ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1987 i Antwerp) mu Bubiligi, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa congo, wakinnye nka myugariro wo hagati. Yakiniye amakipe atatu yo mu Bubiligi hagati ya 1960 na 1980, ntabwo byari bisanzwe ku mukinnyi nya furika icyo gihe. Nyuma yumwuga we, yabaye umutoza wa Zayire amezi make. Yapfuye azize SIDA Ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1987.\nHano haribiganiro kumazina ye, bamwe babyandika \"Kialunda\", abandi \"Kaliunda\". Nkuko umukinnyi ubwe atazi neza uko izina rye ryanditswe, imyandikire ikunze kugaragara, \"Kialunda\", ifatwa nku kuri.\nUmwuga.\nGuhera mu Bumwe.\nJulien Kialunda yavutse Ku ya 24 Mata 1940 i Matadi, muri kiriya gihe haracyari Kongo y'Ububiligi, apfa ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1987 i Antwerp mu Bubiligi. Yatangiriye umupira i \"Daring L\u00e9opoldville\", umurwa mukuru w\u2019abakoloni b\u2019Ababiligi, nyuma uza kuba Kinshasa. Mu 1960, yasimbukiye i Burayi, ariko icyo gihe kikaba cyari gake cyane. Yatangiriye muri Union Saint-Gilloise, ikipe yaturutse i Buruseli, nyuma ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere. Nyuma y'imyaka itatu, iyi kipe isubiye mu cyiciro cya kabiri. Yatsindiye igikombe maze asubira mu ndege ya mbere muri shampiyona ya mbere, ariko kugaruka ntibyatinze, aho \"Abanyamurwango\" barangije ku mwanya wa kabiri kugeza ku mwanya wa nyuma, bisobanura kimwe no kumanuka."}
{"id": "16139", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16139", "title": "Joel Kiassumbua", "text": "Jo\u00ebl Kiassumbua, (yavutse Ku ya 6 Mata 1992)muri Lucerne, ni umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga wa congo. Akina nk'umuzamu.\nUbuzima.\nYavutse Ku ya 6 Mata 1992 i Lucerne ukomoka kuri se wa congo na nyina wo mu Busuwisi, yahisemo guhitamo Abanyekongo muri 2015 agamije kwambara umwenda \"w'ingwe\". Yanze rero ubwenegihugu bw'Ubusuwisi, kubera ko nk'uko ingingo ya 10 y'itegeko nshinga rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ibivuga, \u201cUbwenegihugu bwa Kongo ni bumwe kandi bwihariye. Ntishobora gufatwa icyarimwe n'izindi.\nMuri Werurwe 2015, yakiriye rero guhamagarwa kwe bwa mbere gukina na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, igihugu cya se."}
{"id": "16140", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16140", "title": "Mafu Kibonge", "text": "Mafu Kibonge (yavutse ku ya 12 Gashyantare 1945) noneho muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nkumukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe na Congo-Kinshasa icyo gihe ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 10 (nta gitego cyatsinzwe) hagati muri 1970 na 1974.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage, yakinnye imikino ibiri: kurwanya Sikotilande na Burezile.\nYitabiriye kandi ibikombe bya Afurika byo muri 1968 na 1974. Yatsinze amarushanwa yombi."}
{"id": "16141", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16141", "title": "Mialo Mwape", "text": "Mialo Mwap\u00e9 Mialo (yavutse Ku ya 30 Ukuboza 1951 noneho muri Kongo Mbiligi none muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga wumupira wamaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 2, atatsinze igitego, hagati yo muri 1974 na 1976.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu isi yateguwe mu Budage, nta mukino akina."}
{"id": "16142", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16142", "title": "Muscal Mvuezolo", "text": "Muscal Mvuezolo-Musumbu (yavutse Ku ya 30 Werurwe 1979 i Kinshasa) ni umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nMuskarl Mvuezolo akina mu Bubiligi, Turukiya, Ubugereki na Romaniya.\nYatsindiye bwa mbere mpuzamahanga mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mukino yakinnye na Gaboni Ku ya 25 Werurwe 2008."}
{"id": "16143", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16143", "title": "Chadrack Muzungu", "text": "Chadrack Muzungu Lukombe, (yavutse ku ya 14 Mata 1997 i Kinshasa), ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo ukina nka kuruhande hamwe na RS Berkane.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYatojwe afite imyaka 9 muri ATHLETIC CLUB UJANA Training Center i Kinshasa. Yatangiye umwuga we muri AS Vita Club, ikipe ya turutse mu gihugu akomokamo.\nMuri Mutarama 2019, Lukombe yagiye mu mahanga asinyana n'ikipe yo mu Misiri ENPPI SC.\nKu ya 31 Mutarama umwaka ukurikira, yinjiye mu Burayi na Espagne UD Almer\u00eda. Yahawe ikipe ya B ikina muri Tercera Divisi\u00f3n (icyiciro cya kane). Noneho yi muriwe muri Boulogne mu buryo bw'intizanyo nta mahitamo yo kugura.\nKu ya 20 Gicurasi 2022, yegukanye igikombe cya Confederation nyuma yo gutsinda umukino wa nyuma kuri penaliti yakinnye na Orlando Pirates FC (banganya, 1-1). Ku ya 28 Nyakanga 2022, yatsinze Wydad Casablanca kuri penariti mu mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Maroke kuri Stade Mohammed-V (banganya, 0-0). Ku ya 10 Nzeri 2022, yatangiye ayobowe n'umutoza we mushya Abdelhak Benchikha ku mukino wa nyuma wa CAF Super Cup na Wydad Athletic Club. Umukino warangiye itsinze 0-2 ku kigo cyimikino cya Moulay-Abdallah."}
{"id": "16144", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16144", "title": "Ngonda Muzinga", "text": "Glody Ngonda Muzinga, (yavutse Ku ya 31 Ukuboza 1994),Ni ukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomo ka muri wa congo ukina nkumukinnyi winyuma muri Riga FC.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nAS Vita Club.\nYagiye gukina muri Afurika Champions League ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya Confederation inshuro nyinshi. Yageze ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Confederation hamwe na AS Vita Club muri 2018, batsindwa na Raja de Casablanca.\nUburambe bwa mbere iburayi muri Dijon.\nYinjiye muri Dijon FCO muri Kanama 2019, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka 2 (undi 1 bishoboka) kugirango asubize urugendo rwa Oussama Haddadi na Arnold Bouka Moutou. Byabaye ngombwa ko akina irushanwa n\u2019umusore ukomoka mu gihugu cya Maroke na Hamza Mendyl kandi yakinnye imikino 8 gusa mu marushanwa yose (harimo 6 muri Ligue 1) muri shampiyona ya mbere.\nUmwanditsi w'imyiteguro ibanziriza shampiyona, yatangiye kumunsi wambere wa Ligue 1 muri 2020-2021, ku ya 22 Kanama 2020. Kubwamahirwe, yakomerekejwe m'ugihe cy'umukino hanyuma kubura kwe byagereranijwe mu byumweru byinshi. Mu guhatana na An\u00edbal Chal\u00e1, yagurijwe mu gihembwe, yigaragaje nk'intangiriro ku ruhande rw'ibumoso rwa myugariro wa Dijon.\nYatsinze igitego cya mbere hamwe na Dijon FCO ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 2020, na OGC Nice, mu izina ry'umunsi wa 12 wa Ligue 1. Nyuma yitabiriye intsinzi ya mbere ya Dijon ya shampiyona (amanota ya nyuma 1-3).\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo Ku ya 11 Kanama 2017, kurwanya Kongo. Uku kunganya ibitego biri mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika muri 2018."}
{"id": "16145", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16145", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Retba", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Retba, kizwi kandi ku izina rya ikiyaga cya roza (bisobanura \" ikiyaga cy'umutuku werurutse \"), giherereye mu majyaruguru ya Cap Vert muri Senegali, muri kilometero 35\u00a0z' amajyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'umurwa mukuru Dakar mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Afurka. Yiswe amazi ya roza bitewe n'icyatsi cyo mu nyanja \"Dunaliella salina\" kizwiho kuba kirimo umunyu mwinshi. Ibara ryacyo ryiganza cyane cyane guhera mu mpera za Mutarama kugeza mu ntangiriro za Werurwe mu gihe cyizuba; icyakora, Mu gihe cy'imvura nyinshi yo muri Nzeri 2022 ntihahungabanijwe ibikorwa byo gusarura umunyu ku kiyaga gusa, ahubwo kubera ko watumye ikiyaga gitakaza ibara, byagize ingaruka mbi ku bukerarugendo.\nIbisobanuro.\nIkiyaga giherereye muri kilometero 35\u00a0mu majyaruguru-y'uburasirazuba bwa Dakar, gitandukanijwe n'inyanja ya Atalantika gusa na koridoro ifunganye y'imisozi, kandi yitirirwa amazi yiroza, aterwa n'icyatsi cyo mu nyanja \"Dunaliella salina\". Icyo cyatsi gitanga ibara ritukura kugirango ribafashe kwinjiza urumuri rw'izuba, rubiha imbaraga zo gukora ATP. Ibara rigaragara cyane mu gihe cy'izuba (kuva Ugushyingo kugeza Gicurasi) kandi ntigaragara cyane mu gihe cy'imvura (Kamena kugeza Ukwakira). \nUmunyu.\nIkiyaga kizwiho umunyu mwinshi (kugeza 40% mu turere tumwe na tumwe), ibyo bikaba ahanini biterwa no kwinjira mu mazi yo mu nyanja no guhumeka nyuma. Kimwe n'Inyanja y'Umunyu, ikiyaga kirahagije kuburyo abantu bashobora kureremba byoroshye. \nUmunyu woherezwa mu karere kose hamwe n\u2019abaterankunga bagera ku 3.000, abagabo n\u2019abagore baturutse muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba, bakora amasaha 6-7 ku munsi. Umunyu ukoreshwa n\u2019abarobyi bo muri Senegali mu kubungabunga amafi, akaba ari kimwe mu bintu gakondo, harimo n\u2019ibiryo by\u2019igihugu, ari amafi n\u2019umuceri witwa thieboudienne. Toni zigera ku 38.000 z'umunyu zisarurwa muri iki kiyaga buri mwaka, ibyo bikaba bigira uruhare mu nganda zitanga umunyu muri Senegali. Senegali iri k\u2019umwanya wa mbere utanga umunyu muri Afurika. \nUrutonde rw'umurage wisi.\nIkiyaga cya Retba cyasuzumwe na UNESCO nk'Umurage w'isi kuva mu Kwakira 2005, kandi kiracyabarwa gutyo mu mwaka wa 2023. \nAkamaro muri siporo.\nIkiyaga cyakunze kuba iherezo ry'isiganwa ry'imodoka mu murwa wa Dakar mbere y'uko imyigaragambyo yimukira muri Amerika y'Epfo mu 2009. \nMu 2021, yakiriye irushanwa ry'isiganwa kwiruka ryitwa Extreme Electric off- road "}
{"id": "16146", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16146", "title": "Inganda zikoresha amazi menshi bikabangamira ibidukikije", "text": "Inganda zikora ibinyobwa nizo zitungwa agatoki cyanecyane.\nNyuma yo kubona ko inganda zikora ibinyobwa muri Afurika zikoresha amazi menshi, ba nyiri izo nganda bararakangurirwa gukoresha amazi make mu binyobwa bakora kuko biri muri gahunda yo kurengera umutungo kamere w\u2019Amazi n\u2019ibidukikije muri rusange. \nIbi byasabwe kuri uyu wa 25 Mata 2013 mu nama yaberaga i Kigali ihuje ibihugu 7 byo muri Afurika byibumbiye mu ihuriro ABIWSI rigamije gukangurira inganda nyafurika z\u2019ibinyobwa gukoresha amazi make mu rwego rwo kurengera ibidukikije. \nIbyo bihugu (...)\n\"Nyuma yo kubona ko inganda zikora ibinyobwa muri Afurika zikoresha amazi menshi, ba nyiri izo nganda bararakangurirwa gukoresha amazi make mu binyobwa bakora kuko biri muri gahunda yo kurengera umutungo kamere w\u2019Amazi n\u2019ibidukikije muri rusange.\"\nIbi byasabwe kuri uyu wa 25 Mata 2013 mu nama yaberaga i Kigali ihuje ibihugu 7 byo muri Afurika byibumbiye mu ihuriro ABIWSI rigamije gukangurira inganda nyafurika z\u2019ibinyobwa gukoresha amazi make mu rwego rwo kurengera ibidukikije.\nIbyo bihugu ni Misiri, Ethiopie, Kenya, Rwanda, Tanzanie, Ouganda na Zimbabwe\nAbari mu nama basanze inganda zo muri Afurika zikoresha amazi arenze urugero ugereranyi n\u2019igipimo kiba gisabwa gukorehswa muri litiro y\u2019ikinyobwa gisembuye n\u2019ikidasembuye.\nIkigereranyo fatizo cy\u2019amazi kigomba kujya muri litiro imwe y\u2019ikinyobwa ni Litiro enye z\u2019amazi.\nAlexis Ruzibukira, ushinzwe inganda nini,into n\u2019iziciriritse muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019inganda (MINICOM), yavuze ko iyi nama ari ingirakamaro bitewe nuko ibyavugiwemo bizafasha Inganda z\u2019ibinyobwa muri Afurika gukoresha neza amazi igihe ashyirwa mu binyobwa.\nNgarukiye Deric, ushinzwe ibya tekiniki mu ruganda rw\u2019 Inyange, yatanze urugero rugaragaza ko mu mwaka w\u2019 2010 bakoreshaga amazi angana na litiro 4,5 muri litiro imwe y\u2019 ikinyobwa mu gihe bari barihaye. Kuri ubu uruganda rw\u2019Inyange rukaba rukoresha litiro 4 z\u2019amazi muri ilitiro imwe y\u2019 ikinyobwa.\nKu ruhande rw\u2019uruganda rukora ibinyobwa rwa BRALIRWA, Jules Kalitanyi ushinzwe gukurikirana uro ruganda avuga ko kuva mu myaka icumi bakorana n\u2019umushinga ABIWSI bagabanije amazi bakoresha baka bageze kuri litiro enye muri litiro imwe y\u2019ikinyobwa.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/ibidukikije/ibungabunga/article/inganda-z-ibinyobwa-muri-afurika"}
{"id": "16147", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16147", "title": "Ingaruka z\u2019imyuka ihumanya ikirere ku buzima bwacu", "text": "Kuri ubu isi yose ihangayikishijwe n\u2019ingaruka ziterwa cyangwa zizaterwa n\u2019imyuka ihumanya ikirere igenda yiyongera uko bukeye n\u2019uko bwije. Nyamara twiyibagiza ko uko guhumana kw\u2019ikirere ari twe n\u2019ibikorwa byacu dutuma bibaho.\nImyuka ihumanya ikirere iterwa ahanini kuri ubu n\u2019ubwiyongere bw\u2019inganda ndetse n\u2019ibinyabiziga.\nImyuka ituruka mu nganda, imyotsi iterwa no gutwika amashyamba, imyuka iva mu binyabiziga biri kugenda, ibyo byose birazamuka bikagera kure mu kirere aho bitera impinduka nyinshi.\nMuri zo twavuga:\nIbi hamwe n\u2019ibindi tutarondora hano, ni byo bigira ingaruka ku kiremwamuntu no ku byaremwe muri rusange.\nIngaruka z\u2019imyuka ihumanya ikirere.\nIngaruka z\u2019imyuka ihumanya ikirere ziteye guhangayika cyane. Iyi myuka itera ibibazo mu guhumeka, bityo indwara zinyuranye z\u2019ibihaha n\u2019umutima zikiyongera. Kanseri na zo zikaziraho yaba kanseri y\u2019ibihaha, iy\u2019uruhu n\u2019izindi zinyuranye.\u00a0 By\u2019umwihariko abana bavukira ahantu hakabije kuba umwuka uhumanye bakunze kurwara umusonga na asima.\n2. Ubushyuhe budasanzwe\nIndi ngaruka y\u2019iyi myuka ni ukwiyongera k\u2019ubushyuhe ku isi bizwi nka Global warming. Uko ubushyuhe bwiyongera ku isi bigira ingaruka ku mazi yo mu\u00a0 nyanja kuko ahahoze ari balafu zirashonga, bigatuma aho amazi yageraga aharenga. Ingaruka zikaba imyuzure no kwimuka kw\u2019abantu bahunga aho amazi yuzuye.\n3. Imvura zirimo aside\nImyuka mibi nka NO (nitric oxide) na SO2 (sulfur oxide) igenda yiyongera mu kirere uko ibintu bitwitswe haba mu nganda, gutwika ibishingwe n\u2019ibisigazwa by\u2019inyamaswa. Iyo imvura iguye, ibitonyanga byayo byivanga nay a myuka nuko imvura ikagwa yabaye aside. Ibi bigira ingaruka ku bimera, inyamaswa n\u2019abantu.\n4. Eutrophication \nIyo umwuka wa azote (nitrogen) ubaye mwinshi muri ya myuka ihumanya ikirere ugeze ku mazi yo ku Nyanja birivanga nuko bikabyara ibimera byo mu mazi bizwi nka algae. Nibyo byitwa eutrophication. Ibi bihita bigira ingaruka ku mafi n\u2019ibindi biremwa byose biba mu Nyanja. Kuri ubu algae zisa n\u2019icyatsi ziboneka mu biyaga n\u2019ibizenga by\u2019amazi zose ni ingaruka za nitrogen nyinshi.\n5. Kwangirika kwa Ozone\nNkuko twabibonye ozone twakita nk\u2019akayunguruzo, iturinda imirasire mibi y\u2019izuba izwi nka ultraviolet (UV). Imyuka mibi yangiza aka kayunguruzo ni izwi nka chlorofluorocarbons na \u00a0hydro chlorofluorocarbons. Uko aka kayunguruzo kagenda kangirika niko iyi mirasire igenda yiyongera ku isi ikaba itera ibibaso ku ruhu no ku maso.\nNi gute twacyemura iki kibazo.\nNubwo tubivuze mu magambo Atari menshi nyamara guhumana kw\u2019ikirere bifite ingaruka kandi zizakomeza kwiyongera nihatagira igikorwa ngo imyuka ihumanya ikirere igabanyuke.\nReka turebere hamwe ibyo twakora ngo duhangane n\u2019iki kibazo gihangayikishije isi\nKuri ubu imodoka bwite ziri kugenda ziyongera. Uretse no guteza ikibazo cyo kuba nyinshi mu muhanda, ariko binongera imyuka ijya mu kirere mibi. Nyamara abantu baramutse bakoresheje itwara rya rusange, mwaba mujya mu cyerekezo kimwe aho kugirango buri wese agende mu modoka imwe mukajya muri imwe muri benshi, byagabanya ya myuka ijya mu kirere (aho kugirango usange imodoka 5 zishoreranye buri yose irimo umuntu umwe n\u2019indi myanya 4 itarimo abantu, bajya muri imwe izindi 4 bakaziparika)\nKuri ubu hari uburyo bwinshi bukoreshwa nyamara butaritabirwa na benshi. Imirasire y\u2019izuba itanga amashanyarazi, amashanyarazi ava ku mmuyaga, byose birekura ingufu zingana n\u2019izindi kandi byo ntabwo bihumanya ikirere. Ubu buryo bukoreshejwe neza byagabanya ikoreshwa ry\u2019amashanyarazi akomoka mu gutwika ibisigazwa by\u2019inyamaswa, ingufu ziva mu ikoreshwa ry\u2019amakara kimwe no gutwika amashyamba\nHari ibintu byinshi tujugunya cyangwa dutwika nyamara byakongera gukoreshwa. Amacupa avamo amazi n\u2019imitobe, aho kuyajugunya cyangwa kuyatwika, ashobora gutunganywa akongera agakoreshwa. Ibase ishaje ushyizemo ibitaka wateramo imboga zikamera kandi ukaba wungutse kabiri\nKuri ubu abahanga Bari bakwiye kureba uburyo bwo gutwara ikibanyiziga hadakenewe risansi cyangwa mazutu. Hashobora gukoreshwa imirasire y\u2019izuba (ubu buryo bwatangiye gukoreshwa) kimwe no gukoresha amashanyarazi. Ibi byatuma ya myuka izamuka mu kirere igabanyuka.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://umutihealth.com/imyuka-ihumanya-ikirere/"}
{"id": "16148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16148", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo ni ikiyaga cyo mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, hafi y'umujyi wa Musanze. Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo n'Ikiyaga cya Burera byitwa \u00abibiyaga by'impanga\u00bb.\nIkiyaga cya Ruhondo gifite ubuso bwa hegitari 2 800. Kiri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 764. Amazi yacyo akoreshwa mu gutanga amashanyarazi. Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo kiri mu gace ka Ramsar kitwa Rugezi-Burera-Ruhondo.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Ruhondo kiri hafi y'umujyi wa Musanze. Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo n'Ikiyaga cya Burera byitwa \u00abibiyaga by'impanga\u00bb.\nIkiyaga cya Ruhondo gifite uburebure bwa kilometero 9. Ubugari bwacyo ni kilometero 3. Gifite ubuso bwa hegitari 2 800. Kiri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 764. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugera kuri metero 65. Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo gifite ibirwa 10.\nIkiyaga cya Ruhondo cyaremwe n'ibikorwa by'Ikirunga cya Sabyinyo. Amahindure yafunze ikibaya, nuko amazi araretama. Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo gitandukanywa n'Ikiyaga cya Burera n'agace k'ubutaka. Ako gace gafite ubugari bwa kilometero imwe.\nImigezi mito yisuka mu Kiyaga cya Ruhondo. Amazi y'ikiyaga asohokera mu mugezi wa Mukungwa, mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba. Umugezi wa Mukungwa wisuka mu mugezi wa Nyabarongo. Amazi y'umugezi wa Mukungwa akoreshwa ku rugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwa Mukungwa II.\nAmashanyarazi.\nIkiyaga cya Burera kiri hejuru y'Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo ho metero 98. Iryo tandukaniro rikoreshwa mu gutanga amashanyarazi ku rugomero rwa Ntaruka. Umuyoboro uri munsi y'ubutaka uhuza ibiyaga byombi i Ntaruka. Uwo muyoboro wubatswe n'Ababiligi muri 1959.\nUburobyi n'ubuhinzi.\nIkiyaga cya Ruhondo kibonekamo amafi. Abaturage baturiye ikiyaga basaba ko hakongerwa amafi ashyirwamo. Abahinzi kandi bakoresha amazi y'ikiyaga mu kuhira imyaka.\nKurengera ibidukikije.\nIkiyaga cya Ruhondo kiri mu gace ka Ramsar kitwa Rugezi-Burera-Ruhondo. Ako gace kashyizweho muri 2005. Igishanga cya Rugezi cyongera amazi y'Ikiyaga cya Burera n'Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo.\nUbukerarugendo.\nNtaruka ni ho hantu nyamukuru ho kwinjira ku biyaga byombi. Abasura ibiyaga bahakorera ingendo mu bwato. Kuva ku kiyaga, babona ibirunga bya Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga. Muri 2024, abashoramari bashakaga kubaka ibikorwa by'ubukerarugendo ku nkengero z'Ikiyaga cya Ruhondo."}
{"id": "16149", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16149", "title": "Santos Muntubile", "text": "Jean N'diela Muntubile bakunze kwita \"Santos Muntubile\"(yavutse Ku ya 20 Ukuboza 1958) yavukiye i L\u00e9opoldville, akina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari umutoza wa congo.\nAkina nku mukinnyi ukina hagati mu kibuga na rutahizamu, cyane cyane muri FC Sochaux.\nUbuzima.\nJean N'diela Muntubile uzwi ku izina rya \" Santos \", yagaragaje nkushaka akazi muri FC Sochaux muri 1980. Ni umukinnyi ukina\u00a0kuruhande wihuta, byihuse kandi byiza Nyuma y'igihembwe cya mbere muri ikipe ya Franche-Comt\u00e9, yagurijwe muri 1981 - 1982 muri Olympique de Marseille, icyo gihe yakinnye mu cyiciro cya 2. Nyuma asubira i Sochaux, agumaho kugeza muri 1984. Afite imikino 50 n'ibitego 2 yatsinze mu cyiciro cya 1 hamwe na Sochaux. Yakomeje umwuga we mu Budage no mu Bufaransa. Yabaye umukinnyi wa congo hagati ya 1985 na 1990.\nMu myaka ya za 2000, yatangiye umwuga wo gutoza. Yakoze muri Tout Puissant Mazembe kuva 2005 kugeza 2007 ndetse no muri Daring Club Motema Pembe muri 2009. Ari ku buyobozi bw'ikipe y'igihugu yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona Nyafurika muri 2009. Ni umutoza w\u2019igihugu cya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo inshuro nyinshi, cyane muri 2011 no muri 2013-2014.\nIbihembo.\nNkumutoza"}
