{"id": "16151", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16151", "title": "Ishami ry\u2019ibidukikije, amashyamba n\u2019uburobyi", "text": "Ishami ry\u2019ibidukikije, amashyamba n\u2019uburobyi ni rimwe mu mashami ya guverinoma y\u2019Afurika yepfo. Ifite \ninshingano zo kurengera, kubungabunga no guteza imbere ibidukikije n\u2019umutungo kamere muri Afurika y'epfo.\niri shami ryashinzwe mu mwaka w'2019 rihuzwa n\u2019ishami rishinzwe ibidukikije n\u2019ibice by\u2019amashyamba n\u2019uburobyi bigize ishami ry\u2019ubuhinzi, amashyamba n\u2019uburobyi.\nAmashami.\nAmashami y\u2019ishami rishinzwe ibidukikije ni: "}
{"id": "16152", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16152", "title": "Nelson Munganga", "text": "Nelson Omba Munganga, (yavutse ku ya 27 Werurwe 1993) i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati hamwe n'ikipe yo muri Maroke ya MC Oujda.\nUbuzima.\nYakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe yo muri DR Congo, ku ya 6 Nzeri 2019, ahanganye na Kameruni. Uyu mukino watsinzwe n'amanota 0-2 ni umwe mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2015.\nMuri Mutarama 2015, yakinnye mu cyiciro cya nyuma cy'igikombe cya Afurika cyabereye muri Gineya ya Ekwatoriya. Yitabiriye imikino ibiri muri iri rushanwa, na Cape Veride mu matsinda, hanyuma akina Congo muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza. DR Congo iri ku mwanya wa gatatu muri CAN, itsinze igihugu cyakiriye muri \"ku mukino wa nyuma ubanza\", nyuma yo kurata penariti.\nMuri Mutarama 2016, yitabiriye Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika, yateguwe mu Rwanda. Akina imikino itanu muri iri rushanwa. Nyuma yaje kwitwara neza atsinda igitego cya mbere hamwe na DR Congo, na Angola mu matsinda. DR Congo yatsinze irushanwa itsinze Mali ku mukino wa nyuma, n'amanota ya nyuma ari 3-0.\nMuri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye Igikombe cya COSAFA muri 2016. Yitabiriye imikino ibiri muri iri rushanwa, atsinda igitego muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza na Mozambike."}
{"id": "16153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16153", "title": "Leon Mungamuni", "text": "L\u00e9on Mungamuni (yavute mu mwaka wa 1960) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC). Yatsinze CAN muri 1968."}
{"id": "16154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16154", "title": "J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Mumbere", "text": "J\u00e9r\u00e9mie Mumbere Mbusa ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga wa congo ukina nku mukinnyi ukina hagati muri AS Vita Club.\nUbuzima.\nYakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe yo muri DR Congo ku ya 18 Nzeri 2019, mu mukino wa gicuti yakinnye n'u Rwanda (batsindwa 2-3).\nHamwe na AS Vita Club, yitabiriye inshuro nyinshi muri Afrika Champions League."}
{"id": "16155", "revid": "19167", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16155", "title": "Youssouf Mulumbu", "text": "Youssouf Mulumbu, (yavutse Ku ya 25 Mutarama 1987), yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka i Bumbu, muri komini mu mujyi wa Kinshasa muri Kongo, wahindutse umukinnyi wo hagati, kuri ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru wa FC Tanganyika akaba ari ikipe yo muri Kongo ifite icyicaro i Kalemie.\nUbuzima.\nakiri muto n'umuryango we bagiye mu Bufaransa avuye muri Zayire (izina ryahoze ryitwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo), yakuriye mu mujyi wa \u00c9pinay-sous-S\u00e9nart, mu nkengero za Paris.\nMuri ikipe.\nYinjiye mu kigo cy\u2019imyitozo cya PSG afite imyaka 13, yambikwa ikamba rya shampiyo w\u2019Ubufaransa munsi y\u2019imyaka 18 muri shampiyona yo muri 2005-2006. Ku ya 22 Ukwakira 2006, Guy Lacombe bituma akora bwa mbere muri Ligue 1, ku myaka 19 n'amezi 10, ahanganye na AJ Auxerre asinyana amasezerano ya mbere y'umwuga na PSG Ku ya 13 Ugushyingo y'umwaka umwe. Gusezerana, ni igihe gikurikirwa na Manchester United. Shampiyona irangiye, yatoranijwe mu ikipe y\u2019Ubufaransa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 yatsinze irushanwa rya Toulon.\nYakiriye ihitamwo rye rya mbere mu ikipe y'Ubufaransa ya Espoirs Ku ya 21 Kanama 2007 bakina na Ubutaliyani.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2007-2008, yatijwe nta mahitamo yo kugura Amiens SC muri Ligue 2 (imikino 29, igitego kimwe).\nYagarutse muri PSG muri shampiyona yo muri 2008-2009 yakinnye imikino mike ya UEFA. Ariko, akomeza kugarukira kumwanya wabasimbuye."}
{"id": "16156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16156", "title": "Landry Mulemo", "text": "Landry Mulemo (wavutse ku ya 17 Nzeri 1986 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo n'ubw'Ububiligi. Yakinaga nka myugariro w'ibumoso.\nYakuriye mu ikipe ya Standard de Li\u00e8ge, ayitwarana shampiyona y'u Bubiligi mu 2008 no mu 2009. Yakiniye amakipe y'u Bubiligi y'abato, harimo iyitabiriye Imikino Olempike ya 2008 i Beijing, mbere yo guhitamo gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Kongo kuva mu 2011.\nUmwuga.\nMulemo yatangiriye mu bana ba Standard de Li\u00e8ge mu 1990, akomereza muri R Fl\u00e9malle FC (1992\u20131995), agaruka muri Standard mu 1995. Kuva mu 2004 kugeza mu 2007, yatijwe muri K Saint-Trond VV, ahakina imikino isaga 60.\nAgarutse muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge (2007\u20132010), yatwaranye na yo shampiyona y'u Bubiligi (2008, 2009) n'igikombe cya \"Supercoupe\" (2008, 2009). Muri Kamena 2010, yerekeje muri Bucaspor yo muri Turukiya. Nyuma yaho yakiniye KV Kortrijk (2011\u20132013, 2014\u20132015), Beitar Jerusalem muri Isirayeli (2013\u20132014), Kaposv\u00e1ri R\u00e1k\u00f3czi muri Hongiriya (2014), KF Vllaznia muri Alubaniya (2017) na Birkirkara FC muri Malita (2017\u20132018).\nMuri Mutarama 2020, nyuma y'imyaka ibiri nta kipe afite, yasinyiye Union royale Namur Fosses-la-Ville, aba kapiteni wayo, ayivamo muri Kanama 2020.\nIkipe y'igihugu.\nMulemo yakiniye ikipe y'u Bubiligi y'abatarengeje imyaka 21, yitabira Shampiyona y'u Burayi y'abatarengeje imyaka 21 yo mu 2007 mu Ubuholandi, ndetse n'Imikino Olempike yo mu 2008 i Beijing, aho u Bubiligi bwabaye ubwa kane. Ku ya 9 Ukwakira 2009, yahamagawe bwa mbere mu ikipe nkuru y'u Bubiligi ku mukino na Turukiya, ariko ntiyinjira mu kibuga.\nYifashishije amategeko mashya ya FIFA, ahitamo gukinira Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, nk'uko Joachim Mununga na Andr\u00e9a Mbuyi-Mutombo babigenje. Yakiniye Kongo imikino 10 hagati ya 2011 na 2013, harimo umukino wo gushaka itike y'Igikombe cy'Isi na Swaziland ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 2011.\nNyuma yo gukina.\nMu 2021, yateguye i Kinshasa igikorwa cyo gushakisha impano z'abakiri bato ku bufatanye na M\u00e1laga CF yo muri Esipanye, naho mu 2022 abikora ku bufatanye na KV Kortrijk.\nIbihembo.\nStandard de Li\u00e8ge"}
{"id": "16157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16157", "title": "Remi Mulumba", "text": "R\u00e9mi Mulumba, (yavutse Ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 1992) yavukiya i Abbeville mu Ubufaransa, Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo, ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati urinda.\nUbuzima.\nMulumba yatangiye umwuga we muri SC Abbeville. Muri Kanama 2006, yinjiye mu myaka wa 14 yatoranijwe muri Ligue de Picardie, ari kumwe na Florian Pinteaux hamwe na Birama Tour\u00e9. Yinjiye muri Amiens SC muri 2008. Muri 2010, yinjiye muri FC Lorient.\nNyuma yinguzanyo ebyiri zagiye zikurikirana muriDijon, yongeye kugurizwa, kuriyi nshuro muri Auxerre muri shampiyona yo muri 2014-2015. Yatsinze igitego cya mbere ku ya 9\u00a0umunsi na AC Arles-Avignon (intsinzi 2-1).\nYahisemo gukinira Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kandi yemera guhamagarwa Kanama 2015 gukina umukino na republika ya centrefricaine ubara umunsi wa kabiri wo gushaka itike ya CAN yo muri 2017. Amaherezo ntashobora guhuzwa uwo munsi kubera ibibazo by'ubuyobozi ariko yubaha guhitamo kwe kwa mbere na Nigeriya Ku ya 8 Ukwakira 2015.\nKu ya 14 Kamena 2016, yiyandikishije mu bihe bibiri hamwe no muri Gaz\u00e9lec Ajaccio.\nYitabira igikombe cya mbere cy\u2019Afurika muri Gaboni kuva Mutarama kugeza Gashyantare 2017.\nImibare.\nAfite kandi umwuga mu ikipe y\u2019urubyiruko rw\u2019Ubufaransa imikino 17 yakinnye ndetse atsinda igitego 1:\nmunsi yabafite imyaka 20: Imikino 8 / igitego 1\n-munsi yabafite imyaka19: Imikino 7\n- munsi yabafite imyaka 18: Imikino 2"}
{"id": "16158", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16158", "title": "Jackson Muleka", "text": "Jackson Muleka, (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Ukwakira 1999) i Lubumbashi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo (DRC). Akina nka rutahizamu mu ikipe ya Be\u015fikta\u015f JK. Yiswe akazina k'umuryango wa Facebook muri congo \"sniper\" yerekeza kuri ibi bitaramo hagati yu kwezi kwa Werurwe na Mata 2021 aho yatsinze ibitego hafi muri buri mukino wo muri Jupiler Pro League.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nTP Mazembe (2017-2020).\nYatsinzwe n'ibyiciro byose by'ishuri ry'umupira w'amaguru rya Katumbi, amaherezo ni mu mpera z'umwaka wo muri 2016 nibwo umutoza Hubert Velud (icyo gihe wari umutoza wa Mazembe) yamwinjije mu bakozi b'iyi kipe.\nMuleka yitoreza hamwe niyi kipe ariko atarakina, kugeza muri 2017 haje umutoza Pamphile Mihayo niho Muleka agaragara ku mpapuro z'umukino kandi akunguka mugihe cyo gukina.\nMuri 2018, rutahizamu wa Mazembe mu gihe Ben Malango yakomeretse, Mihayo yizeye rutahizamu we ukiri muto nibwo impano ye yateye imbere.\nAfite ibitego byinshi, haba muri Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru cyangwa muri Afurika muri Champions League.\nYarangije gutsinda ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona ya DR Congo n'ibitego 24 bityo aba abafatanya kwandika agahigo.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2019-2020, Muleka yarangije gutsinda ibitego byinshi muri Afurika muri Champions League n'ibitego 7 (ibitego 2 yatsinze Zamalek, ibitego 4 yatsinze Zesco United, igitego 1 yatsinze Primeiro do Agosto) bituma aba umwe mu bashakishwa cyane -inyuma yabakinnyi k'umugabane wicyo gihe."}
{"id": "16159", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16159", "title": "Kanku Mulekelayi", "text": "Kanku Mulekelayi,(Yavutse Ku ya 1 Mutarama 1980) i Lubumbashi, niumukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati wa TP Mazembe."}
{"id": "16160", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16160", "title": "Mwanza Mukombo", "text": "Albert Mwanza Mukombo (yavutse ku ya 17 Ukuboza 1945 muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo apfa Ku ya 13 Ukwakira 2001) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Congo-Kinshasa icyo gihe yari Zayire, yakinnye imikino 21 (nta gitego yatsinze) hagati yo muri 1968 na 1976.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage, yakinnye imikino itatu: bakina na Sikotilande, Yugosilaviya na Burezile.\nYitabiriye kandi ibikombe bya Afurika muri 1968, 1972 na 1974. Yatsinze amarushanwa muri 1968 na 1974."}
{"id": "16161", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16161", "title": "Pierre Kalala Mukendi", "text": "Pierre Kalala Mukendi, (Yavutse Ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 1939 i Likasi hanyuma apfa Ku ya 30 Kamena 2015) i Johannesburg, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa congo (DRC) wahindutse umutoza.\nUbuzima.\nYari umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga muri congo (DRC), yitabiriye CAN muri 1965, atsinda ibitego bibiri. Ikipe ye isezerewe mu cyiciro cya mbere. Nyuma yakinnye CAN muri 1968, aho yatsinze igitego ku mukino wanyuma atsinda irushanwa.\nYatoje ikipe ya DR Congo muri 1992. Yayoboye abakinnyi ba congo mu gihe CAN muri 1992.\nYapfuye azize impyiko Ku ya 30 Kamena 2015 afite imyaka 75 i Johannesburg,muri Afurika y'Epfo."}
{"id": "16162", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16162", "title": "Jean-Claude Mukanya", "text": "Jean-Claude Mukanya (yavutse Ku ya 1 Gicurasi 1968) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga wumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DR Congo), wakinaga nka myugariro.\nUmwuga.\nMpuzamahanga.\nYabaye akina imikino mpuzamahanga inshuro 49 muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (icyahoze ari Zaire), hagati ya 1991 na 1999."}
{"id": "16163", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16163", "title": "Cyrille Mubiala Kitambala", "text": "Cyrille Mubiala Kitambala (Yavutse Ku ya 7 Nyakanga 1974 i Kinshasa)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri congo (DRC).\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo aho yatsinze igitego ku gihugu cyatsinze na Misiri, nubwo igihugu cye cyatsinzwe ibitego 4-1.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri 1998 muri CS Style du Congo, nyuma yinjira muri AS Dragons.\nAS Vita Club.\nMu 2000 yinjiye muri imwe mu makipe akomeye mu gihugu AS Vita Club imyaka itatu.\nMuri 2003, yari afite ibyifuzo bya makipe nka Ajax Cape Town, Mamelodi Sundowns, n'izindi.\nAjax Cape Town.\nAmaherezo yaje gusinyira Ajax Cape Town aho yakinnye imikino 69 atsinda ibitego 7.\nBloemfontein Celtic FC.\nMuri 2009, yasinyanye na Bloemfontein Celtic FC muri shampiyona imwe, akina imikino 13 atsinda ibitego 3.\nGuhitamo igihugu.\nYitabiriye Igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2004 aho yaje ku mwanya wa gatatu mu itsinda.\nYitabiriye cyane igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 2006 aho yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri mu itsinda inyuma ya Kameruni.\nMuri kimwe cya kane kirangiza hagati ya DR Congo na Misiri. Yatsinze igitego kimwe nubwo yatsinzwe 4\u20131.\nNyuma ya marushanwa yarangije umwuga we mpuzamahanga yari yarakinnye mu mikino 21 yose nigitego 1."}
{"id": "16164", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16164", "title": "Firmin Mubele", "text": "Firmin Mubele Ndombe, (Yavutse Ku ya 17 Mata 1994), ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) ukina mu b'imbere.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYageze ku mukino wa nyuma wa CAF Champions League muri 2014 hamwe na AS Vita Club, batsinzwe na ES S\u00e9tif yo muri Alijeriya. Mu iri rushanwa, yatsinze ibitego bitatu mu ikipe ya Kaizer Chiefs yo muri Afurika yepfo mu cyiciro cya nyuma.\nMu idirishya ryo kwimura impeshyi muri 2015 yimukiye muri Al Ahli SC.\nKu ya 30 Mutarama 2017, yimuriwe kuri Stade Rennes, basinyana amasezerano y'imyaka itatu n'igice.\nFirmin yakinnye umukino wa mbere na Angers SCO, agaruka ku munota 70 mu mwanya wa Yoann Gourcuff.\nYatsinze igitego cya mbere mu mabara ye mashya yakinnye na Olympique Lyonnais kumunsi wa 31 wa Ligue 1. (1-1)\nKu ya 30 Mutarama 2018, yatijwe muri Toulouse FC kugeza shampiyona irangiye ahitamo kugurwa.\nKu ya 7 Kamena 2018, yimuriwe kumugaragaro muri Toulouse FC.\nKu ya 2 Nyakanga 2019, yatijwe muri FK Astana igihembwe 1 ahitamo kugurwa."}
{"id": "16165", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16165", "title": "Tr\u00e9sor Mputu", "text": "Tr\u00e9sor Mputu Mabi, uzwi ku izina \"Sekibi\", (yavutse Ku ya 10 Ukuboza 1985 i Kinshasa (yahoze ari Zayire)), yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo wakinnye nkumukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga. Afatwa nk'umwe mu bakinnyi beza b'Abanyekongo mu bihe byose, niba atari byiza, ndetse n'umwe mu bakinnyi beza bakina ku mugabane wa Afurika.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nIntangiriro.\nMu 2007, yavumbuwe na TP Mazembe, Igikombe cya CAF na CAF Champions League, aho yambitswe umudali rya mbere ry'atsinze ibitego byinshi muri iri rushanwa n'ibitego 9, kandi yatowe nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi ku isi na IFFHS (Ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019umupira w'amaguru &amp; Imibare) yo gutsinda ibitego 20 muri mpuzamahanga muri 2007. Muri 2009, yatsitse muri CAF Champions League hamwe na TP Mazembe kandi yitabira igikombe cy'isi cy'amakipe muri 2009 aho ikipe ye yarangije amarushanwa 6.\u00a0umwanya hamwe n'imikino 2 no gu tsindwa 2. Muri Werurwe 2010, Mputu yatorewe kuba umukinnyi mwiza wa Afurika w'umwaka wao muri 2009, akina ku mugabane.\nUwahoze ari umuyobozi w'ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Claude Le Roy, asobanura ko Mputu aruta rutahizamu wa Kameruni, Samuel Eto'o we ubwe yatoje mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA muri 1998 ubwo yari umutoza wa Kameruni.\nInyungu ziva muri Arsenal nandi makipe.\nMuri Ugushyingo 2007, Ikipe ya Arsenal yo mu Bwongereza, irerekana inyungu muri Mputu. Inyungu zemejwe na perezida w'ikipe ya TP Mazembe, Mo\u00efse Katumbi Chapwe na federasiyo y'umupira w'amaguru ya congo, batangaza ko iyimurwa ryegereje. Uyu mukinnyi rwose yagiye i Londres mu igeragezwa ry'iminsi icumi, umutoza wa Gunners, Arsene Wenger, avuga ko ari umukinnyi uhanga kandi ko byamushimishije kugeza ubu, ariko nta gukurikirana byakurikiranwe. Biragaragara ko yanzwe. Muri 2009, Standard de Li\u00e8ge yahisemo kumwimura, yabonye amasezerano niyi kipe ikomeye yo mu Bubiligi. perezida wa TP Mazembe yamubujije kwimurwa, amutegeka kutagenda.\nAndi makipe yerekanye ko ashishikajwe n\u2019umukinnyi, amakipe y\u2019Ubwongereza (Blackburn, Hull City, Tottenham), ubufaransa (Nantes), ubugereki (Olympiakos), Tuniziya (Club Sportif Sfaxien, Esp\u00e9rance Sportif de Tunis, Club Africain, \u00c9toile Sportif du Sahel) na Ikipe ya Turukiya Galatasaray.\nInyandiko.\nTr\u00e9sor Mputu niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi mu mateka y'ibikombe by'amakipe yo muri Afurika, afite ibitego 41. Ari imbere yu munyamisiri Mahmoud Al-Khatib, ibitego 37."}
{"id": "16166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16166", "title": "Paul-Jos\u00e9 M'Poku", "text": "Paul-Jos\u00e9 M'Poku Ebunge, bakunze kwita Paul-Jos\u00e9 Mpoku akitwa kandi Polo Mpoku, (yavutse Ku ya 19 Mata 1992 i Kinshasa, muri Zayire) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo, Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati muri Incheon United.\nUbuzima.\nAtangira umupira w'amaguru abatarabigize umwuga, muri Cornesse. Hamwe na Luis Pedro Cavanda runaka mu makipe ye.\nPaul-Jos\u00e9 M'Poku yatangiye imyitozo muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge muri 2004. Mu 2008, yavuye mu Bwongereza yinjira mu kigo cy'amahugurwa cya Tottenham Hotspur. Nyuma y'ibihe bibiri hamwe nu rubyiruko rwiyi kipe, yatijwe umwaka umwe muri Leyton Orient.\nKu ya 19 Nyakanga 2011, yasubiye muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge aho yasinye amasezerano 4\u00a0 y'umwuga.\nKu ya 23 Ugushyingo 2012, yatsinze igitego cya mbere ku mutuku m'ugihe cya Standard de Lierse, umukino Standard yatsinze ibitego 3-0\nKu ya 26 Gicurasi 2013, yasinyiye ibitego bitatu ye yambere yatsinze 7-0 na La Gantoise kumukino wibizamini byi Burayi.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2013-2014, yaturikiye rwose mu ikipe ya Li\u00e9geois, yitabira imikino hafi ya yose yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019Ababiligi, maze aba umunyembaraga mu ikipe ye, hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi nka Michy Batshuayi by'umwihariko. Mu mpera zuyu mwaka wuzuye amarangamutima, M'poku azatsinda 12\u00a0 mu mikino 49\u00a0 yitabiriye. Standard izarangiza shampiyona ukurikira wu bubiligi, gusa ibuze umutwe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNi musaza wa Albert Sambi Lokonga, nawe umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru wa bigize umwuga."}
{"id": "16167", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16167", "title": "Issama Mpeko", "text": "Djo Issama Mpeko (yavutse Ku ya 30 Mata 1989 i Kinshasa, Zaire (ubu ni DR Congo)) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina iburyo inyuma kuri TP Mazembe. Yitoje mu ikipe ya Lumi\u00e8res Mbandaka no muri DC Motema Pembe. Muri 2011 yimuriwe muri As Vita Club yakinnye imikino 115 mu myaka 2 atsinda igitego kimwe. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2013, yasinyanye na Kaburscorp, muri Angola. Akina imikino 17 mu myaka 2 ariko azagu komereka. Muri 2015 yasinyanye na TP Mazembe."}
{"id": "16168", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16168", "title": "Samuel Moutoussamy", "text": "Samuel Moutoussamy, (yavutse Ku ya 12 Kanama 1996 i Paris) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya FC Nantes.\nUbuzima.\nKuva muri Guadeloupe binyuze kuri se, Samuel Moutoussamy na we afite inkomoko i kongo binyuze kuri nyina.\nAfite imyaka 8, yabanje gutekereza gukora siporo. Yashakaga kandi kwitoza jido kugirango yige kwirwanaho.\nIntangiriro.\nMu 2003, yatangiye umupira w'amaguru muri ikipe ya AS Meudon. Muri 2009, yinjiye muri INF Clairefontaine, imyaka ibiri mbere yo gutozwa. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2011-2012, Samuel Moutoussamy yageze i Lyon. Kuva muri shampiyona ya mbere, yagiye agaragara inshuro nyinshi hamwe na B bakina mu cyiciro cya kane.\nFC Nantes.\nYarekuwe na Olympique Lyonnais, yinjiye muri FC Nantes muri 2016, ubwo yakinaga n'ikipe yabigenewe. Umwanditsi w ibihe bibiri byiza, cyane yatsinze ibitego bitanu, yinjiye mu makipe ya mbere muri 2017. Yajugunywe na Claudio Ranieri mu mukino wo kwishyushya mu Budage na Ingolstadt. Yakinnye umukino we wambere ku mugaragaro Ku ya 12 Kanama 2017 na Marseille kuri La Beaujoire, maze atsinda igitego cya mbere nku munyamwuga n'ikipe imwe Ku ya 28 Mata 2019 kuri Velodrome..\nKu ya 16 Nyakanga 2019, Samuel Moutoussamy yongereye amasezerano indi myaka ibiri na Canaries, amuhuza n'ikipe ya Nantes kugeza muri 2024.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakiriye itoranywa rye rya mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ku ya 10 Ukwakira 2019 mu mukino wa gicuti na Alijeriya."}
{"id": "16169", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16169", "title": "Anthony Mossi", "text": "Anthony Mossi (Yavutse Ku ya 15 Gicurasi 1994 i Paris) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo Akina nk'u muzamu muri Neuch\u00e2tel Xamax FCS.\nUbuzima.\nMu guhitamo.\nYakinnye umukino wa mbere mpuzamahanga na DR Congo Ku ya 28 Gicurasi 2018 bakina na Nigeriya."}
{"id": "16170", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16170", "title": "Cedric Mongongu", "text": "C\u00e9dric Mongongu (yavutse 22 kamena 1989 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nka myugariro wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nAS Monaco.\nYageze kare cyane mu Bufaransa avuye muri Zayire, Mongongu afite ubwenegihugu bwa Kongo. Ashishikaye cyane nu mupira w'amaguru, yatangiye gukinira hariya mu ikipe ya Garenne-Colombes (Hauts-de-Seine) mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe ya Racing club de France afite imyaka 13, arangije ahakorerwa imyitozo ya AS Monaco muri 2005 hanyuma agaragara bwa mbere muri L1 muri 2007. Yamaze gutorwa mu izamu hagati, yahuye n\u2019Ubufaransa A 'mu mukino wa gicuti wabereye muri Espagne. Muri Monaco, ntarashyirwa mu mwanya runaka. Akenshi yakoreshwaga hagati, Ricardo yatangiye kuyikoresha mu kwirwanaho kubera ubushobozi bwayo bwo ku zamura. Akoreshwa kandi nk'inyura iburyo, asimburana na Fran\u00e7ois Modesto, aho atoroheye cyane kuruta muri myugariro wo hagati.\nKugira ngo yishyure ibikomere, yagaragaye gake cyane nka myugariro wo hagati. Amaherezo Mongongu yatsinze mu izamu ryo hagati, ihura na Nicolas N'Koulou imwe mu mpeta zo hagati mu Burayi.\nMu ntangiriro za shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010, C\u00e9dric yagumanye icyizere cy'umutoza mushya wa ASM, wamuhuje na S\u00e9bastien Puygrenier muri myugariro wo hagati. Yasinyanye amasezerano ya mbere y'umwuga y'imyaka 3. Yakinnye imikino 33 ya Ligue 1 muri shampiyona yamubonye asohoka. Birahumuriza kandi ni byiza gutangira, yanga abamurwanya. Umukino we mwiza rwose niwo wakinnye na Olympique de Marseille kuri V\u00e9lodrome. Imyitwarire ye myiza cyane yatumye aba ku gipangu cy'amakipe akomeye harimo na AC Milan.\nAmaherezo yahisemo gukomeza amarangamutima ya Monegasque. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere wa shampiyona yo muri 2010-2011 i Lyon ariko nyuma yaje gutakaza umwanya kubera imvune nimyitwarire ye."}
{"id": "16171", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16171", "title": "Benjamin Mokulu", "text": "Benjamin Mokulu (yavutse Ku ya 11 Ukwakira 1989 i Buruseli) ni umukinnyi ufite ubwenegihugu bw'umubiligi, umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo Yahindutse muri ravenna calcio.\nUbuzima.\nAmaze gukina mu makipe atandukanye y'urubyiruko mu Bubiligi, amaherezo yahisemo igihugu cye, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ihitamo rya mbere ryabonetse Ku ya 9 Gashyantare 2011 gukina na Gaboni. Yatsindiye Ballon d'or muri 2012, 2013 na 2015.\nKu 1 Nzeri 2014, yinjiye muri Ligue 1 na SC Bastia ku ntizanyo mu gihembwe kimwe, ahitamo kugurwa. Yegereye Sir Alex Fergusson gukinira Manchester United nyuma yicyo gihembwe. Azagabanuka kandi azakina iminota 110 gusa muri myunda wa Bastia mbere yuko KV Mechelen amuha muri AS Avellino, ikipe ya Serie B yo mu Butaliyani, aho yiyemeje kugeza muri 2017."}
{"id": "16172", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16172", "title": "Saio Mokili", "text": "Saio Ernest Mokili Yenga yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) wo mu mwaka wa 1960 na 1970.\nUbuzima.\nUmukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Congo-Kinshasa, yitabiriye AFCON muri 1968, atsinda igitego yatsinze Gana kandi atsinda irushanwa.\nIcyo gihe ni umutoza wa DR Congo muri 1997, mu buryo budasanzwe."}
{"id": "16173", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16173", "title": "Wilfred Moke", "text": "Wilfred Moke Abro, (Yavutse Ku ya 12 Gashyantare 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguruukomoka muri congo i Kinshasa. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya MKE Ankarag\u00fcc\u00fc.\nUbuzima.\nWilfred Moke yitabira Europa League hamwe na m'akipe Steaua Bucharest na Konyaspor.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo Ku ya 5 Nzeri 2017, kurwanya Tuniziya. Kunganya (2-2) biri mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 2018.\nYatoranijwe na Florent Ibenge kugirango azitabira CAN muri 2019. Ikipe ye yakuweho na Madagasikari kuri penariti."}
{"id": "16174", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16174", "title": "Gaston Mobati", "text": "Gaston Mobati (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Nzeri 1961 i L\u00e9opoldville apfa Ku ya 13 Gicurasi 1995) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru Ukomoka muri Zayire wakinaga nka rutahizamu.ku kirwa cya Reunion.\nUbuzima.\nYavutse Ku ya 4 Nzeri 1961 i Kinshasa, muri Kongo, Gaston Mobati wahoze ari rutahizamu arimo kwitoreza muri iki gihugu, mu ikipe ya AS Dragons i Bilima. Yatoranijwe mu ikipe yi gihugu mu basirikare bato, yahise ashakishwa na LOSC. Yatijwe ageze muri 1986/1987 muri Montceau Les Mines muri D2, Mobati yakinnye imikino 7 gusa atsinda ibitego 2. Agaruka i Lille muri 1987, Mobati yakinnye bwa 1\u00a0D1 na LOSC, Ku ya 17 Ukwakira 1987 bakina na Stade Lavallois. Yize ubucuruzi umwaka wa mbere hafi ya Cyriaque Didaux, Guy Lacombe, Jean-Pierre Meudic, itozwa na Georges Heylens. Muri 1987/1988, yagize ibihe byiza, ibitego 10 muri D1 na 3 muri Coupe de France, bizakomeza kuba umwaka mwiza w'umwuga we. Yahujije ibihe bikurikira hafi ya Angloma, Boli, Pel\u00e9, ntagitsinda amanota menshi. Ku buryo muri 89/90, LOSC iyobowe na Jacques Santini yamuretse anyerera mu myitozo. Mobati yambaraga umwenda wa Dogues inshuro 74 muri D1 (ibitego 19) na 16 muri Coupe de France (ibitego 8) kuva 1987 kugeza 1990. Yerekeje mu Bugereki muri Ethnikos Le Piraeus muri 1990, asubira mu Bufaransa muri 90/91 i Guingamp. Nyuma y'imikino 11 (ibitego 2) hamwe na En Avant de Guingamp, yarangije shampiyona muri AS Beauvais (imikino 2 yakinnye). Muri 1991/1992, yagumye muri ikipe ya Picard ariko nta mukino n'umwe yakinnye, amanika abambari be muri 1992, afite imyaka 31.\nGaston Mobati yapfuye Ku ya 15 Gicurasi 1995 ku kirwa cya Reunion. Umuhungu we Alphonse, wanyuze mu kigo cy\u2019amahugurwa cya Toulouse, na we yagerageje umwuga w\u2019umupira w'amaguru wahagaritswe muri 2008, kubera ko utaragera ku rwego rwo hejuru ugereranije na CFA n\u2019igihugu."}
{"id": "16175", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16175", "title": "Albert Milambo Mutumba", "text": "Albert Milambo Mutumba (wavukiye Mbuji-Mayi ku ya 1\u00a0Ukuboza 1984) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Umwanya akunda ni myugariro wo hagati."}
{"id": "16176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16176", "title": "Miche Mika", "text": "Mich\u00e9 Mika, (Yavutse ku ya 16 Nzeri 1996 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati muri TP Mazembe.\nUbuzima.\nYakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ku ya 10 Mutarama 2016, mu mukino wa gicuti yakinnye n'u Rwanda (gutsindwa 1-0).\nYitabiriye nyuma ya Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2016 yateguwe mu Rwanda. Muri iri rushanwa, akina imikino itatu. DR Congo yatsinze irushanwa itsinze Mali ku mukino wa nyuma, 3-0."}
{"id": "16177", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16177", "title": "Pamphile Mihayo Kazembe", "text": "Pamphile Mihayo Kazembe (yavutse Ku ya 17 Nzeri 1976 i Lubumbashi) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC) Akina nku mukinnyi wo hagati cyangwa myugariro wo hagati. Kugeza ubu ni umutoza wa TP Mazembe n'umutoza wungirije w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni se w'abana 4.\nUbuzima.\nMihayo akinira TP Mazembe, yitabiriye igikombe cy'isi cy'amakipe yo muri 2009 ndetse n'igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2010 aho yari kapiteni. Yakinnye umukino wa nyuma yatsinzwe na Inter Milan (gutsindwa 3-0).\nIbihembo.\nNkumutoza"}
{"id": "16178", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16178", "title": "Christopher Mfuyi", "text": "Christopher Nzay Mfuyi (Yavutse Ku ya 3 Nyakanga 1989)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo wavukiye i Geneve, mu Busuwisi. Yakinaga nka myugariro wo hagati hamwe na FC Stade Lausanne Ouchy.\nUmwuga.\nChristophe Mfuyi yagaragaye bwa mbere mu mwuga mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019Ubusuwisi hamwe na Servette FC muri 2007-2008. Yatijwe muriikipe ya Sportif Ch\u00eanois mu cyiciro cya gatatu muri shampiyona ikurikira mbere yo gusubira i Geneve muri 2009-2010. Mu mpeshyi yo muri 2010 yasinyanye na Valenciennes Football Club aho yatangiriye bwa mbere ku ya 26 Ukwakira 2010, muri Coupe de la Ligue yakinnye na Boulogne.\nKu ya 21 Kamena 2012, yagarutse mu ikipe ye yitoreza muri Servette FC."}
{"id": "16179", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16179", "title": "Mpangi Merikani", "text": "Mpangi Merikani (yavutse Ku ya 4 Mata 1967 i Kinshasa) icyo gihe muri Repubulika ya Kongo-Kinshasa, uyu munsi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo (DRC), wakinnye nk'u muzamu, mbere yo kuba umutoza. Umuhungu we, Jonathan Bolingi Mpangi, na we ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga w'abakinnyi.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye hagati muri 1984 na 1996.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 1988, 1992 na 1996. Yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza aya marushanwa muri 1992 na 1996.\nYakinnye kandi imikino itatu ibara icyiciro kibanza cy'igikombe cy'isi."}
{"id": "16180", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16180", "title": "Addy-Waku Menga", "text": "Ardiles-Waku Menga, (yavutse Ku ya 28 Nzeri 1983 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ukina nka rutahizamu.\nMenga yakuriye mu Budage. Yatangiye umwuga we wumwuga muri 2001 hamwe na VfL Osnabr\u00fcck, aho yatsindiye ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona yo muri 2006-2007 n'ibitego 15.\nMpuzamahanga.\nKugeza ubu afite amahitamo y gukinira Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16181", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16181", "title": "Tueba Menayane", "text": "Tueba Menayane (yavutse ku ya 13 Werurwe 1963 i Kinshasa, icyo gihe hari muri Repubulika ya Kongo-Kinshasa, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo (DRC), wakinnye nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nTueba Menayane yakinnye imikino igera kuri 169 atsinda ibitego 8 mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Porutugali hagati muri 1986 na 1993. Hamwe n'ikipe ya Benfica Lisbon, yitabiriye Igikombe cy'Uburayi cya Champion mu ikipe.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye hagati muri 1988 na 1992.\nAri mu itsinda ryatoranijwe mu gihe CAN yo muri 1988 na 1992. Yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza aya marushanwa muri 1992."}
{"id": "16182", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16182", "title": "Andrea Mbuyi-Mutombo", "text": "Andrea Mbuyi-Mutombo, (Yavutse Ku ya 6 Kamena 1990 i Buruseli) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga mu umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga mu ikipeya ikipe RNK Split.\nUmwuga.\nAndr\u00e9a Mbuyi-Mutombo yatangiye umupira w'amaguru mu makipe y'urubyiruko ya RSC Anderlecht. Muri 2006, yinjiye muri FC Bruxelles. Nyuma yu mwaka umwe, yasinyiye muri Portsmouth, ikipe yari yaramushakishije.\nHanyuma yagurijwe kuri SV Zulte Waregem Ku ya 22 Kanama 2008.\nYatsinze igitego cya mbere kuri Zulte Waregem, mu mukino na Mechelen, hashize iminota mike akandagiye mu kibuga. Yatsinze igitego cya kabiri mu mukino ukurikira na Tubize.\nNyuma y'amezi atandatu gusa i Zulte, imikino 14 no gutsinda ibitego bitatu, asubira muri Portsmouth mu gihe ya gombaga kuguma kugeza muri Kamena. Mu byukuri, ikipe ntiyigeze ishima imyifatire ye.\nKu ya 19 Kamena 2009, yasi nye amasezerano y'imyaka 2 na Standard de Li\u00e8ge. Muri 2011, ntabwo yinjiye muri gahunda z'umutoza Jos\u00e9 Riga, yavuye mu ikipe ya Li\u00e8ge yinjira muri Cercle de Bruges muri shampiyona. Byakoreshejwe cyane mu gihe cya shampiona, amasezerano ye ntabwo yongerewe. Yahise yerekeza muri Korowasiya, aho yinjiye mu ikipe ya HNK Rijeka.\nMuri 2015, yakoreye urubanza muri AJ Auxerre ariko ntiyagumaho nyuma yuru.\nNyuma yigihe cyiza mu ikipe ya Scottish club Inverness, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Korowasiya RNK Split.\nYavukiye mu Bubiligi, yahisemo guhitamo Abanyekongo mu ntangiriro zo muri 2010 agamije kwambara umwenda \"w'ingwe\". Yanze rero ubwenegihugu bw'Ububiligi kuko nk'uko ingingo ya 10 y'Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ibivuga, \u201cUbwenegihugu bwa Kongo ni bumwe kandi bwihariye. Ntishobora gufatirwa hamwe nizindi zose \u201d de la famille/LIVRE I DE LA NATIONALITE.htm 1."}
{"id": "16183", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16183", "title": "Mbala Mbuta", "text": "Mbala Mbuta (yavutse Ku ya 7 Mata 1985) ni umutoza muri wa congo (DRC) uvuka i Kinshasa, muri Kongo (DRC).\nUmwuga.\nMuri FC Les Star de Kinshasa niho yavumbuwe. Bidatinze yinjiye muri DC Motema Pembe. Ikipe ye yegukanye igikombe cya congo muri 2002 ndetse na shampiona ya Kinshasa, ibikombe byinshi bya shampiyona ya Kinshasa. Yatsindiye ibikombe 2 bya muri wa Kongo mu myaka ibiri yakurikiyeho ndetse n'indi shampiyona ya Kinshasa mbere yo kuva muri iyi kipe. Amaze gutsinda byinshi muri DC Motema Pembe (DCMP), yageze muri Isiraheli muri 2004 mu gihe kitari gito ku nguzanyo. Yinjiye mu ikipe ya Hapoel Tel-Aviv, yamazeyo amezi atandatu mbere yo kugwa mu Burayi aho azakinira mu Busuwisi muri Yverdon-Sport FC, iyi kipe yazamutse mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019Ubusuwisi. Ntabwo azwi n\u2019abanyaburayi, ariko asanzwe ari inyenyeri mu gihugu cye. Muri 2006, ikipe ye, Yverdon-Sport FC, yamanuwe mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019Ubusuwisi (Challenge League). Zurich Grasshopper noneho ihitamo kugura uyu mukinnyi utanga ikizere cyane. Ku ya 20 Kanama 2014, SO Cholet iratangaza ko yashakishije umukinnyi muri shampiyona itaha."}
{"id": "16184", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16184", "title": "Ekofa Mbungu", "text": "Ekofa Mbungu (yavutse ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 1948 icyo gihe muri Kongo y'Ububiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa Kongo (DRC), wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 2 (ku gitego kimwe yatsinze) hagati yo muri 1974 na 1976. Yari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974.\nYitabiriye kandi CAN muri 1974."}
{"id": "16185", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16185", "title": "Ilombe Mboyo", "text": "Ilombe \u201cPele\u00bbMboyo, (yavutse Ku ya 27 Mata 1987 i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wumubiligi uri mpuzamahanga ukina muri Royal Excelsior Virton nka rutahizamu. Ni urubanza rw\u2019Ababiligi rwo gusubira mu buzima busanzwe kuva yongeye gukina umupira w'amaguru nyuma atoranyirizwa mu ikipe y'igihugu nyuma yo gukatirwa igihano cy'igifungo. Icyakora, kugerageza kwimukira mu Bwongereza byavanyweho kubera ibyifuzo by\u2019abanyamigabane.\nUbuzima.\nIlombe Mboyo yavukiye i Kinshasa ageze mu Bubiligi akiri umwana, yavumbuye umupira w'amaguru muri Zellik Sport (1993-1997), nyuma yimukira muri Sporting d'Anderlecht afite imyaka igera ku 10 (1997-2001). Nyuma y'imukiye muri SC Eendracht Aalst (2001-2002) hanyuma yerekeza muri FC Bruges (2002-2005). Nyuma yinjiye muri Sporting de Charleroi aho yatangiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya mbere muri Ukuboza 2008.\nNyuma yimukiye muri KV Kortrijk muri 2010-2011 hanyuma asinyana na La Gantoise muri 2011. Biteganijwe ko azinjira mu ikipe y\u2019Ubwongereza Norwich City Football Club mu ntangiriro zo muri 2013, cyangwa akazasubira muri Anderlecht. Ku ya 7 Kanama 2013, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka 4 na KRC Genk. Igiciro cyo kwimurwa kingana na miliyoni 4.7 z'amayero, amateka ya club ya Limburg!\nKu ya 8 Ukwakira 2012, nyuma y'imvune ya Romelu Lukaku, yahamagawe kugeza kuri shitani itukura na Marc Wilmots ku mikino yo muri 12 na16 ; Ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2012 muri Seribiya no kurwanya Scotland. Iyi mikino ikinwa mu rwego rwo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi cya FIFA muri 2014. Arazi guhitamo kwe kwa mbere kurwanya Scotland kuri16 octobreKu ya 16 Ukwakira.\nIlombe Mboyo yakinnye umukino wo guhitamo \" Ingwe \u201dya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mukino wa gicuti wahuzaga Gambiya na DRC (3-0) i Banjul Ku ya 10 Kanama 2011, iyobowe na Robert Nouzaret. Kuva icyo gihe ntabwo yahamagawe mu ikipe ya Kongo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nIlombe Mboyo yageze mu Bubiligi akiri umwana. Ni umuhungu wa Ilombe Mboyo, wahoze ari perezida uhuza na AS Vita Club."}
{"id": "16186", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16186", "title": "N'Dinga Mbote", "text": "N'Dinga Philippe Mbote Amily (yavutse Ku ya 11 Nzeri 1966 i Kinshasa, icyo gihe muri Repubulika ya Kongo-Kinshasa, uyu munsi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo, wakinnye nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Vit\u00f3ria Guimar\u00e3es, yakinnye imikino 285 atsinda ibitego bigera 16 mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Porutugali hagati ya 1986 na 1996. Yitabira iyi kipe mu gikombe cya UEFA.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye hagati ya 1988 na 1998.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika cyo muri1992, 1994 na 1996. Yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza amarushanwa buri gihe."}
{"id": "16187", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16187", "title": "Ishyamba rya Kakamega", "text": "Ishyamba rya Kakamega ni ishyamba rikunda kugwamo imvura nyinshi riherereye mu ntara ya Kakamega na Nandi mu gihugu cya Kenya, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'umurwa mukuru Nairobi, rikaba kandi hafi y'umupaka wa Kenya na Uganda. \nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nIshyamba rya Kakamega riri ku butaka bufite hagati ya metero 1500 na 1600 z'ubutumburuke. Riri mazi y'uruzi rwa Isiukhu na Yala, izo nzuzi zombi zinyura mu ishyamba ry Kakamega mbere yo kwisuka mu kiyaga cya Victoria. \nIshyamba ririmo ibigega bifite kilometero kare 238, munsi ya kimwe cya kabiri cyacyo rikaba risigaye ari ishyamba kavukire. Mu majyaruguru y\u2019ishyamba ni hegitari 4,468 habaye Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cy 'ishyamba rya Kakamega, gihabwa imiterere y\u2019amashyamba y\u2019igihugu mu 1985. Mu majyaruguru gusa ni ishyamba rya Kisere. Mu mashyamba yose harimo uruhererekane rw'ibyatsi, rufite ubunini kuva ku rugero rwa 1 kugeza kuri 50.\nIbyerekeye ikirere.\nIshyamba rya Kakamega riratohagiye kandi rigwamo imvura cyane, ugereranije rigira 1200\u00a0mm - 1700\u00a0mm y'imvura ku mwaka. Imvura ni nyinshi cyane muri Mata na Gicurasi, hamwe na Kamena irimo izuba gato. Mutarama na Gashyantare ni amezi abamo izuba. Ubushyuhe burahoraho mugihe cyumwaka, hagati ya dogere selesiyusi 20 na 30. \nIbinyabuzima bitandukanye.\nIshyamba riri mu kibaya cya Victoria-savanna mosaic ecoregion. Ibimera n\u2019ibinyabuzima byo muri iryo shyamba birimo amoko menshi ajyanye n\u2019amashyamba agwamo imvura kenshi yo mu karere ka Gineya-Congoliya, aherereye mu burengerazuba mu kibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Kongo. \nIbimera biboneka muri parike harimo amwe mu mashyamba akomeye kandi yoroheje yo muri Afurika: icyayi cya Elgon \"(Olea welwitschii)\", inkwi zitukura \"(Prunus africana)\", umunuko wera, ubwoko bwinshi bwa croton, na \"Pouteria altissima\". Hariho ubwoko 380 bwanditse bw'ibimera. Ibi birimo amoko 150 y'ibiti n'ibihuru, n'ubwoko 170 bw'ibimera by'indabyo harimo amoko 60 ya orchide ifite amoko 9 aboneka muri iri shyamba gusa.\nIshyamba rizwi cyane ku nyoni zaryo, amoko y\u2019inyoni 367 Nibura inyoni 9 ntizisangwa ahandi. \nInyamaswa z\u2019inyamabere ziboneka muri parike zirimo ingurube yo mu gihuru, duikers, igihuru, otter yo muri Afurika itagira clawless, mongoose, igiti kinini cy\u2019amazi yo muri Afurika, ibisimba, pangoline, pcoline, amababi na primates zitandukanye zirimo inkende y'ubururu, inkende itukura, inkende ya De Brazza, baboon, potto na rimwe na rimwe inguge. Ingwe yagiye ivugwa rimwe na rimwe, ariko yagaragaye bwanyuma mu 1991. \nIbimera n\u2019ibinyabuzima byo mu ishyamba rya Kakamega ntabwo byigeze byigwa cyane.\nUbukerarugendo.\nIgice cyo mu majyepfo y\u2019ishyamba rya Kakamega, sitasiyo y\u2019ishyamba ya Isecheno iyobowe n\u2019ishami ry\u2019amashyamba rya Kenya nicyo gikorerwamo cyane mu ubukerarugendo. Hari igiti kizwi cyane kitwa Mama Mtere, igiti cy'amateka ni igiti gifotorwa cyane mu ishyamba rya Kakamega, hari n' ibindi biti by'imitini. \nUbukerarugendo rw iryo shyamba rwashimishije abantu bakomeye barimo Ambasaderi w\u2019Amerika ucyuye igihe muri Kenya Robert Godec warisuye muri Mata 2018 atangazwa n'ubwiza bwaryo. "}
{"id": "16188", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16188", "title": "Igishanga cya Rurambi", "text": "Igishanga cya Rurambi kiri mu karere ka Bugesera kiri ku buso bwa hegitari 1000 kikaba gihingwamo umuceri n\u2019ibigori, biteganyijwe ko kizongera ubukungu muri ako karere kuko kizajya gitanga umusaruro ugera kuri Toni 9600 z\u2019umuceri.\nUmushinga.\nKu bufatanye na Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi n\u2019umushinga ugamije guteza imbere ubuhinzi mu karere ka Bugesera (PADAB) bamaze gutunganya iki gishanga kikaba kizatangira gutanga umusaruro yuri mwaka. iki gishanga cyari cyuzuyemo urufunzo, mu gihe cy\u2019itumba kikuzura amazi aturutse muri Nyabarongo. Hakaba hatangiye kubakwa imiyoboro n\u2019urugomero ruzajya rwifashishwa mu gukamura igishanga igihe amazi ya Nyabarongo yabaye menshi no kuhira igihe yabaye make.Umushinga wose wo gutunganya igishanga watwaye miliyari 13 z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda ku mushinga wose, ariko ku buso bw\u2019igishanga buhingwaho kubutunganya byatwaye miliyari 7.5.\nUmusaruro.\nmu minsi mike iki gishanga kizaba cyatangiye gutanga umusaruro ugaragara. Duteganya ko nibura hegitari imwe izajya itanga umusaruro uri hagati ya toni esheshatu n\u2019umunani kandi kigahingwa kabiri mu mwaka. Dufite icyizere ko mu mwaka igishanga cya Rurambi kizajya gitanga umusaruro wa toni 9600 by\u2019umuceri.\u201d Mu rwego rwo guteza imbere ibivuye mu buhinzi kandi, mu karere ka Bugesera huzuye uruganda rwa \u201cMayange Rice Mill\u201d rufite ubushobozi bwo gutonora toni 50 z\u2019umuceri ku munsi.\nAbaturage.\nIki gishanga kimaze kuduteza imbere ku buryo butandukanye, twatangiye gukoreramo amafaranga mu mwaka wa 2010 none tumaze no kubonamo imirima yo guhingamo umuceri.Igishanga cya Rurambi ubuso bumaze guhingwa bugera kuri hegitari zisaga 300, abaturage bagihingamo bakaba bibumbiye mu makoperative ane."}
{"id": "16189", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16189", "title": "Igishanga cya Nyabarongo", "text": "Igishanga cya Nyabarongo Ubutaka Ni igishanga cya Leta, ni Ubutaka bwo mu gishanga cya Nyabarongo kimwe n\u2019ubw\u2019ibindi bishanga ni ubwa Leta. Ntibushobora kwegurirwa burundu abantu ku giti cyabo kandi nta wushobora kwitwaza ko abumaranye igihe kirekire ngo abwegukane.\nIbibazo byugarije igishanga cya Nyabarongo.\nNubwo igishanga cya Nyabarongo gifite akamaro cyugarijwe n\u2019ibibazo binyuranye bishingiye cyane cyane ku mikoreshereze yacyo icyangiza, ikanduza amazi, ikanahungabanya urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima. Ibyo bibazo bishingiye ahanini ku bikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi, ubucukuzi bwa kariyeri, ubwubatsi, imiturire, gutwika igishanga n\u2019inkengero zacyo n\u2019ibindi. Nyamara ibyinshi muri ibyo bikorwa birabujijwe cyangwa ababikora basabwa kubikorana ubwitonzi n\u2019ubushishozi buteganywa n\u2019amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza agenga ibishanga mu Rwanda. Bamwe mu baturiye igishanga cya Nyabarongo barahinga bagasenya inkombe z\u2019umugezi bakanatwika urufunzo ngo birukana inkende zibonera."}
{"id": "16190", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16190", "title": "Igishanga cya gatare", "text": "igishanga cy'Agatare mu Mirenge ya Ruhango na Bweramana mu karere ka Ruhango, bongeye guhabwa iki gishanga nyuma y'uko hari hashize imyaka 12 gihawe rwiyemezamirimo ariko akananirwa kukibyaza umusaruro.\nIki gishanga cy\u2019Agatare kibarirwa mu byanya bikomye, mu rwego rwo kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima. Gikorwaho n\u2019imirenge ya Butaro,Kivuye, Gatebe,Ruserabuye, Ruhunde na Ruhunde yo muri Ruhango na Nyankenke na Miyove yo muri Gicumbi Iki gishanga gifitiye igihugu akamaro kanini kuko aricyo soko y\u2019amazi y\u2019urugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi."}
{"id": "16191", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16191", "title": "Gutunganya ibishanga muri Gisagara", "text": "Mu guteza imbere ubuhinzi kuko butunze benshi mu Karere ka Gisagara hatoranyijwe ibihingwa bine byitabwaho kugira ngo abahinzi babashe kwihaza no gusagurira inganda n\u2019amasoko.\nTumenye Ibihingwa byagombaga guhingwa.\nMu Karere ka Gisagara haboneka ibishanga bifite ubuso bugera kuri hegitali 5000. Muri byo hamaze gutunganywa hegitali 2500 harimo izigera ku 1500 zatunganyijwe mu myaka itandatu ishize.Mu guteza imbere ubuhinzi kuko butunze benshi mu Karere ka Gisagara hatoranyijwe ibihingwa bine byitabwaho kugira ngo abahinzi babashe kwihaza no gusagurira inganda n\u2019amasoko.Ibyo bihingwa ni ibigori, umuceri, urutoki n\u2019ibishyimbo.Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere bwashyize ingufu mu gutunganya ibishanga bituma umusaruro w\u2019umuceri wiyongera.Muri gahunda yo kwigisha abahinzi guhinga kijyambere, gukoresha ifumbire mvaruganda n\u2019imborera no gutera imbuto y\u2019indobanure ndetse no gutunganya ibishanga ni byo byatumye umusaruro mu buhinzi wiyongera.ndetse no gukoresha neza amazi cyane mu bishanga ndetse no kuhira imusozi.Gutunganya ibishanga ni uburyo bwo gufata neza amazi, aho amazi ari make hakorwa uburyo bwo kuyongera, aho ari menshi akayoborerwa ahandi.Hari ibice bikibamo amazi menshi ku buryo ibigori n\u2019ibishyimbo bitahera, no mu gihe cy\u2019imvura hari ibice bitwarwa. Abahinzi bifuza uwabatunganyiriza igishanga neza.Umuyobozi w'Intara yamajyepfo mumwaka ushize yashishikarizaga abaturage bafite ibishanga kubikoresha neza, ariko bakanitabira kuhira kuko n\u2019ubwo mu bishanga haba harimo amazi ntaba ari mu mirima imbere.\nGutunganya ibishanga byagize umusaruro.\nUmusaruro wagiye uzamuka, mu mwaka 2015 abahinzi bezaga toni 4000 z\u2019umuceri ariko ubu bageze kuri toni hafi ibihumbi 10. Icyo bifuza ni uko bageze kuri toni ibihumbi 20 kandi bifuza kuzabigeraho nibamara gutunganya ibishanga bisigaye.Mu bigori naho umusaruro wariyongereye kuko kuri ubu abahinzi beza toni 4 kuri hegitari imwe; naho ku bishyimbo bakeza toni 1,48.Mu bishanga biteganyijwe ko bizatunganywa harimo icyitwa Nyiramageni gihuza Imirenge ya Gikonko, Mamba na Ntyazo gifite ubuso bwa hegitari 600. Ikindi ni icya Ngiryi nacyo kiri gushakirwa ubushobozi kugira ngo gitunganywe.Gutunganya ibyo bishanga bizajyana no gushyiraho uburyo bwo kuhira imyaka ku misozi ibikikije.Mu bijyanye no kuhira imisozi hegitali 625 zuhiwe hakoreshejwe imashini muri iyi myaka itandatu ishize, naho hegitali hafi 2800 zishyirwaho amaterasi y\u2019indinganire.Hubatswe ubwanikiro bw\u2019ibigori 42 n'ubw\u2019umuceri 28.Hubatswe uruganda rutunganya urwagwa n\u2019umutobe mu bitoki rufite ubushobozi bwo kwakira toni zisaga 900 mu kwezi kumwe. Rugemura inzoga mu Turere twa Gisagara, Huye, Nyaruguru na Nyamagabe ku buryo ku kwezi rwinjiza amafaranga agera kuri miliyoni 90Frw ajya mu baturage baruha ibitoki.Mu kwita ku musaruro hubatswe inganda zirimo urw\u2019umuceri ruri mu Murenge wa Gikonko rutunganya toni zigera ku 7800; hubakwa n\u2019urutunganya ibigori mo ifu."}
{"id": "16192", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16192", "title": "Igishanga cya Gasuma", "text": "Igishanga cya Gasuma, Abahinga mu bishanga bya Gasuma na Ruhoboba mu Murenge wa Simbi mu Karere ka Huye, barifuza gutunganyirizwa ibi bishanga ku buryo bajya babasha kubona amazi yo kuhira mu buryo bworoshye, bityo babashe kubibyaza umusaruro no mu gihe cy\u2019impeshyi.\nUbuhinzi.\nDufite igishanga cya Gasuma tujya duhingamo imboga n\u2019imbuto, ariko urebye ahanini mu mpeshyi nta mazi tuba dufite. Anyura hepfo, kuyifashisha ni ukujya kuyadaha.\u201dAkomeza agira ati \u201cUwadushyiriraho umuyoboro uca hejuru y\u2019imirima twabasha kubona amazi, tukajya duhinga no mu mpeshyi."}
{"id": "16193", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16193", "title": "Igishanga cya gatorove", "text": "igishanga cy\u2019Agatorove Ubundi kiri ku buso bwa hegitari 80, cyatunganyijwe mu mwaka w\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari yashize. Uyu ni umwaka wa kabiri gihingwa. Igishanga cya gatorove, Ni igishanga abahinzi baturiye igishanga cy\u2019Agatorove giherereye mu Murenge wa Mata mu Karere ka Nyaruguru, barishimira kuba cyaratunganyijwe bakanahabwamo imirima, ariko ubwanikiro bumwe bamaze kubakirwa ngo ntibuhagije.\nGuhinga.\nAbagihingamo bavuga ko kugitunganya byatumye basigaye bahinga bakeza bakanasarura, by\u2019umwihariko abatarakigiragamo imirima bakishimira ko na bo bahawemo aho guhinga. Iki gishanga cyari kibi cyane mbere y\u2019uko gitunganywa. Twahingagamo bwa yisi, ibijumba, ibishyimbo n\u2019ibindi. Nabwo kandi twahingaga mu gahande kamwe, ahandi ntihahingwe.\nUbwanikiro.\nUbwanikiro kandi ngo si ubw\u2019ibigori gusa kuko bushobora kwanikwamo n\u2019ibishyimbo, ndetse n\u2019ibyumba bibwubakwamo bigashobora kubikwamo ifumbire y\u2019imvaruganda, mu gihe abanyamuryango batarabasha kubyifashisha."}
{"id": "16194", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16194", "title": "Dieumerci Mbokani", "text": "Dieudonn\u00e9 Mbokani Bezua, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Dieumerci Mbokani, (Yavutse Ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 1985 i Kinshasa muri Zayire (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo)), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nka rutahizamu muri SK Beveren.\nikipe.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nIherezo ryu muryango wabana barindwi (bashiki bacu 2 nabavandimwe 5), abikesha izina rye rya mbere kubera ko nyina yategereje imyaka 8 kugirango amubone nyuma yo kuvuka kwa mukuru we.\nMuri TP Mazembe niho Dieumerci Mbokani yaje mu bye. Mubyukuri, guhera ku ya 1\u00a0gihembwe, asanzwe ari mu bayobozi b'iyi kipe. Bidatinze, yari umwe mu bagize ikip y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu gihe cyo kwitegura CAN yo mu Misiri kugeza umukino uzahuza Tuniziya. Kubwamahirwe macye, ntiyatoranywa muri 23 bazitabira iri rushanwa. Mbokani arasigaye, hagati aho, yari ntagereranywa arangije azakomeza gtanga akazi keza kandi nini kuri TP Mazembe.\nMu idirishya ryo kwimura impeshyi yi gihembwe cyo muri 2006-2007, yerekeje i Burayi, muri Anderlecht ku ntizanyo. Iyi kipe yamuhaye amahirwe make yo kwigaragaza kuko Franky Vercauteren yahisemo gukina Nicol\u00e1s Frutos na Mohammed Tchit\u00e9. Shampiyona irangiye, yakinnye byinshi kubera kubera imiterere mibi ya Mbo Mpenza n'imvune ya M\u00e9m\u00e9 Tchite.\nIbipimo bya Liege.\nMuri kamena 2007, yinjiye muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge yambara numero 9 (numero yabataka). Muri shampiyona ye yambere yuzuye, yatsinze ibitego 15 maze ashyiraho bombi buzuzanya kandi bakorana neza na Seribiya Milan Jovanovi\u0107 (ibitego 31 hagati yabo muri 2007/08). Yabaye shampiyo w\u2019Ububiligi kandi yamamaye ku bwumvikane kubera uburyo bwe butangaje ndetse n\u2019igihe cyo mu kirere.\nIgihe cyakurikiyeho, yakomeje gutsinda ibitego byingenzi, cyane na Everton kumwanya wa 1\u00a0UEFA (2-2), cyangwa na Sevilla FC (1-0). Muri shampiyona, Mbokani yatsinze ibitego 4 (ahanganye na Dender, Westerlo, Germinal Beerschot na Cercle Bruges), atsinda ibitego 16, arangiza uwatsinze ibitego byinshi aza ari uwa kabiri (inyuma ya Joseph Akpala) na gatandatu ku rutonde rwa Golden Boot 2008. Mu mpera za shampiyona yo muri 2008-09, Stuttgart yatanze miliyoni 15 z'amayero mu ikipe ya Li\u00e8ge. Umukinnyi yifuza gusubiza neza kuri iki cyifuzo ariko ikipe irashaka gukomeza rutahizamu wayo. Yemera ko \u201cyashinje inkoni. Ntabwo nari meze neza mu mutwe \".\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010, yatangiye shampiyona neza atsinda ibitego bitatu mu mikino umunani ariko nyuma yaje gusinzira nabi ariko akomeza gushyigikirwa na L\u00e1szl\u00f3 B\u00f6l\u00f6ni arangiza shampiyona atsinda ibitego 4 bito ku isaha, bidakwiriye ibihe byashize."}
{"id": "16195", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16195", "title": "Kapela Mbiyavanga", "text": "Kapela Mbiyavanga, (yavutseKu ya 12 Gashyantare 1976 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukina umupira wamaguru wa congo, ubu ni umutoza wa Uni\u00e3o SC do U\u00edge yo muri Angola, ukina muri Girabola \nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMu 1994, icyo gihe yari afite imyaka 18, yinjijwe muri DC Motema Pembe, ikipe iri mu gihugu cye kavukire. Yakinnye ibihe bitanu byose hamwe niyi kipe, atwara Linafoot eshatu, n'igikombe cyabatwaye igikombe muri 1994.\nAmaze kuva muri iyo kipe mu idirishya ryo kwimura imbeho 2000, yinjiye muri Atl\u00e9tico P\u00e9troles Luanda yo muri Angola. Mu mwaka wa mbere, yatsindiye Girabola n'i gikombe cya Angola. Yasubiyemo iyi mikorere shampiyona ikurikira. Mu 2002, yongeyeho Supercopa ya Angola.\nYageze kandi muri iyi kipe muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri CAF Champions League muri 2001. Yagaragaye cyane muri iri rushanwa, atsinda igitego mu matsinda yakinnye n'ikipe yo mu Misiri ya Al Ahly, nyuma inshuro ebyiri muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza n'ikipe yo muri Afurika y'Epfo ya Mamelodi Sundowns.\nMuri 2005, yatrijwe igihembwe mu ikipe ya Maritzburg yo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yagurijwe kandi muri 1 \u00b0 de Agosto muri 2007. Mu 2008, yimuriwe muri Kabuscorp SC, club aho yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru nk'umukinnyi muri 2010.\nMuri uwo mwaka, yabaye umutoza wungirije wa Kabuscorp SC, umwanya yari afite umwaka umwe. Yaje kuba umutoza wa Uni\u00e3o SC do U\u00edge muri shampiyona ya 2011/2012. Yongeye kuba umutoza w'iyi kipe muri Gicurasi 2014."}
{"id": "16196", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16196", "title": "Bedi Mbenza", "text": "Hugues Bedi Mbenza (Yavutse ku ya 11 Nzeri 1984 i Kinshasa) numupira wamaguru mpuzamahanga wa congo Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nHugues yatangiye umupira w'amaguru muri 2006, muri AC Mosi. Muri 2007, yinjiye muri TP Mazembe. Muri 2009, yatsindiye CAF Champions League na CAF Supercup. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2009, yatsinze igitego batsinzwe Pohang Steelers ku mupira yari ahawe na Tr\u00e9sor Mputu. Mu mwaka wo muri 2010, yatsindiye igikombe cya Shampiyona na Esp\u00e9rance de Tunis. Mu gikombe cyisi cya ikipe 2010 yongeye gutsinda na CF Pachuca.\nMu 2011, yinjiye mu ikipe yo mu Bubiligi ya RSC Anderlecht aho yakinnye imikino 14.\nMuri 2013, yinjiye muri Club Africain de Tunisiya yakinnye imikino 36 atsinda ibitego 2.\nMuri Kamena 2015, nta masezerano, yinjiye muri FC Renaissance du Congo."}
{"id": "16197", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16197", "title": "Chancel Mbemba", "text": "Chancel Mbemba (yavutse ku ya 8 Kanama 1994 i Kinshasa, muri Zayire (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo))ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Yakinnye kuva muri Nyakanga 2022 muri Olympique de Marseille nka myugariro wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nInkomoko y'umuryango.\nChancel Mbemba yakuriye i Kinshasa mu muryango w'abana 9. Nyina Antoinette ni umukinnyi wa basketball warinze amabara ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mbemba yize ibyamashanayarazi, nyuma yumwuga we, bishoboka ko yakwitoza muri uru rwego.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nRSC Anderlecht (2013-2015).\nYerekanwe na RSC Anderlecht, yageze i Buruseli muri 2011 aho yakinnye bwa mbere n'ikipe yizeye ya Sporting Anderlecht.\nKu ya 28 Nyakanga 2013, ku munsi wa mbere wa shampiyona yo muri 2013\u201314, Mbemba yatangiye gukinira Anderlecht na Lokeren, kimwe na mugenzi we Youri Tielemans. Nubwo baje gutsindwa, buriwese yashoboraga kubonako Chancel afite impano. Yakomeje guhuza imikino mu izamu hamwe na Cheikhou Kouyat\u00e9, asubiza Bram Nuytinck ku ntebe icyarimwe.\nKu ya 17 Nzeri 2013, yerekanye bwa mbere mu Burayi mu mukino wa Champions League wabereye i Lisbonne na Benfica.\nKu ya 19 Ukwakira 2013, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere mu mabara ya Anderlecht ku kibuga cya RAEC Mons, nubwo ya shinzwe bwa mbere nku mukinnyi w'inyuma.\nKu ya 10 Ugushyingo 2013, yatsinze igitego kimwe rukumbi cy'umukino mu kibuga cya Racing Genk yemerera ikipe ye gutsinda intsinzi ikomeye mu guhatanira igikombe gikomeye.\nKu ya 26 Ugushyingo 2014 muri Champions League, yatsinze ibitego bibiri kuri Galatasaray bituma Anderlecht irangiza ku 3 mu itsinda ryabo kandi ikamara igihe cy'itumba ry\u2019Uburayi.\nNewcastle United (2015-2018).\nKu ya 30 Nyakanga 2015, Newcastle yemeje ko Chancel Mbemba ari umukinnyi wayo.\nFC Porto (2018-2022).\nKu ya 23 Nyakanga 2018, yasinyanye amasezerano kugeza mu 2022 na FC Porto.\nMuri 2020, yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona ya Porutugali ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya Porutugali, cyane yatsinze ibitego bibiri ku mukino wa nyuma."}
{"id": "16198", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16198", "title": "Lelo Mbele", "text": "Blaise Lelo Mbele, (Yavutse Ku ya 10 Kanama 1987 i Kalemie) avukira muri DR Congo, ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru wa congo ukina nka rutahizamu muri ikipe ya Al-Ahli Manama.\nUbuzima.\nNyuma yo kwinjira muri CS Sfaxien muri 2007, yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 3 muri Arabiya Sawudite na Al-Hilal FC mu Ukuboza 2007. hari Ihererekanyabubasha rye rigera kuri miliyoni 1 yama yero. Lelo yinjiye mu ikipe yo muri Sudani ya Al Hilal Omdurman muri 2009; ikiguzi cyo kwimurwa kibarirwa ku ma yero 500\u00a0000\u00a0. Nyuma yakinnye muri Libiya (Al Nasr Benghazi), Maleziya (Selangor FA) na Turukiya (\u015eanl\u0131urfaspor). Muri 2012, yasinyanye n\u2019ikipe ya Alijeriya yitwa Mouloudia Club d'Alger yamugurije shampiyona irangiye muri CA Batna. Mu 2014, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Angola, Petro Atl\u00e9tico."}
{"id": "16199", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16199", "title": "Igishanga cya Rwasave", "text": "Igishanga cya Rwasave kiri hagati y\u2019akarere ka Gisagara n'akarere Huye.\nTumenye Igishanga cya Rwasave.\nAbahinzi bahinga muri icyi gishanga kizwi ku izina rya Rwasave gihuriweho n\u2019uturere twa Gisagara na Huye mu mwaka 2013 bavugaga ko nyuma y\u2019uko ubuyobozi bwayoboraga koperative ihinga umuceri buvuyeho bunyereje amafaranga angana na miliyoni 29 byatumye batangira gukorera mu gihombo. Basabaga ko inzego zibishinzwe zabakurikirana vuba icyo kibazo ibikorwa byabo by\u2019ubuhinzi bikongera kugenda neza nk\u2019uko byahoze mbere.Ubuyobozi bw\u2019iyi koperative bwavugaga ko nubwo iki kibazo kimaze igihe cy\u2019umwaka n\u2019amezi 6, cyashyikirijwe inkiko.Iyo koperative yakorera ibikorwa byayo by\u2019ubuhinzi k\u2019ubutaka bufite hegitali 103 buri mu gishanga cya Rwasave; Iki gishanga kikaba gihuriweho n\u2019imirenge 2 yo mu karere ka Gisagara ariyo Save na Kibirizi n\u2019 ibiri yo mu karere ka Huye, Mbazi na Ngoma.\nUmutekano munzira zambukiranya utwo turere.\nIgishanga cya Rwasave kigira inzira zikinyuramo zambukiranya utu turere twombi.Abaturage mu mwaka 2016 bavugaga ko mu masaha ya nimugoroba muri iyi nzira habaga hari insoresore zihabategera zikabambura ibyo bavuye guhaha,ndetse ngo rimwe na rimwe zikanahabakubitira.Abaturage kandi bavuga ko mu myaka ishize muri iyi nzira bahiciye umuntu avuye mu mujyi wa Huye,kuburyo mwicyogihe ngo nta muntu wari ugipfa kuhanyura ari wenyine mu masaha ya nimugoroba.Ubuyobozi bwahumurizaga kandi abaturage, bababwira ko n\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu zirimo zihakora uburinzi, bityo bakaba bakwiye gushyira umutima hamwe.Bavugaga ko nta muntu uzongera kugirira ikibazo aho hantu rwose ko ubuyobozi bwabihagurukiye,bufatanyije n\u2019abaturage ubwabo,bati nibahumure ntacyabananira."}
{"id": "16200", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16200", "title": "Junior Mbele", "text": "Junior Mbele, (Yavutse ku ya 15 Ukuboza 1995 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyiuri mpuzamahanga akaba ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo ukina nkuwo hagati mu kibuga, hamwe na HUS Agadir.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nJunior Mbele atangira umupira w'amaguru mu myitozo ya Daring Club Motema Pembe. Muri Werurwe 2020, yageragejwe muri club ya KAA La Gantoise ariko ananirwa gusinya amasezerano.\nKu ya 3 Ukuboza 2020, yiyandikishije mu gihembwe muri US Monastir. Ku ya 10 Ukuboza 2020, yakinnye umukino we wa mbere n'iyi kipe na CS Sfaxien (gutsindwa, 2-1).\nKu ya 14 Nzeri 2021, yiyandikishije muri shampiyona muri Al Nasr Benghazi.\nKu ya 26 Gashyantare 2022, yinjiye mu bwi sanzure muri Hassania d'Agadir.\nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nKu ya 18 Nzeri 2019, yakiriye bwa mbere mu mukino wa gicuti n'ikipe y'u Rwanda kuri Stade des Martyrs (batsindwa, 2-3)."}
{"id": "16201", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16201", "title": "Marcel Mbayo", "text": "Marcel Mbayo (yavutse Ku ya 23 Mata 1978 i Lubumbashi) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) \nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16202", "title": "Nsumbu Mazuwa", "text": "Emmanuel Nsumbu Mazuwa (yavutse Ku ya 24 Nzeri 1982 i Kisangani) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. Yitabiriye umupira w'amaguru mu gikombe cy'Afurika muri 2004 hamwe na DR Congo. yahizwemo mu ikipe y'igihugu inshuro 31 kuva 2002."}
{"id": "16203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16203", "title": "Michel Mazingu-Dinzey", "text": "Mich\u00e9l Sinda Mazingu-Dinzey (yavutse Ku ya 15 Ukwakira 1972 i Berlin, mu Budage) ni umukinnyi w'Umudage, Umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru, wabaye umutoza. Kugeza ubu ni umuyobozi wa Antigua na Barbuda Ku ya 7 Werurwe 2019.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga w'abakinnyi.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire ubu ni DRC, yakinnye imikino 33 (ku bitego 3 yatsinze) hagati yo muri 1996 na 2004.\nAri mu itsinda ryatoranijwe mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 1996, 2000 na 2004. Yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza aya marushanwa muri 1996.\nYakinnye kandi imikino ibiri ibara, imikino ibanza y'igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 1998, n'imikino ibiri ibara imikino ibanza y'igikombe cy'isi muri 2002."}
{"id": "16204", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16204", "title": "Jason Mayele", "text": "Jason Mayele (wavutse Ku ya 4 Mutarama 1976 i Kinshasa, Zayire hanyuma apfa Ku ya 2 Werurwe 2002 mu mpanuka yo mu muhanda) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Yakina nka rutahizamu.\nUmwuga.\nYashyinguwe mu irimbi ryu mudugudu wu mujyi wa \u00c9pinay-sous-S\u00e9nart."}
{"id": "16205", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16205", "title": "Mayanga Maku", "text": "Jean Adelard Mayanga Maku (yavutse Ku ya 31 Ukwakira 1948 muri Mbandaka) yari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru kuva muri za 1970 muri Zaire. Yakinaga nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nYakinnye kuva muri 1968 kugeza 1982 muri AS Vita Club, aho yiganjemo amarushanwa yi gihugu ndetse atwara igikombe cya Afrika cya Champion ikipe muri 1973.\nyari Umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Zayire kuva muri 1970 kugeza 1979, yarushanwe muri CAN muri 1972 (4, atsinda ibitego 3), CAN muri 1974 (yatsinze, n'ibitego 3), ni gikombe cyisi muri 1974 (1\u00a0kuzenguruka, imikino 3 yakinnye, ibitego 0).\nYatoje muri make ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 2001.\nAmaze gukinira mu Bubiligi, cyane mu mikino Olempike de Charleroi, yarahatuye. Umuhungu we Albert \"Alba\" Pemba Mayanga na we yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru mu rukurikirane rw'igihugu cy'Ububiligi. Abishywa be Micha\u00ebl na Jordan Mayanga nabo bakinnye mu cyiciro cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019Ububiligi."}
{"id": "16206", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16206", "title": "Ricky Mavuba", "text": "Ricky Mavuba Mafuila Ku Mbundu, witwa Ricky Mavuba, (yavukiye Ku ya 15 Ukuboza 1949 yapfuye Ku ya 30 Ugushyingo 1996) yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Zayire (ubu ni Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo). Ni se wa Rio Mavuba.\nUbuzima.\nKu myaka 15-17, Ricky Mavuba yakinnye mu byiciro bya komini kuri stade rusange ya Komine Matete (uyumunsi Stade Jean Kembo). Muri kiriya gihe (1964-1968), imbaga yi yi mikino yo hanze b'amwitaga Larousse, nkaho twavuga umuntu w'ibitabo, intiti cyangwa umuntu ukomeye w'umupira w'amaguru.\nMu 1968, afite imyaka 19, yatangiriye bwa mbere muri Vita Club mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019Umujyi wa Kinshasa, nku mukinnyi wo hagati wa gabye igitero muri sisitemu 4-2-4. Hagati mu kibuga, Mavuba aha sanga Kibonge Gento, inyenyeri ikomeye ya Kinshasa, na Diantela, umukinnyi mpuzamahanga hafi yo kurangiza umwuga we.\nInzobere mu kurasa ku izamu na virtuoso yo kurwanya ibitero, Ricky Mavuba agaragazwa no kurutondeka neza kwe, pasiporo ye yogejwe hamwe nu mfu ruka ye rimwe, bikarangirira mu rushundura. Ibi amaherezo bizamuhesha izina rya Ndoki ya Ndombe (Umupfumu w'umwirabura) na bakunzi ba Green na Black Club.\nMu 1970, igihe Kibonge yigaragaje nk'umukinnyi mwiza ku 10, ukina umukino wa Diantela hanyuma Diantela asubira inyuma, Ricky Mavuba na Maufranc Ma mbwene bahise batangira kwishyira mu kibuga hagati ya V Club."}
{"id": "16207", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16207", "title": "Chris Mavinga", "text": "Chris Mavinga, (Yavutse Ku ya 26 Gicurasi 1991 muri Meaux) ni umupira w'amaguru wumupira w'amaguru Ukomoka muri congo. Akina nka myugariro wo hagati muri Los Angeles Galaxy muri MLS.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nAmahugurwa.\nNi Mpuzamahanga mu makipe akiri muto y'ubufaransa, yatoje m'ukigo cyamahugurwa cya PSG. Chris Mavinga yifuzwa n'amakipe menshi, ariko amaherezo ni Liverpool ni yo ibasha kwinjizamo myugariro ukiri muto, mu mpeshyi ya 2009, ibangamira ikipe ye y'imyitozo ikomeje guhabwa indishyi z'a mahugurwa.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010, yakinnye mu ikipe ya Liverpool ya bigenewe kandi ntiyigeze agaragara rimwe n'ikipe ya mbere. Yakomeje gutsindira muri Shampiyona yu Burayi yabatarengeje imyaka 19 hamwe n\u2019Ubufaransa, afite umwanya wa myugariro w\u2019ibumoso.\nInguzanyo mu Bubiligi.\nNtabwo yabonye umwanya wo gukina shampiyona yakurikiyeho, kandi muri Kuboza 2010, yatijwe mu igice cya kabiri cya shampiyona muri KRC Genk mu Bubiligi kugira ngo abone umwanya wo gukina.\nMu mukino uheruka wa Play-offs ya 1 ya Shampiyona y\u2019Ababiligi muri 2010\u20132011 na Standard de Li\u00e8ge, yakomeretse atabishaka ariko akomeretsa bikomeye Mehdi Carcela mu maso, avurwa izuru, amenyo menshi kandi avunika urwasaya, umusifuzi Frank De Bleeckere amuhana ikarita y'umuhondo. Iyi mvune yateje impagarara mu Bubiligi. Mehdi Carcela yamaze mu bitaro amezi icumi.\nGaruka mu Bufaransa unyure mu Burusiya.\nKu ya 19 Nyakanga 2011, yasinye amasezerano y'imyaka ine na Stade Rennes.\nYimuriwe i Rubin Kazan mu mpeshyi yo muri 2013, asubira mu Bufaransa nyuma y'u mwaka. Intizanyo hamwe nu buryo bwo kugura kuri Stade de Reims Ku ya 30 Kanama 2014, afite intego yo kugarura ubuzima nyuma yo kudakina igice cya shampiyona mu Burusiya. Nubwo shampiyona itoroshye, yarangiye zirindwi gusa itangira muri shampiyona, yagarutse muri Ligue 1 muri shampiyona yo muri 2015-2016, kuriyi nshuro kuri ESTAC. Yirukanwe ku ya 32\u00a0umunota ukurikira amakarita abiri yu muhondo ku mukino wa mbere na Troyes, ku ya 15 Kanama 2015, na OGC Nice (3-3). afite igihe agarutse ahagaritswe mugihe cya 4,\u00a0umunsi wa shampionat, y'agize umukino mushya utoroshye icyumweru cyakurikiyeho, ahanganye na SM Caen (batsindwa 1-3), asimburwa kuri munota 40 na Quentin Othon."}
{"id": "16208", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16208", "title": "Zola Matumona", "text": "Zola Matumona Pitshu (Yavutse Ku ya 26 Ugushyingo 1981 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati muri FC Renaissance.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYageze muri AS Vita Club Kinshasa (imwe mu ma kipe akomeye ya DR Congo) nyuma yo kumara igihe muri ikipe yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri Styles du Congo. Yahise aba umukunzi w'abashyigikiye ikipe y'icyatsi n'umukara bamwitaga \"Icyumba\" yerekeza ku mukino, ugereranije n'umukinnyi w'umudage, Karl-Heinz Rummenigge. Yahamaze ibihembwe bitanu, yegukana igikombe cya shampiyo wa congo, ibikombe byinshi bya Kinshasa, yitabira CAF Champions League ndetse na CAF Cup hamwe ni kipe ye. Yatsindiye kandi igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza muri Kongo inshuro nyinshi mbere yo kuva mu ikipe ye. Yageze muri FC Bruxelles muri 2007 amafaranga bya mayero 60\u00a0000\u00a0.\nYahagaritse ku bushake amasezerano yagiranye niyi kipe nyuma y\u2019amagambo y\u2019ivangura yavuzwe na perezida waryo. Nk\u2019uko uwunganira uyu mukinnyi yabitangaza, Johan Vermeersch yari yatutse Matumona amusobanurira ko \"ntiyari akiri mu gihugu cye kandi yagombaga kwibagirwa ibiti n'i bitoki imbere y'abakozi n'a bandi bakinnyi. Uyu muyobozi yemeza ibyo yavuze ariko asobanura ko ari \"urwenya\".\nUyu mukinnyi yaje gusubukura amasezerano ye amuhuza niyi kipe kugeza muri 2009 nyuma yikiganiro na perezida wasabye imbabazi kumugaragaro kubyo yavuze."}
{"id": "16209", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16209", "title": "Ley Matampi", "text": "Vumi Ley Matampi (Yavutse Ku ya 18 Mata 1989 i Kinshasa) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukin ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umuzamu muri Football Club Renaissance du Congo.\nUbuzima.\nVumi Ley Matampi yatangiye umupira w'amaguru muri AS Vita Club nyuma yinjirayo, muri 2005, DC Motema Pembe. Yakinnye imikino 200 ya shampiyona niyi kipe mu myaka itandatu kandi yegukana igikombe cya shampiyona muri 2005 na 2008 ndetse ni gikombe muri 2006, 2009 na 2010. Imyitwarire myiza muri ikipe yatumye atoranya ikipe y'igihugu ya mbere, kumukino wa gicuti na Misiri. Ku ya 11 Kanama 2010. Yaje gukina ku munota 57 w'umukino, yatsinzwe ku manota y'ibitego bitandatu kuri bitatu, asimbuye Mulopo Kudimbana. Muri Gashyantare 2011, ari mu itsinda ryahamagajwe n'umutoza wa Kongo Santos Muntubile kwitabira amarushanwa ya Afurika y'ibihugu muri 2011. Nta mukino n'umwe yakinnye mu cyiciro cya nyuma yakinnye muri Sudani, aho DR Congo yatsinzwe muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza na Tuniziya n'igitego kimwe ku busa. Ukwezi kumwe, yahamagawe mu ikipe yigihugu ku nshuro ya kabiri, n\u2019umutoza w\u2019Ubufaransa Robert Nouzaret, ku mukino ubara imikino y\u2019amajonjora y\u2019igikombe cy'isi muri 2014, yakinnye na Maurice. Ntabwo ikina mugihe cy'inama yatsindiye ku bitego bitatu kuri nil.\nYinjiye Ukuboza 2011,muri Tout Puissant Mazembe basi nye amasezerano y'imyaka itandatu. Asanga muri iyi kipe afite ikipe yi gihugu Robert Kidiaba maze aba, nkuko byatoranijwe, umusimbura. Muri Mutarama 2012, yubashye guhitamo kwe kwa kane mu ikipe yi gihugu mu mukino wa gicuti na Oman birangira banganyije ibitego bibiri ahantu hose ariko nyuma akabura umwanya, kubera umwanya afite wo gusimbura ikipe. Yakinnye imikino cumi nine gusa muri TPM ye gukanye igikombe cya shampiyona muri 2012 na 2013. Yatijwe Ugushyingo 2013 kuri ikipe ya Angola yo Kabuscorp, iganje muri shampiyona wa Girabola."}
{"id": "16210", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16210", "title": "Alain Masudi", "text": "Alain Ekakanga Masudi, (Yavutse ku ya 12 Gashyantare 1978 i Kinshasa, muri Zayire ubu ni muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kuva mu 1997), yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri SC Bastia muri 1997, mbere yo kwinjira muri N\u00eemes Olympique, icyo gihe yakinnye muri Ligue ya 2. Nyuma yaje gusinyana na AS Saint-\u00c9tienne mbere yo kuva muri shampiyona y'ubufaransa burundu.\nYakiniye mu Busuwisi ahitwa Lausanne-Sports, hanyuma muri Otirishiya na Libiya.\nMu 2004, yageze muri Isiraheli akina mu ma kipe menshi yi cyiciro cya mbere cya Isiraheli. Muri 2008, yasinyanye na Maccabi Herzliya, ikipe yo mu cyiciro cya Isiraheli.\nNi umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa congo, yitabiriye cyane igikombe cya Afrika muri 2004 aho yatsinze igitego kimwe gusa, na Gineya. Kubera ko iyi CAN imwe, atagihamagarwa mu ikipe yigihugu.\nUbuzima bwite.\nHagati ya 2000 na 2003 ya banaga n\u2019umunyamakuru wa televiziyo Francesca Antoniotti, babyarana umuhungu witwa Enzo, wavutse muri 2002."}
{"id": "16211", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16211", "title": "Arthur Masuaku", "text": "Arthur Masuaku (Yavutse ku ya 7 Ugushyingo 1993 i Lille) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Ni umukinnyi w'inyuma mu kibuga kuri Besiktas JK, ku nguzanyo ya West Ham United.\nUbuzima.\nYateye intambwe ya mbere atangirira muri ikipe ya L'OS Fives i Lille. Muri 2006, yinjiye mu kigo cya banjirije imyitozo cya Li\u00e9vin, hamwe na Rapha\u00ebl Varane. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere muri Ligue 1 mu ikipe y'ababyeyi ku ya 10 Kanama 2013 na Toulouse. Yakomeje akomeza kwitwara neza nubwo ibihe bitoroshye ikipe ye yarimo, iguma muri zone yabamanuka. Hamwe n\u2019umutoza w\u2019Ububiligi Ari\u00ebl Jacobs ku buyobozi bw'ikipe, byemejwe ko afite umwanya wo gutangira nta gushidikanya ibumoso.\nYatsinze igitego cye cya mbere muri Ligue 1 ku ya 29 Mutarama 2014, mu mukino wahuje Olympique de Marseille kuri Stade V\u00e9lodrome.\nIbihembo.\nMu mabara ya Olympiakos, yabaye shampiyo w\u2019Ubugereki kabiri muri 2015 na 2016 kandi ye gukana igikombe cy\u2019Ubugereki muri 2015."}
{"id": "16212", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16212", "title": "Kilasu Massamba", "text": "Kilasu Massamba, (yavutse Ku ya 22 Ukuboza 1950 muri Kongo Mbiligi, apfa Ku ya 25 Kamena 2020),ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga wa congo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yegukanye umwanya wa kane mu gikombe cy'Afurika cyo muri 1972 ndetse anakina igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1976. Yagize kandi uruhare mu gutoranya impaka z\u2019igikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974.\nMuriikipe, yambara amabara ya CS Imana na AS Bilima."}
{"id": "16213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16213", "title": "Amedee Masasi", "text": "Am\u00e9d\u00e9e Masasi Obenza, (yavutse Ku ya 11 Nzeri 1991 muri DR Congo) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina nka myugariro wo hagati muri AS Vita Club Kinshasa. Yatoranijwe bwa mbere mu ikipe yi gihugu kwitabira CAN muri Kameruni. Hamwe na DRC, yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza, aho bakuweho ni gihugu cyakiriye Kameruni. Ibitego bye yatsinze mu gihe cyo guhagarara byamuhesheje izina \"Zombie ni mugoroba\". Mu 2021, yabaye shampiyo w'umupira w'amaguru muri DRC hamwe na AS Vita Club. Muri 2022, yasinyanye na TP Mazembe.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nyje muri AS Vita Club, muri 2020, muri igihembwe cyo muri 2020 kugeza 2021..\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu kuri Ku ya 12 Mutarama 2021, mu mukino wa gicuti na Tanzaniya (1-1).\nNyuma yaho, muri Shampiyona y\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika yo 2020 yateguwe muri Kameruni, yitabiriye imikino ine yakinnye n\u2019ingwe maze atsinda ibitego bibiri birimo kimwe na Libiya na Nigeri.\nUrebye uko yitwaye mu gikombe cy\u2019umupira w'amaguru cya Afurika giheruka muri 2020, azahamagarwa mu ikipe nkuru ya DR Congo n'umutoza w\u2019igihugu Christian N'Sengi mu mikino izakina na Gabon na Gambiya mu izina ry\u2019igikombe cya Afurika muri 2021 cya Amajonjora y\u2019i bihugu."}
{"id": "16214", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16214", "title": "Budge Manzia", "text": "Budge Manzia, (yavutse Ku ya 24 Nzeri 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC) ukina nka rutahizamu i Dukla Prague.\nMuri club.\nBudge Manzia yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe ya Sharks XI yo muri Kongo. Muri Mutarama 2013, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Tuniziya yitwa \u00c9toile Sportive du Sahel. Muri Mutarama 2014, yi mukiye mu Burayi no mu gihugu cya Ceki muri Dukla Prague.\nMu guhitamo.\nBudge Manzia yitabiriye irushanwa rya Toulon muri 2013, Igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2013 ndetse n\u2019umupira w'amaguru wa Afurika muri 2013 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Congo."}
{"id": "16215", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16215", "title": "Parfait Mandanda", "text": "Mandanda itunganye, (yavutse Ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1989 muri Nevers mu Ubufaransa), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga wa congo ukina nkumuzamu.\nNi uwa kabiri mu bavandimwe b'abazamu b'abigize umwuga hamwe na Steve Mandanda (wavutse mu 1985, mpuzamahanga w\u2019Abafaransa), Riffi Mandanda (wavutse mu 1992, Umunyamahanga wa Kongo) na Over Mandanda (yavutse mu 1998).\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga w'abakinnyi.\nMandanda yatojwe muri SM Caen, yinjiye mu kigo cy\u2019umwuga cya Girondins de Bordeaux (CFA) muri 2007. Mu gushaka igihe cyo gukina shampiyona ihanitse, yagerageje inshuro nyinshi ashyigikira muri Paris FC, Entente Sannois Saint-Gratien bombi mu ikipe y'iGihugu, no ku kigo cy'amahugurwa cya RC Lens, kigaragaza ko kidashoboka.\nAS Beauvais.\nMuri Mutarama 2009, yanze amasezerano avuye mu mujyi wa Ipswich mu Bwongereza, amaherezo kugirana amasezerano na AS Beauvais, mu Gihugu. Ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2009, akina umukino we wa mbere k'umugaragaro muri Aviron bayonnais, usibye umukino w'onyine wemewe y'itabira. Yamanuwe muri cyiciro cyakurikiyeho nk'umuzamu wa gatatu mu ikipe ya Picard kandi amaherezo nti yagumishijwe mu mpera za shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010.\nAltay Izmir.\nMuri Nyakanga 2010, Parfait Mandanda asinyana na Altay \u0130zmir, ikipe ya kabiri yo muri Turukiya. Yahujwe inshuro 12 mu minsi 36, yungutse uburambe muri shampionat nto. Kubwamahirwe, kurwego rusange, kwihanganira biragoye kuva ikipe idahunga kumanuka m'ucyiciro cya gatatu. Umukinnyi noneho ahagarika uburambe bwe muri Turukiya agerageza gusubira i Burayi.\nIbihembo.\nMu ma club.\nYabaye shampiyo wa D2 mu Bubiligi muri 2012 hamwe na Sporting de Charleroi.\nMu guhitamo.\nHamwe na DR Congo, yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2015."}
{"id": "16216", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16216", "title": "Mambwene Mana", "text": "Mambwene Mana (yavutse Ku ya 10 Ukwakira 1947 hari muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wumupira wamaguru wa congo (DRC), wakinnye nku mukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 10 mu marushanwa yateguwe na FIFA, nta gitego yatsinze, muri 1974.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage, yakinnye imikino itatu: kurwanya Sikotilande, Yugosilaviya na Burezile.\nYitabiriye kandi igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1974 cyatsinzwe n'ikipe ye."}
{"id": "16217", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16217", "title": "Mike Mampuya", "text": "Mike Mampuya-Mawawu Willems (yavutse Ku ya 17 Mutarama 1983 i Verviers, mu Bubiligi) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo.\nAkina nka myugariro w'iburyo. Muri Gicurasi 2014, yasigaye nta masezerano afite na makipe ye ya nyuma, ariyo Livingston Football Club.\nUmwuga.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nMike Mampuya yatoranijwe rimwe gusa mu ikipe y'igihugu ya congo, Ku ya 9 Gashyantare 2011 ku mukino wa gicuti na Gaboni."}
{"id": "16218", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16218", "title": "Emeka Mamale", "text": "Emeka Esanga Mamale (yavutse Ku ya 21 Ukwakira 1977 muri Zayire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo arapfa Ku ya 25 Kamena 2020 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi wari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinaga nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire ubu ni DRC, yakinnye hagati yo muri 1996 na 2001.\nAri mu itsinda ryatoranijwe mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 1996, 2000 na 2004. Yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa yo muri 1998.\nYakinnye kandi imikino ine ibara imikino ibanza y'igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 1998 \nAbapfuye.\nYapfuye ku ya 25 Kamena 2020 mu bitaro bya Saint Joseph i Limete (Kinshasa) nyuma y'uburwayi."}
{"id": "16219", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16219", "title": "Jean-Marc Makusu Mundele", "text": "Jean-Marc Mundele Makusu, (Yavutse Ku ya 27 Werurwe 1992 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Yakinnye nka rutahizamu hamwe n'itsinda rya Orlando Pirates muri Afrika yepfo muri 2019. Kuri ubu akinira AS Vita Club yi Kinshasa.\nUbuzima.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Ceforbel Club, nanone yitwa Bel'Or Training Center yi Kinshasa, iyobowe na Perezida Lolo Mosango Ebisa wabashije kwitoza no kuzamura umukinnyi.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, yinjiye mu Burayi no mu ikipe y'Ububiligi ya Standard de Li\u00e8ge. Nyuma yaje gutizwa mu ikipe ya Ujpest FC yo muri Hongiriya, aho atigeze akina umukino n'ikipe ya mbere.\nJean-Marc Mundele Makusu yitabira Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2014 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yakinnye imikino 3 atsinda ibitego 2 muri iri rushanwa.\nJean-Marc Makusu Mundele niwe mukinnyi ukina hagati wa V.club wari uhari, hamwe na mugenzi we Glody Ngonda hamwe n\u2019umunyekongo Bobo Ungenda, mu ikipe isanzwe y\u2019amarushanwa hagati ya CAF (C1 na C2) muri 2018. Kuri ubu ari muri FC Saint Eloi Lupopo\nMenya ko Makusu, nubwo C2 ya CAF yanyuma yatsinzwe muri 2018 hamwe na V.club, tuzi ko ari:"}
{"id": "16220", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16220", "title": "Rene Makondele", "text": "Ren\u00e9 Muzola Makondele (yavutse Ku ya 20 Mata 1982 i Kinshasa) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya Suwede Sandvikens NIBA.\nIbihembo.\nRen\u00e9 Makondele yatsindiye shampiyona ya Suwede hamwe na Djurg\u00e5rdens NIBA muri 2002 na 2003. Niwe kandi wegukanye igikombe cya Suwede mu 2002 na 2016."}
{"id": "16221", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16221", "title": "Cedric Makiadi", "text": "C\u00e9dric Makiadi Mapuata (yavukiye Kinshasa ubu ni DR Congo Ku ya 23 Gashyantare 1984) ni umukinnyi ukina w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Kuri ubu akina nk'u mukinnyi wo hagati muri \u00c7aykur Rizespor.\nUbuzima.\nUmuhungu w'uwahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo, Richard Mapuata, yageze mu Budage n'umuryango we wose afite imyaka 8\u00a0. Muri iki gihugu niho yakuriye kandi ahugurwa i Wolfsburg. Nyuma yo kubanza kwanga icyifuzo cyo gutoranya mu ikipe ya Kongo guhatanira CAN muri 2006, yemeye gukinira igihugu cya babyeyi be muri Gashyantare 2007 nyuma yi gihe cyo gutekereza."}
{"id": "16222", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16222", "title": "Sabhou Makengo", "text": "Makindu \"Sabhou\" Makengo, (yavutse Ku ya 4 Gicurasi 1964 i Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nSabhou Makengo yakiniye muri Calais RUFC, yo muri US Boulogne C\u00f4te d'Opale na RC Lens.\nWe ubwe ni umuhungu w'umupira w'amaguru, ni se wa bana batanu barimo Terence Makengo, nawe ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga."}
{"id": "16223", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16223", "title": "Yves Makabu-Makalambay", "text": "Yves Makabu-Makalambay, (yavutse Ku ya 31 Mutarama 1986 i Buruseli) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umuzamu.\nUmwuga.\nYves Makabu-Makalambay yabanje kwinjira muri ikipe ya RSC Anderlecht hanyuma yinjira muri PSV Eindhoven muri 2002. Nyuma y'umwaka yimukiye muri Chelsea, ari naho yarangirije imyitozo muri 2005. Yinjiye muri nucleus ya bigize umwuga nku muzamu wa gatatu mu ntangiriro zo muri 2006 mbere yo gutizwa i Watford amezi atandatu Ku ya 18 Gashyantare 2006. Igihembwe kirangiye, yahisemo kuva mu ikipe ya Hibernian yo muri Ekose imuha aho yatangirira.\nHibernian.\nMuri Sikotilande, yabaye umunyezamu wambere wiyi kipe mu myaka ibiri, akina imikino igera kuri mirongo itandatu. Yaje gutakaza umwanya we asanga ari umunyezamu wa gatatu mu nzego, cyane nyuma y\u2019umubano mwiza n'umutoza John Hughes.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYafashwe nk'umuzamu wa kabiri na Jean-Fran\u00e7ois De Sart mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008, yakurikiranye icyiciro cya mbere avuye ku ntebe. Yaje gukina iminota 20 yanyuma ya kimwe cya kane kirangiza yakinnye n'Ubutaliyani, nyuma yimvune ya Logan Bailly.\nusubirwamo hamwe na \"\"Amashitani atukura\" mu m'ukino wa gicuti utemewe na Standard de Li\u00e8ge muri Gashyantare 2008, aho yakinnye kimwe cya kabiri.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, yahisemo kwambara amabara ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, igihugu akomokamo, nyuma y'ukwezi kumwe apfuye. Yakinnye umukino wa mbere muri Gicurasi na Arabiya Sawudite. Muri rusange, ya mbaraga umwenda wa congo inshuro enye."}
{"id": "16224", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16224", "title": "Ishyamba rya Achimota", "text": "Ishyamba rya Achimota ni ishyamba rinini riherereye muri Achimota mu karere ka Okaikwei mu majyaruguru ya Accra; riherereye nko muri kilometero 7,6 uvuye Accra mu gihugu cya Gana. NI ishyamba ririnzwe kandi ribungabunzwe kugirango hadakorerwamo ibyangiza ibinyabuzima biririmo nko guhiga, kubakamo amazu. iryo shyamba kandi ryifashishwa mu kugenzura ibyuka bihumanya ikirere aho muri Accra.\nAmateka.\nIshyamba ryashyizwe mu igazeti mu 1930 kandi rifite ubuso bungana na hegitari 494.95. Kugeza ubu, ingano y\u2019amashyamba agera kuri hegitari 360. Ishyamba rya Achmota ryashyizweho kugirango habeho umupaka hagati y'umujyi wa Accra n'ishuri rya Achimota. Inyinshi mu nyamaswa zo muri Zoo ya Accra zimuriwe mu gasozi igihe hubakwaga ingoro ya Perezida. Kugeza ubu, icungwa nka arboretum hamwe n\u2019ikigo cyita ku nyamaswa. Inyamaswa nka python, ingamiya, imbuni, impyisi, inkende nizindi zishobora kuboneka mu mashyamba. \nIbiriho.\nKomisiyo ishinzwe amashyamba ya Gana yateganyaga guhindura amashyamba ikaba ikigo cy\u2019ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku bidukikije cyiswe \"Parike ya Accra Eco\". Biteganijwe ko hazaba hari amazi, amazi y'umunyu, ahantu nyaburanga, ubusitani, ubuvuzi bw'amatungo, kumenyekanisha ibinyabuzima, ahantu hakambikwa, umuhanda hakanzitirwa. \nImpaka.\nMuri Gicurasi 2022, byavuzwe ko ibice by'ishyamba byashyizwe ahagaragara nk'ishyamba. Samuel Abu Jinapor yahakanye ko Guverinoma yashyize mu kinyamakuru inyandiko nyobozi (EI) kugira ngo yemeze kongera kugenwa, kugurisha cyangwa guteza imbere ishyamba. Umuryango witwa umuryango wa Owoo wavuze ko ari ba nyir'ubutaka bwa mbere bufite amashyamba. Hagati ya 1921 na 1927, isambu yahawe na guverinoma y'abakoloni ku ishuri rya Achimota. Mu itangazo, uyu muryango wavuze ko batabonye indishyi z\u2019ibyo baguze mu 1927. Uyu muryango kandi wavuze ko bababaye, 'akarengane gakabije k\u2019amateka' kubera ko batigeze bigarurira igihugu. "}
{"id": "16225", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16225", "title": "Imisozi ya Ngong", "text": "Imisozi ya Ngong ni impinga iherereye mu kibaya kinini cya Rift, giherereye mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba hafi ya Nairobi, mu majyepfo ya Kenya. Ijambo \"Ngong\" ni ijambo ryaturutse mu rurimi rw'abamasayi mu nteruro yabo igira iti \"enkong'u emuny\" bisobanura isoko y'imvubu, kandi iri zina rikomoka ku masoko aherereye hafi y'umujyi wa Ngong. \nImiterere.\nImisozi ya Ngong, iva ahahanamye h'iburasirazuba yerekeza parike y'igihugu ya Nairobi, no mu majyaruguru, umujyi wa Nairobi. Impinga y'imisozi ya Ngong ni metero 2,460\u00a0 hejuru y'inyanja. \nMu myaka y'ubutegetsi bw'abakoloni b'Abongereza, agace gakikije imisozi ya Ngong kari agace gakomeye ko guhinga, kandi amazu menshi ya gikoroni aracyagaragara muri ako gace. Muri filime \"yitwa Hanze ya Afurika yakinnywe mu mwaka wa\" 1985, impinga enye z\u2019imisozi ya Ngong zigaragara inyuma y\u2019amashusho menshi hafi y\u2019inzu ya Karen Blixen. Abaturage baho baracyavuga ko babonye intare k'umusozi mu myaka ya za 90. Imva yonyine ya Denys Finch Hatton, iherereye mu burasirazuba bw'imisozi ya Ngong, yitegeye parike y'igihugu ya Nairobi.\nHari inzira igenda hejuru y'imisozi ya Ngong. Serivisi ishinzwe amashyamba ya Kenya ifite ibiro munsi ya parike..Abaturage baho rimwe na rimwe bagiye bakora ibikorwa byo guteranira hamwe basenga ku cyumweru ku mpinga y\u2019amajyepfo y'iyo misozi, bareba ikibaya kinini cya Rift.\nHafi y'imisozi ni umujyi wa Ngong. Sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi ya Ngong Hills yarangiye kubakwa mu mwaka wa 2015. \nSerivisi ishinzwe amashyamba muri Kenya itanga abayobora bakanarinda umutekano wa bamukerarugendo bakishyura amafaranga y'inyongera."}
{"id": "16226", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16226", "title": "Umugezi wa Yala", "text": "Umugezi wa Yala ni umugezi rwo mu burengerazuba bwa Kenya, uruzi rw'ikiyaga cya Victoria. Ubusanzwe itemba vuba hejuru y'urutare inyuze mu kibaya kinini mbere yo kwinjira mu mugezi wa Nzoia gukora igishanga cya Yala k'umupaka w'ikiyaga cya Victoria. Ubutaka bukikije umugezi wa Yala ahanini burahingwa cyangwa bugakoreshwa mu kuragira, hamwe n\u2019ibisigisigi bike by\u2019ishyamba rya kimeza. Isuri y'ubutaka irahagaragara mu kibaya cy'uwo mugezi, cyane cyane mu bice byo hepfo yawo. Imishinga irakomeje yo gukoresha uruzi amashanyarazi.\nImiterere y'Umugezi wa Yala.\nUmugezi wa Yala uzamuka muri Nandi mu Ntara y'ikibaya cya Rift, muri Kenya. Itemba iburengerazuba kuri 219 kilometres ku munwa wacyo ku kiyaga cya Victoria mu Ntara ya Kisumu, mu gihugu cya Kenya. [1] umwe mu nzuzi nini zo muri Kenya zigaburira ikiyaga cya Victoria, ikigereranyo cya meterokibe 27.4 mu isegonda. [2] rutanga hafi 5% byinjira mu kiyaga cya Victoria buri mwaka. [3]\nIgishanga cya Yala ku nkombe z'umugezi gifite kirometerokare 175 ku nkombe y'amajyaruguru y'Ikiyaga cya Victoria. [1] Igishanga kirimo hegitari 1,500. Ikiyaga cya Kanyaboli, igishanga cy\u2019amazi meza ya deltaic gifite ubujyakuzimu bwa metero 3 metres, igaburirwa n\u2019amazi y\u2019inzuzi za Nzoia na Yala hamwe n\u2019amazi atemba ava mu kiyaga cya Victoria. Ikiyaga gitanga ubuhungiro bw' amoko menshi y\u2019amafi atakiboneka mu kiyaga cya Victoria. [6]\nIkibaya.\nIkibaya cy'amazi ya Yala gifite kilometerokare 3,351. [1] Ubushakashatsi ku micungire y\u2019ibidukikije ku kibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Yala na Nzoia bwasohoye raporo y'ibanze mu 2008. inyiigo yakorewe ku bantu batatu bahagarariye 10 kuri 10 kiromrterokare z'uduce tw'ubutaka mu kibaya cya Yala. Muri [11] uko ari bitatu igice kinini cy'ubutaka bwahinzwe. Ibihingwa ngandurarugo birimo ibigori, ibishyimbo, amasaka, igitoki, imyumbati n'ibijumba, mu gihe ibihingwa ngengabukungu birimo icyayi, ingano n'imyembe. [12]\nImishinga y'amashanyarazi.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2016, ubushakashatsi bwakozwe bushoboka bwo guteza imbere urugomero rwa Nandi rwo gushyigikira kuhira imyaka, gutanga amazi no kubyaza amashanyarazi. Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwaba rufite tiribine ebyiri za MW 25 Pelton kandi rutanga 185 GWh buri mwaka. [22] Muri Mata 2020 hatangajwe ko Tembo Power ya Maurice, hamwe na Metier na WK Construction yo muri Afurika y'Epfo basinyanye amasezerano yo guteza imbere urugomero rw'amashanyarazi ruva mu ruzi rwa Yala. Sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi ya Kaptis yagombaga kugira ubushobozi [23] 15MW kandi izatangira gukora mu 2022. Umushinga uzatwara miliyoni 30 z'amadolari. Amashanyarazi yagaburirwa umuyoboro ukorwa na leta ya Kenya Power and Lighting Company (KPLC). [24] Urugomero rw'amashanyarazi rwagombaga kuba hafi y'umujyi wa Kakamega. [25]"}
