{"id": "16228", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16228", "title": "Cedrick Mabwati", "text": "Cedrick Mabwati (Yavutse ku ya 8 Werurwe 1992 i Kinshasa) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati ukina muri CD Tudelano.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nUmuryango we wavukiye i Kinshasa, umurwa mukuru wa DR Congo, umuryango we wimukiye muri Esipanye mu mujyi wa Salamanca afite imyaka 12, ahunga amakimbirane igihugu cyabo ba komokamo Yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru ku ishuri nyuma yinjira mu ikipe UD Santa Marta. Yahise abonwa na Atl\u00e9tico de Madrid maze yi njira mu kigo cy\u2019imyitozo cy\u2019iyi kipe mu murwa mukuru wa Espagne afite imyaka 14.\nNyuma yo gukora bwa mbere hamwe na \"Colchoneros\" muri Mutarama 2010, muri Copa del Rey na Recreativo de Huelva mu gihe wi njiye mu mikino. Nyuma yaje kugurizwa mu ikipe ya Numancia yo muri cyiciro cya kabiri, irangiza iyimurwa ry\u2019umusore ukomoka mu gihugu cya Kongo umwaka ukurikira. Nyuma y'ibihe bibiri byemeza muri Liga Adelante, yasinyiye muri Betis Sevilla, azamurwa mu cyiciro cya mbere, yaguze umusore ukomoka mu gihugu cya Kongo ku ngingo yo kurekura ku mayero 1,21! Amaze gukina imikino 24 muri La Liga, no kumanuka gushya kwi kipe ya Andalusiya, yatijwe muri Kanama 2014 muri ikipe Osasuna, nayo yamanutse.\nKu ya 30 Mutarama 2015, yimuriwe muri Crew SC ya Columbus yo muri MLS.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nAmaze gukina na munsi yabafite imyaka 20 ya Congo, yarahamagawe muri Nzeri 2014, n'umutoza mushya w'ingwe, Florent Ibenge, mu majonjora ya CAN muri 2015. Niba gutsindwa na Kameruni biza kwanduza umupira we wa mbere, uwa kabiri azanezezwa cyane n'umusore ku ruhande, ukiri muto, kuko atanga umufasha wa J\u00e9r\u00e9my Bokila, ibyo bikaba byerekana ko Abanye kongo batsinze Siyera Lewone ibitego 2-0."}
{"id": "16229", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16229", "title": "Lema Mabidi", "text": "Lema Mabidi, uzwi ku izina rya Chikito, (yavutse Ku ya 11 Kamena 1993 i Kinshasa ahari Zayire), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati hagati muri AS Vita Club.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nIntangiriro muri DRC.\nYavutse Ku ya 11 Kamena 1993 i Kinshasa, Lema yatangiye gukinira ikipe yo mujyi yavukiyemo, ni Sharks XI FC kandi Mabidi yamenyanye n'isi yu mwuga ubwo yakinaga muri Shampiyona y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo afite imyaka cumi n'itandatu, Lema yatsindiye muri 2009 Amarushanwa ya karito ya Malebo.\nLema Mabidi yitiriwe \"Chikito\" akomeza kuguma mu ikipe ya Sharks FC mu bihembwe bine kugeza muri 2013 ubwo AS Vita Club yamwimuriye afite imyaka 20, Lema yakomeje iterambere rye maze agera mu ikipe y'igihugu muri uwo mwaka muri DRC. Nyuma y'umwuga mwiza, yageze ku mukino wa nyuma wa CAF Champions League muri 2014 hamwe na AS Vita Club. Yatsinze ibitego bibiri mu mukino ubanza yakinnye n'ikipe ya Alijeriya muri ES S\u00e9tif. Ku mukino wa nyuma w'icyiciro cya kabiri, yongeye gutsinda igitego akoresheje amashoti maremare rikomeye. Muri iki gihembwe, Mabidi yahise akurura amakipe yo hanze hanze ya DR Congo.\nUbunyamwuga muri Tuniziya.\nNyuma ya CAN yo muri 2015 no mu gihe cyo kwimura imbeho, amakipe menshi yo muri Afurika yepfo yashimishijwe nu mwirondoro we, ariko yasinyiye muri Club Sportif Sfaxien, shampiyona ye ya mbere hamwe niyi kipe yo muri Tuniziya izatangira nabi, Mabidi ntago yatangiye, nta gitego atsinda. ariko akomeza gutanga ubufasha kandi, nyuma y'ikibazo cyimishahara, afata FIFA kandi yiyemeje Nzeri 2015 Ikipe ya Maroke muri Raja Casablanca."}
{"id": "16230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16230", "title": "Umusozi wa Meru", "text": "Umusozi wa Meru uzwi kandi ku izina rya Sumeru, Sineru cyangwa Mah\u0101meru, ni umusozi ufite impinga eshanu z'imisozi miremire y'Abahindu, Jain, na Budisti. Uyu musozi uvugwa kandi mu byanditswe bimwe na bimwe by'amadini adashingiye ku Buhinde nka Taoism byatewe no kuza kw'abasenga Buda mu Bushinwa. \nAho izina Meru rya Komotse.\nInsengero nyinshi zizwi cyane z'abasenga Buda, Jain, n'Abahindu zubatswe nk'ikigereranyo cy'uyu musozi. \nIzina nyaryo ry'umusozi ni Meru, hiyongeraho imbanzirizazina yemewe ya su-, bivamo ibisobanuro \"Meru ihebuje\" cyangwa \"Meru nziza\". \"Meru\" ni izina ry'amasaro yo hagati muri m\u0101l\u0101. \n= Ubumenyi bw'isi =\nIbipimo byitiriwe umusozi wa Meru - byose bivugako ari igice cy'inyanja ya Cosmic, hamwe n'andi magambo menshi abisobanura mu magambo adasobanutse neza (urugero, \"izuba hamwe n'imibumbe yose bizenguruka umusozi\") - kumenya aho biherereye biragoye cyane, nkuko abahanga benshi babivuga. \nAbashakashatsi benshi bagaragaza umusozi wa Meru cyangwa Sumeru hamwe na Pamirs, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Kashmir. \nSuryasiddhanta avuga ko umusozi wa Meru uri hagati \"y'isi\" (\"bhuva-madhya\") ku butaka bwa Jambunad, inyandiko yo mu kinyejana cya cyenda, ishingiye ahanini ku nyandiko zitashyizwe ahagaragara za Y\u0101mal Tantr, avuga:\n \" Sumeru\u1e25 Prithv\u012b-madhye shr\u016byate drishyate na tu\"\n (Sumeru yunvikana kuba hagati yisi, ariko ntiboneka aho). \nInyandiko nyinshi za cosimologiya zisangwa mu myandiko z'abahindu. Muri imwe muri zo, mu isanzure ry'ikirere, umusozi wa Meru nawo wasobanuwe ko uzengurutswe n'umusozi wa Mandrachala mu burasirazuba, umusozi wa Suparshva mu burengerazuba, umusozi wa Kumuda mu majyaruguru na Kailasa mu majyepfo. "}
{"id": "16231", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16231", "title": "Larrys Mabiala", "text": "Larrys Mabiala, (Yavutse Ku ya 8 Ukwakira 1987 muri Montfermeil) ni Umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nka myugariro wo hagati hamwe na Portland Timbers, muri MLS.\nUmwuga.\nParis Saint Germain.\nYanyuze mu kigo cy\u2019amahugurwa cya PSG, yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'umwuga mu gihe cy'umukino wa nyuma wa cumi na gatandatu wa Coupe de la Ligue na Lorient kuri Parc des Princes on20Ku ya 20 Kamena 2006. Yasinyanye amasezerano ye yu mwuga hafi ako kanya mu Gushyingo 2006 ubwo yakomeretse mu gihe kitazwi (abaganga b'iyi kipe ntibari bazi neza imvune ye. Amaherezo yaje kugaruka avuye mu mvune muri Gashyantare 2007 abitegetswe na Paul Le Guen, ubwo yasinyaga amasezerano ye y'umwuga mu gihe cya Guy Lacombe.\nNyuma y'ibyumweru bike gusa by'imyitozo, umutoza ya hisemo ku mujyana mu cyiciro cya 16 cy'igikombe cya mbere cya UEFA i Lisbonne na Benfica. Kubura amarushanwa nyuma y'amezi ane adahuguwe, birumvikana ko afite ikibazo cyo kugaragara muri Sim\u00e3o.\nYahamagawe mu ikipe y'Ubufaransa munsi y'imwaka 23 ku nshuro ya mbere na Ren\u00e9 Girard ku mikino yakinnye na Danemarike na Noruveje ku ya 23 na Ku ya 27 Werurwe 2007. Muri uyu mukino wa kabiri, yabonye cape ya mbere ya tricolor a kina mu mwanya akunda wa myugariro wo hagati (gutsindwa 1-0).\nKugira ngo yungukire ku gihe kinini cyo gukina, yatijwe muri shampiyona yo muri 2007-2008 muri Plymouth (Shampiyona), ariko uburambe bwo mu Bwongereza bwa ragabanutse kuko yakomeretse ivi umunsi umwe mbere y\u2019umukino wa mbere wa shampiyona ya gombaga kwitabira. Abakozi b'ubuvuzi bahise bifuza ko yabazwe ariko abigishije inama na muganga wa PSG, yahisemo k ubyanga akurikiza ubuvuzi no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe mu Bufaransa. Mu gihe yakiriye i Paris, umuyobozi wa Plymouth Ian Holloway yimukiye mu mujyi wa Leicester. Yasimbuwe na Paul Sturrock, maze ahitamo kubanza guhagarika inguzanyo ye. Mabiala yahise yi njira mu bakozi mu myitozo maze akina imikino ibiri n'ikipe yabigenewe bituma umuyobozi ahindura ibitekerezo, amaherezo ashaka kumugumana. Bibabaje Mabiala ariko ahitamo gusubira i Paris. Yarekuwe mu masezerano ye Ku ya 20 Ukuboza 2007 kandi ntazakina umukino uwo ariwo wose n'ikipe ya mbere.\nKu ya 5 Gashyantare 2008, yemeye gukina n'igihugu akomokamo, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, n'ikipe y'Ubufaransa A '."}
{"id": "16232", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16232", "title": "Bawaka Mabele", "text": "Bawaka Mabele (Yavutse Ku ya 9 Kamena 1988) ni ukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'iburyo inyuma muri AS Vita Club."}
{"id": "16233", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16233", "title": "Tristan M'Bongo", "text": "Tristan M'Bongo (yavutse Ku ya 27 Ukuboza 1982 i Kinshasa) niumukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYavukiye i Kinshasa, Tristan M'Bongo yageze mu Bufaransa afite imyaka 5. Yakoze umwuga we ari muto mu m'akipe yi kinira mbere yo kwinjira muri Albi, ikipe ya CFA, aho yigaragaje nki ntangiriro ikomeye. Muri 2007, yahisemo kujya gukinira Luzenac, wari ugikina muri CFA. Hamwe na Luzenac, yarangije shampiyona nku mukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi ibitego 8. Uwa nyuma yarangije shampyona witsinda rye muri CFA igijemwe gikurikira hanyuma agera muri ikipe k'unshuro ya mbere mu mateka yayo. Igihembwe cya 2009-2010 kizaba icya M'Bongo: Arangiza shampiyona n'i bitego 17 kandi niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri iyi kipe. Imyitwarire ye yashimishije abashaka akazi muri RC Strasbourg, bamwiyandikishije muri Nyakanga muri 2010 nyuma yuko iyi kipe imanuka mu Gihugu. Nyuma yi gihembwe cyiza muri ikipe ya Strasbourg, yahisemo gusubira i Luzenac.\nGuhitamo igihugu.\nYubaha cape ye yonyine hamwe na congo, Ku ya 21 Gicurasi 2010 kurwanya Arabiya Sawudite. Umukino warangiye batsinzwe ibitego 2-0."}
{"id": "16234", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16234", "title": "Robert Kidiaba", "text": "Robert Kidiaba Muteba (yavutse Ku ya 1 Gashyantare 1976) i Lubumbashi ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, kuva 2002, yakiniraga TP Mazembe nkumuzamu. Yari Mpuzamahanga, yahamagawe inshuro 61 mu ikipe y'igihugu hagati ya 2002 na 2015. \nUbuzima.\nYagize uruhare mu gutoranya Abanyekongo mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2004, cyarangije ku mwanya wa nyuma mu itsinda ryo mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019irushanwa, bityo ntabura amahirwe yo kujya muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza. Ikora parade idasanzwe kandi azwiho \"kubyina\" iyo Mazembe itsinze.\nMuri Ukwakira 2011, Kidiaba yakomerekeje ku rutugu rw'iburyo kandi igihe cye kirangiye, yashoboraga gusubira mu kibuga gusa muri 2012 kandi byabaye ngombwa ko atakaza umukino wanyuma w'a majonjora yo guhatanira itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika muri 2012 na Kameruni."}
{"id": "16235", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16235", "title": "Kidumu Mantantu", "text": "Raoul Albert Kidumu Mantantu witwa \"Kidumu Mantantu\", (yavutse Ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 1946 i Thysville, ubu ni Mbanza Ngungu) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wari Zayire muri za 1960 na 1970. Yakinaga nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibigs. Yatangiye umwuga we mu mashitani atukura ya Mbanza Ngungu wa muzamuye, mbere yo kwiyandikisha muri CS Imana FC Matiti Mabe. Inkunga yo gutera imbere, yatoranijwe mu ngwe y'ikipe ya Zayire. Muri 1974, yari kapiteni w'iyi kipe, guhitamo bwa mbere muri Afurika yepfo, Sahara yitabiriye igikombe cy'isi cy'umupira w'amagura; hari mu 1974 i Gelsenkirchen..\nUbuzima.\nNi umukinnyi uri umunyamahanga wa Zayire. Yakinnye ibikombe 3 by'Afurika: muri 1968 (uwatsinze, ibitego 2), 1972 (4) na 1974 (uwatsinze, igitego 1). Yakinnye kandi mu gikombe cyisi cyo mu 1974 (mu cyiciro cy'ambere, imikino 3, ibitego 0, ikarita 1 y'umuhondo).\nMuri ikipe, yakiniye na CS Imana."}
{"id": "16236", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16236", "title": "Papy Kimoto", "text": "Sogokuru Okitankoyi Kimoto (yavutse Ku ya 22 Nyakanga 1976 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina w'umupira w'amaguru wa congo, wavukiye mu Bubiligi muri 2008, wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nYageze mu Bubiligi muri 1999, Kimoto yerekana imico igaragara munsi y'amabara ya Sporting de Lokeren. Nyuma y'imyaka ine, azimurirwa kandi muri Standard de Li\u00e8ge icyarimwe nuwahoze ari mugenzi we, Sambegou Bangoura. Ariko, ntazashobora kwishyira mu mwanya wa Li\u00e8ge.\nNyuma y'igihe gito muri Saint-Trond, Sogo kuru Kimoto azakoresha impano ye muri Isiraheli, aha azamenya ama kipe ane muri shampyina eshatu.\nPapy Kimoto kandi yari umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu ya Kongo inshuro 54.\nNyuma yo gukukuruka, Kimoto yabaye umuyobozi w'umupira w'amaguru ufite uruhushya rwa CAF \"A\". Kimoto yayoboye AS Dragons / Bilima na JS Kinshasa mbere yo kugirwa umuyobozi wa FC Renaissance du Congo muri Ukuboza 2018.\nIbiranga tekinike.\nKugenda neza, birashobora no gukoreshwa nkikintu cyo hagati."}
{"id": "16237", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16237", "title": "Joel Kimwaki", "text": "Jo\u00ebl Kimwaki Mpela (yavutse Ku ya 14 Ukwakira 1986) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahangaUkokoka muri congo. Akina nka myugariro, kuri ubu akina muri na FC Renaissance.\nUbuzima.\nKimwaki yatangiye umwuga muri Daring Club Motema Pembe i Kinshasa.\nMuri 2010, Kimwaki yasinye na TP Mazembe. Yakinnye mu gikombe cyisi cya Club muri 2010, aho yakinnye umukino wa nyuma na Inter Milan (gutsindwa 3\u20130).\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nKimwaki yakinnye bwa mbere na Libiya muri CHAN yo muri 2009 (intsinzi 2-0).\nYitabiriye CHAN muri 2009 hamwe n itsinda rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMuri 2015, yahamagawe na Florent Ibenge guhatanira CAN muri 2015.\nyatsinze igitego cya mbere yatsinze Congo.\nYitabiriye CHAN muri 2016 hamwe nitsinda rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ryatsinze.\nIbihembo.\nMuri ikipe\nMu ikipe y'igihugu"}
{"id": "16238", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16238", "title": "Christian Kinkela", "text": "Christian Kinkela Fuanda, (Yavutse Ku ya 25 Gicurasi 1982 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nMu rubyiruko, yambaraga cyane amabara ya Red Star 93 kuva muri 1994 kugeza 1995 m'ugihe kitarenze imyaka 13. Yavuye muri 2001 yinjira muri Stade Lavallois aho yakinnye n'ikipe yabigenewe muri CFA2.\nYabaye umunyamerika mpuzamahanga kuva muri 2005. Yitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2010-2011, yagize uruhare mu kuzamuka kwa AC Ajaccio muri Ligue ya 1 abona umwanya wa 3 ku rutonde. Yatsinze ibitego icyenda bya shampiyona anatanga imipira umunani. Ikinyamakuru cy\u2019umupira w'amaguru mu Bufaransa cya mwitiriye mu ikipe isanzwe ya Ligue 2 mu mpera za shampiyona.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2011-2012 muri L1, Christian Kinkela yi tabiriye imikino 29 ya shampiyona, atsinda ibitego 3 abonwa n'ikipe ya Corsican iguma mu ntore z\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Bufaransa."}
{"id": "16239", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16239", "title": "Bijou Kisombe Mundaba", "text": "Bijou Kisombe Mundaba (yavutse Ku ya 29 Nzeri 1976 ho muri Zayire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nHamwe na AC Sodigraf, yageze ku mukino wa nyuma w'i gikombe cy'Afurika Yatsinze Igikombe muri 1996.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire ubu ni DRC, yakinnye hagati yo muri 1997 na 2004.\nAri mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri1998, 2002 na 2004. Yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu muri iri rushanwa muri 1998.\nYakinnye kandi imikino itandatu ibara mu kibanza cy'igikombe cy'isi, mu gihe cyo muri 1998 na 2002."}
{"id": "16240", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16240", "title": "Alain Kizamba", "text": "Alain Kizamba ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo wa kinnye nku muzamu.\nUbuzima.\nAlain Kizamba akina cyane muriDC Motema Pembe na Benfica Luanda.\nKizamba yageze mu ikipe ya Benfica mu mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Angola muri 2007.\nYakiriye umwe rukumbi mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ku yambere Kamena 2007, na Etiyopiya. Uyu mukino watsinzwe 1-0 ni umwe mu majonjora yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika muri 2008."}
{"id": "16241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16241", "title": "Andre Ngole Kona", "text": "Andre Ngole Kona cyangwa Andre N'Gole Kona (Yavutse Ku ya 16 Kamena 1970 i Lubumbashi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu cyahoze ari muri Zayire. Yakinaga nka rutahizamu. \nUbuzima.\nYatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru mu gihugu cye kavukire kandi akurikirana amakipe ya Lubumbashi (FC Lubumbashi Sport) na Barumbu (SM Bibicha). Hanyuma yagiye mu kigo cyigisha imyitozo cya Jomo Cosmos muri Afurika y'Epfo.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 1993\u201394, Andre Kona yakiniyeikipe ya Gen\u00e7lerbirli\u011fi.\nMu gutsinda ibitego 74 harimo penariti 12 kuri Gen\u00e7lerbirli\u011fi, yabaye umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri 1958.\nHagati yo muri 1993 (Ku ya 23 Kanama 1993) na 2001 (iKu ya 26 Gicurasi 2001), yakinnye imikino 147 yose hamwe iminota 12\u00a0458 kuriyi kipe.\nImyitwarire ye myiza yaje muri shampiyona ya 1993\u201394, ubwo yatsindaga ibitego 21 byose mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Turukiya \nakinira ikipe ya Antalyaspor, hanyuma yongera gukinira Gen\u00e7lerbirli\u011fi, hanyuma akinira Diyarbakirspor hanyuma asoreza muri \u0130stanbulspor A. \u015e..\nNi umwe mu bakinnyi bonyine muri Turukiya batsinze ibitego birenga 100 muri Shampiyona ya Turukiya."}
{"id": "16242", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16242", "title": "Mulopo Kudimbana", "text": "Nicaise Mulopo Kudimbana, (Yavutse Ku ya 21 Mutarama 1987 i Buruseli, mu Bubiligi) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nku muzamu muri KVC Sint-Eloois-Winkel. Afite kandi ubwenegihugu bw'Ububiligi.\nUbuzima.\nYavukiye mu Bubiligi, yahisemo guhitamo Abanyekongo muri 2008 agamije kwambara umwenda \"w'ingwe\". Yanze rero ubwenegihugu bw'Ububiligi kuko nk'uko ingingo ya 10 y'Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ibivuga, \u201cUbwenegihugu bwa Kongo ni bumwe kandi bwihariye. Ntishobora gufatirwa hamwe nizindi zose \u201d de la famille/LIVRE I DE LA NATIONALITE.htm 1."}
{"id": "16243", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16243", "title": "Restituta Joseph", "text": "Restituta Joseph Kemi (yavutse 30 Nyakanga 1971 i Singida) ni uwiruka wa ukomoka muri Tanzaniya. Yatwaye ibendera inshuro ebyiri rya Tanzaniya mu birori byo gutangiza imikino Olempike yo muri 2000 na 2004.\nYatsinze muri 1997 na 1999 yatsinze isiganwa rya Corrida de Langueux."}
{"id": "16245", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16245", "title": "Banuelia Mrashani", "text": "Banuelia Mrashani-Katesigwa (yavutse ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 1977) ni umunya Tanzaniya kazi wiruka intera ndende. Yitabiriye marato y'abagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2004. "}
{"id": "16246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16246", "title": "Sara Ramadhani", "text": "Sara Ramadhani Makera (yavutse 30 Ukuboza 1987) ni umunyatanzaniya wiruka muri marato. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya marato y'abagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2016 aho yarangije ku mwanya wa 121 akoresheje isaha ya 3:00:03. \nMuri 2019, yaserukiye Tanzaniya mu mikino nyafurika yo muri 2019 yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke. Yarushanwe muri kimwe cya kabiri cya marato y'abagore gusa ntabwo yarangije isiganwa rye. "}
{"id": "16247", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16247", "title": "Magdalena Shauri", "text": "Magdalena Crispin Shauri (yavutse ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1996) ni umukinnyi wiruka intera ndende ukomoka muri Tanzaniya. Yitabiriye marato y'abagore muri Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2017 mu biruka. Muri 2019, yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF yo muri 2019. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 49. "}
{"id": "16248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16248", "title": "Angelina Tsere", "text": "Angelina Daniel Tsere (yavutse ku ya 23 Kanama 1999) ni umukinnyi wiruka intera ndende muri Tanzaniya. Yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF yo muri 2019 yabereye i Aarhus, muri Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 78. \nMuri 2017, yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF mu marushanwa yisi muri 2017 yabereye i Kampala, muri Uganda. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 37. "}
{"id": "16249", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16249", "title": "Nataliya Elisante Sulle", "text": "Nataliya Elisante Sulle (yavutse ku ya 19 Nyakanga 1988) ni umunya Tanzaniya wiruka intera ndende. Yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF yo muri 2019 yabereye i Aarhus, muri Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 68. \nMuri 2019, yaserukiye muri Tanzaniya mu mikino nyafurika yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke. Yarushanwe muri kimwe cya kabiri cya marato y'abagore arangiza ku mwanya wa 7 akoresheje amasaha 1:14:33. "}
{"id": "16250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16250", "title": "Zakia Mrisho Mohamed", "text": "Zakia Mrisho Mohamed (yavutse ku ya 19 Gashyantare 1984) ni umunya Tanzaniya wiruka intera ndende yari kabuhariwe mu kwiruka m'u muhanda. Yahagarariye igihugu cye muri metero 5000 mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 no mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2012.\nYavukiye i Singida, Yitabiriye irushanwa rye rya mbere mpuzamahanga ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri 2003, yiruka muri metero 3000 aho yarangije ari uwa gatandatu. Yatsinze muri Cinque Mulini mu kuzenguruka ibihugu muri 2004, abaye umugore wa mbere wo muri Tanzaniya wa bikoze. Yatoranijwe mu marushanwa ya IAAF muri 2005, kandi abasha kurangiza ku mwanya wa makumyabiri mu isiganwa rirerire. Yaje ku mwanya wa gatandatu muri metero 5000 muri Shampiyona yisi yo muri 2005 mu isiganwa, na gatatu ku mukino wanyuma wisimuri metero 3000 nyuma yu kwezi. Yahagarariye Tanzaniya mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2006, arangiza ari uwamunani muri metero 5000 ari kuri finale.\nMu marushanwa ya IAAF yo muri 2007 yari ku mwanya wa 23 muri rusange ariko ntiyatsinze neza inzira, ananirwa kugera muri metero 5000, ashyushye muri Shampiyona yisi yo muri 2007 mu isiganwa. Amahirwe nk'ayo yamutegereje mu mikino Olempike ya mbere yabereye i Beijing umwaka ukurikira, nu bwo yashoboye kurangiza umwanya wa kane muri metero 3000, ku mukino wa nyuma wa IAAF ku Isi yo muri 2008 kimwe no guhatanira metero 5000. Yageze ku mukino wa nyuma ukomeye ku isi muri shampiyona itaha muri Shampiyona y\u2019isi yo muri 2009 yaberaga mu isiganwa, afata umwanya wa 15 muri metero 5000."}
{"id": "16251", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16251", "title": "Amina Mohamed Mgoo", "text": "Amina Mohamed Mgoo (yavutse ku ya 22 Nyakanga 1998) ni umunya Tanzaniya Witabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF yo muri 2019 yabereye i Aarhus, muri Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wo kuri 99. \nMuri 2017, yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagore bato mu marushanwa ya IAAF mu kuzenguruka isi muri 2017 yabereye i Kampala, muri Uganda. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 68. "}
{"id": "16252", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16252", "title": "Failuna Abdi Matanga", "text": "Failuna Abdi Matanga (yavutse 28 Ukwakira 1992) ni umunya Tanzaniyakazi wiruka birebire. Yarushanwe muri metero 10,000 mu bagore muri Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2017 mu isiganwa. Muri 2019, yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF ya kuzenguruka isi, yabereye muri Aarhus, Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 16. \nMuri Kamena 2021, yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo ahagararire Tanzaniya mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020. "}
{"id": "16253", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16253", "title": "Anna Ndege", "text": "Anna Ndege (yavutse ku ya 5 Werurwe 1982 i Shinyanga) ni umukinnyi wiruka hagati ukomoka muri Tanzaniya. Ibihe byiza bye ni iminota 4: 09.71 kuri metero 1500 ni agahigo ko muri Tanzaniya mu intera ndende.\nIbisubizo bye byiza ni umwanya wa cumi n'icyenda mu isiganwa rigufi muri Shampiyona yisi ya muri 2001. Yigeze guhagararira Tanzaniya inshuro ebyiri mu marushanwa ku rwego rwo hejuru, yiruka mu isiganwa rigufi muri 2001 na 2002. Yitabiriye imikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2002, yiruka muri metero 800 na metero 1500. Yatsindiye umudari muto muri izo ntera zombi mu mikino ya gisirikare ya Afurika. "}
{"id": "16254", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16254", "title": "Nzaeli Kyomo", "text": "Nzaeli Kyomo (yavutse ku ya 2 Kamena 1957) ni Umunyatanzaniya wahoze yiruka mu marushanwa yitabiriye imikino ya Olempike ya Moscou muri 1980 mu burusiya no muri 1984 muri Amerika. Niwe washinze Kyomo.org itanga uburezi bw'ibanze, imyambaro n'ibiryo ku bana ba Tanzaniya. Ni umubyinnyi kandi akaba umunyamuryango wu buhanzi bwaba Olempike. "}
{"id": "16255", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16255", "title": "Adriana Alves", "text": "Adriana Alves (yavutse ku ya 13 Nzeri 1995) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru muri Angola. Yarushanwe muri metero zigera ku 100 mu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2015 yabereye i Beijing, mu bushinwa, gusa ntiyakomeje imbere mu cyiciro cya mbere.\nni Umunyatanzaniya wahoze yiruka mu marushanwa yitabiriye imikino ya Olempike ya Moscou muri 1980 mu burusiya no muri 1984 muri Amerika. Niwe washinze Kyomo.org itanga uburezi bw'ibanze, imyambaro n'ibiryo ku bana ba Tanzaniya. \u00a0Ni umubyinnyi kandi akaba umunyamuryango wu buhanzi bwaba Olempike.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16256", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16256", "title": "Esperan\u00e7a Gicaso", "text": "Esperan\u00e7a Gicaso (yavutse 2 Nyakanga 1992) ni umukinnnyi ukina imikino ngororamubiri ukomoka muri Angola. Yabaye nk'ibendera rya Angola mu mikino Paralympike yo muri 2016. Gicaso yari mu irushanwa mu byiciro bya T11 kubakinnyi batabona. \nIbintu byingenzi byerekana umwuga.\nGicaso yatangiye imyitozo ya siporo muri 2008. Muri 2011, yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu birometero bigera 100 kuri T11 mu mikino nya furika yabereye i Maputo, muri Mozambike. Yitabiriye imikino Paralympike yo muri 2012 muri metero 100, T11 na metero 200 muri T11, na metero 400 muri T12. gusa Ntabwo yazamutse ku mukino w'anyuma w'ibi birori. \nMu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri yo muri IPC 2013 yabereye i Lyon mu Bufaransa, Gicaso yegukanye umudari wa feza muri metero 200 muri T11. Mu mikino nya furika yo muri 2015 yabereye i Brazzaville, muri Repubulika ya Kongo, yegukanye umudari wa feza muri metero 100 T11. \nGicaso yari afite ibendera rya Angola mu birori byo gutangiza imikino Paralympike yo muri 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro. Yarushanwe muri metero 100, metero 200, na metero 400 T11. \nMu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya Para muri 2017 yabereye i Londres, Gicaso yegukanye umudari wa feza muri metero 100 muri T11 n'umudari wa feza muri metero 200 T11. Yatowe nk'umukinnyi ufite agaciro kurusha abandi muri 2017 n'ishyirahamwe ry'abakinnyi b'imikino Olempike muri Angola. \nUbuzima bwite.\nGicaso aba i Maianga, muri Angola. Yigisha Igiporutugali ku ishuri rya Luanda. "}
{"id": "16257", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16257", "title": "Neide Dias", "text": "Neide Dias (yavutse ku ya 11 Kanama 1987) ni umukinnyikazi ukomoka muri Angola wiruka muri metero 800 na 1500.\nYabaye uwa munani mu marushanwa ya bereye Ibero-Amerika yo muri 2004 muri metero 400, uwa gatandatu mu mikino ya Lusophony yo muri 2009 muri metero 800, icyenda mu mikino ny'afurika yo muri 2015 metero 1500 na munani mu mikino nyafurika ya 2019 muri metero 1500.\nYitabiriye kandi amarushanwa ya Ibero-Amerika yo muri 2010 metero 800, Imikino Nyafurika yo muri 2015 muri metero 800, na Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2019 muri metero 1500 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma.\nIbihe byiza yagize ni iminota 2: 07.01 muri metero 800, yagezweho muri kamena 2014 i Bilbao; n'iminota 4: 17.35 muri metero 1500, byagezweho muri kamena 2019 i Braga. Iheruka ni yandikwa rya Angola. "}
{"id": "16258", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16258", "title": "Ana Isabel Elias", "text": "Ana Isabel Elias (yavutse ku ya 17 Nzeri 1965) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Angola, akaba yiruka hagati. Yitabiriye metero 1500 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1992. \nni Umunyangola wahoze yiruka mu marushanwa yitabiriye imikino ya Olempike ya Moscou muri 1980 mu burusiya no muri 1984 muri Amerika. Niwe washinze Kyomo.org itanga uburezi bw'ibanze, imyambaro n'ibiryo ku bana ba Tanzaniya. \u00a0Ni umubyinnyi kandi akaba umunyamuryango wu buhanzi bwaba Olempike."}
{"id": "16260", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16260", "title": "Teresa Nzola Meso Ba", "text": "Teresa Nzola Meso Ba (yavutse 30 Ugushyingo 1983, i Luanda) ni umunyaAngola ufite ubwene gihugu bw'Ubufaransa usimbuka gatatu.\nUbuzima.\nYahoze ahagarariye Angola, ariko nyuma yerekeza mu Bufaransa muri 2003. Mbere yibi yashyizeho agahigo yo gusimbuka inshuro eshatu muri Angola ya metero 13.49, n'ubu niwe ukigafite. \nNzola Meso Ba yarangije ari uwa cyenda muri Shampiyona yo mu Burayi 2006. Mu marushanwa yo mu nzu, yo mu Burayi yo muri 2007, yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu gahigo mu bafaransa ndetse no gusimbuka metero 14.49. Yasimbutse neza mbere yibi birori yari metero 14.07, yagezweho muri 2006.\nYaje kwitabira amarushanwa yisi yo muri 2007, Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2008 ndetse n'imikino Olempike yo muri 2008 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Yateje imbere ubuzima bwe kugera kuri metero 14,69 muri Kamena 2007 i Munich."}
{"id": "16261", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16261", "title": "Christine Botlogetswe", "text": "Christine Ayanda Botlogetswe (yavutse 1 Ukwakira 1995) ni usiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Botswana uhatanira cyane muri metero 400. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo muri 2016, yiruka iminota igera 52.37 yujuje ibyangombwa mu cyiciro cya mbere. Yirukanka muri Orapa Athletics Club kandi atozwa na Justice Dipeba, unatoza na Isaac Makwala, Umugabo wari muri barindwi wihuta cyane mu mateka.\nYujuje ibisabwa kugirango ahagararire Botswana mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16263", "revid": "14885", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16263", "title": "Lydia Jele", "text": "Lydia Casey Jele (yavukiye i Mashila; yavutse ku ya 22 Kamena 1990) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Botswana, wiruka muri metero 400. Yitabiriye mu kwerekanwa muri Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2013, ntago yari yujuje ibisabwa kuirango ajye ku mukino wa nyuma. Yirutse metero 400 mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2016. yaje kuzuza ibisabwa atsindira Amarushanwa y\u2019ishyirahamwe ryimikino ngororamubiri muri Botswana. \nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 11.51 muri metero 100, 24.55 muri metero 200 (-0.1, Shenzhen 2011) niminota 52,65 muri metero 400 (Porto Novo 2012). Jele ni Uwera. \nAmarushanwa.\nREba"}
{"id": "16264", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16264", "title": "Loungo Matlhaku", "text": "Loungo Matlhaku (yavutse ku ya 24 Werurwe 1995) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Botswana uhatanira muri metero 200. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2018. Byongeye kandi, yatsindiye imidari myinshi kurwego rwa karere.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16265", "title": "Amantle Montsho", "text": "Amantle Montsho (yavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 1983) ni umukinyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Botswana kabuhariwe muri metero 400. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2004 na 2008, agera ku mukino wa nyuma ku nshuro ye ya nyuma. Niwe mugore wa mbere wahagarariye Botswana mu mikino Olempike. Yagiye kandi mu marushanwa y'isi yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri ndetse na Shampiyona y'isi ya IAAF, kandi yahoze arishampiyo w'isi hejuru ya metero 400, yatsinze mu bihe byiza bya 49.56 i Daegu.\nMontsho yahagaritswe imyaka ibiri azira kutubahiriza amategeko yo kurwanya ibyongera imbaraga, nyuma yo gupimisha mu mikino ya bavuga ivyongereza muri 2014. \nMu Amarushanwa ya Afurika, inshuro ebyiri yegukanye umudari wa zahabu hejuru muri metero 400, yatsindiye kandi ibikombe muri ibyo birori mu mikino yaberaga muri Afurika muri 2007, Igikombe cy\u2019umugabane wa IAAF muri 2010 ndetse n\u2019imikino yabavua icyongereza muri 2010. Intsinzi ya yabavua icyongereza yatumye Botswana ye gukana umudari wa zahabu wa mbere muri iyo mikino.\nIbihe bye byiza ni amasegonda 11,60 muri metero 100, amasegonda 22.89 muri metero 200, n'amasegonda 49.33 muri metero 400. Yitoje mu kigo cyigisha imyitozo i Dakar, muri Senegali, kandi afite agahigo k\u2019igihugu muri metero 400 haba mu nzu no hanze.\nUmwuga.\nMontsho yavukiye i Maun, muri Ngamilande. Yitabiriye imikino Olempikeyo muri 2004, Imikino ya yabavua icyongereza muri 2006 na Shampiyona y'isi muri 2005 na 2007 gusa atageze ku mukino wa nyuma.\u00a0\nYatsindiye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona nyafurika muri 2006 ndetse n'umudari wa zahabu mu mikino yo muri Afurika muri 2007. Mu mikino ya Afurika yose, yarangije kandi umwanya wa gatanu muri metero 200. Mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 2006 ya IAAF yarangije ku mwanya wa gatandatu hamwe n'ikipe ny'afurika ya metero 4x400. Yayoboye ibyiza ku giti cye na Botswana ya amasegonda 49.83 yo gutsinda muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo muri 2008 muri isiganwa. Iracyari amateka ya Shampiyona k'ubirori.\nAmantle Montsho yize mu ishuri ribanza rya Bonatla i Maun."}
{"id": "16266", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16266", "title": "Tshotlego Morama", "text": "Tshotlego Morama, (yavukiye Lethakane mu 1987) ni umukinnyi wa siporoya parlempike ukomoka muri Botswana.\nwa hagarariye Botswana mu mikino Paralempike yo muri 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi, mu bugereki, yatsindiye umudali wa zahabu mu kwiruka metero 400, mu bagore mu cyiciro cy\u2019abafite ubumuga bwa T46, ashyiraho agahigo mashya ku isi muri icyo gikorwa, akoresheje igihe cyi minota 55.99. Akomeje kuba umukinnyi wenyine wigeze ahagararira Botswana muri Paralempike. \nMorama yatsindiye kandi umudali wa zahabu mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo muri 2007, ashyiraho agahigo gashya muri Afurika muri metero 200 mu bagore. \nMorama yagombaga kongera guhagararira Botswana mu mikino Paralympike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing,mu bushinwa ariko amaherezo ntiyitabira, yavuyemo mbere y'imikino kubera imvune. "}
{"id": "16267", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16267", "title": "Galefele Moroko", "text": "Galefele Moroko (yavutse ku ya 16 Mata 1997) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Botswana. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu bagore mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri. Yujuje ibisabwa kugirango ahagararire Botswana mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020. ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Botswana. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu bagore mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri. Yujuje ibisabwa kugirango ahagararire Botswana mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020 "}
{"id": "16268", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16268", "title": "Tsaone Sebele", "text": "Tsaone Sebele (yavutse 27 Ukwakira 1993) ni umukinnyi usiganwa ukomoka muri Botswanan kabuhariwe muri metero 100 na 200.\nMuri metero 100 yarangije kuwa munani mu mikino nyafurika yo muri 2015 nuwa karindwi muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2018. Yageze mu cyiciro cya 2 muri kaminuza yo muri 2017. Muri 2019, yaserukiye Botswana mu mikino ny'afurika ya 2019 yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke. Yarushanwe muri metero 100 mu bagore. \nMuri metero 200 yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri mu mikino nyafurika yo muri 2015. Yahatanye kandi n'ikipe ya Botswana mu kwerekanwa muri kaminuza yo muri 2017.\nIbihe byiza bye byari amasegonda 11,61 muri metero 100, yageze muri Werurwe 2017 muri Pretoriya ; n'amasegonda 23,79 muri metero 200, byagezweho muri Nzeri 2015 i Brazzaville muri congo. "}
{"id": "16269", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16269", "title": "Goitseone Seleka", "text": "Goitseone Seleka (yavutse ku ya 10 Kanama 1988) ni umukinnyi Ukomoka muri Botswana uhatanira muri metero 400. Yitabiriye metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona y'isi muri 2013 atujuje ibisabwa ku mukino wa nyuma. Goitseone yavukiye kandi akurira mu mudugudu witwa Nkange.\nIbyiza bye muri ibyo birori ni amasegonda 53.11 yashyizwe muri Porto Novo muri 2012."}
{"id": "16270", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16270", "title": "Mema Tiango", "text": "Mema Tiango (yavutse 29 Ukwakira 1991) ni umukinnyi wiruka intera ndende muri Botswana. Yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF yo muri 2019 yabereye i Aarhus, muri Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 109. \nMuri 2017, yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF mu kuzenguruka isi muri 2017 yabereye i Kampala, muri Uganda. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 92. "}
{"id": "16271", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16271", "title": "Umusozi wa Satima", "text": "Umusozi wa Satima, uzwi kandi nk' umusozi wa Lesatima ukunze kwitwa Satima cyangwa Lesatima, niwo musozi wa gatatu muremure muri Kenya kandi muremure muri Aberdare Range. Izina rya Maasai ni Oldoinyo Lesatima, rifite ubundi buryo butandukanye, nka Ol Donyo Le Satima, kandi risobanura \"umusozi w'inyana y'inka\". \nImiterere.\nImpinga iri mu majyaruguru ya Aberdares, nayo ubwayo iri mu burasirazuba bw'ikibaya kinini cya Rift, kandi niho hantu harehare. Hafi yacyo hari umubare munini w'ibirunga bikarishye byitwa \"Amenyo y'ikiyoka\". Hano hari moraine iri hagati ya metero 3,600 na metero 3,800 mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'umusozi. Igitabo kimwe kivuga kuri Kenya cyise umusozi ubwawo\"urutare runini rw'ibyatsi n'ibyatsi bya tussock bizenguruka ibicu\". "}
{"id": "16272", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16272", "title": "Franka Magali", "text": "Magali Franka (yavutse ku ya 24 Mutarama 1990 i Lyon, mu Bufaransa) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru uhatanira ku rwego ruri mpuzamahanga muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, uhatana mu bagore \nMagali yari ahagarariye DR Congo mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing, mu bushinwa Yarushanwe muri metero 100 yiruka ashyira umunani mubushuhe, atarazamuka mu cyiciro cya kabiri. Yirutse intera mu gihe cya masegonda 12.57. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nFranka Magali at World Athletics"}
{"id": "16273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16273", "title": "Safi Nyembo", "text": "Safi Nyembo (yavutse ku ya 23 Nzeri 1984) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'umudage wavukiye muri congo ukina nku mukinnyi ukina imbere mu kibuga.\nUbuzima.\nSafi Nyembo yavutse ku ya 23 Nzeri 1984 i Kinshasa, muri Zayire.\nNyembo yatangiye umwuga we muri FSV Schierstein maze ava mu gihe afite munsi yimwaka 16 mu mpeshyi ya 2001 muri Oberliga yerekeza muri SG Germania Wiesbaden. Muri shampiyona ya 2004/2005, yimukiyekwai mukeba wabo FFC Frankfurt maze atangaza ku ya 5 Ukuboza 2004. umukino we wa mbere muri Bundesliga. Amaze gukina umukino umwe, yimukiye mu mujyi wa FSV Frankfurt aho yabonye amahirwe yo gukina imikino 22. Muri 2006, yagarutse muri FFC Frankfurt akina mu ikipe yabo ya kabiri. Nyuma yi gihembwe muri Bundesliga ya 2, yagumye mu bubiko bw'ikipe ya 1 ya FFC Frankfurt. Nyembo yahisemo kwimukira muri 1 FC Lokomotive Leipzig. Yahise aba umukinnyi uzwi cyane hamwe niyi kipe, atsinda ibitego 35 mu mikino 79 mu myaka itanu. Muri Werurwe 2012, Nyembo yahagaritswe nyuma yo kunengwa n'inama, kandi kuva icyo gihe akina mu ikipe ya kabiri gusa. Nyuma yi myaka itanu i Leipzig yakinnye kugeza muri kamena 2012 mbere yuko ahinduka muri Bundesliga aherutse kuzamurwa mu ikipe ya VfL Sindelfingen. Nyuma yi kigeragezo cyatsinze yahisemo kwimurirwa muri FF USV Jena, aho yasinye amasezerano yi myaka ibiri. Mu mpeshyi yo muri 2013 yishe amasezerano ye, yari gutangira kugeza ku ya 30 Kamena 2014, i Jena maze yinjira mu muryango FFV Leipzig wari umaze gushingwa, umuryango uzasimbura amakipe y\u2019abagore ya FC Lokomotive Leipzig. Nyuma yo kuva muri FFV Leipzig muri Regionalliga muri 2016/2017, yinjiye mu ikipe yashinzwe FC Phoenix. "}
{"id": "16274", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16274", "title": "Beatrice Kamuchanga Alice", "text": "Beatrice Kamuchanga Alice (yavutse ku ya 20 Ugushyingo 1997) ni umukinnyi wiruka intera ndende kuva muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo muri 2016 mu kwiruka metero 5000 mu bagore ; umwanya we wabaye amasaha 19: 29.47 mu bushuhe ntabwo w'ujuje ibyangombwa bya nyuma. "}
{"id": "16275", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16275", "title": "Fathia Ali Bouraleh", "text": "Fathia Ali Bouraleh (yavutse ku ya 14 Ukwakira 1987) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru uhatanira ku rwego mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Djibouti. \nAli Bouraleh yavuze ko yabonye kwiruka byihuse kuko akiri muto, yari umujura. Ali Bouraleh yatangiye imyitozo ya siporo muri 2004 mu mashuri yisumbuye. Yatsinze mu birori mu ishuri ryisumbuye, kandi ashimisha umutoza bihagije ku buryo yamutumiriye gusubira mu myitozo kabiri mu cyumweru. Yamuhaye kandi inkweto zo kwiruka, amusezeranya ko azamwigisha mu ishuri rye. Yitoje kuri sitade, kuko iyo yirukaga mu muhanda abantu bamuteraga amabuye bakamutuka, nubwo yari yambaye ipantaro ndende nigitambara cyo mu mutwe. Amazina ye ni \"Mama,\" kandi niba abayirebaga batutse Ali Bouraleh biruka, bagenzi be barabasakuza bati \"Ntutuke Mama wacu!\" \nAli Bouraleh yaserukiye Djibouti mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing nk'umukinnyi wa kabiri wa Olempike wa Djibouti. Yarushanwe muri metero 100 yiruka ashyira umunani mubushuhe bwe atarazamuka mu cyiciro cya kabiri. Yatangiye ibinyoma mu gerageza kwe kwa mbere. Mugerageza kwa kabiri, yirutse afite amasegonda 14.29, umwe mubatinze umwaka. Yarangije bwa nyuma mu bushyuhe bwe hamwe nigihe cya kabiri cyatinze muri rusange. Bouraleh yarushanijwe n'igitambaro cyo mu mutwe, ku bwe we ntibyagize ingaruka ku gihe cye cyo kurangiza. \nUbu arimo gutoza Abakobwa kwiruka 2, hamwe na Cintia Guzman. Yibera kandi atoza mumurwa mukuru, Djibouti, niho kimwe cya kabiri cyabakobwa biruka hari ikipe 2. Usibye gutoza abakinnyi, Bouraleh anatanga ibikoresho n'inkunga y'amafaranga kubakinnyi aho imyitozo yombi. "}
{"id": "16276", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16276", "title": "Zourah Ali", "text": "Zourah Ali uzwi kandi ku izina rya Souhra Ali Mohamed (yavutse ku ya 23 Ugushyingo 1994) ni umwirutsiukomoka muri jibuti. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo muri 2012 na 2020.\nUmwuga.\nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo muri 2012 mu birometero 400, ayirangiza mu isaha 1: 05.37. Ntabwo yashyize hejuru bihagije mu bushyuhe bwe kugirango abashe kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kuko yarangije kumwanya wa 44 ndetse n'igihe cya kabiri cyatinze muri iri siganwa. Nyuma y'imikino Olempike, Zourah yatewe inkunga n'abasirikare barinda Repubulika, akaba ari ishami rya gisirikare ririnda perezida. Zourah niwe mukinnyi we nyine w\u2019umukobwa mu barinzi ba republika mu gihe runaka, ariko hiyongereyeho abakinnyi nka Kadra Mohamed Dembil, bagura ikipe yabo y\u2019abagore. Yabaye ibendera rya Djibouti mu birori byo gutangiza. \nYitabiriye imikino ya Afurika Yose yo muri 2011 yabereye i Maputo, na 2011 Pan Arab Games yabereye i Doha, 2017 Pan Arab Games yabereye i Baku, Shampiyona y\u2019Abarabu muri Cayiro, na 2019 muri Afurika i Rabat.\nYongeye kwitabira imikino Olempike yo muri 2020, mu birometero 1500. "}
{"id": "16277", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16277", "title": "Kadra Mohamed Dembil", "text": "Kadra Mohamed Dembil (yavutse ku ya 22 Mata 1997) ni uwo muri Somaliya na jibuti wiruka mu ntera yo hagati utuye Ali Sabieh. Kadra yaretse amashuri yisumbuye. Avuga ko Abanyasomaliya kandi azi Igifaransa.\nKadra yinjiye mu ikipe, y'Abakobwa Run 2, mu mwaka wo muri 2012, yishyuye ibikoresho byo gukora, gutwara abantu mu murwa mukuru kugira ngo bahatane mu marushanwa, ndetse n'amafaranga y'ishuri. Muri iyo kipe, niwe wihuta cyane mu kwiruka metero 3000, ku buryo bigoye kwitoza kubera ko nta bahanganye nawe bafasha gukomeza umuvuduko. Imikino ngororamubiri yatoje irimo inzira, imbogamizi, hamwe n'uburemere bukozwe mu mata y'ifu yuzuye ifu yuzuye sima. Kadra yatangiye shampiyona muri 2013\u201314 hamwe n'abakobwa biruka 2, ariko ahabwa akazi nabashinzwe kurinda repubulika (abasirikari bashinzwe kurinda perezida), arangiza igihe cye nabo. \nAmarushanwa ya Olempike.\nIri yerekanwa ryiyongereye ryatumye amenyekana bihagije ko yoherejwe mu mikino Olempike y\u2019abato muri 2014 yabereye i Nanjing mu kwiruka metero 2000, asiganwa atigeze yiruka mbere. Kumenyereza, urwobo rwabanje kuzuzwa umusego, kuko amazi nigicuruzwa cyiza muri Djibouti. Kadra amaze kubimenyera, urwobo rwuzuyemo amazi kugirango ashobore kwitoza imikino Olempike. Nubwo Kadra yinjiye mu mikino Olempike yabato afite amateka mabi ku giti cye, yarangije afite amasaha 7:07, yica agahigo ye ku masegonda 50 arangiza ari uwa 11 mu bushyuhe bwa mbere. Mu gihe cy'ubushyuhe bwa kabiri, Kadra yaguye ku isimbuka ry'amazi ya gatatu, amusubiza inyuma ku mwanya wa 5; iyo uhujwe nubushyuhe bwa mbere, umwanya we wanyuma wari umwanya wa 14. \nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo muri 2016 mu kwiruka metero 1500 mu bagore; umwanya we ni amasaha 4: 42.67 mu bushuhe ntabwo wujuje ibisabwa muri kimwe cya kabiri. "}
{"id": "16278", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16278", "title": "Roda Ali Wais", "text": "Roda Ali Wais ni umukinnyi wo hagati mu kwiruka uhatana muri Djibouti mbere yo kwerekeza muri Ositaraliya. \nAli Wais yari afite imyaka cumi n'itandatu gusa kandi ni umugore wambere wo muri jibuti uhagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino olempike ubwo yitabiriye imikino olempike yo muri 2000 yabereye i Sydney, yinjiye muri metero 800 yaje nyuma yu bushyuhe ku buryo atujuje ibisabwa kugirango akomeze mu cyiciro gikurikira. Nyuma yo gusiganwa, Ali Wais yerekeje muri Ositaraliya abifashijwemo n\u2019umunya ositaraliya wo muri Somaliya, aho yashakanye n\u2019umunya ositaraliya kandi afite abana. Ntabwo yongeye guhatanira muri jibuti. "}
{"id": "16279", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16279", "title": "Adanech Anbesa", "text": "Adanech Anbesa Feyisa (yavutse ku ya 23 Mutarama 1998) ni umunyetiyopiya wiruka muri metero 1500.\nUmwuga wa Biografiya n'umwuga wo gusiganwa.\nYatsindiye umudari wa umuringa muri metero 1500 muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2016 yabereye i Durban, avunika ibyiza bye muri minota 4 amasegonda 5 s 22."}
{"id": "16280", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16280", "title": "Yengus Azenaw", "text": "Yengus Dese Azenaw (yavutse ku ya 4 Nyakanga 1992) ni umukinnyikazi ukina paralempike wo muri Etiyopiya. Yahagarariye Etiyopiya muri 2012 ndetse no mu mikino Paralympike yo muri 2016. yitabiriye ibirori bya muri metero 100, 200 na 400. Yengus Azenaw yashishikarijwe kuba umukinnyi w'abigize umwuga na mwarimu w\u2019ishuri ribanza. "}
{"id": "16281", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16281", "title": "Fantu Magiso", "text": "Fantu Magiso Manedo (yavutse ku ya 9 Kamena 1992) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 400 na metero 800. "}
{"id": "16282", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16282", "title": "Worknesh Mesele", "text": "Worknesh Musele Handeno (yavutse ku ya 10 Kamena 2001) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Etiyopiya, wegukanye ibikombe bya shampiyona y'igihugu ya Etiyopiya muri metero zirenga 400 na metero 800.\nUmwuga.\nMusele yirutse ku nshuro ya 11 yihuta ku isi muri 2021 muri metero 800 z'abagore ubwo yarangizaga Ikigeragezo cya Olempike. Yabanje kwitabira imikino Nyafurika yo muri 2019 yabereye i Kabat muri metero 400 na metero 4x400. \nYirutse ku giti cye 1:58:71 muri metero 800 mu isiganwa ry\u2019imikino Olempike ya Etiyopiya arangiza ku mwanya wa gatatu nyuma ya Werkwuha Getachew na Habitam Alemu muri Kamena 2021 kugira ngo abone umwanya we mu mikino Olempike yatinze ya Tokiyo yo muri 2020. Ibyiza bye byambere byari byiza 2:02:20. Yamenyekanye mu ikipe ya Etiyopiya mu mikino, ariko nti yigeze ahatana. Ku ya 30 Kamena 2021, yatsindiye metero 800 mu nama yo kwibuka Urwibutso rwa Irena Szewi\u0144ska yabereye i Bydgoszcz mu ruzinduko rw\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi uri 2021, yarushije mugenzi we Diribe Welteji amasegonda.07. \nMuri Werurwe 2022 Mesele yegukanye umwanya wa kabiri mu gihugu ye gukana metero 800 muri Hawassa. Yabaye uwa kane muri Shampiyona yo muri 2022 ny'afurika mu kwiruka - Isiganwa rya metero 800 mu bagore. "}
{"id": "16283", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16283", "title": "Medina Eisa", "text": "Medina Eisa (yavutse 3 Mutarama 2005) ni umunyetiyopiya wiruka intera ndende. Yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu muri metero 5000 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 2022 na feza mu isiganwa ry\u2019abato muri Shampiyona y\u2019isi yo muri 2023.\nUmwuga.\nMuri Kamena 2021, afite imyaka 16, Medina Eisa yegukanye umwanya wa cumi mu kwiruka metero 5000 mu bigeragezo by'imikino Olempike ya Etiyopiya mbere y\u2019imikino Olempike yatinze yabereye i Tokiyo. \nMuri Mata 2022, yaje ku mwanya wa kane mu birori mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya Etiyopiya yabereye Hawassa, akoresha igihe cya 15: 50.3. Yatwaye umudari wa zahabu ku bagore muri metero 5000 mu marushanwa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 yabereye i Cali, muri Kolombiya muri Kanama, isaha 15: 29.71 imbere ya mugenzi we Melknat Wudu hamwe na Prisca Chesang wa Uganda uri ku mwanya wa gatatu. Mu Kwakira, Eisa yatsindiye Irilande y'Amajyaruguru Mpuzamahanga kilometero 6 kwiruka byabereye i Dundoland, Belfast m'ugihe cya 21:07. \nMuri Gashyantare 2023, yegukanye umudari wa feza mu marushanwa y'abagore bato mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yakuzenguruka isi, yiruka amasaha 21:00 arangiza amasegonda arindwi inyuma ya mugenzi we Senayet Getachew. Hamwe na kimwe cya kabiri Etiyopiya yatwaye zahabu kurutonde rw'amakipe. "}
{"id": "16284", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16284", "title": "Mekides Abebe", "text": "Mekides Abebe Demewoz (yavutse 29 Nyakanga 2001) ni umukinnyi ukomka muri Etiyopiya. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 3000 y'abagore mu gusiganwa ku maguru mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri yo muri 2019. \nYatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu kwiruka metero 3000 mu bagore mu mikino ny'afurika yo muri 2019 ndetse n'umudari wa feza mu kwiruka metero 2000 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike y'urubyiruko 2018.\nYarushanwe mu kwiruka metero 3000 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020. "}
{"id": "16285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16285", "title": "Elvan Abeylegesse", "text": "Elvan Abeylegesse, (nanone yahoze ari Hewan Abeye na Elvan Can umunyaTurukiya wavutse ku ya 11 Nzeri 1982) ni Umunyetiyopiya ukomoka muri Turukiya ukomoka mu gihugu cya Turukiya wo hagati kandi ufite intera ndende yiruka mu ntera kuva kuri metero 1500 kugeza kuri marato, kandi no mu irushanwa rya mbukiranya igihugu. Niwe wahoze afite agahigo ku isi- afite metero 5000, ku minota 14: 24.68.\nMuri Kanama 2015, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Turukiya ryemeje ko ikizamini cyo kurwanya ibyo ngera imbaraga cyakozwe mu marushanwa y\u2019isi ya 2007 yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri cyagarutsweho kandi ugasanga ari cyiza ku kintu cyagenzuwe, kandi ko uyu mukinnyi yahagaritswe by'agateganyo mu gihe hagitegerejwe ko bamusuzuma 'B' -Urugero '. Niba byemejwe, Abeylegesse yahagaritse gutakaza umudari we muri 2007, ndetse n'ibindi bihembo guhera kuri iyo tariki. Ku ya 29 Werurwe 2017, IAAF yemeje ikizamini cyiza, ihagarika ibisubizo bye kuva ku ya 25 Kanama 2007 kugeza ku ya 25 Kanama 2009 (bityo imwambura imidari ibiri ya feza yari yatsindiye mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008), imubuza imikino ngororamubiri imyaka ibiri. \nUbuzima bwambere nakazi.\nIbintu byingenzi byerekana umwuga.\nKu ya 3 Kamena 2006, igihe cye cyo kwandika yakubiswe n'umunyetiyopiya Meseret Defar, wirutse muri 14: 24.53 mu mujyi wa New York. \nYirutse mu irushanwa rya mbere ry\u2019isi 10K Bangalore muri 2008 arangiza ashyushye hamwe na Grace Momanyi, abasiganwa bombi amaherezo batangazwa ko batsinze. \nYahawe igikombe cya Pierre de Coubertin mu mwaka wo muri 2010, igihembo ngarukamwaka gitangwa na komite mpuzamahanga yo gukina imurikagurisha. Yagurije inkweto zo kwiruka umunywanyi Meselech Melkamu mbere gato yuko itangira rya metero 10,000 ry'anyuma muri Shampiyona yisi yaberaga mu isiganwa 2009. Melkamu amaze kwibagirwa kuzana inkweto ze kumurongo, yagiye gufata ifeza. \nAbeylegesse yatsindiye irushanwa rya Ras Al Khaimah Half Marathon muri 2010 mu gihe cya 1:07:07. Iki nicyo gihe cyihuta cyane k'umugore mu marushanwa ya kimwe cya kabiri cya marato kandi amugira umugore wa gatandatu wihuta muri rusange. Yakinnye ibyifuzo byo guhindurwa burundu mu masiganwa maremare yo mu muhanda, ariko, avuga ko umukino wa mbere wa marato ugomba gutegereza kugeza nyuma yimikino Olempike izabera i Londres 2012. "}
{"id": "16287", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16287", "title": "Habitam Alemu", "text": "Habitam Alemu Bayih (yavutse ku ya 9 Nyakanga 1997) ni Umunyetiyopiyakazi wiruka intera yo hagati, wazobereye muri metero 800.\nUmwuga.\nAlemu wavukiye i Merawi, muri Etiyopiya, yashishikarijwe kugerageza kwiruka n'umwarimu w'ishuri w'amwinjiye mu marushanwa ye ya mbere, yatsinze. Yakomeje gushishikarizwa na murumuna we, atangira imyitozo ikomeye, nyuma yo kwiruka muri shampiyona y\u2019igihugu, yatumiriwe kujya mu ikipe i Addis Abeba. \nAlemu yaserukiye igihugu ciwe mu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2015, kandi yarabaye mu barangihe mu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2016. Mu mikino Olempike ya Rio 2016, yakoresheje uko ashoboye kugira ngo atere imbere binyuze mu bushyuhe, ariko asezererwa muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. \nYashyize ku mwanya wa gatandatu muri metero 800 mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo yo 2020. \nAlemu yinjije inshuro ebyiri zose muri metero 800 World indoor Tour, yatsinze muri 2019 no muri 2021."}
{"id": "16288", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16288", "title": "Abeba Aregawi", "text": "Abeba Aregawi Gebretsadik (yavutse ku ya 5 Nyakanga 1990) ni Umunyetiyopiya na Suwede wirukanye intera ndende yiruka muri metero 1500. Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri metero 1500 mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2012 ndetse n'umudari wa zahabu muri Shampiyona y'isi muri 2013. Yahagarariye Etiyopiya na Suwede ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUbuzima.\nAregawi yavukiye i Adigrat, muri Etiyopiya mu karere ka Tigray. Yahagarariye Etiyopiya ku rwego mpuzamahanga kugeza mu Kuboza 2012, amaze kuba umwenegihugu wa Suwede. Yahagarariye ikipe ya Hammarby ikorera i Stockholm NIBA kugeza Mutarama 2016. \nAregawi yashakanye n'umugabo wo muri Etiyopiya ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Suwede kandi aba i Stockholm kuva muri 2009 kugeza 2012.\u00a0 Yemane Tsegay akaba atuye i Addis Abeba, muri Etiyopiya.\u00a0\nUmwuga wa siporo.\n2009.\nAregawi yagaragaye nk'iruka metero 800 mu 2009 yegukana igikombe cya Etiyopiya muri iri rushanwa mbere ya shampiyona ya Mestawet Tadesse inshuro eshatu. Yarushanwe m'ubihugu byinshi byabanyaburayi nyuma yibi hanyuma ashyiraho ibyiza by'iminota 2: 01.98 muri Tangiers. Igihe cye cyarangiye muri metero 800 umudari wa bronze mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika yo muri 2009, aho yarangirije inyuma ya Caster Semenya. \n2010.\nYahinduye metero 1500 muri cyiciro ya 2010 kandi yishimira gutsinda yatsinze muri Sollentuna Grand Prix na KBC Ijoro ry'imikino ng ororamubiri, ashyiraho ibyiza by'iminota 4: 01.96 mu marushanwa yanyuma. Yirutse kandi ku muzunguruko wa Diamond League 2010 ku nshuro ya mbere, aza ku mwanya wa kane muri DN Galan na karindwi muri Weltklasse Zurich."}
{"id": "16289", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16289", "title": "Meskerem Assefa", "text": "Meskerem Assefa Legesse Wondimagegn (yavutse ku ya 20 Nzeri 1985 i Robe, muri Arsi) ni Umunyetiyopiya wo hagati - kandi wiruka intera ndende. Yahagarariye Etiyopiya mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 na 2012. Afite ibihembo bye bwite harimo iminota 4: 02.12 kuri metero 1500, iminota 8: 46.37 kuri metero 3000 n'amasaha 2:25:11 kuri marato.\nMeskerem irushanwa cyane muri 1500. Yitabiriye inshuro ebyiri mu marushanwa y'isi yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri kandi yatwaye umudari wa feza mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo muri 2008 yaberaga muri irushanwa.\nUmwuga.\nMeskerem yatangiye kwiruka amasiganwa yo hagati muri 2001 naho mugihe muri Oregon muri 2003 yirutse metero 800 nziza cyane m'uminota 2: 01.11 na metero 1500 nziza m'uminota 4: 03.96. Yashingiye ahanini muri Amerika kugeza muri 2007. Intsinzi mu mikino yose yabereye muri Etiyopiya yabereye i Addis Abeba ndetse no ku mwanya wa kabiri mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya Etiyopiya ya muzaniye umwanya mu mikino yaberaga muri Afurika muri 2007, aho yashyize ku mwanya wa kane yiruka 4: Iminota 09.83.\nUmwaka ukurikira yazanye umudari wa mbere ukomeye - niwe wegukanye umudari wa feza inyuma ya Gelete Burka muri metero 1500 muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo muri 2008 muri isiganwa. Kumikino ngororamubiri yo muri Burezile yatsindiye inshuro eshatu zirimo ibyiza by'umuntu w'iminota 2: 02.12 muri metero 800 i Rio de Janeiro. Yirutse neza muri 1500 icyo gihembwe cyari iminota 4: 05.67, cyaje mu nama yabereye i Jerez de la Frontera. Yatorewe guhagararira Etiyopiya mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008, ariko yaje gusezererwa mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'ubushyuhe. "}
{"id": "16290", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16290", "title": "Tigist Assefa", "text": "Tigist Assefa Tessema (yavutse ku ya 28 Werurwe 1994) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka n'amaguru mu marato, wahoze ari inzobere mu metero 800. Nyuma yo gutangira umukino wa marato muri Mata 2022, yateye imbere mu minota irenga 18 nyuma ashyiraho ku mwanya wa gatatu mu biihuta cyane ku rutonde rw\u2019ibihe byose ku isi (kuri ubu ni uwa gatanu) muri Marato ya Berlin muri 2022. \nMuri 2013, Assefa niwe we gukanye umudari wa metero 800 muri Shampiyona ny'afurika. Hamwe n\u2019umwaka wa 2014 witwaye neza muri ibyo birori, yabaye muri 2022 i Berlin umugore wa mbere mu mateka watsinze iminota ibiri kuri metero 800 na 2:20 kuri marato. \nUmwuga.\nMuri Kanama 2014, Tigist Assefa ye gukanye umwanya wa kane muri metero 800 mu bagore mu marushanwa ny'afurika yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri yabereye muri Marrakesh, muri Maroke. Muri uko kwezi, yatsinze isiganwa mu nama ya ISTAF Berlin y'abereye mu Budage. Muri Nzeri, yarangije ku mwanya wa kane hejuru y'intera mu gikombe cya IAAF Continental Cup, nacyo cyabereye i Marrakesh. \nYakuweho muri metero 800 icyiciro cya mbere cyamarushanwa yisi yo muri 2016 yabereye Portland, Oregon. Uyu musore w'imyaka 22 yari ahagarariye Etiyopiya muri metero 800 ibirori byabereye mu mikino Olempike ya Rio muri 2016, aho atujuje ibyangombwa ashyushye hamwe na shampiyona nziza ya 2: 00.21. \nYahinduye umuhanda ukora muri 2018. \nMuri Werurwe 2022, Assefa yerekeje mu ntera ya marato mu marushanwa ya mbere ya Riyadh Marathon muri Arabiya Sawudite, arangiza ku mwanya wa karindwi n'amasaha 2:34:01. Muri Marato y'i Berlin muri Nzeri, umusore w'imyaka 28 yahagaritse isaha mu masaha abiri iminota 15 amasegonda 37, iterambere rirenga iminota 18 ndetse n\u2019umwanya wa gatatu wihuta cyane mu bagore icyo gihe, bitinda gusa 2:14:04 ya ufite agahigo ku isi Brigid Kosgei na 2:15:25 z'uwahoze afite agahio muri Paula Radcliffe. Gutyo yatsinze iminota irenga ibiri, atezi mbere amasomo m'uminota irenga ibiri nigice, anashyiraho amateka ya Etiyopiya. Mu irushanwa ryo gutandukana nabi, igice cye cya kabiri cyirutse mu gihe cya 67:24 cy'arihuse kurusha icyo gihe kimwe cya kabiri cya marathon ku giti cye iminota 67:28, yashyizeho muri Mata uwo mwaka ubwo yatsindaga ibirori agahigo muri Herzogenaurach, no mu Budage. \nIbyagezweho.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nIbisobanuro byose biva kumwirondoro w'imikino ngororamubiri. "}
{"id": "16291", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16291", "title": "Umusozi Kulal", "text": "Umusozi wa Kulal ni ikirunga cyazimye giherereye mu majyaruguru ya Kenya, mu burasirazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Turkana. Umusozi wa Kulal ufite uburebure bwa metero 2,285. Umujyi wa Loiyangalani uri ku kiyaga giherereye muri kilometero 50 i burengerazuba bw'umusozi wa Kulal.\nUmusozi Kulal wabungabunzwe kuva mu mwaka wa 1978. \nUmusozi Kulal niho honyine habonetse Kulal yera-ijisho (\"Zosterops kulalensis\"). "}
{"id": "16292", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16292", "title": "Mimi Belete", "text": "Mimi Belete Gebregeiorges (yavutse ku ya 9 Kamena 1988) wavukiye muri Umunyetiyopiya yiruka hagati kandi akiruka intera ndende uhatanira ku rwego mpuzamahanga muri Bahirayini. Yatsinze muri metero 5000 mu mikino ya Aziya yo muri 2010.\nYimukiye mu Bubiligi ari impunzi ya politiki ari kumwe na murumuna we, Almensh Belete, na we wiruka. Mu Bubiligi niho yatangiye guhatana: yirutse mu rwibutso rwo muri 2007 Dam Damme i Buruseli kandi ni we wegukanye irushanwa rya Eurocross muri 2009. Yahisemo kwimukira muri Bahrein mu ntangiriro za 2009 kandi yasohotse bwa mbere mu gihugu cye gishya yari mu marushanwa ya Aziya yo muri Cross Cross Country, aho yatwaye umudari wa feza inyuma ya mugenzi we Maryam Yusuf Jamal wahindutse. Yirutse muri Shampiyona y'isi ya IAAF mu mwaka wa 2009 muri Werurwe arangiza ku mwanya wo kuri 28. Yatsindiye kandi metero 1500 muri Shampiyona yisi yo muri 2009 yaberaga muri isiganwa maze agera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Umwaka urangiye yashyizeho ibihembo byiza mu nzu mu mikino yo muri Aziya yo muri 2009, afata umwanya wa kane muri metero 800 ndetse afata umwanya wa kabiri muri metero 1500 inyuma ya Liu Qing. \nYatangiye mu mwaka wo muri 2010 arengera izina rye muri Eurocross mbere yo kujya ku mwanya wa 16 mu marushanwa ya IAAF yo muri World Cross Country yabereye i Bydgoszcz muri 2010. Yatagije imbere muri metero 3000 neza arangiza umwanya wa kane muri 8: 32.18 mu nama ya Herculis IAAF Diamond League yabaye muri Nyakanga, nyuma y'ukwezi kumwe yiruka ku giti cye cya 4: 00.25 kuri metero 1500, gufata umwanya wa kabiri inyuma ya Jamal mu nama ya Rieti. Yatoranijwe guhagararira ikipe ya Aziya na Pasifika mu gikombe cy\u2019umugabane wo muri 2010 IAAF akaza ku mwanya wa kane muri metero 1500. Belete yatsindiye imidari ibiri mu mikino ya Aziya yo muri 2010 mu Gushyingo. Yashyizeho ingufu hamwe na Jamal muri metero 1500 kandi yarangije afite umudari wa bronze mugihe Truong Thanh Hang yamugose hafi kurangiza. Kwiruka muri metero 5000, yashoboye gukemura ikibazo cyu Buhinde muburyo bwa Preeja Sreedharan na Kavita Raut kugirango abone umudari wa zahabu mu minota 15: 15.59, arangiza ye gukanye igikombe cya mbere gikomeye. \nKu ya 12 Ukwakira 2018, yatsinze isiganwa rya Marato rya Toronto Waterfront, hamwe na masomo y'amasomo n'ibyiza bya 2:22:28. "}
{"id": "16293", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16293", "title": "Gelete Burka", "text": "Gelete Burka Bati (rimwe yandika nabi \"Burika\", Oromo: Galate Burqaa Baati, yavutse ku ya 23 Mutarama 1986) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka intera ndende. Yavukiye i Kofele muri Arsi Zone yo mu Karere ka Oromia, akarere kamwe na shampiyona w\u2019imikino Olempike ya Haile Gebrselassie.\nGelete niwe wabaye shampiyona wa masomo magufi muri 2006 IAAF yo muri World Cross Country Championship. Ni inshuro eshatu ye gukanye umudari wa Shampiyona yisi IAAF, Imikorere ye myiza ni umudari wa zahabu muri metero 1500 muri 2008. Yitabiriye inshuro enye mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri 2005 kugeza 2011, kandi ahagarariye Etiyopiya mu mikino Olempike haba muri 2008 na 2012.\nYatsindiye kandi umudari ku rwego rw'a karere, kuba yarabaye igisonga cya Shampiyona nya furika muri 2010 mu mikino ngororamubiri ndetse abona n'u mudari wa zahabu mu mikino yo muri Afurika muri 2007. Yari umunyafurica ufite agahigo ko kwiruka ibirometero 1500 mu nzu.\nUmwuga.\nBurka ya mbere ya gezeho cyane muri 2003 muri IAAF World Cross Country Championship, aho yatsindiye umudari w'umuringa mu marushanwa y'abato. Yatangiye kwigaragaza cyane mu mikino ngororamubiri mu mpera z'uwo mwaka, nyuma y\u2019uko federasiyo ya Etiyopiya yanze ko Merima Denboba yitabira amarushanwa, Burka yafashe isiganwa ry\u2019 abagore mu gikombe cya Lotto Cross Cup Bruxelles. Umwaka ukurikira yasubiye mu Bubiligi maze asubiramo ibikorwa. Nyuma yo kuba shampiyo w'isi muto muri cross country yiruka muri Shampiyona yisi ya XC muri 2005, yitabiriye amarushanwa yisi yo muri 2005 yaberaga muri isiganwa, arangiza umunani mu kwiruka metero 1500. Ukwezi kumwe y'egukanye umudari wa bronze muri metero 3000 ku mukino w'anyuma w'imikino ngororamubiri. Yasoje shampiyona itsinze Espagne Cross Internacional de Venta de Ba\u00f1os. "}
{"id": "16294", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16294", "title": "Dawit Seyaum", "text": "Dawit Seyaum Biratu (yavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 1996) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati hamwe n' intera ndende akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 1500. Yegukanye umwanya wa kane muri Shampiyona y'isi muri 2015 kandi y'egukana umudari wa feza mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu yo muri 2016. Dawit yatwaye umudari w'umuringa muri metero 5000 muri Shampiyona y'isi muri 2022.\nYari mu birori by\u2019inzobere byegukanye umudari wa feza mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cyo muri 2013, na shampiyona w\u2019ingimbi muri 2014.\nUmwuga.\nDawit Seyaum y'agize uruhare runini ku rwego rw'igihugu muri 2013, yegukana metero 1500 irushanwarya mutomuri Etiyopiya. Yatangiye gukinira ku rwego mpuzamahanga ku mu zunguruko wa IAAF Diamond League aho yakurikiranye nyuma gato, maze ashyira ku mwanya wa mbere iminota 4: 14.95 mu birori bya bereye mu nama ya Doha Diamond League. Yatoranijwe guhatanira muri metero 1500 mu marushanwa y\u2019urubyiruko ku isi yo muri 2013 ya beraga mu mikino ngororamubiri yabereye i Donetsk, muri Ukerene kandi yari igisonga cya Tigist Gashaw - ku nshuro ye ya mbere Etiyopiya, ifata imyanya ibiri ya mbere muri ibyo birori. Yahinduye iyi myanya mu marushanwa yo muri Afurika mu ngimbi muri 2013, atwara igikombe n'iminota 4: 09.00 amasegonda menshi imbere ya Tigist. \nDawit yatsindiye irushanwa rye rya mbere rya bereye i Prague muri Gashyantare 2014, yiruka metero 1500 hamwe nigihe cy'iminota 4: 09.08. Mu nama ya Rabat, yigaragaje mu bantu 1500 ba mbere ku isi abiruka bafite intsinzi m'uminota 3: 59.53 - agahigo yabato ya Etiyopiya hamwe n'inama y'inama yashyizwe ku mwanya wa karindwi kurutonde rwisi muri uwo mwaka. Yongeye hafi iminota ine muri New York Diamond League, aho yarangije ari uwambere. Dawit yinjiye muri Shampiyona yisi yabato muri Eugene nkuko akunda kandi abitangaho ye gukana umudari wa zahabu, nta nkomyi mu mikino ya nyuma. Umudari we wa mbere mukuru yakurikiranye muri Shampiyona nya furika yaberaga muri isiganwa, aho yari umudari wa feza inyuma ya Hellen Obiri w'inararibonye. Dawit yatoranijwe mu ikipe ya Afurika mu gikombe cya IAAF muri 2014 ndetse arangiza afite umudari wa bronze inyuma ya Sifan Hassan na Shannon Rowbury. "}
{"id": "16295", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16295", "title": "Yihunlish Delelecha", "text": "Yihunlish Delelecha (uzwi kandi ku izina rya Yihunelish Bekele Deleleneh, yavutse ku ya 22 Ukwakira 1981) ni Umunyetiyopiya n' Umunyamerika wiruka mu ntera ndende ndese yari nu munyamuryango w\u2019ikipe ya Shampiyona y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri 1998 yatsinze umudari wa feza muri Etiyopiya. \nUmwuga wabigize umwuga.\nDelelecha yitabiriye amasiganwa mu cyakabiri cya marato muri Etiyopiya. no muri, Moroke, akurayo umudari wa feza.\nnyuma yaje kujya muri america.\nMuri Kamena 2011, iminsi 38 nyuma yo gutsinda i Pittsburgh, Delelecha yegukanye umwanya wa mbere muri Marato ya nyirakuru aba 35 hamwe na 02:30:39. Umugore m'ugenzi we wo mu gihugu, Buzunesh Deba yari yamumenyesheje iryo siganwa kandi amutera inkunga yo kugerageza. Umunsi wa 2011 watangijwe n'imvura, ihagarara nyuma yi siganwa ritangiye. Hariho umurizo muto hamwe n'ikirere gikonje bihagije kugirango ubone umwuka wa biruka ku nkombe yikiyaga cya Superior. Delelecha yi rukanye na Everlyne Lagat kugeza kilometero cya 19. Lagat yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri, naho Dot McMahan yaje avuye inyuma arangiza uwa gatatu. \nUgushyingo ya muzanye mu mujyi w'urukundo rwa kivandimwe kuri Philadelphia Half Marathon. Yatsinze, atsinda Bekelech Bedada w'i myaka 19 na Amanda Marino, umwe mu bagize ikipe ya shampiyona yo muri NCAA Cross Country yo mu 2009 ya Villanova. Igihe cya Delelecha cyiza ku giti cye ni isaha 1:12:42. \nYabaye uwa gatatu muri Marato ya Houston muri 2012, ubwo Benita Willis yamusohokaga hafi yo kurangiza na Alemitu Abera\u00a0[fr] yahunze ayoboye, ashyiraho inyandiko. \nMuri 2012, Delelecha ya yoboye isiganwa rya Cherry Blossom 10 Mile i Washington DC. Igihe cye cyari 54:33 yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu, inyuma y'u watsinze Julliah Kerubo Tinega na Malika Mejdoub uri ku mwanya wa kabiri. \nMuri uwo mwaka, yabaye uwa kane muri Pittsburgh Half Marathon (mu gihe Fatuma Sado yanditse agahigo mu masomo), uwa gatatu agaruka muri Marato ya nyi rakuru (kuri iyi nshuro inyuma ya Everlyne Lagat na Mulu Seboka), uwa gatanu mu Mijyi ya Twin Marato (inyuma ya Jeannette Faber) nuwa kane muri Philadelphia Half Marathon. \nUbuzima bwite.\nDelelecha yabaga i Waldorf, muri Maryland muri 2011. Rimwe na rimwe yakoraga imyitozo i Albuquerque, muri New Mexico, hamwe n'i tsinda ry'abakinnyi b'Abanya furika mu gihe bitegura gusiganwa. "}
{"id": "16296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16296", "title": "Betlhem Desalegn", "text": "Betlhem Desalegn Belayneh (yavutse ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 1991 i Addis Abeba) ni umunyetiyopiya wavukiye muri Etiyopiya Emirati wiruka hagati. Mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2012, yitabiriye metero 1500 mu bagore.\nMuri 2017, Betlhem ya bujijwe imyaka ibiri kubera amakosa muri pasiporo y\u2019ibinyabuzima. Usibye kubuzwa, ibisubizo bye byose buaje hagati ya 6 Werurwe 2014 na 22 Nyakanga 2016 byateshejwe agaciro. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16297", "revid": "16886", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16297", "title": "Abafatanyabikorwa barasabwa kugira uruhare mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe", "text": "Imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ni ikibazo giteye impungenge kwisi yose kandi gikomeje kugira ingaruka nyinshi, akaba ari yo mpamvu abafatanyabikorwa ba leta basabwa kongera ingengo y\u2019imari ishyirwa mu guhangana n\u2019iki kibazo.\nImihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe igira ingaruka zirimo imyuzure, inkangu, isuri itwara ubutaka, amapfa, inzara, gutwara ubuzima bw\u2019abantu, gusenya ibikorwaremezo n\u2019ibindi.\nU Rwanda rukeneye arenga miliyari 11$ azifashishwa mu bikorwa byo kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe muri gahunda ya \"Nationally Determined Contributions (NDC)\", gahunda igihugu cyiyemeje mu kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe hagendewe ku biteganywa n\u2019amasezerano ya Paris yerekeye imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\nMuri miliyari 11 z\u2019amadolari zizakenewa mu gushyira mu bikorwa ibyo u Rwanda rwiyemeje, miliyari 5.7 $ azakoreshwa mu bikorwa byo kugabanya ibishobora guteza imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe, naho miliyari 5.3 $ zijye mu byo guhangana n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\nAya mafaranga akenewe yose biteganijwe ko azaturuka mu bushobozi igihugu gisanganywe andi akava mu nkunga zo hanze.\nKuri uyu wa Gatatu tariki 22 Werurwe 2023, Minisiteri y\u2019imari n\u2019igenamigambi yahurije hamwe abafatanyabikorwa ba leta baganira ku kuzamura amafaranga yongerwa mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere no kureba uko byakwinjizwa mu ngengo y\u2019imari.\nUmunyamabanga wa Leta muri Minisiteri y\u2019Imari n\u2019Igenamigambi ushinzwe Imari ya Leta, Richard Tusabe, yavuze ko iyi nama igamije gushaka amafaranga yafasha mu guhangana n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019imihindagurikire.\nAti \u201cNi ukureba ese ayo mafaranga yava he, twayabona gute, twayakoresha gute, na raporo twatanga zatangwa gute kugira ngo tugire ibipimo bidufasha kureba niba ibyo twiyemeje koko tubigeraho\u201d.\nLeta y\u2019u Rwanda ifite ingamba zikomeye zerekeye ibikorwa byo kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihezikaba ziteganya ko mu mwaka wa 2030 imyuka itera ukwiyongera k\u2019ubushyuhe ku isi izagabanukaho 38%, ibi bikaba bizagabanya toni miliyoni 4.6 z\u2019ibyuka bya carbone.\nU Rwanda rukeneye ingengo y\u2019imari ingana na miliyari 11 z\u2019amadolari kugira ngo izi ngamba zo guhashya imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe zishyirwe mu bikorwa.\nIbikorwa bijyanye no guhashya imihindagurkire y\u2019ibihe bizatwara Miliyari 5.7, mu gihe ibijyanye no guhangana n\u2019ingaruka bizatwara Miliyali 5.3 z\u2019amadolari.\nTusabe avuga ko ibi biganiro ari andi mahirwe yo kureba uko hakubakwa igihugu cyashobora guhangana n\u2019impinduka z\u2019ikirere ku buryo ibibazo byose byashoboraga guterwa n\u2019imihindukire y\u2019ikirere bikumirwa, ibyabayeho bigakemurwa.\nJean Michel Swalens ukora muri Ambasade y\u2019Ababiligi ushinzwe imikoranire hagati y\u2019u Bubiligi n\u2019u Rwanda, yavuze ko nk\u2019abafatanyabikorwa ba leta bareba uko bakongera ingengo y\u2019imari ishyirwa mu bikorwa byo gukumira no guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\nAti \u201cDushobora gushyira amafaranga muri izi ntego, tukamenya ibyo bikorwa ndetse tukanagenzura umusaruro wagezweho mu gukumira no guhangana n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere\u201d.\nYavuze ko nk\u2019u Bubiligi, hari ibiganiro by\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019u Rwanda mu bijyanye no guhangana n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe, hari gahunda nshya y\u2019ubutwererane bw\u2019ibihugu byombi izatangira mu 2024 izitsa cyane ku gushyira imbaraga mu gukumira no guhangana n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe. Ubu butwererane buzibanda cyane ku bikorwa by\u2019ubuhinzi.\nUmuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019Ikigega cy\u2019u Rwanda cyita ku bidukikije (FONERWA), Teddy Mugabo, yavuze ko ibikorwa by\u2019iterambere n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe bidasigana bityo imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe ikwiye gushyirwa mu by\u2019ibanze.\nAti \u201cGushyira ingengo y\u2019imari mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe, dukwiye kubibona nk\u2019icy\u2019ibanze aho kubifata nk\u2019inyongera\u201d.\nU Rwanda rufite imishinga yo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe irimo gutunganya ibishanga bitanu mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Abikorera barashishikarizwa gushora imari muri uru rwego.\nIkigega Mpuzamahanga cy\u2019imari (IMF), giherutse kwemeza inkunga ya miliyoni 319 z\u2019amadolari ni ukuvuga miliyari zirenga 340 Frw, zo gukoresha muri gahunda zo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe no kubaka ubukungu buhamye.\nAmashakiro.\nhttp://mobile.igihe.com/ibidukikije/article/hakenewe-miliyari-11-abafatanyabikorwa-basabwe-kugira-uruhare-mu-guhangana-n"}
{"id": "16298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16298", "title": "Abacukura amabuye yagaciro bakwiye Guca ukubiri no Kwangiza Ibidukikije", "text": "Mu myaka ishize ubwo ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro bwakorwaga mu kajagari mu Rwanda, byari bibangamiye ibidukikije kuko ababukoraga mu buryo butemewe batitaga ku gusiga batunganyije aho bacukuye.\nIbi biri mu byagiraga ingaruka zo guteza isuri n\u2019inkangu mu gihe imvura iguye, ndetse bigateza n\u2019ibindi bibazo bibangamira ibidukikije.\nUmuyobozi wa sosiyete DEMICO ikorera ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro mu Karere ka Kamonyi, Emmanuel Kinyogote, yabwiye IGIHE ko umwuga wabo utacyangiza ibidukikije. Ati \u2018\u2018Uko tugenda ducukura bya kinyamwuga, niko tugenda dukora akazi kacu tubungabunga ibidukikije. Nk\u2019amazi dukoresha ntabwo tugomba kuyareka ngo amanuke ku misozi, aho ashobora guteza isuri\u2019\u2019.\nKinyogote avuga ko banatera ingemwe z\u2019ibiti, ku buryo aho batagikorera ubucukuzi bw'amabuye yagaciro basiga bahateye ibiti, ndetse bagasiga basubiranyije ahacukuwe hadashobora guterwa ibyo biti.\nUshinzwe ibikorwa byo kubungabunga ibidukikije muri sosiyete IMC ikorera ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro mu Karere ka Muhanga, Afazaria Adelphine, na we avuga ko abari mu bucukuzi bw'amabuye yagaciro bahagurukiye kubungabunga ibidukikije. Ati \u201cHazamo gutera ibiti, gucukura imirwanyasuri kuko mwabonye kuri uyu musozi dukoreraho, ni umusozi uhanamye cyane\u2019\u2019.\nAfazaria avuga ko ubucukuzi bw'amabuye yagaciro bwa none atari bwo bwangiza imigezi igaragara hirya no hino yuzuyemo isuri, ahubwo ko ibyo byagizwemo uruhare n\u2019ubucukuzi bw'amabuye yagaciro bwa kera, ku buryo ababukora ubu bari kuziba icyuho ngo bahanagure iyo sura mbi uyu mwuga wahoranye.\nNubwo bimeze gutyo, haracyagaragara bake bakibikora mu buryo butemewe n\u2019amategeko, bagacukura amabuye nabi ku buryo bwangiza imirima y\u2019abaturage cyangwa n\u2019imisozi bukorerwaho.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019Ishami rishinzwe Iyubahirizategeko ry\u2019ibidukikije mu Kigo cy\u2019Igihugu cyo Kubungabunga Ibidukikije (REMA), Akimpaye Beata, aherutse gusaba ubufatanye bw\u2019inzego zose mu kurwanya umuntu wese ukora ubucukuzi butemewe n\u2019amategeko.\nYavuze ko ubucukuzi nk\u2019ubwo bwangiza ibidukikije, bitewe n\u2019uko ababukora muri ubwo buryo basiga badasubiranyije aho bacukuye, cyangwa ngo bafate izindi ngamba zo kurengera ibidukikije zirimo no gutera ibiti mu rwego rwo gufata ubutaka ngo budatwarwa n\u2019imvura.\nIngabire Diane, Ushinzwe ibidukikije mu karere ka Nyanza, avuga ko gukora ingendo shuri mu kwiga uko isuri irwanywa ari kime mu byafasha ababishinzwe kwirebera uburyo kutita ku bidukikije byangiza amasoko y'amazi. Akomeza avugako nyuma yo guhugurwa n'umushinga wa LVEMP II ukorera mu kigo cy'igihugu cyita ku bidukikije,REMA,yabashije kunguka ubumenyi azifashisha mu guhwitura abacukuzi bamabuye yagaciro."}
{"id": "16299", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16299", "title": "Genzebe Dibaba", "text": "Genzebe Dibaba Keneni (yavutse ku ya 8 Gashyantare 1991) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati kandi ntera ndende. Muri metero 1500 muri 2016 y'egukanye umudari wa feza muri olempike, y'egukanye umudari wa zahabu muri iri rushanwa n'umuringa wo muri metero 5000 muri Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2015. Genzebe n'iyubu ifite agahigo kisi kuri metero 1500, hamwe n'ibyabaye m'urugo imbere ya kilometero imwe, muri metero 3000 na metero 5000. Afite umwihariko wo gutunga agahigo menshi kisi n'umugore umwe mu mateka y'umurongo, hamwe nubu atwaye bane, hiyongereyeho ibyiza bibiri byisi.\nAmaze kwitabira amarushanwa yose y\u2019i mikino ngororamubiri ku isi hagati ya 2009 na 2017, Genzebe yashyizwe ku mukino wa nyuma w'i byabaye byose y'itabiriye. Ni inshuro eshanu ari shampiyona w\u2019imbere mu nzu, yegukanye metero 1500 muri 2012, na metero 3000 muri 2014 na 2016, kandi y'egukana metero 1500 / 3000m muri 2018. Yatsinze cyane nk'umukinnyi muto. Mu mwaka wa 2008, afite imyaka 17, ye gukanye igikombe cya mbere cy\u2019isi mu marushanwa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 maze atwara umudari wa feza muri metero 5000 muri Shampiyona y\u2019isi mu bari munsi yimyaka 20. Umwaka ukurikira, Genzebe yongeyeho igikombe cya kabiri cya Cross Country muri 2008 Amarushanwa Yabato Yisi Yimikino ngororamubiri 2008 Amarushanwa Yabato Yisi Yimikino ngororamubiri mu bari munsi y'imyaka 20, naho mu 2010, Shampiyona y'isi muri 2008 Amarushanwa Yabato Yisi Yimikino ngororamubiri\" Amarushanwa Yabato Yisi Yimikino ngororamubirimu bari munsi yimyaka 20 muri metero 5000 ya zahabu. Yatsindiye igikombe cya Diamond League muri 2015 muri ibyo birori. Yahawe igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Laureus wari 2014, na IAAF Umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka ku isi muri 2015. \nGenzebe akomoka mu muryango wa siporo w\u2019abatsindiye imidari myinshi mu mikino Olempike, barimo bashiki be Tirunesh na Ejegayehu, na nyirasenge Derartu Tulu.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nGenzebe Dibaba ni umwe mu bagize ubwoko bwa Oromo ukomoka mu butumburuke bwa Arsi Zone yo mu karere ka Oromiya kandi akomoka mu muryango w'a bakinnyi. Mukuru we Tirunesh ni umukinnyi wamamaye we gukanye imidari myinshi ikomeye. Undi mushiki wye mukuru, Ejegayehu, yegukanye umudari wa feza muri metero 10,000 mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2004, murumuna we Dejene na we ni umukinnyi. Nyirasenge ni Derartu Tulu, 1992 na 2000 yari shampiyo muri olempike muri metero 10,000. \nUmwuga.\nMu marushanwa y'isi yabereye i Beijing, yatwaye metero 1500, kandi yatwaye umudari wa bronze muri metero 5000 ibyabaye.\nYahawe igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza ku isi muri IAAF mu mwaka wo muri 2015. "}
{"id": "16300", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16300", "title": "Hari benshi bashyigikiye Urubyiruko rwiyemeza kurengera Ibidukikije", "text": "Ambasade ya Islael mu Rwanda yifatanije nisi kwizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga ngarukamwaka w\u2019isi (International Mother Earth Day).\nKwizihiza uwo munsi byaranzwe no gutangiza amahugurwa agamije kongera umubare w\u2019abanyeshuri ba Kaminuza bakora ubushakashatsi ku bimera.\nAyo mahugurwa yitabiriwe n\u2019abanyeshuri ba Kaminuza bagera kuri 30, yatewe inkunga na Ambasade ya Israel mu Rwanda, akaba agamije gutanga umusanzu ku iterambere rya gahunda y\u2019Igihugu yo gukora ubushakashatsi ku bimera no gukusanya amakuru ajyanye n\u2019umurage w\u2019ibimera bitandukanye biboneka mu gihugu.\nUmurima ukorerwamo ubushakashatsi ku bimera mu Rwanda (Rwanda\u2019s National Herbarium) uherereye muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, ukaba ubonemo ubwoko bw\u2019ibimera bigera ku bihumbi 17.\nMu rwego rwo guteza imbere ubushakashatsi no gufasha abanyeshuri barangiza Kaminuza ndetse n\u2019abarimu babo kumva neza urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, abo banyeshuri n\u2019abarimu babo bafashijwe gusura Pariki ya Nyungwe kugira ngo bahakure ubumenyi bw\u2019ibanze.\nIryo tsinda ryakusanyije ubwoko bw\u2019ibimera 30, bizaherwaho mu gukora ubushakashatsi bwimbitse ndetse n\u2019inyigo ku ruhare rw\u2019ibimera mu rusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019ibidukikije muri rusange.\nMuri uwo muhango, Ambasaderi wa Israel mu Rwanda, Ron Adam yavuze ko kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima byagombye kuba mu byihutirwa igihugu cyitaho kurusha ibindi.\nAmbasaderi Dr Adam yagize ati \u201cKimwe mu bintu byagombye kwitabwaho ni ukubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima no kwita ku bidukikije muri rusange. Abatuye Isi basabwa kwita ku rusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, kuko kwangirika k\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima bikomeje kuba ikibazo gihangayikishije muri iyi myaka ya vuba aha, n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ijyana n\u2019ubushyuhe bukabije \u201d.\nKabera Juliet, Umuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu cyita ku bidukikije (REMA), wari waherekeje abo banyeshuri bahugurwa, yavuze ko u Rwanda rwiyemeje kubungabunga ibidukikije, bityo ko ubwo bumenyi abo banyeshuri bahabwa bukenewe cyane mu rubyiruko, kugira ngo rushobore guteza imbere gahunda za Leta zijyanye no kwita ku bidukikije.\nUmwe mu bahuguwe yavuze ko ubumenyi bahawe bwabafashije kuko bwabahaye amahirwe yo kumva neza ibyo biga, kandi babyigiye hanze y\u2019ishuri.\nUwase Aim\u00e9e Sandrine, Umuhuzabikorwa wa gahunda y\u2019igihugu yo gukora ubushakashatsi ku bimera (National Herbarium of Rwanda), ndetse wanarangije kwiga mu ishami ry\u2019Ibinyabuzima muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda na we yari muri urwo rugendoshuri rwo muri Pariki ya Nyungwe.\nYagize ati \u201cNishimiye uru rugendo, nize ibintu byinshi bishya, niboneye n\u2019amaso yanjye bimwe mu bimera twari twarize mu ishuri. Turashimira Ambasade ya Israel mu Rwanda kuri aya mahirwe yaduhaye.\u201d\nProf. Elias Bizuru, Umwarimu wa Kaminuuza mu ishami ry\u2019ibimera n\u2019andi masomo ashamikiyeho, mu Ishami rya Kaminuza ryigisha Siyansi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga (UR College of Science and Technology), yavuze ko ayo mahugurwa n\u2019urugendo bizafasha abanyeshuri kumenya kugenzura uko ubwoko bw\u2019ibimera bugenda buhinduka bijyanye n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere.\nBizuru ati \u201cNize byinshi njye n\u2019abanyeshuri banjye, twabonye ubwoko bwinshi bw\u2019ibimera, kandi hari n\u2019ibyo twashoboye kuzana ubundi bitabaga mu murima wa Kaminuza ukorerwamo ubushakashatsi ku bimera\u201d.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibimera/article/ambasade-ya-israel-mu-rwanda-ishyigikiye-urubyiruko-rukora-ubushakashatsi-ku-bimera"}
{"id": "16301", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16301", "title": "Gutera ibiti mu rwego rwo kurwanya Imigindagurikire yikirere", "text": "Mu rwego rwo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, ku bufatanye n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa bako, Akarere ka Rulindo karateganya gutera ibiti birenze Miliyoni eshanu mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka ibiri.\nKuri ubu muri ako Karere hatewe ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka, biri kuri hegitari zirenga ibihumbi 40, naho ubundi buso bugera kuri hegitari zirenga ibihumbi 14, buteyeho ibiti bivangwa n\u2019ishyamba.\nEmmanuel Hategekimana, umuyobozi w\u2019ishami ry\u2019ubuhinzi, ubworozi n\u2019umutungo kamere, avuga ko urugendo rwo gutera ibiti muri ako Karere rugikomeza, n\u2019ubwo bahagaze neza iyo urebye ku gipimo cyo ku rwego rwIigihugu, ku biti bigomba kuba bitewe ku mashyamba.\nAti \u201cIyo urebye ku gipimo cy\u2019uko ubuso buteweho amashyamba, turi ku kigero cya 26%, mu gihe ku rwego rw\u2019Igihugu dufite ko ubuso bugomba kuba buteyeho amashyamba, bugomba kuba buri ku kigero cya 30%, urumva ko ari igikorwa gikomeza, kuko turimo gushyira imbaraga mu gutera ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka, no kuvugurura amashyamba ashaje, kugira ngo tugerageze guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere\u201d.\nIyo agereranyije n\u2019ibipimo bagezeho, ndetse n\u2019umuhigo bagomba kwesa, Hategekimana asanga akurikije abafatanyabikorwa bafite, nta kabuza ko bazabigeraho.\nAti \u201cIyo turebye ibipimo bafite, n\u2019ibyo bateganya kuzakora, umuhigo tuzawesa nta kabuza, ni umufatanyabikorwa waziye igihe, kuko bafite umushinga wo gutera ibiti mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka itanu, kandi umaze igihe cy\u2019imyaka ibiri irenga. Urumva mu gihe gisigaye dutera ibiti, twumva tugereranyije n\u2019ibipimo tugenda tugira buri mwaka, uwo muhigo tuzawesa\u201d.\nUmuyobozi Mukuru w\u2019umuryango uharanira kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019ibinyabuzima mu muhora wa Albert (ARCOS), ukorera mu turere twa Bugesera na Rulindo, Dr. Sam Kanyamibwa, avuga ko bateganya gutera ibiti birenga miliyoni eshanu mu Karere ka Rulindo, mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka ibiri.\nAti \u201cMuri Rulindo tuzatera ibiti bigera hafi kuri Miliyoni eshatu zijyanye na gahunda yo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, ariko hazaterwa ibindi birenga miliyoni ebyiri, twavuga ko ari ibiti bisarurwa vuba, kandi bizajya bigenda bisimburwa, ari byo bijyamo iby\u2019imbuto zoroheje, abaturage bashobora gusarura kugira ngo bibateze imbere\u201d.\nUmunyamabanga Nshingabikorwa w\u2019Umurenge wa Burega, Rodrigue Mbera, avuga ko uretse kuba ARCOS bakorana muri gahunda zijyanye no gutera ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka, imikoranire yabo ngo yahinduye ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage.\nAti \u201cUyu munsi amatsinda bagiye badukorera mu buryo bwiza, nubwo ahuriye ku byo gutera ibiti, ariko na none hari ibindi duhuriramo, kuko iyo abantu bahuye ari 30, bicaye hamwe no kungurana ibitekerezo mu buryo bw\u2019imihingire, kwizigamira n\u2019ibindi, ibyo twe tubona ari imbaraga zo kugira ngo umuturage atere intambwe, ave aho yari ari agere ku rundi rwego rwiza\u201d.\nZimwe mu mpamvu zituma ibiti bishobora kwangirika ntibikure nk\u2019uko byari biteganyijwe mu Karere ka Rulindo, zirimo izuba ryinshi, cyangwa kudaterwa neza, ariko ngo ibipfuye birasimbuzwa, kugeza igihe umusaruro wateganyijwe ugezweho 100%.\nIbiti bigomba guterwa bigeze mu bwoko 15, harimo ubugera kuri 20% bw\u2019ibiti bya gakondo.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibimera/article/rulindo-bagiye-guhangana-n-imihindagurikire-y-ikirere-batera-ibiti-bisaga-miliyoni-eshanu"}
{"id": "16302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16302", "title": "Kutre Dulecha", "text": "Kutre Dulecha (yavutse ku ya 22 Kanama 1978 i Sidamo) ni umukinnyi wiruka hagati mu kibuga muri Etiyopiya. Arushanwa muri metero 1500, aho yashyizeho agahigo kisi muri 1997. Yabaye shampiyona w\u2019imbere muri 2004, Etiyopiya ya mbere yegukanye umudari wa metero 1500 mu bagore. Yatsinze amasomo magufi y'abagore muri Shampiyona yisi ya IAAF muri 2000."}
{"id": "16303", "revid": "11484", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16303", "title": "Kubungabunga ibidukikije bifitanye isano no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu", "text": "Abayobozi n\u2019abakozi ba Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, ku itariki ya 26 Ugushyingo 2022 bifatanyije n\u2019abayobozi ndetse n\u2019abaturage b\u2019Akarere ka Gicumbi hamwe na Guverineri w\u2019Amajyaruguru mu gikorwa cy\u2019umuganda rusange wibanze ku gutera ibiti mu Murenge wa Cyumba.\nKomisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu yaboneyeho no kuhatangiriza icyumweru cyahariwe uburenganzira bwa Muntu kizasozwa ku itariki ya 10 Ukuboza 2022 hizihizwa isabukuru y\u2019imyaka 74 ishize hashyizweho Itangazo Mpuzamahanga ryerekeye Uburenganzira bwa Muntu (The Universal Declaration of Human Rights).\nMuri uwo muganda rusange, Akarere ka Gicumbi na Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Uburenzira bwa Muntu, bafatanyije n\u2019umushinga wa Green Gicumbi watangijwe muri 2019 na Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda, ibinyujije muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ibidukikije n\u2019Ikigega cy\u2019Ibidukikije mu Rwanda (FONERWA), ukaba ugamije kongera ubudahangarwa ku mihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere mu Majyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda.\nUmuganda wabereye mu Murenge wa Cyumba ku musozi wa Kivuruga mu Kagari ka Nyaruka, ahatewe ibiti bibarirwa mu bihumbi 12 ku buso busaga Hegitari eshatu, mu rwego rwo kuvugurura amashyamba ashaje. \nMu butumwa yagejeje ku bitabiriye uyu muganda, Guverineri Nyirarugero Dancille, yasabye abatuye ako gace kubyaza umusaruro amahirwe babonye, cyane cyane bakesha umushinga Green Gicumbi, bityo bakiteza imbere, abasaba kandi gukumira no kurwanya ibiyobyabwenge na magendu, kurwanya isuri no gukumira Ibiza, bita ku biti byatewe.\nAti \u201cTwese nk\u2019abanya-Gicumbi turusheho kubifata neza no kubibyaza umusaruro mu rwego rwo kurushaho guhangana n\u2019ingaruka zikomoka ku mihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\u201d\nPerezida wa Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, Mukasine Marie Claire, yagarutse ku kamaro ko kubungabunga ibidukikije, kurwanya isuri no kubahiriza uburenganzira bwa muntu, asobanura ko kubyitaho bifite uruhare runini mu mu mibereho myiza ya muntu.\nAha ni ho yahereye ashishishikariza abafatanyabikorwa ba Komisiyo kurushaho kongera uruhare rwabo mu guteza imbere ibidukikije no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nMukasine ati \u201cIngaruka zikomoka ku mihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe zihungabanya bikomeye uburenganzira. Ni inshingano zacu twese kubungabunga ibidukikije hagamijwe kurushaho guharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu.\u201d\nMukasine Marie Claire na we yashimye ibikorwa by\u2019umushinga Green Gicumbi kuko bigamije gufasha umuturage kugira ahazaza heza.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibimera/article/kubungabunga-ibidukikije-bifitanye-isano-no-kurengera-uburenganzira-bwa-muntu-mukasine"}
{"id": "16304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16304", "title": "Axumawit Embaye", "text": "Axumawit Alem Embaye (yavutse ku ya 18 Ukwakira 1994) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka intera ndende, akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 1500. Ni inshuro ebyiri yegukanye umudari wa feza muri gikombe cy\u2019imbere kuva muri 2014 na 2022.\nUmwuga.\nAxumawit Embaye yagaragaye bwa mbere muri 2012. Yabaye igisonga cya metero 800 muri Shampiyona y'abato ya Etiyopiya kandi yarangije ari uwa karindwi muri Shampiyona y'isi yabato y'abato muri 2012 muri isiganwa, yagize ibihe byiza by'umuntu ku giti cye ni iminota 4: 12.92. Yarahinduye ajya muri metero 1500 muri shampiyona muri 2013 kandi yitwara neza kumuzunguruko. Yirutse neza mu minota 4: 09.11 mu nzu ya XL Galan kugira ngo ashyire ku mwanya wa kabiri kandi afite umurongo wa kabiri washyizwe hanze mu mikino ya Bislett, Folksam Grand Prix na KBC Ijoro ry'imikino ngororamubiri (yashyizeho ibihe byiza byari 4: hari Iminota 05.16 mu birori by'anyuma). \nImyanya itatu ya mbere yagizwe mu nama ya Banki ya PSD na Weltklasse i Karlsruhe mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wakurikiyeho y'amuzaniye umwanya muri iyi kipe mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu yo muri 2014 mu birori bya metero 1500. Yabaye uwa kabiri kuri Abebe Aregawi mu bushyuhe kandi asubiramo iyo mi korere ku mukino wa nyuma; nubwo Abebe yatsinze neza isiganwa, Axumawit yagumye imbere ya bandi b'apakira gutwara umudari wa feza. \nYashyize ku mwanya wa kane mu birori by\u2019i nzobere mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu ya IAAF muri 2016 yabereye Portland, Oregon. Sifan Hassan niwe we gukanye igihe Dawit Seyaum na Gudaf Tsegay barangije ku mwanya wa kabiri n'uwa gatatu.\nMu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2019 yabereye i Doha, Axumawit yavanyweho mu bushyuhe bwo kwiruka metero 1500 mu bagore.\nMu 2022, Axumawit yasubiyemo ibyo yagezeho kuva mu mwaka wo muri 2014 yegukana umudari wa feza ya metero 1500 muri Shampiyona y\u2019imbere mu nzu yabereye i Belgrade, isaha 4: 02.29. Mugenzi we Tsegay yayoboye imidari ya Etiyopiya muri 3: 57.19 mugihe Hirut Meshesha yarangije umwanya wa gatatu (4: 03.39). "}
{"id": "16305", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16305", "title": "Emebt Etea", "text": "Emebt Etea Bedada (yavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1990 i Waliso) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka intera ndende uhatanira mu marushanwa yo kwiruka mu muhanda. Yagaragaye nk'umwiruka vuba mubto (abatarengeje imyaka 19) hamwe na Shampiyona ny'afurika y'abato kabiri muri metero 1500 na metero 3000. Yabanye umudari mubato wa bronze mu m'arushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country Championship muri 2008.\nYimukiye kure cyane hagati yo muri 2009 atangira kwitabira igice cya marato. Yatsinze marato muri Brescia na Venice muri 2012. Yatsindiye kandi ikipe umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Half Marathon 2012 hamwe n'ikipe y'abagore ya Etiyopiya. Marato ye nziza ni amasaha 2:25:53.\nMushiki we muto Korahubsh Itaa niwe wabaye shampiyo w\u2019urubyiruko ku isi muri 2009 muri stelechase kandi yavunnye urubyiruko ku isi neza mu metero 2000 intera. \nUmwuga.\nAmarushanwa ya mbere ya Emebt muri Etiyopiya yaje afite imyaka cumi n'itanu. Yabaye igisonga muri metero 5000 muri Shampiyona yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba kandi yari metero1500, yegukanye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona ny'afurika y'imikino ngororamubiri muri 2005. Yashyizwe ku mwanya wa karindwi mu marushanwa y'abato mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country muri 2006, arangiza ari uwa kane muri Shampiyona y\u2019ingimbi imyaka 2006. Yaje kandi ku mwanya wa gatandatu muri uwo mwaka ukomeye wo muri Etiyopiya. "}
{"id": "16306", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16306", "title": "Birtukan Fente", "text": "Birtukan Fente Alemu (yavutse ku ya 18 Kamena 1989) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka cyane muri metero 3000. Yahagarariye igihugu cye muri Shampiyona yisi muri 2011 na 2015 agera k'umukino wanyuma kunshuro y'ambere.\nAmarushanwa.\n1 Ntabwo yatangiriye k 'umukino wa nyuma\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16307", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16307", "title": "Tigist Gashaw", "text": "Tigist Gashaw Belay (yavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1996) ni Umunyetiyopiya wavukiye mu ntera yo hagati yiruka mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Bahirayini. Yaserukiye cye icyo gihugu mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2016 gusa ntiyakomeje imbere mu cyiciro cya mbere. Mbere yegukanye umudari wa zahabu mu ma rushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019urubyiruko muri 2013 atangirira muri Etiyopiya.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16308", "title": "Genet Gebregiorgis", "text": "Genet Gebregioris (yavutse muri 1975 i Addis Abeba) ni umunyetiyopiya w'umugore wiruka hagati y'irukankaga mu mpera ya za 1990 no muntangiriro yo muri 2000.\nYatsindiye umudari muri bronze muri metero 1500 mu mikino yo muri Afurika yose yabereye i Harare muri 1995 muir zimbabwe. Nyuma y'imyaka itatu i Dakar muri senegali, muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 1998 yegukanye umudari wa feza muri metero 3000.\nYabaye kandi mu m'akipe atanu ye gukanye umudari wa feza mu birori bigufi mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country Championship, arangiza ku mwanya wo muri 11 muri 1998, ku ya 16 muri 1999, ku ya 17 muri 2000, ku ya 16 muri 2001 na 16 muri 2002"}
{"id": "16309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16309", "title": "Werkuha Getachew", "text": "Werkwuha Getachew (yavutse 7 Ukuboza 1995) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Etiyopiya kabuhariwe mu kwiruka metero 3000. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri ibyo birori mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo muri 2022 na zahabu muri Shampiyona ny'afurika muri 2022.\nGetachew ni umunyetiyopiya ufite agahigo ko muri metero 800 na metero 3000. Kuva muri Nzeri 2022, yashyize ku mwanya wa kane mu birori bya nyuma ku rutonde rw'ibihe byose ku isi. Yari mu birori bye bidasanzwe muri 2022 shampyina ya Diamond League.\nMuri Kamena 2021 kuri Stade ya Fanny Blankers-Koen i Hengelo mu birori byo kugerageza imikino Olempike ya Etiyopiya, Werkwuha Getachew yateje impungenge muri metero 800 z'abagore ubwo yamanukaga ho amasaha 2: 00.20 PB ku mwanya wa mbere ku isi ku mwanya wa isaha 1: 56.67 maze ashyiraho amateka mashya y'igihugu.. Yabaye umugore wa mbere ku isi wacitse 1:57 muri 2021 kandi abona umwanya we mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo yatinze muri 2020. N'ubwo yavuzwe mu nyandiko zemewe kandi yerekeza i Tokiyo, Getachew yakuweho umunsi wo gushyushya metero 800 z'abagore ntiyitabira. "}
{"id": "16310", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16310", "title": "Frehiwat Goshu", "text": "Frehiwat Goshu (yavutse 28 kamena 1990) ni umunyetiyopiya wiruka intera ndende ya marato, aba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 3000.\nYatangiye ku rwego mpuzamahanga, ubwo yari yaje mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika yo mu 2007, aho yaje ku mwanya wa kane muri metero zirenga 1500. Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri metero 3000 muri Shampiyona y\u2019ingimbi muri 2008 arangiza kuwa icyenda ku mukino wa nyuma w\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi muri 2009. Yatsindiye kandi umwanya wa kane mu marushanwa y'abato muri Shampiyona y'isi ya Cross Cross muri 2009. Yatsindiye Cross Internacional muri 2010 Juan Muguerza naho muri 2011 niwe wegukanye irushanwa rya Half Marathon yo muri Madrid naho igisonga cya Madrid 10K. Yafashe umwanya wa kabiri inyuma ya Priscah Cherono muri Cross Internacional de la Constituci\u00f3n muri Kuboza 2011. \nIbihe bye byiza yagize ni iminota 4: 13.54 muri metero 1500, yageze muri Nyakanga 2009 muri Barcelona ; Iminota 8: 50.38 muri metero 3000, yagezweho muri Nzeri 2009 muri Rieti ; n'iminota 15: 21.44 muri metero 5000, byagezweho muri kamena 2009 i M\u00e1laga. "}
{"id": "16311", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16311", "title": "Kalkidan Gezahegne", "text": "Kalkidan Gezahegne (yavutse ku ya 8 Gicurasi 1991) Ni umunyatiyopiya ufite ubwengihugu bwa Baharayini, wuruka metero 10,000 muri 2020 i tokiyo, Yegukanye umudari wa silver olempike. Imyaka 11 mbere yaho, afite imyaka 18, Gezahegne yabaye shampiyo ukiri muto wabaye, imbere mu nzu igihe yatsindaga muri metero 1500.\nGezahegne w'imyaka 17 yegukanye umudari wa feza hejuru ya metero 1500 muri Shampiyona yisi y'abato muri 2008. Yahagarariye Etiyopiya mbere yo kubona ubwe negihugu bwa Bahirayini muri 2013.\nUbuzima n'umwuga.\nKalkidan Gezahegne yavukiye Addis Abeba. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri metero 1500 muri Shampiyona y\u2019isi y\u2019abangavu muri 2008 kandi yegukana undi wa feza y\u2019abato mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika yo muri 2009, arangiza inyuma ya Caster Semenya. Kuzamuka kurwego rwo hejuru, Kalkidan yarangije k'umunani muri metero 1500 kwiruka muri Shampiyona yisi muri 2009 na gatanu muri metero 3000 k'umukino wa nyuma wi mikino ngororamubiri muri 2009. \nYarushanwe mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu ya IAAF yo muri 2010, yagarutse bitangaje kugira ngo yemererwe ku mukino wa nyuma. Hagati y\u2019ubushyuhe, ya gonganye n'umurusiya Yevgeniya Zolotova agwa mu nzira. Yagarutse kugira ngo akomeze isiganwa, ariko, kandi ntiyafashe gusa abo bahanganye, ahubwo yatsinze iryo siganwa hamwe n\u2019igihe cyihuta cy\u2019abiruka uwo munsi. Ku mukino wa nyuma yarushije igihugu cye ndetse na nyampinga uganje Gelete Burka gutwara umudari wa zahabu. Ibi byatumye umusore w'imyaka 18 yatsindiye kuba muto mu birori byabereye mu marushanwa ya IAAF y\u2019isi yaberaga mu nzu, yatsinze amateka yabanje gushyirwaho na Gabriela Szabo mu myaka 15 ishize. Yabuze igihe cyo hanze muri uwo mwaka kubera imvune. \nKu ya 3 Ukwakira 2021, Gezahegne yanditse agahigo ku isimuri kilometero 10 kumuhanda wo kwiruka mu birori bya Giants Geneve, biruka iminota 29:38 no kurenza ikimenyetso cyabanjirije amasegonda 5. "}
{"id": "16312", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16312", "title": "Zewde Hailemariam", "text": "Zewde Hailemariam (yavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1962) yahoze yiruka hagati muri Etiyopiya yiruka mu burebure bwa metero 800, no kwiruka metero 400. Yatsindiye imidari ine mu marushanwa atatu atandukanye ya Afurika yaberaga muri isiganwa, kuva muri 1989 na 1992, harimo zahabu imwe muri metero 800 ku nshuro yo muri 1992 muri Kamena muri uwo mwaka. Nyuma y'ukwezi kumwe gusa yitabiriye Etiyopiya mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1992 mu birori bimwe, ariko yiruka amasaha 2: 11.60, astinda amasegonda arenga atanu ugereranije na shampiyona yo ku mugabane wa Afurika, arangiza ku mwanya wa gatandatu mu bushyuhe bwe bwujuje ibisabwa, ananirwa gukomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri. ku mukino wanyuma. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2016, Hailemariam aracyafite agahigo ka metero 400 yo kwiruka muri Etiyopiya mu minota(57.60) yirukanye mu mikino yaberaga muri Afurika muri 1987 yabereye i Nairobi."}
{"id": "16313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16313", "title": "Freweyni Hailu", "text": "Freweyni Hailu (yavutse 12 Gashyantare 2001) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati. Yashyize ku mwanya wa kane muri metero 1500 mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo yo muri 2020. Mu 2022, Hailu yabonye umudari wa feza ku isi muri metero 800 i Belgrade. \nUmwuga.\nFreweyni Hailu yungutse ubunararibonye mpuzamahanga bwa mbere muri 2018 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019abato yabereye i Tampere, muri Finilande, aho yegukanye umwanya wa gatanu mu kwiruka metero 800 mu bagore.\nUmwaka ukurikira, yabaye uwa kane mu kwiruka abatarengeje imyaka 20 muri meteo 800 mu marushanwa ny'afurika y'abatarengeje imyaka 18 - abatarengeje imyaka 20 yabereye i Abidjan, muri kote divuwari.\nHailu yitabiriye metero 800 mu bagore mu mikino Nyafurika yo muri 2019, aho yakuwe muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. \nMuri Kamena 2021, mu bigeragezo by'imikino Olempike yo muri Etiyopiya, yirutse ku giti cye muri metero 1500 mu bagore kugira ngo igihe cy\u2019imikino Olempike kibe cyujuje ibisabwa mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo yatinze muri 2020. We, Lemlem Hailu, na Diribe Welteji ba shyizwe mu ikipe ya Etiyopiya. Muri iyo mikino, yarangije ku mwanya wa kane mu gihe cya 3: 57.60 inyuma gusa, 1-3, Kwizera Kipyegon, Laura Muir na Sifan Hassan. \nKu ya 14 Nzeri 2021, ku rwibutso rwa Han\u017eekovi\u0107 i Zagreb, Hailu yashyizeho agahigo muri Etiyopiya muri metero 2000 akoresheje umwanya wa metero 5 25.86s, arangiza inyuma ya Francine Niyonsaba we nyine washyize muri iri siganwa agahigo ya 5: 21.56. Ikimenyetso cya Hailu nicyo cya gatatu cyihuta cyane mu mateka. \nMuri Werurwe 2022, Hailu yegukanye umudari wa feza muri metero 800 muri Shampiyona y\u2019imbere mu nzu yabereye i Beligrade hamwe n'igihe cyiza cya 2: 00.54. Aje\u00e9 Wilson yaje ku mwanya wa mbere muri isaha 1: 59.09, naho Halimah Nakaayi aba uwa gatatu (2: 00.66). Wari umudari wa mbere kw'isi yose muri metero 800 mu rugo kubagore ba Etiyopiya mu mateka. "}
{"id": "16314", "revid": "12135", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16314", "title": "Lemlem Hailu", "text": "Lemlem Hailu (yavutse ku ya 21 Gicurasi 2001) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati kandi n'intera ndende. Niweshampiyona w\u2019imbere muri 2022 muri metero 3000 uvuye i Beligrade 22. Hailu yari ahagarariye Etiyopiya muri metero 1500 mu umugore mu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2019 na Olempike ya Tokiyo yo muri 2020.\nKu myaka 16, niwe wabaye shampiyo w\u2019isi ku isi muri metero 1500 muri 2017 gutwara umuringa mu mikino Olempike y\u2019urubyiruko nyuma y'umwaka, na bronze mu mikino nya furika muri 2019. Hailu afite umudari w'isi wabari munsi yabatarengeje imyaka 20 kuri metero 1500 m'urugo.\nUmwuga.\nKu myaka 16, Lemlem Hailu yungutse ubunararibonye mpuzamahanga mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019urubyiruko muri 2017 yabereye i Nairobi, aho yatsindiye metero 1500. Umwaka umwe, yatwaye umudari wa zahabu mu ntera mu mikino ny'afurika y\u2019urubyiruko yabereye muri Algiers maze ajya muri Arijantine mu mikino Olempike y\u2019urubyiruko yabereye i Buenos Aires, aho yegukanye umudari w'umuringa mu kwiruka metero 1500. \nMuri 2019, yatwaye umudari wa bronze muri metero 1500 mu mikino ny'afurika. Hailu yari ahagarariye Etiyopiya muri ibyo birori mu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2019 yabereye i Doha, agera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. \nMuri Gashyantare 2020, yashyizeho agahigo k\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 kuri metero 1500 mu nzu hamwe n'igihe cya 4: 01.79, avunika ku isegonda 0.02, ikimenyetso cy'ambere cyashyizweho na mugenzi we Gudaf Tsegay muri 2016. Muri uko kwezi, Hailu yazamuye agahigo ke agera kuri metero 4 ku isegonda 1.57, iyi ikaba yari inshuro ya kane ku giti cye yagezeho mu byumweru bitatu. Mu Kwakira, yatsinze isiganwa rya metero 1500 muri Kip Keino Classic. "}
{"id": "16315", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16315", "title": "Fantu Worku", "text": "Fantu Worku Taye (yavutse ku ya 29 Werurwe 1999) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati ya metero 1500. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona yisi yabatarengeje imwaka 20 muri 2016. Yahagarariye igihugu cye muri Shampiyona yisi 2017 yabuze gato muri kimwe cya kabiri.\nMu mikino yo Kwizihiza Isabukuru yo muri 2018 yabereye i Londres, yahagaritse kwiruka igice cya lap kare, hakiri kare nyuma yo kwiruka ku mwanya wa mbere, yibeshya umurongo wa kilometero nk'umurongo wa nyuma hanyuma akomeza guhagarika kwiruka amaze kurenga. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16316", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16316", "title": "Diribe Welteji", "text": "Diribe Welteji Kejelcha (yavutse ku ya 13 Gicurasi 2002) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati. Yashyize ku mwanya wa kane muri metero 800 muri Shampiyona y\u2019i mikino ngororamubiri muri 2022.\nKu myaka 16, Welteji yatsindiye muri metero 800 muri Shampiyona yisi yabatarengeje imyaka 20 muri 2018, guca agahigo ya shampionat mubikorwa. Yatwaye ifeza kuri metero 1500 muri Shampiyona yisi muri 2020.\nUmwuga.\nDiribe Welteji w'imyaka 16 y'amavuko yegukanye umudari wa zahabu kuri metero 800 mu ibirori muri Shampiyona yisi yabatarengeje imyaka 20 yabereye i Tampere, aho yanitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore muri metero 4 \u00d7 400\u00a0m kwerekanwa atageze ku mukino w'anyuma, ariko abasha kugera kubanya Etiyopiya bato. \nMuri 2019, yatsindiye zahabu muri metero 1500 muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yabatarengeje imyaka 20, yarangije ku mwanya wa gatandatu muri metero 800 ibirori mu mikino ny'afurika yabereye i Rabat, kandi byavanyweho muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri metero 800 ibirori muri Shampiyona y'isi ya Doha. "}
{"id": "16317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16317", "title": "Getenesh Urge", "text": "Getenesh Urge (yavutse 30 Kanama 1970) ni umunyetiyopiya wasezeye mu kwiruka hagati yirukaga hagati yarushanwe muri 1980 kugeza 2000. Yitabiriye metero 1500 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1992. \nYatsindiye imidari itatu ya bronze mu marushanwa atatu atandukanye ya Afurika muri isiganwa. Muri Annaba muri Shampiyona yo muri 1988 yatsindiye umudari w'umuringa muri metero 1500, asubiramo iyi mikorere nyuma y'imyaka itanu i Durban muri Shampiyona yo muri 1993. Ibi nyuma ya Shampiyona yo muri 1992 yabereye muri Maurice aho yatsindiye umudari w'umuringa muri metero 3000. Yatsindiye kandi umudari wa bronze i Cairo mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo muri 1991, yongera muri metero 1500. Yarangije cumi na gatatu muri metero 5000 muri Shampiyona yisi muri 1999.\nYabaye kandi mu makipe atandatu yegukanye umudari mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country Championship yarangije ku mwanya wa 31 muri 1990 mu gutsindira ifeza y'amakipe, ku ya 28 muri 1992 mu gutwara umuringa w'amakipe, ku mwanya wa 14 muri 1994 gutsindira ifeza y'amakipe, 29 muri 1996 muri gutsindira ifeza y'ikipe, 21 muri 1998 mu gutwara feza y'ikipe na 17 muri 2000 mugutwara feza y'amakipe, byose muri bar 2000 mu mikino ndende."}
{"id": "16318", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16318", "title": "Gudaf Tsegay", "text": "Gudaf Tsegay Desta (yavutse ku ya 23 Kamena 1997) ni Umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati kandi no mutera ndende. Niwe w'egukanye umudari wa bronze wa Tokiyo muri 2020 muri metero 5000 mu bagore. Mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi, yatsindiye umuringa muri metero 1500 muri 2019 na feza muri ibi birori na zahabu kuri metero 5000 muri 2022. Tsegay ni inshuro ebyiri metero 1500 Uwatsindiye umudari wa Shampiyona y'imbere mu nzu, yegukana zahabu muri 2022 na bronze muri 2016. Nubu ufite ragahigo kwisi mu mazu muri metero 1500, ibirori aho yashyizeho kandi isi munsi yi myaka 18 (iriho) na bataarengeje imwaka 20.\nAfite imyaka 17, yabaye Shampiyona yisi yabato 2014 muri metero 1500, umudari wa feza. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu ntera mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu yo muri 2014. Tsegay azi kwiruka cyane. Kugeza muri Gashyantare 2023, yari umugore wa 10 ku isi wihuta cyane muri metero 800, kandi uwa gatandatu kuri metero 5000 na metero 10,000. \nUmwuga.\nMuri Gashyantare 2014, Gudaf Tsegay w'imyaka 17 y'amavuko yashyize ku mwanya wa mbere ku isi munsi y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 18 kuri metero 1500 mu nzu hamwe na metero 4, 8.47s i Stockholm. Muri Nyakanga, yabonye umudari wa zahabu mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye i Eugene, muri Oregon ku mwanya wa 4: 10.83, inyuma ya mugenzi we Dawit Seyaum muri 4: 09.86.\nNyuma yi myaka ibiri, Tsegay yegukanye umudari w\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 muri ibi birori byabereye mu nzu mu gihe cya metero 4 1.81s i Glasgow, yatsinze ibitego byiza byashyizweho na mugenzi we Kalkidan Gezahegne mu mwaka wo muri 2010 n'amasegonda arenga. Amateka ya Tsegay yazamuwe neza muri 2020 nundi mugenzi we Lemlem Hailu. Mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu yabereye i Portland, Oregon, yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri 4: 05.71 inyuma ya Sifan Hassan we nyine uhagarariye Ubuholandi (4: 04.96) na Dawit (4: 05.30). Icyo gihe umusore wi myaka 19 yari ahagarariye Etiyopiya muri metero 800 mu mikino olempike ya Rio 2016, aho yakuyeho ubushyuhe 3, isaha 2: 00.13."}
{"id": "16319", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16319", "title": "Senbere Teferi", "text": "Senbere Teferi (yavutse ku ya 3 Gicurasi 1995) ni Umunyetiyopiya wa bigize umwuga wiruka hagati na intera ndende wiruka cyane muri metero 1500 no kwambukiranya igihugu. Yabonye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona yisi ya IAAF muri 2015. Yaserukiye igihugu cye mu marushanwa y\u2019isi yo muri 2013 kandi yegukana imidari, ari ku murongo ndetse n\u2019abato ku isi ndetse n\u2019urwego rw\u2019abato ku isi.\nUmwuga.\nYavutse Senbere Teferi Sora, yegukanye umudari we wa mbere mpuzamahanga mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019urubyiruko muri 2011 yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri, akaza ku mwanya wa kabiri muri metero 1500, kuri Kwizera kwa Kipyegon. Yazamutse hejuru y'igihugu cyose hamwe na metero 1500 gutsinda muri Shampiyona y imikino ngororamubiri ya Etiyopiya. Yafashe igihanga gikomeye mu buryo bwa Tiki Gelana muri Women First 5K, i Addis Abeba muri Werurwe muri 2012. Mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019ingimbi muri 2012 muri irushanwa, yageze ku byiza bye ku minota 4: 08.28 muri metero 1500 ku mukino wa nyuma, ariko yongeye gutsindwa na Kipyegon ndetse na Amela Terzi\u0107, amusigira umuringa muto. \nirushanwa rya Cross country niyo y'ibandaga nyuma yi gihembwe cyo gukurikirana. Yatsindiye Cross de l'Acier mu Bufaransa muri Gushyingo 2014. Yatoranijwe mu ikipe nkuru ya Etiyopiya mu marushanwa ya IAAF muri 2015 kandi, nubwo yagize ikibazo cy\u2019imvune mu cyumweru cyabanjirije iki gikorwa, yajyanye mu gikombe cy\u2019imbere hamwe na Agnes Jebet Tirop maze bombi baba aba ubwoko, hamwe na Tirop yaje gutsinda Senbere muri metero 200 z'anyuma, gusiga Umunyetiyopiya n'umudari wa feza. Umukinnyi wa mbere wa Senbere kandi yabonye umutwe we w\u2019abagore bo muri Etiyopiya ku gikombe cy\u2019ikipe, afashijwe na mugenzi we (ndetse n\u2019umudari wa bronze) Netsanet Gudeta. "}
{"id": "16320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16320", "title": "Yimenashu Taye", "text": "Yimenashu Taye (yavutse 1979) ni umunyetiyopiya wiruka intera ndende muri marato.\nMu 1998 yatsindiye isiganwa ryabato muri Shampiyona yisi ya Cross Cross Country kandi yegukana imidari ya feza muri metero 1500 na metero 3000 muri Shampiyona yisi yabato. Muri Shampiyona ny'afurika muri uwo mwaka yatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri metero 3000.\nMu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019o kuzenguruka w\u2019isi muri 2000 yarangije ku mwanya wa gatandatu mu isiganwa rigufi, mu gihe ikipe ya Etiyopiya Taye ya bigizemo uruhare yegukanye umudari wa feza mu marushanwa y'amakipe."}
{"id": "16321", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16321", "title": "Genzeb Shumi", "text": "Genzeb Shumi Regasa (yavutse ku ya 29 Mutarama 1991) ni Umunyetiyopiya wavukiye mu ntera yo hagati wiruka mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga muri Bahirayini. Yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu muri metero 1500 muri mu marushanwa ya Athletisme yo muri Aziya muri 2011 ndetse na Shampiyona yo muri Aziya yabaye mu mwaka wo muri 2012. Ibihe byiza bye ni amasaha 2: 01.18 kuri metero 800 na 4: 05.16 kuri 1500.\nUmwuga.\nYavukiye muri Etiyopiya, yatangiye kwiruka muri Bahirayini mu mwaka wa muri 2010, atangira gukinira irushanwa ry\u2019abato mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country muri 2010 ndetse arangiza ari cumi na karindwi. Yatsinze agahigo k'igihugu kabato muri metero 800 na metero 1500 muri uwo mwaka. Yatsinze metero 1500 mu irushanwa yi'mikino ngororamubiri yo muri Aziya yo muri 2010 kandi yabaye igisonga cya metero 3000. Yirutse ku rwego rw'isi mu marushanwa y\u2019ingimbi 2010 ya beraga muri irushanwa nyuma y'ibyumweru bike hanyuma amaze gukora amateka y\u2019abato bo muri Bahrein iminota 4: 14.05 mu bushyuhe, yatinze muri metero 1500, yanyuma kandi yarangije icya cumi. Yashizeho metero 800 mubato akoresha amasaha 2: 04.09 muminota ashyushye mumikino ya Aziya 2010, ariko yongeye gutinda ku mukino wa nyuma, afata umwanya wa munani. \nYakusanyije indi midari mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri yo muri Aziya 2012, atwara 1500 umutwe no kurangiza icya kabiri kuri Zhao Jing muri metero 800. Nyuma yibi yegukanye umudari we wa mbere wa mbukiranya igihugu mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona yo muri Aziya, afata umwanya wa gatatu muri podium ya Bahrein hamwe na Shitaye Eshete na Tejitu Daba. Yirutse muri metero 800 na m 1500 mu mikino Olempike ya 2012, agera muri kimwe cya kabiri cya metero 800. "}
{"id": "16322", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16322", "title": "Besu Sado", "text": "Besu Sado Beko (yavutse ku ya 12 Mutarama 1996) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Etiyopiya witabira imikino yo kwiruka hagati. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu marushanwa y'isi yo muri 2015 yabereye i Beijing mu bushinwa, agera muri kimwe cya kabiri. Byongeye kandi, yegukanye umudari wa feza mu mikino ny'afurika ya muri 2015.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16323", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16323", "title": "Abebech Negussie", "text": "Abebech Negussie (yavutse ku ya 2 Mutarama 1983 muri Arsi) ni Umunyetiyopiya wasezeye mu kwiruka aharehare ndetse no hagati, kabuhariwe muri metero 1500. Yaserukiye Etiyopiya muri ibyo birori mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2000 ndetse na Shampiyona y'isi muri 2001 yaberaga muri irushanwa."}
{"id": "16324", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16324", "title": "Hirut Meshesha", "text": "Hirut Meshesha (yavutse ku ya 20 Mutarama 2001) ni umunyetiyopiya wiruka hagati. Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri metero 1500 mu bagore mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu muri 2022 yabereye i Beligrade. Meshesha yatwaye umudari wa zahabu muri metero 800 mu mikino ny'afurika ya muri 2019.\nUmwuga.\nHirut Meshesha yungutse ubunararibonye mpuzamahanga bwa mbere mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF muri 2017 munsi y'abafite imyaka 18 yabereye i Nairobi muri Kenya, aho yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri metero 800 mu bakobwa. Nyuma yagiye muri Arijantine mu mikino Olempike y\u2019urubyiruko yo mu mpeshyi ya muri 2018 yabereye i Buenos Aires maze atwara umuringa mu birometero 800 by\u2019abakobwa\nMuri Mata 2019, yitabiriye amarushanwa ny'afurika munsi ya'abifte imyaka 18 na munsi ya'abifte imyaka 20 yaberaga i Abidjan, muri kote divuwari, kandi yegukana umudari wa feza kuri metero 800 mu bagore bari munsi y\u2019i myaka 20. Ukwezi kumwe, yatsindiye umudari muri metero 800 mu bagore muri Shampiyona ya Etiyopiya. Muri Kanama, Meshesha yari ahagarariye Etiyopiya mu mikino Ny'afurika yo muri 2019 yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke kandi yegukana umudari wa zahabu mu kwiruka metero 800. \nYatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri metero 1500 mu bagore mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yabereye mu nzu yabereye i Beligrade, muri Seribiya. Mugenzi we Gudaf Tsegay ya yoboye imidari ya Etiyopiya iratwara kuko Axumawit Embaye yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri. "}
{"id": "16325", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16325", "title": "Tigist Mengistu", "text": "Tigist Gezahagn Mengistu (yavutse ku ya 12 Werurwe 2000) ni umukinnyi wa Paralempikee wo muri Etiyopiya. Yagaragaje bwa mbere abamugaye bahagarariye Etiyopiya mu mikino Paralempike yo muri 2020. Mu gihe cy'imikino Paralympike yo muri 2020, yakoze agahigo abaye umudari wa mbere wa zahabu muri Etiyopiya mu mateka y'abamugaye. \nUmwuga.\nYatsindiye umudari wazahabu mu bagore muri T13 1500m mu mikino Paralympike ya Tokiyo yo muri 2020. Wari kandi umudari wa zahabu wa mbere muri Etiyopiya muri Paralempike kandi wari umudari we y'atsindiye ni umudari wa gatatu w\u2019abamugaye muri Etiyopiya hamwe nindi midari ibiri izana ifeza. "}
{"id": "16326", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16326", "title": "Meskerem Legesse", "text": "Meskerem Legesse (Yavutse ku ya 28 Nzeri 1986 - 15 Nyakanga 2013) yari umunyetiyopiya wiruka. Yitabiriye metero 1.500 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi. Legesse yahindutse umunyamwuga kandi yitabira ibikorwa byinshi byo muri Amerika ahantu hatandukanye.\nYashyize ku rutonde rw'abato ku isi muri metero 800 mu nzu hamwe na masaha 2: 01.03 i Fayetteville, muri Amerika ku ya 14 Gashyantare 2004. Mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2004, yirukanye umwanya wa 4:18:03 (umwanya wa cumi na kabiri mu bushyuhe bwo mu cyiciro cya mbere), ntiyakomeza kujya mu cyiciro cy'abatsindira umudari.\nLegesse yabaga i Westport, muri leta ya Connecticut kandi yari amaze imyaka icyenda muri Etiyopiya, kuva muri 2004. Yasezeye kwiruka kubera ikibazo cy'umutima. \nLegesse yapfuye mu buryo butunguranye ibyumweru bitatu mbere yuko abyara. Yari kumwe n'umuhungu we w'imyaka ibiri ubwo yagwaga ku ya 15 Nyakanga 2013 muri resitora i Hamden, muri leta ya Connecticut. Abaganga baratsinze m'ugukiza umwana we wari utaravuka. "}
{"id": "16327", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16327", "title": "Maryam Yusuf Jamal", "text": "Maryam Yusuf Jamal (yavutse yitwa Zenebech Tola yavutse ku ya 16 Nzeri 1984) ni Umunyetiyopiya wavukiye muri Bahirayini yiruka intera ndende. Niwe mukinnyi wa mbere wo muri Bahirayini wegukanye umudari wa Olempike, zahabu (umuringa, ariko nyuma yaje kuzamurwa nyuma yo kurenga ibyongera imbarag ebyiri) mu isiganwa ry\u2019abagore ya metero 1500, mu mikino Olempike yabereye i Londres muri 2012. Uyu kandi wari umudari wa mbere wa olempike wegukanywe n'umugore uhagarariye leta yi kigobe. Yavukiye muri Etiyopiya, 2005 nicyo gihe cye cyambere cyuzuye. Yatsindiye umudari w'igihugu kandi yiruka metero 3000 byihuse y'umwaka, hamwe ni gihe cya 8: 28.87 mu marushanwa yabereye Oslo. Jamal ni shampiyo wisi inshuro ebyiri muri 1500, amaze gutsinda muri Shampiyona yisi ya 2007 na 2009 muri Athletisme.\nYahagarariye Bahirayini mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing, arangiza ari uwa gatanu muri metero 1500 ku mukino wnguma. Jamal kandi yatsindiye byinshi mu marushanwa yo mu karere: yegukanye imidari ibiri ya zahabu mu mikino ya Aziya ya 2006 hiyongereyeho na Shampiyona yo muri Aziya yambukiranya igihugu muri 2007 na 2009.\nJamal yavukiye muri Zone ya Arsi muri karere ka Oromia muri Etiyopiya, agace kazwi cyane mu kwiruka intera, barimo Haile Gebrselassie, Kenenisa Bekele na Tirunesh Dibaba. Ni Umuyisilamu, kandi akomoka muri Oromo."}
{"id": "16328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16328", "title": "Sultan Haydar", "text": "Sultan Haydar (Yavutse ku ya 23 Gicurasi 1985 i Golerogi, muri Etiyopiya) ni Umunyetiyopiya wavukiye muri Turukiya wiruka intera ndende muri marato. ni umukinnyi muremure kuri 55\u00a0kg, hamwe nuburebure bwa metero 170,\u00a0 umunyamuryango wa Enkaspor, aho atozwa na Nikola Bori\u0107. \nYavukiye i Chaltu Girma Meshesha muri Etiyopiya, yatangiye umwuga we wo kwiruka intera yo hagati kandi yaboye umudari wa bronze muri metero 800 mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika yo muri 2005. Yagaragaye ku rwego mpuzamahanga rwa nyuma muri Etiyopiya yaje mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo muri 2006 yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri, aho yerekanye impano yo gusiganwa ku magare kuko yaje ku mwanya wa gatandatu mu bagore kuri kilometero 20. Yimuriye Turukiya muri 2008.\nAmarushanwa ya mbere ya Haydar muri Turukiya ni Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi yo muri 2008. Yatangiye isiganwa ry\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23 mu bagore, vuba ariko atanga umwanya wa mbere maze arekera aho bigeze. Yatsindiye umudari wa metero 1500 muri zahabu, mu marushanwa ya Athletisme yu Burayi yo muri 2009, nyuma atsindira isiganwa ry\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23 mu marushanwa y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi yaberaga muri 2009 nyuma yu wo mwaka. Mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2011 yatangiye bwa mbere muri kimwe cya kabiri cya marato maze yandika isaha 1:10:02 ku mwanya wa karindwi kuri Calibre ndende RAK Half Marathon. Yirutse muri metero 1500 mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri yo mu Burayi muri 2010, ariko ananirwa kurangiza ubushyuhe bwe. Yerekeje kuri metero 3000 mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri yo mu Burayi ya muri 2011, aho yashyize ku mwanya wa mbere iminota 9: 03.50 kugira ngo atsinde ubushyuhe, ariko atinda ku mukino wa nyuma, aza ku mwanya wa cyenda. Hanze, yarushanwe muri Turukiya kubutaka bw'iwabo muri Shampiyona ya mbere ya Shampiyona ya makipe yu Burayi muri 2011 kandi yatsindiye muri metero 3000 mu mwanya muremure wohanagura hamwe na Alemitu Bekele Degfa na Binnaz Uslu. Haydar yatsindiye kandi umuringa muri metero 1500."}
{"id": "16329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16329", "title": "Sifan Hassan", "text": "Sifan Hassan (Yavutse 1 Mutarama 1993 Yasoje inshuro eshatu zitigeze zibaho mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo yo muri 2020 y egukana imidari ya zahabu muri metero 5000 na metero 10,000, n'umudari wa bronze muri metero 1500. Hassan niwe mukinnyi w'enyine mu mateka ya Olempike wegukanye imidari mu birometero bigera hagati ndetse no gusiganwa kure cyane mu mikino imwe. Ni umugore wa kabiri gusa wujuje intera ya olempike kabiri. \nMu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi, Hassan yatwaye ibikombe bya metero 1500 na 10,000, muri 2019, abaye umukinnyi w'enyine (umugabo cyangwa umugore) mu mateka we gukanye ibyo birori byombi mu marushanwa y\u2019isi imwe cyangwa imikino Olempike. Yatsindiye umudari w'umuringa kuri metero 1500 muri 2015, no kuri 5000 muri 2017 ubwo na we yarangije umwanya wa gatanu kuri metero 1500. Hassan ni inshuro eshatu yegukanye umudari wa Shampiyona y\u2019imbere mu nzu, yegukana umudari wa zahabu kuri metero 1500 muri 2016 ndetse nafeza, kuri metero 3000 na bronze kuri 1500 muri 2018. Yabonye imidari itandatu yo mu Burayi (harimo imitwe ibiri yambukiranya igihugu), n'umudari umwe wo mu Burayi. Yatsindiye kandi inshuro eshatu Diamond League, amaze kubona metero 1500 / 5000 muri 2019.\nHassan ni we ufite agahigo ku isi mu gusiganwa ku birometero kimwe na kilometero 5, byombi byashyizweho muri 2019, ndetse no gukora isaha imwe, byashyizweho muri 2020. Yatwaye amateka ku isi ku 10,000 iminsi ibiri muri kamena 2021. Afite inyandiko eshanu zi Burayi (metero 1500, 3000, 5000, 10,000, igice cya marato) hamwe n\u2019uwubuholandi butatu.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nSifan Hassan yavukiye i Adama, Oromia, Etiyopiya akurira mu cyaro cya Kersa mu karere ka Munesa muri Zone ya Arsi ya Oromia. Yari kwiruka mu myidagaduro. Yavuye muri Etiyopiya ari impunzi agera mu Buholandi muri 2008 afite imyaka cumi n'itanu. Yatangiye kwiruka akora amasomo yo kuba umuforomo. Hassan yabaye umwenegihugu w\u2019Ubuholandi muri 2013. "}
{"id": "16330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16330", "title": "Yehualeye Beletew", "text": "Yehualeye Beletew Mitiku (Yavutse ku ya 31 Nyakanga 1998) ni umunyetiyopiya ugenda asiganwa n'amaguru. Yitabiriye ibirori byo kugenda ibirometero 20 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2016. Muri 2019, yitabiriye isiganwa ry\u2019ibirometero 20 mu bagore mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi yabereye i Doha, muri katari. \n Yarangije ku mwanya wa 16. Yitabiriye amarushanwa yo kugenda ibirometero 20 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020. "}
{"id": "16331", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16331", "title": "Aynalem Eshetu", "text": "Aynalem Eshetu Shefrawe (yavutse 5 Gashyantare 1992) ni umunyetiyopiya ugenda n'amaguru. Yatsindiye imidari myinshi kurwego rw'umugabane.\nKugeza ubu afite inyandiko nyinshi zi gihugu mu ntera zitandukanye."}
{"id": "16332", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16332", "title": "Ruddy Zang Milama", "text": "Perennes Paulette Ruddy Zang-Milama (yavutse ku ya 6 Kamena 1987 i Port-Gentil) ni umukinnyi wa siporo ukomoka muri Gabon.\nUmwuga.\nZang Milama yari ahagarariye Gabon mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing. Yarushanwe muri metero 100 yiruka ashyira umwanya wa gatatu m'ubushyuhe bwe bwa mbere nyuma ya Shelly-Ann Fraser na Vida Anim m'ugihe cy'amasegonda 11.62. Yatsindiye mu cyiciro cya kabiri aho yananiwe kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kuko igihe cye cya masegonda 11.59 cyari inshuro ya karindwi mu isiganwa rye. \nMu mwaka wo muri 2010, yegukanye umudari wa bronze i Doha mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu ya IAAF muri 2010. Nyuma yuwo mwaka yatsindiye muri metero 100 abona feza na metero 200 bronze muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2010 y'aberaga muri Nairobi. Muri 2012, yatsindiye agahigo y'igihugu cya Gabon inshuro ebyiri, arangiza afite amasegonda 11.03 arenga metero 100 kugirango atware umudari wa zahabu muri Shampiyona ny'afurika ya bereye muri isiganwa muri 2012. Mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2012, yujuje amajonjora muri metero 100 mu bagore. Muri 2013, yakoze agahigo k'igihugu amasegonda agera 7,12 muri metero 60 i Moscou.\nKu ya 21 Gicurasi 2014, Zang Milama yipimishije ibintu bibujijwe mu kizamini cyo mu marushanwa. Nyuma yaje guhagarikwa amezi arindwi muri siporo. "}
{"id": "16333", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16333", "title": "Gina Bass", "text": "Gina Bass (yavutse ku ya 3 Gicurasi 1995) ni umukinnyi wa Gambiya uhatanira gusiganwa ku maguru. Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri metero 200 muri Shampiyona ny'afurika muri 2016. Bass yujuje ibisabwa mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2016 kandi yari afite ibendera rya Gambiya. \nMu mikino Olempike yo muri 2016, yashyize ku mwanya wa 52 mu bushyuhe bwa metero 200 kandi ntiyujuje ibisabwa muri kimwe cya kabiri. \nNiwe w'ambere wujuje amajonjora ya Gambiya ku mukino wa nyuma mu mikino y'isi y'imikino ngororamubiri.\nKugeza ubu afite agahigo kigihugu muri metero 100 na 200.\nYujuje ibisabwa kugirango ahagararire Gambiya mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2020 mu bagore muri metero 100 na metero 200. Mu kwiruka metero 100, yashyizeho amateka mashya y'igihugu amasegonda agera 11.12. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16334", "title": "Saruba Colley", "text": "Saruba Colley (yavutse ku ya 5 Gashyantare 1989, avukira i Sibanor) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wo muri Gambiya. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 100 mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2012 ; yirukanka abanziriza akora amasegonda 12.21, amushoboza kujya mu cyiciro cya 1, no mu cyiciro cya 1 mu masegonda 12.06, ibyo bikaba byashyize ahagaragara agahigo k\u2019igihugu cya Gambiya ariko ntibyamujuje ibisabwa muri kimwe cya kabiri. "}
{"id": "16335", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16335", "title": "Irmgard Bensusan", "text": "Irmgard Bensusan (yavutse ku ya 24 Mutarama 1991) ni umunyafurika yepfo wavutse akina umukino wa Paralempike yiruka ubu uhatanira mu Ubudage, cyane mu mikino ya T44. Bensusan yitabiriye imikino Paralympike yo muri 2016 aho yatsindiye imidari itatu ya feza mu kwiruka metero 100, 200 na 400.\nUmuntu ku giti cye.\nBensusan yavutse ku ya 24 Mutarama 1991 i Pretoria, Afurika y'Epfo. Yize ibaruramari muri kaminuza ya Johannesburg. \nUmwuga wa siporo.\nBensusan yabanje gukara siporo nku munywanyi ushoboye mu gihe aba muri Afrika yepfo. Muri 2009 mu gihe yarushanwaga yahuye ni mbogamizi, maze acika imitsi mu ivi ry'iburyo. Imvune yamuviriyemo ku mugara ukuguru kw'iburyo munsi yivi. Bensusan yarebye kuba umukinnyi wa para-siporo ariko ntiyabasha kubona ibyiciro muri komite y'abamugaye muri Afrika yepfo. Kubera ko nyina yari Umudage yari yemerewe guhagararira Ubudage, bityo akajya mu Burayi gufata icyicaro i Leverkusen, nyuma aza gushyirwa mu bakinnyi ba T44 basiganwa ku maguru. \nMuri 2014, yaserukiye Ubudage mu birori bye bya mbere mpuzamahanga, yerekeje muri Swansea muri Wales kwitabira amarushanwa ya IPC irushanwa ry\u2019i Burayi muri 2014. Ngaho yatsindiye imidari itatu ya feza, muri metero 100, 200 na 400. Mu birori bibiri bigufi yakubiswe n\u2019umuholandi 'Blade Babe' Marlou van Rhijn, naho muri metero 400 yakubiswe n\u2019igihe gishya cy\u2019isi na Marie-Am\u00e9lie Le Fur w\u2019Umufaransa. Umwaka umwe, Bensusan yitabiriye amarushanwa yisi ya IPC ya muri 2015 yabereye i Doha.\n2016 Imikino Paralympike.\nMu rwego rwo kwitegura imikino Paralympike yo mu 2016 yabereye i Rio, Bensusan yitabiriye Shampiyona ya kabiri y\u2019Uburayi, kuri iyi nshuro i Grosseto, mu Butaliyani. Bensusan yashoboye gutwara umudari wa zahabu haba muri metero 100 na 200. Ibihe bye byerekeje i Rio yabonye Bensusan yujuje ibisabwa byose mu gusiganwa ku maguru mu mikino Paralympike: metero 100, metero 200 na metero 400. Yatwaye ifeza muri ibyo birori uko ari bitatu, atakaza imidari ya zahabu na van Rhijn (metero 100 na metero 200) na Le Fur (metero 400). "}
{"id": "16336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16336", "title": "Marjorie Clark", "text": "Marjorie Rees Clark (yavutse ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 1909 \u2013 15 Kamena 1993) yari umukinnyi w\u2019imikino ngororamubiri wo muri Afurika yepfo, witabiriye imikino Olempike yo muri 1928 ndetse no mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1932. Yavukiye i Bulwer, KwaZulu-Natal kandi yarushanwe mu ikipe ya Albion Ladies Athletic Club. \nMu 1928 Clark yarangije kumwanya wa gatanu mu birori byo gusimbuka hejuru mu mikino Olempike. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa ya metero zigera ku 100, ariko asezererwa muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Nyuma y'imyaka ine yegukanye umudari wa bronze mu marushanwa ya metero 80 yiruka mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1932. Mu isiganwa ryo hejuru ryo muri 1932 yongeye kurangiza ku mwanya wa gatanu no mu marushanwa ya metero zigera 100, ariko asezererwa mu cyiciro cya mbere.\nMuri 1928 Amarushanwa y'abategarugori batabigize umwuga, Association Miss Clark yatsindiye inzitizi 100 yds inzitizi &amp; no gusimbuka hejuru.\nMu mikino yo mu Bwongereza muri 1934 yegukanye umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa ya metero 80 ndetse no mu birori byo gusimbuka. Nk'umunyamuryango w'ikipe ya relay ya Afrika yepfo yarangije umwanya wa kane mu marushanwa ya metero 110-220-110. Mu marushanwa ya metero 100 no mu birori bya metero ya 220 yakuweho mu cyiciro cya mbere."}
{"id": "16337", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16337", "title": "Alyssa Conley", "text": "Alyssa Conley (wavutse ku ya 27 Mata 1991) ni umukinnyi wo muri Afurika yepfo uhatanira gusiganwa ku maguru. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri metero 200 muri Shampiyona ny'afurika muri 2016.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16339", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16339", "title": "Ilse Hayes", "text": "Ilse Hayes (yavutse 30 Kanama 1985), uzwi kandi ku izina rya Ilse Carstens, ni umukinnyi wamugaye ukomoka muri Afurika yepfo uhatanira cyane mu marushanwa yo muri T13. Hayes yagiye guhatanira igihugu cye mu mikino ine y'abamugaye mu mpeshyi guhera mu mikino Paralempike yo muri 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi, mu Bugereki. Yatsindiye imidari kuri buri mukino, mu mikino ine harimo imidari ibiri ya zahabu, haba mu gusimbuka birebire, i Beijing muri2008) na London muri 2012). Nkuko yatsindiye Paralempikee, Hayes niwe wegukanye imidari myinshi kurwego rwa Shampiyona y'isi.\nAmateka bwite.\nHayes yavukiye i Johannesburg, muri Afurika y'Epfo muri 1985. Afite imyaka cumi n'umwe bamusanganye indwara ya Stargardt, ubwoko bwarazwe bwo kwangirika kwu bwonko, bitera kubura icyerekezo buhoro. Yize muri kaminuza ya Stellenbosch, aho yize ubumenyi bwa siporo n\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019abana. Yashakanye na Cassie Carstens kandi batuye muri Stellenbosch. \nUmwuga wa siporo.\nHayes yinjiye ku rwego mpuzamahanga rwa siporo ubwo yinjiraga mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IPC Athletisme muri 2002 y'abereye i Lille mu Bufaransa. Yinjiye mu byiciro bitatu, mu cyiciro cya T13, y'egukana umudari wa zahabu muri metero 400 yiruka n'umuringa muri metero 100. Yinjiye kandi mu gusimbuka birebire, ariko intera nziza yari 4.93 ya mubonye agwa hanze yu mudari wa kane. Ibi bya mujyanye mu mikino ya Paralempike yo muri 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi aho yatwaye umudari we wa mbere w\u2019abamugaye, umuringa mu kwiruka metero 400 mu bagore T13. Yatsindiye kandi umwanya wa gatanu mu bagore metero 100 muri T13. \nMuri 2006 Hayes yinjiye mu marushanwa ye ya kabiri y'isi, iki gihe ni Assen mu Buholandi. Yatwaye indi midari ibiri ya bronze, ku nshuro ya metero 200 na 400. Yateje imbere ibisubizo birebire kuva mu myaka ine yabanjirije kohereza intera ya 5.19, ariko ntiyabasha gubona agatuti. Intsinzi ye ikomeye kugeza ubu izaza nyuma y'imyaka ibiri mu mikino Paralympike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing, ubwo yatsindaga umudari wa mbere wa zahabu. Agezeyo, ye gukanye umwanya wa mbere mu gusimbuka birebire, yandika intsinzi ya 5.68 ubwo ya geragezaga k'unshuro ya kane gutsinda Anthi Karagianni w\u2019Ubugereki ku mwanya wa kabiri na santimetero zigera kuri 5. Hayes yatwaye kandi umudari wa feza avuye i Beijing avuye muri metero 100. "}
{"id": "16340", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16340", "title": "Carina Ihembe", "text": "Carina Ihembe (yavutse 9 Werurwe 1989) ni umukinnyi wiruka wo muri Afrika yepfo. Yarushanwe muri metero 60 muri Shampiyona y'isi muri IAAF 2014 Yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu\nKurenga Doping.\nKu ya 13 Nzeri 2019 yahagaritswe by'agateganyo mu marushanwa azira kurenga ku mategeko yo kurwanya doping. Amatangazo y'ibirego yatanzwe yerekanaga ko Ibutamoren na Ligandrol (LGD-4033). "}
{"id": "16341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16341", "title": "Evette de Klerk", "text": "Evette de Klerk (yavutse ku ya 21 Kanama 1965) ni umunya Afurika yepfo wahoze asiganwa ku maguru. Yabaye umukinnyi wiganje mu bakobwa basiganwa ku maguru muri Afurika yepfo mu myaka ya za 1980, yatsindiye metero 100/200, metero ebyiri muri shampiyona y'igihugu mu myaka icumi yatangiye kuva 1982 kugeza 1991. Yatwaye kandi ibikombe bitatu bya Afrika yepfo muri metero 400. Harimo amarushanwa ya shampiona yamasegonda 11.06 (ubuzima bwe bwiza) kuri metero 100 n'amasegonda 22.36 kuri 200. \nIbyiza bye ku mikino ngufi byombi bikomeza kuba Afrika yepfo ku birometero 200, igihe cy'amasegonda 22.06 nicyo cyihuta cyanditswe nu mukinnyi ny'afurica, ariko ntabwo aricyo gitabo cya Afrika kuko kitari cyemejwe n'inzego nyo bozi z'umugabane. Icyo gihe cyashyize ku mwanya wa kabiri ku isi hejuru ya metero 200 mu 1989, inyuma ya Dawn Sowell. Usibye aya manota, yashyizeho ibyiza byamasegonda 50.57 kuri metero 400. \nDe Klerk ntabwo ya rushanwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu gihe yari ku rwego rwo hejuru mu mwuga we biturutse ku kwamagana siporo yo muri Afurika y'Epfo mu gihe cy'apartheid. Yagaragaye mu ruhando mpuzamahanga muri Afurika yepfo yaje muri shampiyona ye heruka ku rwego rwo hejuru muri 1993). Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze inshuro ebyiri muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 1993 yaberaga muri isiganrwa agera kuri podium muri metero 200 na metero 4 \u00d7 100. Yakomeje guhagararira Afurika y'Epfo mu marushanwa y'isi yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri muri 1993 kandi yabaye kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri metero 200. Yanze icyifuzo cyo guhatanira u Bwongereza mu gihe ibihano byari bihari, nkuko mugenzi we wo muri Afurika y'Epfo, Zola Budd yabigenje. \nYarushanwe muri make ku izina ryubatse nka Evette Armstrong muri 1986 na 1987. \nCarina Ihembe ryangana na metero 100 ya de Klerk amateka yi gihugu muri 2015, nyuma y'imyaka 25 yashizweho. De Klerk akomeza kuba afite umuvuduko wihuse m'ubihe byose, abikesheje umuyaga we wifashishije umuyaga masegonda 10.94 muri 1990. "}
{"id": "16342", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16342", "title": "Amanda Kotze", "text": "Amanda Kotze (Yavutse ku ya 26 Gashyantare 1986) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wo muri Afurika y'Epfo wasezeye ka buhariwe muri metero 400.\nKu giti cye yitabiriye amarushanwa y\u2019isi y\u2019urubyiruko muri 2003 ndetse na Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka muri 2004, nyuma yaje ku mwanya wa gatandatu muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2006 kandi yitabira imikino ya Afurika Yose muri 2007 atagera ku mukino wa nyuma.\nMu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka muri 2004 ya nitabiriye metero 4 \u00d7 100 na metero 4 \u00d7 400. Iyi kipe hamwe na Kotze nk'umunyamuryango nayo yitabiriye metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 2005 ndetse n'imikino ya yabavuga icyo ngereza muri 2006, yegukana umudari wa zahabu muri marushanwa ya Afurika yo muri 2006 ndetse n'umudari wa silver mu mikino yo muri Afurika muri 2007.\nIgihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 52,76, yagezeho mu mikino ya Afrika Yose muri 2007. "}
{"id": "16343", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16343", "title": "Isabel Le Roux", "text": "Isabel Le Roux (yavutse ku ya 23 Mutarama 1987) ni u mukinnyi wo gu siganwa ku maguru wo muri Afurika y'Epfo u zobereye muri metero zigera 200.\nMuri Shampiyona ny'afurika muri 2008 yatsindiye kwiruka muri metero 200 m'ugihe cyiza cy'amasegonda 22.69. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri metero 4x100.\nMuri metero 100 igihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 1, yagezweho muri Mata 2004 i Bloemfontein."}
{"id": "16344", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16344", "title": "Anrune Weyers", "text": "Anrune Weyers (yavutse ku ya 3 Ugushyingo 1992), ni umukinnyi ukina paralempike na siporo wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yatangiye imikino ngororamubiri muri 2010. Weyers yavutse afite inenge ivuka mu kuboko kwe kw'ibumoso kandi arushanwa mu cyiciro cy'abafite ubumuga muri T47. Muri Shampiyona yisi ya IPC yo muri 2011 yegukanye umwanya wa kabiri muri metero 400 na gatandatu muri metero 200. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yatsindiye imidari ibiri mu mikino Paralympike y'i Londres, ari yo silver muri metero 400 n'umuringa muri metero 200. Nyuma y'uwo mwaka, iyo midari yibwe ubwo yavaga ku kibuga cy'indege cya George mu burengerazuba bwa Cape. Muri Shampiyona yisi ya IPC muri 2013 yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri muri metero 200 na metero 400. \nMuri Shampiyona y'isi ya IPC 2015, yatsindiye metero 400, no muri Paralympike ya Rio muri 2016 yatsindiye silver muri metero 200 na 400. Weyers yatsindiye zahabu muri metero 400, ifeza muri metero 200 n'umuringa muri metero 100 muri Shampiyona yisi ya Para ya Athletisme yo muri 2019 yabereye i Dubai, ikanashyiraho amateka yisi ya amasegonda 55.60 kuri metero 400 mu gikombe cya Flanders i Huizengin, mu Bubiligi muri Kanama 2019. \nWeyers yatsindiye zahabu muri metero 400 muri T47 muri Tokiyo muri 2021 (Paralympikee ye ya gatatu) mugihe cyiza cya 56.05. \nUbuzima bwite.\nWeyers ni umukristo. Weyers yashakanye na Stefan Weyers. "}
{"id": "16345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16345", "title": "Elinda Vorster", "text": "Elinda Vorster (Yavutse Rademeyer, yavutse ku ya 8 Nzeri 1965 i Cape Town) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru wazobereye mu gusiganwa ku maguru. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1992 na Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 1993.\nIbyiza bye ni amasegonda 11.22 muri metero 100 (1.4, Germiston 1990) n'amasegonda agera 22.58 muri metero 200 (+1.2, Germiston 1990). "}
{"id": "16346", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16346", "title": "Zen\u00e9y van der Walt", "text": "Zen\u00e9y van der Walt (yavutse ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2000) ni umukinnyi wo muri Afurika yepfo, akaba ari kabuhariwe mu kwiruka metero 400. Yatsindiye imidari ya zahabu muri Shampiyona y'isi munsi y'abarengeje imyaka 18 muri 2017 na Shampiyona yisi 2017 IAAF World abatarengeje imyaka 18 muri shampiyona ya 2017, Amarushanwa ya IAAF yisi 18 munsi y'abarengeje imyaka 20 muri 2018. Muri 2019, yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri kaminuza. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16347", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16347", "title": "Tamzin Thomas", "text": "Tamzin Thomas (Yavutse 6 Ukwakira 1997) ni umukinnyi wo muri Afrika yepfo wiruka. Yatsindiye imidari ibiri muri Shampiyona ny'afurika mu ngimbi muri 2015.\nAmarushanwa mpuzamahanga.\n1 Ntabwo yatangiriye muri kimwe cya kabiri\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16348", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16348", "title": "Tsholofelo Thipe", "text": "Tsholofelo Thipe (yavutse ari Selemela) (yavutse ku ya 9 Ukuboza 1986) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wo muri Afurika y'Epfo, kabuhariwe muri metero 400. Yashyizeho igihe cyiza cya masegonda 51.15 atsinda muri metero 400 mu mikino ya Afrika yepfo yo muri 2009 yabereye i Stellenbosch. Yavukiye i Rustenburg, Intara y'Amajyaruguru.\nUmwuga n'amahugurwa.\nThipe yari umwe mu bagore ba mbere b'abirabura bahagarariye Afurika y'Epfo mu nzira ubwo yarushanwaga muri metero 400 mu mikino Olempike yo muri 2008 yabereye i Beijing. Yirutse mu bushyuhe bwa gatandatu ahanganye n'abandi bakinnyi barindwi, barimo Novlene Williams wo muri Jamayica na Nicola Sanders wo mu Bwongereza, bombi bakaba bakunzwe cyane muri ibi birori. Yarangije isiganwa ku mwanya wa gatandatu, mirongo irindwi na magana atatu (0,73) by'isegonda imbere ya Klodiana Shala wo muri Alubaniya, akoresheje amasegonda agera kuri 54.11. Thipe yananiwe kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, kuko yashyize mirongo ine na gatatu muri rusange, arangiza munsi yi bice bitatu byikora by'imbere by'icyiciro gikurikira. \nThipe yashakaga kandi kujya mu mikino Olempike ye ya kabiri yabereye i Londres. Yabaye uwa gatanu ku mukino wanyuma wa metero 400 mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika muri 2012 yabereye i Porto Novo, muri B\u00e9nin ; ariko, igihe cye cya masegonda agera 52.26 nticyari gihagije kugirango abone umwanya we mu mikino olempike. Ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2012, Thipe yari mu bakinnyi icumi bo muri Afurika y'Epfo batsinzwe ikizamini cy\u2019i biyobyabwenge ku bintu by abujijwe, harimo na norandrosterone, muri Shampiyona ny'afurika. Yagaya umuganga w'ikipe kuba yaramwandikiye ibinini byo kuboneza urubyaro byitwa \"Norlevo\" birimo ibintu bya bujijwe ku bitangazamakuru mbere yo gutumiza iburanisha ashobora kwirwanaho. \nThipe ni umukinnyi utuye muri Royal Bafokeng Athletics Club i Rustenburg. Yatojwe n\u2019umugabo we, Eugene Thipe, unatoza gusiganwa ku maguru n\u2019umunyamabanga w\u2019igihugu Simon Magakwe, watsinze inshuro eshatu mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri furika. "}
{"id": "16349", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16349", "title": "Dikeledi Moropane", "text": "Dikeledi Moropane (yavutse ku ya 12 Werurwe 1976) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo wasezeye muri metero 400.\nYagaragaye cyane muri Shampiyona yisi yo muri 2001, aho yarushanwe muri metero 100 atageze ku mukino wanyuma. \nMu mikino yo muri Afurika yo muri 1999 yarushanwe muri metero 100, naho ikipe ya Afurika yepfo irangiza ku mwanya wa kane muri metero 4 \u00d7 100. Mu mikino yo muri Afurika Yose yo mri 2003, yarushanwe muri metero 100 maze yegukana umudari wa feza muri metero 4 \u00d7 100. Muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2004 yarushanwe muri metero 100 kandi yegukana umudari wa feza muri metero 4 \u00d7 100.\nIbihe byiza bye yagize ni amasegonda 11.38, yageze muri Gashyantare 2000 muri Pretoriya. "}
{"id": "16350", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16350", "title": "Justine Palframan", "text": "Justine Palframan (Yavutse ku ya 4 Ugushyingo 1993) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wo muri Afurika y'Epfo uzobereye mu kwiruka muri metero 200 na 400. Yatsinze metero 400 muri Universit\u00e9 ya Summer muri 2015. Yahagarariye igihugu cya Afurika y'Epfo mu marushanwa y'isi ya IAAF yo muri 2013 na Olempike yo muri 2016.\nUbuzima bwite.\nSe wa Palframan Steve na nyina Trevlyn bahoze ari abakinnyi bakurikirana, mu gihe mushiki we Katelyn na murumuna we David barushanwaga mu mikino ngororamubiri hamwe no koga. Palframan yabanje kwitoza koga, umupira w'amaguru, na siporo, kandi afite imyaka 16 yi banze ku gusiganwa. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "16351", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16351", "title": "Wendy Seegers", "text": "Wendy Seegers (yavutse yitwa Hartman ; yavutse ku ya 28 Gashyantare 1976) ni umukinnyi wo muri Afurika yepfo witwaye neza mu gusiganwa ku maguru. Yahagarariye igihugu cye muri Shampiyona yo muri 1999 no muri 1999. Abashakisha ubu ni abiruka muri Ositaraliya, bashiraho amateka menshi yo muri W35 yo gusiganwa. Iruka 55.72, kuya 17/12/15 kuri metero 400, kugirango ushireho igihugu 35-39 muri Australiya. Ibi byiyongera kubyo yanditse kuri metero 60 ya 7.61, metero 100 ya 12.01 na metero 200 ya 24.42. Ku ya 3 Werurwe 2016 Abashakisha amateka ya W40 yo muri Ositaraliya ya 24.52 kuri metero 200. Yakurikiranye ibi hamwe nandi ma shusho yo muri Ositaraliya ya 12.18 kuri W40 muri metero 100. Iri ni isegonda 1 gusa hanze yubuzima bwe bwiza.\nMu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Masters 2016 yabereye i Perth, Seegers yiganjemo amarushanwa ya W40 y'imyaka, gutsinda metero 100 na 200, nubwo yagize imvune ikomeye. Igihe cye metero 100 cya 11.88 (+3.4) nicyo gihe cyihuta cyane cy'abagore muri rusange kandi niwe mugore wenyine wirutse munsi y'amasegonda 12. Abashakisha bayoboye ibice byombi ku ntsinzi kugirango bakomeze badatsindwa muri shampiyona.\nWendy Seegers yashimangiye izina rye nk'abakinnyi ba mbere ba W40 basiganwa ku maguru ku isi hamwe n'ibi bitaramo. Ni umunyamuryango ukundwa cyane kandi ufite agaciro muri WAMA n'ubwitonzi bw'akazi, ubunyangamugayo no gufasha abandi bakinnyi. Akenshi yishimiwe n'umugabo we, Gys hamwe nabana Jundro, Jeanae na Janko.\nAmarushanwa\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "16352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16352", "title": "Heide Seyerling", "text": "Heide Seyerling (Yavutse ku ya 19 Kanama 1976) yahoze ari umukinnyi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo, wavukiye i Port Elizabeth, yari kabuhariwe muri metero 200 na 400. Yakinnye kabiri mu mikino Olempike, mu 2000 na 2004. Mu mikino yo muri 2000 yageze kuri metero 400 ya nyuma arangiza ari uwa 6 afite amateka mashya (kandi n'ubu aracyahagarariye) igihugu ku gahigo k'amasegonda 50.05. Yashakanye n'uwahoze ari umukinnyi wa siporo Mathew Quinn."}
{"id": "16353", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16353", "title": "Basaula Lemba", "text": "Basaula Lemba (yavutse ku ya 3 Werurwe 1965) ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo wakinnye nku mukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga we wose w'abigize umwuga yamaze muri Porutugali, cyane na Vit\u00f3ria de Guimar\u00e3es. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nLemba yavukiye i Kinshasa, muri Zayire, yageze muri Porutugali afite imyaka 21, asinyana na Vit\u00f3ria SC wo muri AS Vita Club ariko ntacyo yakoze rwose yagize muri shampiyona ye ya mbere - imikino irindwi. Yakoresheje ubukangurambaga butatu bukurikira no muri Primeira Liga, ahagarariye O Elvas CAD na CF Estrela da Amadora.\nBasaula - yitiriwe izina rye mu gihe muri Porutugali - yongeye kwinjira muri Vit\u00f3ria mu 1990, aba umukinnyi ukomeye wo hagati mu ikipe ya Minho ndetse anasanga ikipe n\u2019umuturage N'Dinga Mbote mu gihe cye. Muri Mutarama 1995 yavuye mu rundi ruhande mu gihugu, CF Os Belenenses, yerekeza muri FC Tirsense nyuma gato. Nyuma y'umwaka umwe mu cyiciro cya kabiri hamwe na Moreirense FC yi mukiye muri shampiyona yo hasi, ahagarariye ikipe abiri kurwego rwa kane kugeza asezeye afite imyaka 35.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nLemba yakiniye Zayire mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu cyo muri 1992 na 1994, amarushanwa yombi arangira asohotse muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza."}
{"id": "16354", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16354", "title": "Makabi Lilepo", "text": "Makabi Lilepo (Yavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 1997) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukinira ikipe ya Al-Hilal Club (Omdurman) yo muri Premier League ya Sudani, na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nLilepo yavuye mu rubyiruko rwa AS Vita Club ariko ntabwo yigeze yinjira mu ikipe ya mbere cyangwa ngo ibone umwanya wo gukina Linafoot. Mu mpera zo muri 2018 yatumiwe mu bigeragezo muri Zamalek SC ya Premier League yo muri Misiri. Muri Mutarama 2019, nyuma y'amezi abiri ategereje ko impapuro zirangira, yagurijwe Mbabane Swallows muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Eswatini 2018\u201319. Hagati y'igihe cya 2019\u201320 Linafoot, Lilepo yinjiye muri FC Renaissance du Congo. Yahise agira icyo akora atsinda ibitego bine mu mikino irindwi y'ambere yakinnye niyi kipe. Kugeza muri 2021 Lilepo yari yagarutse muri AS Vita maze agaragara muri iyi kipe muri 2020\u201321 CAF Champions League. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nLilepo yerekeje ku rwego mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga ku ya 17 Mutarama 2021 muri mukino wa Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2020 na Congo. Nyuma y'iminsi 13 yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga yakinnye na Kameruni mu mikino ya kimwe cya kane kirangiza amarushanwa amwe. "}
{"id": "16355", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16355", "title": "Botomotoito Skito Litimba", "text": "Botomotoito Skito Litimba (Yavutse ku ya 7 Nyakanga 1977) ni Umunyekongo wahoze ari umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'abigize umwuga wakiniye nka AS Vita Club, yegukana igikombe cya Linafoot muri 1997. Mu Budage, yakiniye LR Ahlen, SC Paderborn 07, 1. FC Bocholt na SV Straelen.\nYari mu ikipe y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika Igikombe cyo muri 1998, yarangije ku mwanya wa gatatu."}
{"id": "16356", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16356", "title": "Lobilo Boba", "text": "Florian Lobilo Boba (Yavutse ku ya 10 Mata 1950) ni umukinnyi akaba myugariro w'umupira w'amaguru wa congo wakiniye Zayire mu gikombe cyisi cyo FIFA muri 1974. \nUmwuga.\nLobilo yakiniye AS Vita Club, aho yatwara igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1973 cya Champions Club. \nYari mu ikipe ya Zayire yegukanye igikombe cya nyuma cy\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 1974. \nYakinnye inshuro nyinshi muri Zayire muri 1974 yujuje amajonjora y\u2019igikombe cy'isi kandi agaragara mu mukino umwe wo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 1982 ; baza gutsinda Mozambike 5-2 ku ya 13 Nyakanga 1980.\nMu 2006, yatoranijwe na CAF nk'umwe mu bakinnyi 200 b'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika beza mu myaka 50 ishize. "}
{"id": "16357", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16357", "title": "Herv\u00e9 Lomboto", "text": "Herv\u00e9 Nguemba Lomboto (Yavutse ku ya 27 Ukwakira 1989) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Kongo ukina nk'umuzamu wa Motema Pembe ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo.\nUmwuga wabigize umwuga.\nLomboto yatangiye umwuga we muri Amazone Kimbanseke yo muri DR Congo, maze muri 2012 y'imukira muri Vita Club. Yahamaze igihe gito na AC L\u00e9opards yo muri Repubulika ya Kongo muri 2013, mbere yo gusubira muri Vita Club. Yakurikiranye ibyo muri CS Don Bosco na Dauphins Noirs, mbere yo gusinyana na Motema Pembe ku ya 2 Gashyantare 2021. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 7 Nyakanga 2013, Lomboto yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya DR Congo mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika muri 2\u20131 mu 2014 "}
{"id": "16358", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16358", "title": "Serge Lofo Bongeli", "text": "Serge Lofo Bongeli Senge (Yavutse ku ya 13 Ukwakira 1983)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa DR Congo ukina nka Rutahizamu.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nLofo yavukiye i Kinshasa, Yatangiye umwuga we ku rubyiruko hamwe na AS Paulino Kinshasa kandi muri 1999 ya zamuwe mu ikipe nkuru. Nyuma y'imyaka itatu yakoranye na AS Paulino, yinjiye mu itumba 2002 muri TP Mazembe akinayo hari shampiyona ebyiri mbere muri Mutarama 2004 yashakishijwe n\u2019ikipe ikomeye ya Angola Atl\u00e9tico Sport Avia\u00e7\u00e3o. Yagize ibihe bitatu byiza cyane muri AS Avia\u00e7\u00e3o maze asinyana muri Gashyantare 2007 muri Sagrada Esperan\u00e7a, ariko nyuma y'igihembwe kimwe niyi kipe ni myaka ine muri Angola asubira mu mujyi yavukiyemo wa Kinshasa, wasinyanye na AS Vita Club. Ku ya 5 Gashyantare 2010, yavuye muri AS Vita Club afatanije na Tychique Ntela Kalema gusinyira n'ikipe yo mu Budage Rot Weiss Ahlen, ariko ntabwo byari intambwe ikomeye kuri Serge. Ku ya 6 Nzeri 2010, yasinyiye amasezerano y'umwaka n'ikipe yo mu Bubiligi FC Bruxelles. \nMu 2013, yafatiwe muri Isiraheli akekwaho ubwicanyi, ariko arekurwa nyuma yuko inshuti ye yemeye ko ari we wakoze ubwo bwicanyi.\u00a0 \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nLofo yafashwe inshuro icyenda n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Congo DR, maze atsinda ibitego 2. "}
{"id": "16359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16359", "title": "Lomana LuaLua", "text": "Tr\u00e9sor Lomana LuaLua (yavutse ku ya 28 Ukuboza 1980) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri congo uheruka gukina nka rutahizamu. Kuri ubu ni umutoza utoza Spalding United. \nLuaLua yavukiye i Kinshasa, ariko yi mukira mu Bwongereza akiri muto. Nyuma yo kwitwara neza mu mikino y'umupira w'amaguru muri kaminuza, yasinyiye muri Colchester United. Ngaho yatsinze ibitego 21 byose mu mikino 68 byatumye Newcastle United imusinyisha. Ariko, guhatanira umwanya byasobanuraga ko atari muto mu bisanzwe mu ikipe y'ambere, kandi nyuma y'igihembwe bine n\u2019imikino 88, yimukiye i Portsmouth, iyi kipe yari yaramutije amezi atatu igihe yari i Newcastle. Yagumyeyo ibihe bitatu, ariko yaranzwe n'ibibazo bya disipulini na malariya. Amaze kuva muri Portsmouth, yimuye amakipe kenshi, ahagarariye impande mu Bugereki, Qatar, Kupuro na Turukiya, usibye kugaruka gato mu mu pira w'amaguru mu Bwongereza i Blackpool. LuaLua yakiriye bwa mbere imipira 31 mpuzamahanga muri 2002, atsinda ibitego birindwi mu mwuga mpuzamahanga w'imyaka cumi n'umwe. Yahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu cye mu marushanwa ane y\u2019igikombe cya Afurika.\nLuaLua azwiho kandi gushinga \"Fondasiyo ya LuaLua\", yita ku mfubyi zo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, no kuba umurinzi w'itsinda ry'abasuye Haslar. Murumuna we Kazenga, na mubyara we Tr\u00e9sor Kandol na Yannick Bolasie, bose bakina umupira w'amaguru.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nLuaLua yavutse ari Tr\u00e9sor Lua Lua Lomana - na Lua Lua, ni izina rya sekuru, yarihawe na murumuna we Kazenga\u00a0 Umuryango we wabaga mu Irembo ry\u2019Amashyamba i Londres ; niho, yize mu ishuri rya Community Gate Community School atangira gukina umupira afite imyaka 16, ari nako yitabira imikino ngororamubiri. Ibikorwa bye muri gimunasitike nibyo byashingiweho kwizihiza intego y'ibirango bye, ibicuruzwa birindwi by'inyuma hamwe na somersault inyuma. LuaLua yari ahagarariye ishuri rye mu mupira w'amaguru nyuma yo kugaragara atera umupira wa tennisi hirya no hino ku kibuga. Yakiniraga muri Leyton Sixth Form College, aho yize ibijyanye n'ubuhanzi, ubwo yagaragaye afite imyaka 17 kuruhande rwa kabiri, Colchester United. Geoff Harrop, umuskuti mu ikipe y\u2019umupira w'amaguru ya Colchester College, yashimishijwe n\u2019imikorere ya LuaLua, \"Umukino urangiye yatwaye ikipe yose kandi ntibyari bigoye kumutoranya mu basore bagera 22 bafite imyaka 17. \" Harrop yatumiye rutahizamu mu rubanza muri Colchester United maze asinywana niyi kipe. \nMurumuna we, Kazenga LuaLua, nawe ni umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga, na babyara be babiri nabo bakina ubuhanga; Yannick Bolasie, na Tr\u00e9sor Kandol. "}
{"id": "16360", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16360", "title": "Nono Lubanzadio Mayasisilua", "text": "Nono Lubanzadio Mayasisilua (Yavutse Ku ya 27 Mutarama 1980 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Congo (DRC)\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe nkuru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16361", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16361", "title": "Roger Lukaku", "text": "Roger Lukaku, (Yavutse Ku ya 6 Kamena 1967 i L\u00e9opoldville (ubu ni Kinshasa) apfa ku ya 28 Nzeri 2025), ni umukinnyi w' Umubiligi ukina Umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga. Yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru kuva muri 1999. Roger ni papa w'ababiligi mpuzamahanga bo mu Bubiligi Jordan na Romelu Lukaku.\nUbuzima.\nMu 1990, icyo gihe yari afite imyaka 23, Roger Lukaku yatangiye umwuga we umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga. Yinjiye mu ikipe ya FC Boom muri cyiciro cya kabiri cya shampiyona y'Ububiligi. Ikipe iza kura muri 1\u00a0kugabana muri 1992 mbere yo kongera ku manuka muri 2\u00a0kugabana igihe gikurikira. Nyuma yo kumanuka, Roger Lukaku yimukiye muRFC Seraing.\nHamwe na RFC Seraing, yarangije ari 3 muri shampiyona y'Ububiligi. Nyuma y'igihembwe 2, yakoze guhinduranye mu ikipe nshya muri Germinal Ekeren aho yanabonye icya 3\u00a0umwanya muri shampiyona y'Ububiligi.\nMuri 1996 yavuye mu Bubiligi yinjira muri Gen\u00e7lerbirli\u011fi SK yo muri Turukiya. Yamaranye shampiyona imwe gusa muriyi kipe mbere yo gusubira mu Bubiligi muri FC Mechelen.\nRoger Lukaku nawe uri inyuma yo gushinga Ishyirahamwe Sportif Rojolu. Umuryango ukomoka muri Kintambo aho iyi club iherereye. Izina ry'iyi kipe rikomoka ku nyuguti za mbere z'amazina Romelu, Yorodani na Lukaku.\nRoger Lukaku yapfuye ku ya 29 Nzeri 2025, afite imyaka 58, i Kinshasa. Nyuma gato y'urupfu rwe, umuhungu we Romelu Lukaku yamwunamiye, agira ati: \u201cUrakoze kunyigisha ibyo nzi byose. Ubuzima ntibuzongera kubaho ukundi. Warandinze kandi unyobora nk'uko ntawundi wabishobora\u201d."}
{"id": "16362", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16362", "title": "Dodi Lukebakio", "text": "Dodi Lukebakio, Yavutse Ku ya 24 Nzeri 1997 i Asse, mu Bubiligi,) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga w\u2019umubiligi ukina nka winger i Hertha Berlin.\nNyuma yo gutoranyirizwa muri ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mukino wa gicuti muri 2016, amaherezo y'ahisemo muri Bubiligi umwaka ukurikira.\nUbuzima.\nDodi Lukebakio yatangiye umwuga we muri Sporting Anderlecht. Kubera kubura umwanya wo gukina, yinjiye muri Toulouse FC ku nguzanyo mu mpeshyi yo muri 2016. Kuba adafite indangamuntu cyangwa uruhushya rwo gutura, ntashobora ariko gukina niyi kipe, yewe ndetse ni tsinda ry'abigenewe. Bigaragara ko atabonye indangamuntu y'Ububiligi kuko adashobora kwerekana ko yavukiye mu Bubiligi. Mu byukuri, nta cyemezo cy'amavuko afite. Kubura icyemezo cy'amavuko ntibibuza gukorera mu Burayi (ikibazo cya shampiyona w\u2019uburayi Renato Sanches), ariko kugira ngo abone uruhushya rwo gutura mu Bufaransa, Lukebakio agomba kuba ari mpuzamahanga, haba mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo cyangwa mu ikipe y\u2019Ububiligi. Umutoza wa Kongo, Florent Ibenge, yemeye atazuyaje, muri Nzeri 2016, ariko federasiyo y\u2019Ababiligi, na yo yasabye ko yamuhitamo, iramwanga muri iyi shampiyona. Nyuma yakinnye umukino wa gicuti kuri Ku ya 4 Ukwakira 2016 kurwanya na Kenya, idafunga imiryango yo gutoranya Ababiligi."}
{"id": "16363", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16363", "title": "Assani Lukimya-Mulongoti", "text": "Assani Lukimya-Mulongoti (Yavutse ku ya 25 Mutarama 1986 i Uvira muri Congo) ni umunyekongo ukina umupira w'amaguru ufite ubwenegihugu bw'umudage. \nUyu myugariro ufite igihagararo cya siporo yubaka cyane metero 1.89, n'ibiro 93) akinira KFC Uerdingen.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\nAkomoka mu karere ka Kivu y'Amajyepfo mu burasirazuba bwa DR Congo, yitoreje i Hertha Berlin, aho afatwa nk'umusore w'umuhanga cyane. Nyuma yi gihembwe cya 3 hamwe n'ikipe y'ikipe, yasinyiye Hansa Rostock, aho yaje kuba intangiriro idashidikanywaho.\nAriko nyuma yo gusezererwa kw'ikipe ye kandi kubera imvune ya tumye atakaza umwanya, nyuma yinjira mu ikipe ya gatatu,\u00a0Igice cy'Ubudage cya FC Carl Zeiss I\u00e9na muri gihembwe, aho yatsinze vuba cyane. Amasezerano arangiye nyuma yi gihembwe cyose, yasinyiye muri Gashyantare 2010 i Fortuna D\u00fcsseldorf, ku mwanya wa 2\u00a0kugabana kuriyi nshuro, aho umukino wa mbere w'agoye cyane kubera amakosa make yo kwirwanaho ariko yagiye buhoro arawuzuza muri shampiyona ku girango abe igice cy'ingenzi cy'izamu rya D\u00fcsseldorf kandi ashimwa cyane na bakunzi biyi kipe.\nYemeje impano ye muri shampiyona yo muri 2011-2012 agera ku bihe byiza cyagaragaje neza ubushobozi bwe. Fortuna yazamutse muri Bundesliga nyuma yo gutsinda umukino wo kwishyura wa Hertha Berlin na shampiyona ya Lukimya byakuruye ama kipe menshi yo muri Bundesliga.\nNyuma yo gusinyisha FC Cologne, yaje gusinyira Werder Bremen muri Kamena 2012. Asanze uwa 1\u00a0kugabana yari azi muri make na Hansa Rostock."}
{"id": "16364", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16364", "title": "Jody Lukoki", "text": "Jody Lukoki (Yavutse Ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 1992 i Kindu hanyuma apfa Ku ya 9 Gicurasi 2022 mu Buholandi) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru, ukomoka mu budage wavukiye muri congo. Akina nku mukinnyi w'iburyo muri FC Twente.\nUbuzima.\nJody Lukoki yavukiye muri Zayire ariko yimukira mu Buholandi hamwe n'ababyeyi be na murumuna we Madjer Lukoki kubera intambara, igihe yari akiri uruhinja.\nAfite imyaka icumi, yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru muri ikipe ya VVA/Spartaan.\nAjax.\nUwahoze ari umukinnyi wa VVA / Spartan na Young Boys, yinjiye muri Ajax.\nYatangiye bwa mbere hamwe n'itsinda rya mbere muri Ku ya 19 Mutarama 2011, mu ntsinzi 2-0 na m'ukeba we Feyenoord wa simbuye Lorenzo Ebecilio ku munota wa 80. Yongeye kugaragara bwa kabiri muri Ku ya 20 Werurwe 2011, mu gutsindwa 3-2 na ADO La Haye.\nYatsinze igitego cya mbere muri shampiyona yo muri 2011-2012 na Roda JC mu ntangiriro za shampiyona.\nSC Cambuur.\nKu ya 2 Kanama 2013, yagurijwe na SC Cambuur na Ajax.\nKu ya 4 Kanama 2013, yakinnye bwa mbere muri SC Cambuur asimbuye Oliver Feldballe ku munota wa 46\u00a0(0-0). Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere hamwe na SC Cambuur muri Ku ya 20 Nzeri 2013 na SC Heerenveen gutsindwa 2-1."}
{"id": "16366", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16366", "title": "Guy Lusadisu", "text": "Guy Lusadisu ni umunyekongo wahoze akina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga. Aheruka gukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati muri AS Vita Club.\nMuri Gashyantare 2019, yagizwe umutoza mukuru wa AS Maniema Union.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa mbere DR DR.\" \nUmwuga.\nUmutoza.\nMuri 2017 yatangiye umwuga we nk'umutoza wa AS PJSK ikipe ya bigenewe ya AS Vita Club Kandi yafashijwe na Francis Makenda wa musimbuye nyuma yo kuva muri iyi kipe muri 2019 akajya muri AS Maniema Union\nIbihembo.\nUwatsinze\nFinalist\nUwatsinze\nku mukino wanyuma"}
