{"id": "16371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16371", "title": "Jean-Paul Eale Lutula", "text": "Jean-Paul Eale Lutula, (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Ukwakira 1984 i Kinshasa, umurwa mukuru wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Kongo, akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukinira u Rwanda.\nUbuzima.\nJean-Paul Eale Lutula w'imyaka 36 y'umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga.\nYakiriye imipira ibiri mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 2005. Ikina kubwiyi ntego imikino ibiri ya gicuti, ya Tuniziya na Zambiya. Yatsinze igitego ku bakinnyi ba Tuniziya.\nNyuma yaje kubona amahitamo atatu mu ikipe yu Rwanda muri 2009, mu mikino yari mu rwego rwo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy\u2019isi cyo muri 2010. Nyuma yakinnye na Misiri, Alijeriya, na Zambiya.\nHamwe n'ikipe yo mu Bubiligi FCM Bruxelles, yakinnye imikino 23 mu cyiciro cya mbere, atsinda igitego kimwe, mu mikino 66 mu cyiciro cya kabiri, ku bitego 21. Yatsinze ibitego 12 mu cyiciro cya kabiri muri shampiyona ya."}
{"id": "16372", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16372", "title": "Jean-Paul Eale Lutura", "text": "Jean-Paul Eale Lutula, (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Ukwakira 1984 i Kinshasa, umurwa mukuru wa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Kongo, akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukinira u Rwanda.\nUbuzima.\nJean-Paul Eale Lutula w'imyaka 36 y'umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga.\nYakiriye imipira ibiri mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri 2005. Ikina kubwiyi ntego imikino ibiri ya gicuti, ya Tuniziya na Zambiya. Yatsinze igitego ku bakinnyi ba Tuniziya.\nNyuma yaje kubona amahitamo atatu mu ikipe yu Rwanda muri 2009, mu mikino yari mu rwego rwo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy\u2019isi cyo muri 2010. Nyuma yakinnye na Misiri, Alijeriya, na Zambiya.\nHamwe n'ikipe yo mu Bubiligi FCM Bruxelles, yakinnye imikino 23 mu cyiciro cya mbere, atsinda igitego kimwe, mu mikino 66 mu cyiciro cya kabiri, ku bitego 21. Yatsinze ibitego 12 mu cyiciro cya kabiri muri shampiyona ya."}
