{"id": "16382", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16382", "title": "Luyeye Mvete", "text": "Ghislain Luyeye Mvete, Yavutse Ku ya 6 Ukuboza 1979 i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Yakoresheje umwuga we hafi ya TP Mazembe.\nUbuzima.\nYitabiriye hamwe na TP Mazembe mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA Club muri 2009. Yakinnye imikino ibiri muri iri rushanwa.\nMvete yakiriye amatora ane mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mwaka muri 2011. Yakinnye umukino wa mbere ku ya 8 Mutarama 2011, mu mukino wa gicuti na Kenya (intsinzi 1-0)."}
{"id": "16383", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16383", "title": "Ilunga Mwepu", "text": "Joseph Ilunga Mwepu (yavutse ku Ku ya 22 Kanama 1949 muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, arapfa Ku ya 8 Gicurasi 2015 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 9 mu marushanwa yateguwe na FIFA, nta gitego yatsinze, muri 1974.\nBigaragara ko mu itsinda ryatoranijwe m'ugihe cyigikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage, yakinnye imikino itatu: bakina na Sikotilande (0-2), Yugosilaviya (0-9) na Burezile (0-3). Mwepu \"ariyerekana\" n'ibintu bibiri bidasanzwe:gukina na Yugosilaviya iyo bayoboye 4 kuri 0, y'ibasiye umusifuzi wo muri Kolombiya wu mukino Omar Delgado amukubita imigeri mu kibuno, ikimenyetso kitazahanwa kuko umusifuzi atabashaga kubona uwa muteye ny'irizina yirukanwe Matambula N'Daye mu mwanya we mu gihe guhitamo Yugosilaviya yatsinze umukino n'amanota 9-0. Yatoranijwe ku mukino wa gatatu w'ingwe yakinnye na Berezile kandi ibi m'ubihe bigoye (Mobutu yaba yarateye ubwoba abayobozi ba federasiyo ya Zayire ndetse na bakinnyi m'ugihe habaye irukozasoni) ajyana ifirimbi y'umusifuzi mu gihe cy'ikiruhuko, gutera imigeri neza ashyigikirwa na Sele\u00e7\u00e3o asohoka ku rukuta kugirango akubite umupira kandi awusukure n'i mbaraga zose munsi y'amaso y'abakinnyi ba Burezile bataye umutwe n'umusifuzi bahita bamuhana ikarita y'umuhondo.\nYitabiriye kandi igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1974 cyatsinzwe n'ikipe ye.\nAbapfuye.\nIlunga yapfuye muri Gicurasi 2015 nyuma y\u2019uburwayi bwamaze igihe mu bitaro bya Saint-Joseph i Limete (Kinshasa)."}
{"id": "16384", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16384", "title": "Ndaye Mulamba", "text": "Pierre Ndaye Mulamba (Yavutse ku ya 4 Ugushyingo 1948 - 26 Mutarama 2019) yari umukinnyi wo hagati mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ahahoze ari Zayire. Yiswe \"Mutumbula\" (\"umwicanyi\") na \"Volvo\". \nUmwuga wumupira wamaguru.\nMulamba yavukiye i Luluabourg (ubu ni Kananga) muri 1948. Mu 1973, yakinnye muri AS Vita Club ya Kinshasa, wegukanye igikombe cya Afurika cya Champions Club. Yabaye igice cya kabiri cyasimbuye ikipe yigihugu ya Zayire na Maroke mu mikino itajenjetse yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 1974. Muri 1974, Mulamba yakiniye Zayire mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu byombi mu Misiri ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage bw\u2019Uburengerazuba. Muri Egiputa yatsinze ibitego icyenda, biracyari agahigo, ubwo Zayire yatsindaga irushanwa. Mulamba yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019irushanwa kandi yahawe igihembo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019ingwe na Perezida Mobutu Sese Seko. Mu Budage, yayoboye iyo kipe, akina gutsindwa na Sicotilande ibitego 2-0, ariko yirukanwa nyuma yi minota 22 yakinnye na Yugosilaviya. Icyo gihe Zayire yari imaze gutsindwa 4\u20130, amaherezo itsindwa 9\u20130. Mulamba yaje kuvuga ko iyi kipe ititwaye neza, haba mu myigaragambyo cyangwa kubera gutakaza morale, nyuma yo kutabona igihembo cy\u2019amadorari 45,000 yasezeranijwe. "}
{"id": "16385", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16385", "title": "Bunene Ngaduane", "text": "Bunene Ngaduane (yavutse Ku ya 30 Nyakanga 1972 i Kinshasa, icyo gihe hari muri Zayire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo (DRC), wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yari mu itsinda ryatoranijwe mu gikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1994 na 1996, aho ikipe ye yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza buri icyo gihe."}
{"id": "16386", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16386", "title": "Herve Ndonga", "text": "Herv\u00e9 Ndonga (Yavutse iKu ya 2 Gicurasi 1992 i Kinshasa) Kuva icyo gihe yakinnye kuva muri Gashyantare 2015) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru (DRC), kuri Progresso da Lunda Sul nkumukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nHerv\u00e9 Ndonga yitabiriye TP Mazembe mu gikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2010 cyateguwe muri Leta zunze ubumwe z'Abarabu. Ku mukino wanyuma w'igikombe cy'isi cya FIFA cyo muri 2010 wahuje TP Mazembe na Inter Milan (gutsindwa 3-0), yinjiye mu kibuga ku munota wa 89\u00a0mu mwanya wa Dioko Kaluyituka.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYitabiriye amarushanwa ya Toulon muri 2013 atoranya abatarengeje imyaka 20.\nHerv\u00e9 Ndonga yahamagawe kabiri mu ikipe ya DR Congo muri 2013. Iyi ni imikino ibiri yakinnye na Libiya na Togo, mu rwego rwo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi muri 2014."}
{"id": "16387", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16387", "title": "John Buana N'Galula", "text": "John Buana N'Galula, (Yavutse Ku ya 23 Kamena 1968 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Zayire, wakinnye nka myugariro. Umwuga we wose yabigize umwuga mu Bubiligi, aho yagumye kuba kandi abona ubwenegihugu bw'Ububiligi. Hamwe na Zayire, yitabiriye ibikombe bibiri bya Afurika.\nUmwuga.\nJohn Buana N'Galula yageze mu Bubiligi muri 1988, amezi make nyuma yo kwitabira CAN yo muri 1988, ari naho yavuye mu ikipe isanzwe y'iryo rushanwa. Yahawe akazi na K Boom FC, ikipe ikomeye yo mu cyiciro cya 2. Afite imyaka makumyabiri gusa, yigaragaje muri cumi na rimwe akimara kugera muri club. Iyi kipe ikina ku meza buri mwaka ariko ikananirwa gutwara igikombe cya shampiyona, ikananirwa mu cyiciro cya nyuma inshuro eshatu zikurikiranye hagati ya 1989 na 1991. Amaherezo, iyi kipe yashoboye kuyitsinda muri 1992 hanyuma isubira mu cyiciro cya mbere nyuma yimyaka irenga mirongo itatu itegereje, nubwo ukwezi kwa Mutarama kwa myugariro kutabonetse, yajyanye muri CAN muri 1992 aho yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza."}
{"id": "16388", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16388", "title": "Kasongo Ngandu", "text": "Isaac Ngandu Kasongo, (Yavutse Ku ya 6 Ukuboza 1979 i Kinshasa (Zayire)), ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Yakinnye henshi mu mwuga we muri TP Mazembe.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKasongo yatangiye umwuga we mu mupira w'amaguru muri 1997 muri ikipe ya kabiri ya SC Cilu. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2001, hamwe niyi kipe, yabaye shampiyo wa LIFBACO kandi yi tabira icyiciro cya nyuma cya shampiyona y'igihugu muri 2002, aho ikipe ya Lukala yarangije ku mwanya wa kane.\nMuri 2002, yaburaniye TP Mazembe. Mu gihe cye cya mbere hamwe'ibikona\u201c, Yageze ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cy'igihugu kandi yari umuyobozi w'irushanwa rya Lubumbashi kugeza rihagaritswe. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2004, Kasongo yabaye visi-kapiteni w\u2019igihugu kandi yitwara neza i Lumbumbashi. Nyuma yaho, Kasongo na Mazembe begukanye igikombe cya shampiyona inshuro enye (2006, 2007, 2009 na 2011) ndetse batwara inshuro ebyiri igikombe cya Shampiyona ny'afurika (2009, 2010). Yakinnye muri CAF Supercup muri 2010 na 2011. Hagati aho, Kasongo yatsinze igitego mu mukino wa mbere wa Champions League 2010 na Esp\u00e9rance.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKasongo Ngandu yari mu ikipe ya DR Congo kuva 2004. Yari umwe mu bagize ikipe ya Kongo mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2006, cyaje kugera muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza, aho yakuwemo na Misiri, yaje gutsinda irushanwa. Muri CHAN yo muri 2011 no mu marushanwa ya gicuti ya Nil Basin, yabereye i Cayiro muri Mutarama 2011. Mu mukino wo guhatanira umwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa ya Cayiro, Abanyekongo batsinze Abanyakenya ku manota make. Kasongo yabaye umwanditsi w'igitego cy'onyine, bityo afungura amazamu y'ibitego bye kurwego rw'ikipe y'igihugu.\nUbuzima bwite.\nArubatse, afite abahungu babiri n'umukobwa."}
{"id": "16389", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16389", "title": "Ilongo Ngansania", "text": "Ilongo Ngansania, uzwi ku izina rya Saddam, (Yavutse Ku ya 8 Kanama 1984 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru muri Kongo (DRC) Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati muri Forest Rangers Football Club ya Zambiya.\nUbuzima.\nYitabiriye igikombe cya Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yiswe izina kubera uburyo bwe bwo gukina. Afite icyerekezo cyiza cy'umukino, tekiniki nziza nu buhanga bw'umubiri hamwe n'ikirenge cy'ibumoso kidasanzwe. Nyuma yo guhungira muri katari, yasubiye mu gihugu cye, muri DC Motema Pembe agamije gushaka abatoranijwe. Nyuma yo kwitwara neza, yibutswe bwa mbere kuva muri 2008 na Robert Nouzaret na Morice muri Werurwe 2011."}
{"id": "16390", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16390", "title": "Yeni Ngbakoto", "text": "Yeni Atito Ngbakoto, (yavutse Ku ya 23 Mutarama 1992 \u00e0 Croix) ni umufaransa ukina umupira w'amaguru, ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo kuri ubu ukinira Western Wanderers ya Western Sydney nku mukinnyi wo hagati utera.\nYabaye mpuzamahanga hamwe na basore b'Abafaransa (afunzwe na munsi ya 17 na munsi ya 18). Ngbakoto akina cyane nku mukinnyi wo hagati utera, ariko arashobora gufasha nka rutahizamu. Azwiho umuvuduko nu buhanga.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\namasomo mato.\nY\u00e9ni Ngbakoto yatangiye umwuga we umupira w'amaguru muri ikipe ya SC Clemenceau i Besan\u00e7on. Yitwaye neza mu itsinda ry\u2019urubyiruko rw\u2019iyi kipe, aho bamubonye hanyuma akayoborwa na FC Metz, ariko na Tottenham, Chelsea na Barcelona. Amaherezo yasinye amasezerano y'urubyiruko na FC Metz muri 2007. Bitewe nuko yitwaye n\u2019urubyiruko rwo muri Metz, Yeni yahamagawe mu ikipe y\u2019Ubufaransa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka muri 17 na Philippe Bergeroo. Ku ya 25 Kamena 2009, yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 5 yu mwuga na Garnets.\nFC Metz.\nUmukino wa mbere muri Ligue 2.\nY\u00e9ni Ngbakoto yazamuwe mu ikipe ya mbere muri shampiyona yo muri 2009-10, ariko atangira shampiyona hamwe n\u2019ikipe yikinira muri CFA 2, atsinda igitego ku ncuro ya mbere yakiniye iyi kipe yakinnye na CA Pontarlier, Ku ya 15 Kanama 2009. Azakina amezi ane ari imbere mu ikipe yikinira, yongere atsinde muri mu kino na Thionville (intsinzi 1-0). Yahamagawe na Yvon Pouliquen ku mukino wi cyiciro cya 16 cya Coupe de la Ligue na Olempikee Lyonnais, Ku ya 13 Mutarama 2010 akaza gukina muri munota 83,\u00a0 mu mwanya wa Julien Cardy (umukino batsinzwe 3-0). Yagarutse mu ikipe yikinira shampiyona irangiye, arangiza shampiyona (CFA 2) atsinda ibitego 8 mu mikino 16, ikigega cyo muri FC Metz cyarangije kuba shampiyona n'amanota agera 107, umubare munini mu matsinda yose muri iyi shampiyona.\nInyandiko.\nIbipimoReba"}
{"id": "16391", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16391", "title": "Kafula Ngoie", "text": "Kafula Ngoie (yavutse Ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 1945 noneho muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nku mukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 8 (nta gitego yatsinze) hagati yo muri 1972 na 1974. Yari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974.\nYagiye kandi muri CANs yo muri 1972 na 1974."}
{"id": "16392", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16392", "title": "Fabrice Ngoma", "text": "Fabrice Ngoma, ku izina rye ryuzuye ni Fabrice Luamba Ngoma, (Yavutse ku ya 22 Mutarama 1994 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati muri Al Hilal Club.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nIntangiriro muri DRC.\nYavutse ku ya 22 Mutarama 1994 i Kinshasa, Fabrice yatangiye gukinira ikipe yabo mu mujyi ya vukiyemo, FC Arc-en-ciel, bakinnye muri shampiyona muri 2013-2014. Yinjiye mu mwaka wakurikiyeho muri Sharks XI FC, yavumbuwe mu isi y'ababigize umwuga akina muri shampiyona yo muri 2014-2015 ya shampiyona yo muri DRC aho iyi kipe yaje ku mwanya wa gatatu mu itsinda ryayo inyuma ya DC Motema Pembe na AS Vita Club, kugira ngo igere ku mukino, imikino ku mwanya wa gatandatu.\nIndi kipe ya Kinshasa, ni FC Max Mokey Etanch\u00e9it\u00e9, ishishikajwe nuyu musore Ngoma wa muhereye ku gikombe cya shampiyona nshya yo muri 2015-2016, akazarangiza ku mwanya wa gatanu, bivuze ko gukuraho imikino yo kwishyura.\nInararibonye muri Nijeriya.\nMuri 2016-2017, Fabrice Ngoma yakinnye gusa n'ikipe muri kimwe cya kabiri cya shampiyona kuva yimurirwa mu idirishya ryo kwimura imbeho, muri Ifeanyi Ubah FC ikina muri Premier League yo muri Nigeriya (itangira muri Mutarama ikazarangiza muri Nzeri). Imyitwarire ye myiza ntiyagaragaye kandi amakipe benshi ku mugabane wa Afurika baramushaka."}
{"id": "16393", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16393", "title": "Danny Mansoni Ngombo", "text": "Danny Mansoni Ngombo, (yavutse Ku ya 25 Ukwakira 1963) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo (DRC). Akina nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga we wose yawumaze mu Bubiligi. Akinira ikipe ya K Beerschot VAC, Germinal Ekeren, RFC Seraing, Sporting Charleroi, na RCS Vis\u00e9. Yakinnye kandi shampiyona yo mu Budage hamwe n'ikipe ya Wuppertal.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Seraing, yakinnye umukino muri gikombe cya UEFA.\nYitabiriye ikipe ya Zayire mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika bigera kuri bitatu muri 1988, 1992 na 1994. Yakinnye kimwe cya kane kirangiza muri iri rushanwa muri 1992 na 1994. Yakinnye imikino icyenda yose mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu."}
{"id": "16394", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16394", "title": "Michel Ngonge", "text": "Umwuga wa ikipe.\nMichel Ngonge akinira mu Bubiligi, Turukiya, Ubwongereza na Sikotilande.\nYakinnye imikino 239 muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere n'icyakabiri, atsinda ibitego 53. Yatsindiye kwitwara neza muri shampiyona yo muri 1995-1996, aho yatsinze ibitego 14 muri shampiyona y'Ububiligi hamwe n'ikipe ya KRC Harelbeke.\nMu marushanwa y\u2019i Burayi, yitabiriye imikino itatu mu gikombe cya UEFA.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire ubu ni DRC, yakinnye hagati ya 1996 na 2000.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 1996 na 2000. Muri CAN muri 1996, yakinnye umukino na Gabon. Muri CAN muri 2000, yakinnye imikino ibiri, na Alijeriya na Afurika y'Epfo. Yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza CAN muri 1996.\nYakinnye kandi imikino ibiri ibara icyiciro kibanza cy'igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 1998."}
{"id": "16395", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16395", "title": "Mbomboko Fiston Ngoy", "text": "Mbomboko Fiston Ngoy yahoze ari umukinnyi w' umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yabaye muri TP Mazembe kuva muri 2003. Bomboko yapfuye mu ijoro ryo ku ya 4 Kamena 2024, afite imyaka 47, nyuma y\u2019umuriro wibasiye mu kabari i Lubumbashi."}
{"id": "16396", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16396", "title": "Emmanuel Ngudikama", "text": "Emmanuel Christian Ngudikama Kila (Yavutse Ku ya 7 Nzeri 1987 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nNgudikama yatangiye umwuga we mukuru muri FC Les Stars i Kinshasa, mbere yo kwinjira muri AS Vita Club mu mpera muri 2009.\nMuri shampiyona ye ya mbere muri AS Vita Club, Ngudikama yatsindiye shampiyona y'igihugu. Yamenyekanye kandi ari muri Shampiyona ny'afurika. Muri 2014, yageze ku mukino wa nyuma wa Champions League, atsindwa n'ikipe ya Alijeriya yitwa ES S\u00e9tif. Nyuma, muri 2018, yageze ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Confederation Cup, atsindwa n'ikipe yo muri Maroke ya Raja de Casablanca. Yagaragaye cyane mu matsinda, atsinda ibitego bibiri mu ikipe ya kote divuwari ya ASEC Mimosas.\nIkipe y'igihugu.\nKu ya 3 Werurwe 2010, Ngudikama yakiriwe bwa mbere mu ikipe ya DR Congo, mu mukino wa gicuti na Nigeriya (gutsindwa 5-2).\nMu ntangiriro za 2016, yitabiriye icyiciro cya nyuma cya Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika yateguriwe mu Rwanda. Muri iri rushanwa, yakinnye imikino itatu, harimo na kimwe cya kabiri yatsinze kuri penaliti yakina na Gineya. Icyakora, ntabwo yakinnye umukino wa nyuma yatsinzwe na DR Congo kuri Mali.\nMuri rusange, yakiriye batanu hamwe na DR Congo."}
{"id": "16397", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16397", "title": "Granddi Ngoyi", "text": "Granddi Ngoyi Majundu (yavutse Ku ya 17 Gicurasi 1988) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wu mufaransa ukomoka muri congo.\nUmwuga waikipe.\nPSG.\nGranddi yinjiye muri PSG mbere y'imyitozo yo kuri 13. Ufite amasezerano y'indobanure, yinjiye muri Kanama 2007, amasezerano y'imyaka 3 y'umwuga hamwe na ikipe ye.\nYagaragaye bwa mbere muri Ligue 1 kuri Ku ya 4 Kanama 2007 na FC Sochaux-Montb\u00e9liard, ku myaka 19. Yishimiye manda ye ya mbere muri Ligue 1 Ku ya 20 Ukwakira 2007 ku butaka bwa Valenciennes.\nMu gice cya mbere cya shampiyona ya 2008\u201309, yagaragaye rimwe gusa hamwe na PSG mu gutsindwa na Schalke 04 mu gikombe cya UEFA. Yatijwe rero Mutarama 2009 kuri Clermont Foot, hanyuma ukine muri Ligue 2 kugirango ubone umwanya wo gukina.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2009-2010, agaruka muri PSG, yitabiriye imikino 16 ya shampiyona hamwe na PSG.\nBrest.\nMuri Nyakanga 2010 yongeye gutizwa igihembwe hanyuma yerekeza muri Stade Brestois 29, ikipe yari imaze kuzamurwa muri Ligue 1. Nyuma yo gutangira shampiyona ya bangamiwe n\u2019imvune, yigaragaje nk'uwatangiye muri iyi kipe kandi abohesha iminyururu 16 hagati yitariki ya 21 nu munsi wa nyuma yagize uruhare mu kubungabunga Stade Brestois 29 mu ntore."}
{"id": "16398", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16398", "title": "Baggio Siadi", "text": "aggio Siadi Ngusia (yavutse Ku ya 21 Nyakanga 1997 muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukinaumupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Kongo. Akina muri TP Mazembe nk'umuzamu.\nUmwuga.\nMuri ikipe.\nKugeza ubu ni umukinnyi wa TP Mazembe wo mu itsinda \"ry'imikino ry'urubyiruko Bazano\", kuva Ku ya 22 Nyakanga 2021 kumasezerano y'imyaka 5, Baggio nawe yaje guhinduka nku muzamu w'ikipe DCMP."}
{"id": "16399", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16399", "title": "Yorodani Nkololo", "text": "Micha\u00ebl Jordan Nkololo, (Yavutse Ku ya 9 Ugushyingo 1992 i Cr\u00e9teil mu Bufaransa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru arimpuzamahangaukomoka muri congo.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nJordan Nkololo yanyuze mu kigo cyo muri Stade Rennes. Muri Mata 2006, igikombe cy'isi U15 cyabereye i Saint-Pierre muri Nantes hamwe n'a basore ba Rennes, yatsinze Olympique de Marseille ku mukino wa nyuma. Jordan Nkololo ntabwo ari muri Stade Rennes. Agaruka gukina muri \u00cele-de-France muri AC Boulogne-Billancourt, La Berrichonne de Ch\u00e2teauroux yamubonye muri 2011, ubwo yari afite imyaka 19.\nYatangiye umwuga we hano muri shampiyona yo muri 2012\u201313, muri Ligue 2. Umwaka ukurikira, yasinyanye na Clermont Foot aho yakinnye ibihe bibiri muri Ligue 2. Yakiniye imikino 50 ya shampiyona, atsinda ibitego bibiri. Amasezerano arangiye mu mpeshyi yo muri 2015, yatangajwe muri Ligue 1. Ku ya 9 Kamena 2015, umukono we muri SM Caen yashyizwe ku mugaragaro, asinya amasezerano y'imyaka itatu. Muri Mutarama 2017, ugasanga adafite umwanya wo gukina, yatijwe muri kuri Stade Lavallois kugeza shampiyona irangiye.\nAmasezerano arangiye muri Normandy, yinjiye muri FC Hermannstadt, azamurwa mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019Abanyarumaniya.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2015, yatoranijwe mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mikino myinshi ya gicuti. Yamenyekanye ku ncuro ya mbere yakinnye na Kameruni (1-1) maze yinjira mu mukino na Madagasikari (2-1)."}
{"id": "16400", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16400", "title": "Marcel Nkueni", "text": "Marcel Nkueni (yavutse Ku ya 4 Mata 1978) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Akina nkumuzamu hamwe na DC Motema pembe.\nUbuzima.\nNkueni yari umwe mu bagize itsinda rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo muri mwaka wo muri 1998 na 2000 mu gikombe cya Afurika."}
{"id": "16401", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16401", "title": "Eric Miala Nkulukuta", "text": "Eric Miala Nkulukuta, (yavutse Ku ya 6 Nzeri 1982 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. kuri ubu akina muri CS Don Bosco i Lubumbashi.\nUbuzima.\nDC Motema Pembe.\nNkulukuta yinjiye muri DCMP muri 2002 mu bihe bibiri (imikino 56 n'ibitego 0)\nTP Mazembe.\nYinjiye muri TP Mazembe muri 2007 kandi yitabira CAF Champions League muri 2007,2009,2010, 2011,2012, ebyiri muri zo zatsinzwe na TP Mazembe muri (2009,2010).\nIgihe cya 11/12.\nYatsinze igitego kuri AS Veti Club hamwe n'umupira uturutse kure kuri metero 35.\nIgihe cya 12/13.\nYatsinze igitego batsinze Saint Eloi Lupopo ku mupira yari ahawe na Guy Lusadisu.\nIgihe cya 13/14.\nNkulukuta akina gake na ikipe ye bizamutera kuva muri iyi kipe.\nIgihe cya 14/15.\nKu ya 30 Kanama 2014, Nkulukuta yinjiye muri CS Don Bosco."}
{"id": "16402", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16402", "title": "Shabani Nonda", "text": "Shabani Nonda (yavutse Ku ya 6 Werurwe 1977 i Bujumbura mu Burundi), yahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru muri congo wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana, ubuhunzi n'intangiriro.\nShabani Nonda yavukiye mu Burundi ku babyeyi ba Zayirwa, yagaragaye hakiri kare cyane kubera ubuziranenge bwe bwo gutsinda ibitego: afite imyaka cumi n'itanu, yamaze gukina n'abakuze maze yigaragaza nki nyenyeri y'ikipe ya mbere ya Atl\u00e9tico Olympic ikipe nto ya D2 i Bujumbura. Amatike make anyerera mu mufuka kugirango atezimbere ubuzima bwa buri munsi bwu muryango we. Ikipe nini yo mu mujyi irashaka ku musinyisha. Urubanza rukemurwa vuba, amasezerano yasinywe n'amafaranga yakusanyijwe. Ariko mu ntangiriro zuyu mwaka wo muri 1994, umurwa mukuru w\u2019Uburundi hari kumena amaraso. Kimwe n'indi miryango myinshi, Nondas yagiye mu buhungiro. Se akomoka muri Zayire yahisemo kugarura umuryango we mu gihugu cye kavukire. Ariko Shabani, ufite imyaka 17, afata inzira yo mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba hamwe na mukuru we muri Tanzaniya.\nNyuma yo kugenda mu mihanda y'umurwa mukuru wa Tanzaniya no kwitegereza imyitozo ya D1, Nonda yimenyekanisha ku bayobozi b'Abasore b'Abanyafurika, ba shampiyona. Byabanjirijwe n'izina rikomeye nk'umukinnyi watsinze ibitego, bigurishwa n'abari mu buhungiro, kandi byasabwe n'inshuti ze, babyumvikanyweho vuba. Mu buhungiro bwe muri Tanzaniya, yakiniye Young africans kandi atwara igikombe cya Kagame Inter-Club muri shampiyona ya mbere. Muri 1994, yatwaye igikombe cye cya kabiri, Igikombe cya Tanzaniya maze ahitamo guhindura amakipe mu mpera zo muri 1994. Yiyandikishije rero muri shampiyona ya 1995 hamwe na Vaal Professionals, ikipe yo muri Afrika yepfo imaze kumubura. Amahirwe amara amezi icumi, igihe cyo kwambikwa ikamba rya shampiyona nuwatsinze ibitego byinshi hanyuma atsinda ibitego bine mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo gukina igikombe cya Afurika na Vaal Professionals. (2-2 na 2-1). Amezi atatu nyuma yiki gikorwa, yageze muri Afrika yepfo, muri aba Vaal Professionals. Amaherezo ahinduka umunyamwuga. Nubwo kwishyira hamwe byari bigoye, yatsinze ibitego cumi na bibiri mu mezi atandatu y'ambere. Umukozi wo muri Arijantine wasuye yamuhaye urugendo mu Burayi."}
{"id": "16403", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16403", "title": "Fabrice N'Sakala", "text": "Mu ikipe.\nYageze mu kigo cy'imyitozo cya ESTAC afite imyaka 14, muri 2004, avuye mu ikipe ya AS Bondy, Fabrice yakinnye umukino we wa mbere n'ikipe ya mbere ya Trojan, ku ya 9 Nzeri 2008 mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'igikombe cya Shampiyona na SCO Angers. Ku ikubitiro yatojwe nk'umukinnyi ukina ibumoso ukina hagati, yasimbuwe ibumoso n'umutoza we mushya Jean-Marc Furlan.\nKu ya 20 Kanama 2013, ikipe yo mu Bubiligi RSC Anderlecht yatangaje ko imaze kubona serivisi za Fabrice N'Sakala mu bihembwe bitatu.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nNyuma yo kugaragara gake mu ikipe y\u2019Ubufaransa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 17, yatoranijwe na Erick Mombaerts mu ikipe y\u2019Ubufaransa Ikipe_yumupira_wamaguru_yabatarengeje_imyaka_17;ikipe y'abafaransa batarengeje imyaka 17, Ikipe yumupira wamaguru yabatarengeje imyaka batarengeje imyaka 23 ku ya 25 Kanama 2011, mu mukino wo kwishyura muri Ero yo muri 2013 uteganijwe ku ya 2 Nzeri na Lativiya. Fabrice ntaho yitabiriye uyu mukino ariko yemenya guhitamo kwe bwa mbere yizeye ku ya 6 Nzeri 2011 mu mukino wa gicuti na Portugal (kwinjira muri 71\u00a0iminota).\nN'Sakala wavukiye mu Bufaransa, yahisemo ubwenegihugu bwa Kongo hagati mu myaka ya za 2010 agamije kwambara umwenda \"w'ingwe\". Yanze rero ubwenegihugu bw'Ubufaransa kuko nk'uko ingingo ya 10 y'Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ibivuga, \u201cUbwenegihugu bwa Kongo ni bumwe kandi bwihariye. Ntishobora gufatirwa hamwe n'izindi zose \u201d de la famille/LIVRE I DE LA NATIONALITE.htm 1.\nKu ya 10 Werurwe 2015, Florent Ibenge, umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yamuhamagaye bwa mbere kugira ngo yinjire kandi akine umukino wa gicuti na Iraki i Dubayi.\nKu ya 12 Kanama 2020 yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri na Be\u015fikta\u015f JK.\nIbihembo.\nMuri ikipe.\n- T\u00fcrkiye: shampiyona hamwe na Besiktas - Uwatsindiye Igikombe cya Turukiya hamwe na Besiktas - Umukinnyi wanyuma wigikombe cya Turukiya hamwe na Alanyaspor"}
{"id": "16404", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16404", "title": "Vital Nsimba", "text": "Vital Manuel Nsimba, (yavutse Ku ya 8 Nyakanga 1993 muri Cacuaco muri Angola) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo ukina nka myugariro w'ibumoso kuri Girondins de Bordeaux.\nUbuzima.\nVital Manuel Nsimba yavukiye muri Angola aho babaga, kugeza afite imyaka itandatu. Umuryango we uzaa guhungira muri Angola nyuma yuko se aregwa ubujura mu gisirikare. Bahaguruka berekeza mu Bufaransa na Toulouse aho nyirarume yari atuye, ku ruhande rwa se mbere yo kwimukira i Bordeaux mbere i Villenave-d'Ornon hanyuma atura i La Bastide ku nkombe iburyo bw'icyambu cya port de la Lune. Mu Bufaransa, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Sporting Club de la Bastidienne nyuma mu ikipe ya Villenave-d'Ornon aho yagaragaye muri Girondins de Bordeaux. Yinjiye mu kigo cyamahugurwa cyaho afite imyaka 16.\nMuri club.\nYatojwe muri Girondins de Bordeaux, yerekeza muri EA Guingamp muri 2013. Yabaye umukinnyi mukuru wa bigize umwuga, akina muri CFA 2. Yagurijwe muri shampiyona yo muri 2014-2015 na Lu\u00e7on, akina muri National.\nNyuma yasinyanye amasezerano ye yambere y'umwuga na Bourg-en-Bresse 01 muri 2015 avumbura Ligue 2.\nKu ya 8 Kamena 2018, yinjiye muri Auvergne na Clermont Foot aho yagize ibihe byiza muri Ligue 2 ndetse yegera no kuzamuka muri shampiyona yo muri 2019-2020. Ibi birahagarikwa kubera icyorezo cya Covid-19 mu gihe Clermont Foot ari 5 muri Ligue 2. Amaherezo yaje kuvumbura Ligue 1 mu gihe cy'ingengo yimari yo muri 2021-2022 m'ugihe cya mbere mu mateka ya CF63 mu byamamare."}
{"id": "16405", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16405", "title": "Belmond Nsumbu Dituabanza", "text": "Belmond Nsumbu Dituabanza (yavutse Ku ya 31 Mutarama 1982 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muru congo (DRC).\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16406", "title": "Jacky N'Tazambi", "text": "Manunu Jacky N'Tazambi (yavutse Ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1969 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga ukmoka muri Zayire, ubu ni congo wakinnye nka myugariro wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nKu ya 25 Kamena 1989 yakinnye n'ikipe ya Zayire, umukino bakina na Tuniziya uza mu rwego rwo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi muri 1990 (batsindwa 1-0)."}
{"id": "16407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16407", "title": "Tychic Ntela Kalema", "text": "Tychique Ntela Kalema ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) ukinira CSMD Diables Noirs muri Repubulika ituranye ya Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nKalema yatangiye umwuga we muri SC Cilu, asinyana nayo muri 2008 na AS Vita Club.\nYitabiriye na AS Vita Club mu gikombe cya CAF Orange Confederations Cup muri 2010.\nKu ya 5 Gashyantare 2010, avuye hamwe na Serge Lofo Bongeli ikipe ye ya AS Vita Club, basinyana n\u2019ikipe yo mu Budage ya Rot Weiss Ahlen.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nKalema yatoranijwe rimwe gusa Ingwe ya DR Congo. Uyu ni umukino wakinnye na Togo, Ku ya 8 Nzeri 2013. Uyu mukino bawutsinzwe 2-1, uri mukino wari mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 2014.\nAhagarariye igihugu inshuro cumi n'ibiri zose, ubaze imikino yakinnye n'ikipe ya A '. Mu bindi, yari mu ikipe muri Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika yo muri 2009."}
{"id": "16408", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16408", "title": "Jean Kalala N'Tumba", "text": "Jean Kalala Tumba (yavutse Ku ya 7 Mutarama 1949 apfa ku ya 11 Mutarama 2021), yari umukinnyiukina umupira w'amaguru uvuka muri Zayire wo mu myaka ya za miro 70.\nUbuzima.\nJustin Tumba Pus yabanaga n'umuryango we i Kinshasa kugeza mu myaka ya za 1960. Umuryango we wasubiye i Kananga nyuma y'imvururu zaberaga muri Kongo muri iki gihe. muri kiriya gihe umuryango we wabaga muri komini ya Kinshasa.\nMuri icyo gihe, Andr\u00e9 Guillaume Lubaya yabanaga na bo, umunyapolitiki wo muri Kongo wishwe na Joseph D\u00e9sir\u00e9 Mobutu.\nMu gihe Pus n'umuryango we bari i Kinshasa, mukuru we yatangiye umwuga we w'umupira w'amaguru nku muzamu muri AC Mikado. Kugenda i Kananga bizahagarika uyu mwuga wa shampionat ya Leo. Uku n'uburyo Malumba Cobra, mukuru wa Pus,yisanze ari umunyezamu muri Union Tshioto St Gilloise. Umwuga we watangiye ari \"umugongo\" muri Renaissance de Luluabourg. Azahinduka hagati-imbere nyuma. Muri derby hagati ya Union Tshioto na Ranaissance, Ntumba Tshintula-ntula yakuye mukuru we Cobra mu myigaragambyo ikomeye.\nPus yari hagati-hagati kuruhande rwa Renaissance n'umuzamu wa Cobra muri Union Tshioto, ahanganye na murumuna we muto. uyu mukino ya Luluabourgeois yabereye imbere ya Pus na Cobra. Kuri se, kubona murumunawe gutya abamba mukuru we ntibyari byoroshye. Gukurikira iyi ntego ya Pus, Cobra yagombaga kubyutswa. Kandi icyemezo cya kibyeyi cyaraguye, cyumye kandi ntigishobora kumvikana: yaba abahungu be bose bakinnye mu makipe amwe cyangwa umupira w'amaguru, bahagarara bombi. Se yari umufana wa Tshinkunku wo muri Amerika. Nuburyo \"Pus qui tue\" yarangirije muri Amerika Tshinkunku.\nKinshasa yavumbuye uyu musore udasanzwe ari Tumba Pus mu 1971 mugihe cyanyuma cy'igikombe cya congo yatsindiye bwa mbere na Vita Club i Luluabourg."}
{"id": "16409", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16409", "title": "Herv\u00e9 Nzelo-Lembi", "text": "Herv\u00e9 Nzelo-Lembi, wavutse ku ya 25 Kanama 1975 i Kinshasa, ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru wa congo kuri GB Antwerp. Akina nka myugariro.\nAfite kandi ubwenegihugu bw'Ububiligi. Yatsinze mugihe cye muri FC Bruges, Umubiligi Ebony Shoe."}
{"id": "16410", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16410", "title": "Christopher Oualembo", "text": "Christopher Oualembo, (yavutse Ku ya 31 Mutarama 1987 muri Saint-Germain-en-Laye) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nku mukinnyi winyuma muri Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru muri Porutugali mu mabara ya Acad\u00e9mica Coimbra.\nUbuzima.\nIntangiriro.\nChristopher Oualembo yavukiye kuri se ukomoka muri Repubulika ya Kongo na nyina ukomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yatangiye umwuga we muri ikipe Sportif d'Ach\u00e8res afite imyaka 10. Nyuma y'imyaka ibiri, yinjiye mu kigo cyigisha PSG. Mu bihe bitandatu, yarinze amabara ya ikpe nkuru. Muri shampiyona iheruka i Paris, y'egukanye igikombe cya shampiyona w\u2019Ubufaransa munsi y'abafite imyaka 18 na AS Monaco. Yibanze cyane ku myigire kuruta umwuga we w'umupira w'amaguru, yananiwe guhindura kuba umunyamwuga.\nus Quevilly.\nMuri shampiyona yakurikiyeho, Christopher yinjiye muri iyo kipe avuye muri us Quevilly. kumvikana nti bwamaze kabili, kuko nyuma y'amezi atandatu yinjiye muri Levante muri Espanye.\nkuzamuka.\nIcyo gihe turi muri Mutarama 2007, Oualembo asinya amasezerano y'umwaka n'igice n'ikipe ya Valencian. Amasezerano arangiye yasanze nta kipe ya mwakira, nubwo yagerageje inshuro nyinshi mu m'akipe atandukanye yo mu Bufaransa (FC Lorient, Toulouse FC). Umwaka umwe, yinjiye muri AC Monza. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere mu Butaliyani mu Kwakira muri 2009."}
{"id": "16411", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16411", "title": "Kosi Saka", "text": "Kosi Saka, (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Gashyantare 1986 i Kinshasa,) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa congo. Akina nku mukinnyi wo hagati, kuri ubu akina na KFC Uerdingen 05.\nImibare.\nImbonerahamwe ikurikira irerekana muri make imibare mumikino yemewe ya Kosi Saka:"}
{"id": "16412", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16412", "title": "Pelly Ruddock Mpanzu", "text": "Pelly Ruddock Mpanzu, (Yavutse Ku ya 22 Werurwe 1994 muri Hendon,) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa congo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati urinda Luton Town.\nUbuzima.\nKu ya 28 Ugushyingo 2013, yagurijwe mu mujyi wa Luton \nKu ya 28 Mutarama 2014, yinjiye mu mujyi wa Luton burundu."}
{"id": "16414", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16414", "title": "Joel Sami", "text": "Andr\u00e9 Jo\u00ebl Sami (Yavutse Ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 1984 i Montfermeil) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru wumufaransa na congo. Kuri ubu arimo gukina nka myugariro wo hagati muri Ratchaburi FC.\nUbuzima.\nIngano ye ikomeye cyane ya muteye guhabwa agaciro kuri Amiens SC. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2006-2007, yagereye cyane kwinjira muri Ligue 1. Amasezerano yagiranye na ikipe ya Picard arangira shampiyona irangiye muri 2007-2008, yasinyiye kubusa muri Mutarama 2008 amasezerano na AS Nancy-Lorraine, atangira gukurikizwa muri Nyakanga 2008. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu mabara ye mashya muri Coupe de la Ligue na Grenoble. Yatsinze kandi igitego cye cya mbere hamwe na ikipe ya thistle, ku mupira ya Julien F\u00e9ret. Nyuma yaje kureba igihe kirekire adakia kubera imvune ikomeye yatewe mu mukino wahuje Nancy na Motherwell mu gikombe cya UEFA. Iyi niyo mpamvu agaragara bwa mbere cyane muri Ligue 1 m'ugihe cy'umunsi wa 30\u00a0 kurwanya Girondins de Bordeaux. Azahita asiba umukino umwe mbere yuko shampiyona yo muri 2008-2009 irangira. Yatsinze kandi igitego cye cya mbere muri Ligue 1 yatsinze Lorient.\nNyuma y'ibihe birindwi bimara i Lorraine. Ku ya 5 Nyakanga 2015 Ikipe yo mu Bubiligi ya Zulte Waregem iratangaza ko Jo\u00ebl Sami yahagaze imyaka ibiri hiyongereyeho umwaka umwe atabishaka.\nhari umwaka yamaze akina muri jupiler Muri Pro League. \nNubwo yavukiye mu Bufaransa, Sami yahisemo guhagararira igihugu cy\u2019ababyeyi be, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yabonye ihitamo rye rya mbere Ku ya 5 Gashyantare 2008 n'Ubufaransa A 'mu mukino wa gicuti (0-0)."}
{"id": "16415", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16415", "title": "Sami Joel", "text": "Andr\u00e9 Jo\u00ebl Sami (Yavutse Ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 1984 i Montfermeil) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wumufaransa na congo. Kuri ubu arimo gukina nka myugariro wo hagati muri Ratchaburi FC.\nUbuzima.\nIngano ye ikomeye cyane ya muteye guhabwa agaciro kuri Amiens SC. Muri shampiyona yo muri 2006-2007, yagereye cyane kwinjira muri Ligue 1. Amasezerano yagiranye na ikipe ya Picard arangira shampiyona irangiye muri 2007-2008, yasinyiye kubusa muri Mutarama 2008 amasezerano na AS Nancy-Lorraine, atangira gukurikizwa muri Nyakanga 2008. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu mabara ye mashya muri Coupe de la Ligue na Grenoble. Yatsinze kandi igitego cye cya mbere hamwe na ikipe ya thistle, ku mupira ya Julien F\u00e9ret. Nyuma yaje kureba igihe kirekire adakia kubera imvune ikomeye yatewe mu mukino wahuje Nancy na Motherwell mu gikombe cya UEFA. Iyi niyo mpamvu agaragara bwa mbere cyane muri Ligue 1 m'ugihe cy'umunsi wa 30\u00a0 kurwanya Girondins de Bordeaux. Azahita asiba umukino umwe mbere yuko shampiyona yo muri 2008-2009 irangira. Yatsinze kandi igitego cye cya mbere muri Ligue 1 yatsinze Lorient.\nNyuma y'ibihe birindwi bimara i Lorraine. Ku ya 5 Nyakanga 2015 Ikipe yo mu Bubiligi ya Zulte Waregem iratangaza ko Jo\u00ebl Sami yahagaze imyaka ibiri hiyongereyeho umwaka umwe atabishaka.\nhari umwaka yamaze akina muri jupiler Muri Pro League. \nNubwo yavukiye mu Bufaransa, Sami yahisemo guhagararira igihugu cy\u2019ababyeyi be, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yabonye ihitamo rye rya mbere Ku ya 5 Gashyantare 2008 n'Ubufaransa A 'mu mukino wa gicuti (0-0)."}
