{"id": "16428", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16428", "title": "Didier Simba Ekanza", "text": "Didier Simba-Ekanza, (yavutse Ku ya 9 Kanama 1969), ni umukinnyi umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, wakinnye nka rutahizamu. Usibye ibihe bibiri muri Isiraheli, kuri Maccabi Petach-Tikva, ubuzima bwe bwose yabukoresheje mu Bubiligi. Yafashwe inshuro 35 mu ikipe y'igihugu kugeza 1999. Didier Simba-Ekanza yarangije umwuga we muri 2004."}
{"id": "16433", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16433", "title": "Ebunga Simbi", "text": "Ebunga Simbi (yavutse Ku ya 6 Kanama 1983) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri (DRC).\nAkina nka myugariro muri AS Vita Club, ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Kino-Congo ikorera mu mujyi wa Kinshasa.\nUbuzima.\nMuri 2014, yabaye uwa kabiri muri shampiyona muri caf champions league, nyuma y'umukino w'anyuma batsinzwe ES S\u00e9tif yo muri Alijeriya, mugihe yari kapiteni wikipe ye, binjiye muri 2010.\nMuri 2020, nyuma y'urugendo rurerure mu mahanga, yagarutse muri AS Vita Club aba kapiteni wacyo."}
{"id": "16436", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16436", "title": "Ibrahim Som\u00e9", "text": "Ibrahim Lamine Mokabi Som\u00e9-Salombo uzwi cyane nka Ibrahim Som\u00e9 (Yavutse Ku ya 24 Gicurasi 1988 i Kinshasa) ni umupira ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Kuri ubu arimo gukina muri club Sint-Truiden VV ku ntizanyo yatanzwe na RWDM Bruxelles FC. Uyu rutahizamu ushishikaye kandi ufite impano imbere yizamu ni kimwe mu byiringiro bikomeye bya congo by'igihe cyizaza. Kugeza ubu yatoranijwe mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kandi afite imipira itatu. Afite uburebure bwa metero 1.82. Asigaye ari akinisha i moso."}
{"id": "16437", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16437", "title": "Abel Tamata", "text": "Abel Tezzy Tamata (Yavutse Ku ya 5 Ukuboza 1990 i Berg-op-Zoom mu Ubuholandi)Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo. Akina nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nTamata yavukiye i Bergen op Zoom kwa se ukomoka muri congo na nyina w\u2019Ubuholandi. Se akora akazi ko gukora tagisi, afite mushiki we basangiye nyina na barumuna be babiri. Mushiki we basangiye nyina yashakanye n'umuraperi Ali B wabaye umukozi we.\nTamata y'amaze imyaka ine mu ishuri rya Rijks muri Bergen op Zoom maze muri 2009 yigai shuri ribanza muri kaminuza muri Saint Gorge College muri Eindhoven. Yabanye na nyirarume na nyirasenge muri Eindhoven aho yinjiye mu kipe y'urubyiruko yo muri PSV.\nMu guhitamo.\nYatangiye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ku ya 28 Werurwe 2015 i Dubai mu mukino wa gicuti na Iraki, yagaragaye nk'umukinnyi w\u2019ibumoso kandi akina amukino wose, ariko ikipe ye itsindwa igitego kimwe. (1-0)."}
{"id": "16440", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16440", "title": "Patiyo Tambwe", "text": "Patiyo Tambwe, (yavutse Ku ya 2 Mutarama 1986 i Beni muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) mu birometero bike uvuye mu mujyi wa Goma, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri congo ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nPatiyo Tambwe yari afite amahitamo 4 hamwe nitsinda rya DR Congo hagati yo muri 2004 na 2008."}
{"id": "16441", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16441", "title": "Dikete Tampungu", "text": "Dikete Tampungu (Yavutse Ku ya 16 Mata 1980) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa congo.\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16443", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16443", "title": "Marcel Tisserand", "text": "Marcel Tisserand, (Yavutse Ku ya 10 Mutarama 1993 i Meaux, mu Bufaransa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomaka muri congo, ukina nka myugariro wo hagati muri Ettifaq FC.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nMuri 2006, yinjiye muri INF Clairefontaine, ahamara imyaka itatu yo gutangira imyitozo.\nYatorejwe muri AS Monaco aho yatwaye igikombe cya Gambardella muri 2011, yasinye amasezerano ye ya mbere ya bigize umwuga muri Kamena 2013. Nyuma yo kwitabira shampiyona hamwe nitsinda rya Claudio Ranieri, yatangiye umwuga we wa mbere tKu ya 10 Kanama kwinjira mu bihe bya nyuma by'intsinzi i Bordeaux."}
{"id": "16445", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16445", "title": "Paulin Tokala Kombe", "text": "Paulin Tokala Kombe (yavutse Ku ya 26 Werurwe 1977 i Kinshasa, icyo gihe hari muri Zayire, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoaka muri Kongo (DRC), ukina nk'umuzamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire ubu ni DRC, yakinnye hagati yo muri 1996 na 2004. yari mu ikipe yakinnye imikino nya furika muri 1988, no muri 2002 ndetse no muri 2004.\nYakinnye kandi imikino itatu ibara, n'imikino ibanza y'igikombe cy'isi."}
{"id": "16448", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16448", "title": "Jerry Tondelua", "text": "Jerry Tondelua Mbuilua, yavutse27 f\u00e9vrierKu ya 27 Gashyantare 1975, ni umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru wa congo (DRC).\nUbuzima.\nTondelua yitabiriye igikombe cy'Afurika mu 1998 hamwe n'ikipe ya DR Congo, aho yaje ku mwanya wa gatatu atsinda ibitego bine."}
{"id": "16449", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16449", "title": "Isaac Tshibangu", "text": "Isaac Tshikuna Tshibangu, (yavutse Ku ya 17 Gicurasi 2003 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC). Akina nka rutahizamu muri RSC Anderlecht. Yatorejwe mu ikipe yo muri FC Lokolo Moto, nyuma atizwa muri AS Dragons Bilima, amezi make hanyuma yi murirwa by'imazeyo muri kamena 2019 muri TP Mazembe.\nUbuzima.\nYakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo Ku ya 18 Nzeri 2019, mu mukino wa gicuti n'u Rwanda (batsindwa 2-3)."}
{"id": "16451", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16451", "title": "Aaron Tshibola", "text": "Aaron Tshibola(wavutse taliki ya 2 Mutarama 1995) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru wabigize umwuga ukina hagati mu kibuga nk\u2019umukinnyi wo hagati. Akinira ikipe ya Kilmarnock. Yavukiye mu Bwongereza ariko ahagararira ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nYavukiye i London, yanyuze mu ishuri ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya Reading mbere yo kwerekeza muri mu 2016. Yatijwe mu makipe arimo Hartlepool United, Nottingham Forest na Milton Keynes Dons, ndetse no muri Kilmarnock yo muri Ecosse. Yanakiniye mu Bubiligi muri Waasland Beveren no muri Portugal muri Aves.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nTshibola yavukiye mu Karere ka London Borough of Newham mu Bwongereza.\nUmwuga we muma kipe.\nTshibola yinjiye mu ishuri rya Reading afite imyaka 13 asinya amasezerano ya mbere nk\u2019umukinnyi wabigize umwuga muri Werurwe 2011.\nAston Villa.\nTaliki ya 10 Nyakanga 2016, yimukiye muri Aston Villa ku masezerano y\u2019imyaka ine(4).\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nTshibola yakiniye mu 2013.\nNyuma yemerewe guhagararira DR Congo kubera inkomoko ye.\nIbihembo.\nReading U21\nGen\u00e7lerbirli\u011fi"}
{"id": "16452", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16452", "title": "John Tshibumbu", "text": "John Lungeny Tshibumbu, (Yavutse Ku ya 6 Mutarama 1989 i Kinshasa muri Zayire) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukina ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nJohn Tshibumbu yatorejwe muri AS Cannes aho yakinnye n'ikipe ya mbere hagati yo muri 2007 na 2010 muri Shampiyona y'igihugu.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, yasi nye na Royal Charleroi Sporting Club, ni ukipe ikina muri shampiyona yi cyiciro cya mbere mu Bubiligi. Yakinnye imikino 4 hariya hamwe n'itsinda rya mbere maze agurizwa mu cyiciro cya kabiri AFC Tubize muri Mutarama 2011. Yakinnye neza buri gihe, yongeye ku gutizwa muri ikipe, imwe mugihe cy'inyongera muri 2011-2012. Yagize ibihe byuzuye afite ibitego 8 mumikino 29 ya shampiyona.\nIcyakora, yasanze adafite ikipe mu gihembwe, cyane nubwo yageragejwe muri FC Rouen muri Nyakanga 2012.\nMuri Nyakanga 2013, yasinye muri Gaz\u00e9lec Ajaccio. Yitabira ibihe byiza byi kipe yazamuwe kuva muri gihugu akagera muri Ligue 2. Ku ya 15 Gicurasi 2015, yatsinze ibitego bibiri kuri Niort maze atanga ku bazamuka neza muri Ligue 1, kuri Gaz\u00e9lec yatsinze ibitego 3 kuri 2 kuri stade Ange-Casanova."}
{"id": "16454", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16454", "title": "Elias Tshimanga", "text": "Elias Tshimanga yari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC) mu mwaka o muri 1960, watsindiye CAN muri 1968.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga we nturamenyekana, ariko tuzi ko yakinnye umukino wo gutoranya mu Kuboza muri 1967, na Romaniya, kandi ko yari ku rutonde rwabakinnyi 22 batoranijwe na Congo-Kinshasa muri CAN muri 1968, nku mukinnyi wa Amerika Kipushi, cyangwa FC Kipushi.\nMu gihe yari muri CAN, yakinnye imikino wose atangira, atsinda igitego kuri penariti yakinnye na Senegali, kugirango atsinde ibitego bibiri kuri kimwe. Niwe kandi watsinze igitego mu izamu yatsinze ku mukino wa nyuma na Gana. Congo yatsinze irushanwa, niyo nyandiko yonyine ya Tshimanga uzi kugeza ubu.\nIntego mpuzamahanga.\n\"Byamenyekanye: ibitego byatsinzwe mumikino ya gicuti ntabwo biri mururu rutonde\""}
{"id": "16458", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16458", "title": "Kamunda Tshinabu", "text": "Martin Kamunda Tshinabu (yavutse Ku ya 8 Gicurasi 1946 noneho muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nkumukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 7 (nta gitego yatsinze) hagati yo muri 1970 na 1974.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cy'isi cyo muri 1974. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage, yakinnye umukino na Burezile.\nYitabiriye kandi igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 1972 na 1974. Yatsinze amarushanwa muri 1974."}
{"id": "16460", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16460", "title": "Mukandi Tsimaya", "text": "Mukandi Tsimaya (Yavukiye muri 1967 abapfuye Ku ya 30 Mata 1995) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, mu mukino na Panelefsiniakosi.\nUrupfu.\nMukandi Tsimaya yapfuye afite imyaka 28 muri mukino wahuje ikipe ye Atoromitosi na Panelefsiniakosi ku ya 30 Mata 1995. Yakebanye ijosi, amaze kugwa, apfa mu nzira yerekeza ku bitaro."}
{"id": "16462", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16462", "title": "Tshiolola Tshinyama", "text": "Tiko Tshinyama Tshiolola (Yavutse Ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1980 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w' amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC).\nYitabiriye igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2006 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16465", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16465", "title": "Albert Tubilandu Dimbi", "text": "Dimbi Tubilandu (yavutse ku ya 15 Werurwe 1948 muri Kongo Mbiligi, ubu muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo arapfa Ku ya 17 Kamena 2021 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi wari mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo (DRC), wakinnye nkumuzamu.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wo guhitamo.\nHamwe n'ikipe ya Zayire, yakinnye imikino 2 muri 1974.\nYari mu ikipe mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1974. Mu gikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu Budage, yakinnye na Yugosilaviya ubwo yasimbuzaga umunyezamu watangiye nyuma y'iminota 21 kandi amanota yari amaze kuba 3-0 ku ikipe ya Balkan. Gutsindira igitego kuva yatabaye bwa mbere, ntashobora kwirinda kurohama rwose (\"9-0\").\nYitabiriye kandi igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 1974 cya tsinzwe n'ikipe ye."}
{"id": "16466", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16466", "title": "Ricky Tulenge", "text": "Ricky Tulenge Sindani ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa congo ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nMuri shampiyona yo muri 2014-2015, yatsinze ibitego 17 mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Kongo hamwe n'ikipe ya Arc-en-Ciel Kinshasa.\nNyuma, hamwe n'ikipe DCMP Imana, yatsinze ibitego birenga 30 muri cyiciro cya mbere cya Kongo, mu bihe bine.\nMuri Kamena 2019, yasinyishije ibihe bitatu muri ikipe ya Maroke ya Difa\u00e2 El Jadida. Ariko nyuma gato, agarutse avuye kwimenyereza umwuga muri Turukiya, umukinnyi abura muri radari. Yifuza rwose kutazongera gukina n'ikipe ya Maroke, yifuzaga kwinjira muri AS Vita Club.\nHanyuma, nyuma y'imishyikirano myinshi, yiyemeje kugaraga muri AS Vita Club. Ku ya 2 Gashyantare 2020, ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu. Amafaranga yo kwimurwa agera ku 100.000 by'amadolari. Yambara numero 11 mu ikipe ye mashya.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe ya DR Congo Ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 2015, mu mukino wa gicuti na Zambiya.\nNyuma yitabiriye Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika muri 2016 yabereye mu Rwanda. Muri iri rushanwa, akina imikino itanu. DR Congo yatsinze irushanwa itsinze Mali ku mukino wa nyuma 3-0."}
{"id": "16468", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16468", "title": "Jeff Tutuana", "text": "Gemi Tutuana, uzwi ku izina rya Jeff Tutuana, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wa congo ukina nka nkuwo kuruhande, cyangwa rutahizamu. Umwuga we wose yawumaze muri Isiraheli na Kupuro. Hagati yo muri 2002 na 2004, yakinnye imikino itatu mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nUmwuga.\nTutuana yatangira gukina umupira w'amaguru mu ikipe yitwa Japatra muri Kongo. Yakiniyeyo kuva muri 1997 kugeza 1999, nyuma ava muri AS Vita Club, aho yakinnye kuva muri 2000 kugeza 2002.\nNyuma yibyo, yagerageje amahirwe mu Bubiligi hamwe n'inshuti ye yo muri Vita Club yitwa Nsumbu Mazuwa, ariko bombi ntibagumye nyuma yikizamini cy'amakipe. kandi basinyiye ikipe ya Isiraheli Hapoel Haifa muri 2003. Bakina hamwe babyina iyi ikipe kuva muri 2003 kugeza 2005; muri kiriya gihe, batsinze Icyiciro cya kabiri kandi bafasha ikipe kugera muri Premier League ya Isiraheli. Ariko, nyuma y'igihembwe kimwe, ikipe isubira mu cyiciro cya kabiri nyuma yo kurangiza kumwanya wanyuma.\nNyuma, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Beitar Yerusalemu, yamushakaga kuva mu mpera za shampiyona ishize. Yatsinze ibitego 4\u00a0 mu mikino 19\u00a0. Yagize imvune ikomeye mu mugongo arekurwa nyuma yi gihembwe kimwe, asimburwa na rutahizamu wa Espanye, David Aganzo.\nArimo gusubira mu miterere mu Bufaransa, imyitozo hamwe n'ikipe ya AS Saint-\u00c9tienne. Ni gihe cyo kuganira ni kipe yu bufaransa ya AS Cannes, umutoza we Luis Fernandez yari umutoza we wa Beitar. Nyuma asubira muri Isiraheli aho yasinye na FC Ashdod. Akinira nanone Maccabi Netanya.\nTutuana yahise yi mukira muri Chypre muri 2006 akinira Enose Neon Paralimni mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Sipiriyate mu bihe bibiri. Muri 2009, yinjiye muri Ayia Napa FC mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Sipiriyate, hanyuma Olympiakos Nikosiya.\nTutuana akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, akina imikino itatu hagati yo muri 2002 na 2004."}
{"id": "16470", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16470", "title": "Bobo Ungenda", "text": "Bob\u00f3 Ungenda, (yavutse Ku ya 19 Ugushyingo 1989 i Kasa-Vubu,) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nka myugariro wo hagati hamwe na ikipe ya Angola 1 \u00b0 de Agosto.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nHamwe na ikipe yo muri Angola ya 1 \u00b0 de Agosto, yitabiriye inshuro nyinshi muri Afrika Champions League. Yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza aya marushanwa muri 2018.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakiriye bwa mbere mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ku ya 2 Kamena 2012, kurwanya Kameruni. Uyu mukino batsinzwe 1-0 ni umwe mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 2014.\nMuri Mutarama 2014, yitabira Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika yateguwe muri Afurika yepfo. Muri iri rushanwa, akina imikino igera kuri ine. DR Congo yatsinzwe muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza na Gana.\nNyuma, muri Kamena 2016, yitabira Igikombe cya COSAFA. Muri iri rushanwa, akina imikino itatu. DR Congo ye gukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa."}
{"id": "16475", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16475", "title": "Nzuzi Toko", "text": "Nzuzi Bundebele Toko, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Nzuzi Toko, (Yavutse Ku ya 20 Ukuboza 1990 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo.\nKuri ubu akina na W\u00fcrzburger Kickers, muri Shampiyona yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri mu Budage.\nUbuzima.\nUyu mukinnyi nimwe mu byiringiro bikomeye bya congo by'igihe cye cyizaza. Kuri ubu yatoranijwe mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo kandi yahamagawe inshuro imwe gusa.\nNi umukinnyi wo hagati."}
{"id": "16478", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16478", "title": "Yoane Wissa", "text": "Yoane Wissa, (yavutse Ku ya 3 Nzeri 1996 muri Villeneuve-Saint-Georges muri Val-de-Marne), ni umukinnyi uri mpuzamahanga ukin umupira w'amaguru ukina nku mukinnyi w\u2019ibumoso cyangwa hagati mu kibuga muri Brentford FC.\nYoane Wissa ni umuvandimwe wukina muri Olympique Lyonnais hagati akaba ari Eli Wissa. Afite kandi ubwenegihugu bw'Ubufaransa.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nChateauroux (2012-2016).\nMuri kamena 2012 ubwo yakinaga na munis yabarengeje imwaka 17 muri FC \u00c9pinay Athl\u00e9tico mu karere ka Paris, Yoane Wissa yagenzurwaga na bashakisha bo muri La Berrichonne de Ch\u00e2teauroux m'ugihe cy anyuma cyi gikombe cya Essonne yatsinzwe na Fleury kuri penariti. (1-1 | 3-1 tab). Amanota, yemeza kandi ko amaherezo ahuza ikigo cya mahugurwa cya Ch\u00e2teauroux muri Kanama nyuma yi geragezwa ryuzuye. Yahise azamurwa mu ntera na munsi yabafite imyaka 19 maze yinjira mu itsinda rya bo icyo gihe mu gihugu muri shampiyona ya 2015-2016. Mu masezerano y'abatoza muri gihe ye ya mbere hamwe n'itsinda rya babigize umwuga, yakinnye imikino 26 atsinda ibitego umunani, bihagije kugirango ashimishe amakipe yo murwego rwo hejuru."}
{"id": "16480", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16480", "title": "Jean Jacques Yemweni", "text": "Jean-Jacques Yemweni Ngidi, (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Mata 1976) ni umupira ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYemweni yishimiye igihe gito yamaze muri FC Sion muri Super League yo mu Busuwisi, mbere yo gusubira muri DR Congo kuri TP Mazembe.\nYatsinze cyane mu ikipe ya DC Motema Pembe, ibikombe bitatu bya shampiyona yo muri DR Congo.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nJean-Jacques Yemweni yaknnye imipira igerakuri 13 mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo hagati yo muri 2000 na 2007, atsinda ibitego umunani.\nYakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe yigihugu ku ya 27 Mutarama 2000, na Afurika yepfo. Uyu mukino watsinzwe 1-0, uri mu cyiciro cya nyuma cy\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu, wateguwe na Gana na Nijeriya.\nYatsinze igitego cya mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ku ya 7 Mata 2000, yatsinze ikipe ya Djibouti. Kunganya (1-1) biri mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 2002. Nyuma yaho, ku ya 23 Mata uwo mwaka, yamamaye cyane atsinda igitego cy'atsinzwe n'ikipe imwe atsinda 9-1.\nYatsinze igitego muri uwo mwaka yakinnye na Repubulika ya Centrafrique, bakina na Congo, hanyuma yongera gutsinda Repubulika ya Centrafrique."}
{"id": "16481", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16481", "title": "Ngidi Jacques Yemweni", "text": "Jean-Jacques Yemweni Ngidi, (Yavutse Ku ya 4 Mata 1976) ni umupira ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYemweni yishimiye igihe gito yamaze muri FC Sion muri Super League yo mu Busuwisi, mbere yo gusubira muri DR Congo kuri TP Mazembe.\nYatsinze cyane mu ikipe ya DC Motema Pembe, ibikombe bitatu bya shampiyona yo muri DR Congo.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nJean-Jacques Yemweni yaknnye imipira igerakuri 13 mu ikipe ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo hagati yo muri 2000 na 2007, atsinda ibitego umunani.\nYakinnye umukino we wa mbere mu ikipe yigihugu ku ya 27 Mutarama 2000, na Afurika yepfo. Uyu mukino watsinzwe 1-0, uri mu cyiciro cya nyuma cy\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu, wateguwe na Gana na Nijeriya.\nYatsinze igitego cya mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ku ya 7 Mata 2000, yatsinze ikipe ya Djibouti. Kunganya (1-1) biri mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cyisi muri 2002. Nyuma yaho, ku ya 23 Mata uwo mwaka, yamamaye cyane atsinda igitego cy'atsinzwe n'ikipe imwe atsinda 9-1.\nYatsinze igitego muri uwo mwaka yakinnye na Repubulika ya Centrafrique, bakina na Congo, hanyuma yongera gutsinda Repubulika ya Centrafrique."}
{"id": "16482", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16482", "title": "Yannick Yenga", "text": "Risasi Yannick Yenga, (Yavutse Ku ya 10 Mata 1985 i Kinshasa,ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga wo muri congo (DRC) ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYannick Yenga yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru muri Meaux ari i Seine-et-Marne muri CS Meaux, hanyuma asigara akina muri Tours FC, ahamara umwaka n'igice wose.\nNyuma yinjiye muri Le Mans, icyo gihe yari muri Ligue 1, ariko yakinnye bike mu ikipe yambere kandi anyurwa n'ikipe yabigenewe muri CFA. Kugirango abone umwanya wo gukina yasinyiye muri Ch\u00e2tellerault muri gihugu aho yagize ibihe byiza, nyuma yinjira muri Ligue 2 i Dijon imyaka ibiri.\nMuri 2008, yimukiye i Paris FC muri gihugu kandi agira ibihe byiza cyane bituma ahurwa n'amakipe amwe ya Ligue 2."}
{"id": "16483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16483", "title": "Risasi Yenga Yannick", "text": "Risasi Yannick Yenga, (Yavutse Ku ya 10 Mata 1985 i Kinshasa,ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru uri mpuzamahanga wo muri congo (DRC) ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nMuri ikipe.\nYannick Yenga yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru muri Meaux ari i Seine-et-Marne muri CS Meaux, hanyuma asigara akina muri Tours FC, ahamara umwaka n'igice wose.\nNyuma yinjiye muri Le Mans, icyo gihe yari muri Ligue 1, ariko yakinnye bike mu ikipe yambere kandi anyurwa n'ikipe yabigenewe muri CFA. Kugirango abone umwanya wo gukina yasinyiye muri Ch\u00e2tellerault muri gihugu aho yagize ibihe byiza, nyuma yinjira muri Ligue 2 i Dijon imyaka ibiri.\nMuri 2008, yimukiye i Paris FC muri gihugu kandi agira ibihe byiza cyane bituma ahurwa n'amakipe amwe ya Ligue 2."}
{"id": "16484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16484", "title": "Gabriel Zakuani", "text": "Gabriel Abdala Zakuani, (Yavutse Ku ya 31 Gicurasi 1986 i Kinshasa) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo. Akina nka myugariro i Gillingham. Murumuna we, Steve Zakuani, nawe ni umupira wamaguru.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nLeyton Iburasirazuba.\nYavukiye i Kinshasa, Gabriel n'umuryango we bimukiye mu Bwongereza afite imyaka icyenda. aho, baza gutura mu nkengero z'umujyi wa London. Yamenyekanye mu kipe ya Leyton Orient Football Club nyuma y'ibihe bibiri akiri muto, yatangiye bwa mbere afite imyaka 16 gusa muri shampiyona yakinnye na Bury muri Gicurasi 2003. Mu bihe byo muri 2004-2005 na 2005-2006, yabaye intangiriro idasanzwe.\nFulham.\nNyuma y'ibihe byiza, Gabriel yasinyiye muri Fulham muri kamena 2006. Mu myaka itatu, ntabwo yigeze akoreshwa muri shampiyona nyuma y'imvune yo mu ivi kandi akina imikino y'igikombe gusa. Ari mu ntizanyo muri Stoke City kugirango abone uburambe."}
{"id": "16486", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16486", "title": "Steve Zakuani", "text": "Steve Zakuani, (Yavutse Ku ya 9 Gashyantare 1988 i Kinshasa, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo) ni umukinnyi ukina Umupira w'amaguru mu bongereza ukomoka mu banyekongo. Yatoranijwe bwa mbere n\u2019igihugu cye mu mukino wa gicuti na Mali muri Gushyingo 2010. Murumuna we, na Gabriel nawe ni umunyamahanga wa congo.\nUbuzima.\nAmashuri ya Arsenal yuzuye, yashakishijwe mu shuri rya AZ Alkmaar, ariko ibizamini byagaragaye ko bidashoboka. Amaherezo yaje kujya muri Amerika, aho yakinnyemuri kaminuza ya Akron Zips ndetse na Cleveland International International muri PDL mu mpeshyi ya 2008.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAkunda kureba udukino dusetsa two muri Afurika, ibirori, kumarana umwanya na bagenzi be no gusubira i Londres abona ko ari umujyi yavukiyemo. Akunda cyane igihugu cye, akora ingendo buri gihe i Kinshasa, umujyi yavukiyemo. Yashizeho kandi ishyirahamwe rifasha abana ba mugaye ryitwa Kingdom Hope."}
{"id": "16488", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16488", "title": "Arsene Zola", "text": "Ars\u00e8ne Zola, (wavutse ku ya 23 Gashyantare 1996 i Lubumbashi) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga muri congo ukina nka myugariro wo hagati hamwe na Wydad AC.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYaturutse mu kigo cy\u2019imyitozo cya Katumbi Football Academy, yatangiye umwuga we muri Congo D1 hamwe na TP Mazembe. Muri 2017, yatsinze igikombe cya Confederation Cup yitabiriye imikino itatu yo ku mugabane wa Afurika. Muri 2018, yabaye umukinnyi mu basoje muri CAF Super Cup. Muri 2019 na 2021, yatsindiye igikombe cya shampiyona ya congo.\nKu ya 14 Mutarama 2022, yiyandikishije mu bihe bitatu muri Chabab Mohamm\u00e9dia. Ku ya 12 Gashyantare 2022, yakinnye umukino we wa mbere muri shampiyona ya Maroke na IR Tangier (intsinzi ya 3-0). Ku ya 18 Mata 2022, yakiriye umukino we wa mbere muri Youssoufia Berrechid (intsinzi, 2-0).\nUmwuga w'ikipe y'igihugu.\nKu ya 29 Werurwe 2021, yakiriye bwa mbere mu majonjora ya CAN muri 2021 na Gambiya (intsinzi, 1-0)."}
{"id": "16490", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16490", "title": "Distel Zola", "text": "Distel Zola, (yavutse Ku ya 5 Gashyantare 1989 i Paris) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati urinda.\nUbuzima.\nImiterere n'intangiriro.\nAkomoka mu mujyi wa Champigny-sur-Marne (Quartier des Boullereaux), yakiniye ikipe y'abato muri Amerika Alfortville, mbere yuko agaragara muri 2002 mu ikipe ya AS Monaco mu marushanwa. Yaje gusinyana amasezerano n'ikipe ya Monegasque.\nMu ntangiriro o muri 2008, yasinye amasezerano n\u2019indobanure n\u2019ikipe ye yitoreza. Yagaragaye bwa mbere mu itsinda rya babigize umwuga, muri Ligue 1, ahanganye na Saint-\u00c9tienne ku ya 17 Gicurasi 2008.\nUmwuga w'abakinnyi.\nYarangije umwuga we wo gukina muri Amerika muri Shampiyona ya USL.\nAmasomo mpuzamahanga.\nAmaze kujya mu makipe y'urubyiruko yo muri Bufaransa aho yambaraga akaboko ka kapiteni, yahisemo gukinira DR Congo muri 2010 no kwambara umwenda \"w'ingwe\". Ntabwo yatoranijwe muri CAN muri 2015 na Florent Ibenge.\nKumenyereza.\nMu 2021 yashizeho umusingi w'abana bugarijwe n'ibibazo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16491", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16491", "title": "Zola Tistel", "text": "Distel Zola, (yavutse Ku ya 5 Gashyantare 1989 i Paris) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati urinda.\nUbuzima.\nImiterere n'intangiriro.\nAkomoka mu mujyi wa Champigny-sur-Marne (Quartier des Boullereaux), yakiniye ikipe y'abato muri Amerika Alfortville, mbere yuko agaragara muri 2002 mu ikipe ya AS Monaco mu marushanwa. Yaje gusinyana amasezerano n'ikipe ya Monegasque.\nMu ntangiriro o muri 2008, yasinye amasezerano n\u2019indobanure n\u2019ikipe ye yitoreza. Yagaragaye bwa mbere mu itsinda rya babigize umwuga, muri Ligue 1, ahanganye na Saint-\u00c9tienne ku ya 17 Gicurasi 2008.\nUmwuga w'abakinnyi.\nYarangije umwuga we wo gukina muri Amerika muri Shampiyona ya USL.\nAmasomo mpuzamahanga.\nAmaze kujya mu makipe y'urubyiruko yo muri Bufaransa aho yambaraga akaboko ka kapiteni, yahisemo gukinira DR Congo muri 2010 no kwambara umwenda \"w'ingwe\". Ntabwo yatoranijwe muri CAN muri 2015 na Florent Ibenge.\nKumenyereza.\nMu 2021 yashizeho umusingi w'abana bugarijwe n'ibibazo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "16492", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16492", "title": "Thievy Bifouma", "text": "Thievy Guivane Bifouma Koulossa Gouombas, (yavutse Ku ya 13 Gicurasi 1992 muri Saint-Denis)ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri congo, ukina nka rutahizamu muri OFI Crete.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAmahugurwa muri RC Strasbourg no kugenda muri Espanye.\nAfite Inkomoko y'Abanyekongo, Thievy yatangiriye muri CS Meaux mbere yo kwinjira mu kigo cy'amahugurwa cyo muri RC Strasbourg muri 2006. Muri 2009, yatangiriye mu basimbura muri CFA, akina imikino icyenda atsinda igitego kimwe. Nyuma yuko iyi kipe imanuka muri Gihugu, Thievy yimukiye mu ikipe ya Iberian Espanyol de Barcelona hari 2010. RC Strasbourg na CS Meaux bahise bajuririra FIFA kugira ngo bamagane uburyo bwo kugenda, butagombaga kwishyurwa indishyi z'indezi (ibihumbi 90\u00a0000\u00a0 ku mwaka bya mayero). Uyu mukinnyi amaze gusinyira uruhushya rwo gukinira muri esipanye, ikipe yaba Katolika amaherezo yaje gusonewe kwishyura izo indishyi.\nMu gihe cyo muri 28\u00a0umunsi wa shampiona ya Esipanye muri 2010-2011, yatangiye gukina umwuga we na Deportivo La Coruna yinjira mu mikino habura iminota ibiri. Yagaragaye ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Katolika, atsinda ibitego bitatu na FC Barcelona B."}
{"id": "16497", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16497", "title": "Bruce Abdoulaye", "text": "Bruce Abdoulaye (yavutse Ku ya 15 Mata 1982 muri Ch\u00e2teau-Thierry) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga wo muri congo ukina nk'umuzamu wahindutse umutoza.\nUbuzima.\nBruce Abdoulaye yatangira umupira w'amaguru muri ikipe y'umujyi akuriramo: La Fert\u00e9 Gaucher. Munsi yabafite imyaka 15, ni bwo yinjiye muri US Torcy mbere yuko yinjira muri US Vaires-sur-Marne aho yabonye na Grenoble Foot. Yahamaze shampiyona ebyiri, akina imikino ye ya mbere y'abigize umwuga muri Ligue 2 mbere yo gusinya muri 2004 na FC Lausanne. Hasigaye igihe kimwe gusa kandi Kamena 2005, US S\u00e9nart-Moissy ikina mu cyiciro cya kane.\nNyuma y'amezi atandatu, yiyandikishije muri Clermont Foot asubira muri Ligue 2. Yahise afata umwanya wo gutangirira mu ikipe ariko ikipe irangiza ku 18\u00a0ikibanza kandi gisubizwa mu gice cya gatatu. Ntabwo yagize impaka, yagize uruhare mukuzamuka kw'ikipe mu gihembwe cyakurikiyeho arangiza ari shampiyona w'igihugu.\nIbingwi.\nYabaye shampiyo w'igihugu muri 2007 hamwe na Clermont Foot."}
{"id": "16499", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16499", "title": "Richard Akiana", "text": "Richard Akiana, (Yavutse Ku ya 20 Nzeri 1969 i Brazzaville) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo wahindutse ugurisha abakinnyi.\nYakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nAkiana yatangiye umwuga we muri US Cr\u00e9teil aho yagiye agaragara gake muri shampiyona yo muri 1990\u201391. Nyuma y'igihe gito muri D2, yakinnye mu mikino myinshi yikinira nku tarabigize umwuga. Ubwa mbere muri Olempike ya Saint-Dizier, hanyuma kuri Racing 92, muri CFA, aho yatsinze ibitego ma kumyabiri mu mikino mirongo itatu n'itatu.\nBimaze kumenyekana, yiyandikishije na Paris FC, akina muri National 1, ariko ananirwa kwihagararaho, asubira muri Racing Club de France aho yatsinze ibitego mirongo itatu n'umunani muri shampiyona ebyiri. Akiana yongeye kugerageza amahirwe mu cyiciro cya gatatu, yambara umwenda wa FC Bourges mu ntangiriro zo muri shampiyona 1997-1998. Yavuye muri iyo kipe mu Kuboza 1997 y'erekeza muri Cr\u00e9teil. Nyuma y'amezi arindwi, yasinye na ES Troyes AC, mu cyiciro cya 2, ariko yatsinze ibitego cumi na bibiri gusa mu mikino makumyabiri n'itanu muri 1998-1999."}
{"id": "16501", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16501", "title": "Ishmael Ankobo", "text": "Isma\u00ebl Ankobo, (yavutse Ku ya 13 Ukwakira 1997 i Brazzaville) Ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo, ukina nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima.\nMu ikipe y'igihugu.\nYakiriye ihitamo rye rya mbere mu ikipe ya Congo, Ku ya 4 Nzeri 2016, bakina na Gineya-Bisawu. Uyu mukino batsinzwe 1-0, uri mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'afurika muri 2017."}
{"id": "16503", "revid": "11469", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16503", "title": "Lucien Aubey", "text": "Lucien Yann Sherril Aubey, (yavutse iKu ya 24 Gicurasi 1984 i Brazzaville) Ni umukinnyi ukina ari mpuzamahanga mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri congo muri 2000 na 2010. Mu gihe cye, yakinnye nka myugariro.\nUbuzima.\nLucien Aubey yatorejwe muri AS Cannes, ariko asinya amasezerano ye yambere y'umwuga muri Toulouse FC, aho yavuye muri gihugu yerekeza muri Ligue 1 aho yaje gutangira, akina imikino irenga 30 muri shampiyona.\nMuri icyo gihe, ahora ahamagarwa mu ikipe y'Ubufaransayabatarengeje imyaka 23. Yakinnye by'umwihariko Ero ibyiringiro muri 2006 muri Porutugali.\nYasinyanye na Racing Club de Lens Ku ya 5 Nyakanga 2007 kuri miliyoni 3 z'amayero, nyuma yatijwe ku ya 18 Mutarama na Portsmouth. Nyuma y'imikino 8 ya Premier League, Aubey yagarutse muri RC Lens yoherezwa kuri miliyoni 5 z'amayero mu ntangiriro za Kanama muri Stade Rennes, ahasinya imyaka itatu."}
