{"id": "16554", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16554", "title": "Nill De Pauw", "text": "Nill De Pauw, (wavutse Ku ya 6 Mutarama 1990) i Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ari mpuzamahanga muri congo ukina ku ruhande muri Royal Antwerp FC.\nUbuzima.\nkuya 17, kamena 2015, yari mu ikipe ya guingamp. \nYagarutse mu Bubiligi yizeye ko iki gihe kizagira ubuzima busanzwe, i Zulte Waregem.\nikipe y'urubyiruko mu bubirigi.\nNill De Pauw wavukiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, abyarwa na se w'Umubiligi na nyina wa Kongo, yakinnye n'amakipe y'urubyiruko mu Bubiligi.\nDe Pauw, yatoranijwe mu ikipe nkuru yigihugu cya kongo, utoranyijwe na Christian N'Sengi."}
{"id": "16555", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16555", "title": "Marie Hanitra Roilya Ranaivosoa", "text": "Marie Hanitra Roilya Ranaivosoa akunze kwitwa Roilya Ranaivosoa (yavutse ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 1990) ni umunyamoritaniya uterura ibiremereye muri Morise ukomoka muri Malagasi, uhatanira mubafite ibiro 48, yahatanye mu cyiciro anahagararira Morise mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nYitabiriye amarushanwa menshi ya Shampiyona y'isi yo guterura ibiremereye. Yitabiriye imikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2014 mu birori bya bapima ibiro 58. \nYahagarariye Morise mu mikino y'olempike yo muri 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 11 mu bagore mu bapima ibiro 49. \nYatsindiye umudari wa feza mu bagore bapima ibiro 49 mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza yabereye i Birmingham mu Bwongereza. Mu kuboza 2022, yatorewe kuba umwe mu bagize komisiyo y'abakinnyi ba IWF. "}
{"id": "16562", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16562", "title": "Mons Bassouamina", "text": "Mons Bassouamina, yavutse Ku ya 28 Gicurasi 1998) ni umukinnyi w' Umufaransa - Umukinnyi wumupira ukomoka muri congo, ukina nka rutahizamu muri Pau FC. Mons Bassouaina ni umuhungu w'uwahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Kongo Andr\u00e9 Michel.\nYavukiye mu Bufaransa, akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Kongo.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAmahugurwa.\nMons Bassouamina atangira umupira w'amaguru mu karere ka Parisi.\nAfite imyaka 15, yinjiye mu kigo cyamahugurwa cya AS Nancy. Muri 2015 na 2016, yahamagawe buri gihe mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019Ubufaransa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 18, kandi yari amaze k'untera ibitugu hamwe na Jean Ruiz.\nYasinye amasezerano ye yambere y'umwuga muri 2018. Hamwe na AS Nancy, Bassouamina yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya mbere iyobowe na Didier Tholot mu mukino wa Coupe de la Ligue na Red Star Football Club. Ubwo yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere cy'umwuga.\nFC Pau.\nMuri Kamena 2022, Bassouamina yasinye muri Ligue 2 i Pau. Mubyukuri, ibyiringiro byo kongera guhinduka ukurikije amabwiriza ya Didier Tholot yemejwe umunsi wo gusinya.\nIyi kipe irimo gutangira buhoro muri shampiyona yo muri 2022-2023, kandi igitero kiri hafi ya mast. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, Bassouamina yaje kwigaragaza nk'igitero cy'Abamaya.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBassouamina yavukiye mu Bufaransa, akomoka muri Kongo. Numukinnyi mpuzamahanga muto m'ubufaransa. Yahamagariwe guhagararira ikipe y'igihugu ya Congo mu mukino wa gicuti muri Werurwe 2022.\nYatangiye gukina muri Congo mu mukino wa gicuti batsinzwe na Zambiya ku ya 25 Werurwe 2022.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBassouamina ni umufana wu muziki wo muri congo, harimo rumba, ndombolo, coup\u00e9-d\u00e9cal\u00e9 na soukous."}
