{"id": "16567", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16567", "title": "Rogeani Bassouamina", "text": "Mons Bassouamina, yavutse Ku ya 28 Gicurasi 1998) ni umukinnyi w' Umufaransa - Umukinnyi wumupira ukomoka muri congo, ukina nka rutahizamu muri Pau FC. Mons Bassouaina ni umuhungu w'uwahoze ari umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Kongo Andr\u00e9 Michel.\nYavukiye mu Bufaransa, akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Kongo.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAmahugurwa.\nMons Bassouamina atangira umupira w'amaguru mu karere ka Parisi.\nAfite imyaka 15, yinjiye mu kigo cyamahugurwa cya AS Nancy. Muri 2015 na 2016, yahamagawe buri gihe mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019Ubufaransa y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 18, kandi yari amaze k'untera ibitugu hamwe na Jean Ruiz.\nYasinye amasezerano ye yambere y'umwuga muri 2018. Hamwe na AS Nancy, Bassouamina yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya mbere iyobowe na Didier Tholot mu mukino wa Coupe de la Ligue na Red Star Football Club. Ubwo yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere cy'umwuga.\nFC Pau.\nMuri Kamena 2022, Bassouamina yasinye muri Ligue 2 i Pau. Mubyukuri, ibyiringiro byo kongera guhinduka ukurikije amabwiriza ya Didier Tholot yemejwe umunsi wo gusinya.\nIyi kipe irimo gutangira buhoro muri shampiyona yo muri 2022-2023, kandi igitero kiri hafi ya mast. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, Bassouamina yaje kwigaragaza nk'igitero cy'Abamaya.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBassouamina yavukiye mu Bufaransa, akomoka muri Kongo. Numukinnyi mpuzamahanga muto m'ubufaransa. Yahamagariwe guhagararira ikipe y'igihugu ya Congo mu mukino wa gicuti muri Werurwe 2022.\nYatangiye gukina muri Congo mu mukino wa gicuti batsinzwe na Zambiya ku ya 25 Werurwe 2022.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBassouamina ni umufana wu muziki wo muri congo, harimo rumba, ndombolo, coup\u00e9-d\u00e9cal\u00e9 na soukous."}
