{"id": "16571", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16571", "title": "Marvin Baudry", "text": "Marvin Baudry (yavutse Ku ya 26 Mutarama 1990 muri Reim) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomka muri congo. Akina nka myugariro wo hagati kuri Stade Lavallois.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nImiterere n'intangiriro.\nMarvin Tony Baudry yavukiye i Reims kwa se w'umufaransa na nyina wa congo. Yatojwe mu mujyi yavukiyemo mu bijyanye na siporo kuva afite imyaka 14.\nMuri Kamena 2012, nyuma y'imyitozo y'igihembwe hamwe nibyiza, kugaragara muri Coupe de la Ligue hamwe ni ntebe nke muri Ligue 2, yasinye amasezerano ya mbere y'umwuga, amara ibihe bitatu, hamwe na Amiens SC. Yakinnye imikino 61 muri National, abaho ibihe bitoroshye by'iyi kipe afata umwanya wo kuba umuyobozi.\nIgice cya mbere cy'Ababiligi.\nMuri Gicurasi 2015 yashimishijwe na RC Lens ariko yinjira muri Zulte Waregem mu Bubiligi D1, muri bihe bibiri hiyongereyeho, icyifuzo. Mu rwego rwo kwirwanaho, ye gukanye igikombe cy\u2019Ububiligi ku ya 28 Werurwe 2017, nyuma yu mukino udahumeka yatsinze KV Oostende nyuma yo kurata penariti (3-3 ap, 4-2 tab). Iyi nyito ifungura imiryango yumuryango wiburayi.\nMuri Nzeri 2022, ni kapiteni watoranijwe.\nMyugariro wa Axial, yamaze kugira amahirwe yo gukina neza muri Zulte Waregem cyangwa mu guhitamo kugirango asubizwe. Isuku muri duel, Marvin Baudry adondorwa nka myugariro yumye kandi itomoye, ishyizwe neza kuruhande rw'igifuniko, ingenzi mu mikino yo mu kirere, byukuri mukuzamuka kwe, cyangwa kumwanya runaka ufata \".\nUbuzima bwite.\nNi se w'abahungu babiri."}
