{"id": "16629", "revid": "13833", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16629", "title": "Inkono", "text": "Inkono ni igikoresho gitekwamo, ibiryo byingeri zita ndukanye harimo ibitoki,isombe,ibirayi,ibishyimbo,ibijumba nibindi..., gikorwa mu ibumba. Inkono ikoreshwa cyane cyane mugikoni. Ababumba inkono bifashisha ibumba riva mubishanga bakaritunganya bakaba ariryo babumbamo inkono bakabona kuzitwika bakoresheje umuriro kugirango inkono ikomere Kandi ise neza. Inkono Kandi ifatwa nkigikoresho cya gakondo bitewe naho is igeze ubu mwiterambere"}
{"id": "16630", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16630", "title": "Inkono y'itabi", "text": "Inkono y'itabi niyo bakoreshagamo itabi ry\u2019igikamba, akenshi ryatekererwaga mu nkono y\u2019itabi mu gihe cyohambere, ryafatwaga nk\u2019ikirango cya buri cyu musaza n\u2019umukecuru, bamwe bemezako ariryo barya bakaritumaguye batagohekaga. rero Muri iki gihe umuco wo gutekera urujigo (Inkono y\u2019itabi) usa naho ugenda ukendera.\nItabi.\nBamwe mu bakecuru n\u2019abasaza baravuga ko itabi ry\u2019igikamba ryabuze mu bice byinshi byo mu Rwanda, bigatuma ibiciro byaryo bikazamuka cyane ku buryo rihenze ari amafaranga menshi ndetse rimwe rwose bakaribura. Itabi ry\u2019igikamba, ubundi akenshi ryatekwaga mu nkono y\u2019itabi, mu gihe cyashije, ryafatwaga rero nk\u2019ikirango cya buri musaza ndetse n\u2019umukecuru, aho bamwe bemezaga ko iyo baryamaga batarinyoye batagohekaga\nUbusanzwe gutumura itabi cyangwa igikamba ntacyo byongerera rwose umubiri mu bijyanye n\u2019intungamubiri, icyakora abasaza cyangwa abakecuru bageze mu zabukuru, ribafasha yane kubona ibitotsi iyo baryamye. Ikindi nanone kandi yaba umusaza cyangwa kimwe na bagenzi be ba bakecuru bemeza ko badashobora kunywa itabi rya korewe mu ruganda ryitwa irya kizungu ku mpamvu z\u2019uko baziko abarinywa bamira umwotsi maze ukabangiza, bakizera ko iryo mu nkono nta kibazo ribatera kuko batamira umwotsi.\nUmuco.\nIki gihe turimo umuco wo kugendana urujigo (cyangwa Inkono y\u2019itabi) usa naho ugenda ukendera ugabanuka, bamwe mu bakuru nabo bavuga ko biterwa n\u2019uko ahanini ubuhinzi bw\u2019itabi ry\u2019ibikamba butagihabwa agaciro mu gihugu, bituma na bake baribona rihenda kuko rikigonderwa na bantu bake. Igikamba banywa ubu kiva mu Burundi kuko mu Rwanda, iri tabi ntago rigihingwa, ibyo bigatuma iryo baguraga amafaranga 5 ubu barigura 1000, aya mafaranga yajyaga ahabwa Abanyarwanda noneho bakayihera Abarundi. "}
{"id": "16631", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16631", "title": "Urusyo", "text": "Urusyo rusobanura ibuye, rimeze nk'uruziga useraho (rwo gusya ingano), uruziga rukomeye. Mu kwagura ikintu cyizengurutse cyane ibyatsi cyangwa uruziga rwa foromaje. Iri jambo rishobora kandi kwerekeza ikirundo cy'ibiti bitwikiriwe nisi ikoreshwa mu gukora amakara.Birashoboka cyane ko urusyo ruzenguruka rwaba rwarakorewe mu bihugu bikikije inyanja ya mediterane ahagana mu kinyejana cya kabiri M.I.C\nIri jambo kandi bifite imizi imwe ninshinga gusya.\nAmagambo.\nIri jambo riva mu kilatini rikaba risobanure urusyo. Urusyo rwakoreshaga gute mu bihe bya bibiriya??\nUmuntu ubera abandi igisitaza, icyamubera kiza ni uko yahambirwa urusyo runini ku ijosi maze akarohwa mu nyanja, Amadini y'ibinyoma azazimangatana, nk'urusyo rujugunywe mu nyajwa-; Ibyahishuwe18;21\nIkirundo cy'ibyatsi cyangwa ibyatsi.\nUrusyo ni igikoresho cyo kumisha no kubika ibyatsi mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya XX.\u00a0ikinyejana, nyuma yo gutema cyangwa gusarura, byabanzaga gutunganywa n'intoki, nyuma yo kubitunganya, kandi mbere yuko iki gikorwa giteranwa hagamijwe kubihunika mu bishanga, hamwe no guteza imbere uburyobikoreshwa mu buhinzi.\nRyari rifite kandi imbogamizi zo gushobora kureka bimwe mu bice byacyo bikanyagirwa n\u2019imvura, ubundi bikagira uburozi cyangwa se gutera uburwayi inyamaswa.\nIgikoresho.\nUruziga rusya ni ibuye rishobora gukorwa mu ibuye risanzwe ryangirika (ni urusyo ruzunguruka) cyangwa rigizwe n'umukungugu mwinshi, hamwe na hamwe ukoresha resinike ya fenolike (ni inziga zo mu bwoko bwa bakelite) cyangwa ibumba (ibiziga bisya ceramike).\nInziga zo gusya zikoreshwa mu gusya no kuma mashini zisya. Inziga zisya zikoreshwa mu gukuraho uduce duto twibikoresho cyangwa gukata.\nrero, uruziga rusya rwinjije mu kigega cyuzuye amazi, ndetse kandi rwatwarwaga no kuzunguruka; byemeye, kurugero rwo gusya, ndetse no gukarisha ibyuma nibindi byuma. urusyo rugaragara hamwe na moteri yo gusya, na moteri y'amashanyarazi.\nKugeza ubu, urusyo ni inziga zikoreshwa mu nganda zitandukanye hari nk'icyuma, inganda, kubaka ibyuma, kubaka imodoka, kariyeri n'amabuye ya marimari.\nUruziga rutegurwa cyangwa rugororotse hifashishijwe igikoresho cyu zuzanya cyitwa \"umwambaro\", diyama yanditswe cyangwa ikozwe mu karibone ishobora kuvana ibikoresho mu ruziga.\nUruziga rwa mabuye rukoreshwa hanze y'umugozi, bitandukanye nu ruziga ruhindukirira insinga kugirango ityaze.\nGusya.\nAmabuye y'urusyo yari agamije kandi gusya ibinyampeke mo ifu (ibinyampeke, amahembe, igituza, karobo, imyelayo,\u00a0n'ibindi) banza ukoreshe amabuye yoroheje yafasha intoki, hanyuma akoreshwe ni nyamaswa cyangwa amababa yu muyaga cyangwa uruziga cyangwa turibine yimashini, mbere yuko haza moteri zifite insyo zigezweho.\nUruganda ruto rw'amashanyarazi ruragurishwa kugirango rubyare ifu.\nGuhinga ibihumyo bihingwa.\nAmabuye y'urusyo agereranya imirongo miremire y'ifumbire mu mazu y'ibihumyo yahingamo ibihumyo (reba ifoto)."}
{"id": "16632", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16632", "title": "Hanshin Tigers", "text": "Hanshin Tigers (\u962a\u795e\u30bf\u30a4\u30ac\u30fc\u30b9) ni ikipe Ubuyapani yabigize umwuga. Biri muri Ligue Nkuru. Ikibanza cyabereye ni Stade Hanshin Koshien mu mujyi wa Nishinomiya, Perefegitura ya Hyogo.\nIzina rigufi ni \" Hanshin \" naho izina ni \" Ingwe \". Rimwe na rimwe byitwa \" ingwe \" cyangwa \" kurwanya ingwe \". Mu makipe 12 asanzwe yabigize umwuga mu Buyapani, ifite amateka ya kabiri maremare nyuma ya Yomiuri Giants, kandi ni imwe mu makipe yatangije shampiyona yabigize umwuga mu 1936. Kugeza mu 1960, yitwaga Ingwe za Osaka usibye igihe cyintambara.\nIsosiyete ikora ni Hanshin Tigers Co., Ltd. Isosiyete y'ababyeyi ni Hanshin Electric Railway (ishami rya Hankyu Hanshin Holdings).\nShampiyona eshanu zatsinze (zashyizwe ku mwanya wa 5 mu mubare watsinze), inshuro imwe gusa mu Buyapani (ihuza amanota yo hasi mu makipe 12), kandi kuva 1987 kugeza 2001, imyaka yijimye yo kurohama kugeza hasi inshuro 10 muri saison 15."}
{"id": "16633", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16633", "title": "Isekuru", "text": "Isekuru ni kimwe mu bikoresho bikozwe mugiti byakoreshwaga ahambere n'anubu bikaba bigikoreshwa mu gusya bimwe mu bihingwa aribyo imyumbati,ubunyobwa,indagara,amasaka,nibindi...bikoreshwa mu gikoni. \nIbi bikorwa byakorwaga m'ugihe ukoresheje ibi bikoresho cyitwako cyizengurukaho.\nisekuru urebye yakuye izina ryayo muri kilatine aho yitwa mortarium, naho mu gihe pesitile yakuye izina ryayo ku nshinga y'Ikilatini yitwa pilare, bisobanura \"kanda cyane\".\nAmateka.\nAmateka ya mbere.\nImbere ya y'isekuru yambere ikora bitinze. Bifitanye isano ndetse ninzibacyuho yo kuva mubahigi kandi bahiga bajyaga mu bukungu bwu buhinzi, kandi ifite ubwoko bwinshi bwo gukoresha: harimo kumenagura ibikoresho, kumenagura ibiryo ndeste nibikoresho bya muzika (reba hepfo igice \" Ibikoresho bya muzika \").\nIkibanza cya Natufiya cya Raqefet (muri Isiraheli) cyagaragaje ibimenyetso byerekana ifumbire mvaruganda muri isekuru yacukuwe mu rutare.\nUbwubatsi.\n\"Mortarium\" y'ikilatini ibanza kwerekana inkono yayo uko yubatse, hanyuma ibiyirimo. Iri tandukaniro ryagumanye natwe kuva ijambo isekuru risobanurwa nka kontineri n'ibiyirimo. inkono isobanura uwakoze inkono yamabuye yitwa inkono hanyuma uwamena amabuye akomeye kugirango akore sima, agizwe cyane numwe mu mashyirahamwe y'ambere y'abigize umwuga, yemejwe nigitabo \"cyubucuruzi\" cya ' \u00c9tienne Boileau, cyanditswemo 1268.\nLouis Vicat, igihe yageragezaga na isekuru, yakomeje gukoresha amabuye y'icyuma hamwe n'udukoko twangiza muri ikinyejana cya XIX.\u00a0.\nFarumasi.\ninkono byakoreshejwe kuva mubihe byabanjirije amateka mbere cyane, kugirango bakubite imiti itandukanye ya farumasi, kugirango kandi bategure imiti. Mubihe bya kera, bari nabategura farumasi.\nNibimwe mubimenyetso bikunze kugaragara kubategurwa kw'isi.\nIbiryo.\nIsekuru ikoreshwa mu miryango gakondo nko gusya ibinyampeke mugihe habuze urusyo, cyangwa se kubitegura neza. rero imvange y'ibirungo byavaga mu gikoni cy'Ubuhinde, nka aioli na pistou - icya nyuma gikesha izina ryacyo, cyangwa se \"pistoni\".\nIngoma zifite impera izengurutse cyangwa impera iringaniye. Uruziga ruzengurutse rukora neza muguhonda ibirungo cyangwa ibyatsi byari ibya aromatiya muri isekuru mu gihe impera iringaniye ikora neza mu birahuri byo gukora cocktail cyangwa kumena ibintu binini (urugero Millet). Impera iringaniye akenshi iba ifite pini byorohereza akazi mukurinda udukoko kunyerera.\nibi Ibikoresho bikomeye kandi bidakurura (urugero ibyuma bitagira umwanda, ceramike, cyangwa ikirahure) ni byiza kuko bidashiramo imyiteguro bityo bikemerera kutavanga uburyohe. Ariko, akenshi usanga bihenze cyane pe. Ku rundi ruhande, ibiti, birashobora koroha gukoresha ibyatsi bihumura neza, kuko bikunda kunyerera ku byuma bitagira umwanda cyangwa ikirahure cyoroshye cyane (reba isekuru y\u2019Abayapani hepfo kugirango ikemure iki kibazo). Ceramike irashobora kumeneka mugihe umuti wamanutse cyangwa washize.\nMu Buyapani, isekuru nini cyane zikoreshwa mugutegura \"mochi\". isekuru ifite ubunini busanzwe, ariko hepfo yayo ikaba ifite imirongo minini yo gusya ingano, bita suribachi ndetse na pestle \"surikogi\". Abayapani kandi bakoresha ubwoko bwa isekuru ndende yitwa \"yagen\", aho udukoko dusimbuzwa uruziga. Irashobora kuboneka muri manga nyinshi.\nisekueu nziza iraremereye kugirango itanyerera cyangwa ngo itamanyagurika hejuru, kandi ifite impande ndende kugirango ibuze imyiteguro gusuka iyo uri kuyikora.\nImisemburo ya gakondo ya Mexico, ikozwe muri basalt, ikaba yitwa \"molcajetes\".\nIsekuru ya Maghrebian (\"mehraz\") uyirebye ikozwe mubyuma; irashobora kuba ibuye mubice bimwe byicyaro. Ikoreshwa mugukubita ibirungo cyangwa gutegura pasite igizwe ni birungo na tungurusumu. isekuru ikoreshwa cyane mu biryo gakondo byo muri Maghreb.\nMuri Reyiniyo, isekuru yitwa \"pestle\u00bbNa pestle yitwa\u00abkalou \".\nUmuco.\nIbikoresho bya muzika.\nIsekuri irashobora gukoreshwa nkigikoresho cyumuziki, igakora iterambere rishimishije rya ethnomusicology ishobora kuboneka mumiryango gakondo ya none nkurugero, muri Tuareg ya kijyambere aho isekuru yo guteka iri, nimugoroba, ikoreshwa nkibikoresho bya muzika mu kuzamuka. umwanya kandi utwikiriwe n'uruhu. Muri Senegali, Abagore baho bakora imyitozo yibiganiro hagati ya minisiteri\u00bb.\nMuri Malayita, mu birwa bya Salomo, abagabo bakora imyitozo mu matsinda yo gukubita \"taro\" muri isekuru kandi iki gikorwa kijyana n \"indirimbo zihiga\". Mu majyaruguru yizinga abamotari bameze nkubwato; mu majyepfo, ni umuzenguruko.\nIyi sekuru ikoreshwa mu gukora umuziki kimwe no kugira uruhare mu buryo bw'ikigereranyo mu mihango y'imvura mu Bushinwa \nImihango.\nIsekuru irashobora kuba ibikoresho by imihango cyangwa igice cyibikorwa bya alichemi.\nRero Hafi y\u2019umusozi wa Hageni muri Gineya, amabuye ya kera y\u2019amabuye aboneka mu gihuru cyangwa mu gihe bari cyo guhinga ubutaka cyangwa mu gihe cyo gusarura. Bafatwa nkibintu byera cyane kubera kubaho kwabo no kugaragara bidasanzwe, kandi bijyanye nu buzima, ubudahangarwa nuburumbuke. ibuye rizunguruka rifite uruhare mu rw'udukoko bigaragara nka umwana\u00bbIsekuru ; mu kigobe cya Huwoni isekuru birashobora gusobanurwa nkibimenyetso byi ngingo zumugabo nigitsina gore by'imana. Abaturage baho (akarere ka Morob\u00e9 ariko rero n'ahandi) ntibagikora ndetse ntibazi nikoreshwa ryacyo. Amabuye ya yisekuru menshi ashushanyijeho ibishushanyo bitandukanye, akenshi usanga bifitanye isano rigaragara rya bugufi n'ibishushanyo bitatse imitwe y'amabuye. Kubera ko ubukoloni bw\u2019ubutaka buherereye kuri metero zirenga 1\u00a0800\u00a0 mu butumburuke butashobokaga kugeza nyuma y\u2019i birayi biryoshye, hafatwa ko gukora isekuru byahagaritswe n\u2019iki kirayi kigeze kuri \u00a0ikinyejana cya XVI. Ikoreshwa rya isekuru rishobora guhuzwa nuburyo bwo guhinga ku masoko yagizwe n\u2019imiyoboro yo kuhira, guhera mu \u00a0kinyejana cya IV mbere ya Yesu kristo\nUbuvanganzo.\nMu migani y'Abarusiya, umurozi witwa Baba Yaga agendera muri isekuru."}
{"id": "16636", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16636", "title": "Vuba Vuba", "text": "Vuba Vuba africa n'Ikigo kizobereye mu byo kugeza amafunguro ku bantu babyifuza bayasabye bifashishije ikoranabuhanga, Vuba Vuba Africa cyamaze kwagura ibikorwa byacyo biva mu Mujyi wa Kigali bigera no mu karere ka Musanze.Iyi resitora icuruza ibyo kurya mu buryo koranabuhanga mujyi wa Kigali nohanze yawo ikaba ikoresha uburyo bwa moto kugirango igeze ibyo kurya ku bakririya bayo.\nIncamake.\nMuri Mutarama 2020 nibwo iyi sosiyete yatangiye nyuma y\u2019ifunga ry\u2019iyari isanzwe ikora akazi nk\u2019aka ya Jumia Food. Nyuma y\u2019amezi icyenda iki kigo gikorera mu Mujyi wa Kigali kuri uyu wa 8 Nzeri 2020 cyatangiye ibikorwa byo kugeza amafunguro no ku bantu bari hirya no hino mu mujyi wa Musanze.\nMu kiganiro umuyobozi wa Vuba Vuba Africa, Albert Munyabugingo yagiranye na IGIHE yavuze ko bafashe umwanzuro wo gukorera no mu Mujyi wa Musanze nyuma y\u2019igenzura bakoze bagasanga wujuje ibisabwa.\nSerivisi.\nVuba Vuba itanga ibiribwa muri Africa, irimo kwagura ibikorwa byayo mu Karere ka Musanze mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru, ni nyuma amezi icyenda gusa itangiye gukorera mu Rwanda.\nKuwa 8 Nzeri 2020 Albert Munyabugingo, uwashinze vuba vuba yatangarije ikinyamakuru The New Times ati: \"Vuba Vuba Afurika izafungura ishami rishya mu Karere ka Musanze\"\nIshami rishya muri Musanze rizajya ryita kubakiriya batuye muri kariya gace ndetse na ba mukerarugendo bashobora kuhaguma.\nNk\u2019uko Munyabugingo abitangaza ngo umushinga mushya waho uzaharanira kuzana ibiryo byiza na serivisi zitangwa mu karere. Akarere ka Musanze ni umwe mu mijyi minini yo mu Rwanda kandi ni ihuriro ry'ubukerarugendo.Vuba Vuba ivuga ko yagiye isesengura isoko rya Musanze kandi yizera ko yiteguye kwakira ibikorwa bya e-ubucuruzi.\nNyuma yo gusesengura isoko yagize ati: Birazwi ko muri iyi minsi, abaguzi bamara igihe kinini kuri interineti kandi ba nyir'ubucuruzi bifuza gukoresha imbaraga ziyongera ku mbuga nkoranyambaga no ku mbuga za interineti.\" Ikigo cyizera cyane ko Musanze ari isoko rishobora kuba ryiteguye kuzamura umusaruro wubucuruzi.\nItangizwa rya serivisi yo gutanga kumurongo wa Vuba Vuba i Musanze ryatangiranye na resitora zizwi cyane muri kariya gace harimo La Paillotte, Amikus, Ndaza Escape, na Le Bamboo.\nAbakiriya.\nAbatuye hamwe na ba mukerarugendo i Musanze babona ibintu byose uhereye ku biryo bitandukanye, kugeza kuri supermarket za ngombwa na serivisi z'itumanaho binyuze muri telefone ya MTN Isoko rya Musanze. Ibikorwa mu karere bizatangirana nitsinda ryabantu 10 batwara ibicuruzwa, hateganijwe kongera umubare wibicuruzwa byiyongera.\nIsosiyete yatangiye gukora muri Mutarama uyu mwaka nyuma yo kugumana 80 ku ijana by'abahoze ari abakozi ndetse n'abatwara Jumia. Vuba Vuba itanga urubuga kuri ubu ifite itsinda ryabakozi 25 bahoraho, resitora 130 n'amaduka muri Kigali hamwe n'abagenzi 100 batanga impuzandengo ya 600 hafi kumunsi."}
{"id": "16639", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16639", "title": "Ubucuruzi muri afurika", "text": "Afurika ni umugabane mu nini ugizwe n'ibice bitanu by'ingenzi [Amajyarugu, Amajyepfo, Africa yo hagati, Uburasirazuba, n'uburengerazuba]. Abaturage b'Afurika batunzwe n'imirimo itandukanye ariko bibanda cyane k'ubucuruzi. Muri Afurica hakorwa ubwoko bu biri bw'ubucuruzi \" Ubukorerwa muri Africa (Mu icyongereza: Internal Trade) n'ubwambukiranya imbibi z'afurika (Mu icyongereza: External Trade)\nUbucuruzi bw'imbere.\nUbucuruzi bw\u2019imbere muri Afurika ntabwo bukunze kwerekana umubare ufatika w' ibicuruzwa bigurishwa bitewe n\u2019igipimo kinini cya magendu, ibyo bigatuma umubare munini w\u2019ubucuruzi gakondo bwambukiranya umupaka. Uretse ibyo, ubucuruzi hagati y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika ntibukorwa neza kubera ko ubucuruzi bwakomeje kwibanda mu turere dusanzwe dufite ifaranga ndetse n\u2019ubucuruzi bwateye imbere mu bihugu bya Afurika, mu gihe cy\u2019abakoloni, hakoreshejwe uburyo bwo gutwara abantu n\u2019itumanaho bidahagije, na kubura ubuhinzi cyangwa ibindi bicuruzwa byuzuzanya, hamwe niterambere rito ryinganda zikora.\nByinshi mubicuruzwi byimbere muri Afrika bigizwe nibikoreshwa buri munsi - ibiryo, ibinyobwa, itabi, isukari, inka, n'inyama. Iterambere ry\u2019inganda mu bihugu bimwe na bimwe, ryaherekejwe no kwiyongera mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ibicuruzwa biramba. Habayeho kandi ubucuruzi bunini bwo kohereza ibicuruzwa hagati y\u2019ibihugu byo ku nkombe n\u2019imbere mu gihugu, cyane cyane amamashini, ibikoresho byo gutwara, n\u2019ibicuruzwa byo kuvugurura amamodoka cyangwa ibikoreshwa mu bw'ubatsi.\nIfaranga rimwe n\u2019ubucuruzi byahindutse binyuze mu gutanga ibyifuzo cyangwa imikorere y\u2019ifaranga risanzwe ryarazwe n\u2019ubutegetsi bwahoze ku gihe cy'ubukoloni harimo: Umuryango w\u2019ubukungu n\u2019amafaranga muri Afurika yo hagati (CEMAC), ugizwe na Kameruni, Gabon, Repubulika ya Centrafrique, Gineya ya Ekwatoriya, Tchad, na Repubulika ya Kongo kandi iri mu muryango w\u2019ubukungu bunini bw\u2019ibihugu byo muri Afurika yo hagati (CEEAC), urimo na Angola, u Burundi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, na Sao Tome na Purensipe; Umuryango w\u2019ubukungu w\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba (ECOWAS), ugizwe na Benin, Burkina Faso, Cape Verde, C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, Gambiya, Gana, Gineya, Gineya-Bissau, Liberiya, Mali, Niger, Nijeriya, Senegali, Siyera Lewone, na Togo; Isoko Rusange rya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'Amajyepfo (COMESA), rigizwe n'Uburundi, Comoros, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Djibouti, Misiri, Eritereya, Etiyopiya, Kenya, Libiya, Madagasikari, Malawi, Mauritius, u Rwanda, Seychelles, Sudani, Swaziland, Uganda, Zambiya, na Zimbabwe; Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ugizwe na Kenya, Uganda, Tanzaniya, u Rwanda, n'Uburundi; Umuryango w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika yepfo (SADC), ugizwe na Angola, Botswana, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Lesotho, Madagasikari, Malawi, Maurice, Mozambike, Namibiya, Seychelles, Afurika y'Epfo, Swaziland, Tanzaniya, Zambiya, na Zimbabwe; Ubumwe bw'Abarabu Maghreb (UMA), bahuza Alijeriya, Libiya, Mauritania, Maroc, na Tuniziya.\nUbucuruzi bwo hanze.\nKuva Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose yatangira habayeho kwaguka cyane mu bucuruzi bwo muri Afurika muri rusange. Iterambere rigereranywa neza n'utundi turere dutera imbere, nka Amerika y'Epfo. Agaciro k\u2019ibitumizwa mu mahanga ariko, karenze ibyoherezwa mu mahanga mu gihe runaka, bituma habaho ubusumbane bukabije mu bucuruzi mu bihugu byinshi bya Afurika. Kwiyongera kwinshi mu byoherezwa muri Afurika muri rusange biterwa no kwiyongera kw'ibicuruzwa by'ibanze mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose ndetse no mu gihe cyo kwiyubaka nyuma y'intambara. Nyuma y\u2019ubwigenge n\u2019ibihugu byinshi bya Afurika, cyane cyane mu ntangiriro ya za 1960, bikurikirwa no guharanira iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu, byashimangiye gahunda yo kwagura ibyoherezwa mu mahanga. Indi mpamvu yatumye ubwiyongere bwihuse bw\u2019ibicuruzwa byoherezwa muri Afurika ni izamuka ry\u2019agateganyo ry\u2019ibiciro by\u2019ibicuruzwa by\u2019ibanze, nubwo nyuma yaho icyerekezo rusange, usibye peteroli, cyerekeje ku biciro by\u2019ibicuruzwa byihebye. Kuba iki kibazo gikomeje kuba kimwe mu byatumye ubukungu bw\u2019ibihugu byinshi bya Afurika bumuga kubera amadeni menshi y\u2019amahanga.\nIbyoherezwa mu mahanga.\nIkintu cyingenzi cyagize uruhare mu izamuka ry\u2019ibicuruzwa byoherezwa mu mahanga muri Afurika ni ukuvumbura peteroli mu bihugu byinshi, cyane cyane Libiya, Alijeriya, Nijeriya, Gabon, Angola, Repubulika ya Kongo, na Kameruni, ndetse n\u2019izamuka ry\u2019ibiciro ryazanywe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019umuryango Ibihugu byohereza peteroli mu mahanga (OPEC) mu myaka ya za 70. Ibindi bintu birimo kuvumbura no kwiyongera kwamabuye y'agaciro akenewe cyane, nka diyama - cyane cyane muri Siyera Lewone, Repubulika ya Kongo, Repubulika ya Centrafrique, na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo - no gukoresha ibindi amabuye y'agaciro, nk'amabuye ya uranium.\nIbicuruzwa bitumizwa mu mahanga.\nUbwiyongere bukabije bw\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibicuruzwa biva muri Afurika bwasobanuye ko umushinga w\u2019ibicuruzwa byatumijwe mu bihugu byinshi bya Afurika urenze ibyoherezwa mu mahanga; Ingaruka zabyo, leta nyinshi zashyizeho imipaka yo gutumiza mu mahanga cyangwa gutera inkunga byinshi mu bicuruzwa byatumijwe mu mahanga. Igice kinini cy\u2019ibitumizwa mu mahanga biva mu Burayi bw\u2019iburengerazuba, cyane cyane ibihugu by\u2019Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi, aho umubano ukomeye w\u2019ubucuruzi ukomeje ku murongo w\u2019abakoloni. Habayeho ariko kwiyongera cyane mu bicuruzwa biva muri Amerika, Ubuyapani, na Afurika y'Epfo. Ibicuruzwa bitumizwa mu mahanga birakenewe cyane cyane mu guteza imbere inganda, bityo rero, bigarukira ahanini ku bicanwa by\u2019amabuye y'agaciro, ibicuruzwa byo mu nganda, imashini, ibikoresho byo gutwara abantu n'ibicuruzwa biramba."}
{"id": "16641", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16641", "title": "Iterambere m'ubucuruzi bw'Afrika", "text": "Afurika ifite isoko rinini ryimbere mu gihugu rifite amahirwe akomeye. Kugeza ubu, Afurika ifite 2,9 ku ijana by'umusaruro w'isi na 2,6 ku ijana by'ubucuruzi bw'isi nubwo 16.3 ku ijana by'abatuye isi baba ku mugabane wa Afurika.\nHariho itandukaniro rinini ry\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu haba hagati y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika ndetse no mu bihugu bya Afurika byateye imbere. Ubukene buracyagaragara muri Afurika aho 32 kuri 48 mu bihugu byateye imbere cyane (LDCs).\nUbucuruzi bw'imbere.\nUbucuruzi bw\u2019imbere muri Afurika bwiyongereye mu myaka yashize bugera kuri 15.4 ku ijana. Nubwo bimeze bityo, Aziya n'Uburayi biracyafite uruhare runini mubucuruzi bwumugabane. Kwishingikiriza cyane ku bucuruzi bw'ibicuruzwa bya mbere, ibicuruzwa byinshi hamwe n\u2019ibicuruzwa byoherezwa mu mahanga, hamwe n\u2019imiyoboro idahwitse yo mu karere biri mu mbogamizi zikomeye z\u2019intara za Afurika.\nImikorere mike mu bipimo byorohereza ubucuruzi nayo ibangamira iterambere ry\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019ubukungu mu karere. Kurugero, ibihugu byinshi bya Afrika bifite amanota make mubucuruzi bwa e-ubucuruzi, guhuza umurongo woherejwe no gukora ibipimo byubucuruzi.\nImbogamizi.\nBimwe mubibazo bigoye muri Afrika biterwa namasoko mato, yamenetse kandi igice cyitaruye. Ibihugu byinshi bya Afurika byifashishije ingamba ziterambere nyuma yo kubona ubwigenge burimo no gushyiraho Umuryango w\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019akarere (REC). Nyamara, REC nyinshi zifite abanyamuryango benshi kandi bisa nkaho bigoye aho koroshya umubano wubucuruzi mubihugu bya Afrika. Ibihugu bya Afurika byafashe ingamba zo guhuza umugabane binyuze mu gushyiraho akarere k\u2019ubucuruzi bwisanzuye ku mugabane.\nAmasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi ku mugabane wa Afurika.\nAmasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi ku mugabane wa Afurika (CFTA) yashyizweho umukono mu 2018 n\u2019ibihugu 44 bya Afurika afite intego ndende ndende zo kurushaho kwishyira hamwe hagati y\u2019ibihugu bigize Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika no kubaka Afurika itera imbere kandi yunze ubumwe. Mu ntego nyamukuru za CFTA harimo korohereza, guhuza no guhuza neza uburyo bw\u2019ubucuruzi kimwe no gukuraho ibibazo bifitanye isano n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi menshi kandi arenga ku mugabane wa Afurika. Binyuze muri aya masezerano, ubukungu bw\u2019Afurika bwizeye gushimangira guhangana n\u2019inganda zaho, kumenya ubukungu bw\u2019ibipimo ku bicuruzwa bikomoka mu gihugu, gutanga neza umutungo no gukurura ishoramari ritaziguye.\nIbipimo by'ubucuruzi.\nMugihe igice cyerekana bimwe mubipimo byubucuruzi bikoreshwa cyane kurwego rwumugabane, indi mibare imwe igereranya imiterere nimikorere yibice umunani byingenzi byubatswe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika: Umuryango w\u2019abarabu Maghreb (AMU / UMA), Umuryango w\u2019ubukungu w\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba. y'ibihugu bya Sahel-Sahara (CEN-SAD)."}
{"id": "16643", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16643", "title": "Amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi ku mugabane w' Afurika", "text": "Amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi y\u2019ubucuruzi ku mugabane wa Afurika (CFTA) yashyizweho umukono mu 2018 n\u2019ibihugu 44 bya Afurika afite intego ndende ndende zo kurushaho kwishyira hamwe hagati y\u2019ibihugu bigize Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika no kubaka Afurika itera imbere kandi yunze ubumwe. Mu ntego nyamukuru za CFTA (mu icyongereza; AFRICAN CONTINENTAL FREE TRADE AREA) harimo korohereza, guhuza no guhuza neza uburyo bw\u2019ubucuruzi kimwe no gukuraho ibibazo bifitanye isano n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi menshi kandi arenga ku mugabane wa Afurika. Binyuze muri aya masezerano, ubukungu bw\u2019Afurika bwizeye gushimangira guhangana n\u2019inganda zaho, kumenya ubukungu bw\u2019ibipimo ku bicuruzwa bikomoka mu gihugu, gutanga neza umutungo no gukurura ishoramari ritaziguye.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nInama ya 18 isanzwe y\u2019Inteko y\u2019abakuru b\u2019ibihugu na guverinoma y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika Yunze ubumwe, yabereye Addis Abeba, muri Etiyopiya muri Mutarama 2012, yemeje icyemezo cyo gushyiraho akarere k\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi ku mugabane wa Afurika (CFTA) ku itariki yerekana 2017. Inama yemeje kandi gahunda y'ibikorwa byo kuzamura ubucuruzi hagati ya Afurika (BIAT) igaragaza amatsinda arindwi: politiki y\u2019ubucuruzi, korohereza ubucuruzi, ubushobozi butanga umusaruro, ibikorwa remezo bijyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi, imari y\u2019ubucuruzi, amakuru y\u2019ubucuruzi, no guhuza isoko. CFTA izahuza ibihugu mirongo itanu na bine bya Afurika bifite abaturage barenga miliyari imwe hamwe n\u2019umusaruro rusange w\u2019imbere mu gihugu urenga miriyoni 3.4.\nIbiganiro.\nBiteganijwe ko imishyikirano ya CFTA iteganijwe muri Kamena 2015 kandi CFTA igomba gutangizwa n\u2019itariki yerekana umwaka wa 2017. Intego nyamukuru za CFTA ni ugushiraho isoko rimwe ry\u2019umugabane w\u2019ibicuruzwa na serivisi, hamwe n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019abashoramari n\u2019ishoramari, bityo bigatanga inzira yo kwihutisha ishyirwaho ry\u2019ubumwe bwa gasutamo. Bizagura kandi ubucuruzi hagati y\u2019Afurika binyuze mu guhuza neza no guhuza ibikorwa byo kwishyira ukizana mu bucuruzi no korohereza ibikoresho n\u2019ibikoresho muri REC ndetse no muri Afurika muri rusange. Biteganijwe kandi ko CFTA izamura ubushobozi bwo guhangana ku ruganda no ku rwego rw\u2019ibikorwa binyuze mu gukoresha amahirwe yo kubyara umusaruro mwinshi, kugera ku isoko ry\u2019umugabane no kugabana umutungo neza. Ishyirwaho rya CFTA no gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda y'ibikorwa byo kuzamura ubucuruzi bw\u2019imbere muri Afurika (BIAT) bitanga urwego rwuzuye rwo gukurikiza ingamba z\u2019iterambere ry\u2019akarere. Iyambere yatekerejwe nkumushinga uteganijwe igihe, mugihe BIAT ikomeje intego zifatika zo gukuba kabiri ibicuruzwa biva muri Afrika kuva muri Mutarama 2012 na Mutarama 2022."}
{"id": "16644", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16644", "title": "Abagore mu Iterambere ry'Africa", "text": "Abagore mu iterambere ry'Africa.\nMumyaka yo hambere abagore muri Africa bafatwaga nkabantu badashoboye kandi batagira iterambere bageza\nkuri Rubanda nyamwinshi (Societe). kugeza ubu siko bikibarwa kuko abagore ni bamwe mubabarwaho gukora\ncyane kandi iterambere ryabo rikagaragara.\nUbucuruzi muri Africa.\nAbagore bo hirya no hino muri Africa bimaze kugaragara ko bafite uruhare runini mu iterambere ry'ibihugu byabo\naho bagaragara muri bamwe bahembwa ni ibihugu byabo kubera ibikorwa bimwe nabimwe by'iterambere bagezeho\nno mu Rwanda abagore batandukaye bagaragara mubikorwa by'ubucuruzi ndetse no mubuyobozi bahembwa\nkubera ibikorwa by'indashyikirwa bitandukanye\nIterambere ry'umugore mu Rwanda.\nWorld Economic Forum agaragajeko u Rwanda ruza kumwana wa gaanu (5) ku isi mu bijyanye no guharanira iterambere ry'umugore. ibi kandi byakozwe hagendewe ku byiciro bine (4) birimo uruhare rw'abagore mubukungu bw'igihugu, ndetse no guha uburezi bukwiriye abana b'abakobwa, kubungabunga ubuzima bw'igitsina gore ndetse no guhabwa imyanya munzego zifata ibyemezo. \nUbusumbane hagati y 'umugore n'umugabo.\nkuva kera mu mumateka umugore akunze kubuzwa uburenganzira no guhezwa muburyo butandukanye kandi bikagaragara mu mico hafi yayose hiya nohino ku Isi ibi kandi byagize ingaruka zikomeye kubuzima bw'umugore kandi izi ngaruka ziracyagaragara mubusumbane bukiri ku Isi hagati y'abagore ndetse n'abagabo.\nIshami ry'umuryango wabibumbye ryita ku bagore (UN Women) rivugako uburezi ari imwe mu nkingi ituma umuryango runaka w'abanttu utangira guhindura imyumvire y\u2019uburyo ufata abagore.\nGLOBAL GENDER GAP REPORT igaragaza icyuho muburinganire aho yerekana ko bimwe mu bihugu byateje imbere\nuburinganire binasanganwe urwego rw'uburezi buteye imbere nka Iceland iyoboye ibindi bihugu kuri uru rutonde,99% \nby'abaturage baba barageze mu ishuri. icyakora no mubihugu byateye imbere nkibi haracyagaragara ubusumbane hagati y 'umugabo n'umugore.\nUburinganire.\nMurwego rwo guteza imbere uburinganire hagati y\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore, mumwaka wi 1977 umuryango w'abibumbye(LONI) wemeje ko ittariki ya 8 werurwe iharirwa kuzirikana ku kamaro k'umugore mubuzima bwa muntu, hakarebwa ku ntambwe yatewe mu rugendo rw\u2019iterambere ndetse n\u2019imbogamizi agihura na zo.\nUmwihariko wu Rwanda mu iterambere ry'umugore.\nNyuma ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda umwaka wi 1994, kimwe mubikorwa by'ingenzi leta yu Rwanda yagezeho nuko yashyize imbaraga mu guteza imbere uburinganire hagati y\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore. Mu 1995, u Rwanda rwashyize umukono ku masezerano agamije guteza imbere uburenganzira bw\u2019abagore n'abakobwa yasinyiwe i Beijing mu Bushinwa.\nIbi kandi byakurikiwe nizindi ngamba zitandukanye zirimo gushyiraho Minisiteri yihariye ifite munshingano zayo gukurikirana uburinganire, hashyirwaho kandi gahunda zigamije guteza imbere uburezi bw\u2019abakobwa, havugururwa amategeko ku mitungo n\u2019ibindi byinshi, byose bigamije guteza imbere uburinganire."}
{"id": "16645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16645", "title": "Umuryango w'Iterambere ry'Africa y'Epfo", "text": "Umuryango w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika yepfo (SADC) wabayeho kuva mu 1980, igihe washingwa nk\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu icyenda bigengwa n\u2019abaturage benshi bo muri Afurika yepfo bizwi ku izina ry\u2019inama yo guhuza iterambere ry\u2019amajyepfo ya Afurika (SADC), intego nyamukuru yo guhuza imishinga yiterambere hagamijwe kugabanya gushingira ku bukungu kuri Afrika yepfo icyo gihe ivangura. Icyicaro gikuru cya SADC giherereye i Gaborone, muri Botswana.\nAmateka.\nIbihugu bigize Umuryango ni: Angola, Botswana, Lesotho, Malawi, Mozambique, Swaziland, Repubulika yunze ubumwe ya Tanzaniya, Zambiya na Zimbabwe.\nSADC yashinzwe i Lusaka, muri Zambiya ku ya 1 Mata 1980, nyuma yo kwemeza Itangazo rya Lusaka - Afurika y'Epfo: Kugana Ubukungu.\nGuhindura uyu muryango kuva mu nama mpuzabikorwa mu muryango w\u2019iterambere (SADC, mu icyongereza: Southern\u00a0 African Development Coordination Conference) byabaye ku ya 17 Kanama 1992 i Windhoek, muri Namibiya, ubwo Itangazo n\u2019amasezerano byashyirwaga umukono mu nama y\u2019abakuru b\u2019ibihugu na guverinoma bityo bagaha umuryango ubuzimagatozi.\nIbihugu bigize uyu muryango ni Angola, Botswana, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Lesotho, Madagasikari, Malawi, Maurice, Mozambique, Namibiya, Seychelles, Afurika y'Epfo, Swaziland, Repubulika yunze ubumwe ya Tanzaniya, Zambiya na Zimbabwe"}
{"id": "16646", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16646", "title": "National Cement Company Limited", "text": "National Cement Company Limited (NCCL), cyangwa National Cement Company Kenya Limited, ni uruganda rukora sima mu gihugu cya Kenya. Ni ishami ry\u2019itsinda ry\u2019amasosiyete nka Devki, N'ihuriro ry\u2019inganda, rifite icyicaro muri Kenya hamwe n\u2019ibigo bikora nko muri Kenya, Uganda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. \nAho biherereye.\nInganda nkuru za NCCL ziherereye ku muhanda wa Nairobi na Mombasa, mu mujyi wa Athi River, Intara ya Machakos. hari kilometero k'umuhanda, mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba bwa Nairobi, umurwa mukuru wa Kenya. Ibiharanga ni 1 \u00b0 29'31.0 \"S, 37 \u00b0 03'26.0\" E (Ubunini: -1.491944; Uburebure: 37.057222). \nIncamake.\nNational Cement Company Limited yashinzwe mu 2008 itangira gukora sima muri 2010. \nKugeza muri Mata 2018, NCCL niyo yari nini mu gukora sima kavukire muri Kenya, ifite ibihingwa byinshi muri iki gihugu. Ifite ijana ku ijana bya Simba Cement Uganda Limited, uruganda rwa sima mu mujyi wa Tororo wa Uganda, rufite ubushobozi bwo gukora toni miliyoni imwe buri mwaka. \nNyirubwite.\nKuba sosiyete ifite guhera muri 2018 nkuko bigaragara mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira: \nAmajyambere ya vuba.\nMuri Gicurasi 2019, NCCL yashyize umukono ku masezerano y\u2019amadorari miliyoni 50 yo kugura umutungo wa Kenya hamwe n\u2019ibigo byose bya ARM Cement Plc. (Muri Receivership), nk'ikibazo cyigenda. Igitekerezo gisaba kwemererwa n'amategeko muri Kenya. \nKugura ARM bizatera inkunga ingana na miliyoni 25 y\u2019amafaranga ya madorali yatanzwe n\u2019imbere mu gihugu n\u2019inguzanyo zitangwa n\u2019ikigo mpuzamahanga cy\u2019imari n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Kenya. Hamwe n'ogushaka NCCL, izaba ifite ubushobozi bwa toni 1,400.000 buri mwaka, bingana na 13% byu musaruro rusange w'igihugu. "}
{"id": "16647", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16647", "title": "SWEDD", "text": "projet pour l\u2019autonomisation des femmes et le dividende d\u00e9mographique au Sahel, (Umushinga wo kwitana k'ubushobozi bw\u2019umugore wa Sahel), uzwi kandi ku magambo ahinnye y'Icyongereza, SWEDD (Sahel Empowerment and Demographics), watangijwe mu Gushyingo 2015 bisabwe n\u2019ibihugu birindwi byo mu karere ka Sahel aribyo: Bene, Burukina Faso, Kote Divuwari, Mali, Maritaniya, Nigeri na cade. Intego yayo ni uguteza imbere ubushobozi bw\u2019umugore n\u2019abakobwa n'abangavu, ndetse no kunoza uburyo bwo kubona serivisi nziza z\u2019imyororokere, iy'ababyeyi n\u2019abana. Uyu mushinga wungukira ku nkunga y'amafaranga yatanzwe na Banki y'Isi, inkunga ya tekiniki y'Ikigega cy'Umuryango w'Abibumbye gishinzwe abaturage (UNFPA) n'Umuryango w'Abibumbye wita ku Buzima (OOAS). Icyifuzo cyayo muri rusange ni kwihutisha iterambere ry\u2019abaturage, kubyaza inyungu z\u2019abaturage no kugabanya ubusumbane bw\u2019uburinganire mu karere ka Sahel.,,,,,, [13],, [, [,.\nIntego.\nIntego rusange yu mushinga wa SWEDD: ni ukunoza ubushobozi bw\u2019umugore n\u2019abakobwa n'abangavu, ndetse no kubona serivisi nziza z\u2019imyororokere, abana n\u2019ababyeyi. Igamije kandi gushimangira ubumenyi mu karere no gusangira ubumenyi, ndetse n'ubushobozi bw'akarere no guhuza ibikorwa.,,,,,,, [,.\nBy'umwihariko, intego z'umushinga ni:\nUmushinga SWEDD rero ugamije kuzamura ubuzima n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abagore n\u2019abakobwa bangavu, ndetse no guteza imbere iterambere rirambye mu karere.\nGushyira mu bikorwa.\nIshyirwa mu bikorwa ry'umushinga SWEED rikorwa mu byiciro bibiri (02):\nIcyiciro cya 1.\nIcyiciro cya mbere cyerekanye akamaro ko gushora imari mu kongerera ubushobozi abagore no guteza imbere imari y\u2019abantu n'ingamba zo gukura mu iterambere.\nIcyiciro cya 2.\nIcyiciro cya kabiri cy'umushinga SWEDD cyemejwe n'Inama y'Ubuyobozi ya Banki y'Isi muri Gicurasi 2020, mu kungukirwa n'inkunga y'inyongera ingana na miliyoni 376 z'amadolari, ahwanye na miliyari 188 yama FCFA. Iki cyiciro kigamije gukaza umurego ibikorwa biri gukorwa mu bihugu bigize uyu muryango nka Nigeri, Burkina Faso, cade, Kote Divuwari, Mali, B\u00e9ne na Mauritaniya, mu gihe bigera no mu bindi bihugu bibiri bishya nka, Kameruni na Gineya.,,.\nIntego nyamukuru ni ukubaka imari y\u2019abantu muri Afurika no kuzamura iterambere ry\u2019akarere.\nAbagenerwabikorwa.\nUmushinga SWEDD ugamije kongerera ubushobozi abagore n\u2019abakobwa b\u2019ingimbi mu bihugu bigize uyu muryango ubaha serivisi nziza z\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019imyororokere, iz'ababyeyi n\u2019abana. Aba bagore n'abakobwa b'ingimbi ni bo bungukirwa cyane n'uyu mushinga, ugamije guteza imbere kwibohora kwabo.\nIbihugu bigize umuryango.\nUmushinga SWEDD ukubiyemo ibihugu birindwi byo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba no Hagati, aribyo Nigeri, Burkina Faso, cade, Kote Divuwari, Mali, B\u00e9ne na Mauritaniya., \nMuri 2020, ibindi bihugu nka Gineya na Kameruni nabyo byinjiye mu mushinga wa SWEDD."}
{"id": "16648", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16648", "title": "Simba Cement Uganda Limited", "text": "Simba Cement Uganda Limited (SCUL), cyangwa Sosiyete yi gihugu cya Uganda ikora sima, ni uruganda rukora sima muri Uganda. Ni ishami rya National Cement Company Limited, uruganda rukora ibikoresho by'ubwubatsi ruherereye muri Kenya. Isima yi gihugu ubwayo ni ishami ryitsinda rya Devki ryamasosiyete. \nAho biherereye.\nInganda n'ibiro bikuru bya SCUL biherereye hafi y'umuhanda uri muri Tororo - Mbale, mu \"Mudugudu wa Nyakesi\", muri Paruwasi ya Nyakesi, mu ntara ya Rubongi, mu Karere ka Tororo, nko mu kilometero 9, kumuhanda uri mu majyaruguru hari ubucuruzi bukuru bwu mujyi wa Tororo. Bibarizwa kuri: 0 \u00b0 44'05.0 \"N, 34 \u00b0 11'02.0\" E (Ubunini: 0.734709; Uburebure: 34.183878). \nIncamake.\nUri ruganda rushya rwa sima rufite ubushobozi bwo gutanga umusaruro wa toni miliyoni imwe buri mwaka. Yakozwe ku kigereranyo cya miliyoni 185 z'amadora ya America. Andi masoko yizewe avuga ko yatwaye miliyoni 199 z'amadora y'America. Umusaruro w'ubucuruzi watangiye mugihembwe cya mbere cyo muri 2018. Umusaruro washyizweho ni toni 3.000 buri munsi, bivuze ko toni zigera kuri 800.000 buri mwaka. \nNyirubwite.\nSCUL ni ishami ryuzuye rya National Cement Company Limited (NCCL) rifite icyicaro gikuru muri Kenya. Akaba ifite imigabane muri National Cement Kenya, ariyo rabyaye uruganda rwa Simba Cement Uganda Limited, nkuko bigaragara mu mbonerahamwe ikurikira: \nUbwubatsi.\nRwiyemezamirimo nyamukuru yari Mepani Technical Services Limited. Kubaka uruganda (usibye ibikoresho na sisitemu), byatwaye hafi miliyoni 55 z'amadora y'America, kandi byatwaye imyaka ibiri n'igice. Gutangiza ku mugaragaro byabaye ku ya 29 Kanama 2018. "}
{"id": "16649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16649", "title": "Dozy Mmobuosi", "text": "Dozy Mmobuosi ni umucuruzi wo muri Nigeriya na rwiyemezamirimo mu ikoranabuhanga. Ni umuvugizi witerambere ryikoranabuhanga muri Afrika. Niwe washinze Tingo Inc. akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wayo. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nDozy Mmobuosi yavukiye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza muri siyanse politiki, yakuye muri kaminuza ya Ambrose Alli, muri Ekpoma, muri Leta ya Edo. Yabonye kandi impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza imwe. Yarangije afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga muri kaminuza mu iterambere ry'icyaro yakuye muri Universiti Putra muri Maleziya. Muri Werurwe 2022, Mmobuosi yarangije gahunda yo kuyobora mu ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Sa\u00efd, muri kaminuza ya Oxford. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2001, Mmobuosi yashinze Tingo Mobile kugirango itange ikoranabuhanga rigendanwa hamwe n\u2019ibisubizo bya Fintech ku baturage bo mu cyaro muri Nijeriya. Muri 2015, Mmobuosi yashinze Tingo Inc, isosiyete igurishwa ku mugaragaro ku itsinda rya OTC Markets Group. Muri Mutarama 2019, Dozy Mmobuosi yashyize ahagaragara Nwassa, Agri-Isoko rya sisitemu, hamwe n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya mbere ry\u2019ubuhinzi muri Afurika. \nUkuboza 2022, Dozy Mmobuosi yashyize ahagaragara ikigo cy\u2019ubuyobozi cya Dozy Mmobuosi (DMLC), kibarizwa i Oxford, mu Bwongereza, hagamijwe guteza imbere abayobozi b\u2019Afurika ubumenyi bwo kubafasha guhindura serivisi zabo bwite n\u2019abikorera. Muri Gashyantare 2023, byavuzwe ko Mmobuosi yari hafi miliyoni 90 z'amapawundi yo kugura umupira w'amaguru mu Bwongereza muri Sheffield United. "}
{"id": "16650", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16650", "title": "Cimerwa", "text": "Cimerwa ni uruganda rukora sima mu Rwanda, rukaba rukorera mu Rwanda kuva mu 1984, kuri ubu rukora toni ibihumbi 600 za sima, aho rwakoraga toni ibihumbi 50 buri mwaka.\nAho rubarizwa.\nuruganda rwa Cimerwa ni rumwe mu nganda zisanzwe zibarizwa mu Rwanda aho zitunganya sima, Cimerwa Plc ruherereye mu kibaya cya Bugarama mu karere ka Rusizi, mu intara y'iburengerazuba.\nMu Bucuruzi.\nuruganda rwa Cimerwa rero rwaguzwe, na PPC ikomoka mu gihugu cya Afurika y'Epfo,ibarizwa ku mugabane wa Afurika, aho ari uruganda rukora sima nyinshi mu Rwanda.\nImari n'imigabane.\nuruganda rwa Cimerwa ubu ruri ku isoko ry'imari n'imigabane kuva muri 2020, ikaba ari isoka rya kabilo mu rwanda rinini."}
{"id": "16651", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16651", "title": "Angia Cement prefabricated", "text": "Ni Kampani yitwa Anjia Prefabricated Construction iri mu Rwanda, ifite umushinga wo kubaka uruganda rukora sima mu rwanda rwitwa Angia cement prefabricated, rwubatse uruganda mu cyanya cyahariwe ibintu by'inganda mu Karere ka Muhanga.\nAho Ikomoka.\nAnjia Prefabricated Construction ubundi isanzwe ifite icyicaro gikuru mu gihugu cya Etiyopiya, ariko ikaba nanone ikorera no mubindi bihugu birimo Repubulika Iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo, Uburundi ndetse na Tanzaniya.\nI Muhanga.\nAnjia Prefabricated Construction izubaka iri mu Muhanga, aho iri kubaka uruganda rwa sima ku buso bungana na hegitari 67, aho rwitezweho kuzajya rukora sima Nyarwanda, ndetse n\u2019ibindi bikoresho byifashishwa mu bwubatsi. uru ruganda nirwuzura ruzajya rutanga umusaruro ungana na Toni 1.000.000 ku mwaka."}
{"id": "16652", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16652", "title": "Prime Cement Ltd", "text": "Prime Cement Ltd ni uruganda rukorera sima mu Rwanda. Akaba ari ishami ryu ruganda rwa Milbridge Holding SA. Ni uruganda kandi rukora ibikoresho bitandukanye byo kubaka, rufite kandi amashami atandukanye muri Angola, leta zunze ubumwe bw'abarabu, mu Rwanda na Afurika yepfo.\nMu Rwanda.\nPrime Cement Ltd ni uruganda rukora cima aho ruherereye mu karere ka Musanze mu intara ya Majyaruguruyu Rwanda.\nuruganda.\nUru ruganda rwubatswe mu byiciro bibiri, rufite ubushobozi bwo gukora amatoni 600.000, mu cyiciro cya mbere, cyatwaye agiciro ka miliyoni 40z'amadorali y'America, rwatangiye gukora muri Kanama 2020."}
{"id": "16655", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16655", "title": "Isoko Rusange ry'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'Amajyepfo", "text": "Isoko Rusange ry'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'Amajyepfo (COMESA Mu icyongereza: Common Market for Eastern and Southern Africa) ni umuryango w'ubukungu mu karere muri Afurika ufite ibihugu makumyabiri na kimwe bigize uyu muryango kuva muri Tuniziya kugera Eswatini. \nAmateka.\nCOMESA yashinzwe mu Kuboza 1994, isimbuza Agace k\u2019ubucuruzi kariho kuva mu 1981. Icyenda mu bihugu bigize uyu muryango byashyizeho ubucuruzi bw' akarere bwisanzuye mu 2000 (Djibouti, Misiri, Kenya, Madagasikari, Malawi, Mauritius, Sudani, Zambiya na Zimbabwe), hamwe n'u Rwanda n'Uburundi byinjira muri FTA mu 2004, Comoros na Libiya mu 2006, Seychelles muri 2009 na Tuniziya na Somaliya muri 2018. COMESA ni imwe mu nkingi z'umuryango w\u2019ubukungu nyafurika.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, COMESA yemeye kwagura ubucuruzi bw'akarere bwisanzuye harimo abanyamuryango b\u2019andi mashyirahamwe abiri y\u2019ubucuruzi muri Afurika, Umuryango w\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba (EAC) n\u2019umuryango w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika yepfo (SADC). COMESA irasuzuma kandi gahunda rusange ya viza yo kuzamura ubukerarugendo."}
{"id": "16657", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16657", "title": "Tap and go wifi", "text": "Tap&amp;Go Wifi Ni ikarita ya shinzwe n'ikigo nyarwanda gikora ibintu by' ikoranabuhanga cyitwa AC Group, cyahanze ikoranabuhanga rigezweho rya Tap&amp;Go rikoreshwa mu kwishyura amatike na serivise y\u2019ingendo mu modoka ziri rusange mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nUko yatangiye.\niyi karita yi koranabuhanga ya Tap&amp;Go yatangijwe na AC Group muri 2015, kugirango haveho ibibazo mu biciro by\u2019ingendo hagati y\u2019abagenzi n\u2019ababatwara, ndetse gukuraho impaka z'abagaho mu kugena ibiciro by\u2019ingendo, no gufasha ibigo bitanga serivise z\u2019ubwikorezi kurushaho gukora kinyamwuga, no gukuraho ihererekanya ry\u2019amafaranga yacaga mu ntoki z\u2019abantu.\nUko akora.\nAya makarita ya Tap&amp;Go ashyirwaho amafaranga n\u2019abakozi babishizwe ba AC Group bazwi nk\u2019ab\u2019agenti bari mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019umujyi wa kigali, ubundi rero umugenzi akaba yishyura urungendo akoresheje iyi ikarita. Umugenzi kandi ashobora kubona amafaranga asiganye ku ikarita ye, amaze gukoza ku cyuma kiba kiri muri buri modoka agiye kugendamo, ndetse akaba ashobora kuba yanakoresha telefoni gendanwa."}
{"id": "16658", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16658", "title": "Ihuriro ry'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba", "text": "Ishyirahamwe Nyafurika y'Iburasirazuba (Igiswahiri: Shirikisho la Afrika Mashariki) ni ihuriro ryashyizweho rya politiki ry\u2019ibihugu birindwi byigenga, uy\u2019umuryango ugizwe n\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba mu karere ka Afurika y\u2019ibiyaga bigari - u Burundi, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Kenya, u Rwanda, Sudani y'Amajyepfo, Tanzaniya na Uganda - nk'igihugu kimwe cyigenga cya federasiyo.\nAmateka.\nIgitekerezo cy\u2019iri shyirahamwe cyabayeho kuva mu ntangiriro ya za 1960, ariko ntikirasohora kubera impamvu zitandukanye. Muri Nzeri 2018, hashyizweho komite ishinzwe gutangiza gahunda yo gutegura itegeko nshinga ry\u2019akarere, kandi umushinga w\u2019itegeko-nshinga ry\u2019iri shyirahamwe wagombaga kwandikwa mu mpera za 2021 n\u2019ishyirwa mu bikorwa ryayo mu 2023. Icyorezo cya cyahagaritse gahunda yo gutegura no gushyira mu bikorwa itegeko nshinga. Ku ya 20 Werurwe 2023, EAC yatangaje ko gahunda yo gutegura izakomeza muri Gicurasi 2023 muri Kenya.\nMu gihe ihuriro ry\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba ritarashyirwaho, hafashwe ingamba nyinshi kugira ngo iyi ntego igerweho. Inzego n\u2019inzego nyobozi bimaze kubaho kugirango ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu byunze ubumwe, hamwe n\u2019abahagarariye ibihugu byose bifitanye isano bakorera hamwe kugira ngo bagere kuri iyo ntego.\nIbihugu birindwi byunze ubumwe mu muryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba byaranzwe na ruswa ishingiye kuri ndetse n\u2019ibihugu birenga imbaraga, kandi bikabangamirwa n\u2019ubudashyikirwa bwabo mu bijyanye n\u2019ururimi n\u2019amacakubiri. Aka karere karizera gutsinda izo nzitizi kugira ngo haboneke inyungu z\u2019ubukungu ubumwe bushobora guha aba baturage benshi kandi biyongera."}
{"id": "16659", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16659", "title": "Urukiko rw'Ubutabera rwa Afurika y'Iburasirazuba", "text": "Urukiko rw'Ubutabera rwa Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EACJ mu icyongereza: East African Court of Justice) ni urwego rw'ubucamanza rushingiye ku masezerano y'Umuryango w' rufite inshingano zo kubahiriza amategeko mu gusobanura no gushyira mu bikorwa no kubahiriza amasezerano y'umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba yo mu 1999. Urukiko rugizwe ibice bibiri: Igice cya mbere cy'Urwego n'Ubujurire. Abacamanza bayo, ntarengwa icumi mu gice cya mbere cy\u2019urwego rwa mbere na batanu mu ishami ry\u2019ubujurire, bashyirwaho n\u2019inama y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba, urwego rukuru rw\u2019umuryango, mu bantu basabwe n\u2019ibihugu by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa bafite ubunyangamugayo, kutabogama no kwigenga no kuzuza ibisabwa mu bihugu byabo kugira ngo bakore ubutabera bukuru, cyangwa ni abahanga mu mategeko babishoboye.\nUbubasha.\nUrukiko rufite ububasha bwo gusobanura no gushyira mu bikorwa ayo masezerano kandi rushobora kugira ubundi buryo bw'umwimerere, kujurira, uburenganzira bwa muntu cyangwa ubundi bubasha nyuma yo gushyiraho protocole kugira ngo ubwo bubasha bwagutse. Urukiko rushobora kwifashishwa n\u2019amategeko n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo, ibihugu by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa hamwe n\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango.\nIshingiro umuturage wese uri mu bihugu by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa ashobora gusaba kugenwa n\u2019Urukiko, amategeko y\u2019amategeko ayo ari yo yose, amabwiriza, amabwiriza, icyemezo cyangwa ibikorwa by\u2019igihugu cy\u2019abafatanyabikorwa cyangwa ikigo cy\u2019Umuryango ni ukubera ko \u201cbitemewe. \u201dCyangwa\u201c kurenga \u201dku biteganijwe mu Masezerano.\nUbubasha bw'inkiko z'igihugu bwirukanwa aho Amasezerano yose ayashyikiriza Urukiko rwo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, kubera ko ibyemezo by'Urukiko ku bijyanye no gusobanura no gushyira mu bikorwa ayo masezerano byibanze ku byemezo by'inkiko z'igihugu ku kibazo nk'icyo.\nUrubanza.\nNi itegeko Urukiko rusuzuma kandi rukagena ingingo zose rwakurikijwe hashingiwe ku Masezerano hakurikijwe amategeko yarwo hanyuma rugatanga, mu nama rusange, urubanza rushingiye ku ngingo rusuzumwa, rusuzumwa, rukubahirizwa, rwemeza kandi ntirushobora kujurira.\nGusaba gusubirishamo urubanza birashobora gushyikirizwa Urukiko. Ariko, gusa iyo ishingiye ku kuvumbura ibintu bimwe na bimwe bishobora kuba byaragize uruhare rukomeye mu rubanza iyo bimenyeshwa Urukiko igihe urubanza rwatangwaga, ariko, icyo gihe kikaba kivugwa., Urukiko n\u2019uruhande rwabisabye, kandi ntirwashoboye kuvumburwa n\u2019umwete ushishikaye, mbere y\u2019urubanza, cyangwa kubera amakosa, uburiganya cyangwa amakosa ku maso ya inyandiko cyangwa kubera ko akarengane kakozwe.\nEjo hazaza h\u2019izindi nkiko zo mu karere zifite ububasha buvuguruzanya nk\u2019isoko rusange ry\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019Amajyepfo, Umuryango w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Afurika yepfo n\u2019urukiko nyafurika rushinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu n\u2019abaturage rushingiye ku gushidikanya gukomeye bitewe n\u2019izi ngingo.\nKwakira.\nImpaka zose zerekeye gusobanura cyangwa gushyira mu bikorwa ayo masezerano cyangwa kimwe mu bibazo byoherejwe mu Rukiko ntigishobora gukemurwa mu bundi buryo butari ubw'amasezerano. Iyo amakimbirane yoherejwe mu Rukiko, ibihugu by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa birasabwa kwirinda igikorwa icyo ari cyo cyose gishobora kubangamira ikemurwa cyangwa gishobora kongera amakimbirane, Leta y\u2019abafatanyabikorwa cyangwa Inama Njyanama \"igomba gufata\", bidatinze, ingamba zisabwa kugira ngo ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry'urubanza."}
{"id": "16661", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16661", "title": "Ubumwe bw'Abarabu Maghreb", "text": "Ubumwe bw'Abarabu Maghreb (UMA mu icyongereza: \"Arab Maghreb Union\", Mu igifaransa: \"Union du Maghreb Arabe\") ni ubumwe bwa politiki n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi y\u2019ubumwe agamije ubumwe bw\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ejo hazaza mu bihugu by\u2019abarabu Ibihugu biherereye cyane cyane i Maghreb muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru. Abanyamuryango bayo ni ibihugu bya Alijeriya, Libiya, Mauritania, Maroc na Tuniziya. Ubumwe ntibwashoboye kugera ku majyambere agaragara ku ntego zabwo kubera ubwumvikane buke mu by'ubukungu na politiki hagati ya Maroc na Alijeriya ku bijyanye n'ikibazo cya Sahara y'Uburengerazuba. Nta nama yo mu rwego rwo hejuru yabaye kuva ku ya 3 Nyakanga 2008, kandi abasobanuzi bavuga ko Ubumwe businziriye.\nKurema.\nIgitekerezo cy\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ubukungu cya cyatangiranye n\u2019ubwigenge bwa Tuniziya na Maroc mu 1956. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka mirongo itatu, ni bwo ibihugu bitanu bya Maghreb - Alijeriya, Libiya, Mauritania, Maroc, na Tuniziya byahuye bwa mbere. Inama ya Maghreb mu 1988. Ubumwe bwashinzwe ku ya 17 Gashyantare 1989 ubwo amasezerano yasinywaga n\u2019ibihugu bigize uyu muryango i Marrakech.Dukurikije Itegeko Nshinga, intego yaryo ni ukwemeza ubufatanye \"n\u2019inzego zisa n\u2019akarere... [kugira] uruhare mu gutunganya ibiganiro mpuzamahanga... [gushimangira ubwigenge bw\u2019ibihugu bigize uyu muryango kandi... [kurinda] umutungo wabo. \" Ingamba zifatika z\u2019akarere zishingiye ku kuba, hamwe, hamwe na fosifate nini, peteroli, na gaze, kandi ni ikigo cyambukiranya Uburayi bw\u2019amajyepfo. Intsinzi y'Ubumwe rero, yaba ingenzi mubukungu.\nIshirahamwe.\nHariho ubuyobozi busimburana muri AMU bukorwa na buri gihugu. Umunyamabanga mukuru uriho ubu ni umunya Tuniziya.\nAbanyamuryango.\nMu nama ya 16 y\u2019abaminisitiri b\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ba AMU, yabaye ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 1994 muri Algiers, Misiri yasabye kwinjira mu itsinda rya AMU.\nUbukungu.\nUbukungu bwa AMU buhuza ubukungu bwibihugu bine kuri bitanu bigize uyu muryango. Ibihugu byose byiganjemo ibihugu by\u2019abarabu n\u2019abayisilamu. Ibihugu bine kuri bitanu bya AMU bifite ihuriweho (mugihe cyo kugura imbaraga zingana; PPP) ingana na tiriyari 1.5276 USD. Igihugu gikize cyane hashingiwe kuri GDP kuri buri muntu muri PPP ni Alijeriya. Hashingiwe kuri GDP umuturage (nominal), Libiya nicyo gihugu gikize cyane, aho amafaranga yinjiza arenga US $ 65.803 kuri buri muntu."}
{"id": "16662", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16662", "title": "YegoMoto", "text": "YegoMoto ni gahunda y'ikoranabuhanga ikorwa na Yego Innovision, ikaba ifasha mugutwaba abantu n'ibintu, ikoreshwa mu mujyi wa kigali. YegoMoto yatangoye gukoreshwa muri 2017, yegoMoto ikaba ikoreshwa n'abamotari bagera kuri 4500, aho ishyirwa muri moto igafasha abagenzi kwishyura urugendo, bitagombeye guciririkana. \nIbindi.\nUretse kandi imashini za YegoMoto zihabwa abamotari, ikigo Yego Innovision cyari gisanzwe cyarahaye abatwara abagenzi mu modoka ntoya zitwa taxi, hari imashini za mubazi zizwi nka Yego Cabs, hakaba hari izirenga 1,140."}
{"id": "16663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16663", "title": "Umuryango w'Ubukungu bw'Afurika y'Iburengerazuba", "text": "ECOWAS (mu icyongereza:Economic Community of West African States) ni ubumwe bwa politiki nubukungu bwakarere byibihugu cumi na bitanu biherereye muri Afrika yuburengerazuba. Hamwe na hamwe, ibi bihugu bigizwe n'ubuso bwa 5.114.162 km2 (1,974.589 sq mi), naho muri 2015 bikaba byari bifite abaturage barenga miliyoni 349.\nUfatwa nk'imwe mu z\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019umugabane wa Afurika (), intego yavuzwe na ECOWAS ni ukugera ku \" hamwe\" ku bihugu bigize uyu muryango hashyirwaho umuryango umwe w\u2019ubucuruzi wubaka ubukungu bwuzuye kandi kandi ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi. Ihuriro ryashinzwe ku ya 28 Gicurasi 1975, hasinywe amasezerano y\u2019i Lagos, hamwe n\u2019inshingano zayo zo guteza imbere ubufatanye bw\u2019ubukungu mu karere kose. Ivugurura ry\u2019amasezerano ryaremejwe kandi ryashyizweho umukono ku ya 24 Nyakanga 1993 i Cotonou.\nECOWAS ikora kandi nk'ingabo zishinzwe mu karere, ibihugu bigize uyu muryango rimwe na rimwe byohereza ingabo z\u2019ingabo zunze ubumwe kugira ngo zivange mu bihugu bigize uyu muryango mu gihe cy'imidugararo ya politiki n'imidugararo.\nIbihugu bigize Umuryango.\nKuva muri Gashyantare 2017, ECOWAS ifite ibihugu 15 bigize uyu muryango; umunani muri bo bavuga Igifaransa, batanu bavuga Icyongereza, na babiri bavuga Igiporutugali. Muri Gicurasi 1975, abanyamuryango bose binjiye mu muryango nkabanyamuryango bashinze, usibye Cape Verde winjiye mu 1977\nUwahoze ari umunyamuryango wa ECOWAS ni Mauritania ivuga Icyarabu, na we akaba yari umwe mu banyamuryango bashinze mu 1975 maze ahitamo kuva mu Kuboza 2000. Muri Kanama 2017, Mauritania yashyize umukono ku masezerano mashya y\u2019abanyamuryango\nMarocyasabye ku mugaragaro kwinjira muri ECOWAS muri Gashyantare 2017. Icyifuzo cyemejwe mu nama y'abakuru b'ibihugu muri Kamena 2017, ariko icyifuzo cya Maroc cyo kuba umunyamuryango nticyahagaritswe.\nAmateka.\nECOWAS yashinzwe bwa mbere kuva muri kariya karere kahoze gakolonijwe n\u2019Abafaransa, Abongereza na Porutugali, na Liberiya yigenga, nyuma y\u2019ubwigenge bwa nyuma y\u2019abakoloni mu karere kose (cyane cyane mu myaka ya za 1960 na 1970). Yashinzwe kugirango itange ubufatanye mu bukungu mu karere, ariko kuva ubwo yagiye ihinduka ikubiyemo ubufatanye bwa politiki n\u2019igisirikare, ndetse.\nIhuriro ryashinzwe ku ya 28 Gicurasi 1975, hasinywe amasezerano y\u2019i Lagos, hamwe n\u2019inshingano zayo zo guteza imbere ubufatanye bw\u2019ubukungu mu karere kose. Ivugurura ry\u2019amasezerano ryaremejwe kandi ryashyizweho umukono ku ya 24 Nyakanga 1993 i Cotonou.\nUfatwa nk'imwe mu nkingi z\u2019umuryango w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019umugabane wa Afurika (AEC), intego yavuzwe na ECOWAS ni ukugera ku \"kwihaza hamwe\" ku bihugu bigize uyu muryango hashyirwaho umuryango umwe w\u2019ubucuruzi wubaka ubukungu bwuzuye kandi kandi ihuriro ry\u2019abakozi.\nECOWAS ikora kandi nk'ingabo zishinzwe kubungabunga amahoro mu karere, ibihugu bigize uyu muryango rimwe na rimwe byohereza ingabo z\u2019ingabo zunze ubumwe kugira ngo zivange mu bihugu bigize uyu muryango mu gihe cy'imidugararo ya politiki n'imvururu. Mu myaka yashize, harimo no gutabara muri Coryte d'Ivoire mu 2003, Liberiya mu 2003, Gineya-Bissau muri 2012, Mali muri 2013, na Gambiya muri 2017. \nECOWAS, kuva mu myaka ya za 90, yitwikiriye akarere kahoze kitwa \"umukandara wo guhirika ubutegetsi\", yagerageje kurengera ihinduka ry\u2019akarere muri demokarasi kurwanya ibitero by\u2019igitugu. Icyakora, iryo tsinda ryavuzweho ibisubizo bidakomeye kandi bitagize icyo bitwara mu ntangiriro ya za 2020, igihe ibihugu bitatu bigize uyu muryango byagize ihirikwa ry\u2019ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare - bibiri muri Burkinafaso, bibiri muri Mali, kimwe cyagerageje muri Nijeriya, ikindi muri Gineya.\nMuri 2011, ECOWAS yemeye igishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019iterambere mu myaka icumi iri imbere, Icyerekezo 2020, kandi, kugira ngo iherekeze, Politiki y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ()."}
{"id": "16664", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16664", "title": "Pascal Moto", "text": "Pascal Moto ni gahunda igezweho y'ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda ikorwa na pascal technology, ikaba ifasha mugutwaba ibitandukanye nka abantu n'ibintu, ikaba ikoreshwa mu mujyi wa kigali. Pascal Moto yatangiye gukoreshwa muri 2022, Pascal Moto ikaba ikoreshwa n'abamotari benshi muri kigali, Pascal rero ishyirwa muri moto zirwara abagenzi zigafasha kwishyura urugendo, bitagombeye guciririkana n'umumotari."}
{"id": "16665", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16665", "title": "Irembo Gov", "text": "IREMBO ni ikoranabuhanga rihuza abaturage ku isi na serivisi za Leta y\u2019u Rwanda. Ni urubuga rukoreshwa gushaka ibyangombwa byose wifuza muri serivisi zose utarinze kujya Kigali cyangwa ku karere cyangwa ku murenge. Iri koranabuhanga ry\u2019Irembo ryavunnye amaguru abaturarwanda, yaba abenegihugu ndetse n\u2019abanyamahanga batuye u Rwanda.\nIzo services zose ushobora kuzisaba uri mu rugo iwawe ukoresheje mudasobwa yawe cyangwa telefone igendanwa hanyuma \nukakira ibyangombwa byawe kuri email habayeho guhanahana amakuru kuri murandasi."}
{"id": "16667", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16667", "title": "Qatar Airways", "text": "Qatar Airways (Arabic:) n'indege y'igihugu ya Emirate ya Qatar. Qatar Airways ni imwe mu ndege ziyongera cyane mu nganda z\u2019indege ku isi, kuri ubu umuyoboro uhuza abantu barenga 100 mu Burayi, Amerika y'Amajyaruguru, Amerika y'Epfo, Uburasirazuba bwo hagati, Afurika, Aziya y'Epfo, Uburasirazuba bwa Ositaraliya, cyane cyane ku kibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Doha.\nQatar Airways ikora buri munsi kuva i Roma Fiumicino, Milan Malpensa na Venice kugera ku Kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Doha, itanga umurongo wa buri cyumweru 25 (indege 29, bitewe n\u2019indege 4 ziyongereye ziva i Roma ziteganijwe mu gihe cya 01 Nyakanga - 30 Nzeri 2011). Kuva ku Kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Doha hari ingendo zerekeza Dubai hafi buri saha: igihe cyo guhaguruka ni isaha 1.\nIbihembo.\nKuva mu 2009, Qatar Airways yakoze impamyabumenyi y\u2019inyenyeri 5 yatanzwe na World Airline Awards 2011 (isosiyete ikora ubushakashatsi mu Bwongereza, imwe mu mashyirahamwe azwi cyane mu nzego z\u2019indege za gisivili kubera ko yahawe ibihembo by\u2019umwaka ku masosiyete atandukanye y\u2019indege, harimo ibihembo byisi byindege - Igihembo cyindege yumwaka) kandi yahawe igihembo cyiswe \"Airline of the Yearby kubera ibikorwa byindashyikirwa mu bwato no kuba indashyikirwa mu bikorwa.\nAbakozi ba Qatar Airways bahawe igihembo cya \"Crew nziza mu burasirazuba bwo hagati\". Byongeye kandi, Qatar Airways yatorewe kuba \u201cindege nziza mu burasirazuba bwo hagati\u201d mu bushakashatsi bwakorewe abagenzi mpuzamahanga barenga miliyoni 15 muri Skytrax World Airline Awards 2011."}
{"id": "16669", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16669", "title": "RwandAir", "text": "RwandAir ni sosiyete y'indege y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda. Ni iya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ifite icyicaro i Kigali. Ikorera ku Kibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Kigali, i Kanombe.\nYashinzwe mu 2002 yitwa Rwandair Express. Yafashe izina rya RwandAir mu 2009. Ijya cyane cyane mu bihugu bya Afurika. Ijya kandi mu Burayi.\nAmateka.\nKuva kuri Air Rwanda kugeza kuri Rwandair Express.\nAir Rwanda yari sosiyete y'indege y'igihugu. Yahagaritse ingendo mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. Nyuma yaho, Leta yashatse kongera kuyibyutsa. Sosiyete SA Alliance Air yo muri Uganda yayiyoboye kuva mu 1997 kugeza mu 2000.\nLeta yahise yisubiza ibikorwa byayo. Rwandair Express yashinzwe ku wa 1 Ukuboza 2002. Yatangiye ingendo mu 2003.\nRwandAir (kuva mu 2009).\nMu 2009, isosiyete yatangiye kwagura ingendo mu karere: Dar es Salaam, Nairobi na Gisenyi. Muri Kamena 2009, yahinduye izina iba RwandAir.\nMu Kwakira 2010, John Mirenge yabaye umuyobozi mukuru. Muri uwo mwaka, yakiriye indege ebyiri za Boeing 737-500. Mu 2011, yaguze indege ya mbere nshya ivuye mu ruganda, Boeing 737-800.\nMu 2015, RwandAir yinjiye mu Ishyirahamwe Mpuzamahanga ry'Ubwikorezi bwo mu Kirere (IATA). Mu 2016, yahawe icyemezo cy'umutekano ku bikorwa byo ku butaka (ISAGO). Mu 2017, Bene yayihaye uburenganzira bwo gukorera i Cotonou.\nMuri Mata 2018, Yvonne Makolo yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa RwandAir.\nMu 2020, Qatar Airways yatangaje ko ishaka kugura imigabane 49% ya RwandAir. Kugeza mu 2023, ayo masezerano yari ataranozwa. Muri Nzeri 2022, RwandAir yatangaje ko ishaka kwinjira mu ihuriro ry'indege Oneworld.\nIbikorwa.\nUbuyobozi.\nRwandAir ni iya Leta y'u Rwanda 100%. Umuyobozi mukuru wayo ni Yvonne Makolo kuva mu 2018.\nIndege n'ingendo.\nMu 2025, RwandAir yari ifite indege 14. Zirimo Airbus A330, Boeing 737-800, Bombardier CRJ900 na Dash 8. Muri uwo mwaka, umuyobozi wayo yatangaje intego yo gukuba kabiri umubare w'indege mu myaka itanu.\nMu 2018, RwandAir yajyaga ahantu 23. Ahenshi ni muri Afurika. Yajyaga kandi i Londres n'i Bruxelles. Mu 2025, yatangaje ingendo nshya zijya i Mombasa no muri Zanzibar."}
{"id": "16670", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16670", "title": "Ikigo gishinzwe indege za gisivili", "text": "Rwanda Civil Aviation Authority Ikigo gishinzwe iby'indege za gisivili mu Rwanda (RCAA, Kinyarwanda) ni ubuyobozi bwindege za gisivili zo mu Rwanda. Icyicaro cyayo kiri ku Kibuga cy'Indege Mpuzamahanga cya Kigali. Ni Ububasha bwashyizweho nk'ikigo gishinzwe indege za gisivili n'Itegeko No 21/2004 ryo ku wa 10/08/2004, risimbuza ikigo cy'indege cy'u Rwanda, cyari cyashinzwe muri 1986. Itegeko ryakurikiyeho No 44/2006 ryo kuwa 05/10/2006 ryongeye guhindura m'umuryango nka RCAA. "}
{"id": "16671", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16671", "title": "Rwanda Civil Aviation Authority", "text": "Rwanda Civil Aviation Authority Ikigo gishinzwe iby'indege za gisivili mu Rwanda (RCAA, Kinyarwanda) ni ubuyobozi bw'indege za gisivili zo mu Rwanda. Icyicaro cyayo kiri ku Kibuga cy'Indege Mpuzamahanga cya Kigali. Ni Ububasha bwashyizweho nk'ikigo gishinzwe indege za gisivili n'Itegeko No 21/2004 ryo ku wa 10/08/2004, risimbuza ikigo cy'indege cy'u Rwanda, cyari cyashinzwe muri 1986. Itegeko ryakurikiyeho No 44/2006 ryo kuwa 05/10/2006 ryongeye guhindura m'umuryango nka RCAA. "}
{"id": "16672", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16672", "title": "Kandt House Museum", "text": "Kandt House Museum ni Inzu Ndangamurage ya Kandt, yahoze yitwa Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Amateka Kamere, iherereye mu cyahoze ari umujyi wa Kigali, Akarere ka Nyarugenge, mu burengerazuba bwawo. Aha hantu hatoranijwe nk'umurwa mukuru w\u2019abakoloni mu Rwanda mu Budage muri 1907 n\u2019umuturage w\u2019Umudage (Administrator) Richard Kandt ku izina rya Nyarugenge. Izina ryahinduwe Kigali muri 1908 kuko byari bigoye cyane ko abakoloni bavuga. Ariko izina Kigali ryitiriwe Umwami Cyirima I Rugwe mu kinyejana cya cu 14 mu kwita izina ubu musozi wa Kigali.\nHanyuma, igitekerezo cya Richard Kandt, hamwe n\u2019abandi bayobozi b\u2019igisirikare cy\u2019abakoloni, Abanyarwanda batangiye kubaka inyubako z\u2019ubuyobozi, harimo n\u2019iyi nyubako ndangamurage muri 1908. Iyi niyo nyubako yonyine isigaye kuva mu mwaka wo muri 1908. Kubera iyo mpamvu, iyi nyubako yavuguruwe muri 2004 ihinduka nk'inzu ndangamurage y\u2019amateka karemano yerekana umutungo kamere w\u2019u Rwanda. Byongeye kandi, ku ya 17 Ukuboza 2017, inzu ndangamurage yahinduye izina yitwa Inzu Ndangamurage ya Kandt hamwe n\u2019imurikagurisha rishya ryerekana amateka y\u2019u Rwanda mbere ndetse no mu bukoloni bw\u2019Abadage ku izina rishya ry\u2019ingoro ndangamurage ya Kandt. Hariho kandi iyerekanwa ry\u2019ibikururuka bizima nka ingona za Nili, inzoka nka mamba yirabura, python, cobra, nizindi ziboneka mu cyaro cyu Rwanda.\nIyi ngoro ndangamurage iri munsi y\u2019ishuri ry\u2019umurage ndangamuco mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "16673", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16673", "title": "Uganda Airlines", "text": "Uganda Airlines ni indege ya Uganda iri mu yahoze izwi nka Flag Carrier, Iyi sosiyete ni ubukombe kuko yakoze kuva 1977 kugeza 2001 mbere yo kwitwa Uganda Airlines. yakomeje Ubwikorezi muri Kanama 2019. Iyi sosiyete y'indege yanditswe yigenga yanditswe mu gihugu itwara abantu, kandi ifite uburenganzira butangwa na leta mu bikorwa mpuzamahanga.\nAho iherereye.\nIcyicaro gikuru giherereye mu kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya, mu Karere ka Wakiso, nko mu bilometero 34 (21 mi), ku muhanda, mu majyepfo y\u2019akarere ka bucuruzi hagati ya, umurwa mukuru n\u2019umujyi muri Uganda\nAmateka.\nNyuma y\u2019ubushakashatsi n\u2019inama nyinshi, y\u2019Abaminisitiri ya Uganda yahisemo kongera gutangiza indege ya Uganda Airlines, [19] ifite indege nshya esheshatu, ebyiri muri zo zikaba ari umubiri mugari, intera ndende A330-800 naho izindi enye zikaba indege CRJ900. 20] Ubushakashatsi bwasabye leta gushora imari ingana na miliyoni 70 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika n\u2019inguzanyo ingana na miliyoni 330 z\u2019amadolari y\u2019Amerika, yatijwe n\u2019abatanga inguzanyo mu karere nka Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019iterambere, kugira ngo barangize.\nMuri Gicurasi 2018, yatangaje ko guverinoma ya Uganda yashyize amafaranga make kuri buri ndege esheshatu, mu gihe isoza gahunda yo gutera inkunga. Icyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019indege CRJ900 cyari giteganijwe mu Gushyingo 2018, mu gihe hateganijwe ko hatangwa indege mu Kuboza 2020"}
{"id": "16675", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16675", "title": "Agace kahariwe bose k'ubucuruzi", "text": "Agace kahariwe bose k'ubucuruzi ni akarere kagizwe n'umuryango w\u2019ubucuruzi ukubiyemo ibihugu byashyize umukono ku masezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi buhariwe bose (FTA). Amasezerano nkaya akubiyemo ubufatanye hagati y\u2019ibihugu byibuze bibiri agamije kugabanya inzitizi z\u2019ubucuruzi, igipimo cy\u2019ibicuruzwa bitumizwa mu mahanga n\u2019amahoro, no kongera ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibicuruzwa na serivisi hagati y'ibyo bihugu. Niba abantu basanzwe nabo bafite umudendezo wo kugendanirana hagati y\u2019ibihugu, iyo hiyongereyeho amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi buhariwe bose, bifatwa nk\u2019umupaka ufunguye. Bishobora gufatwa nk'icyiciro cya kabiri cyo kwishyira hamwe mu bukungu. \nIhuriro ry\u2019amahoro ni ubwoko bwihariye bw'ubucuruzi buhariwe bose. Aho uturere twose dufite gahunda z'amasezerano y'imbere, aho amashyaka ashyira mu ngiro kugirango habeho ubwisanzure kandi horoshywe ubucuruzi hagati yabo. Itandukaniro rikomeye hagati y\u2019amashyirahamwe ya gasutamo n\u2019ubucuruzi buhariwe bose ni uburyo bwabo ku bandi bantu bihariye. Mu gihe ihuriro rya gasutamo risaba impande zose gushyiraho no gukomeza imisoro imwe yo hanze ku bijyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019abatavuga rumwe n\u2019ubutegetsi, impande z\u2019ubucuruzi buhariwe bose ntizubahirizwa. Ahubwo, bashobora gushyiraho no gukomeza uburyo ubwo aribwo bwose bw'amahoro bukoreshwa mu bitumizwa mu mashyaka nkuko bibaye ngombwa. Mu karere k\u2019ubucuruzi bwisanzuye nta guhuza ibiciro byo hanze, kugira ngo bikureho ingaruka z\u2019ibiciro by\u2019ubucuruzi, amashyaka azashyiraho uburyo bw\u2019amategeko agenga inkomoko. \nIjambo \"agace k'ubucuruzi buhariwe bose\" ryasobanuwe mbere n'amasezerano rusange yerekeye amahoro n'ubucuruzi (GATT 1994) akubiyemo ubucuruzi bw'ibicuruzwa gusa. Amasezerano afite intego imwe, ni ukuvuga kuzamura ubwisanzure mu bucuruzi muri serivisi, yiswe ingingo ya V y\u2019amasezerano rusange yerekeye ubucuruzi muri serivisi (GATS) nk \"amasezerano yo guhuza ubukungu\". Ariko, mu bikorwa, iryo jambo ubu rikoreshwa cyane mu kwerekeza ku masezerano atareba ibicuruzwa gusa ahubwo anareba serivisi ndetse n\u2019ishoramari.\nIbice byemewe by'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose.\nIshyirwaho ry\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose rifatwa nk'umwihariko ku ihame ry\u2019igihugu cyashyigikiwe cyane (MFN) n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubucuruzi ku isi (WTO) kubera ko ibyifuzo by\u2019amashyaka y\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose biha abayemeje ibirenze ibyo biyemeje. Nubwo ingingo ya XXIV ya GATT yemerera abanyamuryango ba WTO gushinga uduce tw\u2019ubucuruzi tugenewe bose cyangwa kwemeza amasezerano y\u2019agateganyo akenewe kugira ngo ashyirwe mu bikorwa, hari ibintu byinshi byerekeranye n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose, cyangwa amasezerano y\u2019agateganyo aganisha ku bucuruzi bugenewe bose.\nUbwa mbere, imisoro nandi mabwiriza yubahirizwa muri buri gihugu cyashyize umukono ku masezerano y'ubucuruzi bwisanzuye, bikurikizwa mu gihe ubwo bucuruzi bugenewe bose bwashinzwe, ngo habeho ubuhahirane hagati yabadafite aho bahurira n'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose ntibushobora kuba hejuru cyangwa burenze kubuza kurenza imirimo ijyanye n'andi mabwiriza ariho mu mashyaka amwe asinya mbere yo gushinga agace k'ubucuruzi bwisanzuye. Mu yandi magambo, gushyiraho agace k\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose kugira ngo gatange ubuvuzi bw\u2019ibanze mu banyamuryango bacyo biremewe n\u2019amategeko ya WTO, ariko impande z\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose ntizemerewe gufata nabi amashyaka atari make mbere y\u2019uko ako karere gashyirwaho. Ikintu cya kabiri gisabwa giteganywa n'ingingo ya XXIV ni uko amahoro n\u2019izindi nzitizi z\u2019ubucuruzi bigomba kuvaho kugira ngo horoherezwe ubucuruzi bwose buri mu bucuruzi bugenewe bose. \nAmasezerano y'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose agizwe n'agace ku bucuruzi buhariwe bose muri rusange aboneka hanze y'ubucuruzi bwa sisitemu nyinshi. Icyakora, abanyamuryango ba WTO bagomba kumenyesha Ubunyamabanga igihe bagiranye amasezerano mashya y\u2019ubucuruzi buhariwe bose kandi ahanini inyandiko z\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi buhariwe bose zigomba gusuzumwa na komite ishinzwe amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi mu karere. N\u2019ubwo amakimbirane avuka mu duce tw'ubucuruzi buhariwe bose adashobora kuburanishwa n\u2019urwego rushinzwe gukemura amakimbirane ya WTO, \"nta cyemeza ko inteko za WTO zizubahiriza kandi zikanga gukoresha ububasha mu rubanza runaka\". \nInkingi z'ubukungu bw'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose.\nGutandukanya ubucuruzi no guhanga ubucuruzi\nMuri rusange, \"gutandukanya ubucuruzi\" bivuze ko agace kahariwe ubucuruzi bugenewe bose kazayobora ubucuruzi kure yabatanga ibicuruzwa neza hanze y'akarere bakerekeza kubidakorwa neza mu karere. Mu gihe, \"guhanga ubucuruzi\" bivuze ko agace kahariwe ubucuruzi bugenewe bose gahanga ubucuruzi bushobora kuba butari busanzweho. Muri byose, ubucuruzi buzamura imibereho n'ubukungu bw'igihugu. \nKurema ubucuruzi no gutandukanya ubucuruzi n'ingaruka z'ingenzi ziboneka mu gushyiraho akarere k'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose. Guhanga ubucuruzi bizatuma ibicuruzwa biva mu bicuruzwa bihendutse bikajya ku giciro gito, kandi ubucuruzi buzaguka. Ibinyuranye, gutandukana mu bucuruzi bizatuma ubucuruzi buva mu bicuruzwa bidahenze hanze y'akarere bikajya mu bindi bihenze imbere y'akarere. Ihinduka nkiryo ntirizagirira akamaro abakiriya mu bucuruzi bugenewe bose kuko babuze amahirwe yo kugura ibicuruzwa bihendutse bitumizwa mu mahanga. Icyakora, abahanga mu bukungu basanga gutandukana mu bucuruzi bitajya byangiza imibereho rusange y\u2019igihugu: bishobora no guteza imbere imibereho rusange y\u2019igihugu niba ingano y\u2019ubucuruzi butandukanye ari nto. \nAgace kahariwe ubucuruzi bugenewe bose nk'ibicuruzwa rusange\nAbashinzwe ubukungu bagerageje gusuzuma urugero aho ubucuruzi bw\u2019ubuntu bushobora gufatwa nkibicuruzwa rusange. Babanje gukemura ikintu kimwe cyingenzi cy\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ubuntu, aribwo buryo bw\u2019inkiko zashyizweho zikora nk\u2019abakemurampaka mu makimbirane y\u2019ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga. Ubu buryo nk'imbaraga zo gusobanura amategeko ariho na politiki mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubukungu byemejwe mu masezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi. \nUburyo bwa kabiri aho ubucuruzi bugenewe bose bufatwa nk'ibicuruzwa rusange bifitanye isano n'iterambere ryabo rihinduka \"byimbitse\". Ubutumburuke bw'ubucuruzi bwisanzuye bivuga ubwoko bwongeyeho bwa politiki y'imiterere ikubiyemo. Mu gihe amasezerano y'ubucuruzi ashaje afatwa nk '\u201cubushake buke\u201d kuko akubiyemo uduce duke (nk'ibiciro n'amahoro), amasezerano aheruka gusinywa yerekeye izindi nzego nyinshi, kuva kuri serivisi kugeza ku ubucuruzi bukorewe ku ikoranabuhanga no kumenyekanisha amakuru. Kubera ko ubucuruzi hagati y\u2019amashyaka y\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose buhendutse ugereranije n\u2019abafite amashyaka, ahantu hagenewe ubucuruzi bugenewe bose usanga bidashoboka. Noneho ko amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi yimbitse azamura ihuzwa ry\u2019amabwiriza kandi yongera urujya n\u2019uruza mu bucuruzi n\u2019abatari mu mashyaka, bityo bigabanye inyungu za FTA, uduce dushya twahariwe ubucuruzi bugenewe bose tubona ibintu by'ingenzi biranga ibicuruzwa rusange. \nKuzuza ibyifuzo bigendanye n'uduce tw'ubucuruzi tugenewe bose.\nBitandukanye n\u2019amashyirahamwe ya gasutamo, impande z\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose ntizigumana amahoro asanzwe yo hanze, bivuze ko bakoresha imisoro itandukanye, kimwe n'izindi politiki zerekeye abatari abanyamuryango. Iyi mikorere itanga amahirwe yabatari abanyamashyaka bashobora kugendera ku buntu mu bucuruzi bugenewe bose bwinjira mu masoko hamwe n\u2019ibiciro byo hasi byo hanze. Izi ngaruka zisaba ko hashyirwaho amategeko kugirango hamenyekane ibicuruzwa biva mu mahanga byemerewe byemerewe ahantu h\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose, icyifuzo kidaturuka ku ishingwa ry\u2019amashyirahamwe ya gasutamo. Ahanini, haribisabwa ku rwego ntarengwa rwo gutunganya ibivamo \"guhinduka gukomeye\" ku bicuruzwa kugirango bibonwe ko byaturutse. Mu gusobanura ibicuruzwa bikomoka muri PTA, amategeko y'ingenzi agenga inkomoko atandukanya ibicuruzwa bituruka n'ibidakomoka: gusa abambere nibo bazahabwa uburenganzira bw'amahoro yagenwe n'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose, aba nyuma bagomba kwishyura amahoro ya MFN ku byinjiye. \nTwijeje ko mu kwemererwa gukurikiza inkomoko, hariho uburyo butandukanye bwo gutandukanya inyongeramusaruro zikomoka mu bucuruzi bugenewe bose no hanze yako gace. Mu bisanzwe inyongeramusaruro ikomoka mu mashyaka imwe ya FTA izafatwa nk'inkomoko kurundi ruhande niba zinjijwe mu bikorwa byo gukora murindi shyaka. Rimwe na rimwe, ibiciro by'umusaruro bivuka mu mashyaka imwe nabyo bifatwa nk'ibikomoka mu rindi shyaka. Mu mategeko agena inkomoko, ubwo buryo bwo kuvura butandukanye butangwa mu buryo bwo gukusanya cyangwa kwakira. Iyi ngingo isobanura kandi uburyo bwo guhanga ibicuruzwa no gutandukanya ubucuruzi bw\u2019akarere kahariwe ubucuruzi bugenewe bose twavuze haruguru, kubera ko umuburanyi w\u2019akarere k\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose afite ubushake bwo gukoresha inyongeramusaruro zikomoka mu rindi shyaka kugira ngo ibicuruzwa byabo byujuje ibisabwa bitangire. \nUbubikoshingiro ku duce tw'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose.\nKubera ko muri iki gihe hari uduce twinshi tw\u2019ubucuruzi twisanzuye kandi tugirana ibiganiro (abagera kuri 800 bakurikije ITC Amabwiriza agena Inkomoko, kubara kandi n\u2019ubucuruzi budasubirwaho), ni ngombwa ko abashoramari n\u2019abafata ibyemezo bakurikirana uko bahagaze. Hano hari umubare wabikijwe n'amasezerano y'ubucuruzi bugenewe bose aboneka haba kurwego rw'igihugu, uturere cyangwa mpuzamahanga. Bimwe birimo ububiko bw'ububiko shingiro bw'amasezerano y'ubucuruzi yo muri Amerika y'Epfo y'aguye yubatswe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ryunze ubumwe ry\u2019Amerika (ALADI), urubuga ku masezerano y'ubucuruzi n\u2019ubucuruzi mu bihugu bigize ubumwe bw\u2019Uburayi. \nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, hari ububikoshingiro bubiri bw'ingenzi bw'ubuntu bwateguwe n'imiryango mpuzamahanga kubafata ibyemezo n'ubucuruzi:\nSisitemu y'amakuru y'amasezerano y'ubucuruzi mu karere\nNkuko abanyamuryango ba WTO bategekwa kumenyesha Ubunyamabanga amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose, ubu bubikoshingiro bwubatswe bushingiye ku masoko yemewe y\u2019amakuru ku masezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose (byitwa amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi mu karere mu mvugo ya WTO). Ububikoshingiro butuma abakoresha bashaka amakuru ku masezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi yatangajwe na WTO mu gihugu cyangwa ku ngingo (ibicuruzwa, serivisi cyangwa ibicuruzwa na serivisi). Ububikoshingiro butanga abakoresha urutonde ruvuguruwe rw'amasezerano yose akurikizwa, icyakora, abatamenyeshejwe WTO bashobora kubura. Yerekana kandi raporo, imbonerahamwe n'ibishushanyo bikubiyemo imibare kuri aya masezerano, na byumwihariko isesengura ry'ibiciro. \nIkarita y'imbibi z'isoko rya ITC\nIkarita igaragaza imibibi z'isoko yateguwe n\u2019ikigo mpuzamahanga cy\u2019ubucuruzi (ITC) hagamijwe koroherezwa ubucuruzi kuri, guverinoma n\u2019abashakashatsi mu bibazo byo kubona isoko. Ububikoshingiro, bugaragara hifashishijwe igikoresho cyo kumurongo w'ikoranabuhanga Ikarita yo Kwinjira ku Isoko, ikubiyemo amakuru yerekeye imisoro n\u2019inzitizi zidasoreshwa mu masezerano yose y\u2019ubucuruzi akora, ntagarukira gusa ku bamenyeshejwe ku mugaragaro WTO. Yandika kandi amakuru ku masezerano y'ubucuruzi adakunzwe (urugero, Sisitemu Rusange ya Gahunda Y'ibyifuzo). Kugeza muri 2019, Ikarita yo Kwinjira ku Isoko yatanze amahuza ashobora gukururwa n'amasezerano y'amasomo n'amategeko agenga inkomoko. Ubusobanuro bushya bw'ikarita yinjira ku masoko azaza muri uyu mwaka bizatanga ku miyoboro itaziguye ku rupapuro rw'amasezerano kandi bihuze n'ibindi bikoresho bya ITC, byumwihariko Amategeko agena Inkomoko. Biteganijwe ko kizaba igikoresho kinini gifasha ibigo gusobanukirwa n\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ubucuruzi bugenewe bose no kuzuza ibisabwa ku nkomoko y'amasezerano. "}
{"id": "16676", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16676", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Angola", "text": "Inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo muri Angola zishingiye ku bidukikije by\u2019igihugu, harimo imigezi, amasumo n\u2019inkombe. Inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo za Angola ni shyashya, kubera ko igice kinini cy\u2019igihugu cyashegeshwe mu ntambara y\u2019abenegihugu nyuma y\u2019abakoloni yarangiye mu mwaka wa 2002. Bitandukanye n\u2019ibihugu byinshi byo mu karere, muri rusange biha Amerika, n'Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi, n\u2019abandi baturage benshi viza yo kuhagera cyangwa idasaba viza na gato, Angola ifite ibibazo bya viza bigoye (ibaruwa yemewe y'ubutumire, inyandiko zerekeye intego y'urugendo, kopi y'urugendo rw'ingendo, gihamya y'amafaranga, n'ibindi, byose byoherezwa i Luanda kugira ngo byemezwe). Ubu buryo bugenewe abashyitsi bushyira igihugu ku mbogamizi ku isoko mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ubukerarugendo.\nIbikurura abashyitsi.\nParike y'igihugu ya Cameia.\nParike y'igihugu ya Cameia ni ibikurura abashyitsi muri Angola. Ni parike y'igihugu mu ntara ya Moxico ya Angola, iherereye kuri metero 1100 hejuru y\u2019inyanja. Iragabana izina ryayo hamwe na komine yegeranye ya Cameia. Umuhanda wa Cameia - Luacano ugize umupaka w'amajyaruguru wa parike n'umugezi wa Chifumage ugize igice cy'amajyepfo y'umupaka w'iburasirazuba n'inzuzi za Lumege na Luena umupaka w'amajyepfo-uburengerazuba. Igice kinini cya parike kigizwe n\u2019ibibaya byuzuyemo ibihe bigize igice cy\u2019umugezi wa Zambezi, igice cy\u2019amajyaruguru cya parike kinjira mu ruzi rwa Chifumage. Hariho kandi amashyamba manini ya miombo, asa n'ayari mu kibaya cya Zambezi cyo mu burengerazuba bwa Zambiya. Parike n'icyitegererezo cy'ibidukikije bitagaragara ahandi muri Angola. Ibiyaga bibiri, Lago Cameia na Lago Dilolo (nibyo biyaga binini muri Angola) biri hanze y'imbibi za parike kandi byombi bifite urubingo runini n\u2019ibishanga byatsi bikungahaye ku nyoni zo mu mazi. \nParike y'igihugu ya Cangandala.\nParike y'igihugu ya Cangandala ni ikindi kintu gikurura abashyitsi muri Angola. Ni Parike ntoya mu gihugu kandi iherereye mu ntara ya Malanje. Iherereye hagati y'umugezi wa Cuije n'ubutaka 2 butavuzwe izina bw'umugezi wa Cuanza, hamwe n'umujyi wa Culamagia na Techongolola kumpande za parike. Iyi parike yashinzwe mu 1963 mugihe Angola yari ikiri munsi ya koloni ya Porutugali. \nParike y'igihugu ya Iona.\nParike y'igihugu ya Iona, iherereye mu Ntara ya Namibe, ni ahandi hantu nyaburanga hasurwa. Nibirometero 200 (Mayiro 120) uvuye mu mujyi wa Mo\u00e7\u00e2medes kandi, kuri kilometero kare 15,200 (Mayiro kare 5.850), nini mu gihugu. Mbere y'intambara y'abenegihugu ya Angola, Iona yari \"paradizo y'inyamaswa, ikungahaye ku mukino ukomeye\". Nyamara, nkuko bimeze kuri parike nyinshi zo muri Angola, guhiga mu buryo butemewe no gusenya ibikorwa remezo byangije byinshi muri parike yahoze ikize. Iyi parike izwi kandi ku bimera bidasanzwe n'ibitare bitangaje. \nParike y'igihugu ya Mupa.\nParike y'igihugu ya Mupa mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'intara ya Cunene yatangajwe ko ari Parike y'igihugu ku ya 26 Ukuboza 1964 mu gihe iki gihugu cyari cyikiri mubukoloni bwa Porutugali. Parike ifite akamaro kanini kubiteganijwe (nubwo muri rusange itize) avifauna. Abanya Angola benshi baba muri parike, hamwe n'abashumba b'inzererezi ndetse n'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro bibangamira inyamaswa zo muri parike. Nk\u2019uko ingingo imwe ibivuga, \"N'ubwo parike yabanje gutangazwa kugira ngo irinde amoko yo mu bwoko bwa giraffe, \"Giraffa camelopardalis angolensis\", mu 1974 nta n'umwe wasigaye kubera ko morfologiya ya Giraffe yera ituma ishobora kwibasirwa cyane na mine yasigaye mu ntambara y'abenegihugu ya Angola ugereranije ku yandi moko ya giraffe. Izindi nyamabere zabayeho, zirimo intare, ingwe, imbwa yo mu gasozi n'impyisi ziboneka \".\nInkombe.\nAngola ihana imbibi n'inyanja ya Atalantika kandi ifite kilometero 1.650 z'inkombe."}
{"id": "16677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16677", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri B\u00e9nin", "text": "Ubukerarugendo muri B\u00e9nin ni inganda ntoya. Mu 1996, Benin yari ifite ba mukerarugendo bagera ku 150.000. Kugeza 2014 umubare wazamutse ugera ku 242.000. Igihugu gito gifite ibyiza nyaburanga bikurura ba mukerarugendo, parike y'igihugu ya Benin ndetse n'umuco biri mu bikurura ba mukerarugendo. Abomey ni kamwe mu turere dukurura ba mukerarugendo ba Benin, hamwe n'ingoro zahindutse Umurage w'isi mu 1982. Umurwa mukuru Porto Novo ibyiza nyaburanga birimo ingoro ndangamurage n\u2019ubwubatsi. \nCotonou n'ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cyonyine muri B\u00e9nin. Hariho indege zerekeza muri B\u00e9nin ziva mu Bubiligi, mu Bufaransa, no mu bihugu byinshi bya Afurika. Muri iki gihugu hari kilometero 578 za gari ya moshi, zakozwe ku bufatanye na Repubulika ya Niger. \nGuverinoma ya Benin ibona ubukerarugendo nk'uburyo bwo gutandukanya ubukungu bwabwo, gukurura ishoramari ryinshi mu mahanga, no kugabanya ubwishingizi bwa Benin ku nganda z\u2019ubuhinzi. N'ubwo guverinoma ifite Politiki y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019ubukerarugendo, ntabwo yashyizeho ingufu nyinshi mu kuzamura ibikorwa by\u2019ubukerarugendo cyangwa gucuruza Benin nk'ahantu nyaburanga. \nBimwe mu bice byiza by\u2019inyamanswa muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba biboneka mu majyaruguru ya B\u00e9nin, aho Parike y'igihugu ya Pendjari na Parike y'igihugu ya W biherereye. Igihe cyiza cyo kubona inyamanswa ya Parike ya Pendjari iri hafi kurangira igihe cy'izuba. Parike irashobora kugera kubagenzi kandi amacumbi arahari. Parike y'igihugu ya W iherereye mu majyaruguru ya Benin, kandi ikambukiranya Burkina Faso na Niger. Iyi parike ifite inyamanswa nyinshi, ariko biragoye kuyigeraho muri B\u00e9nin. "}
{"id": "16678", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16678", "title": "Osama Daoud Abdellatif", "text": "Osama Daoud Abdellatif ni umuherwe ukomeye w\u2019umucuruzi wo muri Sudani akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w'ikigo cyitwa DAL Group, n'amasosiyete menshi afite icyicaro i Khartoum, muri Sudani. \nUbucuruzi.\nIkigo cya DAL Group.\nOsama Daoud ni umuyobozi akaba n'uwashinze ikigo cya DAL Group, kigizwe n'umubare munini w'amasosiyete afite icyicaro i Khartoum, muri Sudani. Itsinda rya DAL ribarizwa mu nzego zinyuranye z\u2019ubukungu, nko mu kongera umusaruro w\u2019ibiribwa, ubwubatsi, cyangwa ubucuruzi, binyuze mu masosiyete nka DAL Motors, DAL Engineering, ibiryo bya DAL (birimo ifu ya Sayga, Dairy Blue Nile Dairy, Nobo Pasta,), Sutrac na Sudani Liquid Air, kimwe n'andi masosiyete menshi. \nDAL Group yashinze ishuri ry\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga wa Khartoum (KICS) kandi, mu rwego rwo gushyigikira inshingano z\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, ikora mu bikorwa binyuranye by\u2019umuco, nk\u2019ibirori by\u2019ibiribwa gakondo bya Sudani cyangwa iminsi mikuru yizihiza imigenzo y'umuziki wa Sudani. \nDaoud amaze kuragwa sosiyete ikora ibijyanye n\u2019ubwubatsi n\u2019imashini zikora ubuhinzi mu myaka ya za 1960, Daoud yahise ayagura kugeza ku rwego iriho muri iki gihe nk\u2019umuryango munini wa Sudani. Nubwo Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika yafatiye ibihano byerekeranye n'ubucuruzi hagati ya Sudani, DAL Food Industries yabaye kompanyi ikora amacupa ikanayacuruza kuri Sosiyete ya Coca-Cola muri Sudani.\nUbuzima bwite.\nOsama Daoud arubatse kandi afite abana batandatu."}
{"id": "16679", "revid": "9913", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16679", "title": "Bukonla Adebakin", "text": "Bukonla Adebakin ni umuvugizi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'ubucuruzi wa Nigeriya. Ni umugore ndetse ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ibikorwa bya RED muri Afrika. Niwe kandi uyobora itsinda rya Future Project ritegura ibihembo byitwa Future Awards Afrika. \nUburezi.\nAdebakin yize ubumenyi, ikoranabuhanga n'uburezi muri Kaminuza ya Lagos, yo muri Nigeria."}
{"id": "16680", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16680", "title": "Nonkululeko Gobodo", "text": "Nonkululeko Gobodo (wavutse ku ya 10 Ukwakira 1960, avukira i Mthatha, mu burasirazuba bwa Cape) niwe wabaye umucungamari wa mbere w\u2019umugore w\u2019umwirabura muri Afurika yepfo mu 1987. Mu 2023 yabaye umuyobozi wa kaminuza ya Walter Sisulu.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nAmaze kwiga, Nonkululeko yavugiye muri KPMG, maze ahabwa ubufatanye mu mikoranire arabyanga. Yaje gukora mu kigo cyitwa Transkei Development Corporation, nyuma y'igihe yaje kuzamuka aba umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe imari. Nyuma yibyo, yashinze ikigo cye giciriritse cyitwa Gobodo Incorporated. Yagize uruhare runini mu kuyobora ihuriro rya Gobodo Incorporated na SizweNtsaluba VSP mu mwaka wa 2011 yaje gushinga ikigo cyitwa SizweNtsalubaGobodo, ikigo kinini cy\u2019ibaruramari gifite Afurika y'Epfo. Muri 2014 yeguye ku mirimo y'umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo. \nUmwuga w'ubu.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, yashinze ikigo cya Nkululeko Leadership Consulting (NLC), ni ikigo cy\u2019ubujyanama cy\u2019abayobozi kandi gifite giherereye i Sandton, Johannesburg. Kugeza ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe ubujyanama muri NLC. Ni umuyobozi mukuru utari mu nama ngishwanama mu kigo cya PPC Ltd na Clicks Group Limited. Yagizwe umuyobozi wa kaminuza ya Walter Sisulu kuva ku ya 1 Gicurasi 2023, azatangira inshingano ku mugaragaro ku ya 29 Kamena 2023. "}
{"id": "16681", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16681", "title": "Pam Golding", "text": "Pam Golding (12 Nzeri 1928 - 3 Mata 2018) yari umunya-Afurika y'epfo utunganya imitungo itimukanwa yo muri Afurika yepfo. Binyuze mu kigo cyitwa Pam Golding Properties yashinze mu 1976, ni rimwe mu matsinda manini y\u2019imitungo itimukanwa muri Afurika yepfo, ifite ibiro birenga 300 muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara ndetse no mu mahanga. Umuhungu wa Golding, Andrew Golding, ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo. Golding yapfuye ku ya 3 Mata 2018, afite imyaka 89, yapfiriye iwe mu rugo muri Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo. "}
{"id": "16682", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16682", "title": "Kubi Indi", "text": "Kubi Chaza Indi ni umurwanashyaka w'iterambere wo muri Zimbabwe ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umugore. Akunze gukoresha izina rye rya mbere, Kubi Chaza, yari umukinnyi wa filime mu Bwongereza, agaragara muri \"Live and Let Die\" mu 1973 ari umwanditsi w\u2019igurisha ukorera James Bond. Amaze gusubira muri Zimbabwe, we n'umugabo we w'umukinnyi wa filime witwaJohn Indi batangije uruganda rukora ibicuruzwa by'ubwiza.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nIndi afite uruhare runini mu iterambere ry'imiryango, byumwihariko ku bijyanye n\u2019ibibazo byugarije abagore, kandi ni umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abagore bakora ubucuruzi b\u2019abasangwabutaka bo muri Zimbabwe.\nUmuryango wa Indi wakomeje gukora mu mitunganyirize ya film, John nk'umukinnyi, ariko Kubi kumpande zombi za kamera. Mu 1989, yakoze \"I am the Future\", filime ivuga ku mukobwa ukiri muto (wakinwe na Stella Chiweshe) ujya mu mujyi munini ahunze intambara y'ubwigenge bwa Zimbabwe mu cyaro. Mu 1993, yakinnye eponymous heroine's modern neighbour muri \"Neria\", inyandiko ya Tsitsi Dangarembga ivuga ku bapfakazi muri Zimbabwe. Filime zombi zayobowe na Godwin Mawuru, naho \"Neria\" yagaragayemo amajwi ya Oliver Mtukudzi.\nIndi ni umunyamuryango w'abakora amafilime b'abagore bo muri Zimbabwe.\nUmwuga.\nYakinnye ari umukobwa wakoraga agurisha mu iduka rya Oh Cult Voodoo yaje igihe yari mu Bwongereza, maze abigiramo uruhare. Yakinnye nk'umukobwa ucuruza akorera James Bond (yakinnye na Roger Moore), amupfunyikira ikintu hanyuma avuza Mister Big igihe Bond avuye mu iduka. \nZimbabwe imaze kwigenga, Indi n'umugabo we John basubiye mu gihugu. Ari naho batangiriye uruganda rw'ibicuruzwa by'ubwiza rwitwa Kubi Cosmetics. Ubu ni iduka rizwi cyane muri Afrika yepfo. Ikora ibicuruzwa byumwihariko ku ruhu n'umusatsi wa Afrika. "}
{"id": "16683", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16683", "title": "Tshepo Motsepe", "text": "Tshepo Motsepe (yavutse ku ya 17 Kamena 1953) ni umuganga wo muri Afurika yepfo akaba na rwiyemezamirimo. Ni Madamu wa Perezida wa Afurika y'Epfo, ni umugore wa Cyril Ramaphosa, Perezida wa Afurika y'Epfo. Ni mukuru wa Bridgette Radebe na musaza we ni Patrice Motsepe. \nUbuzima.\nTshepo Motsepe yize nk'umuganga uvura muri kaminuza ya KwaZulu-Natal arangiza icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu buzima rusange mu ishuri ry\u2019ubuzima rusange rya Harvard. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yarangije amasomo y'impamyabushobozi muri gahunda yo kwihangira imirimo (SECP) mu kigo cya Gordon Institute of Business Science. Ubu ni umuyobozi wa African Self Help Trust (ASHA Trust), yibanda ku iterambere ry\u2019abana bato ndetse n\u2019uburezi. \nYakoze mu bikorwa rusange ndetse n'abikorera ku giti cyabo i Mmakau, Mahikeng, Johannesburg, Pretoria, no muri Zimbabwe. Yahoze ari Umuyobozi wungirije w'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi ku buzima bw'imyororokere.\nUmuryango.\nMotsepe yashakanye na Cyril Ramaphosa, Perezida wa Repubulika ya Afurika y'Epfo, bafitanye abana bane. Motsepe ni umugore wa gatatu wa Ramaphosa. Se ni nyakwigendera Chief Augustin Butana Chaane Motsepe, murumuna we ni Patrice Motsepe ukomeye mu bucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro, na mushiki we Bridgette Radebe, umugore w'umunyapolitiki w'ishyaka ryitwa Kongere y'igihugu (ANC) akaba n'uwahoze ari Minisitiri w'ingufu, Jeff Radebe. "}
{"id": "16684", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16684", "title": "Rebecca Naa Dedei Aryeetey", "text": "Rebecca Naa Dedei Aryeetey (1923 - 22 Kamena 1961) uzwi kandi ku izina rya Dedei Ashikishan, yari umudamu ukora umwuga w'ubucuruzi muri Gana, yari umunyapolitiki. Yari azwi cyane ku bucuruzi bw'ifu muri Accra. Niwe mugore kandi ugaragara ku giceri cya 50 cy'amaPesewas. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nRebeca Naa Dedei yavutse mu mwaka wa1923, avukira ahitwa Osu akurira mu mujyi wa James, wo muri Accra. Nyina na se bakomoka muri Ga Asere na Osu. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kwiga amashuri abanza, Naa Dei yahise akora ubucuruzi bw'ifu. Byatumye aba umukire kandi ukomeye cyane mu bucuruzi yakoraga bw'ifu bwamuhesheje izina ry'akabyiniririo rya 'Ashikishan', rikaba ijambo ryo mu rurimi rwitwa Ga rifite igisobanuro cy'ifu. Yari azwiho kuba umunyemari mukuru w'ishyaka rya CPP icyo gihe kandi yayoboye ibikorwa by'abagore ba CPP iwe i Kokomlemle - Accra. Nk'umunyapolitiki uharanira inyungu za CPP, yiyamamaje kandi atera inkunga Nkrumah n\u2019ishyaka rya CPP kandi yagize uruhare runini mu gihe cyo guharanira ubwigenge bwa Gana. Yateye inkunga Nkrumah kugira ngo atsindire intebe y\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko ya Ashiedu Keteke bituma aba Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa mbere wa Gana. \nUrupfu.\nKuba yari umuntu wa hafi ya Nkrumah byatumye aba umwanzi w\u2019ishyaka rya politiki ryari ihanganye bivugwa ko aribyo byamugejeje no kugupfa hakiri kare. Yapfuye urupfu rubabaje mu gikorwa cya CPP i Ho ku ya 22 Kamena 1961 afite imyaka 38. Byaravuzwe ko abarwanashyaka ba politiki n\u2019abagore bahawe uburozi muri icyo gikorwa nyuma yo gufata icyayi gishyushye ubwo yinubira ububabare bwo mu gifu. \nIcyubahiro.\nBisi zifite amagorofa abiri zazanywe mu mujyi wa Accra zizanywe na Harry Sawyer zahise zitiriwa 'Auntie Dedei', yari afite kandi ishusho ye kuri kashe y'igihugu ndetse no ku giceri cya 50 cya pesewa cya Gana, byose mu rwego rwo kumwibuka no kumuha icyubahiro. "}
{"id": "16685", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16685", "title": "Sylvia Nduka", "text": "Sylvia Nduka (yavutse 14 Ukwakira 1992) ni umunyanijeriya wigeze gutsinda mu irushanwa ry'ubwiza ndetse ni rwiyemezamirimo. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nSylvia Nduka akomoka mu gace kitwa Isuofia ni muri Leta ya Anambra. Ni umuhererezi muri bavandimwe be batanu. Yize ibaruramari muri kaminuza ya Lagos.\nUmwuga.\nUmukobwa mwiza cyane muri Nigeriya 2011.\nYahataniye ikamba rya Nyampinga Miss Taraba mu marushanwa. aratsinda, yahawe imodoka ya Hyundai na miliyoni 3 naira.\nUmushinga.\nIntego z'ibanze mu mushinga we, 'Sylvia Educational Foundation', ni ugushinga umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta wahaye imbaraga abantu binyuze mu burezi kandi ukita ku bana badafite amahirwe. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSylvia Nduka yashinze kandi anayobora ikigo cyita k'umusatsi wa Sylvia, ubucuruzi bwo kwita k'umusatsi. "}
{"id": "16686", "revid": "16550", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16686", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Botswana", "text": "Botswana y'ibyingenzi bikurura ba mukerarugendo n'ububiko bw'imikino, hamwe no guhiga hamwe na safari yo gufotora irahari. Ibindi bikurura ibyiza harimo akarere ka Okavango Delta, mu gihe cy'imvura ni akajagari k'inzira z'amazi, ibirwa, n'ibiyaga. Inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo nazo zafashije mu gutandukanya ubukungu bwa Botswana buturuka ahantu gakondo nka diyama n\u2019inka ndetse bihanga imirimo 23.000 mu 2005. \nIterambere ry'inganda m'ubukerarugendo.\nInganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo za Botswana zatangiye gutera imbere mu rwego rwa politiki y'imiterere nziza mu myaka ya za 90. Afurika y'amajyepfo yagize umutekano mu bya politiki nyuma y'ivangura ndetse no kurekurwa kwa Nelson Mandela mu 1990. Iterambere ry\u2019isi mu buryo bwo gutwara abantu n\u2019itumanaho ry'icyo gihe ryarushijeho kugira uruhare mu bukerarugendo muri Botswana. Mu 1990 Botswana yashyize mu bikorwa Politiki y'Ubukerarugendo igamije kongera umubare w'ubukerarugendo, amafaranga yinjira muri leta, n'amahirwe yo kubona akazi. Politiki yibanze ku gukurura ba mukerarugendo mpuzamahanga ku isoko baturutse mu Burayi, Amerika y'Amajyaruguru, Ositaraliya, na Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande kugira ngo bongere amafaranga. Mu gihe igipimo cy\u2019akazi cyazamutse neza hamwe n\u2019inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo zingana na 4.5% by\u2019imirimo isanzwe yemewe muri Botswana, imyanya myinshi y\u2019imicungire y\u2019imishahara myinshi mu nganda yagenewe abakozi bo mu mahanga.\nUbukerarugendo bwa Ongera uhindure Botswana bwabaye mu 2020 hagamijwe kongera ubukerarugendo bwo mu gihugu. \nIngaruka mbonezamubano n\u2019ibidukikije.\nBotswana yishingikiriza ku mutungo kamere haba mu mibereho rusange n'ubukerarugendo. Umutungo kamere muke kandi woroshye w'igihugu ni ingenzi cyane mu buzima bw'icyaro, bukoresha amazi, amashyamba, nubutaka. Agace ka Okavango Delta ni ahantu nyaburanga hasurwa na ba mukerarugendo ndetse ni n'umurage w'isi nka kimwe muri delta nini zo mu gihugu imbere ku isi. Kuba harakunzwe na ba mukerarugendo byatumye iterambere ry\u2019ibikorwa remezo ryaguka, ndetse n'ibikoresho, na serivisi mu karere birimo amabanki, amahoteri, n\u2019indege. Icyakora, abaturage bo mu midugudu ya Khwai, Mababe na Sankoyo muri Okavango binubira ko badafite umutungo kamere w\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya Moremi kuko yiganjemo ba mukerarugendo mpuzamahanga ndetse n\u2019amasosiyete y\u2019ubukerarugendo yo mu mahanga. Ibikorwa byubukerarugendo bwa Botswanan byasobanuwe nka ahantu hateganijwe ibikorwa by'ubukerarugendo kandi bigateranirizwa mu karere gato, ibikoresho byonyine bidatanga ibikorwa byinshi by'ubukungu mu turere tuyikikije.\nNubwo igice kinini gikurura abantu gishingiye ku mutungo kamere w\u2019igihugu, inganda zubukerarugendo ubwazo zitanga umutungo nyirizina wahinduye ibicuruzwa byangiritse. Amatsinda manini y'abantu mumatsinda y'ubukerarugendo ashobora guhungabanya inyamanswa akaziyobora ku kwimukira ahandi hantu ziashobora kuba zitamenyera. Imyanda isigwa nabamukerarugendo ishobora kandi guhindura imiterere y'ubutaka no kumenyekanisha amoko yangiza mu karere. Ibindi bikorwa by'ubukerarugendo bizwi cyane nk'ubwato bwihuta bishobora kurushaho guhungabanya inyamaswa zo mu mazi mugihe inyamanswa n\u2019ifoto z\u2019inyoni bishobora kugoreka imyitwarire y'ubwoko runaka harimo kugaburira no korora. \nBotswana yagerageje uburyo butandukanye bwo kubungabunga umutungo kamere harimo n\u2019imicungire y\u2019umutungo kamere w\u2019abaturage (CBNRM), ikaba ishingiye ku kwibwira ko abaturage baho bafite ubushake bwinshi kandi biyemeje kurushaho gukoresha umutungo kamere aho batuye ugereranije na guverinoma yakuweho. Nyamara, kubura amikoro n'ubuhanga mu baturage bikunze kubatera kwishingikiriza kumfashanyo yabafatanyabikorwa mpuzamahanga kugirango bagere ku ntego zabo ebyiri zo kuzamura iterambere ry'ubukungu no kubungabunga umutungo kamere. \nKwagura ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku muco muri Botswana bifite ubushobozi bwo kurushaho guteza imbere ubukerarugendo mu kugabanya umuvuduko mu mihanda ahantu nyaburanga hakurura inyamaswa mu gihe\u00a0 hashyirwaho uburyo bunoze bwo gukwirakwiza iterambere ry\u2019ubukerarugendo mu guha amahirwe menshi abaturage baho kugira uruhare mu bukungu bw\u2019ubukerarugendo. Ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku muco butanga amahirwe kuri ba mukerarugendo mu kwiga ibijyanye n'ubuhanzi, umurage, n'imigenzo yaho. Bamwe bavuga ko bishobora kuzamura ubukungu bw\u2019abaturage, guhanga imirimo, kuzamura ubumwe n\u2019ishema ry\u2019umuco, no kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019ibikorwa remezo. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku midugudu bwibanda kandi ku kwereka ba mukerarugendo ubukorikori gakondo ndetse n'ubuzima bwa buri munsi, ibyo bikaba byiza cyane cyane ku bagore, bakunze gusigara mu nyungu z'ubukerarugendo. Amafaranga ava mu bukerarugendo bushingiye ku midugudu atanga amahirwe yo kwihugura mu imyuga no kwihangira imirimo ku bagore baho. Akazi mu mudugudu wabo kavukire gatuma abagore basohoza inshingano zo mu miryango mu gihe babonye ubwigenge bw'amafaranga. \nIbikurura abashyitsi.\nAmahoteri, amacumbi hamwe n\u2019ahantu hakambitse.\nBotswana iha abagenzi guhitamo amacumbi kuva muri hoteri z'ubukerarugendo zo mu rwego rwo hejuru, amacumbi meza ndetse n\u2019inkambi za safari, guteganya amazu yabatumirwa hamwe n'inkambi. Ahantu nyaburanga hasurwa hafite amacumbi yigenga, inkambi za safari, hamwe n\u2019ahantu hakambika abantu.\nIbyokurya bitandukanye bitangwa mu mahoteri na resitora kuva aho ukunda n'inyama zimikino, kugeza kumugabane wa Aziya no muri Aziya. Hano hari ibicuruzwa byinshi byihuse hamwe na resitora ntoya / gufata ibyokurya byaho. Kumurongo wuzuye wamacumbi, urashobora gushakisha mubukerarugendo muri Botswana - Urubuga rwubukerarugendo rwa Afrika.\nParike z'igihugu.\nIcyanya cyo hagati cya Kalahari.\nIcyanya cyo hagati cya Kalahari ni parike nini yigihugu mu butayu bwa Kalahari ya Botswana. Yashinzwe mu 1961 ifite ubuso bungana na 52.800\u00a0km 2, ikabikigira icyanya cya kabiri kinini ku isi. Iyi pariki irimo inyamanswa nka giraffe, impyisi yijimye, warthog, impyisi, imbwa yo mu gasozi, ingwe, intare, inyamanswa yubururu, itamu, gemsbok, kudu na hartebeest itukura.\nParike y'igihugu ya Chobe.\nParike y'igihugu ya Chobe, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Botswana, ifite imwe mu cyanya kinini kibanda ku mugabane wa Afurika. Ku bunini, iyi ni parike ya gatatu nini mu gihugu, nyuma y'Icyanya cyo hagati cya Kalahari Hagati na Parike y\u2019igihugu ya Gemsbok, kandi iratandukanye cyane. Iyi nayo ni parike yambere y'igihugu.\nParike ya Kgalagadi Transfrontier.\nPariki ya Kgalagadi Transfrontier ni agace kanini ko kubungabunga ubuzima bw'inyamanswa no kubungabunga ibidukikije mu majyepfo ya Afurika. Iyi parike ihuza umupaka uhuza Afurika y'Epfo na Botswana kandi igizwe na parike ebyiri zegeranye: Parike y'igihugu ya Kalahari Gemsbok muri Afurika y'Epfo na Parike y'igihugu ya Gemsbok muri Botswana. Ubuso bwa parike ni kilometero kare 38000 (milimetero kare 14,668). Hafi ya bitatu bya kane bya parike biri muri Botswana na kimwe cya kane muri Afrika yepfo.\nAmakuru y'ubukerarugendo.\nPolitiki y\u2019igihugu yo kubungabunga ibidukikije n\u2019ubukerarugendo bwa guverinoma ya Botswana yashyizweho hagamijwe guteza imbere ubukerarugendo mu gihe harinzwe ibice by\u2019ibinyabuzima. Abaturage bo muri Amerika, Afurika y'Epfo, ibihugu bigize Umuryango w'ibihugu bikoresha ururimi r'icyongereza, ndetse n'ibihugu byinshi byo mu Burayi bw'i Burengerazuba ntibakenera viza yo kumara iminsi itarenze 91. Icyangobwa cy'inzira cyirakenerwa kugirango habeho ingendo mu gihugu. Icyemezo cyumuriro wumuhondo hamwe n'inkingo za kolera birasabwa ba mukerarugendo baturutse ahantu banduye. \nRaporo y\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019ubukungu ku isi ku bijyanye n\u2019ubukerarugendo n\u2019ubukerarugendo ku isi byashyize urwego Botswana rwa 88 mu bihugu 141 mu rutonde rw\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019ubukerarugendo n\u2019ubukerarugendo mu mwaka wa 2015. Raporo imwe yashimye ibyiza bikurura bya Botswana, kandi igipimo cyo hasi cyatewe n\u2019ibibazo byugarije ba mukerarugendo, harimo kutabona ikoranabuhanga rigezweho, imihanda mibi n\u2019itumanaho. \nImibare.\nMu 1999, hari ibyumba bya hoteri 2100 bifite ibitanda 3,720 nigipimo cya 53%. Abashyitsi 843.314 bageze muri Botswana muri uwo mwaka hamwe n\u2019abasaga 720.000 baturutse mu bindi bihugu bya Afurika. Amafaranga yinjira mu bukerarugendo mu mwaka wa 2000 yose hamwe angana na miliyoni 313 z'amadolari. Mu 2003, Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika yavuze ko impuzandengo ya buri munsi yo kuguma muri Gaborone ari amadorari 129, ugereranije na Kasane ku madolari 125. Ibiciro birashobora kuba munsi y'amadorari 50 mu tundi turere tw'igihugu. Botswana ifatwa nk'igihugu gifite umutekano mu gusurwa muri Afurika. \nAbashyitsi benshi bageze muri Botswana bavuze ko ibiruhuko ari intego yabo yo kwinjira mu 2014 baturutse mu bihugu bikurikira by\u2019ubwenegihugu: "}
{"id": "16687", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16687", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Burkinafaso", "text": "Guverinoma ya Burkina Faso ivuga ko mu mwaka wa 2011 ba mukerarugendo 433,778 basuye iki gihugu \nIkigo.\nOuagadougou.\nAhantu hagaciro mu bukerarugendo muri Ouagadougou harimo: Pariki ya Bangr Weogo Urban Park, Ingoro Ndangamurage ya Burkina Faso, Imurikagurisha mpuzamahanga ry\u2019ubugeni n\u2019ubukorikori, hamwe n\u2019ibirori bya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican bya Ouagadougou.\nZiniar\u00e9.\nAhantu nyaburanga muri Ziniar\u00e9 harimo: Pariki y\u2019inyamanswa ya Ziniare, inama nyunguranabitekerezo ya granite, iba buri myaka ibiri, hamwe n\u2019inzu ndangamurage ya Manega. \nKoudougou.\nImbuga nyaburanga muri Koudougou zirimo ingona ntagatifu za Sabou. \nIburengerazuba.\nBobo-Dioulasso.\nAhantu nyaburanga muri Bobo-Dioulasso harimo: Umusigiti Mukuru, imva ya Guimbi Ouattara, Inzu Ndangamurage y\u2019Intara ya Houet, na Guinguette. \nBanfora.\nAhantu hashimishije muri Banfora harimo: Isumo Kamere rya Banfora, Ikiyaga cya Tengrela, na Peaks ya Sindou. \nIburasirazuba.\nDiapaga.\nAhantu hashimishije muri Diapaga harimo: Pariki yigihugu ya Arli, Parike y'igihugu ya W, n\u2019imisozi ya Gobnangou. \nSahel.\nDjibo.\nAhantu hashimishije muri Djibo harimo inzu ndangamurage ya kera ya Pob\u00e9 Mengao hamwe n\u2019ibishushanyo mbonera bya Pob\u00e9 Mengao. \nGorom Gorom.\nAhantu hashimishijwe muri Gorom Gorom harimo Centre Feminine Artisan Centre ya Gorom hamwe n'ingando y'ubukerarugendo ya Gorom Gorom. "}
{"id": "16688", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16688", "title": "Ndi Okereke-Onyiuke", "text": "Ndi Okereke-Onyiuke (wavutse ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 1950) yahoze ari umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ikigo cy'imari n'imigabane muri Nijeriya akaba ari nawe wabaye umucuruzi w'imigabane wa mbere w'umugore muri Nijeriya.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAmashuri yisumbuye yayize mu kigo cyitwa ishuri ry\u2019umwamikazi, giherereye Enugu, muri Nijeriya. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'ubucuruzi n'imiyoborere aho yari yize ubumenyi mu by'imari n'ubumenyi bwa mudasobwa abyiga muri kaminuza yo mu mujyi wa New York, muri Leta zunze ubumwe z'Amerika. N'ubwo Okereke-Onyiuke yavugaga ko yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Dogiteri murir Filozofiya) ndetse na Dogiteri w\u2019imiyobore n'umutekano w'Isoko ry\u2019Imari n\u2019imigabane yakuye mu Ishuri Rikuru rya kaminuza imwe, nta nyandiko ivuga ko kaminuza yavuze ko yitabiriyemo iyo gahunda kandi ko yahawe impamyabumenyi. Ndi Okereke-Onyiuke yatangiye gukorana n\u2019isoko ry'imari n'imigabane rya Nijeriya muri Mutarama 1983 nk'umuyobozi mukuru akaba n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe ubushakashatsi n\u2019amakuru.\nUmwuga.\nYazamutse ku mwanya wo hejuru w\u2019Umuyobozi Mukuru n\u2019Umuyobozi nshingwabikorwa w\u2019isoko ry'imari n'imigabane ya Nijeriya (NSE). Ndi Okereke Onyiuke ni umwe mu bagore bazwi cyane muri Nijeriya bahawe inshingano ku myanya ikomeye kandi y'ingirakamaro mu buyobozi na politiki. Niwe mugore wambere wigeze gufata umwanya wa Diregiteri wa NSE.\u00a0\nNdi Okereke-Onyiuke ni umwe mu bandi bahawe igihembo na Professional Excellence Foundation yo muri Nijeriya (PEFON) kubera ibikorwa by'indashyikirwa no kuyobora neza mu mwuga wabo \nMuri Nigeriya.\nNdi Okereke-Onyiuke wari umunyamigabane wu mugore ntacyo atakoze gitandukanye nkiri DG kuko kuva umunsi wambere nashizeho, natoje abantu benshi. Naje gufasha Nijeriya kugira ivunjisha rya mbere ku isi, kandi nakomeje kubikora. Sisitemu ikora ishyirahamwe. Twari twarashyizeho imiterere ikwiye kugirango tumenye neza ko sisitemu ikora, yaba umuyobozi mukuru cyangwa adahari. Ni nako bigenda ku bayobozi b'amashami. Twabonye abakozi bafite impano ikomeye, tubashora mubikorwa kandi tubahemba uko bikwiye. Ntamwanya numwe wabaye mubi."}
{"id": "16689", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16689", "title": "Dorothy Ooko", "text": "Dorothy Akinyi Ooko ni umunyakenya uharanira inyungu rusange akaba n'umuhanga mu ikoranabuhanga.\nYavukiye mu bitaro bya Mater, i Nairobi, Yize mu ishuri ribanza rya Fort Hall Road mu mujyi yavukiyemo hanyuma yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye ry\u2019abakobwa rya Pangani mu cyiciro rusange nyuma asoza amashuri y'icyiciro cyisumbuye mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Alliance Girls. Nyuma yagiye muri kaminuza ya \"Universit\u00e9 de Haute Bretagne\" mu Bufaransa, aho yize \"Lettres Modernes\" mbere yo kwimuka ngo ajye mu rurimi rw'icyongereza. Yagarutse muri Kenya ahigira impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'Igifaransa n'Icyongereza mu buvanganzo kuva 1985-1988. Yigishije mu kigo cya Mukumu Girls igihe gito hanyuma ahabwa buruse yo gukorera impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'igifaransa yakuye muri kaminuza ya Kenya. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri muri kaminuza mu ishami ry'imiyoborere mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza mpuzamahanga yo muri Amerika (USIU).\nOoko ni umuyobozi ushinzwe itumanaho, Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'ibihugu bikoresha ururimi rw'Igifaransa muri sosiyete ya Google ikorera i Nairobi. Mbere yibyo, yakoreraga Nokia i Nairobi.\nIbyagezweho.\nOoko yagize uruhare mu kuyobora umushinga wo gukuraho umusoro ku nyongeragaciro (TVA) kuri terefone zigendanwa muri Kenya. Mu rwego rw'itsinda rya Nokia y'Iburasirazuba no mu majyepfo ya Afurika, yakoranye n'itsinda rya LG, Safaricom hamwe n'abacuruza telefone zigendanwa. "}
{"id": "16690", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16690", "title": "Kornelia Shilunga", "text": "Kornelia Kashiimbindjola Shilunga (wavutse ku ya 25 Gicurasi 1970, avukira ahitwa Okadila, ni mu Karere ka Oshana) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu gihugu cya Namibiya akaba n'umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko kuva mu 2015, kuri ubu afite inshingano zo kuba Minisitiri wungirije w\u2019ibirombe n\u2019ingufu. ndetse yabaye Minisitiri wungirije wa mbere w'umugore muri Minisiteri. Shilunga yubatse amateka ashimishije mu kazi yakoze. Minisitiri wungirije yakoze mu myanya itandukanye nk'umwarimu n'umuforomo w'umwuga. \nUburezi.\nShilunga afite impamyabumenyi ebyiri z'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza, imwe mu buyobozi bw'ubucuruzi yakoreye mu kigo gishinzwe imiyoborere mu Burasirazuba bwa Afurika y'Amajyepfo (ESAMI), n'indi mpamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'amahame rusange n'Ubuyobozi yakoreye muri kaminuza ya Namibiya (UNAM). Impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu burezi bw\u2019abaforomo n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage hamwe na Diplome mu bumenyi rusange bw\u2019ubuforomo, Ubumenyi bw\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe n\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019ababyaza, nayo yayikuye muri kaminuza ya Namibiya ndetse yize amashuri ye yisumbuye mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Gabriel Taapopi i Ongwediva mu 1989 \nUmwuga.\nYakoze mu biro bya Perezida nk'umukozi ushinzwe guhuza ishami rishinzwe ibibazo by'abagore, aho yayoboye uturere tubiri, aritwo Oshana na Omusati, Nyiricyubahiro Shilunga yabaye rwiyemezamirimo mu myaka icyenda ishize, yanakoreye Minisiteri y\u2019uburinganire n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abana aho yari afite inshingano zo kuba umuyobozi mukuru uhuza ibikorwa. Shilunga ni rwiyemezamirimo, akaba umwe mu bagize Komite Ngishwanama ya Skill Share International yo mu gihugu cya Namibiya, ndetsu ni mwe mu bagize komite ishinzwe kurengera abagore n\u2019abana ndetse akaba n'umwe mu bagize akanama gashinzwe kurekura g bagororwamuri Minisiteri y\u2019ituze n\u2019umutekano.\nIbyifuzo n'ibimunyura.\nMu bintu byamukururaga cyane harimo ingufu n\u2019inganda kandi akaba yakora nk'Umuyobozi mu kigo cyitwa Inama ishinzwe ingufu ku isi giherereye muri Namibia, niwe muyonozi mukuru w'icyo kigo akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019umugore mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019amabuye y'agaciro muri Namibiya. "}
{"id": "16691", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16691", "title": "Oluwatomi Somefun", "text": "Oluwatomi Somefun (yavutse ku ya 2 Ukwakira) ni umugore w'umucuruzi wo muri Nijeriya akaba umunyamabanki. Kugeza ubu akora nk'umuyobozi mukuru akaba n'umuyobozi nshingwabikorwa wa Unity Bank plc. \nUburezi n'umwuga.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'icyongereza mu 1981 yakuye muri kaminuza ya Obafemi Awolowo, Ile-Ife muri leta ya Osun ndetse yabaye n\u2019umunyeshuri w\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Harvard na kaminuza y\u2019ubucuruzi ya kaminuza ya Columbia, New York.\nSomefun yatangiye umwuga we atangiriye mu kigo cyitwa Peat Marwick and Co nyuma yimukira muri Arthur Andersen (ubu cyitwa KPMG) mbere yo kuba umuyobozi mukuru muri Unity Bank plc. "}
{"id": "16692", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16692", "title": "Ubukerarugendo mu Burundi", "text": "Ubukerarugendo mu Burundi bushingira ku mujyi wa Bujumbura, ukaba ari nawo mujyi munini kandi wahoze ari umurwa mukuru w\u2019Uburundi,ukurura bamukerarugendo mu igihugu. Usibye ibi, ikiyaga cya Tanganyika nacyo kizwi mugukurura ba mukerarugendo. \nInganda.\nUburundi bufite umutungo kamere ndetse n\u2019ibinyabuzima, ariko inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo z\u2019Uburundi ntabwo ziteye imbere. Ubukerarugendo bufite umugabane muto mu bicuruzwa byinjira mu gihugu (GDP). Umusanzu utaziguye w\u2019ingendo ndetse n\u2019ubukerarugendo mu bicuruzwa byinjira mu gihugu wari 2,1% muri 2013 na 2% muri 2014. Dukurikije imibare ya Banki y'Isi, umubare wa ba mukerarugendo mpuzamahanga wiyongereye mu myaka ya za 2000. Mu mwaka wa 2000, ba mukerarugendo mpuzamahanga bagera ku 29,000 basuye u Burundi, umubare wariyongereye ugera ku 148,000 mu mwaka wa 2005. Umubare wa ba mukerarugendo wageze ku 214,000 mu mwaka wa 2006; kugeza mu mwaka wa 2010, ba mukerarugendo 142,000 gusa ni bo bari basuye igihugu. Mu gihe urwego rw\u2019ubukerarugendo ari ruto ariko rugenda rwiyongera, imidugararo ikomeje kwangiza ubukerarugendo mu gihugu. \nMu Burundi Ibikorwa remezo by'ubukerarugendo biri hasi cyane. Ubushobozi bwo gutwara no gucumbikira ba mukerarugendo ni ngerere. Mu mwaka wa 2010, guverinoma y\u2019Uburundi yateguye gahunda y\u2019imyaka 20 yo guteza imbere ibikorwa remezo ku bufatanye na Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere hagamijwe kunoza ibikorwa remezo by\u2019ubukerarugendo muri iki gihugu. Inkunga kandi nanone zituruka mu bindi bihugu na mashyirahamwe. \nInama.\nMbere yo gusura u Burundi hakenerwa icyemezo cyerekana ko wakingiwe irwara yo mubwoko bw'ibicurane yiswe yellow fever. Malariya ni icyorezo mu Burundi, mu gihe kandi urukingo rwa kolera narwo rushobora gukenerwa igihe usuye u Burundi. \nIbikurura.\nUbukerarugendo bw'ibidukikije kamere ni bumwe mu bice by\u2019ubukerarugendo mu Burundi. Pariki ya Kibira, Umugezi wa Rurubu n'ikiyaga cya Tanganyika bifatwa nk'ahantu nyaburanga ku nyamaswa. Hariho kandi ibiyaga byinshi by'inyoni zo mu gasozi, nk'ikiyaga nyaburanga cya Rwihinda. \nAbarundi bavuza ingoma, bazwi ku izina rya \"Abatimbo\", ni bamwe mu bakurura ubukerarugendo bw'umuco. Ingoma z'imbaho ziri mu muco wa kera w'Uburundi. Amajwi yabo azwi nkamajwi ya \"kera\" ndetse \"yera\" yo mu Burundi kandi akaba ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubumwe. Mu mwaka wa 2014, imbyino y\u2019ingoma y\u2019Abarundi yashyizwe ku rutonde rw\u2019umurage ndangamuco w'Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ushinzwe uburezi, ubumenyi ndetse n\u2019umuco uzwi nka UNESCO. Muri mwaka wa 2017, Perezida Pierre Nkurunziza yongeye kubyutsa imihango yo kuvuza ingoma mu birori ndetse abuza n'abagore kuvuza ingoma. \nNta murage w\u2019isi uzwi n'Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ushinzwe uburezi, ubumenyi ndetse n\u2019umuco uzwi nka UNESCO mu Burundi ariko hari ibibanza 10 biri ku rutonde rw\u2019agateganyo rw'Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ushinzwe uburezi, ubumenyi ndetse n\u2019umuco uzwi kuzina rya UNESCO. Izi mbuga 10 zirimo Gishora, Mugamba, Muramvya, Gasumo (isoko y\u2019amajyepfo ya Nili), Ikibaya Kamere cya Rwihinda, Ikiyaga cya Tanganyika, Parike y\u2019igihugu ya Rusizi, Parike y\u2019igihugu ya Kibira, Parike y\u2019igihugu ya Ruvubu n\u2019isumo rya Kagera. "}
{"id": "16693", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16693", "title": "Zeb Tsikira", "text": "Zeb Tsikira ni umunyazimbabwe akaba rwiyemezamirimo ubarizwa mu bikorwa byo gutunganya imitungo itimukanwa, aba muri Kanada. Ndetse n'umwanditsi w'ibitabo. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nZeb Tsikira yavukiye mu gace kitwa \"Bulawayo\" akaba ari naho yakuriye mu nkengero za Nketa. Yize amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza rya Manondwane n'ayisumbuye mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Hamilton. Yaje kwimukira muri Kanada mu mwaka wa 2001 n'umuryango we. \nMu mwaka wa 2010 Tsikira yavuye muri kaminuza atayirangije aho yigaga mu ishami ry'intekerezo za muntu muri \"kaminuza ya Ottawa\". Yahise ashinga ikigo cyitwa Canvestus Group na Nyon Communications mu mwaka wa 2013 byakoraga by'umwihariko ibyerekeranye n'imitungo itimukanwa no gutunganya inyubako. Tsikira yahawe igihembo mu bihembo byahariwe abanyazimbabwe besheje imihigo byitwa \"Zimbabwe Achievers Awards\" mu mwaka wa 2019 aho yahembwe nka rwiyemezamirimo w'umugabo w'umwaka wa 2019.\nNi umuterankunga utanga umusanzu muri L'Arche Zimbabwe kandi agira uruhare mu bikorwa byo gutunganya umuziki mu gihugu cya Zimbabwe. "}
{"id": "16694", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16694", "title": "Anita Uwagbale", "text": "Anita Queen Uwagbale ni umudamu ukomoka mu gihugu cya Nijeriya akaba ari rwiyemezamirimo ndetse akaba yarigeze kuba umwamikazi w'ubwiza. \nUwagbale yamaze hafi imyaka ye yose yo mu buto muri Lagos kugeza igihe yaboneye urwandiko rumwemerera kwinjira muri kaminuza ya Madonna, i Port Harcourt agiye kwiga ibaruramari. Nk'umunyeshuri wigaga mu cyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza, Uwagbale yambitswe ikamba ry'umukobwa mwiza (Nyampinga) muri Nigeriya mu mwaka wa 2004, bituma ashobora kwitabira irushanwa ry'ubwiza ku Isi yose ryitwa \"Miss Universe\" nyuma yaje kwitabira Miss World mu mwaka wa 2004. Mu irushanwa rya Miss World 2004 Uwagbale yashyizwe muri banyampinga 15 ba mbere ku rwego rwa kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza maze agirwa \"umwamikazi w\u2019ubwiza w\u2019umugabane\" \"wa\" \"Afurika\". Nka MBGN, urubuga rwa Uwagbale rwari rufite intego zo kwita ku bihumanya Ibidukikije.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2008 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2018, Uwagbale yashakanye na rwiyemezamirimo witwa Tom Iseghohi, baje guhura hagati mu gihe yegukanaga ikamba nka MBGN. Nyuma y\u2019imihango yo kwiyandikisha nk'abasezeranye muri Amerika, abashakanye bakoreye ubukwe bw'imbere y'amategeo i Lagos mu mwaka wa 2008, ubu bakaba ari ababyeyi bafite abahungu babiri n\u2019umukobwa umwe. Mu mwaka wa 2009, yashinjwaga kunyereza abanyamigabane ba NITEL, ariko ibirego biraseswa. \nUwagbale yakomeje amasomo ye ajya kwiga muri Amerika mu gihe nanone yakoraga ubucuruzi bwe burimo gutunganya uruhuri rw'ibicuruzwa bikenerwa n'ababyeyi bigizwe na \"Ububiko bw'abana\". Muri Gicurasi 2011, ububiko bw'abana bwa Uwagbale bwafunguye mu isoko rya Chase Mall, hafi y'umuhanda wa Ademola Adetokunbo, ku kirwa cya Victoria, i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "16696", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16696", "title": "Icyanya cy'ahariwe Umusambi", "text": "Umudugudu wa Umusambi, washinzwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ryita ku kubungabunga inyamaswa zo mu Rwanda uyobowe n\u2019umuvuzi w\u2019amatungo ariwe Olivier Nsengimana, ni igishanga giherereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda kikaba icumbi ry\u2019imisozi irenga 50 itagira ingano y\u2019imikara (\"Balearica regulorum\") yakuwe mu buryo butemewe n'amategeko. ubucuruzi bw'amatungo. \nIzi nyoni zagaruwe nubunyage kandi ntizishobora kurekurwa mu gasozi. Umudugudu wa Umusambi utanga izo nyoni ahantu hateye imbaraga zishobora guhura na kamere yazo. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nNsengimana yatangiye umushinga w'Umudugudu wa Umusambi muri 2014. Icyari kigamijwe kwari uguhagarika ubucuruzi butemewe bwa umusambi mu buryo butemewe, guteza imbere imyumvire, no kurekura umusambi nyinshi zajyanywe bunyago zisubira mu gasozi, muri parike y\u2019igihugu ya Akagera.\nMuri uwo mushinga, basanze imisambi nyinshi yaramugaye kubera gufungwa kwayo. Ibi bikunze guhuzwa no gufata no gutwara, ndetse no gukata amababa kugirango birinde kuguruka, bishobora kugenda nabi cyane iyo bikozwe nta buhanga. "}
{"id": "16697", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16697", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Cape Verde", "text": "Ubukerarugendo muri Cape Verde, ku nkombe za Senegali hari itsinda ry\u2019ibirwa, byatangiye mu myaka ya za 70 ku kirwa cya Sal kandi byiyongera buhoro buhoro mu myaka ya za 1980 na 1990 muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba. \nIncamake.\nUbukerarugendo bwatanze miliyoni 41 z'amadolari y'Amerika mu bukungu bw'igihugu mu mwaka wa 2000. Inganda z\u2019amahoteri zatanze 2.0% by'umusaruro rusange mu mwaka wa 1997, wiyongera ku kigero cya 6.8% mu mwaka wa 2001. Biro y'ibarurishamibare ya Cape Verdean ivuga ko umubare w\u2019abakerarugendo wiyongereye uva ku 45,000 mu mwaka wa 1997 ugera ku barenga 115,000 mu mwaka wa 2001 ndetse urenga 765,000 mu mwaka wa 2018.\u00a0Abenshi muri aba binjira baturutse mu Bwongereza bangana na (23,6%), naho Ubudage bangana na (11.2%), Ibihugu byo hasi (ni ukuvuga Ubuholandi n'Ububiligi), Ubufaransa, Porutugali, Ubutaliyani, n'ibindi bihugu. Ba mukerarugendo batageze kuri umwe kw'ijana baturutse muri Amerika. Umubare munini wa ba mukerarugendo basura ibirwa biringaniye ndetse n'ibirwa bidatuwe cyane nka Sal, Boa Vista, na Maio hamwe n'inyanja y'umusenyi wera.\u00a0\nIbirwa bya Cape Verde bigira imiterere y'ikirere myiza ahanini mu gihe kingana n'iminsi 350 y'igihe cy'izuba mu mwaka, kandi ibirwa bimwe muribi bitanga imisozi ishimishije cyane. Imikino yo gusimbuka mu mazi, imikino yo kugendera k'umuvumba, ubwato hamwe n'ingendo z'amaguru zirahari kubakerarugendo. Ubukerarugendo rw'ibidukikije rimwe na rimwe bugenda butera imbere ku birwa bya S\u00e3o Nicolau, Santiago na Boa Vista. Ku bakerarugendo bashishikajwe n'insanganyamatsiko z'umuco, umujyi wa Cidade Velha ku kirwa cya Santiago watangajwe na UNESCO mu 1997, ariko ubukerarugendo bushingiye ku muco ntabwo bwatezwa imbere cyane kugeza ubu.\nPolitiki ya viza ya Cape Verde isaba viza kubakerarugendo baturutse ku isi yose. Vuba aha ariko, gusonerwa viza ku baturage b\u2019Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi, abenegihugu b\u2019Amerika na Kanada, hamwe n\u2019abaturage b\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi hanze y\u2019akarere ka Schengen, byashyizwe mu bikorwa kandi bitangira gukurikizwa ku ya 1 Mutarama 2019. \nImibare.\nAbashyitsi benshi mu bigo by\u2019ubukerarugendo, mu gihugu batuyemo, mu mwaka wa 2015: "}
{"id": "16698", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16698", "title": "Inzu Ndangamurage ya Rwesero", "text": "Inzu Ndangamurage ya Rwesero cyangwa Ingoro y\u2019Ubugeni n\u2019Ubuhanzi yo ku Rwesero, ni inzu ndangamurage iherereye i Nyanza, mu Rwanda. Yashinzwe n'Ikigo cy'ingoro z'umurage w'u Rwanda.\nYubatswe nk'ingoro y'Umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa, gusa ariko ntiyigeze agira umwanya wo kuyijyamo; yapfuye mbere yo kuyigarurira, ihinduka inzu ndangamurage y'ubuhanzi mu Rwanda.\nindangasoko.\nInzu ndangamurage - Rwanda News"}
{"id": "16699", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16699", "title": "Dian Fossey Gorilla Fund International", "text": "Ikigega mpuzamahanga cya Dian Fossey Gorilla (mu ntangiriro cyari Ikigega cya Digit) n\u2019ishirahamwe ryita ku kurinda ingagi zo mu misozi ziri m'ukaga. Ikigega cya Digit cyashinzwe na Dr. Dian Fossey muri 1978 hagamijwe gutera inkunga mu kurwanya guhiga no gukumira inyamaswa z\u2019ingagi zo mu misozi. Fossey yakoze ubushakashatsi mu kigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cya Karisoke kiri mu imisozi ya Virunga byo mu Rwanda. Ikigega kidaharanira inyungu cyiswe icyo kwita ku ingagi yakundaga cyane yitwa Fossey. Waciwe umutwe na ba rushimusi kugira ngo atange amadorari 20 y\u2019amadolari y\u2019umucuruzi w\u2019umuhutu w\u2019inzobere mu kugurisha imitwe y\u2019ingagi, nk'ibikombe ndetse n'amaboko y'ingagi zikurura ba mukerarugendo. \nFossey yaje gushiraho ikigega cya Digit cyo gukusanya amafaranga yo gukora amarondo arwanya guhiga no gushimita ingagi. Yiswe \"Dian Fossey Gorilla Fund International\" mu 1992. \nFossey ahanini yarwanyije imbaraga z\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga, yumvaga idakoresheje neza amafaranga yabo mu bikoresho byinshi ku bayobozi ba parike y\u2019u Rwanda, bamwe muri bo bakaba baravugaga ko batumije zimwe mu ngagi. Yatanze ibisobanuro ku ngaruka zikomeye z'urupfu rwa Digit, rwagize mu buryo bwo kubungabunga ibidukikije:\"Nagerageje kutareka ngo ntekereze ububabare bwa Digit, ububabare ndetse no gusobanukirwa rwose agomba kuba yarabonye mu kumenya icyo abantu bamukorera. Kuva uwo mwanya, naje gutura mu gice cyanjye cyitaruye. \" \nIbikorwa.\nBinyuze mu kigega cya Digit, Fossey yateye inkunga amarondo yo gusenya imitego ya ba rushimusi mu misozi ya Virunga. Mu mezi ane mu 1979, irondo rya Fossey rigizwe n\u2019abakozi bane bo muri Afurika ryasenye imitego y\u2019abahigi 987 mu gace k\u2019ubushakashatsi. Abashinzwe kurinda parike y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda, igizwe n\u2019abakozi 24, ntibigeze bafata imitego ya ba rushimusi muri icyo gihe kimwe. \nIkigega mpuzamahanga cya Dian Fossey Gorilla gikomeje gukora ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cya Karisoke, Fossey yashinze mu 1967, gikurikirana ingagi za buri munsi n\u2019irondo."}
{"id": "16700", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16700", "title": "H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines", "text": "H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines\n(Hotel y\u2019imisozi igihumbi) ni hoteri nini iri mu mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda. Yamenyekanye cyane nyuma yuko abantu 1.268 bahungiye muri iyi nyubako mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994. Inkuru ya hoteri n\u2019umuyobozi wayo muri kiriya gihe yari, Paul Rusesabagina, yaje gukoreshwa nk'ishingiro rya filime ya Terry George ya \"Hotel Rwanda\" muri 2004.\nIyi hoteli y'inyenyeri 4 itanga ikigo cy'ubucuruzi na Wi-Fi y'ubuntu. Ibikoresho byo kwidagadura birimo pisine yo hanze ifite akabari, spa n'ibigo by'imyitozo ngororamubiri, n'ibibuga bya tenisi. Ahantu nyaburanga hafi harimo Sitade Amahoro n'Ikigo cy'Urwibutso rwa Jenoside cya Kigali.\nAmateka.\nIsosiyete y'indege y'Ababiligi Sabena niyo yubatse H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines muri 1973 kandi yari iyifite mu gihe cya Jenoside yo mu Rwanda muri 1994. \nYari hoteri Y'inyenyeri enye ifite ibyumba 112, akabari, ibyumba bitatu by'inama, resitora, pisine, hamwe na tennis. \nKu ya 10 Kanama 2005, Hoteli Sabena yagurishije Hotel des Mille Collines kuri Hotel MIKCOR Hotel Holding kuri miliyoni 3.2 z'amadolari y'Amerika (hafi miliyari 1.8 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda). Umuyobozi mukuru w'itsinda rya MIKCOR, Miko Rwayitare, yavuze ko mu ihererekanyabubasha ryabereye muri iyo hoteri ku wa kane tariki ya 16, yavuze ko ubu iryo tsinda rifite 89% bya hoteri byose, ifite 8.5% na 2.5% ifitwe na Banki ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda (BRD) na guverinoma yu Rwanda. Rwayitare kandi yari umuyobozi mukuru wa Telecel International, yari isosiyete y'itumanaho. Muri Mata 2014, Mickor Investment Holdings Ltd yahinduye imicungire ya hoteri ayishyikiriza Hoteli Kempinski maze K\u00f4inski yitwa H\u00f4tel des Mille Collines. Hoteri yavuye mu munyururu wa Kempinski nyuma y'imyaka ibiri, kw'itariki 1 Mata 2016, isubira ku izina ryayo rya mbere.\nMu muco uzwi.\nHoteri niho hategurirwaga filime \"Hotel Rwanda\", ariko ntabwo igaragara muri iyi filime, ariko ahanini yafatiwe muri Afurika yepfo. Iyi hoteri ariko igaragara muri firime ya HBO 2005, Rimwe na rimwe muri Mata, na firime yo muri Kanada muri 2007, \"Shake Hands hamwe na Sekibi\", nayo yafatiwe ahantu mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "16701", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16701", "title": "Chez Lando", "text": "Chez Lando ni hoteri na resitora biherereye mu murwa mukuru w'igihugu cyu Rwanda, Kigali. Iyi hoteri yashinzwe mu myaka wo muri 1980 n\u2019umucuruzi ukomeye w\u2019abanyarwanda n\u2019umunyapolitiki witwa Lando Ndasingwa, n\u2019umugore we w\u2019umunyakanada H\u00e9l\u00e8ne, bombi bishwe muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda muri 1994. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa Ndasingwa, hoteri yigaruriwe na mushiki we Anne-Marie Kantengwa, wari umunyeshuri mu 2013 muri gahunda y'amahoro ya IEEW binyuze muri gahunda y'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. hotel chez lando yatangiye mugihe cyo hambere "}
{"id": "16703", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16703", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique", "text": " Repubulika ya Centrafrique yagiyge hasi mu bukerarugendo kubera amateka ya vuba y\u2019amakimbirane n\u2019imvururu, ndetse n\u2019umutekano muke mu turere tumwe na tumwe tw\u2019igihugu, cyane cyane amajyaruguru n\u2019amajyaruguru ashyira uburengerazuba. \nUbukerarugendo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) bwahuye n'ingaruka kubera intambara y'abenegihugu n'amakimbirane mu bihugu bihakikije.\nRepubulika ya Centrafrique CAR ni igihugu kidakora ku inkombe muri Afurika yo hagati gifite abaturage 6,100,000 mu buso bwa kilometero kare 623,000.\nRepubulika ya Centrafrique CAR ikikijwe na Tchad mu majyaruguru, Sudani mu majyaruguru, Sudani y'Amajyepfo mu burasirazuba, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo na Repubulika ya Kongo mu majyepfo, na Kameruni mu burengerazuba.\nKuva mu ntangiriro yo mu myaka yaza 2000, intambara y'abenegihugu n'imidugararo mu karere byateje ihungabana ndetse n'umutekano mucye, bituma ubukerarugendo butagira umutekano.\nMinisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika ifite ubujyanama bw\u2019ingendo mu rwego rwo guca intege ingendo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) ku benegihugu ba Amerika kubera ibyago by\u2019imvururu z\u2019abaturage n\u2019ibyaha by\u2019urugomo. Muri Mata mu mwaka wa 2007, ibirori byo guhiga byabereye hafi y'umujyi wa Ndele byarateye maze umuhigi w'umufaransa aricwa abandi batatu barakomereka. \nMu mwaka wa 2019, igihugu cyanditsweho ba mukerarugendo bagera ku 87,000 bari ku mwanya wa 174 ku isi. \nRepubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) kandi yibasiwe n\u2019amakimbirane yo mu karere, harimo nk\u2019intambara yo muri Sudani yepfo ndetse n\u2019imirwano mu bihugu byabaturanyi. Umutekano mu gihugu ntushikamye, cyane cyane mu majyaruguru no mu majyaruguru ahana imbibi n'uburengerazuba. \nMu myaka yashize, guverinoma yafashe ingamba zo gukaza umutekano mu gihugu kandi hamaze guterwa intambwe mu inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo. Nubwo, mu gihe intambara y'abenegihugu yarikomeje ndetse n'amakimbirane yo mu karere, ubukerarugendo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) bwakomeje guhabwa imbibi.\n\"Ubukerarugendo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique\" bwagize ingaruka mbi ku mateka ndetse n'imirwano ibera mu bihugu byabaturanyi. Umutekano mu gihugu ntumeze neza, cyane cyane mu majyaruguru no mumbibi za majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba. \nRepubulika ya Centrafrique igira ibibazo byo kubura ikirere bigatuma aho ahantu hahenda. Ikibuga mpuzamahanga gihari ni Bangui M'poko. Ahantu mu gihugu hakurura abagenzi harimo Chutes De Boali, amasoko y'uburebure bwa m 50 (164 ft).\nParike y'igihugu ya Dzanga-Sangha mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'igihugu ifite ingagi n'inzovu. Abaturage ba Baka batuye muri kariya gace. Bayanga iruhande rw'umugezi wa Sangha mu mudugudu munini hafi ya parike y'igihugu. Uwo mudugudu ufite amazu mato mato hamwe naho kuryama. Igihe cyiza cyo gusura igice kinini cy'igihugu ni guhera mu Gushyingo kugeza Mata. "}
{"id": "16704", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16704", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Tchad", "text": "Ubukerarugendo muri Tchad ni inganda ntoya. Abagenzi benshi bakururwa nubushobozi bwa Chad bwo guhiga hamwe na parike yigihugu ya Zakouma.\nBa mukerarugendo bagomba kuba bafite pasiporo na viza byemewe, hamwe n'ibimenyetso byo gukingira irwara yibicurani yiswe (yellow fever). Kuva mu mwaka wa 2000, mu gihugu haje abakerarugendo bagera ku 43,000. Tchad yari ifite ibyumba 677 bya hoteri ifite ibitanda 1,250 muri uwo mwaka. Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika yavuze ko impuzandengo ya buri munsi yo kuguma muri N'Djamena ari amadorari 239 mu mwaka wa 2002, ugereranije n\u2019amadorari 50 mu tundi turere tw\u2019igihugu. "}
{"id": "16705", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16705", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Comoros", "text": "Comoros ntabwo ifite inganda zikomeye z'ubukerarugendo.\nUmubare w'abakerarugendo.\nNubwo Comoros ifite umutungo kamere w'ubukerarugendo, nk'inyanja n\u2019ibidukikije byo mu nyanja, ntabwo ifite inganda zikomeye z\u2019ubukerarugendo nk\u2019abanywanyi bayo bo mu karere nka R\u00e9union, Maurice, na Seychelles. Inganda z\u2019ubukerarugendo zifite intege nke ahanini ziterwa n\u2019imiterere ya politiki idafite umutekano, hamwe n\u2019imivurungano ya politiki mu myaka mirongo itatu ishize. \nBa mukerarugendo muri Comoros ahanini ni abatunzi b'Abanyamerika n'Abanyaburayi, mu gihe ubushoramari muri hoteri bwaturutse muri Afurika y'Epfo. \nIbikurura ba mukerarugendo.\nUbukerarugendo bukurura ba mukerarugendo muri Comoros ni inkombe zabwo, uburobyi, hamwe n\u2019imisozi. Moh\u00e9li ikurura ba mukerarugendo beza. Grand Comore ifite ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga hamwe na hoteri nyinshi za Comoros. "}
{"id": "16706", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16706", "title": "Ubukerarugendo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo", "text": "Ubukerarugendo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ntibusanzwe. Ba mukerarugendo bashobora kubona inyamanswa, imico kavukire, nibintu bya geologiya bidashobora kuboneka cyangwa n'ahandi hose muri Afrika.\nMu murwa mukuru, Kinshasa, amahirwe make y'ubukerarugendo arahari. Mu mujyi wa Kinshasa isoko ry'inzovu rirahari aho usibye ibihangano bigaragara bya congo, masike y'imiryango, nibindi bicuruzwa byiza bishobora kugurwa. Hanze ya Kinshasa kubungabunga bonobo bita Lola Ya Bonobo. I Kinshasa gusura uruzi rwa congo cyangwa amasomo ya golf yo mu mujyi cyangwa resitora zo mu mujyi birashobora kuba byiza.\nBa mukerarugendo bashobora gukora ingendo kugira ngo babone ingagi zo mu misozi no mu bibaya byo mu gasozi, wanahura n'abantu bagufi cyane bakora imyitozo gakondo yabo mu mashyamba, bonobos na okapi ni amoko abiri adasanzwe ataboneka ahandi ku isi, hanyuma uzamuke mu mpinga y'ibirunga maze urebe ikiyaga cya lava gitetse mu mwobo w'umusozi wa Nyiragongo. Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) yahuye n\u2019imvururu zikunze kugaragara mu burasirazuba bw\u2019igihugu.\nIngendo zigenga zihendutse muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) kuruta mu Rwanda cyangwa Uganda.\nParike y'igihugu ya Virunga.\nPariki y'igihugu ya Virunga nicyo kimenyetso cya mbere cy'igihugu muri Afrika, cyashinzweho mu mwaka wa 1925. Parike n'ingenzi mu bukerarugendo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC). Ni ikibanza ndangamurage cy'umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ushinzwe uburezi, ubumenyi n\u2019umuco (UNESCO) giherereye mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC).\u00a0\nKu ya 11 Gicurasi 2018, muri parike y'igihugu ya Virunga hashimuswe ba mukerarugendo babiri b'Abongereza, abashinzwe parike, n'umushoferi wa Kongo. Umurinzi yarishwe ariko abandi batatu bararekurwa. Parike y'igihugu ya Virunga yafunzwe by'agateganyo kugira ngo ikemure ibibazo by'umutekano. Parike yongeye gufungura muri Gashyantare 2019. Ba mukerarugendo bashobora gusura Virunga cyangwa gutembera ku kiyaga kinini cya lava ku isi, umusozi wa Nyiragongo."}
