{"id": "16708", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16708", "title": "Equity Bank Rwanda Limited", "text": "Equity Bank Rwanda Limited (EBRL), ni banki yubucuruzi ikorera mu Rwanda. Banki yahawe uruhushya na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, ariyo banki nkuru ikaba ari umugenzuzi w\u2019amabanki. \nIncamake.\nEBRL ni ikigo cy\u2019imari iciriritse gitanga serivisi z\u2019imari mu Rwanda, bikaba bivugwa ko umutungo rusange ungana na miliyoni 363.39 y'amadorali y'America (miliyari y'amafaranga yu Rwanda 366.39), guhera ku ya 31 Werurwe 2021. Umugabane w\u2019abanyamigabane ni miliyoni 52.42 y'amadorali y'America (miliyari y'amafaranga yu Rwanda angana 52.86). \nAmateka.\nBanki yahawe uruhushya rwa banki na Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, muri 2011 itangira serivisi z\u2019amabanki mu gihembwe cya kane cyo muri 2011. U Rwanda nicyo gihugu cya kane muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba aho Itsinda rya banki za Equity ryafunguye ishami. Naho Ibikorwa byo muri Tanzaniya byatangiye mu gihembwe cya mbere cya 2012. Ifite irindi tsinda rya mabanki, aho ifite amashami y\u2019imari muri Kenya, Rwanda, Sudani yepfo, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo Uganda na Tanzaniya. Biteganijwe ko ibikorwa byayo mu Burundi bizatangira mu myaka itanu iri imbere.\nNk\u2019uko ikinyamakuru New Times Rwanda kibitangaza ngo banki ya Equity yu Rwanda rwabonye igihembo cya Banki y'umwaka mu Rwanda muri 2020 na Banki mu gihembo cya Banki y'umwaka. \nMuri 2020 banki ya Equity yu Rwanda yafunguye ishami ryu bwishingizi. \nNyirubwite.\nEquity Bank Rwanda Limited ikomeza amashami akurikira, guhera mu Kuboza 2014\nbanki ya Equity.\nIbigo bigize Equity Group Holdings Limited birimo ariko ntibigarukira kuri ibi bikurikira:\nUbubiko bwa Equity Group Holdings Limited iri ku Isoko ryimigabane rya Nairobi, ifite ikimenyetso cya EQTY. Ku wa kane tariki ya 18 Kamena 2009, itsinda ry\u2019imigabane ry\u2019itsinda ryanditswe ku isoko ry\u2019imigabane rya Uganda (USE), maze ritangira gucuruza uwo munsi, ku kimenyetso cya: EBL. banki ya Equity yu Rwanda rwatangiye gucururiza mu Isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda muri 2015 ku kimenyetso EQTY. "}
{"id": "16709", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16709", "title": "Hoteli chez Lando", "text": "Chez Lando ni hoteri na resitora biherereye mu murwa mukuru w'igihugu cyu Rwanda, umujyi wa Kigali.Iyi hoteri yashinzwe mu myaka wo muri 1980 n\u2019umucuruzi ukomeye w\u2019abanyarwanda n\u2019umunyapolitiki witwa Lando Ndasingwa, n\u2019umugore we w\u2019umunyakanada H\u00e9l\u00e8ne, bombi bishwe muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda muri 1994. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa Ndasingwa, hoteri yigaruriwe na mushiki we Anne-Marie Kantengwa, wari umunyeshuri mu 2013 muri gahunda y'amahoro yitwa IEEW binyuze muri gahunda y'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "16710", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16710", "title": "Icyambu cy'ubucuruzi cya Kigali", "text": "Kigali Logistics Platform ni icyambu cy'imbere mu gihugu kidakora ku mazi (\"dry port\") giherereye i Masaka, mu Akarere ka Kicukiro, mu mujyi wa Kigali. Cyubatswe kandi gicungwa na DP World ku bufatanye na Leta y'u Rwanda. Iki cyambu gifasha mu kwakira, kubika no gutwara ibicuruzwa hagati y'u Rwanda, ibihugu byo mu karere ndetse n'ibyambu bya Mombasa muri Kenya na Dar es Salaam muri Tanzaniya.\nAho kiri n'imiterere.\nKigali Logistics Platform iherereye i Masaka, mu Karere ka Kicukiro. Iki cyambu cyubatse ku buso bwa metero kare 130.000, burimo ikibuga cya kontineri kingana na metero kare 12.000 n'ububiko bw'ibicuruzwa bungana na metero kare 19.600.\nGifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira kontineri zigera ku 50.000 za TEU ku mwaka no kubika ibicuruzwa bigera kuri toni 640.000 ku mwaka. Icyambu kandi gifite uburyo bwo kubika ibicuruzwa mu bukonje no gukurikirana ibicuruzwa hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga.\nAmateka.\nMu 2016, Leta y'u Rwanda yagiranye na DP World amasezerano y'imyaka 25 yo kubaka no gucunga Kigali Logistics Platform. Iki cyambu cyatangiye gukora mu buryo bw'igerageza muri Nzeri 2018, mbere yo gutahwa ku mugaragaro na Perezida Paul Kagame ku wa 21 Ukwakira 2019.\nIgice cya mbere cy'umushinga cyatwaye miliyoni 35 z'amadolari ya Amerika. Mu gihe cy'itahwa ryacyo, iki cyambu cyari kimaze gutanga imirimo 667 itaziguye n'iziguye, aho 98% by'abakozi bari Abanyarwanda.\nAkamaro.\nKigali Logistics Platform yashyiriweho korohereza ubwikorezi bw'ibicuruzwa no kugabanya igihe n'ikiguzi byatwaraga kugira ngo ibicuruzwa bigere mu Rwanda cyangwa bive mu Rwanda bijya ku masoko mpuzamahanga.\nNyuma y'uko icyambu gitangiye gukora, igihe amakamyo yamaraga mu bikorwa byo kwakira no gutanga ibicuruzwa cyagabanutse kiva hagati y'iminsi 10 na 14 kigera ku minsi itatu. DP World yavuze ko, mu gihe icyambu gikora ku bushobozi bwacyo bwose, gishobora gutuma abacuruzi bo mu Rwanda bazigama amafaranga agera kuri miliyoni 50 z'amadolari ya Amerika buri mwaka.\nIki cyambu kandi gihuza u Rwanda n'ibyambu bya Mombasa na Dar es Salaam, ndetse kigafasha ubucuruzi hagati y'u Rwanda n'ibihugu birukikije birimo Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Burundi, Uganda, Tanzaniya na Kenya.\nMu muhango wo gutaha iki cyambu, Perezida Paul Kagame yasabye abacuruzi n'abashoramari kukibyaza umusaruro kugira ngo barusheho kugera ku masoko yo muri Afurika no hanze yayo."}
{"id": "16711", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16711", "title": "Alliance In Motion Global Rwanda", "text": "Umuhanda wo kwamakuza inyubako yo makuza arinayo ibamo ibiro bya AIM Global Rwanda\nAlliance In Motion Global izwi kandi nka AIM Global ni sosiyete mpuzamahanga igurisha ibicuruzwa byayo kwisi no muri Afurika. Iyi sosiyete imaze imyaka irenga icumi itanga serivisi ku isi. AIM Global Rwanda irashaka abaterankunga binyuze mu gukwirakwiza ubutumwa mu rubyiruko ndetse n'abakuru bushishikariza abantu gukora online business ku mugabane shingiro w'amafaranga 228000 y'u Rwanda.\nIbicuruzwa.\nIbicuruzwa bya AIM ku isi byose ni ibyokurya bisanzwe birimo intungamubiri zifasha umubiri kugera kubuzima bwiza, kuramba, ubwiza no kurwanya indwara. Ibyinshi mu bicuruzwa bikorerwa muri Amerika n\u2019amasosiyete atandukanye hamwe n\u2019inzobere mu buzima bushingiye ku imirire myiza, bifashishije ibyatsi.\nAmahugurwa.\nAim Global itanga amahugurwa y'ubuntu ku abakiriya bayo ku biro byayo mu Rwanda. Ushobora kandi kwitabira amahugurwa y'ubungu ku biro byose bya AIM Global mubindi bihugu."}
{"id": "16712", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16712", "title": "Mary Wambui", "text": "Mary Wambui ni umunyakenya uzwi mu mwuga w'ubucuruzi ndetse akaba ari n'umunyapolitiki. Yasimbuye uwahoze ari perezida Mwai Kibaki nk'umudepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko kubwa Othaya kandi akora izo nshingano mu gihe cya manda imwe gusa yabaye guhera mu mwaka wa 2013 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2017. \nWambui yagirizwa kuba yari umugore wa kabiri wa Kibaki nubwo nta gihamya ihari. Umuryango wa Wambui wemezako Mwai yashakanye na Mary mu mwaka 1972 imbere y'amategeko yo mu migenzo ya Kikuyu ndetse ngo bombi banafitanye umwana w'umukobwa, witwa Wangui Mwai. Mu mwaka wa 2004 itangazamakuru ryatangaje ko bivugwako Kibaki afite umugore wa kabiri bashyingiranywe mu mategeko, Mary Wambui, n'umwana wabo w'umukobwa, witwa Wangui Mwai. Nyuma yuko ayo makuru yasakaye hanze, Ibiro bya perezida byasohoye itangazo ridasinyeho rivuga ko umuryango wa Kibaki ugizwe gusa n'umugore we, Lucy n'abana babo bane. Mu mwaka wa 2009, Kibaki, aherekejwe n'umugore we Lucy Kibaki, batumije ikiganiro bari kumwe n'itangazamakuru bagirango bahamirize isi ko afite umugore umwe rukumbi.\nMu kiganiro hamwe n'igitangazamakuru cyitwa \"The Standard\" cyanditswe ku ya 5 Mata 2007, Winnie yavuze ko we na Artur Margaryan, ukekwaho kuba ari umucuruzi ukomoka muri Arumeniya, bagamije kuzashyingiranwa mu gihe cy'ahazaza. \nMu kiganiro aherutse kugirana n\u2019itangazamakuru ryo muri Kenya, Wambui yavuze ko afite abana batanu ariko yanze gutangaza amazina yabo bana.\u00a0\nIbyo Yakoze.\nMary Wambui Mungai yari umuyobozi w'ikigo gishinzwe itumanaho muri Kenya, aho yorohewe cyane mu rubanza yarafite ubwo u rukiko nyuma yuko umucamanza yemereye abashinjacyaha gukuraho urubanza rwa miliyari 2 nigice. Ibi byabaye nyuma y ukwezi nyuma y\u2019ubushinjacyaha (nka DPP) ahagaritse kandi urundi rubanza ruregwamo Madamu Mungai rurimo gutunga intwaro ndetse n\u2019amasasu mu buryo butemewe n'amategeko. Ndetse Kwamamaza Yinjiye mu rutonde rwagutse rw\u2019ibikorwa bya guverinoma, ndetse imanza zari inshinjabyaha zaje gusenyutse mu bihe byari byashize."}
{"id": "16713", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=16713", "title": "Isoko ry\u2019Imari n\u2019Imigabane", "text": "Rwanda Stock Exchange Limited yashinzwe ku ya 7 Ukwakira 2005 hagamijwe gukora ibikorwa by\u2019isoko ryimigabane n'imigabane. Isoko ry'imigabane ryatandukanijwe kuva ryatangira kuko ryanditswe nka sosiyete igarukira ku migabane. Iyi sosiyete yatangijwe ku mugaragaro ku ya 31 Mutarama 2011.\nAmateka.\nImiryango y'ivunjisha yafunguye ubucuruzi ku ya 31 Mutarama 2011. Uwo munsi wahuriranye n\u2019umunsi wa mbere w\u2019ubucuruzi mu bubiko bw\u2019uruganda rukora inzoga rukumbi mu Rwanda, Bralirwa, rucuruza munsi y\u2019ikimenyetso cya BLR. Isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda ryasimbuye Rwanda Over The Counter Exchange kuva muri Mutarama 2008, hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete abiri yashyizwe ku rutonde, ari yo Itsinda iry\u2019Ubucuruzi rya Kenya (KCB) ryashyizwe ku ya 18 Kamena 2009 n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019itangazamakuru (NMG) ryashyizwe muri 2 Ugushyingo 2010. \n\"Amarembo y'iri soko yafunguwe ku itariki ya 31 Mutarama 2011, igihe hasozwaga ibikorwa by'Isoko ry'Imigabane mu Rwanda, ryari rimaze gukora kuva muri Mutarama 2008. Iryo soko ryasimbuye isoko ryari risanzweho, aho amasosiyete abiri, ariyo Kenya Commercial Bank Group (KCB) yashyizwe ku rutonde ku ya 18 Kamena 2009, na National Media Group (NMG) yashyizwe ku rutonde ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 2010. Iri soko ry'imigabane ryatangiriye ku isosiyete ya Bralirwa, ububiko bukomeye bw'inzoga mu Rwanda, ikaba yari isosiyete ya mbere gukoresha umugabane ku isoko ry'imigabane ry'u Rwanda. Ubu buryo bwateje imbere ubucuruzi bw'imigabane mu gihugu, bigira uruhare mu kwagura ishoramari no kuzamura umuco wo gukoresha isoko ry'imigabane.\"\n\"Amarembo y'iri soko yafunguwe ku itariki ya 31 Mutarama 2011, igihe hasozwaga ibikorwa by'Isoko ry'Imigabane mu Rwanda, ryari rimaze gukora kuva muri Mutarama 2008. Iryo soko ryasimbuye isoko ryari risanzweho, aho amasosiyete abiri, ariyo Kenya Commercial Bank Group (KCB) yashyizwe ku rutonde ku ya 18 Kamena 2009, na National Media Group (NMG) yashyizwe ku rutonde ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 2010. Iri soko ry'imigabane ryatangiriye ku isosiyete ya Bralirwa, ububiko bukomeye bw'inzoga mu Rwanda, ikaba yari isosiyete ya mbere gukoresha umugabane ku isoko ry'imigabane ry'u Rwanda. Ubu buryo bwateje imbere ubucuruzi bw'imigabane mu gihugu, bigira uruhare mu kwagura ishoramari no kuzamura umuco wo gukoresha isoko ry'imigabane.\"\nNyuma yo gutangiza neza Bralirwa nk'ikigo cya mbere cy'ubucuruzi rusange (IPO), ikigo cya kabiri cy'ubucuruzi rusange ku isoko ry'imigabane mu Rwanda (RSE) cyari Banki ya Kigali, yatanijwe ku itariki ya 31 Kamena 2011. Ku ya 14 Mata 2015, Crystal Ventures yatangaje ko ifite umugambi wo kugira ikigo cya mbere cy'ubucuruzi rusange (IPO) ku isoko ry'imigabane ry'u Rwanda, mu kigo cyayo cy'ubucuruzi bwite, Crystal Telecom. Crystal Telecom ifite imigabane ingana na 20% muri MTN Rwanda, ikigo kinini cy'itumanaho mu gihugu.\nMu kwezi kwa Mata 2014, Isoko ry\u2019Imigabane ry\u2019u Rwanda (RSE) ryacuruzaga amasosiyete atanu yo mu Rwanda n\u2019ayo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, kandi rikaba ryarakoraga ubucuruzi bw'ibikoresho bitatu bya leta n'ikigo kimwe cy'ibikoresho bifite inyungu (fixed income). Iri soko rikora iminsi itanu mu cyumweru kandi ni umunyamuryango w\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Isoko ry\u2019Imigabane muri Afurika. RSE ifitanye umubano wihariye n\u2019Isoko ry\u2019Imigabane rya Nairobi (NSE) muri Kenya, Isoko ry\u2019Imigabane rya Dar es Salaam (DSE) muri Tanzania, n\u2019Isoko ry\u2019Imigabane rya Uganda (USE) muri Uganda. Hari gahunda yo guhuza izi masoko ane agahinduka isoko rimwe rusange ryo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Mu kwa Mbere 2016, \"The EastAfrican\" yatangaje ko hari IPO eshatu zari muri gahunda.\nKwaguka.\nAmaze gutangiza Bralirwa nk'intangarugero yatangiriye kumugaragaro (IPO), ya kabiri ya RSE ni Banki ya Kigali, yatangijwe ku ya 31 Kamena 2011. Ku ya 14 Mata 2015, haje Crystal Ventures yatangaje ko ifite umugambi wo gutanga ku mugaragaro (IPO) ku Isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda ry\u2019ishami ryayo ryuzuye, Crystal Telecom. Crystal Telecom yari ifite imigabane 20% muri MTN Rwanda, yari isosiyete ikora ibijyanye n\u2019itumanaho mu gihugu.\nMuri Gashyantare 2011, Banki Nkuru y\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda, yagiranye amasezerano n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe kubitsa no gutuza (CDSC), kizana isosiyete yo muri Kenya, kugira ngo ikorere isoko ry\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda umwaka umwe no guhugura abakozi b\u2019u Rwanda kugeza igihe u Rwanda rushobora gutangira no gukora igitabo cyihariye. Ku ya 7 Ukuboza 2012, RSE yashyize ahagaragara \"urutonde rw\u2019imigabane y\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda\" (RSESI), ibarwa mu giye yigenga, ishingiye ku mategeko, imari shingiro y\u2019isoko iremereye ibipimo ngenderwaho by\u2019imigabane y\u2019imigabane mu Rwanda. \nExpansion.\nNyuma yo gutangiza neza Bralirwa nk'ikigo cya mbere cy'ubucuruzi rusange (IPO), ikigo cya kabiri cy'ubucuruzi rusange ku isoko ry'imigabane mu Rwanda (RSE) cyari Banki ya Kigali, yatanijwe ku itariki ya 31 Kamena 2011. Ku ya 14 Mata 2015, Crystal Ventures yatangaje ko ifite umugambi wo kugira ikigo cya mbere cy'ubucuruzi rusange (IPO) ku isoko ry'imigabane ry'u Rwanda, mu kigo cyayo cy'ubucuruzi bwite, Crystal Telecom. Crystal Telecom ifite imigabane ingana na 20% muri MTN Rwanda, ikigo kinini cy'itumanaho mu gihugu.\nExpansion.\n\"Amarembo y'iri soko yafunguwe ku itariki ya 31 Mutarama 2011, igihe hasozwaga ibikorwa by'Isoko ry'Imigabane mu Rwanda, ryari rimaze gukora kuva muri Mutarama 2008. Iryo soko ryasimbuye isoko ryari risanzweho, aho amasosiyete abiri, ariyo Kenya Commercial Bank Group (KCB) yashyizwe ku rutonde ku ya 18 Kamena 2009, na National Media Group (NMG) yashyizwe ku rutonde ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 2010. Iri soko ry'imigabane ryatangiriye ku isosiyete ya Bralirwa, ububiko bukomeye bw'inzoga mu Rwanda, ikaba yari isosiyete ya mbere gukoresha umugabane ku isoko ry'imigabane ry'u Rwanda. Ubu buryo 